export default {"format":"cadcraft-help","version":1,"app":"takeoffcraft","name":"TakeoffDesk","common":"basics","sections":{"start":"Getting started","tasks":"Walkthroughs","switching":"Coming from other software","reference":"Reference","trouble":"Troubleshooting and limits"},"variants":{"os":{"mac":"Mac","windows":"Windows","linux":"Linux"},"browser":{"chromium":"Chrome or Edge","firefox":"Firefox","safari":"Safari"},"shell":{"web":"In the browser","desktop":"Desktop app"},"net":{"online":"Online","offline":"Offline"},"input":{"mouse":"Mouse","touch":"Touch"}},"topics":[{"slug":"getting-started","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Getting started with TakeoffDesk","summary":"What TakeoffDesk does, where it runs, and your first measured and priced item from a PDF plan set.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["start","first takeoff","quick start","introduction","estimate","quantity takeoff","plan set","pdf"],"headings":[{"id":"where-it-runs","text":"Where it runs","level":2},{"id":"your-first-takeoff-in-ten-steps","text":"Your first takeoff in ten steps","level":2},{"id":"what-to-read-next","text":"What to read next","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk measures plan sets, PDFs and DWG or DXF drawings, and turns the measurements into a priced estimate. You open the files (a drawing counts straight from its blocks: see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EOpen a DWG or DXF drawing\u003C/a\u003E), give each sheet a scale (a drawing brings its own), make \u003Cstrong\u003Eitems\u003C/strong\u003E (a wall type, a floor finish, a fixture), and click on the sheets to take them off. Quantities, costs and the job total update as you go. You can export the estimate as a spreadsheet and a copy of the PDFs with your takeoff drawn in.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you have done takeoff in other programs, read \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/coming-from\"\u003EComing from other takeoff software\u003C/a\u003E next. Some things work differently here.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-it-runs\"\u003EWhere it runs\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk runs in your web browser. Open TakeoffDesk and the screen is ready at once; there is nothing to install.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYour PDFs stay on your computer.\u003C/strong\u003E They are opened by the browser and never uploaded. Saving is a download.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt works in current Chrome, Edge, Firefox and Safari. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EBrowsers and computers\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt works with no internet connection once you choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar and it says \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EWorking offline\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECloud saving is not available: your files stay on your computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-first-takeoff-in-ten-steps\"\u003EYour first takeoff in ten steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis walk-through measures one wall type and prices it. It takes a few minutes on any plan you have.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E group of the toolbar (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), pick one or more PDFs, and choose Open. You can also drop the PDFs anywhere on the page. The sheets appear on the left and the first sheet opens in the middle.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFind the sheet&#039;s printed scale in its title block or under a drawing title.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E list in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E group and pick that scale, for example \u003Ccode\u003E1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. The bar at the bottom of the sheet now says &quot;Scale 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and click the two ends of a dimension printed on the drawing. The readout in the status bar at the bottom left should match the printed dimension. If it does not, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003ESet the scale\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E panel on the right, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E, type a name like \u003Ccode\u003EInterior wall type A\u003C/code\u003E, leave the type on \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear (length)\u003C/span\u003E, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E in the toolbar (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the start of a wall, then each corner along it. Double-click, press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or right-click to finish the run. The run is drawn in the item&#039;s color and its length appears next to the item.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the item editor under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E, type \u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0.85\u003C/code\u003E in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial $/LF\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Ccode\u003E1.20\u003C/code\u003E in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabor $/LF\u003C/span\u003E. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table at the bottom shows the length, the extended material and labor, and the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Your browser downloads a \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E file. It holds your items, scales and marks, and reopens on top of the same PDFs.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E menu in the toolbar and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E to download the estimate as a spreadsheet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to stop whatever you are doing and go back to the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E tool. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E undoes any change.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-to-read-next\"\u003EWhat to read next\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/workspace\"\u003EThe TakeoffDesk screen\u003C/a\u003E names every part of the window.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\"\u003EStart a takeoff and open a plan set\u003C/a\u003E covers several PDFs and the sheets list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ECreate takeoff items\u003C/a\u003E explains types, units, waste and rates.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EAssemblies and formulas\u003C/a\u003E turns one measurement into studs, sheets of board and more.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003EKeyboard and mouse\u003C/a\u003E lists every key.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk measures plan sets, PDFs and DWG or DXF drawings, and turns the measurements into a priced estimate. You open the files (a drawing counts straight from its blocks: see Open a DWG or DXF drawing), give each sheet a scale (a drawing brings its own), make items (a wall type, a floor finish, a fixture), and click on the sheets to take them off. Quantities, costs and the job total update as you go. You can export the estimate as a spreadsheet and a copy of the PDFs with your takeoff drawn in. If you have done takeoff in other programs, read Coming from other takeoff software next. Some things work differently here. Where it runs TakeoffDesk runs in your web browser. Open TakeoffDesk and the screen is ready at once; there is nothing to install. Your PDFs stay on your computer. They are opened by the browser and never uploaded. Saving is a download. It works in current Chrome, Edge, Firefox and Safari. See Browsers and computers. It works with no internet connection once you choose Save for offline in the app bar and it says Offline ready. See Working offline. Cloud saving is not available: your files stay on your computer. Your first takeoff in ten steps This walk-through measures one wall type and prices it. It takes a few minutes on any plan you have. Choose Open plans in the File group of the toolbar (or press Ctrl+O), pick one or more PDFs, and choose Open. You can also drop the PDFs anywhere on the page. The sheets appear on the left and the first sheet opens in the middle. Find the sheet's printed scale in its title block or under a drawing title. Open the Preset list in the Scale group and pick that scale, for example 1/4\" = 1'-0\". The bar at the bottom of the sheet now says \"Scale 1/4\" = 1'-0\"\". Choose Check (or press D) and click the two ends of a dimension printed on the drawing. The readout in the status bar at the bottom left should match the printed dimension. If it does not, see Set the scale. In the Items panel on the right, choose New item, type a name like Interior wall type A, leave the type on Linear (length), and choose Add. Choose Linear in the toolbar (or press L). Click the start of a wall, then each corner along it. Double-click, press Enter or right-click to finish the run. The run is drawn in the item's color and its length appears next to the item. In the item editor under Items, type 9'-0\" in Height, 0.85 in Material $/LF and 1.20 in Labor $/LF. The Quantities table at the bottom shows the length, the extended material and labor, and the Job total. Choose Save takeoff (or press Ctrl+S). Your browser downloads a .takeoff.json file. It holds your items, scales and marks, and reopens on top of the same PDFs. Open the Export menu in the toolbar and choose XLSX to download the estimate as a spreadsheet. Press Esc to stop whatever you are doing and go back to the Select tool. Ctrl+Z undoes any change. What to read next The TakeoffDesk screen names every part of the window. Start a takeoff and open a plan set covers several PDFs and the sheets list. Create takeoff items explains types, units, waste and rates. Assemblies and formulas turns one measurement into studs, sheets of board and more. Keyboard and mouse lists every key.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"workspace","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"The TakeoffDesk screen","summary":"A tour of the window by on-screen name - the toolbar, the sheets list, the sheet, the Items panel, the Quantities table and the status bar.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["screen","layout","layouts","ribbon","project browser","toolbox","info box","toolbar","panels","sheets list","items panel","quantities","status bar","tour","interface"],"headings":[{"id":"the-toolbar","text":"The toolbar","level":2},{"id":"sheets-left","text":"Sheets (left)","level":2},{"id":"the-sheet-middle","text":"The sheet (middle)","level":2},{"id":"items-right","text":"Items (right)","level":2},{"id":"quantities-bottom","text":"Quantities (bottom)","level":2},{"id":"status-bar-bottom","text":"Status bar (bottom)","level":2},{"id":"other-layouts","text":"Other layouts","level":2},{"id":"full-screen-and-themes","text":"Full screen and themes","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk fills the browser window under the app bar. From top to bottom and left to right:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPart\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhere\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it is for\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EApp bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVery top\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe app name, the version, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAbout TakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull screen\u003C/span\u003E button and the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E theme switch.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EToolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnder the app bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEvery command, in groups: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheets\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELeft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEvery page of every open PDF, with a thumbnail, its scale and its mark count.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe sheet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiddle\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe open page. You measure here.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItems\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERight\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYour takeoff items, the selected item&#039;s settings, and the selected mark.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantities\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBottom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantities and costs by item or by sheet, and the job total.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStatus bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVery bottom\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe live measurement, messages, the 45° hint and the zoom.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar\"\u003EThe toolbar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHover over any button to see what it does and its key.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EGroup\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EButtons\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E (empty takeoff), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen PDFs\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen takeoff\u003C/span\u003E (a \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E project), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOne menu: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), and the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E list\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, an on/off switch), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, an on/off switch), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste in place\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect all\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect none\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit page\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit width\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe tool you are using is shown pressed. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E buttons stay pressed while they are on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sheets-left\"\u003ESheets (left)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESearch sheets\u003C/strong\u003E filters the list by sheet name, file name or page label.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach sheet shows a thumbnail (drawn as you scroll), its name, and either its scale or \u003Cstrong\u003ENo scale\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe right side of each row shows how many marks the sheet has. While an item is highlighted, it shows how many of that item&#039;s marks are on the sheet instead.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick a sheet to open it. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E move to the next and previous sheet in the list.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen a takeoff covers PDFs that are not open, a note under the list names them. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ESave and reopen a takeoff\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESheet names come from the PDF: a page label such as \u003Ccode\u003EA-101\u003C/code\u003E becomes the sheet name. A page with no label is named after its file and page number, like &quot;Plans, page 3&quot;. With several PDFs open, labeled sheets also show the file name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-sheet-middle\"\u003EThe sheet (middle)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe bar under the sheet shows the sheet name and its scale, or &quot;No scale yet: pick a preset or calibrate&quot;. Its buttons: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/span\u003E (when that app can take the PDF; see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-plan-set\"\u003EStart a takeoff and open a plan set\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECompare\u003C/span\u003E (an older version of the sheet over this one: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\"\u003ECompare a revised sheet\u003C/a\u003E), &quot;(n) to check&quot; (flagged marks, when there are any) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E (the \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003E3D check view\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBefore any PDF is open, the middle shows a short five-step guide.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe wheel zooms at the pointer. Drag to pan. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003EKeyboard and mouse\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhile you use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E, a bar with its controls appears at the top of the sheet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"items-right\"\u003EItems (right)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the top, the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid area\u003C/span\u003E list: the building, floor or phase new marks go in (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EBid areas\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E opens a small form: a name, a type (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear (length)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe list shows each item&#039;s color, type icon, name and quantity. Click an item to draw with it and highlight its marks on every sheet. Click it again to stop highlighting.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder the list, \u003Cstrong\u003EItem: (name)\u003C/strong\u003E is the item editor: name, type, color, unit, height or depth, waste, material and labor rates, the measured values, and the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ECreate takeoff items\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESelected mark\u003C/strong\u003E appears when you select a mark: which item it belongs to, its sheet, its measurements, and buttons such as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a cut-out\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete mark\u003C/span\u003E. With several marks selected it becomes \u003Cstrong\u003ESelected marks\u003C/strong\u003E: how many of each item, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete marks\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe item editor ends with \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy item\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate item\u003C/span\u003E: an item with its assembly and costs, without marks. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003ECopy, paste and duplicate marks\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"quantities-bottom\"\u003EQuantities (bottom)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy item\u003C/span\u003E lists every item and its assembly components with quantity, waste, rates and extended costs. You can type waste and rates straight into the table.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy sheet\u003C/span\u003E lists each item&#039;s quantity on each sheet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA warning starting with \u003Cstrong\u003EIncomplete:\u003C/strong\u003E appears when something is left out of the totals.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E is at the right of the header.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe arrow button at the far right hides or shows the table to give the sheet more room.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/read-quantities\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/read-quantities\"\u003ERead quantities and the estimate\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"status-bar-bottom\"\u003EStatus bar (bottom)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFrom left to right: the live measurement while you draw (length, area, radius or a check result), the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EType\u003C/span\u003E box while you type a length, messages from TakeoffDesk, the reminder &quot;Shift snaps to 45°&quot; (or &quot;Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle&quot; when that is on in \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003ESettings\u003C/a\u003E), the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E button (snapping to the drawing&#039;s lines, on when highlighted; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), and the zoom percentage.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERead the status bar when something does not happen. TakeoffDesk explains there why it refused a click, for example &quot;This sheet has no scale yet&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"other-layouts\"\u003EOther layouts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEverything above is the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk classic\u003C/span\u003E layout, the start. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E offers two more; the same tools and keys work in all three, and picking \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk classic\u003C/span\u003E again puts every control back where it was.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ELayout\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIn TakeoffDesk\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon and project browser\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff ribbon\u003C/span\u003E across the top (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/a\u003E), a bar for the running tool, a tab for each sheet you open (a drawing&#039;s Model and layouts are sheets too) with the scale presets and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit page\u003C/span\u003E under the sheet. The left panel holds \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProperties\u003C/span\u003E (the selected item, note or mark) over the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff browser\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E (click one to open it in a tab), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConditions\u003C/span\u003E (click one to draw with it) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E (each item&#039;s total and the job total); the thumbnails are its second tab.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbox and info box\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe toolbar over the sheet, an info box with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid area\u003C/span\u003E, the running tool or the selection and the sheet bar, a column of the takeoff tools on the left, a tab for every sheet, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E and the zoom under the sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile the \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003E3D check view\u003C/a\u003E is open, the sheet tabs and the bar under the sheet step aside; close the 3D view to measure again. On a phone the phone layout always runs.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"full-screen-and-themes\"\u003EFull screen and themes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull screen\u003C/span\u003E button in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (Control on every platform, also on a Mac), cycles through normal, full screen, and full screen with the bars hidden. With the bars hidden, move the pointer to the top edge to show them again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaper\u003C/span\u003E is the light theme and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E the dark one. In \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModel\u003C/span\u003E the drawing is shown inverted (light lines on dark) on screen only; exports are never changed.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk fills the browser window under the app bar. From top to bottom and left to right: Part Where What it is for App bar Very top The app name, the version, About TakeoffDesk, Help (F1), Save for offline, Settings (Ctrl+,), the Full screen button and the Paper / Model theme switch. Toolbar Under the app bar Every command, in groups: File, Export, Scale, Takeoff, Edit, View. Sheets Left Every page of every open PDF, with a thumbnail, its scale and its mark count. The sheet Middle The open page. You measure here. Items Right Your takeoff items, the selected item's settings, and the selected mark. Quantities Bottom Quantities and costs by item or by sheet, and the job total. Status bar Very bottom The live measurement, messages, the 45° hint and the zoom. The toolbar Hover over any button to see what it does and its key. Group Buttons File New (empty takeoff), Open PDFs (Ctrl+O), Open takeoff (a .takeoff.json project), Save takeoff (Ctrl+S) Export One menu: XLSX, CSV, Marked PDF Scale Calibrate (K), Check (D), and the Preset list Takeoff Select (V), Linear (L), Area (A), Circle (O), Arc (R, an on/off switch), Deduct (E, an on/off switch), Cut-out (X), Count (C), Auto count (S) Edit Undo (Ctrl+Z), Redo (Ctrl+Y), Copy (Ctrl+C), Paste (Ctrl+V), and More: Cut, Copy, Paste, Paste in place, Duplicate, Delete, Select all, Select none View Fit page (F), Fit width (W) The tool you are using is shown pressed. The Arc and Deduct buttons stay pressed while they are on. Sheets (left) Search sheets filters the list by sheet name, file name or page label. Each sheet shows a thumbnail (drawn as you scroll), its name, and either its scale or No scale. The right side of each row shows how many marks the sheet has. While an item is highlighted, it shows how many of that item's marks are on the sheet instead. Click a sheet to open it. Page Down and Page Up move to the next and previous sheet in the list. When a takeoff covers PDFs that are not open, a note under the list names them. See Save and reopen a takeoff. Sheet names come from the PDF: a page label such as A-101 becomes the sheet name. A page with no label is named after its file and page number, like \"Plans, page 3\". With several PDFs open, labeled sheets also show the file name. The sheet (middle) The bar under the sheet shows the sheet name and its scale, or \"No scale yet: pick a preset or calibrate\". Its buttons: MarkupCraft (when that app can take the PDF; see Start a takeoff and open a plan set), Compare (an older version of the sheet over this one: Compare a revised sheet), \"(n) to check\" (flagged marks, when there are any) and 3D (the 3D check view). Before any PDF is open, the middle shows a short five-step guide. The wheel zooms at the pointer. Drag to pan. See Keyboard and mouse. While you use Auto count, a bar with its controls appears at the top of the sheet. Items (right) At the top, the Bid area list: the building, floor or phase new marks go in (Bid areas). New item opens a small form: a name, a type (Linear (length), Area or Count) and Add. The list shows each item's color, type icon, name and quantity. Click an item to draw with it and highlight its marks on every sheet. Click it again to stop highlighting. Under the list, Item: (name) is the item editor: name, type, color, unit, height or depth, waste, material and labor rates, the measured values, and the Assembly. See Create takeoff items. Selected mark appears when you select a mark: which item it belongs to, its sheet, its measurements, and buttons such as Add a cut-out and Delete mark. With several marks selected it becomes Selected marks: how many of each item, and Copy, Duplicate, Cut and Delete marks. The item editor ends with Copy item and Duplicate item: an item with its assembly and costs, without marks. See Copy, paste and duplicate marks. Quantities (bottom) By item lists every item and its assembly components with quantity, waste, rates and extended costs. You can type waste and rates straight into the table. By sheet lists each item's quantity on each sheet. A warning starting with Incomplete: appears when something is left out of the totals. Job total is at the right of the header. The arrow button at the far right hides or shows the table to give the sheet more room. See Read quantities and the estimate. Status bar (bottom) From left to right: the live measurement while you draw (length, area, radius or a check result), the Type box while you type a length, messages from TakeoffDesk, the reminder \"Shift snaps to 45°\" (or \"Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle\" when that is on in Settings), the Snap button (snapping to the drawing's lines, on when highlighted; F3), and the zoom percentage. Read the status bar when something does not happen. TakeoffDesk explains there why it refused a click, for example \"This sheet has no scale yet\". Other layouts Everything above is the TakeoffDesk classic layout, the start. Settings (Ctrl+,) › Global › Layout offers two more; the same tools and keys work in all three, and picking TakeoffDesk classic again puts every control back where it was. Layout In TakeoffDesk Ribbon and project browser The Takeoff ribbon across the top (Menus, keys and mouse), a bar for the running tool, a tab for each sheet you open (a drawing's Model and layouts are sheets too) with the scale presets and Fit page under the sheet. The left panel holds Properties (the selected item, note or mark) over the Takeoff browser: Sheets (click one to open it in a tab), Conditions (click one to draw with it) and Estimate (each item's total and the job total); the thumbnails are its second tab. Toolbox and info box The toolbar over the sheet, an info box with the Bid area, the running tool or the selection and the sheet bar, a column of the takeoff tools on the left, a tab for every sheet, and Snap and the zoom under the sheet. While the 3D check view is open, the sheet tabs and the bar under the sheet step aside; close the 3D view to measure again. On a phone the phone layout always runs. Full screen and themes The Full screen button in the app bar, or Ctrl+Shift+F (Control on every platform, also on a Mac), cycles through normal, full screen, and full screen with the bars hidden. With the bars hidden, move the pointer to the top edge to show them again. Paper is the light theme and Model the dark one. In Model the drawing is shown inverted (light lines on dark) on screen only; exports are never changed.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"files","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Files TakeoffDesk opens and saves","summary":"PDFs in, a takeoff project file, spreadsheets and marked PDFs out - what each holds, where it goes, and what changes online, offline and between browsers.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["files","formats","pdf","takeoff.json","project file","xlsx","csv","marked pdf","download","save","open","offline"],"headings":[{"id":"what-it-opens","text":"What it opens","level":2},{"id":"what-it-saves","text":"What it saves","level":2},{"id":"where-downloads-go","text":"Where downloads go","level":2},{"id":"why-the-project-file-and-the-pdfs-are-separate","text":"Why the project file and the PDFs are separate","level":2},{"id":"online-and-offline","text":"Online and offline","level":2},{"id":"spreadsheets","text":"Spreadsheets","level":2},{"id":"desktop-and-cloud","text":"Desktop and cloud","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-opens\"\u003EWhat it opens\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFile\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHow\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENotes\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF (\u003Ccode\u003E.pdf\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, or drop on the page\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESeveral at once. Each page becomes a sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoff project (\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen takeoff\u003C/span\u003E, or drop on the page\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYour items, scales and marks. You can drop it together with its PDFs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOther files dropped on the page are skipped, and the status bar names them.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPassword-protected PDFs\u003C/strong\u003E do not open: &quot;(name) is password-protected. Open an unprotected copy.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe same PDF twice\u003C/strong\u003E is opened once: &quot;(name) is already open.&quot; TakeoffDesk knows files by their contents, not their names.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EScanned PDFs\u003C/strong\u003E open and measure like any other; TakeoffDesk does not need the text in the PDF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELarge plan sets\u003C/strong\u003E: every PDF is read in full when it opens (to fingerprint it), so a very large file takes a moment. Thumbnails are drawn one at a time as you scroll.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-saves\"\u003EWhat it saves\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery save is a download. Nothing is written back into your PDFs.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYou choose\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYou get\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat is in it\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItems, assemblies, rates, sheet scales and every mark, keyed to each PDF by its contents. No PDF pages.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFour worksheets: Estimate (with live formulas), By sheet, Marks, Scales.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).csv\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe estimate as plain values, one row per item and component.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(PDF name) (takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA copy of each open PDF that has marks, with the takeoff drawn on its pages and a legend. One file per PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe name is taken from the first PDF you opened in this takeoff. There is no rename box yet: rename the downloaded file if you want another name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EExport the estimate and a marked PDF\u003C/a\u003E and \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003EExport columns\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-downloads-go\"\u003EWhere downloads go\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour browser saves them where it saves every download, usually the Downloads folder. Find it in \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Eyour file manager\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E. If your browser is set to ask where to save each file, it asks.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E with several marked PDFs downloads several files at once. Chrome and Edge may ask once whether this site may download multiple files. Choose Allow.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari saves to Downloads unless you changed the download location in Safari Settings, under General.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-the-project-file-and-the-pdfs-are-separate\"\u003EWhy the project file and the PDFs are separate\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E file holds only your takeoff. It finds its PDFs again by their contents (a fingerprint of each file), so:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERenaming or moving a PDF does not matter.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA PDF that was changed or saved again by another program counts as a different file, even with the same name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarks on PDFs that are not open still count in the totals.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ESave and reopen a takeoff\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"online-and-offline\"\u003EOnline and offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour PDFs and takeoffs never leave your computer, online or offline. The connection matters only for loading TakeoffDesk itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo work with no connection, save the app first, while you are online:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar at the top. The button counts up, &quot;Saving 12 of 40&quot;, while it saves.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWait for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESaving TakeoffDesk keeps the app, this help, the PDF reader, the PDF writer used by \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E and the auto count worker in your browser, about 6 MB. Once it says \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E, everything works offline: opening PDFs, measuring, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EThe button says\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeaning\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot saved in this browser yet. Choose it to save.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaving (n) of (m)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaving now.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaved. Choose it for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave again (get the newest version)\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove the offline copy\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECould not save\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESome files did not download. Check your connection and choose it again.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline not available\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThis browser window cannot keep an offline copy (private windows and some managed computers block it).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMore, including how long a saved copy lasts in each browser: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EWorking offline\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou are offline. If the app bar shows \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E, everything works. If it does not, the parts TakeoffDesk has not loaded yet in this tab (the PDF writer for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E, the auto count worker) cannot load now, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E stops with &quot;The marked PDF could not be written&quot;. Your takeoff is safe either way: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E need no connection. Do not reload the tab until you are online again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:online\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOnline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou are online. Before a site visit or a flight, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E and wait for \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spreadsheets\"\u003ESpreadsheets\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe XLSX keeps live formulas, so a spreadsheet program recalculates the estimate when it opens the file and keeps it right when you change a rate or waste there. The workbook has been checked in LibreOffice Calc, which recalculated every total to the same cent. It has not been opened in Excel yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe CSV is plain values with a byte order mark, so spreadsheet programs read characters such as m² correctly.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"desktop-and-cloud\"\u003EDesktop and cloud\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"shell:desktop\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EDesktop app\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk runs in the browser; there is no installer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECloud saving is not available yet. Keep your \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E files with the job&#039;s PDFs, and back them up like any other file. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EWhere your files go\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What it opens File How Notes PDF (.pdf) Open plans, Ctrl+O, or drop on the page Several at once. Each page becomes a sheet. Takeoff project (.takeoff.json) Open takeoff, or drop on the page Your items, scales and marks. You can drop it together with its PDFs. Other files dropped on the page are skipped, and the status bar names them. Password-protected PDFs do not open: \"(name) is password-protected. Open an unprotected copy.\" The same PDF twice is opened once: \"(name) is already open.\" TakeoffDesk knows files by their contents, not their names. Scanned PDFs open and measure like any other; TakeoffDesk does not need the text in the PDF. Large plan sets: every PDF is read in full when it opens (to fingerprint it), so a very large file takes a moment. Thumbnails are drawn one at a time as you scroll. What it saves Every save is a download. Nothing is written back into your PDFs. You choose You get What is in it Save takeoff (name).takeoff.json Items, assemblies, rates, sheet scales and every mark, keyed to each PDF by its contents. No PDF pages. XLSX (name).xlsx Four worksheets: Estimate (with live formulas), By sheet, Marks, Scales. CSV (name).csv The estimate as plain values, one row per item and component. Marked PDF (PDF name) (takeoff).pdf A copy of each open PDF that has marks, with the takeoff drawn on its pages and a legend. One file per PDF. The name is taken from the first PDF you opened in this takeoff. There is no rename box yet: rename the downloaded file if you want another name. See Export the estimate and a marked PDF and Export columns. Where downloads go Your browser saves them where it saves every download, usually the Downloads folder. Find it in Finder / File Explorer / your file manager. If your browser is set to ask where to save each file, it asks. Marked PDF with several marked PDFs downloads several files at once. Chrome and Edge may ask once whether this site may download multiple files. Choose Allow. Safari saves to Downloads unless you changed the download location in Safari Settings, under General. Why the project file and the PDFs are separate The .takeoff.json file holds only your takeoff. It finds its PDFs again by their contents (a fingerprint of each file), so: Renaming or moving a PDF does not matter. A PDF that was changed or saved again by another program counts as a different file, even with the same name. Marks on PDFs that are not open still count in the totals. See Save and reopen a takeoff. Online and offline Your PDFs and takeoffs never leave your computer, online or offline. The connection matters only for loading TakeoffDesk itself. To work with no connection, save the app first, while you are online: Choose Save for offline in the app bar at the top. The button counts up, \"Saving 12 of 40\", while it saves. Wait for Offline ready. Saving TakeoffDesk keeps the app, this help, the PDF reader, the PDF writer used by Marked PDF and the auto count worker in your browser, about 6 MB. Once it says Offline ready, everything works offline: opening PDFs, measuring, Auto count, Save takeoff, XLSX, CSV and Marked PDF. The button says Meaning Save for offline Not saved in this browser yet. Choose it to save. Saving (n) of (m) Saving now. Offline ready Saved. Choose it for Save again (get the newest version) or Remove the offline copy. Could not save Some files did not download. Check your connection and choose it again. Offline not available This browser window cannot keep an offline copy (private windows and some managed computers block it). More, including how long a saved copy lasts in each browser: Working offline. You are offline. If the app bar shows Offline ready, everything works. If it does not, the parts TakeoffDesk has not loaded yet in this tab (the PDF writer for Marked PDF, the auto count worker) cannot load now, and Marked PDF stops with \"The marked PDF could not be written\". Your takeoff is safe either way: Save takeoff, XLSX and CSV need no connection. Do not reload the tab until you are online again. You are online. Before a site visit or a flight, choose Save for offline and wait for Offline ready. Spreadsheets The XLSX keeps live formulas, so a spreadsheet program recalculates the estimate when it opens the file and keeps it right when you change a rate or waste there. The workbook has been checked in LibreOffice Calc, which recalculated every total to the same cent. It has not been opened in Excel yet. The CSV is plain values with a byte order mark, so spreadsheet programs read characters such as m² correctly. Desktop and cloud TakeoffDesk runs in the browser; there is no installer. Cloud saving is not available yet. Keep your .takeoff.json files with the job's PDFs, and back them up like any other file. See Where your files go.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"open-plan-set","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"\"Hajmni boshlash va reja toʻplamini ochish\"","summary":"\"Bir yoki bir nechta PDF ni reja toʻplami sifatida oching, varaqlar boʻylab yoʻl toping va ular orasida oʻting.\"","section":"tasks","order":10,"keywords":["ochish","reja toʻplami","bir nechta pdf","bir nechta fayl","varaqlar","chizmalar","sahifa belgilari","varaqlar roʻyxati","yoʻl topish","tashlash","uzatish","boshqa ilovada ochish","belgilash"],"headings":[{"id":"pdf-larni-ochish","text":"PDF larni ochish","level":2},{"id":"chizmalar-pdf-yonida","text":"Chizmalar PDF yonida","level":2},{"id":"boshqa-ilovadan-uzatilgan-pdf","text":"Boshqa ilovadan uzatilgan PDF","level":2},{"id":"varaqni-topish","text":"Varaqni topish","level":2},{"id":"varaqlar-qanday-nomlanadi","text":"Varaqlar qanday nomlanadi","level":2},{"id":"varaq-atrofida-harakatlanish","text":"Varaq atrofida harakatlanish","level":2},{"id":"keyingisi","text":"Keyingisi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EReja toʻplami koʻpincha bir nechta PDF boʻladi: arxitektura, konstruksiya, mexanika. TakeoffDesk ularni varaqlarning yagona roʻyxati sifatida yonma-yon ochadi va bitta hajm butun toʻplamni qamrab oladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pdf-larni-ochish\"\u003EPDF larni ochish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E guruhida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERejalarni ochish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing. (Boshqa menyu uslublarida u \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDFlarni ochish…\u003C/span\u003E deb ataladi.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFayl oynasida toʻplamning har bir PDF ini tanlang. Bir nechtasini tanlash uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003ECommand\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E ni ushlab turing, yoki oraliqni tanlash uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOchish ni tanlang. Har bir fayl oʻqilayotganda “(name) ochilmoqda…” xabari koʻrinadi. Keyin har bir sahifa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVaraqlar\u003C/span\u003E ostida paydo boʻladi va yangi birinchi PDF ning birinchi sahifasi ochiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPDF larni \u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EFinder\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows\" title=\"Windows\"\u003EFile Explorer\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:linux\" title=\"Linux\"\u003Efayl menejeringiz\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E dan sudrab, TakeoffDesk ustiga istalgan joyga tashlashingiz ham mumkin. Sudrash paytida “PDF, DWG yoki DXF chizmalarini yoki .takeoff.json faylini tashlang” ramkasi paydo boʻladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKeyinroq yana PDF qoʻshish uchun xuddi shuni qayta bajaring. Allaqachon ochiq PDF lar oʻtkazib yuboriladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoshlash ekrani yaqinda ochgan PDF va hajmlaringizni ham koʻrsatadi — sahifaga faylni qayta ochishga ruxsat beradigan brauzerlarda (Chrome va Edge). Birini bosib oching; brauzer avval ruxsat soʻrashi mumkin. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EFayllaringiz\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHech narsa yuklanmaydi. Brauzer PDF larni kompyuteringizdan oʻqiydi va siz yorliqni yopganingizda yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYangi\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlaganingizda ular TakeoffDesk dan yoʻqoladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chizmalar-pdf-yonida\"\u003EChizmalar PDF yonida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERejalarni ochish\u003C/span\u003E DWG va DXF chizmalarini ham oladi, yakka holda yoki PDF lar bilan birga: har bir chizmaning model maydoni va maketlari xuddi shu roʻyxatda varaqlarga aylanadi. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EDWG yoki DXF chizmasini ochish\u003C/a\u003E, keyin \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EChizmadan sanash\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"boshqa-ilovadan-uzatilgan-pdf\"\u003EBoshqa ilovadan uzatilgan PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EToʻplamdagi boshqa ilova ochiq turgan PDF ni uzatishi mumkin: u TakeoffDesk ni yangi yorliqda ochadi va PDF u yerda xuddi siz uni tashlaganingizdek ochiladi. Holat satri “Ochildi: (name). Uzatuvchi ilova: (app). Asl fayl oʻzgarmagan.” deb yozadi. Hech narsa yuklanmaydi: fayl shu brauzerning oʻz xotirasi orqali oʻtadi va ochilgach undan yoʻqoladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAgar holat satri PDF “yetib kelmadi” deb yozsa, yorliq juda uzoq kutgan yoki PDF boshqa yorliqda allaqachon ochilgan boʻlgan: uni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERejalarni ochish\u003C/span\u003E bilan oching.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETeskarisi: MarkupCraft siz turgan joyda ishlayotgan va faylni qabul qila olganda, chizma ostidagi varaq paneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/span\u003E tugmasiga ega: u ekrandagi varaqning PDF ini MarkupCraft da yangi yorliqda ochadi, koʻrib chiqish va belgilash uchun.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"varaqni-topish\"\u003EVaraqni topish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChapdagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVaraqlar\u003C/span\u003E roʻyxatini aylantiring va varaqni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERoʻyxat tepasidagi \u003Cstrong\u003EVaraqlarni qidirish\u003C/strong\u003E ga yozing: varaq raqami, fayl nomi yoki sahifa belgisi boʻyicha filtrlash uchun. Filtr yoqilgan paytda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVaraqlar\u003C/span\u003E yonidagi hisoblagich “40 tadan 3” koʻrsatadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKeyingi varaq uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, oldingisi uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing. Ular filtrlangan roʻyxat boʻyicha harakatlanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPage Up va Page Down tugmalari boʻlmagan Mac klaviaturasida fn ni yuqori yoki pastki strelka bilan birga bosing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"varaqlar-qanday-nomlanadi\"\u003EVaraqlar qanday nomlanadi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPDF unga belgi bergan sahifa, masalan \u003Ccode\u003EA-101\u003C/code\u003E, shu belgi bilan nomlanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBelgisi yoʻq sahifa (yoki faqat sahifa raqamidan iborat belgi) “(file name), sahifa (n)” deb nomlanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBir nechta PDF ochiq boʻlganda, belgilangan varaqlarda fayl nomi ham boʻladi: “A-101 — Arxitektura”.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVaraq nomlarini hozircha qoʻlda kiritib boʻlmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"varaq-atrofida-harakatlanish\"\u003EVaraq atrofida harakatlanish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESichqoncha gʻildiragini aylantiring: kattalashtirish kursor turgan joyda boʻladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESurish uchun chap yoki oʻrta tugma bilan suring. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAvtosanash\u003C/span\u003E bilan yoki belgining burchagidan boshlaganingizda, sudrash paytida \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni ushlab turing yoki oʻrta tugma bilan suring.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EButun varaqni koʻrish uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESahifaga moslash\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang; uning kengligiga moslash uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKenglikka moslash\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKattalashtirish uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"=\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, kichraytirish uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing; koʻrinishning oʻrtasi atrofida.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir varaq ochiq turguncha oʻz kattalashtirishi va joylashuvini eslab qoladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"keyingisi\"\u003EKeyingisi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVaraqni oʻlchashdan oldin unga masshtab kerak: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EMasshtabni belgilash\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Reja toʻplami koʻpincha bir nechta PDF boʻladi: arxitektura, konstruksiya, mexanika. TakeoffDesk ularni varaqlarning yagona roʻyxati sifatida yonma-yon ochadi va bitta hajm butun toʻplamni qamrab oladi. PDF larni ochish Fayl guruhida Rejalarni ochish ni tanlang yoki Ctrl+O ni bosing. (Boshqa menyu uslublarida u PDFlarni ochish… deb ataladi.) Fayl oynasida toʻplamning har bir PDF ini tanlang. Bir nechtasini tanlash uchun Command / Ctrl / Ctrl ni ushlab turing, yoki oraliqni tanlash uchun Shift ni. Ochish ni tanlang. Har bir fayl oʻqilayotganda “(name) ochilmoqda…” xabari koʻrinadi. Keyin har bir sahifa Varaqlar ostida paydo boʻladi va yangi birinchi PDF ning birinchi sahifasi ochiladi. PDF larni Finder / File Explorer / fayl menejeringiz dan sudrab, TakeoffDesk ustiga istalgan joyga tashlashingiz ham mumkin. Sudrash paytida “PDF, DWG yoki DXF chizmalarini yoki .takeoff.json faylini tashlang” ramkasi paydo boʻladi. Keyinroq yana PDF qoʻshish uchun xuddi shuni qayta bajaring. Allaqachon ochiq PDF lar oʻtkazib yuboriladi. Boshlash ekrani yaqinda ochgan PDF va hajmlaringizni ham koʻrsatadi — sahifaga faylni qayta ochishga ruxsat beradigan brauzerlarda (Chrome va Edge). Birini bosib oching; brauzer avval ruxsat soʻrashi mumkin. Qarang: Fayllaringiz. Hech narsa yuklanmaydi. Brauzer PDF larni kompyuteringizdan oʻqiydi va siz yorliqni yopganingizda yoki Yangi ni tanlaganingizda ular TakeoffDesk dan yoʻqoladi. Chizmalar PDF yonida Rejalarni ochish DWG va DXF chizmalarini ham oladi, yakka holda yoki PDF lar bilan birga: har bir chizmaning model maydoni va maketlari xuddi shu roʻyxatda varaqlarga aylanadi. Qarang: DWG yoki DXF chizmasini ochish, keyin Chizmadan sanash. Boshqa ilovadan uzatilgan PDF Toʻplamdagi boshqa ilova ochiq turgan PDF ni uzatishi mumkin: u TakeoffDesk ni yangi yorliqda ochadi va PDF u yerda xuddi siz uni tashlaganingizdek ochiladi. Holat satri “Ochildi: (name). Uzatuvchi ilova: (app). Asl fayl oʻzgarmagan.” deb yozadi. Hech narsa yuklanmaydi: fayl shu brauzerning oʻz xotirasi orqali oʻtadi va ochilgach undan yoʻqoladi. Agar holat satri PDF “yetib kelmadi” deb yozsa, yorliq juda uzoq kutgan yoki PDF boshqa yorliqda allaqachon ochilgan boʻlgan: uni Rejalarni ochish bilan oching. Teskarisi: MarkupCraft siz turgan joyda ishlayotgan va faylni qabul qila olganda, chizma ostidagi varaq paneli MarkupCraft tugmasiga ega: u ekrandagi varaqning PDF ini MarkupCraft da yangi yorliqda ochadi, koʻrib chiqish va belgilash uchun. Varaqni topish Chapdagi Varaqlar roʻyxatini aylantiring va varaqni bosing. Roʻyxat tepasidagi Varaqlarni qidirish ga yozing: varaq raqami, fayl nomi yoki sahifa belgisi boʻyicha filtrlash uchun. Filtr yoqilgan paytda Varaqlar yonidagi hisoblagich “40 tadan 3” koʻrsatadi. Keyingi varaq uchun Page Down, oldingisi uchun Page Up ni bosing. Ular filtrlangan roʻyxat boʻyicha harakatlanadi. Page Up va Page Down tugmalari boʻlmagan Mac klaviaturasida fn ni yuqori yoki pastki strelka bilan birga bosing. Varaqlar qanday nomlanadi PDF unga belgi bergan sahifa, masalan A-101, shu belgi bilan nomlanadi. Belgisi yoʻq sahifa (yoki faqat sahifa raqamidan iborat belgi) “(file name), sahifa (n)” deb nomlanadi. Bir nechta PDF ochiq boʻlganda, belgilangan varaqlarda fayl nomi ham boʻladi: “A-101 — Arxitektura”. Varaq nomlarini hozircha qoʻlda kiritib boʻlmaydi. Varaq atrofida harakatlanish Sichqoncha gʻildiragini aylantiring: kattalashtirish kursor turgan joyda boʻladi. Surish uchun chap yoki oʻrta tugma bilan suring. Avtosanash bilan yoki belgining burchagidan boshlaganingizda, sudrash paytida Space ni ushlab turing yoki oʻrta tugma bilan suring. Butun varaqni koʻrish uchun F ni bosing yoki Sahifaga moslash ni tanlang; uning kengligiga moslash uchun W yoki Kenglikka moslash. Kattalashtirish uchun + yoki =, kichraytirish uchun − ni bosing; koʻrinishning oʻrtasi atrofida. Har bir varaq ochiq turguncha oʻz kattalashtirishi va joylashuvini eslab qoladi. Keyingisi Varaqni oʻlchashdan oldin unga masshtab kerak: Masshtabni belgilash.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"open-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"\"DWG yoki DXF chizmasini ochish\"","summary":"\"Chizma faylini varaqlar sifatida oching (model maydoni va har bir maket), chizma bergan masshtab bilan boshlang, uning qatlamlarini koʻrsating yoki yashiring va bogʻlangan chizmalarni kiriting.\"","section":"tasks","order":12,"keywords":["dwg","dxf","cad","chizma","chizmani ochish","maketlar","model maydoni","qogʻoz maydoni","varaqlar","birliklar","insunits","koʻrinish oynasi masshtabi","xref","bogʻlangan chizma","qatlamlar","muzlatilgan","PDF siz","chop etish","chop etmasdan"],"headings":[{"id":"chizmani-ochish","text":"Chizmani ochish","level":2},{"id":"varaqlar","text":"Varaqlar","level":2},{"id":"masshtab","text":"Masshtab","level":2},{"id":"qatlamlar","text":"Qatlamlar","level":2},{"id":"bog-langan-chizmalar-xref","text":"Bogʻlangan chizmalar (xref)","level":2},{"id":"cheklovlar","text":"Cheklovlar","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk DWG yoki DXF chizmasini PDF kabi ochadi: uni avval PDF ga chop etishingiz shart emas. Chizmaning oʻzidan sanash aniq, chunki chizma har bir obyekt nima ekanligini biladi. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EChizmadan sanash\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chizmani-ochish\"\u003EChizmani ochish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E guruhida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERejalarni ochish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDWG yoki DXF faylini tanlang. Bir nechtasini, shuningdek PDF lar bilan birga tanlashingiz mumkin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOchish ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChizma fayllarini PDF lar kabi TakeoffDesk ustiga ham tashlashingiz mumkin. Hech narsa yuklanmaydi: brauzer faylni kompyuteringizdan oʻqiydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk AutoCAD 2000 dan 2018 gacha boʻlgan DWG ni va R12 dan 2018 gacha boʻlgan ASCII DXF ni oʻqiydi. U ikkilik DXF ni (uni ASCII yoki DWG sifatida saqlang) va ikkalasi ham boʻlmagan faylni rad etadi va sababini aytadi. Shikastlangan fayl oʻqilgan qismi bilan ochiladi va xabar buni aytadi; uning sanoqlari toʻliq boʻlmasligi mumkin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"varaqlar\"\u003EVaraqlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel\u003C/strong\u003E — chizmaning model maydoni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHar bir maket\u003C/strong\u003E (qogʻoz maydoni varaqchasi) — varaq, uning varaqchasi nomi bilan, varaqchalar tartibida. Maket modelni oʻzining koʻrinish oynalari orqali koʻrsatadi, xuddi chop etilgandek.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKattalashtirish, surish, chizmaning oʻz chiziqlariga tutib olish, belgilar, izohlar, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibrlash\u003C/span\u003E va qolganlari PDF dagidek ishlaydi. Chizmaning varaqlari hajmda fayl nomi va mazmun izi orqali PDF kabi saqlanadi: xuddi shu faylni qayta oching — belgilar oʻz varaqlarida boʻladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"masshtab\"\u003EMasshtab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVaraq chizma bergan masshtab bilan boshlanadi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaket\u003C/strong\u003E oʻzining eng katta koʻrinish oynasi masshtabini oladi. 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; kabi masshtab oʻzi boʻlgan oldindan oʻrnatilgan nom bilan ataladi; boshqasi “Chizmaning koʻrinish oynasidan: 1&quot; = 2.5&#039;&quot;” koʻrinishida chiqadi. Agar maketda boshqa masshtabdagi koʻrinish oynalari boʻlsa, eng kattasi varaq masshtabini belgilaydi: qolganlarini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETekshirish\u003C/span\u003E bilan tekshiring.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel\u003C/strong\u003E chizmaning birliklarini (dyuym, millimetr, fut…) masshtab sifatida oladi: “Chizma birliklari (dyuym)”.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBirliklari yoʻq chizma\u003C/strong\u003E (chizma birlik dyuym yoki millimetr ekanligini hech qachon aytmagan) masshtabga ega emas: varaqda “Masshtab yoʻq” yoziladi va uni oʻlchashga rad etiladi, xuddi masshtabsiz PDF dagidek. Sanash masshtabni talab qilmaydi. Unga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibrlash\u003C/span\u003E bilan masshtab bering.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibrlash\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETekshirish\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOldindan oʻrnatilgan\u003C/span\u003E roʻyxati masshtabni istalgan vaqtda oʻzgartiradi va chizmanikidan ustun boʻladi. Oldindan oʻrnatilgan roʻyxat Model da oʻchirilgan, chunki u qogʻoz oʻlchamiga ega emas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qatlamlar\"\u003EQatlamlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVaraq panelidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQatlamlar\u003C/span\u003E chizmaning qatlamlarini, har birida shu varaqda nechta obyekt borligi bilan koʻrsatadi. Fayl oʻchirgan yoki muzlatgan qatlamlar yashirin holda boshlanadi. Qatlamni yashirish uchun belgisini olib tashlang, yashirin qatlamni koʻrsatish uchun esa belgilang: varaq qayta chiziladi, yashirilgan narsalar sanoqlardan va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChizmani oʻlchash\u003C/span\u003E uchun taklif qilinadigan obyektlardan chiqariladi, agar yashirin qatlamlarni ham sanashni soʻramasangiz. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHammasini koʻrsatish\u003C/span\u003E har bir qatlamni koʻrsatadi; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayldagi qatlamlarga qaytarish\u003C/span\u003E oʻzgartirishlaringizni bekor qiladi. Qatlam tanlovlari shu seansga tegishli, hajm fayliga emas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bog-langan-chizmalar-xref\"\u003EBogʻlangan chizmalar (xref)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoshqa chizmalarni bogʻlagan chizma ularni joylashtirilgan joyda koʻrsatadi. TakeoffDesk bogʻlangan chizmani \u003Cstrong\u003Eochiq fayllar\u003C/strong\u003E orasidan fayl nomi boʻyicha topadi: asosiy chizmani va uning bogʻlangan chizmasini birga (yoki ketma-ket) oching. Shunga qadar holat satri nechta bogʻlangan chizma topilmaganini koʻrsatadi, ularning chizgan narsalari yetishmaydi va sanoqlar buni aytadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"cheklovlar\"\u003ECheklovlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETakeoffDesk oʻqiy olmaydigan yoki joylashtira olmaydigan obyektlar (proksi obyektlar, nomaʼlum sinflar) sanash oynasida tur boʻyicha roʻyxatga olinadi; ular hech qanday xabarsiz tashlanmaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJuda katta chizmalar qisman chiziladi, sanoqlar chegaraga yetganda toʻxtaydi va buni aytadi. Bunday chizmaning oʻrniga uning PDF chop etilgan nusxasini oching.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChizma qora rangda va oʻz ranglarida, oq qogʻoz uchun qoraytirilgan holda chiziladi. Chop etish uslubi jadvallari va qalam tayinlashlari qoʻllanmaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk DWG yoki DXF chizmasini PDF kabi ochadi: uni avval PDF ga chop etishingiz shart emas. Chizmaning oʻzidan sanash aniq, chunki chizma har bir obyekt nima ekanligini biladi. Qarang: Chizmadan sanash. Chizmani ochish Fayl guruhida Rejalarni ochish ni tanlang yoki Ctrl+O ni bosing. DWG yoki DXF faylini tanlang. Bir nechtasini, shuningdek PDF lar bilan birga tanlashingiz mumkin. Ochish ni tanlang. Chizma fayllarini PDF lar kabi TakeoffDesk ustiga ham tashlashingiz mumkin. Hech narsa yuklanmaydi: brauzer faylni kompyuteringizdan oʻqiydi. TakeoffDesk AutoCAD 2000 dan 2018 gacha boʻlgan DWG ni va R12 dan 2018 gacha boʻlgan ASCII DXF ni oʻqiydi. U ikkilik DXF ni (uni ASCII yoki DWG sifatida saqlang) va ikkalasi ham boʻlmagan faylni rad etadi va sababini aytadi. Shikastlangan fayl oʻqilgan qismi bilan ochiladi va xabar buni aytadi; uning sanoqlari toʻliq boʻlmasligi mumkin. Varaqlar Model — chizmaning model maydoni. Har bir maket (qogʻoz maydoni varaqchasi) — varaq, uning varaqchasi nomi bilan, varaqchalar tartibida. Maket modelni oʻzining koʻrinish oynalari orqali koʻrsatadi, xuddi chop etilgandek. Kattalashtirish, surish, chizmaning oʻz chiziqlariga tutib olish, belgilar, izohlar, Kalibrlash va qolganlari PDF dagidek ishlaydi. Chizmaning varaqlari hajmda fayl nomi va mazmun izi orqali PDF kabi saqlanadi: xuddi shu faylni qayta oching — belgilar oʻz varaqlarida boʻladi. Masshtab Varaq chizma bergan masshtab bilan boshlanadi: Maket oʻzining eng katta koʻrinish oynasi masshtabini oladi. 1/2\" = 1'-0\" kabi masshtab oʻzi boʻlgan oldindan oʻrnatilgan nom bilan ataladi; boshqasi “Chizmaning koʻrinish oynasidan: 1\" = 2.5'\"” koʻrinishida chiqadi. Agar maketda boshqa masshtabdagi koʻrinish oynalari boʻlsa, eng kattasi varaq masshtabini belgilaydi: qolganlarini Tekshirish bilan tekshiring. Model chizmaning birliklarini (dyuym, millimetr, fut…) masshtab sifatida oladi: “Chizma birliklari (dyuym)”. Birliklari yoʻq chizma (chizma birlik dyuym yoki millimetr ekanligini hech qachon aytmagan) masshtabga ega emas: varaqda “Masshtab yoʻq” yoziladi va uni oʻlchashga rad etiladi, xuddi masshtabsiz PDF dagidek. Sanash masshtabni talab qilmaydi. Unga Kalibrlash bilan masshtab bering. Kalibrlash, Tekshirish va Oldindan oʻrnatilgan roʻyxati masshtabni istalgan vaqtda oʻzgartiradi va chizmanikidan ustun boʻladi. Oldindan oʻrnatilgan roʻyxat Model da oʻchirilgan, chunki u qogʻoz oʻlchamiga ega emas. Qatlamlar Varaq panelidagi Qatlamlar chizmaning qatlamlarini, har birida shu varaqda nechta obyekt borligi bilan koʻrsatadi. Fayl oʻchirgan yoki muzlatgan qatlamlar yashirin holda boshlanadi. Qatlamni yashirish uchun belgisini olib tashlang, yashirin qatlamni koʻrsatish uchun esa belgilang: varaq qayta chiziladi, yashirilgan narsalar sanoqlardan va Chizmani oʻlchash uchun taklif qilinadigan obyektlardan chiqariladi, agar yashirin qatlamlarni ham sanashni soʻramasangiz. Hammasini koʻrsatish har bir qatlamni koʻrsatadi; Fayldagi qatlamlarga qaytarish oʻzgartirishlaringizni bekor qiladi. Qatlam tanlovlari shu seansga tegishli, hajm fayliga emas. Bogʻlangan chizmalar (xref) Boshqa chizmalarni bogʻlagan chizma ularni joylashtirilgan joyda koʻrsatadi. TakeoffDesk bogʻlangan chizmani ochiq fayllar orasidan fayl nomi boʻyicha topadi: asosiy chizmani va uning bogʻlangan chizmasini birga (yoki ketma-ket) oching. Shunga qadar holat satri nechta bogʻlangan chizma topilmaganini koʻrsatadi, ularning chizgan narsalari yetishmaydi va sanoqlar buni aytadi. Cheklovlar TakeoffDesk oʻqiy olmaydigan yoki joylashtira olmaydigan obyektlar (proksi obyektlar, nomaʼlum sinflar) sanash oynasida tur boʻyicha roʻyxatga olinadi; ular hech qanday xabarsiz tashlanmaydi. Juda katta chizmalar qisman chiziladi, sanoqlar chegaraga yetganda toʻxtaydi va buni aytadi. Bunday chizmaning oʻrniga uning PDF chop etilgan nusxasini oching. Chizma qora rangda va oʻz ranglarida, oq qogʻoz uchun qoraytirilgan holda chiziladi. Chop etish uslubi jadvallari va qalam tayinlashlari qoʻllanmaydi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"open-an-ifc-file","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"\"IFC 4.3 faylidan miqdorlarni olish\"","summary":"\"Yoʻl, temir yoʻl, koʻprik yoki yer ishlari IFC 4.3 faylini oching va har bir klass boʻyicha sanoqni hamda fayl bayon qilgan uzunlik, maydon va hajmlarni tipli miqdorlar sifatida oling.\"","section":"tasks","order":13,"keywords":["ifc","ifc4x3","ifc 4.3","yoʻl","temir yoʻl","koʻprik","yoʻl qoplamasi","bordyur","qatlam","yer ishlari","tayanch","infratuzilma","miqdorlar","bim","fuqarolik","tipli miqdorlar"],"headings":[{"id":"faylni-ochish","text":"Faylni ochish","level":2},{"id":"nima-qilmaydi","text":"Nima qilmaydi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIFC 4.3 fayli yoʻllar, temir yoʻllar, koʻpriklar, dengiz inshootlari va ularning qismlarini saqlashi mumkin: qoplamalar, qatlamlar, bordyurlar, relslar, yer ishlari, tayanchlar, qoziqlar va boshqalar. TakeoffDesk ularni oʻqiydi va narxlash mumkin boʻlgan tipli miqdorlarga aylantiradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"faylni-ochish\"\u003EFaylni ochish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E guruhida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERejalarni ochish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIFC faylini tanlang (uni PDF lar bilan birga tanlashingiz mumkin) yoki uni TakeoffDesk ustiga tashlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir klass va oldindan belgilangan tur uchun bitta tipli miqdor yaratiladi, masalan “Yoʻl qoplamasi (egiluvchan): sanoq”, va fayl ularni bayon qilganda — “uzunlik” m da, “maydon” m² da va “hajm” m³ da. Har bir elementdagi izoh nechta element sanalganini va nechtasi miqdor bermaganini aytadi. Xuddi shu nomli yangiroq faylni ochish bu miqdorlarni yangilaydi, yangilarini qoʻshmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nima-qilmaydi\"\u003ENima qilmaydi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EU fayl olib yuradigan miqdorlar toʻplamlarini (IfcElementQuantity) oʻqiydi. U 3D shakllarni oʻlchamaydi, shuning uchun miqdorlar toʻplami boʻlmagan element sanaladi, lekin uzunlik, maydon yoki hajm qoʻshmaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaqat IFC 4.3 ning infratuzilma klasslari oʻqiladi. Bino fayli (devorlar, eshiklar, plitalar) bu yerda miqdorlarga aylantirilmaydi; IFC 4.3 boʻlmagan fayl buni aytadi va hech narsa olib kirmaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBirliklar faylning oʻz birliklari boʻlib, metrga aylantiriladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"IFC 4.3 fayli yoʻllar, temir yoʻllar, koʻpriklar, dengiz inshootlari va ularning qismlarini saqlashi mumkin: qoplamalar, qatlamlar, bordyurlar, relslar, yer ishlari, tayanchlar, qoziqlar va boshqalar. TakeoffDesk ularni oʻqiydi va narxlash mumkin boʻlgan tipli miqdorlarga aylantiradi. Faylni ochish Fayl guruhida Rejalarni ochish ni tanlang yoki Ctrl+O ni bosing. IFC faylini tanlang (uni PDF lar bilan birga tanlashingiz mumkin) yoki uni TakeoffDesk ustiga tashlang. Har bir klass va oldindan belgilangan tur uchun bitta tipli miqdor yaratiladi, masalan “Yoʻl qoplamasi (egiluvchan): sanoq”, va fayl ularni bayon qilganda — “uzunlik” m da, “maydon” m² da va “hajm” m³ da. Har bir elementdagi izoh nechta element sanalganini va nechtasi miqdor bermaganini aytadi. Xuddi shu nomli yangiroq faylni ochish bu miqdorlarni yangilaydi, yangilarini qoʻshmaydi. Nima qilmaydi U fayl olib yuradigan miqdorlar toʻplamlarini (IfcElementQuantity) oʻqiydi. U 3D shakllarni oʻlchamaydi, shuning uchun miqdorlar toʻplami boʻlmagan element sanaladi, lekin uzunlik, maydon yoki hajm qoʻshmaydi. Faqat IFC 4.3 ning infratuzilma klasslari oʻqiladi. Bino fayli (devorlar, eshiklar, plitalar) bu yerda miqdorlarga aylantirilmaydi; IFC 4.3 boʻlmagan fayl buni aytadi va hech narsa olib kirmaydi. Birliklar faylning oʻz birliklari boʻlib, metrga aylantiriladi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"set-the-scale","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Masshtabni oʻrnatish","summary":"Har bir varaqqa oldindan oʻrnatma yoki maʼlum oʻlcham boʻyicha kalibrlash orqali masshtab bering, uni tekshiring va nima uchun masshtabsiz varaqlar jamidan chiqarilishini tushuning.","section":"tasks","order":20,"keywords":["masshtabni aniqlash","masshtabni oʻqish","matndan masshtab","hamma varaqlar","masshtab","kalibrlash","oldindan oʻrnatma","masshtabni tekshirish","tekshirish","maʼlum oʻlcham","masshtabsiz","masshtab yoʻq","nisbat","masshtabni oʻrnatish"],"headings":[{"id":"oldindan-o-rnatmadan-foydalanish-pdf-to-liq-o-lchamda-chop-etilgan-bo-lsa","text":"Oldindan oʻrnatmadan foydalanish (PDF toʻliq oʻlchamda chop etilgan boʻlsa)","level":2},{"id":"masshtabni-varaq-matnidan-o-qish","text":"Masshtabni varaq matnidan oʻqish","level":2},{"id":"ma-lum-o-lcham-bo-yicha-kalibrlash","text":"Maʼlum oʻlcham boʻyicha kalibrlash","level":2},{"id":"masshtabni-tekshirish","text":"Masshtabni tekshirish","level":2},{"id":"masshtabni-o-zgartirish","text":"Masshtabni oʻzgartirish","level":2},{"id":"nima-uchun-masshtabsiz-varaqlar-nolga-teng-hisoblanmaydi","text":"Nima uchun masshtabsiz varaqlar nolga teng hisoblanmaydi","level":2},{"id":"maslahatlar","text":"Maslahatlar","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EHar bir varaqning oʻz masshtabi bor. Siz uni oʻrnatasiz yoki TakeoffDesk varaqlar matnidan oʻqisin (quyida), keyin tekshirasiz. Varaqda masshtab boʻlmaguncha \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChiziqli\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaydon\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAylana\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKesib olish\u003C/span\u003E uni oʻlchamaydi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESanash\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAvtosanash\u003C/span\u003E masshtabsiz ishlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVaraqlar roʻyxatida har bir varaqning masshtabi yoki \u003Cstrong\u003EMasshtab yoʻq\u003C/strong\u003E koʻrsatiladi. Ochiq varaq ostidagi chiziq ham shuni aytadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"oldindan-o-rnatmadan-foydalanish-pdf-to-liq-o-lchamda-chop-etilgan-bo-lsa\"\u003EOldindan oʻrnatmadan foydalanish (PDF toʻliq oʻlchamda chop etilgan boʻlsa)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVaraqni oching.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasshtab\u003C/span\u003E guruhidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOldindan oʻrnatilgan\u003C/span\u003E roʻyxatini oching.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChizmada chop etilgan masshtabni tanlang, masalan Arxitektura boʻlimidagi \u003Ccode\u003E1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Holat satrida yoziladi: &quot;Bu varaq uchun masshtab: 1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETekshiring (quyida).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOldindan oʻrnatma PDF chizma moʻljallangan haqiqiy qogʻoz oʻlchamida deb taxmin qiladi. Agar PDF &quot;sahifaga moslab&quot; yaratilgan boʻlsa yoki yarim oʻlchamdagi toʻplam boʻlsa, oldindan oʻrnatma notoʻgʻri boʻladi. Bunday holda kalibrlang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EToʻliq roʻyxat: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/scale-presets\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/scale-presets\"\u003EMasshtab oldindan oʻrnatmalari\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"masshtabni-varaq-matnidan-o-qish\"\u003EMasshtabni varaq matnidan oʻqish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoʻpchilik chizmalar masshtabini yozadi: asosiy yozuv blokida \u003Ccode\u003ESCALE: 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, koʻrinish ostida esa \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E. TakeoffDesk uni oʻqiy oladi va hamma varaqlarni bir vaqtda belgilay oladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOldindan oʻrnatilgan\u003C/span\u003E roʻyxatini oching va yuqoridagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVaraqlar matnidan…\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERoʻyxatda har bir varaq koʻrsatiladi: uning hozirgi masshtabi va matni nima deyishi — \u003Cstrong\u003EMatnida 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; deyilgan\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EMatnida masshtab yoʻq\u003C/strong\u003E yoki \u003Cstrong\u003EMasshtab emas deyilgan\u003C/strong\u003E (NTS).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMasshtabsiz va masshtabni yozgan varaqlar belgilanadi. Istalganini belgilang yoki belgisini olib tashlang, keyin \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBelgilangan masshtablarni oʻrnatish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Bitta \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hammasini qaytaradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHar bir varaqda bitta oʻlchamni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETekshirish\u003C/span\u003E bilan tekshiring (quyida): oldindan oʻrnatma faqat PDF toʻliq oʻlchamda chop etilgan boʻlsa toʻgʻri boʻladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU arxitektura (\u003Ccode\u003E3/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E), muhandislik (\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 20&#039;\u003C/code\u003E) va metrik (\u003Ccode\u003E1:50\u003C/code\u003E) belgilarni oʻqiydi; ular \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/scale-presets\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/scale-presets\"\u003Eoldindan oʻrnatma\u003C/a\u003E bilan mos keladi. Varaqda bir nechta masshtab yozilgan boʻlsa (batafsil tafsilotlari kattalashtirilgan reja), u koʻproq takrorlanganini oladi, SCALE sʻzidan keyin yozilgani esa ikki marta hisoblanadi. Boshqalari qizil rangda koʻrsatiladi, shunda tekshira olasiz. Skanerlangan varaqda matn boʻlmaydi: uning masshtabini qoʻlda oʻrnating.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ma-lum-o-lcham-bo-yicha-kalibrlash\"\u003EMaʼlum oʻlcham boʻyicha kalibrlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBuni ishonadigan bosilgan masshtab boʻlmaganda, toʻplam oʻlchami oʻzgartirilganda yoki varaqda &quot;masshtab emas&quot; deyilgan, lekin oʻlchamlari bor boʻlganda ishlating.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVaraqni oching va maʼlum uzun oʻlchamga yaqinlashing, masalan setka chizigʻi oraligʻi yoki butun bino oʻlchami. Qanchalik uzun boʻlsa, shunchalik aniq boʻladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasshtab\u003C/span\u003E guruhidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibrlash\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOʻlchamning bir uchini bosing. Aniqlik uchun har bir uchida yaqinlashing; bosishlar orasida yaqinlashish va surish mumkin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkkinchi uchini bosing. Chiziqni 0°, 45° yoki 90° da saqlash uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni ushlab turing. \u003Cstrong\u003EBu varaqni kalibrlash\u003C/strong\u003E oynasi ochiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHaqiqiy masofa\u003C/strong\u003E maydoniga haqiqiy masofani kiriting, masalan \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E24.5\u003C/code\u003E (oʻnli futlar), \u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E yoki \u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EUzunlik, stavka va foiz kiritish\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasshtabni oʻrnatish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Holat satrida masshtab &quot;1&quot; = (n)&#039;&quot; kabi koʻrsatiladi; u oldindan oʻrnatmadan 0.5% doirasida boʻlsa, qaysi biriga mosligi aytiladi, masalan &quot;1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; ga mos keladi (aniq masshtab uchun shu oldindan oʻrnatmani tanlang)&quot;. TakeoffDesk yana \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETanlash\u003C/span\u003E vositasiga qaytadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKalibrlash oldindan oʻrnatmaga mos kelganda, shu oldindan oʻrnatmani tanlash aniq masshtab beradi, bosgan joyingizga bogʻliq masshtab oʻrniga.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"masshtabni-tekshirish\"\u003EMasshtabni tekshirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYangi masshtabni har doim ikkinchi oʻlcham boʻyicha tekshiring.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasshtab\u003C/span\u003E guruhidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETekshirish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChizmada chop etilgan oʻlchamning ikkala uchini bosing. Holat satrida yoziladi: &quot;Tekshirish: 12&#039;-6&quot;&quot; — bir xil uzunlik oʻnli futlarda va metrda; tekshirish chizigʻi uzunligi bilan varaqda qoladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUni chop etilgan oʻlcham bilan solishtiring. Farq boʻlsa, uzunroq oʻlcham boʻyicha kalibrlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETekshirish chizigʻini tozalash uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"masshtabni-o-zgartirish\"\u003EMasshtabni oʻzgartirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoshqa oldindan oʻrnatmani tanlang yoki qayta kalibrlang. Varaqda oʻlchovlar boʻlsa, TakeoffDesk \u003Cstrong\u003EBu varaqning masshtabini oʻzgartirasizmi?\u003C/strong\u003E deb soʻraydi va necha oʻlchov qayta oʻlchanishini aytadi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasshtabni oʻzgartirish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Varaqdagi har bir chiziq va maydon yangi masshtabda qayta oʻlchanadi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bilan qaytarish mumkin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nima-uchun-masshtabsiz-varaqlar-nolga-teng-hisoblanmaydi\"\u003ENima uchun masshtabsiz varaqlar nolga teng hisoblanmaydi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMasshtabi yoʻq varaqdagi belgining haqiqiy uzunligi yoki maydoni yoʻq. TakeoffDesk uni hech qachon nol deb hisoblamaydi, chunki bu smetangizni yashirincha past qilib qoʻyardi. Buning oʻrniga:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebelgilarni jamidan chiqaradi,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiqdorlar\u003C/span\u003E da element yonida &quot;+(n) masshtabsiz&quot; koʻrsatadi,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ejadval sarlavhasida &quot;Toʻliq emas: masshtabi yoʻq varaqlardagi (n) ta belgi (jamiga kirmaydi)&quot; koʻrsatadi,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esonni eksport qilingan jadvalning izohlar ustuniga yozadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBu hol masshtablari hech qachon oʻrnatilmagan loyihani ochganingizda yuz berishi mumkin. Varaqqa masshtab bering — belgilar darhol hisobga olinadi. Sanash belgilari har doim hisobga olinadi; ularga masshtab kerak emas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"maslahatlar\"\u003EMaslahatlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOʻlchaydigan har bir varaqqa oʻlchashdan oldin masshtab bering. Qolganlarini topish uchun varaqlar roʻyxatida \u003Cstrong\u003EMasshtab yoʻq\u003C/strong\u003E ni qidiring (qidiruv maydoni varaq nomlariga qaraydi, masshtabga emas).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBir varaqdagi batafsil va kattalashtirilgan rejalar boshqa masshtabdan foydalanadi. TakeoffDesk har bir varaqqa bitta masshtab beradi; qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EHali qurilmagan narsalar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMetrik chizmalar: \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E kabi metrik oldindan oʻrnatmani tanlang yoki \u003Ccode\u003E6000 mm\u003C/code\u003E kabi metrik masofa bilan kalibrlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Har bir varaqning oʻz masshtabi bor. Siz uni oʻrnatasiz yoki TakeoffDesk varaqlar matnidan oʻqisin (quyida), keyin tekshirasiz. Varaqda masshtab boʻlmaguncha Chiziqli, Maydon, Aylana va Kesib olish uni oʻlchamaydi. Sanash va Avtosanash masshtabsiz ishlaydi. Varaqlar roʻyxatida har bir varaqning masshtabi yoki Masshtab yoʻq koʻrsatiladi. Ochiq varaq ostidagi chiziq ham shuni aytadi. Oldindan oʻrnatmadan foydalanish (PDF toʻliq oʻlchamda chop etilgan boʻlsa) Varaqni oching. Masshtab guruhidagi Oldindan oʻrnatilgan roʻyxatini oching. Chizmada chop etilgan masshtabni tanlang, masalan Arxitektura boʻlimidagi 1/8\" = 1'-0\". Holat satrida yoziladi: \"Bu varaq uchun masshtab: 1/8\" = 1'-0\".\" Tekshiring (quyida). Oldindan oʻrnatma PDF chizma moʻljallangan haqiqiy qogʻoz oʻlchamida deb taxmin qiladi. Agar PDF \"sahifaga moslab\" yaratilgan boʻlsa yoki yarim oʻlchamdagi toʻplam boʻlsa, oldindan oʻrnatma notoʻgʻri boʻladi. Bunday holda kalibrlang. Toʻliq roʻyxat: Masshtab oldindan oʻrnatmalari. Masshtabni varaq matnidan oʻqish Koʻpchilik chizmalar masshtabini yozadi: asosiy yozuv blokida SCALE: 1/4\" = 1'-0\", koʻrinish ostida esa 1:100. TakeoffDesk uni oʻqiy oladi va hamma varaqlarni bir vaqtda belgilay oladi. Oldindan oʻrnatilgan roʻyxatini oching va yuqoridagi Varaqlar matnidan… ni tanlang. Roʻyxatda har bir varaq koʻrsatiladi: uning hozirgi masshtabi va matni nima deyishi — Matnida 1/4\" = 1'-0\" deyilgan, Matnida masshtab yoʻq yoki Masshtab emas deyilgan (NTS). Masshtabsiz va masshtabni yozgan varaqlar belgilanadi. Istalganini belgilang yoki belgisini olib tashlang, keyin Belgilangan masshtablarni oʻrnatish ni tanlang. Bitta Ctrl+Z hammasini qaytaradi. Har bir varaqda bitta oʻlchamni Tekshirish bilan tekshiring (quyida): oldindan oʻrnatma faqat PDF toʻliq oʻlchamda chop etilgan boʻlsa toʻgʻri boʻladi. U arxitektura (3/16\" = 1'-0\", 1 1/2\" = 1'-0\"), muhandislik (1\" = 20') va metrik (1:50) belgilarni oʻqiydi; ular oldindan oʻrnatma bilan mos keladi. Varaqda bir nechta masshtab yozilgan boʻlsa (batafsil tafsilotlari kattalashtirilgan reja), u koʻproq takrorlanganini oladi, SCALE sʻzidan keyin yozilgani esa ikki marta hisoblanadi. Boshqalari qizil rangda koʻrsatiladi, shunda tekshira olasiz. Skanerlangan varaqda matn boʻlmaydi: uning masshtabini qoʻlda oʻrnating. Maʼlum oʻlcham boʻyicha kalibrlash Buni ishonadigan bosilgan masshtab boʻlmaganda, toʻplam oʻlchami oʻzgartirilganda yoki varaqda \"masshtab emas\" deyilgan, lekin oʻlchamlari bor boʻlganda ishlating. Varaqni oching va maʼlum uzun oʻlchamga yaqinlashing, masalan setka chizigʻi oraligʻi yoki butun bino oʻlchami. Qanchalik uzun boʻlsa, shunchalik aniq boʻladi. Masshtab guruhidagi Kalibrlash ni tanlang yoki K ni bosing. Oʻlchamning bir uchini bosing. Aniqlik uchun har bir uchida yaqinlashing; bosishlar orasida yaqinlashish va surish mumkin. Ikkinchi uchini bosing. Chiziqni 0°, 45° yoki 90° da saqlash uchun Shift ni ushlab turing. Bu varaqni kalibrlash oynasi ochiladi. Haqiqiy masofa maydoniga haqiqiy masofani kiriting, masalan 24'-6 1/2\", 24.5 (oʻnli futlar), 30\" yoki 7.5 m. Qarang: Uzunlik, stavka va foiz kiritish. Masshtabni oʻrnatish ni tanlang. Holat satrida masshtab \"1\" = (n)'\" kabi koʻrsatiladi; u oldindan oʻrnatmadan 0.5% doirasida boʻlsa, qaysi biriga mosligi aytiladi, masalan \"1/4\" = 1'-0\" ga mos keladi (aniq masshtab uchun shu oldindan oʻrnatmani tanlang)\". TakeoffDesk yana Tanlash vositasiga qaytadi. Kalibrlash oldindan oʻrnatmaga mos kelganda, shu oldindan oʻrnatmani tanlash aniq masshtab beradi, bosgan joyingizga bogʻliq masshtab oʻrniga. Masshtabni tekshirish Yangi masshtabni har doim ikkinchi oʻlcham boʻyicha tekshiring. Masshtab guruhidagi Tekshirish ni tanlang yoki D ni bosing. Chizmada chop etilgan oʻlchamning ikkala uchini bosing. Holat satrida yoziladi: \"Tekshirish: 12'-6\"\" — bir xil uzunlik oʻnli futlarda va metrda; tekshirish chizigʻi uzunligi bilan varaqda qoladi. Uni chop etilgan oʻlcham bilan solishtiring. Farq boʻlsa, uzunroq oʻlcham boʻyicha kalibrlang. Tekshirish chizigʻini tozalash uchun Esc ni bosing. Masshtabni oʻzgartirish Boshqa oldindan oʻrnatmani tanlang yoki qayta kalibrlang. Varaqda oʻlchovlar boʻlsa, TakeoffDesk Bu varaqning masshtabini oʻzgartirasizmi? deb soʻraydi va necha oʻlchov qayta oʻlchanishini aytadi. Masshtabni oʻzgartirish ni tanlang. Varaqdagi har bir chiziq va maydon yangi masshtabda qayta oʻlchanadi. Ctrl+Z bilan qaytarish mumkin. Nima uchun masshtabsiz varaqlar nolga teng hisoblanmaydi Masshtabi yoʻq varaqdagi belgining haqiqiy uzunligi yoki maydoni yoʻq. TakeoffDesk uni hech qachon nol deb hisoblamaydi, chunki bu smetangizni yashirincha past qilib qoʻyardi. Buning oʻrniga: belgilarni jamidan chiqaradi, Miqdorlar da element yonida \"+(n) masshtabsiz\" koʻrsatadi, jadval sarlavhasida \"Toʻliq emas: masshtabi yoʻq varaqlardagi (n) ta belgi (jamiga kirmaydi)\" koʻrsatadi, sonni eksport qilingan jadvalning izohlar ustuniga yozadi. Bu hol masshtablari hech qachon oʻrnatilmagan loyihani ochganingizda yuz berishi mumkin. Varaqqa masshtab bering — belgilar darhol hisobga olinadi. Sanash belgilari har doim hisobga olinadi; ularga masshtab kerak emas. Maslahatlar Oʻlchaydigan har bir varaqqa oʻlchashdan oldin masshtab bering. Qolganlarini topish uchun varaqlar roʻyxatida Masshtab yoʻq ni qidiring (qidiruv maydoni varaq nomlariga qaraydi, masshtabga emas). Bir varaqdagi batafsil va kattalashtirilgan rejalar boshqa masshtabdan foydalanadi. TakeoffDesk har bir varaqqa bitta masshtab beradi; qarang: Hali qurilmagan narsalar. Metrik chizmalar: 1:100 kabi metrik oldindan oʻrnatmani tanlang yoki 6000 mm kabi metrik masofa bilan kalibrlang.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"create-items","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Create takeoff items","summary":"Make linear, area and count items and set their unit, height or depth, waste and material and labor rates.","section":"tasks","order":30,"keywords":["crew","production rate","crew size","wage","hours","man-hours","worker-hours","crew-days","labor hours","item","new item","condition","multi-condition","also measure","several types","room","linear","area","count","unit","height","depth","waste","material","labor","rate","color","cost"],"headings":[{"id":"typed-quantities-no-drawing","text":"Typed quantities (no drawing)","level":2},{"id":"make-an-item","text":"Make an item","level":2},{"id":"pick-the-item-you-draw-with","text":"Pick the item you draw with","level":2},{"id":"set-up-the-item","text":"Set up the item","level":2},{"id":"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks","text":"One item, several kinds of marks","level":2},{"id":"rates-in-the-table","text":"Rates in the table","level":2},{"id":"how-pricing-works","text":"How pricing works","level":2},{"id":"labor-by-crew","text":"Labor by crew","level":2},{"id":"metric-items","text":"Metric items","level":2},{"id":"next","text":"Next","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAn \u003Cstrong\u003Eitem\u003C/strong\u003E is one thing you measure and price: a wall type, a floor finish, a ceiling, a door, a light fixture. Every mark you draw belongs to an item. Other programs call these conditions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach item has a type (and can take other kinds of marks too, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\"\u003EOne item, several kinds of marks\u003C/a\u003E):\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EType\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYou draw\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIt reports\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUnits\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERuns of connected points\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength, number of runs, and wall area when it has a height\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF or m\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EClosed outlines, with cut-outs\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea, perimeter, number of areas\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m²\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOne click per thing\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHow many\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEA\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETyped quantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENothing: you type the quantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe number you typed (or one brought in from CivilCraft)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELS, EA, CY, m³, lb, TON, kg, t, LF, m, SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m²\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"typed-quantities-no-drawing\"\u003ETyped quantities (no drawing)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESome things in an estimate are never drawn: mobilization, permits, a contingency, a lump-sum subcontract, the cut and fill CivilCraft worked out. Make them a \u003Cstrong\u003ETyped quantity\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E, type a name, pick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETyped quantity (no drawing)\u003C/span\u003E and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the item editor pick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnit\u003C/span\u003E (LS for a lump sum) and type the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantity\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E1\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E1,250\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESet waste and rates as for any other item. An assembly&#039;s formulas use \u003Ccode\u003EQ\u003C/code\u003E, the quantity, for example \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(Q / 12)\u003C/code\u003E truck loads.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA typed quantity takes no marks and never makes the estimate incomplete. When the takeoff has bid areas, the editor also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid area\u003C/span\u003E: the quantity then counts in that area, its alternates and its totals, just as a mark there would. Quantities brought in from another app say where they came from, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/earthwork#cut-and-fill-from-civilcraft\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/earthwork\" data-hash=\"cut-and-fill-from-civilcraft\"\u003EEarthwork and spot elevations\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"make-an-item\"\u003EMake an item\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E panel on the right, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType a name, like \u003Ccode\u003EInterior wall type A\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003ECarpet tile\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick the type: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear (length)\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E (or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). The item appears in the list with its own color, becomes the item you draw with, and its editor opens below the list. The status bar tells you which tool to pick next.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E in the form to close it without adding an item.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you pick a measuring tool first, TakeoffDesk uses the last item of the right type, or opens the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E form with that type already chosen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pick-the-item-you-draw-with\"\u003EPick the item you draw with\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick an item in the list. It becomes the item new marks go to, its measuring tool comes on (Linear, Area or Count, as the item is; Circle or Room stay on for an area item, Path for a linear one), and its marks glow on every sheet. Every other mark stays fully visible. The view stays where it is: if the open sheet has none of its marks, the status bar says so and the sheet list shows how many each sheet has. Click the item again to stop highlighting; it stays the item you draw with.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClicking a mark with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E tool also makes its item the current one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"set-up-the-item\"\u003ESet up the item\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe item editor (\u003Cstrong\u003EItem: (name)\u003C/strong\u003E) has these fields. Each one is saved when you leave the field or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, and each change can be undone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EField\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EName\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShown in the list, the tables and the exports.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EType\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear, Area or Count. It is locked once the item has marks (&quot;An item with marks keeps its type&quot;).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EColor\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe color of its marks on screen and in the marked PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantity factor\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMultiplies the measured quantity everywhere it is used: the item list, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E, the exports, the marked PDF&#039;s legend and the formulas of its assembly. \u003Ccode\u003E0.5\u003C/code\u003E counts half of what you draw, for example a continental crosswalk whose bars cover about half its outline; \u003Ccode\u003E1.1\u003C/code\u003E adds 10%. You can also type \u003Ccode\u003E50%\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E1/2\u003C/code\u003E. Empty means 1. The list shows it after the quantity (&quot;(×0.5)&quot;) and \u003Cstrong\u003EMeasured\u003C/strong\u003E shows what was drawn. Linear items multiply their length (and the wall area made from it), area items their area, count items their count.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELine\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHow its runs and area outlines are drawn: Solid, Dashed, Dotted or Double. Deducted segments stay thin and dashed. Shown on screen and in the marked PDF.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcon\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChoose an image…\u003C/span\u003E picks any PNG, JPEG or SVG; it is shrunk to a small square and saved inside the takeoff. The icon replaces the color square in the lists and the dot of each count mark, on screen and in the marked PDF. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E goes back to the dot.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnit\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWhat the quantity is reported in: LF or m for linear; SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m² for area; EA for count.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlso measure\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe other kinds of marks the item takes, each with its own unit. See below.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E (linear)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA wall height. The item then also reports wall area (length × height). Runs that came from a BimCraft model carry their doors and windows: those are taken out once, and the item says the gross area, the openings and the net. A takeoff from a BimCraft project that chose a measurement method is measured by that method here too (the note names it, with its source, and says it is unchecked by a quantity surveyor); the method cannot be changed in TakeoffDesk. Bricks or blocks and mortar from a wall type arrive as two components: the units to order and the mortar volume.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDepth\u003C/span\u003E (area)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA depth or thickness, used in assembly formulas (for example concrete volume).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaste %\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdded to the quantity before pricing: 10 means quantity × 1.10.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial $/LF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial cost per unit. The label follows the unit: $/SF, $/EA and so on.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabor $/LF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELabor cost per unit.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSI number\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIts CSI MasterFormat number, like \u003Ccode\u003E09 21 16\u003C/code\u003E (or just the division, \u003Ccode\u003E09\u003C/code\u003E). The workbook&#039;s By division worksheet groups costs by it. Items from \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003Etrade packs\u003C/a\u003E have one already.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHeight and depth take feet and inches (\u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E8&#039; 6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E) or decimal feet (\u003Ccode\u003E9\u003C/code\u003E) for imperial units, and meters (\u003Ccode\u003E2.7\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2700 mm\u003C/code\u003E) for metric units. Rates take amounts like \u003Ccode\u003E12.50\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E$1,250\u003C/code\u003E, up to four decimals. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003ELength, rate and percent entry\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBelow the fields, \u003Cstrong\u003EMeasured\u003C/strong\u003E shows the totals the item&#039;s formulas can use, with their letters: Length (L), Runs (N), Wall area (A) for linear; Area (A), Perimeter (P), Areas (N) for area; Count (N) for count.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\"\u003EOne item, several kinds of marks\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESome things are measured more than one way: a room has a floor (an area), a base along its walls (a length) and doors (a count). Instead of three items, make one:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMake the item with its main type, such as an area item \u003Ccode\u003ERoom 101\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlso measure\u003C/span\u003E in its editor, tick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E or both. Each one gets a unit next to it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDraw with any tool whose kind the item takes: with \u003Ccode\u003ERoom 101\u003C/code\u003E current, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E draws its floor, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E its base and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E its doors. TakeoffDesk does not ask for another item.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe items list shows every quantity (\u003Ccode\u003E50.00 SF + 2 EA\u003C/code\u003E). In the quantities table the item&#039;s row has its main quantity, and each other kind gets its own row below it, such as \u003Cstrong\u003ERoom 101 (count)\u003C/strong\u003E, with its own waste and material and labor rates. The exports, the per-sheet table and the marked PDF&#039;s legend list them the same way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe main type&#039;s fields stay the main type&#039;s own: the height or depth, the pitch, back-outs and the 3D shape apply to its marks only. A base run drawn for an area item is measured plainly along the plan, and shows flat in 3D. Assembly formulas use the main type&#039;s totals.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA kind can be unticked only while the item has no marks of it; delete them, or move them to another item under \u003Cstrong\u003ESelected mark\u003C/strong\u003E, first. Marks can move to any item that takes their kind.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFurther down is the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E: components such as studs or board, each with its own formula and rates. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EAssemblies and formulas\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the bottom: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove up\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove down\u003C/span\u003E change the item&#039;s place in the list and in the exports, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete item\u003C/span\u003E removes it with all its marks (after asking; you can undo it).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EArea items also have \u003Cstrong\u003EPitch\u003C/strong\u003E (roof planes measured on the slope: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/roofs-and-slopes\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/roofs-and-slopes\"\u003ERoofs and slopes\u003C/a\u003E) and \u003Cstrong\u003EBack-out\u003C/strong\u003E (their marks come off other items&#039; areas: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#back-outs-columns-shafts-and-openings-taken-out-of-several-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"back-outs-columns-shafts-and-openings-taken-out-of-several-items\"\u003EMeasure areas\u003C/a\u003E). Linear items have \u003Cstrong\u003ESlope\u003C/strong\u003E (Level, Rake, Hip or valley) and, for rakes and hips, \u003Cstrong\u003EPitch\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rates-in-the-table\"\u003ERates in the table\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou can also type \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaste %\u003C/span\u003E, material and labor rates straight into the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table at the bottom (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy item\u003C/span\u003E). It is the same setting as in the editor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-pricing-works\"\u003EHow pricing works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFor each item and each assembly component:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWith waste\u003C/strong\u003E = quantity × (1 + waste %).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaterial\u003C/strong\u003E = with waste × material per unit, rounded to the cent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELabor\u003C/strong\u003E = with waste × labor per unit, rounded to the cent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETotal\u003C/strong\u003E = material + labor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E adds every item and every component. An item can carry its own rates and an assembly at the same time; both are counted, so leave the item&#039;s rates at 0 when its components carry the cost.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"labor-by-crew\"\u003ELabor by crew\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInstead of a labor rate per unit, an item&#039;s labor can come from a crew: how much it puts in per hour, how many people, and what each earns. Under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabor by crew\u003C/span\u003E in the item editor, tick \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrice labor from a crew\u003C/span\u003E and fill in:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EField\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EExample\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProduction\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E20\u003C/code\u003E LF an hour (in the item&#039;s unit) for the whole crew\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECrew size\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2\u003C/code\u003E people\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWage $/hour each\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E45\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk works out, from the quantity with waste:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ecrew-hours\u003C/strong\u003E = quantity ÷ production (110 LF ÷ 20 = 5.5),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Eworker-hours\u003C/strong\u003E = crew-hours × crew size (11),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Ecrew-days\u003C/strong\u003E = crew-hours ÷ 8 (0.69),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Elabor\u003C/strong\u003E = worker-hours × wage ($495.00).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe editor shows the result and the rate it comes to ($4.50/LF). The item&#039;s own labor rate is then read-only, in the editor and in the table. The header of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table adds the job&#039;s worker-hours and crew-days. The exports note each crew&#039;s hours, and in the workbook the labor cell is a formula on the crew (\u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F2/20*2*45,2)\u003C/code\u003E). Untick the box to go back to a rate per unit.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"metric-items\"\u003EMetric items\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPick m (linear) or m² (area) as the unit. Quantities, heights and formula values are then in meters. The sheet scale can be any preset or calibration; units and scales are independent.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"next\"\u003ENext\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003EMeasure linear runs\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\"\u003EMeasure areas with cut-outs\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\"\u003ECount by hand\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"An item is one thing you measure and price: a wall type, a floor finish, a ceiling, a door, a light fixture. Every mark you draw belongs to an item. Other programs call these conditions. Each item has a type (and can take other kinds of marks too, see One item, several kinds of marks): Type You draw It reports Units Linear Runs of connected points Length, number of runs, and wall area when it has a height LF or m Area Closed outlines, with cut-outs Area, perimeter, number of areas SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m² Count One click per thing How many EA Typed quantity Nothing: you type the quantity The number you typed (or one brought in from CivilCraft) LS, EA, CY, m³, lb, TON, kg, t, LF, m, SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m² Typed quantities (no drawing) Some things in an estimate are never drawn: mobilization, permits, a contingency, a lump-sum subcontract, the cut and fill CivilCraft worked out. Make them a Typed quantity: Choose New item, type a name, pick Typed quantity (no drawing) and choose Add. In the item editor pick the Unit (LS for a lump sum) and type the Quantity: 1, 2.5 or 1,250. Set waste and rates as for any other item. An assembly's formulas use Q, the quantity, for example ceil(Q / 12) truck loads. A typed quantity takes no marks and never makes the estimate incomplete. When the takeoff has bid areas, the editor also has Bid area: the quantity then counts in that area, its alternates and its totals, just as a mark there would. Quantities brought in from another app say where they came from, see Earthwork and spot elevations. Make an item In the Items panel on the right, choose New item. Type a name, like Interior wall type A or Carpet tile. Pick the type: Linear (length), Area or Count. Choose Add (or press Enter). The item appears in the list with its own color, becomes the item you draw with, and its editor opens below the list. The status bar tells you which tool to pick next. Press Esc in the form to close it without adding an item. If you pick a measuring tool first, TakeoffDesk uses the last item of the right type, or opens the New item form with that type already chosen. Pick the item you draw with Click an item in the list. It becomes the item new marks go to, its measuring tool comes on (Linear, Area or Count, as the item is; Circle or Room stay on for an area item, Path for a linear one), and its marks glow on every sheet. Every other mark stays fully visible. The view stays where it is: if the open sheet has none of its marks, the status bar says so and the sheet list shows how many each sheet has. Click the item again to stop highlighting; it stays the item you draw with. Clicking a mark with the Select tool also makes its item the current one. Set up the item The item editor (Item: (name)) has these fields. Each one is saved when you leave the field or press Enter, and each change can be undone. Field What it does Name Shown in the list, the tables and the exports. Type Linear, Area or Count. It is locked once the item has marks (\"An item with marks keeps its type\"). Color The color of its marks on screen and in the marked PDF. Quantity factor Multiplies the measured quantity everywhere it is used: the item list, Quantities, the exports, the marked PDF's legend and the formulas of its assembly. 0.5 counts half of what you draw, for example a continental crosswalk whose bars cover about half its outline; 1.1 adds 10%. You can also type 50% or 1/2. Empty means 1. The list shows it after the quantity (\"(×0.5)\") and Measured shows what was drawn. Linear items multiply their length (and the wall area made from it), area items their area, count items their count. Line How its runs and area outlines are drawn: Solid, Dashed, Dotted or Double. Deducted segments stay thin and dashed. Shown on screen and in the marked PDF. Icon Choose an image… picks any PNG, JPEG or SVG; it is shrunk to a small square and saved inside the takeoff. The icon replaces the color square in the lists and the dot of each count mark, on screen and in the marked PDF. Remove goes back to the dot. Unit What the quantity is reported in: LF or m for linear; SF, SY, SQ, ac, ha or m² for area; EA for count. Also measure The other kinds of marks the item takes, each with its own unit. See below. Height (linear) A wall height. The item then also reports wall area (length × height). Runs that came from a BimCraft model carry their doors and windows: those are taken out once, and the item says the gross area, the openings and the net. A takeoff from a BimCraft project that chose a measurement method is measured by that method here too (the note names it, with its source, and says it is unchecked by a quantity surveyor); the method cannot be changed in TakeoffDesk. Bricks or blocks and mortar from a wall type arrive as two components: the units to order and the mortar volume. Depth (area) A depth or thickness, used in assembly formulas (for example concrete volume). Waste % Added to the quantity before pricing: 10 means quantity × 1.10. Material $/LF Material cost per unit. The label follows the unit: $/SF, $/EA and so on. Labor $/LF Labor cost per unit. CSI number Its CSI MasterFormat number, like 09 21 16 (or just the division, 09). The workbook's By division worksheet groups costs by it. Items from trade packs have one already. Height and depth take feet and inches (9'-0\", 8' 6\") or decimal feet (9) for imperial units, and meters (2.7, 2700 mm) for metric units. Rates take amounts like 12.50 or $1,250, up to four decimals. See Length, rate and percent entry. Below the fields, Measured shows the totals the item's formulas can use, with their letters: Length (L), Runs (N), Wall area (A) for linear; Area (A), Perimeter (P), Areas (N) for area; Count (N) for count. One item, several kinds of marks Some things are measured more than one way: a room has a floor (an area), a base along its walls (a length) and doors (a count). Instead of three items, make one: Make the item with its main type, such as an area item Room 101. Under Also measure in its editor, tick Linear, Count or both. Each one gets a unit next to it. Draw with any tool whose kind the item takes: with Room 101 current, Area draws its floor, Linear its base and Count its doors. TakeoffDesk does not ask for another item. The items list shows every quantity (50.00 SF + 2 EA). In the quantities table the item's row has its main quantity, and each other kind gets its own row below it, such as Room 101 (count), with its own waste and material and labor rates. The exports, the per-sheet table and the marked PDF's legend list them the same way. The main type's fields stay the main type's own: the height or depth, the pitch, back-outs and the 3D shape apply to its marks only. A base run drawn for an area item is measured plainly along the plan, and shows flat in 3D. Assembly formulas use the main type's totals. A kind can be unticked only while the item has no marks of it; delete them, or move them to another item under Selected mark, first. Marks can move to any item that takes their kind. Further down is the Assembly: components such as studs or board, each with its own formula and rates. See Assemblies and formulas. At the bottom: Move up and Move down change the item's place in the list and in the exports, and Delete item removes it with all its marks (after asking; you can undo it). Area items also have Pitch (roof planes measured on the slope: Roofs and slopes) and Back-out (their marks come off other items' areas: Measure areas). Linear items have Slope (Level, Rake, Hip or valley) and, for rakes and hips, Pitch. Rates in the table You can also type Waste %, material and labor rates straight into the Quantities table at the bottom (By item). It is the same setting as in the editor. How pricing works For each item and each assembly component: With waste = quantity × (1 + waste %). Material = with waste × material per unit, rounded to the cent. Labor = with waste × labor per unit, rounded to the cent. Total = material + labor. The Job total adds every item and every component. An item can carry its own rates and an assembly at the same time; both are counted, so leave the item's rates at 0 when its components carry the cost. Labor by crew Instead of a labor rate per unit, an item's labor can come from a crew: how much it puts in per hour, how many people, and what each earns. Under Labor by crew in the item editor, tick Price labor from a crew and fill in: Field Example Production 20 LF an hour (in the item's unit) for the whole crew Crew size 2 people Wage $/hour each 45 TakeoffDesk works out, from the quantity with waste: crew-hours = quantity ÷ production (110 LF ÷ 20 = 5.5), worker-hours = crew-hours × crew size (11), crew-days = crew-hours ÷ 8 (0.69), labor = worker-hours × wage ($495.00). The editor shows the result and the rate it comes to ($4.50/LF). The item's own labor rate is then read-only, in the editor and in the table. The header of the Quantities table adds the job's worker-hours and crew-days. The exports note each crew's hours, and in the workbook the labor cell is a formula on the crew (ROUND(F2/20*2*45,2)). Untick the box to go back to a rate per unit. Metric items Pick m (linear) or m² (area) as the unit. Quantities, heights and formula values are then in meters. The sheet scale can be any preset or calibration; units and scales are independent. Next Measure linear runs Measure areas with cut-outs Count by hand","lang":"en"},{"slug":"measure-from-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Chizmadan oʻlchash","summary":"Uzunliklar va maydonlarni chizmaning oʻz chiziqlari, yoylari, polichiziqlari va shtrixlaridan tanlash orqali oling, aniq yoylar va teshiklar bilan, nuqtalar bilan iz chizmasdan.","section":"tasks","order":33,"keywords":["chizmani oʻlchash","geometriya","polichiziq","yoy","aylana","shtrixlash","bulge","aniq uzunlik","aniq maydon","tanlash","oyna","iz","CAD dan","chiziqli","maydon"],"headings":[{"id":"obyektlarni-chiziqli-yoki-maydon-elementi-sifatida-olish","text":"Obyektlarni chiziqli yoki maydon elementi sifatida olish","level":2},{"id":"har-bir-element-turi-nimani-oladi","text":"Har bir element turi nimani oladi","level":2},{"id":"aniq-va-deyarli-aniq","text":"Aniq va deyarli aniq","level":2},{"id":"qayerdan-nimani-oladi","text":"Qayerdan nimani oladi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDWG yoki DXF varagʻining varaq panelidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure drawing\u003C/span\u003E chizmaning oʻz obyektlarini belgilar sifatida oladi, shuning uchun ularni bosish bilan iz chizmaysiz. Polichiziqning uzunligi, yoyning uzunligi, aylananing maydoni va teshiklari bilan shtrixlashning maydoni aniq chiqadi: hajmlarni hisoblash har bir belgi uchun ishlatadigan arifmetikadan foydalanadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"obyektlarni-chiziqli-yoki-maydon-elementi-sifatida-olish\"\u003EObyektlarni chiziqli yoki maydon elementi sifatida olish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E ostida \u003Cstrong\u003Echiziqli\u003C/strong\u003E yoki \u003Cstrong\u003Emaydon\u003C/strong\u003E elementini yarating yoki bosing. Varaqqa masshtab kerak.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure drawing\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVaraqdagi obyektlarni bosib tanlang yoki atrofidan oyna sudrang: uning ichida toʻliq joylashgan hammasi tanlanadi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tanlanganga oyna qoʻshadi; tanlangan obyektni yana bossangiz, u chiqadi. Panelda jami koʻrsatiladi: &quot;6 ta yoʻl: jami 108&#039;-9 1/8&quot;&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQoʻshish tugmasini tanlang, u sonni va elementni nomlaydi, masalan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdge ga 6 ta qoʻshish\u003C/span\u003E (yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing). Har bir obyekt elementning bitta belgisiga aylanadi, bitta ortga qaytarish qadamida. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tanlaganingizni tozalaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"har-bir-element-turi-nimani-oladi\"\u003EHar bir element turi nimani oladi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EChiziqli\u003C/strong\u003E element chiziqlar, yoylar, polichiziqlar, aylanalar va splaynlarni uzunligi boʻyicha oladi. Yopiq shakl perimetri boʻyicha hisoblanadi. Shtrixlash chetda qoladi: u uzunlikka emas, maydonga ega, va panel buni aytadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMaydon\u003C/strong\u003E elementi yopiq shakllarni oladi: yopiq polichiziqlar, aylanalar, 2D jismlar va teshiklari bilan shtrixlashlar. Ochiq yoʻllar chetda qoladi, va panel buni aytadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aniq-va-deyarli-aniq\"\u003EAniq va deyarli aniq\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChiziqlar, yoylar (istalgan bulge), bulge bilan polichiziqlar va aylanalar aniq: uzunliklar va maydonlar yoyning radiusi va burchagidan hisoblanadi, uning rasmidan emas. Ellipslar, splaynlar va chegarasi chekkalardan iborat shtrixlashlar bir gradus yoki undan maydaroq vatarlar bilan oʻlchanadi; bu ellipslar uchun foizning yuzdan birida, qolganlari uchun oʻndan birida aniqlik beradi. Panel tanlaganingizdan qanchasi shu turdagi egri ekanligini koʻrsatadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qayerdan-nimani-oladi\"\u003EQayerdan nimani oladi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel\u003C/strong\u003E: model fazosidagi obyektlar. \u003Cstrong\u003ELayout\u003C/strong\u003E: uning oʻz chiziqlari va koʻrinish oynasi (viewport) ichidagi model obyektlari, u orqali masshtablangan. Koʻrinish oynasi chetini kesib oʻtgan obyekt taklif qilinmaydi (u kesilgan holda chop etiladi); ikkita koʻrinish oynasi ikkalasi koʻrsatgan obyekt bir marta olinadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaqat varaq koʻrsatgan qatlamlar. Bloklar sanaladi, oʻlchanmaydi: qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003EChizmadan sanash\u003C/a\u003E. 3D polichiziqlar, toʻrlar, jismlar va mintaqalar taklif qilinmaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"DWG yoki DXF varagʻining varaq panelidagi Measure drawing chizmaning oʻz obyektlarini belgilar sifatida oladi, shuning uchun ularni bosish bilan iz chizmaysiz. Polichiziqning uzunligi, yoyning uzunligi, aylananing maydoni va teshiklari bilan shtrixlashning maydoni aniq chiqadi: hajmlarni hisoblash har bir belgi uchun ishlatadigan arifmetikadan foydalanadi. Obyektlarni chiziqli yoki maydon elementi sifatida olish Items ostida chiziqli yoki maydon elementini yarating yoki bosing. Varaqqa masshtab kerak. Measure drawing ni tanlang. Varaqdagi obyektlarni bosib tanlang yoki atrofidan oyna sudrang: uning ichida toʻliq joylashgan hammasi tanlanadi. Shift tanlanganga oyna qoʻshadi; tanlangan obyektni yana bossangiz, u chiqadi. Panelda jami koʻrsatiladi: \"6 ta yoʻl: jami 108'-9 1/8\"\". Qoʻshish tugmasini tanlang, u sonni va elementni nomlaydi, masalan Edge ga 6 ta qoʻshish (yoki Enter ni bosing). Har bir obyekt elementning bitta belgisiga aylanadi, bitta ortga qaytarish qadamida. Esc tanlaganingizni tozalaydi. Har bir element turi nimani oladi Chiziqli element chiziqlar, yoylar, polichiziqlar, aylanalar va splaynlarni uzunligi boʻyicha oladi. Yopiq shakl perimetri boʻyicha hisoblanadi. Shtrixlash chetda qoladi: u uzunlikka emas, maydonga ega, va panel buni aytadi. Maydon elementi yopiq shakllarni oladi: yopiq polichiziqlar, aylanalar, 2D jismlar va teshiklari bilan shtrixlashlar. Ochiq yoʻllar chetda qoladi, va panel buni aytadi. Aniq va deyarli aniq Chiziqlar, yoylar (istalgan bulge), bulge bilan polichiziqlar va aylanalar aniq: uzunliklar va maydonlar yoyning radiusi va burchagidan hisoblanadi, uning rasmidan emas. Ellipslar, splaynlar va chegarasi chekkalardan iborat shtrixlashlar bir gradus yoki undan maydaroq vatarlar bilan oʻlchanadi; bu ellipslar uchun foizning yuzdan birida, qolganlari uchun oʻndan birida aniqlik beradi. Panel tanlaganingizdan qanchasi shu turdagi egri ekanligini koʻrsatadi. Qayerdan nimani oladi Model: model fazosidagi obyektlar. Layout: uning oʻz chiziqlari va koʻrinish oynasi (viewport) ichidagi model obyektlari, u orqali masshtablangan. Koʻrinish oynasi chetini kesib oʻtgan obyekt taklif qilinmaydi (u kesilgan holda chop etiladi); ikkita koʻrinish oynasi ikkalasi koʻrsatgan obyekt bir marta olinadi. Faqat varaq koʻrsatgan qatlamlar. Bloklar sanaladi, oʻlchanmaydi: qarang: Chizmadan sanash. 3D polichiziqlar, toʻrlar, jismlar va mintaqalar taklif qilinmaydi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"snap-to-the-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Chizma chiziqlariga tutib olish","summary":"Oʻlchash yoki kalibrlashda nuqtalar PDF ning oʻz chiziqlariga sakraydi: uchlari, oʻrtalari, kesishmalari yoki chiziq ustidagi istalgan joy, qaysi biri ekanini koʻrsatuvchi belgi bilan.","section":"tasks","order":35,"keywords":["tutib olish","osnap","obyektga tutib olish","uchi","oʻrtasi","kesishma","eng yaqin","vektor","chiziqlar","aniq","toʻgʻri","f3","magnit","burchak"],"headings":[{"id":"nimaga-tutib-olinadi","text":"Nimaga tutib olinadi","level":2},{"id":"qayerda-ishlaydi","text":"Qayerda ishlaydi","level":2},{"id":"tutib-olish-mumkin-bo-lmagan-varaqlar","text":"Tutib olish mumkin boʻlmagan varaqlar","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EKoʻpgina loyiha toʻplamlari vektor PDF lardir: ularning devorlari va chekkalari piksel emas, haqiqiy chiziqlardir. Oʻlchash vaqtida TakeoffDesk bosishlaringizni shu chiziqlarga tutib oladi, shunda chiziq aynan devor burchagidan boshlanadi va kalibrlash bosgan pikselni emas, chizmachi chizgan oʻlchamni oʻqiydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoshlanganda Tutib olish yoqilgan boʻladi. Uni holat satrida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETutib olish\u003C/span\u003E yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bilan yoqing yoki oʻchiring; bu sozlama shu brauzerda saqlanadi (u \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/a\u003E ostida ham bor).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nimaga-tutib-olinadi\"\u003ENimaga tutib olinadi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoʻrsatkich chiziqqa taxminan 10 ekran pikseli yaqinlashganda, bosish qayerga tushishini va uning nomini koʻrsatuvchi belgi chiqadi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBelgi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENomi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQayerda\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKvadrat\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUchi\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChiziqning uchi yoki chiziqlar tutashgan burchak. Egri chiziqning ikki uchi hisobga olinadi; uning boʻylab joylashgan nuqtalar olinmaydi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUchburchak\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOʻrtasi\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EToʻgʻri chiziqning oʻrtasi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXoch\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKesishma\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkki chiziq kesishgan joy yoki bir chiziq ikkinchisida tugagan joy.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQum soati\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EChiziq ustida\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChiziqdagi eng yaqin nuqta, agar uchi, oʻrtasi yoki kesishma yaqin boʻlmasa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEng yaqin uchi, oʻrtasi yoki kesishma ustun keladi. Faqat hech biri yaqin boʻlmasa, nuqta chiziqning oʻzida qoladi. Bir-biriga yaqin joylashgan nuqtalar orasida tanlash uchun kattalashtiring: 10 piksel ekran pikseli boʻlgani uchun, kattaroq kattalashtirishda ular varaqning kamroq qismini qamrab oladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qayerda-ishlaydi\"\u003EQayerda ishlaydi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETutib olish \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChiziqli\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaydon\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAylana\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKesib olish\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibrlash\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETekshirish\u003C/span\u003E rejimlarida ishlaydi, hamda tanlangan belgining burchagini sudrasangiz ham. U yoy nuqtalarini ham joylashtiradi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESanash\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAvtosanash\u003C/span\u003E va qoʻyishda tutib olish ishlamaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETutib olingan nuqta \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ning 45° ga tutib olishidan ustun turadi: chiziqlardan uzoqda 45° da chizish uchun avval \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bilan tutib olishni oʻchiring.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETutib olish yoqilgan holda kalibrlang. Maʼlum oʻlchov chizigʻining yoki devorning ikki uchiga yaqin bosing: ikkala nuqta ham aynan chizmaga tushadi va masshtab aniq chiqadi (shunda holat satri u mos keladigan oldindan oʻrnatilgan masshtabni koʻrsatadi).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tutib-olish-mumkin-bo-lmagan-varaqlar\"\u003ETutib olish mumkin boʻlmagan varaqlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESkanerlangan varaqlar\u003C/strong\u003E rasm boʻlib, tutib olish uchun chiziqlari yoʻq. Holat satrida &quot;Bu varaqda tutib olish uchun chiziqlar yoʻq (skanerlangan sahifa rasm).&quot; deb yoziladi va nuqtalar bosgan joyingizga tushadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJuda katta chizmalar\u003C/strong\u003E: tutib olish har bir varaqda 400,000 tagacha chiziq kesmasini oʻqiydi. Undan koʻp boʻlgan varaqda bu haqda xabar beriladi va faqat birinchilariga tutib olinadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMatn\u003C/strong\u003Ega tutib olinmaydi, agar PDF harflarini chiziq sifatida chizmasa (baʼzi plotterlar shunday qiladi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVaraqning chiziqlari uni birinchi marta ochganingizda fonda oʻqiladi; katta varaqda belgilar paydo boʻlishidan oldin bir soniya ketishi mumkin.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Koʻpgina loyiha toʻplamlari vektor PDF lardir: ularning devorlari va chekkalari piksel emas, haqiqiy chiziqlardir. Oʻlchash vaqtida TakeoffDesk bosishlaringizni shu chiziqlarga tutib oladi, shunda chiziq aynan devor burchagidan boshlanadi va kalibrlash bosgan pikselni emas, chizmachi chizgan oʻlchamni oʻqiydi. Boshlanganda Tutib olish yoqilgan boʻladi. Uni holat satrida Tutib olish yoki F3 bilan yoqing yoki oʻchiring; bu sozlama shu brauzerda saqlanadi (u Sozlamalar ostida ham bor). Nimaga tutib olinadi Koʻrsatkich chiziqqa taxminan 10 ekran pikseli yaqinlashganda, bosish qayerga tushishini va uning nomini koʻrsatuvchi belgi chiqadi: Belgi Nomi Qayerda Kvadrat Uchi Chiziqning uchi yoki chiziqlar tutashgan burchak. Egri chiziqning ikki uchi hisobga olinadi; uning boʻylab joylashgan nuqtalar olinmaydi. Uchburchak Oʻrtasi Toʻgʻri chiziqning oʻrtasi. Xoch Kesishma Ikki chiziq kesishgan joy yoki bir chiziq ikkinchisida tugagan joy. Qum soati Chiziq ustida Chiziqdagi eng yaqin nuqta, agar uchi, oʻrtasi yoki kesishma yaqin boʻlmasa. Eng yaqin uchi, oʻrtasi yoki kesishma ustun keladi. Faqat hech biri yaqin boʻlmasa, nuqta chiziqning oʻzida qoladi. Bir-biriga yaqin joylashgan nuqtalar orasida tanlash uchun kattalashtiring: 10 piksel ekran pikseli boʻlgani uchun, kattaroq kattalashtirishda ular varaqning kamroq qismini qamrab oladi. Qayerda ishlaydi Tutib olish Chiziqli, Maydon, Aylana, Kesib olish, Kalibrlash va Tekshirish rejimlarida ishlaydi, hamda tanlangan belgining burchagini sudrasangiz ham. U yoy nuqtalarini ham joylashtiradi. Sanash, Avtosanash va qoʻyishda tutib olish ishlamaydi. Tutib olingan nuqta Shift ning 45° ga tutib olishidan ustun turadi: chiziqlardan uzoqda 45° da chizish uchun avval F3 bilan tutib olishni oʻchiring. Tutib olish yoqilgan holda kalibrlang. Maʼlum oʻlchov chizigʻining yoki devorning ikki uchiga yaqin bosing: ikkala nuqta ham aynan chizmaga tushadi va masshtab aniq chiqadi (shunda holat satri u mos keladigan oldindan oʻrnatilgan masshtabni koʻrsatadi). Tutib olish mumkin boʻlmagan varaqlar Skanerlangan varaqlar rasm boʻlib, tutib olish uchun chiziqlari yoʻq. Holat satrida \"Bu varaqda tutib olish uchun chiziqlar yoʻq (skanerlangan sahifa rasm).\" deb yoziladi va nuqtalar bosgan joyingizga tushadi. Juda katta chizmalar: tutib olish har bir varaqda 400,000 tagacha chiziq kesmasini oʻqiydi. Undan koʻp boʻlgan varaqda bu haqda xabar beriladi va faqat birinchilariga tutib olinadi. Matnga tutib olinmaydi, agar PDF harflarini chiziq sifatida chizmasa (baʼzi plotterlar shunday qiladi). Varaqning chiziqlari uni birinchi marta ochganingizda fonda oʻqiladi; katta varaqda belgilar paydo boʻlishidan oldin bir soniya ketishi mumkin.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"pick-the-lines","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"\"PDF chiziqlarini tanlash\"","summary":"\"Vektor PDF ning chizigʻini bosing — uning butun ulangan yoʻlini oʻlchang yoki yopiq kontur ichiga bosib uning maydonini oling; boʻshliq chegarasi koʻrsatiladi va har bir segment uchun bitta bekor qilish.\"","section":"tasks","order":36,"keywords":["yoʻl","tanlash","chiziqlar","ulangan","butun yoʻl","kuzatish","kontur","perimetr","boʻshliq","chegara","koʻprik","segmentlar","Tab","vektor","chiziqlardan maydon","p"],"headings":[{"id":"yo-l-yoki-kontur-tanlash","text":"Yoʻl yoki kontur tanlash","level":2},{"id":"bo-shliq-chegarasi","text":"Boʻshliq chegarasi","level":2},{"id":"tugmalar","text":"Tugmalar","level":2},{"id":"bilib-qo-yish-foydali","text":"Bilib qoʻyish foydali","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EVektor PDF da devorlar va chekkalar haqiqiy chiziqlardir. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYoʻl\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ularni chizilgani kabi oladi: chiziqdagi bitta bosish unga ulangan hamma narsani uchidan uchigacha oʻlchaydi, shuning uchun devorni burchaklarini bosib kuzatish shart emas. Varaqda masshtab boʻlishi kerak. Skanerlangan sahifada tanlanadigan chiziqlar yoʻq; u yerda \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003ELinear\u003C/a\u003E yoki \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\"\u003EArea\u003C/a\u003E dan foydalaning.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yo-l-yoki-kontur-tanlash\"\u003EYoʻl yoki kontur tanlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYoʻl\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Kursor ostidagi chiziq konturlanadi, u boshqa mumkin boʻlgan yoʻllar bilan birga ingichka chizilishi mumkin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChiziqni bosing: butun ulangan yoʻl tanlanadi. Asboblar paneli ostidagi satr uning segmentlarini, uzunligini, boʻshliq chegarasini va nechta boʻshliq koʻprik qilinganini beradi. Boshiga qaytib kelgan yoʻl yopiq hisoblanadi va uning perimetrini ham koʻrsatadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYoki yopiq kontur ichiga, chiziqlardan uzoqroq bosing: shu nuqta atrofidagi kontur maydon sifatida tanlanadi. Eng kichigi birinchi keladi; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E navbatdagi kattaroqini sinab koʻradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBelgilarni qoʻshish uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing (yoki oʻng tugma, yoki ikki marta bosish). Tanlangan yoʻl \u003Cstrong\u003ELinear\u003C/strong\u003E elementining belgisiga, kontur \u003Cstrong\u003EArea\u003C/strong\u003E elementining belgisiga aylanadi: agar faol element shu turga ega boʻlsa oʻsha, aks holda shu turdagi eng yangisi. Bunday element boʻlmasa, yangi element shakli ochiladi va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni yana bosmaguningizcha hech narsa qoʻshilmaydi. Tanlangan hamma narsa bitta bekor qilish qadamida qoʻshiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bo-shliq-chegarasi\"\u003EBoʻshliq chegarasi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChizmachilar chiziqlar uchrashishi kerak boʻlgan joylarda kichik teshiklar qoldiradi. Ikki chiziq uchlari \u003Cstrong\u003Eboʻshliq chegarasi\u003C/strong\u003Edan yaqinroq boʻlsa birlashadi. U varaqda 1.5 nuqtadan boshlanadi (masshtabda futlar va dyuymlarda koʻrsatiladi); shu kenglikdagi punktirli halqa kursorni kuzatadi va ostidagi yoʻlning har bir uchida turadi. Koʻprik qilingan har bir teshik tanlangan yoʻlda toʻq sariq rang bilan halqalanadi, va satr ularni sanaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E chegarani kengaytiradi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kichikroq qiladi. Tanlangan yoʻl yangi chegarada darhol qayta ulanadi. Tutashuv joyida yoʻl eng kam buriladigan tarzda toʻgʻri davom etadi va tarmoqni qoldiradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tugmalar\"\u003ETugmalar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETugma yoki amal\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENima qiladi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBosish\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKursor ostidagi yoʻlni yoki uning atrofidagi konturni tanlaydi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + bosish\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETanlanganga yana yoʻl yoki kontur qoʻshadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKursor ostidagi navbatdagi yoʻlni yoki navbatdagi kattaroq konturni sinab koʻradi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOxirgi tanlangan yoʻldan oxirgi segmentni olib tashlaydi, bir vaqtda bitta segment. Segmentlari qolmagan yoʻl ham yoʻqoladi. Hech narsa tanlanmagan boʻlsa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oddiy bekor qilishdir.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoʻshliq chegarasini kichikroq va kengroq qiladi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBelgilarni qoʻshadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETanlanganlarni tozalaydi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilib-qo-yish-foydali\"\u003EBilib qoʻyish foydali\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChizmadagi egri chiziq qisqa toʻgʻri boʻlaklar zanjiri, shuning uchun uning uzunligi haqiqiy yoy uzunligidan bir oz kam. Aniq yoy uchun chizmaning oʻz faylini oʻlchang (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\"\u003EChizmadan oʻlchash\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKoʻprik qilingan boʻshliq uni kesib oʻtuvchi toʻgʻri sakrash hisoblanadi, shuning uchun yopiq konturning perimetriga u kiradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaqat sahifaning oʻz yoʻllaridagi chiziqlar va toʻldirishlar chiziq hisoblanadi. Harf sifatida chizilgan matn va rasmlar emas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Vektor PDF da devorlar va chekkalar haqiqiy chiziqlardir. Yoʻl (P) ularni chizilgani kabi oladi: chiziqdagi bitta bosish unga ulangan hamma narsani uchidan uchigacha oʻlchaydi, shuning uchun devorni burchaklarini bosib kuzatish shart emas. Varaqda masshtab boʻlishi kerak. Skanerlangan sahifada tanlanadigan chiziqlar yoʻq; u yerda Linear yoki Area dan foydalaning. Yoʻl yoki kontur tanlash Yoʻl ni tanlang. Kursor ostidagi chiziq konturlanadi, u boshqa mumkin boʻlgan yoʻllar bilan birga ingichka chizilishi mumkin. Chiziqni bosing: butun ulangan yoʻl tanlanadi. Asboblar paneli ostidagi satr uning segmentlarini, uzunligini, boʻshliq chegarasini va nechta boʻshliq koʻprik qilinganini beradi. Boshiga qaytib kelgan yoʻl yopiq hisoblanadi va uning perimetrini ham koʻrsatadi. Yoki yopiq kontur ichiga, chiziqlardan uzoqroq bosing: shu nuqta atrofidagi kontur maydon sifatida tanlanadi. Eng kichigi birinchi keladi; Tab navbatdagi kattaroqini sinab koʻradi. Belgilarni qoʻshish uchun Enter ni bosing (yoki oʻng tugma, yoki ikki marta bosish). Tanlangan yoʻl Linear elementining belgisiga, kontur Area elementining belgisiga aylanadi: agar faol element shu turga ega boʻlsa oʻsha, aks holda shu turdagi eng yangisi. Bunday element boʻlmasa, yangi element shakli ochiladi va Enter ni yana bosmaguningizcha hech narsa qoʻshilmaydi. Tanlangan hamma narsa bitta bekor qilish qadamida qoʻshiladi. Boʻshliq chegarasi Chizmachilar chiziqlar uchrashishi kerak boʻlgan joylarda kichik teshiklar qoldiradi. Ikki chiziq uchlari boʻshliq chegarasidan yaqinroq boʻlsa birlashadi. U varaqda 1.5 nuqtadan boshlanadi (masshtabda futlar va dyuymlarda koʻrsatiladi); shu kenglikdagi punktirli halqa kursorni kuzatadi va ostidagi yoʻlning har bir uchida turadi. Koʻprik qilingan har bir teshik tanlangan yoʻlda toʻq sariq rang bilan halqalanadi, va satr ularni sanaydi. ] chegarani kengaytiradi, [ kichikroq qiladi. Tanlangan yoʻl yangi chegarada darhol qayta ulanadi. Tutashuv joyida yoʻl eng kam buriladigan tarzda toʻgʻri davom etadi va tarmoqni qoldiradi. Tugmalar Tugma yoki amal Nima qiladi Bosish Kursor ostidagi yoʻlni yoki uning atrofidagi konturni tanlaydi. Shift + bosish Tanlanganga yana yoʻl yoki kontur qoʻshadi. Tab Kursor ostidagi navbatdagi yoʻlni yoki navbatdagi kattaroq konturni sinab koʻradi. Backspace yoki Ctrl+Z Oxirgi tanlangan yoʻldan oxirgi segmentni olib tashlaydi, bir vaqtda bitta segment. Segmentlari qolmagan yoʻl ham yoʻqoladi. Hech narsa tanlanmagan boʻlsa, Ctrl+Z oddiy bekor qilishdir. [ va ] Boʻshliq chegarasini kichikroq va kengroq qiladi. Enter Belgilarni qoʻshadi. Esc Tanlanganlarni tozalaydi. Bilib qoʻyish foydali Chizmadagi egri chiziq qisqa toʻgʻri boʻlaklar zanjiri, shuning uchun uning uzunligi haqiqiy yoy uzunligidan bir oz kam. Aniq yoy uchun chizmaning oʻz faylini oʻlchang (Chizmadan oʻlchash). Koʻprik qilingan boʻshliq uni kesib oʻtuvchi toʻgʻri sakrash hisoblanadi, shuning uchun yopiq konturning perimetriga u kiradi. Faqat sahifaning oʻz yoʻllaridagi chiziqlar va toʻldirishlar chiziq hisoblanadi. Harf sifatida chizilgan matn va rasmlar emas.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"measure-linear","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Chiziqli yoʻllarni oʻlchash","summary":"Devorlar, quvurlar, bezak va boshqa uzunliklarni yoʻl sifatida oling: toʻgʻri kesmalar, yoylar va Shift bilan 45 gradusli tortish bilan.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["chiziqli","uzunlik","yoʻl","polichiziq","devorlar","lf","chiziqli fut","yoy","egri","45 gradus","ortogonal","tortish","kesmalar","polylength","ayirish","ochiqlik","eshik","boʻshliq","kiritish","kiritilgan","koordinatalar","masofa","toʻgʻri masofa","polyar"],"headings":[{"id":"yo-lni-chizish","text":"Yoʻlni chizish","level":2},{"id":"45-qadamli-to-g-ri-chiziqlar","text":"45° qadamli toʻgʻri chiziqlar","level":2},{"id":"yoylar-va-egri-devorlar","text":"Yoylar va egri devorlar","level":2},{"id":"uzunliklar-va-koordinatalarni-kiritish","text":"Uzunliklar va koordinatalarni kiritish","level":2},{"id":"yo-lning-bir-qismini-ayirish","text":"Yoʻlning bir qismini ayirish","level":2},{"id":"yo-l-tafsilotlarini-ko-rish","text":"Yoʻl tafsilotlarini koʻrish","level":2},{"id":"yo-lni-tuzatish","text":"Yoʻlni tuzatish","level":2},{"id":"devor-maydoni","text":"Devor maydoni","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EChiziqli element uzunlikni oʻlchaydi. Har bir yoʻl nuqtalar zanjiri: toʻgʻri kesmalar va yoy rejimini yoqqan joyda yoylar. Element istalgan sonli varaqda istalgan sonli yoʻlga ega boʻlishi mumkin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoshlashdan oldin: varaqqa masshtab kerak (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EMasshtabni oʻrnatish\u003C/a\u003E) va chiziqli element kerak (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EHajm elementlarini yaratish\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVektor PDF da bosishlaringiz chizmaning oʻz chiziqlariga tortiladi: uchlari, oʻrtalari va kesishmalari (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003EChizma chiziqlariga tortish\u003C/a\u003E; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uni oʻchiradi).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yo-lni-chizish\"\u003EYoʻlni chizish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E ostidagi chiziqli elementni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAsboblar panelida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYoʻlning boshini bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBoʻylab har bir burchakni bosing. Holat satrida &quot;Uzunlik&quot; (kursorgacha boʻlgan yoʻl) va &quot;kesma&quot; (chizayotgan kesma) fut va dyuymda koʻrinadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYoʻlni tugating: oxirgi nuqtani ikki marta bosing, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing yoki oʻng tugmani bosing. Yoʻl element rangida chiziladi va tanlangan belgiga aylanadi. Elementning uzunligi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E roʻyxatida va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E jadvalida oshadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAsbob \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E da qoladi, shuning uchun keyingi yoʻlni darhol boshlashingiz mumkin. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E ga qaytish uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChizish paytida:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) oxirgi nuqtani olib tashlaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tugallanmagan yoʻlni tashlab yuboradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESudrash varaqni suradi, gʻildirak kattalashtiradi, nuqta qoʻshmasdan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMac sensorli panelida oʻng tugma — ikki barmoq bosish (Tizim sozlamalari, Trackpad boʻlimida ikkilamchi bosishni yoqing). TakeoffDesk faqat ikkilamchi tugmani oʻqiydi, shuning uchun Control-bosish oddiy bosish sifatida qabul qilinib, nuqta qoʻshishi mumkin. Ikki marta bosish yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E har doim tugatadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESensorli ekranda nuqta qoʻyish uchun tegining, surish uchun bitta barmoqni sudrang, kattalashtirish uchun ikki barmoq bilan chimdiring. Uzoq bosib, ikki marta teginib yoki varaq ostidagi panelda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFinish\u003C/span\u003E ni bosib tugating (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E oxirgi nuqtani qaytaradi). Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/troubleshooting#touch-screens\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/troubleshooting\" data-hash=\"touch-screens\"\u003EMuammolarni bartaraf etish\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"45-qadamli-to-g-ri-chiziqlar\"\u003E45° qadamli toʻgʻri chiziqlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENuqta qoʻyayotganda \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni ushlab turing. Oxirgi nuqtadan kesma eng yaqin 0°, 45°, 90° yoki 135° yoʻnalishga tortiladi va siz sudragan uzunlikni saqlaydi. Holat satri eslatadi: &quot;Shift 45° ga tortadi&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYoy rejimida u yoy tugaydigan joyga qoʻllanadi: yoy vatari boshlanadigan joydan 45° qadamlarda yoʻnaladi. Egri ustida bosgan nuqtangiz hech qachon tortilmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yoylar-va-egri-devorlar\"\u003EYoylar va egri devorlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYoʻlni chizayotganda egri boshlanadigan nuqtani qoʻying.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYoy rejimini yoqing: asboblar panelida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing. Tugma bosilgan holatda qoladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEgri ustidagi istalgan nuqtani bosing, uning oʻrtasiga yaqin. Holat satriga &quot;(yoy: tugaydigan joyni bosing)&quot; qoʻshiladi va koʻrinish sizning nuqtangiz orqali egiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEgri tugaydigan joyni bosing. Yoy qoʻshiladi. Uning uzunligi aniq yoy uzunligi, qisqa vatarlar zanjiri emas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKeyingi egri ustidagi boshqa nuqtani va uning oxirini bosing va yoylarni chizishda davom eting, yoki toʻgʻri kesmalarga qaytish uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni yana bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E avval egri ustidagi kutilayotgan nuqtani tashlaydi; odatdagidek nuqtalarni olib tashlash uchun yana bosing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uzunliklar-va-koordinatalarni-kiritish\"\u003EUzunliklar va koordinatalarni kiritish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBirinchi nuqtadan keyin bosish oʻrniga keyingi nuqta qayerga borishini yozishingiz mumkin. Raqam, \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E yoki \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E yozing: holat satrida yozganingiz bilan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EType\u003C/span\u003E maydoni ochiladi. Nuqtani qoʻyish uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing; maydon keyingisi uchun ochiq qoladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKiritish\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKeyingi nuqta boradi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12&#039;-6&quot; oxirgi nuqtadan, kursor tomon (yoʻnalishni koʻrsating, soʻng uzunlikni yozing)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;&lt;45\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12&#039;-6&quot; 45° da, ekranning oʻng tomonidan soat strelkasi teskari yoʻnalishda hisoblanadi (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;90\u003C/code\u003E yuqoriga, \u003Ccode\u003E&lt;-90\u003C/code\u003E pastga)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E@6&#039;,-4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eoxirgi nuqtadan 6&#039; oʻngga va 4&#039; pastga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6&#039;,4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E (yoki \u003Ccode\u003E#6&#039;,4&#039;\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eshu yoʻlning birinchi nuqtasidan 6&#039; oʻngga va 4&#039; yuqoriga\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUzunliklar TakeoffDesk da hamma joyda boʻlgani kabi yoziladi (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EKiritish formatlari\u003C/a\u003E): \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12.5\u003C/code\u003E (fut), \u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E. &quot;Oʻng&quot; va &quot;yuqori&quot; varaqni qanday koʻrsangiz shunday, PDF sahifasi aylantirilgan boʻlsa ham.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoʻsh maydonda \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E varaqdagidek yoʻlni tugatadi; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E maydonni yopadi, lekin yoʻl davom etadi. Yozilgan nuqtalar bosishlar bilan bir xil qoidalardan oʻtadi: ayirmalar, yoylar va maydonni yopish ishlaydi. Xuddi shu maydon \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E da ishlaydi; aylana markazidan keyin u radiusni oladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yo-lning-bir-qismini-ayirish\"\u003EYoʻlning bir qismini ayirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEshik yoki vitrinadan oʻtadigan devor yoʻlini toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri chizish mumkin va baribir faqat devor hisoblanadi: ochiqlik boʻylab kesmalar \u003Cstrong\u003Eayirmalar\u003C/strong\u003E boʻladi. Ular shtrixli va ingichka chiziladi hamda hisobga olinmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChizish paytida:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOchiqlik boshlanadigan nuqtani qoʻying.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAsboblar panelida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing. Tugma bosilgan holatda qoladi va holat satri keyingi kesmalar ayirmalar ekanini aytadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOchiqlik tugaydigan joyni bosing. Kesma shtrixli chiziladi; holat satridagi &quot;Uzunlik&quot; uni chiqarib tashlaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni yana bosing va devor boʻylab davom eting.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChizgandan keyin: yoʻlni tanlang. \u003Cstrong\u003ETanlangan belgi\u003C/strong\u003E ostida har bir kesmada \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E qutisi bor: kesmani ayirish uchun belgilang, uni qayta hisobga olish uchun belgisini olib tashlang. Har bir oʻzgarish bitta ortga qaytarish qadami.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYoʻlda har doim kamida bitta hisobga olinadigan kesma qoladi. Panelda keyin \u003Cstrong\u003EAyirmalar\u003C/strong\u003E (ayirilgan uzunlik) va \u003Cstrong\u003EChizilgan\u003C/strong\u003E (butun yoʻl) koʻrinadi; \u003Cstrong\u003EUzunlik\u003C/strong\u003E, elementning miqdori, devor maydoni va xarajatlarning hammasi ayirmalarsiz uzunlikdan foydalanadi. 3D tekshiruv koʻrinishida devorda boʻshliq qoladi, belgilangan PDF ayirmalarni shtrixli chizadi va eksport qilingan \u003Cstrong\u003EBelgilar\u003C/strong\u003E varagʻi ularni roʻyxatga oladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBurchakni siljitish ayirmalarni saqlaydi. Nuqtalarni qoʻshish yoki olib tashlash (yoʻlni qayta chizish orqali) ularsiz boshlanadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yo-l-tafsilotlarini-ko-rish\"\u003EYoʻl tafsilotlarini koʻrish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ni tanlang va yoʻlni bosing. Oʻngdagi \u003Cstrong\u003ETanlangan belgi\u003C/strong\u003E quyidagilarni koʻrsatadi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eu tegishli boʻlgan element (yoʻlni u yerga oʻtkazish uchun roʻyxatdan boshqa chiziqli elementni tanlang),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Evaraq,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUzunlik\u003C/strong\u003E fut va dyuymda hamda LF da,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKesmalar\u003C/strong\u003E soni va element balandligi boʻlsa, \u003Cstrong\u003EDevor maydoni\u003C/strong\u003E,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehar bir kesmaning uzunligi, yoylardan keyin &quot;(yoy)&quot; bilan, va uning \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E qutisi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVaraqda tanlangan yoʻlning har bir kesmasi uzunligi bilan belgilanadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yo-lni-tuzatish\"\u003EYoʻlni tuzatish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENuqtani siljitish\u003C/strong\u003E: yoʻlni tanlang, soʻng uning kvadrat burchak dastaklaridan birini sudrang. Siljitilgan kesmani 45° qadamlarga tortish uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni ushlab turing. Yoy oʻz bulge ini saqlaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYoyni egish\u003C/strong\u003E: tanlangan yoʻlda har bir yoy oʻrtasida dumaloq dastak koʻrinadi. Uni sudrang: yoy qoʻyib yuborgan joyingiz orqali oʻtadi, shuning uchun u koʻproq, kamroq yoki teskari egiladi. Uchlari orasidagi toʻgʻri chiziqqa sudrasangiz, u toʻgʻri kesmaga aylanadi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uni bekor qiladi (&quot;Yoyni egish&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYoʻlni oʻchirish\u003C/strong\u003E: uni tanlang va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing, asboblar panelining \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E menyusidan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki panelda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete mark\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOrtga qaytarish\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; qayta bajarish \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bilan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHozircha yoʻl oʻrtasiga nuqta qoʻshib boʻlmaydi. Yoʻlni oʻchiring va qayta chizing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"devor-maydoni\"\u003EDevor maydoni\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChiziqli elementga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E bering (masalan, \u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E). Keyin u \u003Cstrong\u003EDevor maydoni (A)\u003C/strong\u003E = uzunlik × balandlik ni SF da (yoki metrik element uchun m² da) koʻrsatadi, va devor maydoni jadval eksportining izohlar ustuniga tushadi. Uni yigʻmalarda taxta, boʻyoq yoki izolyatsiya uchun ishlating: qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EYigʻmalar va formulalar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Chiziqli element uzunlikni oʻlchaydi. Har bir yoʻl nuqtalar zanjiri: toʻgʻri kesmalar va yoy rejimini yoqqan joyda yoylar. Element istalgan sonli varaqda istalgan sonli yoʻlga ega boʻlishi mumkin. Boshlashdan oldin: varaqqa masshtab kerak (Masshtabni oʻrnatish) va chiziqli element kerak (Hajm elementlarini yaratish). Vektor PDF da bosishlaringiz chizmaning oʻz chiziqlariga tortiladi: uchlari, oʻrtalari va kesishmalari (Chizma chiziqlariga tortish; F3 uni oʻchiradi). Yoʻlni chizish Items ostidagi chiziqli elementni bosing. Asboblar panelida Linear ni tanlang yoki L ni bosing. Yoʻlning boshini bosing. Boʻylab har bir burchakni bosing. Holat satrida \"Uzunlik\" (kursorgacha boʻlgan yoʻl) va \"kesma\" (chizayotgan kesma) fut va dyuymda koʻrinadi. Yoʻlni tugating: oxirgi nuqtani ikki marta bosing, Enter ni bosing yoki oʻng tugmani bosing. Yoʻl element rangida chiziladi va tanlangan belgiga aylanadi. Elementning uzunligi Items roʻyxatida va Quantities jadvalida oshadi. Asbob Linear da qoladi, shuning uchun keyingi yoʻlni darhol boshlashingiz mumkin. Select ga qaytish uchun Esc ni bosing. Chizish paytida: Backspace (yoki Delete) oxirgi nuqtani olib tashlaydi. Esc tugallanmagan yoʻlni tashlab yuboradi. Sudrash varaqni suradi, gʻildirak kattalashtiradi, nuqta qoʻshmasdan. Mac sensorli panelida oʻng tugma — ikki barmoq bosish (Tizim sozlamalari, Trackpad boʻlimida ikkilamchi bosishni yoqing). TakeoffDesk faqat ikkilamchi tugmani oʻqiydi, shuning uchun Control-bosish oddiy bosish sifatida qabul qilinib, nuqta qoʻshishi mumkin. Ikki marta bosish yoki Enter har doim tugatadi. Sensorli ekranda nuqta qoʻyish uchun tegining, surish uchun bitta barmoqni sudrang, kattalashtirish uchun ikki barmoq bilan chimdiring. Uzoq bosib, ikki marta teginib yoki varaq ostidagi panelda Finish ni bosib tugating (Back oxirgi nuqtani qaytaradi). Qarang: Muammolarni bartaraf etish. 45° qadamli toʻgʻri chiziqlar Nuqta qoʻyayotganda Shift ni ushlab turing. Oxirgi nuqtadan kesma eng yaqin 0°, 45°, 90° yoki 135° yoʻnalishga tortiladi va siz sudragan uzunlikni saqlaydi. Holat satri eslatadi: \"Shift 45° ga tortadi\". Yoy rejimida u yoy tugaydigan joyga qoʻllanadi: yoy vatari boshlanadigan joydan 45° qadamlarda yoʻnaladi. Egri ustida bosgan nuqtangiz hech qachon tortilmaydi. Yoylar va egri devorlar Yoʻlni chizayotganda egri boshlanadigan nuqtani qoʻying. Yoy rejimini yoqing: asboblar panelida Arc ni tanlang yoki R ni bosing. Tugma bosilgan holatda qoladi. Egri ustidagi istalgan nuqtani bosing, uning oʻrtasiga yaqin. Holat satriga \"(yoy: tugaydigan joyni bosing)\" qoʻshiladi va koʻrinish sizning nuqtangiz orqali egiladi. Egri tugaydigan joyni bosing. Yoy qoʻshiladi. Uning uzunligi aniq yoy uzunligi, qisqa vatarlar zanjiri emas. Keyingi egri ustidagi boshqa nuqtani va uning oxirini bosing va yoylarni chizishda davom eting, yoki toʻgʻri kesmalarga qaytish uchun R ni yana bosing. Backspace yoki Esc avval egri ustidagi kutilayotgan nuqtani tashlaydi; odatdagidek nuqtalarni olib tashlash uchun yana bosing. Uzunliklar va koordinatalarni kiritish Birinchi nuqtadan keyin bosish oʻrniga keyingi nuqta qayerga borishini yozishingiz mumkin. Raqam, @ yoki # yozing: holat satrida yozganingiz bilan Type maydoni ochiladi. Nuqtani qoʻyish uchun Enter ni bosing; maydon keyingisi uchun ochiq qoladi. Kiritish Keyingi nuqta boradi 12'6\" 12'-6\" oxirgi nuqtadan, kursor tomon (yoʻnalishni koʻrsating, soʻng uzunlikni yozing) 12'6\"\u003C45 12'-6\" 45° da, ekranning oʻng tomonidan soat strelkasi teskari yoʻnalishda hisoblanadi (\u003C90 yuqoriga, \u003C-90 pastga) @6',-4' oxirgi nuqtadan 6' oʻngga va 4' pastga 6',4' (yoki #6',4') shu yoʻlning birinchi nuqtasidan 6' oʻngga va 4' yuqoriga Uzunliklar TakeoffDesk da hamma joyda boʻlgani kabi yoziladi (Kiritish formatlari): 12'-6 1/2\", 12.5 (fut), 30\", 3.2 m. \"Oʻng\" va \"yuqori\" varaqni qanday koʻrsangiz shunday, PDF sahifasi aylantirilgan boʻlsa ham. Boʻsh maydonda Enter varaqdagidek yoʻlni tugatadi; Esc maydonni yopadi, lekin yoʻl davom etadi. Yozilgan nuqtalar bosishlar bilan bir xil qoidalardan oʻtadi: ayirmalar, yoylar va maydonni yopish ishlaydi. Xuddi shu maydon Area va Cut-out da ishlaydi; aylana markazidan keyin u radiusni oladi. Yoʻlning bir qismini ayirish Eshik yoki vitrinadan oʻtadigan devor yoʻlini toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri chizish mumkin va baribir faqat devor hisoblanadi: ochiqlik boʻylab kesmalar ayirmalar boʻladi. Ular shtrixli va ingichka chiziladi hamda hisobga olinmaydi. Chizish paytida: Ochiqlik boshlanadigan nuqtani qoʻying. Asboblar panelida Deduct ni tanlang yoki E ni bosing. Tugma bosilgan holatda qoladi va holat satri keyingi kesmalar ayirmalar ekanini aytadi. Ochiqlik tugaydigan joyni bosing. Kesma shtrixli chiziladi; holat satridagi \"Uzunlik\" uni chiqarib tashlaydi. E ni yana bosing va devor boʻylab davom eting. Chizgandan keyin: yoʻlni tanlang. Tanlangan belgi ostida har bir kesmada Deduct qutisi bor: kesmani ayirish uchun belgilang, uni qayta hisobga olish uchun belgisini olib tashlang. Har bir oʻzgarish bitta ortga qaytarish qadami. Yoʻlda har doim kamida bitta hisobga olinadigan kesma qoladi. Panelda keyin Ayirmalar (ayirilgan uzunlik) va Chizilgan (butun yoʻl) koʻrinadi; Uzunlik, elementning miqdori, devor maydoni va xarajatlarning hammasi ayirmalarsiz uzunlikdan foydalanadi. 3D tekshiruv koʻrinishida devorda boʻshliq qoladi, belgilangan PDF ayirmalarni shtrixli chizadi va eksport qilingan Belgilar varagʻi ularni roʻyxatga oladi. Burchakni siljitish ayirmalarni saqlaydi. Nuqtalarni qoʻshish yoki olib tashlash (yoʻlni qayta chizish orqali) ularsiz boshlanadi. Yoʻl tafsilotlarini koʻrish Select (V) ni tanlang va yoʻlni bosing. Oʻngdagi Tanlangan belgi quyidagilarni koʻrsatadi: u tegishli boʻlgan element (yoʻlni u yerga oʻtkazish uchun roʻyxatdan boshqa chiziqli elementni tanlang), varaq, Uzunlik fut va dyuymda hamda LF da, Kesmalar soni va element balandligi boʻlsa, Devor maydoni, har bir kesmaning uzunligi, yoylardan keyin \"(yoy)\" bilan, va uning Deduct qutisi. Varaqda tanlangan yoʻlning har bir kesmasi uzunligi bilan belgilanadi. Yoʻlni tuzatish Nuqtani siljitish: yoʻlni tanlang, soʻng uning kvadrat burchak dastaklaridan birini sudrang. Siljitilgan kesmani 45° qadamlarga tortish uchun Shift ni ushlab turing. Yoy oʻz bulge ini saqlaydi. Yoyni egish: tanlangan yoʻlda har bir yoy oʻrtasida dumaloq dastak koʻrinadi. Uni sudrang: yoy qoʻyib yuborgan joyingiz orqali oʻtadi, shuning uchun u koʻproq, kamroq yoki teskari egiladi. Uchlari orasidagi toʻgʻri chiziqqa sudrasangiz, u toʻgʻri kesmaga aylanadi. Ctrl+Z uni bekor qiladi (\"Yoyni egish\"). Yoʻlni oʻchirish: uni tanlang va Delete ni bosing, asboblar panelining More menyusidan Delete ni tanlang yoki panelda Delete mark ni tanlang. Ortga qaytarish: Ctrl+Z; qayta bajarish Ctrl+Y bilan. Hozircha yoʻl oʻrtasiga nuqta qoʻshib boʻlmaydi. Yoʻlni oʻchiring va qayta chizing. Devor maydoni Chiziqli elementga Height bering (masalan, 9'-0\"). Keyin u Devor maydoni (A) = uzunlik × balandlik ni SF da (yoki metrik element uchun m² da) koʻrsatadi, va devor maydoni jadval eksportining izohlar ustuniga tushadi. Uni yigʻmalarda taxta, boʻyoq yoki izolyatsiya uchun ishlating: qarang: Yigʻmalar va formulalar.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"show-lengths-in-meters","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Uzunliklarni metrda koʻrsatish","summary":"Uzunliklarni fut-dyuym oʻrniga metrda, santimetrda yoki millimetrda koʻring va maydonlarni m2 da koʻring.","section":"tasks","order":45,"keywords":["metr","metrlar","santimetr","millimetr","metrik","uzunliklarni koʻrsatish","global boʻyicha","birliklar","koʻrinish","m2","kvadrat metr","devor maydoni","fut-dyuym","harorat","selsiy"],"headings":[{"id":"nima-qilasiz","text":"Nima qilasiz","level":2},{"id":"qadamlar","text":"Qadamlar","level":2},{"id":"eslatmalar","text":"Eslatmalar","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"nima-qilasiz\"\u003ENima qilasiz\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk uzunliklarni qanday koʻrsatishini oʻzgartiring, shunda metrik ish varaqda, holat satrida va panellarda metrda, santimetrda yoki millimetrda oʻqiladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qadamlar\"\u003EQadamlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E ni ilova panelidagi tishli tugma yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bilan oching va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E yorligʻida qoling.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUzunliklarni koʻrsatish\u003C/span\u003E ni toping va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFut-dyuym\u003C/span\u003E, m, cm yoki mm ni tanlang. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal boʻyicha\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBirliklar\u003C/span\u003E ichida yulduzcha qoʻyilgan metrik uzunlik birligidan foydalanadi, hech narsa belgilanmagan boʻlsa — fut-dyuym.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVaraqqa qarang: holat satridagi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElementlar\u003C/span\u003E roʻyxatidagi va panellardagi uzunliklar endi tanlagan birlikda oʻqiladi. Balandliklar, chuqurlik, qalinlik va sathlar ham shunday.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EElement haroratini Selsiy yoki Farengeyt gradusida oʻqish uchun shu yorliqda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHaroratni quyidagicha koʻrsatish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eslatmalar\"\u003EEslatmalar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaqat koʻrinish oʻzgaradi. Miqdorlar, xarajatlar va eksport aniq uzunliklardan hisoblanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBalandlik maydoniga yozilgan oddiy raqam koʻrsatilgan birlikda oʻqiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E1/16, 1/8 va 1/4 dyuym tanlovi faqat fut-dyuym uchun koʻrinadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMetrik element bilan oʻlchangan maydon chizmada, belgi panelida va jadvalda m2 deb yoziladi. Balandlikli chiziqli element devor maydonini ham koʻrsatadi. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/units\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/units\"\u003EBirliklar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Nima qilasiz TakeoffDesk uzunliklarni qanday koʻrsatishini oʻzgartiring, shunda metrik ish varaqda, holat satrida va panellarda metrda, santimetrda yoki millimetrda oʻqiladi. Qadamlar Sozlamalar ni ilova panelidagi tishli tugma yoki Ctrl+, bilan oching va TakeoffDesk yorligʻida qoling. Uzunliklarni koʻrsatish ni toping va Fut-dyuym, m, cm yoki mm ni tanlang. Global boʻyicha Sozlamalar › Global › Birliklar ichida yulduzcha qoʻyilgan metrik uzunlik birligidan foydalanadi, hech narsa belgilanmagan boʻlsa — fut-dyuym. Varaqqa qarang: holat satridagi, Elementlar roʻyxatidagi va panellardagi uzunliklar endi tanlagan birlikda oʻqiladi. Balandliklar, chuqurlik, qalinlik va sathlar ham shunday. Element haroratini Selsiy yoki Farengeyt gradusida oʻqish uchun shu yorliqda Haroratni quyidagicha koʻrsatish ni tanlang. Eslatmalar Faqat koʻrinish oʻzgaradi. Miqdorlar, xarajatlar va eksport aniq uzunliklardan hisoblanadi. Balandlik maydoniga yozilgan oddiy raqam koʻrsatilgan birlikda oʻqiladi. 1/16, 1/8 va 1/4 dyuym tanlovi faqat fut-dyuym uchun koʻrinadi. Metrik element bilan oʻlchangan maydon chizmada, belgi panelida va jadvalda m2 deb yoziladi. Balandlikli chiziqli element devor maydonini ham koʻrsatadi. Qarang: Birliklar.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"sign-off-the-estimate","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Stavkasi yoʻq qatorlar va smetani tasdiqlash","summary":"Smetaning qaysi qatorlarida miqdor bor-u stavka yoʻqligini koʻring, smetani oʻz ismingiz bilan tasdiqlang — shunda fayl kim, qachon va qaysi jami bilan tasdiqlaganini yozib oladi — va raqamni bosib, undan kelgan belgilarni tanlang.","section":"tasks","order":46,"keywords":["smeta","tasdiqlash","tasdiqlangan","tasdiq","stavkasi yoʻq","stavkasiz","narxsiz","stavka","jami","miqdor boʻyicha ekspert","yozuv","audit","belgilarni tanlash","raqam","kuzatish"],"headings":[{"id":"nima-qilasiz","text":"Nima qilasiz","level":2},{"id":"stavkasi-yo-q-qatorlar","text":"Stavkasi yoʻq qatorlar","level":2},{"id":"smetani-tasdiqlash","text":"Smetani tasdiqlash","level":2},{"id":"raqam-qayerdan-kelganini-ko-rish-uchun-bosing","text":"Raqam qayerdan kelganini koʻrish uchun bosing","level":2},{"id":"foydali-ma-lumot","text":"Foydali maʼlumot","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"nima-qilasiz\"\u003ENima qilasiz\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESmetaning har bir qatori narxlanganini tekshiring, keyin ismingizni qoʻying. Hajm fayli kim tasdiqlaganini, qachon va qaysi jami uchun ekanini yozib oladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"stavkasi-yo-q-qatorlar\"\u003EStavkasi yoʻq qatorlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMiqdorlar › Element boʻyicha\u003C/strong\u003E da miqdori bor, lekin material yoki mehnat stavkasi yoʻq qator \u003Cstrong\u003Estavkasi yoʻq\u003C/strong\u003E deb belgilanadi va jadval ustidagi satr shunday qatorlar nechta ekanini koʻrsatadi. Bunday qator jamiga hech narsa qoʻshmaydi. Oʻz stavkasi boʻlmagan element, agar uning tarkibiy qismlaridan biri narxlangan boʻlsa, belgilanmaydi: yigʻma uning qismlari orqali narxlanadi. Eksport qilingan smetaning Izohlar ustunida har bunday qator uchun \u003Cstrong\u003EStavkasi yoʻq\u003C/strong\u003E yoziladi va ular sanaladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"smetani-tasdiqlash\"\u003ESmetani tasdiqlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiqdorlar jadvali ustidagi \u003Cstrong\u003ESmetani tasdiqlash\u003C/strong\u003E tugmasini bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuloqot tasdiqlayotgan jamingizni koʻrsatadi va stavkasi yoʻq qatorlarni sanab chiqadi. Ismingizni va xohlasangiz lavozimingizni kiriting.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETasdiqlash\u003C/strong\u003E ni bosing. Satrda endi &quot;Tasdiqlagan: …&quot; va jami koʻrinadi. Uni faylda saqlash uchun hajmni saqlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETasdiqlash siz tasdiqlagan raqamlarga tegishli. Keyingi har qanday miqdor, stavka yoki qator oʻzgarishi uni bekor qiladi va TakeoffDesk buni aytadi. Ortga qaytarish tasdiqlangan smetani va uning tasdiqlashini qaytaradi. Qatorni qayta nomlash raqam oʻzgarishi hisoblanmaydi. \u003Cstrong\u003ETasdiqlashni olib tashlash\u003C/strong\u003E uni yoʻq qiladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk tashqarisida tahrirlangan hajm fayli tasdiqlangandan keyin tasdiqsiz ochiladi va bu haqda izoh chiqadi. Eksport qilingan smeta (CSV va XLSX) jami ostida tasdiqlashni nomlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaqat inson tasdiqlaydi. AI yordamchi smeta tasdiqlanganmi va qaysi stavkalar yoʻqligini oʻqiy oladi; lekin tasdiqlash imkoni yoʻq.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"raqam-qayerdan-kelganini-ko-rish-uchun-bosing\"\u003ERaqam qayerdan kelganini koʻrish uchun bosing\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQatordagi miqdor yoki summani bosing — undan oʻlchangan belgilar tanlanadi. Ular boshqa varaqda boʻlsa, oʻsha varaq ochiladi. \u003Cstrong\u003EIsh boʻyicha jami\u003C/strong\u003E qatoridagi raqamni bosing — shu varaqdagi hamma belgilar tanlanadi. Kiritilgan miqdorda belgi yoʻq.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"foydali-ma-lumot\"\u003EFoydali maʼlumot\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETasdiqlash ismni kiritilganidek yozib oladi. Bu faylda yozuv, elektron imzo emas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHajmda subpudratchilarga yoki muqobillarga berilgan taklif paketlari boʻlsa, tasdiqlangan jami \u003Cstrong\u003EIsh boʻyicha jami\u003C/strong\u003E sifatida koʻrsatilgan asosiy taklif boʻladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Nima qilasiz Smetaning har bir qatori narxlanganini tekshiring, keyin ismingizni qoʻying. Hajm fayli kim tasdiqlaganini, qachon va qaysi jami uchun ekanini yozib oladi. Stavkasi yoʻq qatorlar Miqdorlar › Element boʻyicha da miqdori bor, lekin material yoki mehnat stavkasi yoʻq qator stavkasi yoʻq deb belgilanadi va jadval ustidagi satr shunday qatorlar nechta ekanini koʻrsatadi. Bunday qator jamiga hech narsa qoʻshmaydi. Oʻz stavkasi boʻlmagan element, agar uning tarkibiy qismlaridan biri narxlangan boʻlsa, belgilanmaydi: yigʻma uning qismlari orqali narxlanadi. Eksport qilingan smetaning Izohlar ustunida har bunday qator uchun Stavkasi yoʻq yoziladi va ular sanaladi. Smetani tasdiqlash Miqdorlar jadvali ustidagi Smetani tasdiqlash tugmasini bosing. Muloqot tasdiqlayotgan jamingizni koʻrsatadi va stavkasi yoʻq qatorlarni sanab chiqadi. Ismingizni va xohlasangiz lavozimingizni kiriting. Tasdiqlash ni bosing. Satrda endi \"Tasdiqlagan: …\" va jami koʻrinadi. Uni faylda saqlash uchun hajmni saqlang. Tasdiqlash siz tasdiqlagan raqamlarga tegishli. Keyingi har qanday miqdor, stavka yoki qator oʻzgarishi uni bekor qiladi va TakeoffDesk buni aytadi. Ortga qaytarish tasdiqlangan smetani va uning tasdiqlashini qaytaradi. Qatorni qayta nomlash raqam oʻzgarishi hisoblanmaydi. Tasdiqlashni olib tashlash uni yoʻq qiladi. TakeoffDesk tashqarisida tahrirlangan hajm fayli tasdiqlangandan keyin tasdiqsiz ochiladi va bu haqda izoh chiqadi. Eksport qilingan smeta (CSV va XLSX) jami ostida tasdiqlashni nomlaydi. Faqat inson tasdiqlaydi. AI yordamchi smeta tasdiqlanganmi va qaysi stavkalar yoʻqligini oʻqiy oladi; lekin tasdiqlash imkoni yoʻq. Raqam qayerdan kelganini koʻrish uchun bosing Qatordagi miqdor yoki summani bosing — undan oʻlchangan belgilar tanlanadi. Ular boshqa varaqda boʻlsa, oʻsha varaq ochiladi. Ish boʻyicha jami qatoridagi raqamni bosing — shu varaqdagi hamma belgilar tanlanadi. Kiritilgan miqdorda belgi yoʻq. Foydali maʼlumot Tasdiqlash ismni kiritilganidek yozib oladi. Bu faylda yozuv, elektron imzo emas. Hajmda subpudratchilarga yoki muqobillarga berilgan taklif paketlari boʻlsa, tasdiqlangan jami Ish boʻyicha jami sifatida koʻrsatilgan asosiy taklif boʻladi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"draw-arcs-ten-methods","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Yoylarni oʻn usul bilan chizish","summary":"Yoy qanday chizilishini tanlang: uch nuqta, yoki boshlanish, markaz, oxir, burchak, uzunlik, yoʻnalish yoki radius.","section":"tasks","order":46,"keywords":["yoy","yoylar","egri","egri devor","3 nuqta","radius","burchak","vatar uzunligi","yoʻnalish","markaz","boshlanish","oxir","yoy usuli"],"headings":[{"id":"nima-qilasiz","text":"Nima qilasiz","level":2},{"id":"qadamlar","text":"Qadamlar","level":2},{"id":"eslatmalar","text":"Eslatmalar","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"nima-qilasiz\"\u003ENima qilasiz\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChiziqli yoʻnalishda, maydonda yoki kesib olishda egri chekkani chizing, sizda bor oʻlchamlarga mos yoy usulidan foydalanib.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qadamlar\"\u003EQadamlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYoʻnalish, kontur yoki kesib olishni boshlang va egri boshlanadigan nuqtani qoʻying.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAsboblar panelida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E ni yoqing yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVaraq panelida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc method\u003C/span\u003E ni oching. U faqat Arc yoqilgan boʻlganda koʻrinadi. Quyidagilardan birini tanlang: 3 nuqta; Boshlanish, Markaz, Oxir; Boshlanish, Markaz, Burchak; Boshlanish, Markaz, Uzunlik; Boshlanish, Oxir, Burchak; Boshlanish, Oxir, Yoʻnalish; Boshlanish, Oxir, Radius; Markaz, Boshlanish, Oxir; Markaz, Boshlanish, Burchak yoki Markaz, Boshlanish, Uzunlik.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHolat paneli nimani kutayotganini aytadi: markaz, oxirgi nuqta, burchak, uzunlik, yoʻnalish yoki radius. Nuqtani bosing yoki sonni kiriting (burchak, uzunlik, radius va yoʻnalish uchun).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOxirgi kiritish berilganda, yoy yoʻnalishga qoʻshiladi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yoyni bekor qiladi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uning oxirgi qadamini qaytaradi va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E Arc ni oʻchiradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eslatmalar\"\u003EEslatmalar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYoy rad etiladi (holat panelida xabar bilan), agar uning nuqtalari ustma-ust tushsa yoki bir chiziqda yotsa, yoki radius oxirgi nuqtaga yetmasa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUning uzunligi aniq yoy uzunligi, eski fayllar esa xuddi shunday ochiladi. Batafsil: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#arcs-and-curved-walls\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"arcs-and-curved-walls\"\u003EChiziqli yoʻnalishlarni oʻlchash\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Nima qilasiz Chiziqli yoʻnalishda, maydonda yoki kesib olishda egri chekkani chizing, sizda bor oʻlchamlarga mos yoy usulidan foydalanib. Qadamlar Yoʻnalish, kontur yoki kesib olishni boshlang va egri boshlanadigan nuqtani qoʻying. Asboblar panelida Arc ni yoqing yoki R ni bosing. Varaq panelida Arc method ni oching. U faqat Arc yoqilgan boʻlganda koʻrinadi. Quyidagilardan birini tanlang: 3 nuqta; Boshlanish, Markaz, Oxir; Boshlanish, Markaz, Burchak; Boshlanish, Markaz, Uzunlik; Boshlanish, Oxir, Burchak; Boshlanish, Oxir, Yoʻnalish; Boshlanish, Oxir, Radius; Markaz, Boshlanish, Oxir; Markaz, Boshlanish, Burchak yoki Markaz, Boshlanish, Uzunlik. Holat paneli nimani kutayotganini aytadi: markaz, oxirgi nuqta, burchak, uzunlik, yoʻnalish yoki radius. Nuqtani bosing yoki sonni kiriting (burchak, uzunlik, radius va yoʻnalish uchun). Oxirgi kiritish berilganda, yoy yoʻnalishga qoʻshiladi. Esc yoyni bekor qiladi, Backspace uning oxirgi qadamini qaytaradi va R Arc ni oʻchiradi. Eslatmalar Yoy rad etiladi (holat panelida xabar bilan), agar uning nuqtalari ustma-ust tushsa yoki bir chiziqda yotsa, yoki radius oxirgi nuqtaga yetmasa. Uning uzunligi aniq yoy uzunligi, eski fayllar esa xuddi shunday ochiladi. Batafsil: Chiziqli yoʻnalishlarni oʻlchash.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"office-layout","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"\"The office layout: grouping, subtotals, title and headings from your Default Policies\"","summary":"Switch on the Default Policies add-on and the estimate, the quantities by sheet, the exports and what an assistant reads take your office's schedule layout, the same one BimCraft's schedules take.","section":"tasks","order":47,"keywords":["office standard","office layout","default policies","add-on","schedule layout","group by type","group by sheet","subtotal","totals","title","headings","capitals","estimate layout","export layout","settings"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-ll-do","text":"What you'll do","level":2},{"id":"steps","text":"Steps","level":2},{"id":"what-takes-the-layout","text":"What takes the layout","level":2},{"id":"what-keeps-its-own","text":"What keeps its own","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-ll-do\"\u003EWhat you&#039;ll do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHave TakeoffDesk lay its tables out the way your office issues them, without setting it up in each takeoff. The layout is set once, in Default Policies, and holds for every takeoff on this computer, and the other way round.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"steps\"\u003ESteps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ESettings › Add-ons\u003C/strong\u003E and switch on \u003Cstrong\u003EDefault Policies\u003C/strong\u003E. It is off until you do; with it off, or with nothing set, TakeoffDesk is exactly as it was.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ESettings › Global › Default Policies\u003C/strong\u003E and find \u003Cstrong\u003ESchedule layout (the office standard)\u003C/strong\u003E:\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPolicy\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does in TakeoffDesk\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGroup schedules by\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EType\u003C/strong\u003E groups the estimate by item type (Linear, Area, Count, Typed quantity). \u003Cstrong\u003ELevel\u003C/strong\u003E groups the quantities by sheet by their sheet. \u003Cstrong\u003ERoom\u003C/strong\u003E and \u003Cstrong\u003ENo grouping\u003C/strong\u003E leave both ungrouped\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETotals in schedules\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA subtotal under each group and a total\u003C/strong\u003E adds a subtotal under each group. The job total always stays\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESchedule title\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA line over the table, for example \u003Ccode\u003E{schedule}: office layout\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EColumn headings\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAs written, IN CAPITALS or With Capitals\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClose Settings. The tables follow at once.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-takes-the-layout\"\u003EWhat takes the layout\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQuantities › By item\u003C/strong\u003E and \u003Cstrong\u003EBy sheet\u003C/strong\u003E: group headings, a subtotal under each group, the title and the heading case. A line under the title says which parts your office standard set. The rows are the same rows: you still type rates and waste in them and click figures to select their marks. A component or a second condition stays under its item.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe exported estimate\u003C/strong\u003E (CSV and XLSX): the same groups and subtotals. In the workbook a subtotal is a \u003Ccode\u003ESUBTOTAL\u003C/code\u003E formula over its group, and the job total is one too, so nothing is counted twice.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EWhat an assistant reads\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_estimate\u003C/code\u003E and \u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_quantities\u003C/code\u003E (by sheet) add a \u003Ccode\u003Elayout\u003C/code\u003E block with the groups, the rows and the subtotals, and say which parts the office set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-keeps-its-own\"\u003EWhat keeps its own\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQuantities › By area\u003C/strong\u003E states its own grouping (by bid area) and keeps it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe \u003Cstrong\u003Ejob total\u003C/strong\u003E, the markups of the bid summary and the alternates are not regrouped.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA grouping the table has no column for is left out: the estimate has no level, the quantities by sheet have no type.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe policies are kept in this browser and travel in the Default Policies file (\u003Cstrong\u003ESave to a file\u003C/strong\u003E / \u003Cstrong\u003ELoad from a file\u003C/strong\u003E in the same place), so an office shares one file.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAn estimate exported as CSV with groups in it is for reading. To bring an estimate back in as a price library, export it with no grouping set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft&#039;s side of the same standard: schedules, set-ups and exports. TakeoffDesk has no policies of its own yet, so there is no Default Policies section under Settings › TakeoffDesk.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you'll do Have TakeoffDesk lay its tables out the way your office issues them, without setting it up in each takeoff. The layout is set once, in Default Policies, and holds for every takeoff on this computer, and the other way round. Steps Open Settings › Add-ons and switch on Default Policies. It is off until you do; with it off, or with nothing set, TakeoffDesk is exactly as it was. Open Settings › Global › Default Policies and find Schedule layout (the office standard): Policy What it does in TakeoffDesk Group schedules by Type groups the estimate by item type (Linear, Area, Count, Typed quantity). Level groups the quantities by sheet by their sheet. Room and No grouping leave both ungrouped Totals in schedules A subtotal under each group and a total adds a subtotal under each group. The job total always stays Schedule title A line over the table, for example {schedule}: office layout Column headings As written, IN CAPITALS or With Capitals Close Settings. The tables follow at once. What takes the layout Quantities › By item and By sheet: group headings, a subtotal under each group, the title and the heading case. A line under the title says which parts your office standard set. The rows are the same rows: you still type rates and waste in them and click figures to select their marks. A component or a second condition stays under its item. The exported estimate (CSV and XLSX): the same groups and subtotals. In the workbook a subtotal is a SUBTOTAL formula over its group, and the job total is one too, so nothing is counted twice. What an assistant reads: takeoff_estimate and takeoff_quantities (by sheet) add a layout block with the groups, the rows and the subtotals, and say which parts the office set. What keeps its own Quantities › By area states its own grouping (by bid area) and keeps it. The job total, the markups of the bid summary and the alternates are not regrouped. A grouping the table has no column for is left out: the estimate has no level, the quantities by sheet have no type. Good to know The policies are kept in this browser and travel in the Default Policies file (Save to a file / Load from a file in the same place), so an office shares one file. An estimate exported as CSV with groups in it is for reading. To bring an estimate back in as a price library, export it with no grouping set. BimCraft's side of the same standard: schedules, set-ups and exports. TakeoffDesk has no policies of its own yet, so there is no Default Policies section under Settings › TakeoffDesk.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"measure-areas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Maydonlarni kesiklar bilan oʻlchash","summary":"Pollar, shiftlar va plitalarning konturini chizing, ulardan teshiklarni kesib oling, egri chekkalar, aylanalar va dumaloq kesiklar qoʻshing, maydon va perimetrni oʻqing.","section":"tasks","order":50,"keywords":["xona toʻldirish","oqim toʻldirish","boʻyoq chelagi","xonani bosish","avtomaydon","orqaga ayirish","backout","ustun","shaxta","bir nechta elementdan ayirish","maydon","kontur","kvadrat fut","sf","kesik","teshik","ayirish","aylana","dumaloq","yoy","perimetr","pol","shift","plita"],"headings":[{"id":"maydon-konturini-chizish","text":"Maydon konturini chizish","level":2},{"id":"egri-chekkalar","text":"Egri chekkalar","level":2},{"id":"aylana","text":"Aylana","level":2},{"id":"xonani-bitta-bosish-bilan-to-ldirish","text":"Xonani bitta bosish bilan toʻldirish","level":2},{"id":"maydondan-teshik-kesib-olish","text":"Maydondan teshik kesib olish","level":2},{"id":"teskari-ayirishlar-ustunlar-shaxtalar-va-bir-necha-elementdan-ayriladigan-ochiqliklar","text":"Teskari ayirishlar: ustunlar, shaxtalar va bir necha elementdan ayriladigan ochiqliklar","level":2},{"id":"maydonni-o-qish","text":"Maydonni oʻqish","level":2},{"id":"maydonni-tuzatish","text":"Maydonni tuzatish","level":2},{"id":"hajmlar-uchun-chuqurlik","text":"Hajmlar uchun chuqurlik","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EMaydon elementi yopiq maydonni oʻlchaydi. Har bir kontur undan kesib olingan teshiklarga ega boʻlishi mumkin (shaxta, ustun, gulzor), va uning chekkalari toʻgʻri yoki egri boʻlishi mumkin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoshlashdan oldin: varaqqa masshtab kerak (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EMasshtabni oʻrnatish\u003C/a\u003E) va maydon elementi kerak (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EHajm elementlarini yaratish\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"maydon-konturini-chizish\"\u003EMaydon konturini chizish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E ostidagi maydon elementini bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAsboblar panelida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXona yoki plitaning har bir burchagini ketma-ket bosing. 0°, 45° va 90° chekkalar uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni ushlab turing. Uchinchi nuqtadan boshlab kontur toʻladi va holat satrida &quot;Maydon&quot; hamda &quot;perimetr&quot; koʻrinadi. Birinchi nuqta atrofida kichik halqa paydo boʻladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKonturni yoping: birinchi nuqtani (uning halqasi ichida) bosing, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing, ikki marta bosing yoki oʻng tugmani bosing. Maydon elementining rangida yengil toʻldiriladi, kvadrat futlarda belgilanadi va tanlangan belgiga aylanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E oxirgi burchakni olib tashlaydi; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E konturni tashlab yuboradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOʻzini kesib oʻtgan kontur rad etiladi: &quot;Kontur oʻzini kesib oʻtadi, shuning uchun uning maydoni notoʻgʻri boʻladi. Uni kesishmasdan qayta chizing.&quot; Sakkizsimon shaklni ikki maydon sifatida chizing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"egri-chekkalar\"\u003EEgri chekkalar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKontur chizayotganda yoy rejimini yoqing (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Burchakdan keyin egri chiziq boʻylab nuqtani, soʻng egri tugaydigan joyni bosing. Konturni egri bilan yopish uchun oxirgi bosishni birinchi nuqtada qiling. Maydon va perimetr aniq egri chiziqdan hisoblanadi. Toʻgʻri chekkalar uchun yana \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing. Keyinchalik egrini oʻzgartirish uchun maydonni tanlang va yoy oʻrtasidagi dumaloq dastakni sudrang. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#arcs-and-curved-walls\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"arcs-and-curved-walls\"\u003EChiziqli yoʻllarni oʻlchash\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aylana\"\u003EAylana\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMaydon elementi bilan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMarkazni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChekkadagi istalgan nuqtani bosing. Siz harakatlanayotganda holat satri radius va maydonni koʻrsatadi. Aylana aniq maydon va perimetrli maydon belgisi sifatida qoʻshiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xonani-bitta-bosish-bilan-to-ldirish\"\u003EXonani bitta bosish bilan toʻldirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXonalar yopiq devorlar sifatida chizilgan boʻlsa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) bitta bosishda pol maydonini oladi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMaydon elementini tanlang (masalan, pol qoplamasi) va varaqqa masshtab bering.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E guruhida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXona ichida, ochiq polda bosing (chiziq yoki yorliq ustida emas).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk varaqning chiziqlarini oʻqiydi, bosish atrofidagi boʻshliqni topadi va uni devorlarning ichki yuzlari boʻylab joriy elementning maydoni sifatida konturlaydi. \u003Cstrong\u003E4&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E gacha boʻlgan eshik teshiklari yopiq deb hisoblanadi, shuning uchun kontur eshik ogʻzi boʻylab toʻgʻri oʻtadi; \u003Cstrong\u003ESozlamalar › TakeoffDesk › Xona toʻldirish ochiqliklarni yopish chegarasi\u003C/strong\u003E bu kenglikni oʻzgartiradi (3&#039;-0&quot; dan 8&#039;-0&quot; gacha). Xona nomlari, mebel va jihozlar xonada teshik hosil qilmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQuyidagi hollarda u rad etadi va sababini aytadi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebosish chiziq ustida (&quot;Bu chiziq ustida&quot;);\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eboʻshliq yopiq emas: sozlamadagidan kengroq ochiqlik uni varaq chetiga chiqarib yuboradi. Sozlamani oshiring yoki bu xonani qoʻlda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E bilan konturlang;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eboʻshliq juda kichik (belgi, xona emas).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEshik sozlamadan kengroq boʻlsa, toʻldirish keyingi xonaga oʻtib, ikkalasini birga konturlaydi: ortga qaytaring (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), sozlamani oshiring va yana bosing. Konturni boshqa maydonlardek tekshiring: tuzatish uchun burchaklarini sudrang. Skanerlangan varaq xuddi shunday ishlaydi, lekin uning chiziqlari yetarlicha qoramtir boʻlishi kerak; och kulrang chiziqlar toʻldirishni toʻxtatmasligi mumkin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"maydondan-teshik-kesib-olish\"\u003EMaydondan teshik kesib olish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ni tanlang va maydonni bosing. Uning burchaklarida kvadrat dastaklar koʻrinadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAsboblar panelida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang (yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing) yoki \u003Cstrong\u003ETanlangan belgi\u003C/strong\u003E ostida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a cut-out\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETeshik burchaklarini maydon ichida bosing. Bu yerda ham yoy rejimi ishlaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUni maydon kabi yoping: birinchi nuqtasini bosing, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing, ikki marta bosing yoki oʻng tugmani bosing. Teshik toʻldirilmay qoladi va holat satrida &quot;Kesik qoʻshildi. Yana chizing yoki Esc ni bosing.&quot; yoziladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXuddi shu maydonda yana teshiklar chizing yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDumaloq teshik uchun \u003Cstrong\u003ETanlangan belgi\u003C/strong\u003E ostida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a round cut-out\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang, markazini, soʻng chekkasidagi nuqtani bosing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKesik maydon ichida toʻliq joylashishi va boshqa kesik bilan ustma-ust tushmasligi kerak. Aks holda TakeoffDesk uni rad etadi: &quot;Kesik maydon ichida toʻliq joylashishi kerak.&quot; yoki &quot;Kesiklar bir-biri bilan ustma-ust tushishi mumkin emas.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOxirgi teshikni yana olib tashlash uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove last cut-out\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"teskari-ayirishlar-ustunlar-shaxtalar-va-bir-necha-elementdan-ayriladigan-ochiqliklar\"\u003ETeskari ayirishlar: ustunlar, shaxtalar va bir necha elementdan ayriladigan ochiqliklar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKesik bitta maydon belgisiga tegishli. \u003Cstrong\u003ETeskari ayirish\u003C/strong\u003E bir marta chiziladi va siz tanlagan elementlar uchun u ustma-ust tushgan har bir maydondan chiqariladi: ustunlarni bir marta chizing, ular pol qoplamasi, shift va plitadan birga ayriladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUlar uchun maydon elementi yarating, masalan &quot;Ustunlar&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EElement sozlamalarida \u003Cstrong\u003ETeskari ayirish: uning belgilari maydonini boshqa elementlardan chiqaradi\u003C/strong\u003E ni belgilang. Boshqa maydon elementlaringiz roʻyxati paydo boʻladi, hammasi belgilangan: teskari ayirishlar tegmasligi kerak boʻlganlarining belgisini olib tashlang (masalan, devorlardagi boʻyoq).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUstunlarni odatdagidek \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E bilan oʻlchang. Har biri shtrixli chiziladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBir varaqdagi belgilangan elementning har bir maydon belgisi teskari ayirish qoplagan qismini yoʻqotadi: u ichida boʻlsa, butun teskari ayirish; chekkani kesib oʻtsa, faqat ustma-ust tushgan qism; kesik ichida esa hech narsa. Tanlangan maydon panelida \u003Cstrong\u003ETeskari ayirishlar\u003C/strong\u003E va qolgan maydon koʻrsatiladi. Elementning miqdori, uning yigʻma formulalari, xarajatlar, 3D tekshiruv koʻrinishi va eksportning hammasi qolgan maydondan foydalanadi; smetaning izohlarida teskari ayirishlar qancha olib tashlaganligi yoziladi. Teskari ayirish elementining oʻzi oʻz maydonini hisoblaydi (agar narxlamasangiz, xarajatlarini nolga qoldiring).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETeskari ayirish \u003Cstrong\u003Eqavariq\u003C/strong\u003E boʻlishi kerak: toʻrtburchak, aylana yoki ichki burchagi boʻlmagan istalgan kontur. TakeoffDesk qavariq boʻlmaganini chizishni rad etadi; L shaklidagi shaxtani ikkita teskari ayirish sifatida chizing. Teskari ayirishlarda kesik boʻlishi mumkin emas; bir-biri bilan ustma-ust tushgan ikki teskari ayirishning ikkalasi ham hisobga olinadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPerimetr (\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E) oʻzgarmaydi: teskari ayirishlar faqat maydonni olib tashlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"maydonni-o-qish\"\u003EMaydonni oʻqish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaydonni tanlang. \u003Cstrong\u003ETanlangan belgi\u003C/strong\u003E quyidagilarni koʻrsatadi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQator\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMaʼnosi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaydon\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESof maydon: kontur minus kesiklar. Element aynan shuni hisoblaydi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontur\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontur ichidagi yalpi maydon (kesiklar boʻlganda koʻrsatiladi).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKesiklar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENechta teshik va ularning umumiy maydoni.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPerimetr\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontur chekkasining uzunligi, \u003Cstrong\u003Eva\u003C/strong\u003E har bir kesik chekkalari (&quot;kesiklar bilan&quot;).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPerimetrga kesik chekkalari ataylab kiritilgan, masalan, teshik atrofidan oʻtadigan chekka qoliplari yoki poydevor uchun. Faqat tashqi chekka kerak boʻlsa, teshiklarni shu elementdan chiqarib qoʻying yoki tashqi chekkani chiziqli yoʻl sifatida oʻlchang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EElementning \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnit\u003C/span\u003E jami qanday koʻrsatilishini belgilaydi: SF, SY yoki m². \u003Cstrong\u003ETanlangan belgi\u003C/strong\u003E paneli va holat satri doim kvadrat futlarni koʻrsatadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"maydonni-tuzatish\"\u003EMaydonni tuzatish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBurchakni siljitish\u003C/strong\u003E: maydonni tanlang va burchak dastagini sudrang (teshiklarda ham dastaklar bor). Agar yangi shakl oʻzini kesib oʻtsa yoki teshikni tashqariga surib chiqarsa, burchak qaytariladi: &quot;Nuqta qaytarildi.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBoshqa elementga oʻtkazish\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cstrong\u003ETanlangan belgi\u003C/strong\u003E ostidagi \u003Cstrong\u003EElement\u003C/strong\u003E roʻyxatidan boshqa maydon elementini tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOʻchirish\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, asboblar panelidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E menyusidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete mark\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hajmlar-uchun-chuqurlik\"\u003EHajmlar uchun chuqurlik\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaydon elementiga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDepth\u003C/span\u003E bering (masalan, plita uchun \u003Ccode\u003E0&#039;-4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E) va kubik yard olish uchun yigʻma tarkibiy qismida \u003Ccode\u003EA * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E dan foydalaning. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EYigʻmalar va formulalar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Maydon elementi yopiq maydonni oʻlchaydi. Har bir kontur undan kesib olingan teshiklarga ega boʻlishi mumkin (shaxta, ustun, gulzor), va uning chekkalari toʻgʻri yoki egri boʻlishi mumkin. Boshlashdan oldin: varaqqa masshtab kerak (Masshtabni oʻrnatish) va maydon elementi kerak (Hajm elementlarini yaratish). Maydon konturini chizish Items ostidagi maydon elementini bosing. Asboblar panelida Area ni tanlang yoki A ni bosing. Xona yoki plitaning har bir burchagini ketma-ket bosing. 0°, 45° va 90° chekkalar uchun Shift ni ushlab turing. Uchinchi nuqtadan boshlab kontur toʻladi va holat satrida \"Maydon\" hamda \"perimetr\" koʻrinadi. Birinchi nuqta atrofida kichik halqa paydo boʻladi. Konturni yoping: birinchi nuqtani (uning halqasi ichida) bosing, Enter ni bosing, ikki marta bosing yoki oʻng tugmani bosing. Maydon elementining rangida yengil toʻldiriladi, kvadrat futlarda belgilanadi va tanlangan belgiga aylanadi. Backspace oxirgi burchakni olib tashlaydi; Esc konturni tashlab yuboradi. Oʻzini kesib oʻtgan kontur rad etiladi: \"Kontur oʻzini kesib oʻtadi, shuning uchun uning maydoni notoʻgʻri boʻladi. Uni kesishmasdan qayta chizing.\" Sakkizsimon shaklni ikki maydon sifatida chizing. Egri chekkalar Kontur chizayotganda yoy rejimini yoqing (Arc yoki R). Burchakdan keyin egri chiziq boʻylab nuqtani, soʻng egri tugaydigan joyni bosing. Konturni egri bilan yopish uchun oxirgi bosishni birinchi nuqtada qiling. Maydon va perimetr aniq egri chiziqdan hisoblanadi. Toʻgʻri chekkalar uchun yana R ni bosing. Keyinchalik egrini oʻzgartirish uchun maydonni tanlang va yoy oʻrtasidagi dumaloq dastakni sudrang. Qarang: Chiziqli yoʻllarni oʻlchash. Aylana Maydon elementi bilan Circle ni tanlang yoki O ni bosing. Markazni bosing. Chekkadagi istalgan nuqtani bosing. Siz harakatlanayotganda holat satri radius va maydonni koʻrsatadi. Aylana aniq maydon va perimetrli maydon belgisi sifatida qoʻshiladi. Xonani bitta bosish bilan toʻldirish Xonalar yopiq devorlar sifatida chizilgan boʻlsa, Room (B) bitta bosishda pol maydonini oladi: Maydon elementini tanlang (masalan, pol qoplamasi) va varaqqa masshtab bering. Takeoff guruhida Room ni tanlang yoki B ni bosing. Xona ichida, ochiq polda bosing (chiziq yoki yorliq ustida emas). TakeoffDesk varaqning chiziqlarini oʻqiydi, bosish atrofidagi boʻshliqni topadi va uni devorlarning ichki yuzlari boʻylab joriy elementning maydoni sifatida konturlaydi. 4'-0\" gacha boʻlgan eshik teshiklari yopiq deb hisoblanadi, shuning uchun kontur eshik ogʻzi boʻylab toʻgʻri oʻtadi; Sozlamalar › TakeoffDesk › Xona toʻldirish ochiqliklarni yopish chegarasi bu kenglikni oʻzgartiradi (3'-0\" dan 8'-0\" gacha). Xona nomlari, mebel va jihozlar xonada teshik hosil qilmaydi. Quyidagi hollarda u rad etadi va sababini aytadi: bosish chiziq ustida (\"Bu chiziq ustida\"); boʻshliq yopiq emas: sozlamadagidan kengroq ochiqlik uni varaq chetiga chiqarib yuboradi. Sozlamani oshiring yoki bu xonani qoʻlda Area bilan konturlang; boʻshliq juda kichik (belgi, xona emas). Eshik sozlamadan kengroq boʻlsa, toʻldirish keyingi xonaga oʻtib, ikkalasini birga konturlaydi: ortga qaytaring (Ctrl+Z), sozlamani oshiring va yana bosing. Konturni boshqa maydonlardek tekshiring: tuzatish uchun burchaklarini sudrang. Skanerlangan varaq xuddi shunday ishlaydi, lekin uning chiziqlari yetarlicha qoramtir boʻlishi kerak; och kulrang chiziqlar toʻldirishni toʻxtatmasligi mumkin. Maydondan teshik kesib olish Select (V) ni tanlang va maydonni bosing. Uning burchaklarida kvadrat dastaklar koʻrinadi. Asboblar panelida Cut-out ni tanlang (yoki X ni bosing) yoki Tanlangan belgi ostida Add a cut-out ni tanlang. Teshik burchaklarini maydon ichida bosing. Bu yerda ham yoy rejimi ishlaydi. Uni maydon kabi yoping: birinchi nuqtasini bosing, Enter ni bosing, ikki marta bosing yoki oʻng tugmani bosing. Teshik toʻldirilmay qoladi va holat satrida \"Kesik qoʻshildi. Yana chizing yoki Esc ni bosing.\" yoziladi. Xuddi shu maydonda yana teshiklar chizing yoki Esc ni bosing. Dumaloq teshik uchun Tanlangan belgi ostida Add a round cut-out ni tanlang, markazini, soʻng chekkasidagi nuqtani bosing. Kesik maydon ichida toʻliq joylashishi va boshqa kesik bilan ustma-ust tushmasligi kerak. Aks holda TakeoffDesk uni rad etadi: \"Kesik maydon ichida toʻliq joylashishi kerak.\" yoki \"Kesiklar bir-biri bilan ustma-ust tushishi mumkin emas.\" Oxirgi teshikni yana olib tashlash uchun Remove last cut-out ni tanlang. Teskari ayirishlar: ustunlar, shaxtalar va bir necha elementdan ayriladigan ochiqliklar Kesik bitta maydon belgisiga tegishli. Teskari ayirish bir marta chiziladi va siz tanlagan elementlar uchun u ustma-ust tushgan har bir maydondan chiqariladi: ustunlarni bir marta chizing, ular pol qoplamasi, shift va plitadan birga ayriladi. Ular uchun maydon elementi yarating, masalan \"Ustunlar\". Element sozlamalarida Teskari ayirish: uning belgilari maydonini boshqa elementlardan chiqaradi ni belgilang. Boshqa maydon elementlaringiz roʻyxati paydo boʻladi, hammasi belgilangan: teskari ayirishlar tegmasligi kerak boʻlganlarining belgisini olib tashlang (masalan, devorlardagi boʻyoq). Ustunlarni odatdagidek Area yoki Circle bilan oʻlchang. Har biri shtrixli chiziladi. Bir varaqdagi belgilangan elementning har bir maydon belgisi teskari ayirish qoplagan qismini yoʻqotadi: u ichida boʻlsa, butun teskari ayirish; chekkani kesib oʻtsa, faqat ustma-ust tushgan qism; kesik ichida esa hech narsa. Tanlangan maydon panelida Teskari ayirishlar va qolgan maydon koʻrsatiladi. Elementning miqdori, uning yigʻma formulalari, xarajatlar, 3D tekshiruv koʻrinishi va eksportning hammasi qolgan maydondan foydalanadi; smetaning izohlarida teskari ayirishlar qancha olib tashlaganligi yoziladi. Teskari ayirish elementining oʻzi oʻz maydonini hisoblaydi (agar narxlamasangiz, xarajatlarini nolga qoldiring). Teskari ayirish qavariq boʻlishi kerak: toʻrtburchak, aylana yoki ichki burchagi boʻlmagan istalgan kontur. TakeoffDesk qavariq boʻlmaganini chizishni rad etadi; L shaklidagi shaxtani ikkita teskari ayirish sifatida chizing. Teskari ayirishlarda kesik boʻlishi mumkin emas; bir-biri bilan ustma-ust tushgan ikki teskari ayirishning ikkalasi ham hisobga olinadi. Perimetr (P) oʻzgarmaydi: teskari ayirishlar faqat maydonni olib tashlaydi. Maydonni oʻqish Maydonni tanlang. Tanlangan belgi quyidagilarni koʻrsatadi: Qator Maʼnosi Maydon Sof maydon: kontur minus kesiklar. Element aynan shuni hisoblaydi. Kontur Kontur ichidagi yalpi maydon (kesiklar boʻlganda koʻrsatiladi). Kesiklar Nechta teshik va ularning umumiy maydoni. Perimetr Kontur chekkasining uzunligi, va har bir kesik chekkalari (\"kesiklar bilan\"). Perimetrga kesik chekkalari ataylab kiritilgan, masalan, teshik atrofidan oʻtadigan chekka qoliplari yoki poydevor uchun. Faqat tashqi chekka kerak boʻlsa, teshiklarni shu elementdan chiqarib qoʻying yoki tashqi chekkani chiziqli yoʻl sifatida oʻlchang. Elementning Unit jami qanday koʻrsatilishini belgilaydi: SF, SY yoki m². Tanlangan belgi paneli va holat satri doim kvadrat futlarni koʻrsatadi. Maydonni tuzatish Burchakni siljitish: maydonni tanlang va burchak dastagini sudrang (teshiklarda ham dastaklar bor). Agar yangi shakl oʻzini kesib oʻtsa yoki teshikni tashqariga surib chiqarsa, burchak qaytariladi: \"Nuqta qaytarildi.\" Boshqa elementga oʻtkazish: Tanlangan belgi ostidagi Element roʻyxatidan boshqa maydon elementini tanlang. Oʻchirish: Delete, asboblar panelidagi More menyusidagi Delete yoki Delete mark. Hajmlar uchun chuqurlik Maydon elementiga Depth bering (masalan, plita uchun 0'-4\") va kubik yard olish uchun yigʻma tarkibiy qismida A * H / 27 dan foydalaning. Qarang: Yigʻmalar va formulalar.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"roofs-and-slopes","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Tomlar va qiyaliklar","summary":"Maydonga qiyalik bering — reja boʻyicha tom yuzasini oʻlchash uchun — va qiya chekka, qiya burchak va ariqlarni ularning qiyaligi boʻylab oʻlchang.","section":"tasks","order":55,"keywords":["tom","qiyalik","qiyalik koeffitsiyenti","koʻtarilish","yurish","6:12","qiya chekka","qiya burchak","ariq","shipak","tom materiali","kvadratlar","qiyalik maydoni","haqiqiy uzunlik","reja maydoni"],"headings":[{"id":"qiyalikni-kiritish","text":"Qiyalikni kiritish","level":2},{"id":"tom-maydonlari","text":"Tom maydonlari","level":2},{"id":"qiya-chekkalar-qiya-burchaklar-va-ariqlar","text":"Qiya chekkalar, qiya burchaklar va ariqlar","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETom rejasida har bir tom tekisligi tepadan koʻrinishda tekis koʻrsatiladi. Tomning oʻzi esa kattaroq: 6:12 qiyalikdagi tekislik rejasiga nisbatan taxminan 12% koʻproq yuzaga ega, uning qiya qirralari esa koʻringanidan uzunroq. Elementga qiyalikni bering — TakeoffDesk oʻlchovni qiyalik boʻylab oladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qiyalikni-kiritish\"\u003EQiyalikni kiritish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQiyalik — tom rejasidagi qiyalik belgilaridagi kabi, har 12 birlik yurish uchun koʻtarilish. Uni \u003Ccode\u003E6:12\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6/12\u003C/code\u003E yoki faqat \u003Ccode\u003E6\u003C/code\u003E shaklida kiriting; boshqa yurish ham ishlaydi (\u003Ccode\u003E4:10\u003C/code\u003E bu 4.8:12 ga teng). Burchak daraja belgisi bilan ham ishlaydi: \u003Ccode\u003E26.57°\u003C/code\u003E. Boʻsh yoki \u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E — tekis.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tom-maydonlari\"\u003ETom maydonlari\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETom materiali uchun maydon elementini yarating yoki mavjudini oching.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUning sozlamalarida \u003Cstrong\u003EQiyalik\u003C/strong\u003E ni kiriting, masalan \u003Ccode\u003E6:12\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHar bir tom tekisligining konturini rejada odatdagidek \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaydon\u003C/span\u003E bilan belgilang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir tekislik reja maydonini qiyalik koeffitsiyenti bilan koʻpaytiradi: √(1 + (koʻtarilish ÷ 12)²) — 6:12 da 1.118, 12:12 da 1.414. Tekislikni tanlang: uning \u003Cstrong\u003EMaydon\u003C/strong\u003E (qiyalik boʻyicha), \u003Cstrong\u003EReja maydoni\u003C/strong\u003E va \u003Cstrong\u003EQiyalik koeffitsiyenti\u003C/strong\u003E koʻrinadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoshqa qiyalikdagi tekisliklar: tekislikni tanlang va uning panelida oʻz \u003Cstrong\u003EQiyalik\u003C/strong\u003E ini kiriting. Elementniki ishlatilishi uchun boʻsh qoldiring. 3D tekshirish koʻrinishi, yigʻmalar (\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E — qiyalik maydoni), xarajatlar va eksport hammasi qiyalik maydonidan foydalanadi. Qiyali tekislikdagi ayirmalar, masalan, tomdagi yorugʻlik oynalari, shu qiyalikda chegirib tashlanadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPerimetr (\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E) reja perimetri boʻlib qoladi. Eaves, qiya chekka, qiya burchak va ariqlarni chiziq sifatida oʻlchang (quyida).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qiya-chekkalar-qiya-burchaklar-va-ariqlar\"\u003EQiya chekkalar, qiya burchaklar va ariqlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChiziqli element yarating, masalan &quot;Qiya chekka&quot; yoki &quot;Qiya burchaklar&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUning \u003Cstrong\u003EQiyalik\u003C/strong\u003E ini \u003Cstrong\u003EQiya chekka\u003C/strong\u003E (shipak chekkasi kabi qiyali qirra) yoki \u003Cstrong\u003EQiya burchak yoki ariq\u003C/strong\u003E (ikki tekislik tutashgan chiziq) ga oʻrnating va tom tekisliklarining \u003Cstrong\u003EQiyalik\u003C/strong\u003E ini kiriting.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChiziqli\u003C/span\u003E bilan rejada chiziqlarni chizing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQiya chekka reja uzunligini qiyalik koeffitsiyentiga koʻpaytiradi. Qiya burchak yoki ariq ikki bir xil qiyalikdagi tekislik orasida rejada 45° burchak ostida oʻtadi, shuning uchun uning haqiqiy uzunligi reja uzunligi × √(1 + (koʻtarilish ÷ 12)² ÷ 2): 6:12 da 1.061, 12:12 da 1.225.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBitta chiziq ikkalasini ham aralashtirishi mumkin. Uni tanlang: uning panelidagi har bir segmentda qiyalik roʻyxati bor — \u003Cstrong\u003EElementniki\u003C/strong\u003E (elementning sozlamasi), \u003Cstrong\u003ESathniki\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EQiya chekka\u003C/strong\u003E yoki \u003Cstrong\u003EQiya burchak yoki ariq\u003C/strong\u003E — va uning qiyalik boʻylab uzunligi. Chiziqning panelidagi oʻz \u003Cstrong\u003EQiyalik\u003C/strong\u003Ei barcha segmentlar uchun elementnikini almashtiradi. Panelda \u003Cstrong\u003EReja uzunligi\u003C/strong\u003E ham koʻrinadi, varaqdagi yozuvlar esa qiyalik boʻylab uzunliklarni koʻrsatadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAyirmalar ham ishlayveradi: chegirilgan segment qiyali-qiyasiz hech narsa hisoblamaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQiya burchak va ariqlar ikki tekislikning qiyaligi bir xil deb hisoblanadi. Turli qiyalikdagi tekisliklar uchun qiya burchakni boshqa joyda haqiqiy uzunligi boʻyicha oʻlchang yoki unga teng qiyalikdagi qiya chekka sifatida chizing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Tom rejasida har bir tom tekisligi tepadan koʻrinishda tekis koʻrsatiladi. Tomning oʻzi esa kattaroq: 6:12 qiyalikdagi tekislik rejasiga nisbatan taxminan 12% koʻproq yuzaga ega, uning qiya qirralari esa koʻringanidan uzunroq. Elementga qiyalikni bering — TakeoffDesk oʻlchovni qiyalik boʻylab oladi. Qiyalikni kiritish Qiyalik — tom rejasidagi qiyalik belgilaridagi kabi, har 12 birlik yurish uchun koʻtarilish. Uni 6:12, 6/12 yoki faqat 6 shaklida kiriting; boshqa yurish ham ishlaydi (4:10 bu 4.8:12 ga teng). Burchak daraja belgisi bilan ham ishlaydi: 26.57°. Boʻsh yoki 0 — tekis. Tom maydonlari Tom materiali uchun maydon elementini yarating yoki mavjudini oching. Uning sozlamalarida Qiyalik ni kiriting, masalan 6:12. Har bir tom tekisligining konturini rejada odatdagidek Maydon bilan belgilang. Har bir tekislik reja maydonini qiyalik koeffitsiyenti bilan koʻpaytiradi: √(1 + (koʻtarilish ÷ 12)²) — 6:12 da 1.118, 12:12 da 1.414. Tekislikni tanlang: uning Maydon (qiyalik boʻyicha), Reja maydoni va Qiyalik koeffitsiyenti koʻrinadi. Boshqa qiyalikdagi tekisliklar: tekislikni tanlang va uning panelida oʻz Qiyalik ini kiriting. Elementniki ishlatilishi uchun boʻsh qoldiring. 3D tekshirish koʻrinishi, yigʻmalar (A — qiyalik maydoni), xarajatlar va eksport hammasi qiyalik maydonidan foydalanadi. Qiyali tekislikdagi ayirmalar, masalan, tomdagi yorugʻlik oynalari, shu qiyalikda chegirib tashlanadi. Perimetr (P) reja perimetri boʻlib qoladi. Eaves, qiya chekka, qiya burchak va ariqlarni chiziq sifatida oʻlchang (quyida). Qiya chekkalar, qiya burchaklar va ariqlar Chiziqli element yarating, masalan \"Qiya chekka\" yoki \"Qiya burchaklar\". Uning Qiyalik ini Qiya chekka (shipak chekkasi kabi qiyali qirra) yoki Qiya burchak yoki ariq (ikki tekislik tutashgan chiziq) ga oʻrnating va tom tekisliklarining Qiyalik ini kiriting. Chiziqli bilan rejada chiziqlarni chizing. Qiya chekka reja uzunligini qiyalik koeffitsiyentiga koʻpaytiradi. Qiya burchak yoki ariq ikki bir xil qiyalikdagi tekislik orasida rejada 45° burchak ostida oʻtadi, shuning uchun uning haqiqiy uzunligi reja uzunligi × √(1 + (koʻtarilish ÷ 12)² ÷ 2): 6:12 da 1.061, 12:12 da 1.225. Bitta chiziq ikkalasini ham aralashtirishi mumkin. Uni tanlang: uning panelidagi har bir segmentda qiyalik roʻyxati bor — Elementniki (elementning sozlamasi), Sathniki, Qiya chekka yoki Qiya burchak yoki ariq — va uning qiyalik boʻylab uzunligi. Chiziqning panelidagi oʻz Qiyaliki barcha segmentlar uchun elementnikini almashtiradi. Panelda Reja uzunligi ham koʻrinadi, varaqdagi yozuvlar esa qiyalik boʻylab uzunliklarni koʻrsatadi. Ayirmalar ham ishlayveradi: chegirilgan segment qiyali-qiyasiz hech narsa hisoblamaydi. Qiya burchak va ariqlar ikki tekislikning qiyaligi bir xil deb hisoblanadi. Turli qiyalikdagi tekisliklar uchun qiya burchakni boshqa joyda haqiqiy uzunligi boʻyicha oʻlchang yoki unga teng qiyalikdagi qiya chekka sifatida chizing.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"count-by-hand","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Qoʻlda sanash","summary":"Har bir eshik, asbob yoki qurilmani sanash uchun ustiga bosing, sanoqlaringizni tekshiring va xatolarni tuzating.","section":"tasks","order":60,"keywords":["sanash","har biri","ea","asboblar","eshiklar","qurilmalar","belgilar","tally","bosib sanash","qoʻlda sanash"],"headings":[{"id":"sanash","text":"Sanash","level":2},{"id":"sanashni-tuzatish","text":"Sanashni tuzatish","level":2},{"id":"nuqta-o-lchami-ekranda-va-pdf-da","text":"Nuqta oʻlchami, ekranda va PDF da","level":2},{"id":"ko-p-bir-xil-belgilar","text":"Koʻp bir xil belgilar","level":2},{"id":"sanashni-formulalarda-ishlatish","text":"Sanashni formulalarda ishlatish","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESanash elementi narsalarni sanaydi: eshiklar, yorituvchi asboblar, rozetkalar, santexnika asboblari. Varaqdagi har bir bosish bitta sanash belgisi qoʻshadi. Sanash masshtabni talab qilmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sanash\"\u003ESanash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E ostida sanash elementini yarating yoki bosing (turi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAsboblar panelida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVaraqdagi har birini bosing. Har bir bosish elementning rangida nuqta qoʻyadi va elementning soni bittaga oshadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKeyingi varaqqa oʻting (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) va sanashda davom eting. Vosita \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E da qoladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETugatganingizda \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing. TakeoffDesk \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E ga qaytadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanash vaqtida sudrash hali ham koʻrinishni siljitadi va gʻildirak hali ham kattalashtiradi, shuning uchun nuqta qoʻymasdan varaq atrofida harakatlanishingiz mumkin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanash elementini bosing, shunda uning nuqtalari har bir varaqda ajratib koʻrsatiladi. Varaqlar roʻyxati keyin har birida nechta borligini koʻrsatadi, bu hali sanamagan varaqlaringizni topishga yordam beradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sanashni-tuzatish\"\u003ESanashni tuzatish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENuqtani olib tashlash\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ni tanlang, nuqtani bosing va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete mark\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Yoki notoʻgʻri bosishdan keyin darhol \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENuqtani koʻchirish\u003C/strong\u003E: uni tanlang, keyin sudrang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENotoʻgʻri element ostida sanalgan\u003C/strong\u003E: nuqtani tanlang va \u003Cstrong\u003ESelected mark\u003C/strong\u003E ostidagi \u003Cstrong\u003EItem\u003C/strong\u003E roʻyxatidan toʻgʻri sanash elementini tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nuqta-o-lchami-ekranda-va-pdf-da\"\u003ENuqta oʻlchami, ekranda va PDF da\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENuqtalar qanchalik kattalashtirilmasin, ekranda bir xil oʻlchamda qoladi. Oʻzgartirish uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E ni oching, TakeoffDesk yorligʻini tanlang va \u003Cstrong\u003ESanash belgisi oʻlchami\u003C/strong\u003E ni tanlang: Juda kichik, Kichik, Oʻrta (standart) yoki Katta.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPDF eksporti (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › belgilangan PDF) har bir nuqtani qogʻozda varaq oʻlchamidan qatʼi nazar bir xil oʻlchamda chizadi: 100% da koʻrsatilgan PDF ni koʻruvchi nuqtalarni ekrandagidek katta koʻradi. Agar varaqdagi nuqtalar hali ham bir-biriga tegsa, eksport oʻsha varaqning nuqtalarini kichikroq qiladi, shunda ularning har biri oʻqilishi mumkin boʻladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ko-p-bir-xil-belgilar\"\u003EKoʻp bir xil belgilar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVaraqda koʻp marta takrorlanadigan belgi uchun \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EAvtosanash\u003C/a\u003E ni sinab koʻring: bittasini ramkaga oling, nima topganini koʻrib chiqing va hammasini bir qadamda qoʻshing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sanashni-formulalarda-ishlatish\"\u003ESanashni formulalarda ishlatish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESanash elementining miqdori \u003Cstrong\u003EN\u003C/strong\u003E dir. Yigʻma tarkibiy qismlari uni ishlatishi mumkin, masalan eshiklar uchun mentelar \u003Ccode\u003EN * 3\u003C/code\u003E. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EYigʻmalar va formulalar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Sanash elementi narsalarni sanaydi: eshiklar, yorituvchi asboblar, rozetkalar, santexnika asboblari. Varaqdagi har bir bosish bitta sanash belgisi qoʻshadi. Sanash masshtabni talab qilmaydi. Sanash Items ostida sanash elementini yarating yoki bosing (turi Count). Asboblar panelida Count ni tanlang yoki C ni bosing. Varaqdagi har birini bosing. Har bir bosish elementning rangida nuqta qoʻyadi va elementning soni bittaga oshadi. Keyingi varaqqa oʻting (Page Down) va sanashda davom eting. Vosita Count da qoladi. Tugatganingizda Esc ni bosing. TakeoffDesk Select ga qaytadi. Sanash vaqtida sudrash hali ham koʻrinishni siljitadi va gʻildirak hali ham kattalashtiradi, shuning uchun nuqta qoʻymasdan varaq atrofida harakatlanishingiz mumkin. Sanash elementini bosing, shunda uning nuqtalari har bir varaqda ajratib koʻrsatiladi. Varaqlar roʻyxati keyin har birida nechta borligini koʻrsatadi, bu hali sanamagan varaqlaringizni topishga yordam beradi. Sanashni tuzatish Nuqtani olib tashlash: Select (V) ni tanlang, nuqtani bosing va Delete ni bosing yoki Delete mark ni tanlang. Yoki notoʻgʻri bosishdan keyin darhol Ctrl+Z ni bosing. Nuqtani koʻchirish: uni tanlang, keyin sudrang. Notoʻgʻri element ostida sanalgan: nuqtani tanlang va Selected mark ostidagi Item roʻyxatidan toʻgʻri sanash elementini tanlang. Nuqta oʻlchami, ekranda va PDF da Nuqtalar qanchalik kattalashtirilmasin, ekranda bir xil oʻlchamda qoladi. Oʻzgartirish uchun Settings ni oching, TakeoffDesk yorligʻini tanlang va Sanash belgisi oʻlchami ni tanlang: Juda kichik, Kichik, Oʻrta (standart) yoki Katta. PDF eksporti (Export › belgilangan PDF) har bir nuqtani qogʻozda varaq oʻlchamidan qatʼi nazar bir xil oʻlchamda chizadi: 100% da koʻrsatilgan PDF ni koʻruvchi nuqtalarni ekrandagidek katta koʻradi. Agar varaqdagi nuqtalar hali ham bir-biriga tegsa, eksport oʻsha varaqning nuqtalarini kichikroq qiladi, shunda ularning har biri oʻqilishi mumkin boʻladi. Koʻp bir xil belgilar Varaqda koʻp marta takrorlanadigan belgi uchun Avtosanash ni sinab koʻring: bittasini ramkaga oling, nima topganini koʻrib chiqing va hammasini bir qadamda qoʻshing. Sanashni formulalarda ishlatish Sanash elementining miqdori N dir. Yigʻma tarkibiy qismlari uni ishlatishi mumkin, masalan eshiklar uchun mentelar N * 3. Qarang: Yigʻmalar va formulalar.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"auto-count","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Belgini avtosanash","summary":"Bitta belgini belgilang, TakeoffDesk bu varaqdan yoki ochiq barcha varaqlardan boshqalarini topsin, moslikni surgich bilan koʻrib chiqing va bir qadamda qoʻshing.","section":"tasks","order":70,"keywords":["istalgan burchak","burilgan","boshqa masshtab","turli masshtab","avtosanash","avtomatik sanash","belgini qidirish","belgilarni topish","andoza","shablon","moslik","aniqlash","sanash asbobi"],"headings":[{"id":"belgilarni-topish","text":"Belgilarni topish","level":2},{"id":"moslik-natijalarini-ko-rib-chiqish","text":"Moslik natijalarini koʻrib chiqish","level":2},{"id":"ularni-qo-shish","text":"Ularni qoʻshish","level":2},{"id":"nimani-topadi-va-nimani-o-tkazib-yuboradi","text":"Nimani topadi va nimani oʻtkazib yuboradi","level":2},{"id":"tezlik-va-brauzerlar","text":"Tezlik va brauzerlar","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAvtosanash\u003C/span\u003E bitta belgini belgilaganingizdan keyin uning har bir nusxasini topadi. Soʻngra varaqdagi moslikni koʻrib chiqasiz va qabul qilganlaringizni sanash belgilari sifatida qoʻshasiz. Bu yordamchi vosita, kafolat emas: qoʻshishdan oldin doim koʻrib chiqing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"belgilarni-topish\"\u003EBelgilarni topish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElementlar\u003C/span\u003E ostidagi sanash elementini yarating yoki tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBelgi uchraydigan varaqni oching.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAsboblar panelida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAvtosanash\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tugmasini bosing. Varaq yuqorisida satr paydo boʻladi: &quot;Bu varaqdagi bitta belgi atrofiga quti torting.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaqat shu varaqni emas, ochiq barcha varaqlarni qidirish uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarcha ochiq varaqlarni qidirish\u003C/span\u003E katakchasini belgilang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBelgini yaxshi koʻrish uchun kattalashtiring, soʻngra uning bitta nusxasi atrofiga qutini zich torting. Belgining butun qismini kiriting; atrofidagi boʻsh qogʻoz kesib tashlanadi. Satrda &quot;Qidirilmoqda…&quot; yozuvi, progress chizigʻi va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBekor qilish\u003C/span\u003E tugmasi koʻrinadi. Sahifa javob berishda davom etadi: kattalashtirish, surish va varaqlar orasida oʻtish mumkin. Boshqa asbobni tanlash yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E qidiruvni bekor qiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETugagach, moslik varaqda elementning rangidagi qutilar boʻlib koʻrinadi va satrda xulosa chiqadi, masalan: &quot;22 ta moslik, 19 tasi qoʻshiladi (3 tasi allaqachon sanalgan). Rad etish yoki qaytarish uchun qutini bosing.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAvtosanash\u003C/span\u003E rejimida varaqda sudrash surish emas, quti chizadi. Surish uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni ushlab turing va torting yoki oʻrta tugma bilan torting.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"moslik-natijalarini-ko-rib-chiqish\"\u003EMoslik natijalarini koʻrib chiqish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQutini bosing\u003C/strong\u003E uni rad etish uchun. Rad etilgan quti punktir va xoch bilan belgilanadi. Qaytarish uchun yana bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoslik\u003C/span\u003E surgichini suring\u003C/strong\u003E (50% dan 95% gacha, 75% dan boshlanadi). Yuqori qiymat faqat yaqin moslikni, past qiymat esa keng moslikni koʻrsatadi. Surgich faqat topilganlarni filtrlaydi; qayta qidirmaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAllaqachon sanalgan\u003C/strong\u003E: shu elementning sanash belgisi bor joydagi moslik rad etilgan holda boshlanadi, shuning uchun hech narsa ikki marta sanalmaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBoshqa varaqlar\u003C/strong\u003E: barcha ochiq varaqlarni qidirgan boʻlsangiz, varaqlar roʻyxati yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E orqali varaqlar orasida oʻting va har birini koʻrib chiqing. Xulosada nechta varaqda moslik borligi aytiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ularni-qo-shish\"\u003EUlarni qoʻshish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoʻshish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Tugmada nechta ekani yoziladi, masalan &quot;19 ta belgini qoʻshish&quot;. Sanash belgilari har bir qabul qilingan quti markaziga qoʻshiladi: &quot;&quot;Duplex receptacle&quot; elementiga 19 ta sanash belgisi qoʻshildi. Ctrl+Z ularning hammasini olib tashlaydi.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EButun partiya bitta bekor qilish qadami boʻladi, shuning uchun bitta \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uni olib tashlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHech narsa qoʻshmasdan koʻrib chiqishni bekor qilish uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERad etish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing. Boshqa asbobni tanlash ham uni bekor qiladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nimani-topadi-va-nimani-o-tkazib-yuboradi\"\u003ENimani topadi va nimani oʻtkazib yuboradi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk chizmani piksellar boʻyicha siz belgilagan belgi bilan solishtiradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBelgini 0°, 90°, 180° va 270° ga burilgan holda topadi. Istalgan burchakda ham topish uchun quti chizishdan oldin avtosanash panelida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIstalgan burchak ostida (sekinroq)\u003C/span\u003E ni belgilang: u har 15° da sinaydi, soʻngra har bir topilmani daraja va yarim darajagacha aniqlaydi. Bu taxminan olti barobar uzoq davom etadi. Aks ettirilgan belgini topmaydi (agar belgi aks ettirilganda ham oʻxshash boʻlmasa).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarcha ochiq varaqlarni qidirish\u003C/span\u003E belgilangan boʻlsa, boshqa masshtabdagi varaq shu varaqda belgi egallagan oʻlchamda qidiriladi: 1/8&quot; planda masshtabda chizilgan qurilma 1/4&quot; planda undan ikki baravar kichik boʻladi, lekin yana topiladi. Bunday varaq quti oʻz oʻlchamida ham qidiriladi — bu har bir varaqda bir xil oʻlchamda chop etilgan teglar va belgilar uchun. Buning uchun ikkala varaqda ham masshtab boʻlishi kerak; masshtabi boʻlmagan varaq faqat quti oʻlchamida qidiriladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJuda oʻxshash belgilar bir-biriga moslashishi mumkin: duplex va quad rozetkasi yoki bir harfga farq qiladigan ikki qurilma tegi. Toʻgʻri belgilar qolguncha surgichni koʻtaring va qolganlarini qoʻlda rad eting.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBoshqa chiziqlar, shtrixlash yoki matn kesib oʻtgan belgi past ball oladi va surgichning pastroq qiymati kerak boʻlishi mumkin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EJuda kichik qutilar qabul qilinmaydi: &quot;Quti juda kichik. Belgining butun qismi atrofida torting.&quot; Boʻsh quti ham qabul qilinmaydi: &quot;Quti deyarli boʻsh. Belgi atrofida torting.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBu belgi uchun kerakli oʻlchamda juda katta boʻladigan varaq oʻtkazib yuboriladi va xulosada &quot;1 ta varaq bu belgi oʻlchamida qidirish uchun juda katta edi.&quot; deyiladi. Kattaroq belgini torting yoki oʻsha varaqni qoʻlda sanang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHech narsa topilmasa, holat satri quyidagini koʻrsatadi: &quot;Moslik yoʻq. Moslik surgichini pastga suring yoki belgini tigʻizroq torting.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tezlik-va-brauzerlar\"\u003ETezlik va brauzerlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQidiruv fon ishchisida ishlaydi, shuning uchun sahifa javob berishda davom etadi va istalgan vaqtda bekor qilish mumkin. Har bir varaq avval sahifaning oʻzida ishchi oʻlchamda chiziladi, bu juda katta varaqda qisqa toʻxtashga olib kelishi mumkin. U joriy Chrome, Edge, Firefox va Safari da ishlaydi. Koʻp varaqlarni qidirish uzoqroq davom etadi; progress chizigʻi varaqma-varaq siljiydi. Oflayn holatda avtosanash \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOflayn tayyor\u003C/span\u003E ilova panelida koʻrsatilganda ishlaydi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOflayn uchun saqlash\u003C/span\u003E ishchini ham saqlab qoladi. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EOflayn ishlash\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Avtosanash bitta belgini belgilaganingizdan keyin uning har bir nusxasini topadi. Soʻngra varaqdagi moslikni koʻrib chiqasiz va qabul qilganlaringizni sanash belgilari sifatida qoʻshasiz. Bu yordamchi vosita, kafolat emas: qoʻshishdan oldin doim koʻrib chiqing. Belgilarni topish Elementlar ostidagi sanash elementini yarating yoki tanlang. Belgi uchraydigan varaqni oching. Asboblar panelida Avtosanash ni tanlang yoki S tugmasini bosing. Varaq yuqorisida satr paydo boʻladi: \"Bu varaqdagi bitta belgi atrofiga quti torting.\" Faqat shu varaqni emas, ochiq barcha varaqlarni qidirish uchun Barcha ochiq varaqlarni qidirish katakchasini belgilang. Belgini yaxshi koʻrish uchun kattalashtiring, soʻngra uning bitta nusxasi atrofiga qutini zich torting. Belgining butun qismini kiriting; atrofidagi boʻsh qogʻoz kesib tashlanadi. Satrda \"Qidirilmoqda…\" yozuvi, progress chizigʻi va Bekor qilish tugmasi koʻrinadi. Sahifa javob berishda davom etadi: kattalashtirish, surish va varaqlar orasida oʻtish mumkin. Boshqa asbobni tanlash yoki Esc qidiruvni bekor qiladi. Tugagach, moslik varaqda elementning rangidagi qutilar boʻlib koʻrinadi va satrda xulosa chiqadi, masalan: \"22 ta moslik, 19 tasi qoʻshiladi (3 tasi allaqachon sanalgan). Rad etish yoki qaytarish uchun qutini bosing.\" Avtosanash rejimida varaqda sudrash surish emas, quti chizadi. Surish uchun Space ni ushlab turing va torting yoki oʻrta tugma bilan torting. Moslik natijalarini koʻrib chiqish Qutini bosing uni rad etish uchun. Rad etilgan quti punktir va xoch bilan belgilanadi. Qaytarish uchun yana bosing. Moslik surgichini suring (50% dan 95% gacha, 75% dan boshlanadi). Yuqori qiymat faqat yaqin moslikni, past qiymat esa keng moslikni koʻrsatadi. Surgich faqat topilganlarni filtrlaydi; qayta qidirmaydi. Allaqachon sanalgan: shu elementning sanash belgisi bor joydagi moslik rad etilgan holda boshlanadi, shuning uchun hech narsa ikki marta sanalmaydi. Boshqa varaqlar: barcha ochiq varaqlarni qidirgan boʻlsangiz, varaqlar roʻyxati yoki Page Down orqali varaqlar orasida oʻting va har birini koʻrib chiqing. Xulosada nechta varaqda moslik borligi aytiladi. Ularni qoʻshish Qoʻshish ni tanlang. Tugmada nechta ekani yoziladi, masalan \"19 ta belgini qoʻshish\". Sanash belgilari har bir qabul qilingan quti markaziga qoʻshiladi: \"\"Duplex receptacle\" elementiga 19 ta sanash belgisi qoʻshildi. Ctrl+Z ularning hammasini olib tashlaydi.\" Butun partiya bitta bekor qilish qadami boʻladi, shuning uchun bitta Ctrl+Z uni olib tashlaydi. Hech narsa qoʻshmasdan koʻrib chiqishni bekor qilish uchun Rad etish ni tanlang yoki Esc ni bosing. Boshqa asbobni tanlash ham uni bekor qiladi. Nimani topadi va nimani oʻtkazib yuboradi TakeoffDesk chizmani piksellar boʻyicha siz belgilagan belgi bilan solishtiradi. Belgini 0°, 90°, 180° va 270° ga burilgan holda topadi. Istalgan burchakda ham topish uchun quti chizishdan oldin avtosanash panelida Istalgan burchak ostida (sekinroq) ni belgilang: u har 15° da sinaydi, soʻngra har bir topilmani daraja va yarim darajagacha aniqlaydi. Bu taxminan olti barobar uzoq davom etadi. Aks ettirilgan belgini topmaydi (agar belgi aks ettirilganda ham oʻxshash boʻlmasa). Barcha ochiq varaqlarni qidirish belgilangan boʻlsa, boshqa masshtabdagi varaq shu varaqda belgi egallagan oʻlchamda qidiriladi: 1/8\" planda masshtabda chizilgan qurilma 1/4\" planda undan ikki baravar kichik boʻladi, lekin yana topiladi. Bunday varaq quti oʻz oʻlchamida ham qidiriladi — bu har bir varaqda bir xil oʻlchamda chop etilgan teglar va belgilar uchun. Buning uchun ikkala varaqda ham masshtab boʻlishi kerak; masshtabi boʻlmagan varaq faqat quti oʻlchamida qidiriladi. Juda oʻxshash belgilar bir-biriga moslashishi mumkin: duplex va quad rozetkasi yoki bir harfga farq qiladigan ikki qurilma tegi. Toʻgʻri belgilar qolguncha surgichni koʻtaring va qolganlarini qoʻlda rad eting. Boshqa chiziqlar, shtrixlash yoki matn kesib oʻtgan belgi past ball oladi va surgichning pastroq qiymati kerak boʻlishi mumkin. Juda kichik qutilar qabul qilinmaydi: \"Quti juda kichik. Belgining butun qismi atrofida torting.\" Boʻsh quti ham qabul qilinmaydi: \"Quti deyarli boʻsh. Belgi atrofida torting.\" Bu belgi uchun kerakli oʻlchamda juda katta boʻladigan varaq oʻtkazib yuboriladi va xulosada \"1 ta varaq bu belgi oʻlchamida qidirish uchun juda katta edi.\" deyiladi. Kattaroq belgini torting yoki oʻsha varaqni qoʻlda sanang. Hech narsa topilmasa, holat satri quyidagini koʻrsatadi: \"Moslik yoʻq. Moslik surgichini pastga suring yoki belgini tigʻizroq torting.\" Tezlik va brauzerlar Qidiruv fon ishchisida ishlaydi, shuning uchun sahifa javob berishda davom etadi va istalgan vaqtda bekor qilish mumkin. Har bir varaq avval sahifaning oʻzida ishchi oʻlchamda chiziladi, bu juda katta varaqda qisqa toʻxtashga olib kelishi mumkin. U joriy Chrome, Edge, Firefox va Safari da ishlaydi. Koʻp varaqlarni qidirish uzoqroq davom etadi; progress chizigʻi varaqma-varaq siljiydi. Oflayn holatda avtosanash Oflayn tayyor ilova panelida koʻrsatilganda ishlaydi: Oflayn uchun saqlash ishchini ham saqlab qoladi. Qarang: Oflayn ishlash.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"count-from-a-drawing","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Chizmadan sanash","summary":"DWG yoki DXF dan toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri bloklar, qatlamdagi obyektlar yoki matnni sanang: aniq, ichki bloklar, dinamik blok variantlari va blok massivlari hisobga olinadi, bir qadamda qaytariladi.","section":"tasks","order":71,"keywords":["chizmadan sanash","cad sanash","blok sanash","bloklarni sanash","qoʻyish","blok nomi","ichki bloklar","dinamik blok","variant","minsert","massiv","qatlam","obyekt turi","doiralar","matn","atribut","teg","yashirin qatlamlar","aniq sanash","qanday qilish","eshiklar","asboblar"],"headings":[{"id":"blokni-sanash","text":"Blokni sanash","level":2},{"id":"nima-sanaladi","text":"Nima sanaladi","level":3},{"id":"nima-sanalmaydi","text":"Nima sanalmaydi","level":3},{"id":"bu-varaq-ko-rsatadigan-yoki-butun-chizma","text":"Bu varaq koʻrsatadigan yoki butun chizma","level":2},{"id":"blokni-yana-sanash","text":"Blokni yana sanash","level":2},{"id":"qatlam-va-tur-bo-yicha","text":"Qatlam va tur boʻyicha","level":2},{"id":"matn-bo-yicha","text":"Matn boʻyicha","level":2},{"id":"avtosanashni-qachon-ishlatish","text":"Avtosanashni qachon ishlatish","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EVaraq panelidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECAD count\u003C/span\u003E (boshqa menyu uslublarida \u003Cstrong\u003ECount from the drawing\u003C/strong\u003E buyrugʻi) DWG yoki DXF da nima borligini sanaydi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E belgining rasmini qidiradi va bitta narsani qoldirishi yoki soxta narsani topishi mumkin; bu esa obyektlarni sanaydi: \u003Ccode\u003EDOOR-36\u003C/code\u003E nomli blokning har bir qoʻyilishi bitta eshik. Avval chizmani oching: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/open-a-drawing\"\u003EDWG yoki DXF chizmasini ochish\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"blokni-sanash\"\u003EBlokni sanash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChizmaning varagʻini oching. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECAD count\u003C/span\u003E varaq panelida.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUni tanlang. Oyna bloklar roʻyxatini va har biridan nechtasi borligini koʻrsatadi. Nomi boʻyicha qidiring, soʻng birini tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERoʻyxat ostidagi qatorni tekshiring: &quot;22 found, 22 to add.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd to\u003C/span\u003E ostida sanash elementini tanlang yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA new count item\u003C/span\u003E ni qoldirib, unga nom bering.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESonni koʻrsatuvchi qoʻshish tugmasini bosing: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E22 ta belgi qoʻshish\u003C/span\u003E. Belgilar blokning qoʻyilish nuqtalarida paydo boʻladi va elementning miqdori sanoq boʻladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBu bitta qaytarish bosqichi: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E belgilarni (va yangi elementni) birga olib tashlaydi. Hisob-kitob, elektron jadval va belgilangan PDF elementni boshqa sanash elementi kabi koʻradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"nima-sanaladi\"\u003ENima sanaladi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBlok nomining har bir qoʻyilishi\u003C/strong\u003E, masshtabi va burchagidan qatʼi nazar, model fazosida yoki qogʻoz fazosida. Blok nomlari registrga bogʻliq emas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBlok massivlari\u003C/strong\u003E (MINSERT): massivdagi har bir nusxa bitta hisoblanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIchki bloklar.\u003C/strong\u003E Boshqa blok ichiga qoʻyilgan blok har qanday chuqurlikda sanaladi. Roʻyxatda &quot;6 inside other blocks&quot; yoziladi; faqat chizmaga toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri qoʻyilganlarni sanash uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount blocks inside other blocks too\u003C/span\u003E ni belgisini olib tashlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDinamik bloklar.\u003C/strong\u003E Dinamik blok oʻz nomi ostida sanaladi, fayl saqlaydigan anonim nusxalar (\u003Ccode\u003E*U12\u003C/code\u003E) ostida emas. Uning holatlari alohida roʻyxatlanadi (&quot;Single 12, Double 4&quot;): faqat ularni sanash uchun holatni tanlang yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery variant\u003C/span\u003E. Fayl nusxa qaysi holatni koʻrsatishini aytmasa, ular &quot;(state not known)&quot; deb roʻyxatlanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EQatlam filtri.\u003C/strong\u003E Bir nechta qatlamdagi blok: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOn layer\u003C/span\u003E ostida bittasini tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"nima-sanalmaydi\"\u003ENima sanalmaydi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYashirin qatlamlar.\u003C/strong\u003E Faylda oʻchiq yoki muzlatilgan qatlamdagi obyekt (yoki siz \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayers\u003C/span\u003E da yashirgan obyekt) chiqarib tashlanadi va qatorda nechtasi ekani aytiladi: &quot;3 on hidden layers left out&quot;. Ularni ham kiritish uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount them too\u003C/span\u003E ni belgilang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOchilmagan bogʻlangan chizmalar\u003C/strong\u003E sanalmaydi; oyna buni aytadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXuddi shunday turdagi boshqa obyekt ustiga aynan qoʻyilgan obyektlar\u003C/strong\u003E ikkita hisoblanadi (ular ikkita obyekt) va oyna buni aytadi: odatda chizma xatosi boʻlib, koʻzdan kechirish kerak.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bu-varaq-ko-rsatadigan-yoki-butun-chizma\"\u003EBu varaq koʻrsatadigan yoki butun chizma\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBu varaq koʻrsatadigan\u003C/strong\u003E sanash sahifa koʻrsatgan obyektlarni sanaydi: joylashuvda, uning koʻrinish oynalaridagi model obyektlari (koʻrinish oynasida muzlatilgan qatlam u yerda sanalmaydi) va joylashuvning oʻz obyektlari.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EButun chizma, har bir obyekt bir marta\u003C/strong\u003E model fazosini bir marta sanaydi, belgilar Model varagʻida boʻladi va bir nechta joylashuv koʻrsatgan narsani qayta sanamaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJoylashuv koʻrsatgan va Model koʻrsatgan narsalarni sanash bir xil obyektlar uchun bir xil sonni beradi; bitta elementga ikkalasini qoʻshmang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"blokni-yana-sanash\"\u003EBlokni yana sanash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXuddi shu blokni xuddi shu element bilan yana sanash faqat yangisini qoʻshadi: &quot;22 already counted.&quot; Har bir belgi bitta obyektni bildiradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qatlam-va-tur-bo-yicha\"\u003EQatlam va tur boʻyicha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy layer and type\u003C/span\u003E da qatlam va obyekt turini tanlang (doiralar, polichiziqlar, shtrixlar...): &quot;E-LITE dagi barcha doiralar&quot;. Blok taʼriflari ichidagilarni ham, har bir qoʻyilgan joyda, qoʻshish uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAlso count objects inside blocks\u003C/span\u003E ni belgilang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"matn-bo-yicha\"\u003EMatn boʻyicha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy text\u003C/span\u003E da matnni yozing, masalan \u003Ccode\u003EA3\u003C/code\u003E, va u aynan shu, oʻz ichiga olgan yoki butun soʻz sifatida ekanini ayting. Matn obyektlari, multileader matni va blok \u003Cstrong\u003Eatribut qiymatlari\u003C/strong\u003E ham sanaladi (teg atributi \u003Ccode\u003EITEM = A3\u003C/code\u003E topiladi); faqat bitta atributni sanash uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn attribute\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Eng koʻp uchraydigan matnlar bosish uchun roʻyxatlanadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"avtosanashni-qachon-ishlatish\"\u003EAvtosanashni qachon ishlatish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPDF lar uchun va blok boʻlmagan (erkin chizilgan yoki portlatilgan) chizmadagi belgilar uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E dan foydalaning. Blok sifatida chizilgan boʻlsa, bu yerda sanang.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Varaq panelidagi CAD count (boshqa menyu uslublarida Count from the drawing buyrugʻi) DWG yoki DXF da nima borligini sanaydi. Auto count belgining rasmini qidiradi va bitta narsani qoldirishi yoki soxta narsani topishi mumkin; bu esa obyektlarni sanaydi: DOOR-36 nomli blokning har bir qoʻyilishi bitta eshik. Avval chizmani oching: DWG yoki DXF chizmasini ochish. Blokni sanash Chizmaning varagʻini oching. CAD count varaq panelida. Uni tanlang. Oyna bloklar roʻyxatini va har biridan nechtasi borligini koʻrsatadi. Nomi boʻyicha qidiring, soʻng birini tanlang. Roʻyxat ostidagi qatorni tekshiring: \"22 found, 22 to add.\" Add to ostida sanash elementini tanlang yoki A new count item ni qoldirib, unga nom bering. Sonni koʻrsatuvchi qoʻshish tugmasini bosing: 22 ta belgi qoʻshish. Belgilar blokning qoʻyilish nuqtalarida paydo boʻladi va elementning miqdori sanoq boʻladi. Bu bitta qaytarish bosqichi: Ctrl+Z belgilarni (va yangi elementni) birga olib tashlaydi. Hisob-kitob, elektron jadval va belgilangan PDF elementni boshqa sanash elementi kabi koʻradi. Nima sanaladi Blok nomining har bir qoʻyilishi, masshtabi va burchagidan qatʼi nazar, model fazosida yoki qogʻoz fazosida. Blok nomlari registrga bogʻliq emas. Blok massivlari (MINSERT): massivdagi har bir nusxa bitta hisoblanadi. Ichki bloklar. Boshqa blok ichiga qoʻyilgan blok har qanday chuqurlikda sanaladi. Roʻyxatda \"6 inside other blocks\" yoziladi; faqat chizmaga toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri qoʻyilganlarni sanash uchun Count blocks inside other blocks too ni belgisini olib tashlang. Dinamik bloklar. Dinamik blok oʻz nomi ostida sanaladi, fayl saqlaydigan anonim nusxalar (*U12) ostida emas. Uning holatlari alohida roʻyxatlanadi (\"Single 12, Double 4\"): faqat ularni sanash uchun holatni tanlang yoki Every variant. Fayl nusxa qaysi holatni koʻrsatishini aytmasa, ular \"(state not known)\" deb roʻyxatlanadi. Qatlam filtri. Bir nechta qatlamdagi blok: On layer ostida bittasini tanlang. Nima sanalmaydi Yashirin qatlamlar. Faylda oʻchiq yoki muzlatilgan qatlamdagi obyekt (yoki siz Layers da yashirgan obyekt) chiqarib tashlanadi va qatorda nechtasi ekani aytiladi: \"3 on hidden layers left out\". Ularni ham kiritish uchun Count them too ni belgilang. Ochilmagan bogʻlangan chizmalar sanalmaydi; oyna buni aytadi. Xuddi shunday turdagi boshqa obyekt ustiga aynan qoʻyilgan obyektlar ikkita hisoblanadi (ular ikkita obyekt) va oyna buni aytadi: odatda chizma xatosi boʻlib, koʻzdan kechirish kerak. Bu varaq koʻrsatadigan yoki butun chizma Bu varaq koʻrsatadigan sanash sahifa koʻrsatgan obyektlarni sanaydi: joylashuvda, uning koʻrinish oynalaridagi model obyektlari (koʻrinish oynasida muzlatilgan qatlam u yerda sanalmaydi) va joylashuvning oʻz obyektlari. Butun chizma, har bir obyekt bir marta model fazosini bir marta sanaydi, belgilar Model varagʻida boʻladi va bir nechta joylashuv koʻrsatgan narsani qayta sanamaydi. Joylashuv koʻrsatgan va Model koʻrsatgan narsalarni sanash bir xil obyektlar uchun bir xil sonni beradi; bitta elementga ikkalasini qoʻshmang. Blokni yana sanash Xuddi shu blokni xuddi shu element bilan yana sanash faqat yangisini qoʻshadi: \"22 already counted.\" Har bir belgi bitta obyektni bildiradi. Qatlam va tur boʻyicha By layer and type da qatlam va obyekt turini tanlang (doiralar, polichiziqlar, shtrixlar...): \"E-LITE dagi barcha doiralar\". Blok taʼriflari ichidagilarni ham, har bir qoʻyilgan joyda, qoʻshish uchun Also count objects inside blocks ni belgilang. Matn boʻyicha By text da matnni yozing, masalan A3, va u aynan shu, oʻz ichiga olgan yoki butun soʻz sifatida ekanini ayting. Matn obyektlari, multileader matni va blok atribut qiymatlari ham sanaladi (teg atributi ITEM = A3 topiladi); faqat bitta atributni sanash uchun In attribute ni tanlang. Eng koʻp uchraydigan matnlar bosish uchun roʻyxatlanadi. Avtosanashni qachon ishlatish PDF lar uchun va blok boʻlmagan (erkin chizilgan yoki portlatilgan) chizmadagi belgilar uchun Auto count dan foydalaning. Blok sifatida chizilgan boʻlsa, bu yerda sanang.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"count-everything","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Toʻplamdagi hammasini sanash","summary":"Belgilar legendasini bir marta ramkaga oling, TakeoffDesk esa ochiq har bir varaqdagi har bir belgini bir yurishda sanaydi. Har bir son oʻz varaqiga havola, qoʻshishdan oldin koʻrib chiqasiz.","section":"tasks","order":71,"keywords":["hammasini sanash","legenda","belgilar legendasi","butun toʻplam","har bir varaq","barcha varaqlar","har bir eshik","har bir asbob","qurilmalar","jadval","belgilar","avtosanash","hammasini sanash","chizmalar toʻplami","200 varaq","moslik darajasi","oʻxshash"],"headings":[{"id":"legendani-sanash","text":"Legendani sanash","level":2},{"id":"sanoqlarni-ko-rib-chiqish","text":"Sanoqlarni koʻrib chiqish","level":2},{"id":"ularni-qo-shish","text":"Ularni qoʻshish","level":2},{"id":"yordamchingiz-bilan","text":"Yordamchingiz bilan","level":2},{"id":"istalgan-burchakdagi-belgilar","text":"Istalgan burchakdagi belgilar","level":2},{"id":"yaxshi-bilish-kerak","text":"Yaxshi bilish kerak","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount everything\u003C/span\u003E belgilar legendasini oʻqiydi va keyin har bir belgini ochiq har bir varaqda sanaydi. Bu butun legenda uchun bir vaqtning oʻzida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E dir. Bu oʻz varaqlaringizda oddiy belgilarni moslashtirish, oʻqitilgan model emas, va hech narsa kompyuteringizdan chiqmaydi. Qoʻshishdan oldin sanoqlarni koʻrib chiqing: bu yordamchi, kafolat emas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"legendani-sanash\"\u003ELegendani sanash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChizmalarni oching. Har qanday varaqdagi legenda yetarli: nomlari yonida belgilar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAsboblar panelida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount everything\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELegenda atrofida ramka chizing: belgilar va nomlari bilan. Yonida belgisi boʻlmagan sarlavha (SYMBOL LEGEND) oʻzi chiqarib tashlanadi. Panel har bir belgini rasmi va yonida yozilgan nomi bilan koʻrsatadi. Nom element nomiga aylanadi, shuning uchun xohlasangiz uni shu yerda qayta nomlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESanalishini istamagan belgini belgisini olib tashlang. Qidirib boʻlmaydigan belgi (juda kichik yoki boʻsh) buni aytadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount on N sheets\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Qidirilayotgan varaqni bar koʻrsatadi; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECancel\u003C/span\u003E yurishni toʻxtatadi. Sahifa ishlatishga yaroqli qoladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELegendaning oʻz belgilari uning varagʻida sanalmaydi. Boshqa masshtabda chizilgan varaq shu masshtabda qidiriladi va belgilar har qanday toʻgʻri burchakda aylantirilgan holda topiladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sanoqlarni-ko-rib-chiqish\"\u003ESanoqlarni koʻrib chiqish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHar bir belgi oʻz jami sonini koʻrsatadi va uning ostida, u bor har bir varaq uchun havola bor (&quot;E-103: 4&quot;). Oʻsha varaqqa oʻtish uchun bosing. Topilganlar element rangida ramkalangan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERamkani bosing\u003C/strong\u003E, shu topilmani chiqarib tashlash uchun. U shtrixli va xoch bilan chizilgan boʻladi; qaytarish uchun yana bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMoslik darajasini\u003C/strong\u003E siljiting (50% dan 100% gacha, Sozlamalardagi darajangizdan boshlab). Yuqorisi faqat yaqin mosliklarni qoldiradi. Surgich faqat topilganlarni filtrlaydi; hech narsa qayta qidirilmaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBir-biriga oʻxshash ikki belgi (ikki rozetka va toʻrt rozetka) bir joyga mos kelishi mumkin. Yaxshiroq moslik joyni oladi va panelda bu nechta joyda sodir boʻlgani aytiladi, shuning uchun tekshirishingiz mumkin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBelgining oʻlchamida qidirish uchun juda katta varaq oʻtkazib yuboriladi va panelda bu aytiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ularni-qo-shish\"\u003EUlarni qoʻshish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd N marks\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Har bir belgi har bir topilma uchun belgili sanash elementiga aylanadi. Allaqachon sizning sanash elementingiz boʻlgan nom qayta ishlatiladi (qoʻlda belgilangan joyga hech narsa ikki marta qoʻshilmaydi). Butun yurish bitta qadam: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hamma elementlar va belgilarni qaytaradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQabul qilganingiz \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearned\u003C/span\u003E ga ham uzatiladi: belgilar keyingi safar uchun hajm faylida eslab qolinadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yordamchingiz-bilan\"\u003EYordamchingiz bilan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESozlamalarda yordamchilarga ruxsat bergan boʻlsangiz, ular legendani oʻqishi (legend_open), sanashni fonda ishga tushirishi (legend_count_start, soʻngra legend_count_status), sanoqlarni oʻqishi (legend_count_result) va ularni qoʻshishi (legend_count_add, u avval nima qoʻshishini oldindan koʻrishi mumkin). Bu panelda koʻrgan yurishingiz bilan bir xil.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"istalgan-burchakdagi-belgilar\"\u003EIstalgan burchakdagi belgilar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBurchak ostida chizilgan belgilarni (toʻgʻri burchak boʻlmagan diagonal devor tiqini, tom boʻylab aylantirilgan asbob) ham topish uchun sanashdan oldin \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESymbols at any angle\u003C/span\u003E ni belgilang. Qidiruv har bir belgini har 15 gradusda aylantiradi; dumaloq belgi bir marta qidiriladi, dumaloq boʻlmagan belgi esa olti barobargacha koʻproq vaqt olishi mumkin. Toʻgʻri burchakli chizilgan chizmalar uchun oʻchirib qoʻying.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yaxshi-bilish-kerak\"\u003EYaxshi bilish kerak\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnga legendadagidek chizilgan belgilar kerak. Varaqlardan boshqa oʻlchamda chizilgan legenda yaxshi, agar varaqlarning masshtablari sozlangan boʻlsa; masshtablarsiz belgilar legendaning oʻlchamida qidiriladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDevor yoki uzun chiziq toʻgʻridan oʻtgan belgi topilmay qolishi mumkin, chunki u endi legendadagi rasmga oʻxshamaydi. Qolganiga ishonishdan oldin birinchi varaqdagi topilmalarni tekshiring.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMatnsiz skaner ham ishlaydi: belgilar qatorlari boʻyicha topiladi va nomlarini siz yozasiz.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Count everything belgilar legendasini oʻqiydi va keyin har bir belgini ochiq har bir varaqda sanaydi. Bu butun legenda uchun bir vaqtning oʻzida Auto count dir. Bu oʻz varaqlaringizda oddiy belgilarni moslashtirish, oʻqitilgan model emas, va hech narsa kompyuteringizdan chiqmaydi. Qoʻshishdan oldin sanoqlarni koʻrib chiqing: bu yordamchi, kafolat emas. Legendani sanash Chizmalarni oching. Har qanday varaqdagi legenda yetarli: nomlari yonida belgilar. Asboblar panelida Count everything ni tanlang. Legenda atrofida ramka chizing: belgilar va nomlari bilan. Yonida belgisi boʻlmagan sarlavha (SYMBOL LEGEND) oʻzi chiqarib tashlanadi. Panel har bir belgini rasmi va yonida yozilgan nomi bilan koʻrsatadi. Nom element nomiga aylanadi, shuning uchun xohlasangiz uni shu yerda qayta nomlang. Sanalishini istamagan belgini belgisini olib tashlang. Qidirib boʻlmaydigan belgi (juda kichik yoki boʻsh) buni aytadi. Count on N sheets ni tanlang. Qidirilayotgan varaqni bar koʻrsatadi; Cancel yurishni toʻxtatadi. Sahifa ishlatishga yaroqli qoladi. Legendaning oʻz belgilari uning varagʻida sanalmaydi. Boshqa masshtabda chizilgan varaq shu masshtabda qidiriladi va belgilar har qanday toʻgʻri burchakda aylantirilgan holda topiladi. Sanoqlarni koʻrib chiqish Har bir belgi oʻz jami sonini koʻrsatadi va uning ostida, u bor har bir varaq uchun havola bor (\"E-103: 4\"). Oʻsha varaqqa oʻtish uchun bosing. Topilganlar element rangida ramkalangan. Ramkani bosing, shu topilmani chiqarib tashlash uchun. U shtrixli va xoch bilan chizilgan boʻladi; qaytarish uchun yana bosing. Moslik darajasini siljiting (50% dan 100% gacha, Sozlamalardagi darajangizdan boshlab). Yuqorisi faqat yaqin mosliklarni qoldiradi. Surgich faqat topilganlarni filtrlaydi; hech narsa qayta qidirilmaydi. Bir-biriga oʻxshash ikki belgi (ikki rozetka va toʻrt rozetka) bir joyga mos kelishi mumkin. Yaxshiroq moslik joyni oladi va panelda bu nechta joyda sodir boʻlgani aytiladi, shuning uchun tekshirishingiz mumkin. Belgining oʻlchamida qidirish uchun juda katta varaq oʻtkazib yuboriladi va panelda bu aytiladi. Ularni qoʻshish Add N marks ni tanlang. Har bir belgi har bir topilma uchun belgili sanash elementiga aylanadi. Allaqachon sizning sanash elementingiz boʻlgan nom qayta ishlatiladi (qoʻlda belgilangan joyga hech narsa ikki marta qoʻshilmaydi). Butun yurish bitta qadam: Ctrl+Z hamma elementlar va belgilarni qaytaradi. Qabul qilganingiz Learned ga ham uzatiladi: belgilar keyingi safar uchun hajm faylida eslab qolinadi. Yordamchingiz bilan Sozlamalarda yordamchilarga ruxsat bergan boʻlsangiz, ular legendani oʻqishi (legend_open), sanashni fonda ishga tushirishi (legend_count_start, soʻngra legend_count_status), sanoqlarni oʻqishi (legend_count_result) va ularni qoʻshishi (legend_count_add, u avval nima qoʻshishini oldindan koʻrishi mumkin). Bu panelda koʻrgan yurishingiz bilan bir xil. Istalgan burchakdagi belgilar Burchak ostida chizilgan belgilarni (toʻgʻri burchak boʻlmagan diagonal devor tiqini, tom boʻylab aylantirilgan asbob) ham topish uchun sanashdan oldin Symbols at any angle ni belgilang. Qidiruv har bir belgini har 15 gradusda aylantiradi; dumaloq belgi bir marta qidiriladi, dumaloq boʻlmagan belgi esa olti barobargacha koʻproq vaqt olishi mumkin. Toʻgʻri burchakli chizilgan chizmalar uchun oʻchirib qoʻying. Yaxshi bilish kerak Unga legendadagidek chizilgan belgilar kerak. Varaqlardan boshqa oʻlchamda chizilgan legenda yaxshi, agar varaqlarning masshtablari sozlangan boʻlsa; masshtablarsiz belgilar legendaning oʻlchamida qidiriladi. Devor yoki uzun chiziq toʻgʻridan oʻtgan belgi topilmay qolishi mumkin, chunki u endi legendadagi rasmga oʻxshamaydi. Qolganiga ishonishdan oldin birinchi varaqdagi topilmalarni tekshiring. Matnsiz skaner ham ishlaydi: belgilar qatorlari boʻyicha topiladi va nomlarini siz yozasiz.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"what-it-learned","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"TakeoffDesk hajmlaringizdan nimalarni oʻrgangani","summary":"TakeoffDesk Avtosanash bilan tasdiqlagan simvollaringizni, shartlar toʻplamlaringizni, eng koʻp ishlatgan yigʻmalaringizni va har bir sahifada takrorlagan naqshlaringizni saqlaydi — hammasi hajmning oʻz faylida. Koʻring, ishlating, oʻchiring.","section":"tasks","order":72,"keywords":["oʻrganish","oʻrganilgan","oʻrganish","yordamchi","eslab qolish","simvollar","shablonlar","oxirgi ish bilan bir xil","oxirgi ish","shartlar toʻplami","shartlar","qayta ishlatish","yigʻmalar","eng koʻp ishlatilgan","takliflar","har bir sahifada takrorlash","har bir sahifa","sarlavha bloki","naqsh","tozalash","unutish","maxfiylik"],"headings":[{"id":"simvollar","text":"Simvollar","level":2},{"id":"shartlar-to-plamlari","text":"Shartlar toʻplamlari","level":2},{"id":"oxirgi-ish-bilan-bir-xil","text":"Oxirgi ish bilan bir xil","level":2},{"id":"eng-ko-p-ishlatiladigan-yig-malar","text":"Eng koʻp ishlatiladigan yigʻmalar","level":2},{"id":"har-bir-sahifada-takrorlash","text":"Har bir sahifada takrorlash","level":2},{"id":"ko-rish-va-o-chirish","text":"Koʻrish va oʻchirish","level":2},{"id":"bilib-qo-yish-uchun","text":"Bilib qoʻyish uchun","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk siz bilan qancha koʻp hajm qilsangiz, shuncha tez ishlaydi. U \u003Cstrong\u003Efaqat siz qabul qilgan narsalardan\u003C/strong\u003E oʻrganadi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EAvtosanash\u003C/a\u003E bilan belgilab, soʻng qoʻshgan simvollaringizdan,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esaqlagan shartlar toʻplamlaringizdan,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eishlatgan yigʻmalaringizdan (ish uchun bir marta),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehar bir sahifada takrorlagan belgilar naqshlaringizdan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBu oʻz varaqlaringizda oddiy moslashtirish — Avtosanash bajaradigan qidiruvning oʻzi. Bu oʻrgatilgan model emas. Oʻrgangan hamma narsa \u003Cstrong\u003Eshu hajmning faylida\u003C/strong\u003E (\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E) saqlanadi va hech qayerga yuborilmaydi. Keyingi ishga olib oʻtish uchun \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/what-it-learned#same-as-last-job\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/what-it-learned\" data-hash=\"same-as-last-job\"\u003EOxirgi ish bilan bir xil\u003C/a\u003E dan foydalaning.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHammasini koʻrish uchun asboblar panelidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOʻrganilgan\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang (lampochka belgisi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAvtosanash\u003C/span\u003E yonida).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"simvollar\"\u003ESimvollar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAvtosanash bilan simvolni belgilab, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoʻshish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlasangiz, belgilagan simvolingiz qabul qilgan moslik darajasi bilan saqlanadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOʻrganilgan\u003C/span\u003E da \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShu varaqdan topish\u003C/span\u003E yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHar bir varaqdan topish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Odatdagi Avtosanash koʻrib chiqish oynasi ochiladi: qutini chiqarib tashlash uchun bosing, surgichni siljiting, soʻng ularni qoʻshing. Siz buni qilmaguncha hech narsa qoʻshilmaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOʻrganilgan simvoli hali yoʻq varaqni ochganingizda, yuqoridagi panel uning uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETopish …\u003C/span\u003E ni taklif qiladi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHozir emas\u003C/span\u003E shu varaq uchun uni yashiradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHajmda shu nomdagi element boʻlmasa, belgilarni qoʻshish elementni ham qoʻshadi (bitta ortga qaytarish qadami).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShu elementning simvolini yana qoʻshsangiz, u tanish simvol hisoblanadi; boshqacha koʻrinishdagi simvol ikkinchi simvol sifatida saqlanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAvtosanash kabi, simvol burchak ostida va boshqa masshtabdagi varaqlarda ham topiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"shartlar-to-plamlari\"\u003EShartlar toʻplamlari\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EToʻplam hajmning shartlarini (birliklari, stavkalari, chiqindisi va yigʻmalari bilan elementlar) belgilarsiz saqlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOʻrganilgan\u003C/span\u003E da \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShu hajm shartlarini toʻplam sifatida saqlash…\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang va unga nom bering. Bir xil nomli toʻplam almashtiriladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToʻplam bor hajmda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoʻshish\u003C/span\u003E unda hali yoʻq shartlarni qoʻshadi. Bir xil nom va turdagi shartlar oʻzgartirilmaydi. Bu bitta ortga qaytarish qadami.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"oxirgi-ish-bilan-bir-xil\"\u003EOxirgi ish bilan bir xil\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOxirgi ishingiz faylida u oʻrgangan narsalar bor. Yangi ishni shundan boshlash uchun:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYangi rejalarni oching, soʻng \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOʻrganilgan\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOxirgi ish bilan bir xil…\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOxirgi ishning \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E faylini tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENimalarni olib kirishni belgilang: uning shartlarini (faqat bu hajmda yoʻqlarini) va oʻrgangan narsalarini (simvollar, toʻplamlar, yigʻmalar, naqshlar). Soʻng \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOlib kirish\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShartlari shu ish nomi bilan toʻplam sifatida ham saqlanadi. Belgilari va miqdorlari oʻz faylida qoladi. Hammasi bitta ortga qaytarish qadami.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eng-ko-p-ishlatiladigan-yig-malar\"\u003EEng koʻp ishlatiladigan yigʻmalar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYigʻmaga ega element, miqdori boʻlsa va hajmni saqlasangiz, u ish uchun bir marta ishlatilgan hisoblanadi. Ish — bu hajm olingan rejalar toʻplami, shuning uchun bir xil hajmni qayta saqlash ikki marta sanalmaydi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEng koʻp ishlatiladigan yigʻmalar\u003C/span\u003E ostidagi roʻyxat eng koʻp ishlatganlaringizni birinchi qoʻyadi. Bu hajmda allaqachon boʻlganlarni chiqarib tashlaydi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoʻshish\u003C/span\u003E uni oxirgi marta ishlatganingizdek, barcha qismlari bilan qoʻshadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"har-bir-sahifada-takrorlash\"\u003EHar bir sahifada takrorlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EToʻplamning har bir sahifasida bir xil boʻladigan belgilar uchun, masalan sarlavha blokini sanash yoki odatiy detal:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBir varaqdagi belgilarni tanlang (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste#select-the-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-hash=\"select-the-marks\"\u003EBelgilarni tanlash\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOʻrganilgan\u003C/span\u003E da \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETanlangan belgilarni har bir sahifada takrorlash…\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang, naqshga nom bering va tasdiqlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUlar ochiq boshqa har bir sahifaga \u003Cstrong\u003Ebir xil oʻlchamdagi\u003C/strong\u003E sahifalarga, bir xil joyga, bitta ortga qaytarish qadamida qoʻyiladi. Yoʻllar va maydonlar faqat bir xil masshtabli sahifalarga tushadi; sanashlar bu oʻlchamdagi istalgan sahifaga tushadi. Ularga ega boʻlgan sahifa oʻtkazib yuboriladi. Naqsh saqlanadi, shuning uchun keyin ochadigan sahifalaringiz panelda taklif oladi yoki roʻyxatdagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHar bir sahifada takrorlash\u003C/span\u003E dan foydalanishingiz mumkin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ko-rish-va-o-chirish\"\u003EKoʻrish va oʻchirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOʻrgangan hamma narsa \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOʻrganilgan\u003C/span\u003E da roʻyxatlanadi. Savat belgisi bitta narsani oʻchiradi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHammasini tozalash\u003C/span\u003E oʻrgangan hamma narsani oʻchiradi va elementlar hamda belgilaringizga tegmaydi. Ikkalasini ham hajmni yopguncha bekor qilish mumkin va ikkalasi ham hajm bilan birga saqlanadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBitta hajmda oʻrganishni toʻxtatish uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShu hajmdan oʻrganish\u003C/span\u003E ni oʻchiring. Yangi narsa oʻrganilmaydi, roʻyxatdagilar siz ularni oʻchirguncha qoladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilib-qo-yish-uchun\"\u003EBilib qoʻyish uchun\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETakeoffDesk&#039;ning eski versiyalari oʻrgangan narsalari bor faylni odatdagidek ochadi. Ular bu qismni eʼtiborsiz qoldiradi va faylni qayta saqlasa, uni tashlab yuboradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOʻrgangan simvol siz belgilagan narsaning kichik rasmi boʻlib, faylda saqlanadi (har biri bir necha kilobayt).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOʻrgangan simvollar Avtosanash kabi qidiriladi, shuning uchun oʻsha cheklovlar qoʻllanadi: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003ESimvolni avtosanash\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk siz bilan qancha koʻp hajm qilsangiz, shuncha tez ishlaydi. U faqat siz qabul qilgan narsalardan oʻrganadi: Avtosanash bilan belgilab, soʻng qoʻshgan simvollaringizdan, saqlagan shartlar toʻplamlaringizdan, ishlatgan yigʻmalaringizdan (ish uchun bir marta), har bir sahifada takrorlagan belgilar naqshlaringizdan. Bu oʻz varaqlaringizda oddiy moslashtirish — Avtosanash bajaradigan qidiruvning oʻzi. Bu oʻrgatilgan model emas. Oʻrgangan hamma narsa shu hajmning faylida (.takeoff.json) saqlanadi va hech qayerga yuborilmaydi. Keyingi ishga olib oʻtish uchun Oxirgi ish bilan bir xil dan foydalaning. Hammasini koʻrish uchun asboblar panelidagi Oʻrganilgan ni tanlang (lampochka belgisi, Avtosanash yonida). Simvollar Avtosanash bilan simvolni belgilab, Qoʻshish ni tanlasangiz, belgilagan simvolingiz qabul qilgan moslik darajasi bilan saqlanadi. Oʻrganilgan da Shu varaqdan topish yoki Har bir varaqdan topish ni tanlang. Odatdagi Avtosanash koʻrib chiqish oynasi ochiladi: qutini chiqarib tashlash uchun bosing, surgichni siljiting, soʻng ularni qoʻshing. Siz buni qilmaguncha hech narsa qoʻshilmaydi. Oʻrganilgan simvoli hali yoʻq varaqni ochganingizda, yuqoridagi panel uning uchun Topish … ni taklif qiladi. Hozir emas shu varaq uchun uni yashiradi. Hajmda shu nomdagi element boʻlmasa, belgilarni qoʻshish elementni ham qoʻshadi (bitta ortga qaytarish qadami). Shu elementning simvolini yana qoʻshsangiz, u tanish simvol hisoblanadi; boshqacha koʻrinishdagi simvol ikkinchi simvol sifatida saqlanadi. Avtosanash kabi, simvol burchak ostida va boshqa masshtabdagi varaqlarda ham topiladi. Shartlar toʻplamlari Toʻplam hajmning shartlarini (birliklari, stavkalari, chiqindisi va yigʻmalari bilan elementlar) belgilarsiz saqlaydi. Oʻrganilgan da Shu hajm shartlarini toʻplam sifatida saqlash… ni tanlang va unga nom bering. Bir xil nomli toʻplam almashtiriladi. Toʻplam bor hajmda Qoʻshish unda hali yoʻq shartlarni qoʻshadi. Bir xil nom va turdagi shartlar oʻzgartirilmaydi. Bu bitta ortga qaytarish qadami. Oxirgi ish bilan bir xil Oxirgi ishingiz faylida u oʻrgangan narsalar bor. Yangi ishni shundan boshlash uchun: Yangi rejalarni oching, soʻng Oʻrganilgan › Oxirgi ish bilan bir xil… ni tanlang. Oxirgi ishning .takeoff.json faylini tanlang. Nimalarni olib kirishni belgilang: uning shartlarini (faqat bu hajmda yoʻqlarini) va oʻrgangan narsalarini (simvollar, toʻplamlar, yigʻmalar, naqshlar). Soʻng Olib kirish. Shartlari shu ish nomi bilan toʻplam sifatida ham saqlanadi. Belgilari va miqdorlari oʻz faylida qoladi. Hammasi bitta ortga qaytarish qadami. Eng koʻp ishlatiladigan yigʻmalar Yigʻmaga ega element, miqdori boʻlsa va hajmni saqlasangiz, u ish uchun bir marta ishlatilgan hisoblanadi. Ish — bu hajm olingan rejalar toʻplami, shuning uchun bir xil hajmni qayta saqlash ikki marta sanalmaydi. Eng koʻp ishlatiladigan yigʻmalar ostidagi roʻyxat eng koʻp ishlatganlaringizni birinchi qoʻyadi. Bu hajmda allaqachon boʻlganlarni chiqarib tashlaydi. Qoʻshish uni oxirgi marta ishlatganingizdek, barcha qismlari bilan qoʻshadi. Har bir sahifada takrorlash Toʻplamning har bir sahifasida bir xil boʻladigan belgilar uchun, masalan sarlavha blokini sanash yoki odatiy detal: Bir varaqdagi belgilarni tanlang (Belgilarni tanlash). Oʻrganilgan da Tanlangan belgilarni har bir sahifada takrorlash… ni tanlang, naqshga nom bering va tasdiqlang. Ular ochiq boshqa har bir sahifaga bir xil oʻlchamdagi sahifalarga, bir xil joyga, bitta ortga qaytarish qadamida qoʻyiladi. Yoʻllar va maydonlar faqat bir xil masshtabli sahifalarga tushadi; sanashlar bu oʻlchamdagi istalgan sahifaga tushadi. Ularga ega boʻlgan sahifa oʻtkazib yuboriladi. Naqsh saqlanadi, shuning uchun keyin ochadigan sahifalaringiz panelda taklif oladi yoki roʻyxatdagi Har bir sahifada takrorlash dan foydalanishingiz mumkin. Koʻrish va oʻchirish Oʻrgangan hamma narsa Oʻrganilgan da roʻyxatlanadi. Savat belgisi bitta narsani oʻchiradi. Hammasini tozalash oʻrgangan hamma narsani oʻchiradi va elementlar hamda belgilaringizga tegmaydi. Ikkalasini ham hajmni yopguncha bekor qilish mumkin va ikkalasi ham hajm bilan birga saqlanadi. Bitta hajmda oʻrganishni toʻxtatish uchun Shu hajmdan oʻrganish ni oʻchiring. Yangi narsa oʻrganilmaydi, roʻyxatdagilar siz ularni oʻchirguncha qoladi. Bilib qoʻyish uchun TakeoffDesk'ning eski versiyalari oʻrgangan narsalari bor faylni odatdagidek ochadi. Ular bu qismni eʼtiborsiz qoldiradi va faylni qayta saqlasa, uni tashlab yuboradi. Oʻrgangan simvol siz belgilagan narsaning kichik rasmi boʻlib, faylda saqlanadi (har biri bir necha kilobayt). Oʻrgangan simvollar Avtosanash kabi qidiriladi, shuning uchun oʻsha cheklovlar qoʻllanadi: Simvolni avtosanash.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"price-memory","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Price memory from your past jobs","summary":"TakeoffDesk remembers the rates you used on past takeoffs, on this computer only, so a new takeoff can start from what you paid last time. See it, use it, forget it.","section":"tasks","order":73,"keywords":["price memory","prices","remember prices","last job","past jobs","typical price","median","rates","unpriced","reprice","learn from a past takeoff","forget","library"],"headings":[{"id":"what-gets-remembered","text":"What gets remembered","level":2},{"id":"use-it-on-a-new-takeoff","text":"Use it on a new takeoff","level":2},{"id":"see-it-change-it-forget-it","text":"See it, change it, forget it","level":2},{"id":"with-your-assistant","text":"With your assistant","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrices\u003C/span\u003E on the toolbar (the dollar sign) opens what TakeoffDesk remembers about the prices you used. It is a plain list: for each item name, the rates from your last jobs. It is kept in this browser beside the price Library, never inside a takeoff file, and nothing is sent anywhere. It is not a trained model.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-gets-remembered\"\u003EWhat gets remembered\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen you save a takeoff, each item that has a price and is used (it has a mark, or a typed quantity above zero) is remembered under its name and type: material rate, labor rate, waste and unit. A job is the plan files it is taken off, so saving the same takeoff again replaces its own prices instead of adding another job. The last 12 jobs are kept for each name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo start with your older work, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn from a past takeoff…\u003C/span\u003E and pick a saved takeoff (.json). Its priced, used items are remembered the same way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENames match when their words match, whatever the case or punctuation (&quot;2x4 Stud, 8 ft&quot; and &quot;2x4 stud 8 FT&quot; are the same). The same words for another kind of item (a linear item and a count item) are not the same price.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"use-it-on-a-new-takeoff\"\u003EUse it on a new takeoff\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMake the items of the new takeoff.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrices\u003C/span\u003E. Under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThis takeoff\u003C/span\u003E you see every item that has a remembered price, what you have on it now, the last job&#039;s rates, the typical rates (the middle of the remembered jobs) and the range.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse last\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse typical\u003C/span\u003E on one item, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPrice N unpriced items from memory\u003C/span\u003E to fill every item that has no price yet from the last job.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach use is one step: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Z\"\u003E⌃Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E takes it back. An item that only has a similar name (one name inside the other) says so, and the buttons use the similar name&#039;s rates. A price remembered per each is never put on an item per foot: the dialog says the units differ and leaves it alone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"see-it-change-it-forget-it\"\u003ESee it, change it, forget it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything remembered\u003C/span\u003E lists every name with its rates and the number of jobs. The trash button forgets one name; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClear all prices\u003C/span\u003E forgets them all. Turn off \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemember my prices when I save a takeoff\u003C/span\u003E to stop remembering; what is already there stays until you forget it. Your takeoffs and the price Library are never touched.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"with-your-assistant\"\u003EWith your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you allow assistants in Settings, they can read what is remembered for the takeoff&#039;s items (prices_list) and price items from it (prices_apply, which can preview first). It is the same list as the dialog.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Prices on the toolbar (the dollar sign) opens what TakeoffDesk remembers about the prices you used. It is a plain list: for each item name, the rates from your last jobs. It is kept in this browser beside the price Library, never inside a takeoff file, and nothing is sent anywhere. It is not a trained model. What gets remembered When you save a takeoff, each item that has a price and is used (it has a mark, or a typed quantity above zero) is remembered under its name and type: material rate, labor rate, waste and unit. A job is the plan files it is taken off, so saving the same takeoff again replaces its own prices instead of adding another job. The last 12 jobs are kept for each name. To start with your older work, choose Learn from a past takeoff… and pick a saved takeoff (.json). Its priced, used items are remembered the same way. Names match when their words match, whatever the case or punctuation (\"2x4 Stud, 8 ft\" and \"2x4 stud 8 FT\" are the same). The same words for another kind of item (a linear item and a count item) are not the same price. Use it on a new takeoff Make the items of the new takeoff. Choose Prices. Under This takeoff you see every item that has a remembered price, what you have on it now, the last job's rates, the typical rates (the middle of the remembered jobs) and the range. Choose Use last or Use typical on one item, or Price N unpriced items from memory to fill every item that has no price yet from the last job. Each use is one step: Ctrl+Z takes it back. An item that only has a similar name (one name inside the other) says so, and the buttons use the similar name's rates. A price remembered per each is never put on an item per foot: the dialog says the units differ and leaves it alone. See it, change it, forget it Everything remembered lists every name with its rates and the number of jobs. The trash button forgets one name; Clear all prices forgets them all. Turn off Remember my prices when I save a takeoff to stop remembering; what is already there stays until you forget it. Your takeoffs and the price Library are never touched. With your assistant If you allow assistants in Settings, they can read what is remembered for the takeoff's items (prices_list) and price items from it (prices_apply, which can preview first). It is the same list as the dialog.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"supplier-stock","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Taʼminotchi zaxirasi va yetkazib berish muddatlarini tekshirish","summary":"Taʼminotchi zaxira roʻyxatini (CSV yoki elektron jadval) qoʻshing, va TakeoffDesk hajm talab qilgan narsani, chiqindi bilan birga, unga qarshi tekshiradi: zaxirada yetarlimi va kutish qancha. Yetishmovchiliklar va uzoq kutishlar Muammolar panelida koʻrinadi.","section":"tasks","order":74,"keywords":["taʼminotchi","zaxira","zaxirada bor","yetkazib berish muddati","mavjudlik","yetishmovchilik","kechiktirilgan buyurtma","buyurtma roʻyxati","csv","sku","sotuvchi","materiallar","taʼminot","muammolar"],"headings":[{"id":"fayl","text":"Fayl","level":2},{"id":"hajmni-tekshirish","text":"Hajmni tekshirish","level":2},{"id":"elektron-jadval-fayllari-va-narxlar-kutubxonasi","text":"Elektron jadval fayllari va narxlar kutubxonasi","level":2},{"id":"muammolar-panelida","text":"Muammolar panelida","level":2},{"id":"yordamchingiz-bilan","text":"Yordamchingiz bilan","level":2},{"id":"bilib-oling","text":"Bilib oling","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETaʼminot\u003C/span\u003E tugmasi (yuk mashinasi belgisi) hajm nimani talab qilishini taʼminotchining zaxira roʻyxati bilan tekshiradi. Kerakli taʼminotchi satrlari hajmning oʻz faylida saqlanadi. Hech narsa hech joyga yuborilmaydi va hech kim taʼminotchidan soʻramaydi: faylni siz olib kelasiz.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fayl\"\u003EFayl\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESarlavha satri bor CSV fayl. Unda nom yoki SKU ustuni va zaxira yoki yetkazib berish muddati ustuni boʻlishi kerak. Quyidagi sarlavhalar tan olinadi (tartibi va bosh-kichik harflari ahamiyatsiz): Item, Name, Description yoki Product; SKU, Part yoki Item #; In stock, On hand, Available yoki Quantity; Lead time yoki Delivery days; Unit yoki UOM; Price yoki Cost; Supplier yoki Vendor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EZaxira son boʻlishi mumkin (1,200), &quot;In stock&quot; yoki &quot;Out of stock&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYetkazib berish muddati &quot;5 days&quot;, &quot;2 weeks&quot;, &quot;2-3 weeks&quot; (uzunroq qiymat olinadi), &quot;3 months&quot;, &quot;same day&quot; yoki &quot;backorder&quot; boʻlishi mumkin. Oddiy son sarlavhadagi birlikda boʻladi: sarlavhada hafta yoki oy aytilmagan boʻlsa, kun.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EExcel fayllari oʻqilmaydi: avval varaqni CSV sifatida saqlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hajmni-tekshirish\"\u003EHajmni tekshirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETaʼminot\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang, soʻng \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETaʼminotchi faylini qoʻshish…\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlab, CSV faylni koʻrsating. Bir nechtasini qoʻshishingiz mumkin: jami beshtagacha fayl, hammasi boʻyicha 2,000 tagacha satr saqlanadi, avvalo elementlaringizga mos keladiganlari.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMiqdori bor har bir element, ikkinchi shart va yigʻma qismi nom boʻyicha yoki nomidagi SKU boʻyicha satrga moslashtiriladi. Aniq nom boʻlmasa, oʻxshash nom (biri ikkinchisi ichida) ishlatiladi va bu haqda aytiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHajm nimani talab qiladi\u003C/span\u003E ostida kamchiliklari bor elementlar birinchi turadi: &quot;120 EA yetishmaydi&quot;, &quot;Yetkazib berish 21 kun&quot;, &quot;Kechiktirilgan buyurtmada&quot;, &quot;Birlik farq qiladi&quot;, &quot;Zaxira raqami yoʻq&quot; yoki &quot;Zaxirada bor&quot;. Talabga chiqindi kiradi. Smetadagidan farq qiladigan taʼminotchi birligi (futga qarshi tonna) haqida xabar beriladi va hech qachon solishtirilmaydi. Har bir satrda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElementni tanlash\u003C/span\u003E bor, u elementga oʻtkazadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEng uzoq kutish (kunlarda)\u003C/span\u003E ni oʻrnating (standart: 14). Zaxirada boʻlmagan va undan uzoqroq kutadigan element belgilanadi, xulosada esa muhim boʻlgan eng uzoq kutish nomlanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBuyurtma roʻyxati (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E yetishmayotgan elementlarni, yetishmayotgan miqdori, taʼminotchisi va yetkazib berish muddati bilan yuklab oladi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETekshiruvdan chiqarish\u003C/span\u003E talabni tekshiruvdan chiqaradi (bu ortga qaytarish qadami).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"elektron-jadval-fayllari-va-narxlar-kutubxonasi\"\u003EElektron jadval fayllari va narxlar kutubxonasi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaʼminotchi roʻyxati CSV bilan bir qatorda Excel ish kitobi (.xlsx) boʻlishi ham mumkin: birinchi varaq oʻqiladi, ustun nomlari xuddi shunday. Formulalar hech qachon hisoblanmaydi; oʻqiladigan narsa faylda saqlangan qiymat.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENarxlari bor fayl qoʻshilgach, dialogdagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENarxlarni kutubxonaga kiritish\u003C/span\u003E fayl narxlagan har bir \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003EKutubxona\u003C/a\u003E yozuvining material narxini oʻrnatadi: nomi bir xil va birligi bir xil (yoki aytilmagan) boʻlsa. Mehnat, chiqindi, balandlik va yigʻmalar oʻz holicha qoladi, yozuv izohida esa narx qaysi fayldan olinganligi yoziladi. Metrdagi yozuv futdagi roʻyxat boʻyicha narxlanmaydi, mos nomi boʻlmagan yozuv esa tegilmaydi; holat satrida birlik sababli oʻtkazib yuborilganlar soni koʻrsatiladi. Yangi narxlarni shu hajmga olib kirish uchun Kutubxonadan qayta narxlang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muammolar-panelida\"\u003EMuammolar panelida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYetishmovchilik ogohlantirish, uzoq kutish esa izoh boʻlib, umumiy Muammolar panelida (&quot;Taʼminotchi zaxirasi&quot;) turadi, shuning uchun ular boshqa barcha tekshiruvlar bilan birga boʻladi. Sababini koʻrsatib uni qabul qilishingiz mumkin, va qabul hajmda saqlanadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yordamchingiz-bilan\"\u003EYordamchingiz bilan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAgar Sozlamalar da yordamchilarga ruxsat bersangiz, ular tekshiruvni oʻqiy oladi (supply_check). Taʼminotchi faylini qoʻshish esa sizning ishingiz.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilib-oling\"\u003EBilib oling\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZaxira raqamlari faqat qoʻshgan faylingiz kabi yangi boʻladi. Yangilash uchun faylni qayta qoʻshing: bir xil nomli fayl oldingisining oʻrnini bosadi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Taʼminot tugmasi (yuk mashinasi belgisi) hajm nimani talab qilishini taʼminotchining zaxira roʻyxati bilan tekshiradi. Kerakli taʼminotchi satrlari hajmning oʻz faylida saqlanadi. Hech narsa hech joyga yuborilmaydi va hech kim taʼminotchidan soʻramaydi: faylni siz olib kelasiz. Fayl Sarlavha satri bor CSV fayl. Unda nom yoki SKU ustuni va zaxira yoki yetkazib berish muddati ustuni boʻlishi kerak. Quyidagi sarlavhalar tan olinadi (tartibi va bosh-kichik harflari ahamiyatsiz): Item, Name, Description yoki Product; SKU, Part yoki Item #; In stock, On hand, Available yoki Quantity; Lead time yoki Delivery days; Unit yoki UOM; Price yoki Cost; Supplier yoki Vendor. Zaxira son boʻlishi mumkin (1,200), \"In stock\" yoki \"Out of stock\". Yetkazib berish muddati \"5 days\", \"2 weeks\", \"2-3 weeks\" (uzunroq qiymat olinadi), \"3 months\", \"same day\" yoki \"backorder\" boʻlishi mumkin. Oddiy son sarlavhadagi birlikda boʻladi: sarlavhada hafta yoki oy aytilmagan boʻlsa, kun. Excel fayllari oʻqilmaydi: avval varaqni CSV sifatida saqlang. Hajmni tekshirish Taʼminot ni tanlang, soʻng Taʼminotchi faylini qoʻshish… ni tanlab, CSV faylni koʻrsating. Bir nechtasini qoʻshishingiz mumkin: jami beshtagacha fayl, hammasi boʻyicha 2,000 tagacha satr saqlanadi, avvalo elementlaringizga mos keladiganlari. Miqdori bor har bir element, ikkinchi shart va yigʻma qismi nom boʻyicha yoki nomidagi SKU boʻyicha satrga moslashtiriladi. Aniq nom boʻlmasa, oʻxshash nom (biri ikkinchisi ichida) ishlatiladi va bu haqda aytiladi. Hajm nimani talab qiladi ostida kamchiliklari bor elementlar birinchi turadi: \"120 EA yetishmaydi\", \"Yetkazib berish 21 kun\", \"Kechiktirilgan buyurtmada\", \"Birlik farq qiladi\", \"Zaxira raqami yoʻq\" yoki \"Zaxirada bor\". Talabga chiqindi kiradi. Smetadagidan farq qiladigan taʼminotchi birligi (futga qarshi tonna) haqida xabar beriladi va hech qachon solishtirilmaydi. Har bir satrda Elementni tanlash bor, u elementga oʻtkazadi. Eng uzoq kutish (kunlarda) ni oʻrnating (standart: 14). Zaxirada boʻlmagan va undan uzoqroq kutadigan element belgilanadi, xulosada esa muhim boʻlgan eng uzoq kutish nomlanadi. Buyurtma roʻyxati (CSV) yetishmayotgan elementlarni, yetishmayotgan miqdori, taʼminotchisi va yetkazib berish muddati bilan yuklab oladi. Tekshiruvdan chiqarish talabni tekshiruvdan chiqaradi (bu ortga qaytarish qadami). Elektron jadval fayllari va narxlar kutubxonasi Taʼminotchi roʻyxati CSV bilan bir qatorda Excel ish kitobi (.xlsx) boʻlishi ham mumkin: birinchi varaq oʻqiladi, ustun nomlari xuddi shunday. Formulalar hech qachon hisoblanmaydi; oʻqiladigan narsa faylda saqlangan qiymat. Narxlari bor fayl qoʻshilgach, dialogdagi Narxlarni kutubxonaga kiritish fayl narxlagan har bir Kutubxona yozuvining material narxini oʻrnatadi: nomi bir xil va birligi bir xil (yoki aytilmagan) boʻlsa. Mehnat, chiqindi, balandlik va yigʻmalar oʻz holicha qoladi, yozuv izohida esa narx qaysi fayldan olinganligi yoziladi. Metrdagi yozuv futdagi roʻyxat boʻyicha narxlanmaydi, mos nomi boʻlmagan yozuv esa tegilmaydi; holat satrida birlik sababli oʻtkazib yuborilganlar soni koʻrsatiladi. Yangi narxlarni shu hajmga olib kirish uchun Kutubxonadan qayta narxlang. Muammolar panelida Yetishmovchilik ogohlantirish, uzoq kutish esa izoh boʻlib, umumiy Muammolar panelida (\"Taʼminotchi zaxirasi\") turadi, shuning uchun ular boshqa barcha tekshiruvlar bilan birga boʻladi. Sababini koʻrsatib uni qabul qilishingiz mumkin, va qabul hajmda saqlanadi. Yordamchingiz bilan Agar Sozlamalar da yordamchilarga ruxsat bersangiz, ular tekshiruvni oʻqiy oladi (supply_check). Taʼminotchi faylini qoʻshish esa sizning ishingiz. Bilib oling Zaxira raqamlari faqat qoʻshgan faylingiz kabi yangi boʻladi. Yangilash uchun faylni qayta qoʻshing: bir xil nomli fayl oldingisining oʻrnini bosadi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"copy-paste","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Belgilarni nusxalash, qoʻyish va dublikatlash","summary":"Belgilarni elementlari bilan nusxalang, bosgan joyingizga yoki boshqa varaqda xuddi shu joyga qoʻying, dublikatlang, kesing, oʻchiring va hammasini tanlang; har biri bir qadam bilan qaytariladi.","section":"tasks","order":75,"keywords":["nusxalash","qoʻyish","kesish","dublikat","joyida qoʻyish","bufer","hammasini tanlash","tanlovni bekor qilish","bir nechta belgi","tipik qavat","takrorlash","xuddi shu reja","boshqa varaq","elementni nusxalash","elementni dublikatlash"],"headings":[{"id":"belgilarni-tanlash","text":"Belgilarni tanlash","level":2},{"id":"bosgan-joyingizga-nusxalash-va-qo-yish","text":"Bosgan joyingizga nusxalash va qoʻyish","level":2},{"id":"joyida-qo-yish","text":"Joyida qoʻyish","level":2},{"id":"masshtab-mos-kelishi-kerak","text":"Masshtab mos kelishi kerak","level":2},{"id":"dublikatlash","text":"Dublikatlash","level":2},{"id":"kesish-va-o-chirish","text":"Kesish va oʻchirish","level":2},{"id":"elementni-nusxalash","text":"Elementni nusxalash","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAsboblar panelining \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E guruhida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E bor. Uning \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMore\u003C/span\u003E menyusida qolganlari, har biri oʻz tugmasi bilan: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste in place\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect all\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect none\u003C/span\u003E. Ularning har biri \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bilan bir qadam qaytariladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"belgilarni-tanlash\"\u003EBelgilarni tanlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) ni tanlang va belgini bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYana belgilar qoʻshish uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni ushlab turing va bosing. Tanlangan belgida \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + bosish uni yana olib tashlaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYoki ochiq varaqdagi barcha belgilarni olish uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect all\u003C/span\u003E) ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBir nechta belgi tanlanganda oʻng panelda \u003Cstrong\u003ESelected marks\u003C/strong\u003E koʻrsatiladi: har bir elementdan nechtadan, hamda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete marks\u003C/span\u003E tugmalari bilan. Burchak tutqichlari faqat bitta belgi tanlanganda koʻrinadi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect none\u003C/span\u003E) tanlovni tozalaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bosgan-joyingizga-nusxalash-va-qo-yish\"\u003EBosgan joyingizga nusxalash va qoʻyish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBelgilarni tanlang va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy\u003C/span\u003E) ni bosing. Belgilar elementlari bilan nusxalanadi, shu jumladan har bir elementning yigʻmasi, chiqindisi va narxlari bilan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUlarni kerakli varaqqa oʻting (bu xuddi shu varaq boʻlishi mumkin).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E) ni bosing. Koʻrsatkichga shtrixli nusxa biriktiriladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQayerga borishini bosing. Nusxalangan belgilarning markazi koʻrsatkichga tushadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bekor qiladi va hech narsa qoʻshmaydi. Qoʻyilgan belgilar keyin tanlanadi, shuning uchun ularni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bilan yana olib tashlash mumkin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXuddi shu hajmda qoʻyilgan belgilar \u003Cstrong\u003Ebir xil elementlarga\u003C/strong\u003E tushadi, shuning uchun ularning miqdorlari shu elementlarga qoʻshiladi. Boshqa hajmda (boshqa yorliqda yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E dan keyin) bir xil nomli va turdagi element ishlatiladi; aks holda element oʻz yigʻmasi bilan qoʻshiladi. Agar nom boshqa turdagi element tomonidan band boʻlsa, qoʻshilgan element &quot;(name) (copy)&quot; deb ataladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoʻyilgan belgilar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E panelining yuqorisida tanlangan hisob maydoniga tushadi (yoki hech biriga). Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EHisob maydonlari\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"joyida-qo-yish\"\u003EJoyida qoʻyish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste in place\u003C/span\u003E) nusxani ochiq varaqda sahifadagi oʻz oʻrniga aynan koʻchiradi. Tipik qavat uchun foydalaning: 2-qavatni hisoblang, nusxalang, 3-qavatni oching, joyida qoʻying.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJoyida qoʻyish nusxa olingan varaq bilan \u003Cstrong\u003Ebir xil oʻlchamdagi\u003C/strong\u003E varaqni talab qiladi. Boshqa oʻlchamdagi varaqda TakeoffDesk buni aytadi va hech narsa qoʻymaydi; buning oʻrniga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E dan foydalaning va bosing. Nusxa olingan varaqda nusxa asllarning ustiga tushadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"masshtab-mos-kelishi-kerak\"\u003EMasshtab mos kelishi kerak\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUzunliklar va maydonlar varaqning masshtabiga bogʻliq. 1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; masshtabda 10&#039; oʻlchaydigan chiziq 1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; varaqda 20&#039; boʻladi. Shuning uchun TakeoffDesk chiziqlar va maydonlarni faqat ular kelgan varaq bilan \u003Cstrong\u003Ebir xil masshtabli\u003C/strong\u003E varaqqa qoʻyadi va buni ochiq aytadi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOchiq varaqda hali masshtab yoʻq: avval unga masshtab bering (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EMasshtabni belgilash\u003C/a\u003E), keyin qoʻying.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOchiq varaqda boshqa masshtab bor: xabarda ikkala masshtab ham aytiladi. Bir xil masshtabli varaqqa qoʻying.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESanashlar masshtabni talab qilmaydi: nusxalangan sanashlar istalgan joyga qoʻyiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dublikatlash\"\u003EDublikatlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate\u003C/span\u003E) tanlangan belgilarni nusxalaydi va nusxani darhol koʻrsatkichga qoʻyadi; qayerga borishini bosing. Bosmaguningizcha hech narsa qoʻshilmaydi va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hech narsa qoldirmaydi. Dublikatlash \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E qoʻyadigan narsani oʻzgartirmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kesish-va-o-chirish\"\u003EKesish va oʻchirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut\u003C/span\u003E) tanlangan belgilarni nusxalaydi va oʻchiradi. Ularni kerakli joyga qoʻying yoki kesishni qaytaring.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E) tanlangan belgilarni nusxalamasdan oʻchiradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"elementni-nusxalash\"\u003EElementni nusxalash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EElement muharriri (\u003Cstrong\u003EItems\u003C/strong\u003E ostida) quyidagilar bilan tugaydi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy item\u003C/span\u003E: elementni yigʻmasi, chiqindisi va narxlari bilan nusxalaydi, belgilarsiz. Keyin \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E uning nusxasini shu hajmga yoki boshqasiga qoʻshadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDuplicate item\u003C/span\u003E: nusxani darhol &quot;(name) (copy)&quot; nomi bilan qoʻshadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENusxa shu kompyuterda qoladi: u shu yorliqda va brauzer xotirasida saqlanadi, shuning uchun boshqa TakeoffDesk yorligʻi ham uni qoʻyishi mumkin. Hech narsa yuklanmaydi va tizim buferi ishlatilmaydi, shuning uchun belgilarni boshqa dasturlarga qoʻyib boʻlmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENusxa bir vaqtda bitta varaqdan olinadi. Belgilar qanday boʻlsa, shundayligicha qoʻyiladi: nusxani aylantirish yoki aks ettirish hali mumkin emas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Asboblar panelining Edit guruhida Undo, Redo, Copy va Paste bor. Uning More menyusida qolganlari, har biri oʻz tugmasi bilan: Cut, Copy, Paste, Paste in place, Duplicate, Delete, Select all va Select none. Ularning har biri Ctrl+Z bilan bir qadam qaytariladi. Belgilarni tanlash Select (V) ni tanlang va belgini bosing. Yana belgilar qoʻshish uchun Shift ni ushlab turing va bosing. Tanlangan belgida Shift + bosish uni yana olib tashlaydi. Yoki ochiq varaqdagi barcha belgilarni olish uchun Ctrl+A (Select all) ni bosing. Bir nechta belgi tanlanganda oʻng panelda Selected marks koʻrsatiladi: har bir elementdan nechtadan, hamda Copy, Duplicate, Cut va Delete marks tugmalari bilan. Burchak tutqichlari faqat bitta belgi tanlanganda koʻrinadi. Esc (Select none) tanlovni tozalaydi. Bosgan joyingizga nusxalash va qoʻyish Belgilarni tanlang va Ctrl+C (Copy) ni bosing. Belgilar elementlari bilan nusxalanadi, shu jumladan har bir elementning yigʻmasi, chiqindisi va narxlari bilan. Ularni kerakli varaqqa oʻting (bu xuddi shu varaq boʻlishi mumkin). Ctrl+V (Paste) ni bosing. Koʻrsatkichga shtrixli nusxa biriktiriladi. Qayerga borishini bosing. Nusxalangan belgilarning markazi koʻrsatkichga tushadi. Esc bekor qiladi va hech narsa qoʻshmaydi. Qoʻyilgan belgilar keyin tanlanadi, shuning uchun ularni Delete yoki Ctrl+Z bilan yana olib tashlash mumkin. Xuddi shu hajmda qoʻyilgan belgilar bir xil elementlarga tushadi, shuning uchun ularning miqdorlari shu elementlarga qoʻshiladi. Boshqa hajmda (boshqa yorliqda yoki New dan keyin) bir xil nomli va turdagi element ishlatiladi; aks holda element oʻz yigʻmasi bilan qoʻshiladi. Agar nom boshqa turdagi element tomonidan band boʻlsa, qoʻshilgan element \"(name) (copy)\" deb ataladi. Qoʻyilgan belgilar Items panelining yuqorisida tanlangan hisob maydoniga tushadi (yoki hech biriga). Qarang: Hisob maydonlari. Joyida qoʻyish Ctrl+Shift+V (Paste in place) nusxani ochiq varaqda sahifadagi oʻz oʻrniga aynan koʻchiradi. Tipik qavat uchun foydalaning: 2-qavatni hisoblang, nusxalang, 3-qavatni oching, joyida qoʻying. Joyida qoʻyish nusxa olingan varaq bilan bir xil oʻlchamdagi varaqni talab qiladi. Boshqa oʻlchamdagi varaqda TakeoffDesk buni aytadi va hech narsa qoʻymaydi; buning oʻrniga Paste dan foydalaning va bosing. Nusxa olingan varaqda nusxa asllarning ustiga tushadi. Masshtab mos kelishi kerak Uzunliklar va maydonlar varaqning masshtabiga bogʻliq. 1/4\" = 1'-0\" masshtabda 10' oʻlchaydigan chiziq 1/8\" = 1'-0\" varaqda 20' boʻladi. Shuning uchun TakeoffDesk chiziqlar va maydonlarni faqat ular kelgan varaq bilan bir xil masshtabli varaqqa qoʻyadi va buni ochiq aytadi: Ochiq varaqda hali masshtab yoʻq: avval unga masshtab bering (Masshtabni belgilash), keyin qoʻying. Ochiq varaqda boshqa masshtab bor: xabarda ikkala masshtab ham aytiladi. Bir xil masshtabli varaqqa qoʻying. Sanashlar masshtabni talab qilmaydi: nusxalangan sanashlar istalgan joyga qoʻyiladi. Dublikatlash Ctrl+D (Duplicate) tanlangan belgilarni nusxalaydi va nusxani darhol koʻrsatkichga qoʻyadi; qayerga borishini bosing. Bosmaguningizcha hech narsa qoʻshilmaydi va Esc hech narsa qoldirmaydi. Dublikatlash Paste qoʻyadigan narsani oʻzgartirmaydi. Kesish va oʻchirish Ctrl+X (Cut) tanlangan belgilarni nusxalaydi va oʻchiradi. Ularni kerakli joyga qoʻying yoki kesishni qaytaring. Delete yoki Backspace (Delete) tanlangan belgilarni nusxalamasdan oʻchiradi. Elementni nusxalash Element muharriri (Items ostida) quyidagilar bilan tugaydi: Copy item: elementni yigʻmasi, chiqindisi va narxlari bilan nusxalaydi, belgilarsiz. Keyin Paste uning nusxasini shu hajmga yoki boshqasiga qoʻshadi. Duplicate item: nusxani darhol \"(name) (copy)\" nomi bilan qoʻshadi. Nusxa shu kompyuterda qoladi: u shu yorliqda va brauzer xotirasida saqlanadi, shuning uchun boshqa TakeoffDesk yorligʻi ham uni qoʻyishi mumkin. Hech narsa yuklanmaydi va tizim buferi ishlatilmaydi, shuning uchun belgilarni boshqa dasturlarga qoʻyib boʻlmaydi. Nusxa bir vaqtda bitta varaqdan olinadi. Belgilar qanday boʻlsa, shundayligicha qoʻyiladi: nusxani aylantirish yoki aks ettirish hali mumkin emas.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"carbon-and-5d-prices","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Oʻrnatilgan uglerod va 5D narx jadvali","summary":"Uglerod hajmlarni hisoblashning har bir elementining miqdoridan va ochiq koeffitsientlar jadvalidan hajmlarning oʻrnatilgan uglerodini yigʻadi hamda stavkalaringizni BimCraft ga 5D xarajatlari uchun narx jadvali sifatida yuboradi.","section":"tasks","order":76,"keywords":["uglerod","oʻrnatilgan uglerod","kgCO2e","co2","koeffitsientlar","A1-A3","tashish","chiqindi","5d","narx jadvali","xarajat","bimcraft","epd"],"headings":[{"id":"o-rnatilgan-uglerod","text":"Oʻrnatilgan uglerod","level":2},{"id":"5d-xarajatlari-uchun-narx-jadvali","text":"5D xarajatlari uchun narx jadvali","level":2},{"id":"yordamchingiz-bilan","text":"Yordamchingiz bilan","level":2},{"id":"bilib-qo-yish-kerak","text":"Bilib qoʻyish kerak","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUglerod\u003C/span\u003E asboblar panelida oʻlchagan narsangizning oʻrnatilgan uglerodini yigʻadi va stavkalaringizni bino modeli ishlatishi mumkin boʻlgan narx jadvaliga aylantiradi. Bu taxminiy hisob, baholash emas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"o-rnatilgan-uglerod\"\u003EOʻrnatilgan uglerod\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir elementning miqdori, chiqindisi bilan birga, koeffitsientlar jadvalining qatoriga koʻpaytiriladi. Qator element nomining soʻzlari boʻyicha mos keladi (&quot;concrete slab&quot; kalit soʻzi concrete boʻlgan qatorni topadi). Jadval BimCraft ishlatadigan oʻsha ochiq jadval, shuning uchun bu yerda yuklagan fayl u yerda ham ishlaydi. \u003Cstrong\u003EDasturga kiradigan qatorlar boshlangʻich qiymatlar: umumiy, tekshirilmagan va hech qanday maʼlumotlar bazasidan emas.\u003C/strong\u003E Muloqot oynasi buni raqamlar yonida aytadi; raqamga tayanishdan oldin ularni oʻz manbangiz bilan almashtiring.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUglerod\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Hisoblangan elementlar kg CO2e miqdorlari bilan koʻrsatiladi; jami yuqorida.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBu bosqichlarni ham hisoblash uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA4 tashish\u003C/span\u003E yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EA5 qurilish chiqindisi\u003C/span\u003E ni belgilang — ularga raqam beruvchi qatorlar uchun. Mahsulot bosqichi har doim hisoblanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EElementga boshqa qatorni yoki hech birini ishlatish uchun uning qatoridagi roʻyxatdan foydalaning.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoeffitsientlarni fayldan…\u003C/span\u003E oʻz manbangizdan tuzilgan koeffitsientlar jadvalini (JSON yoki CSV) yuklaydi; uning qatorlari bir xil id ga ega boshlangʻich qatorlarning oʻrnini egallaydi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoeffitsientlar (JSON)\u003C/span\u003E sizniki saqlaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoeffitsient metr, kvadrat metr, kub metr, element yoki kilogramm uchun. Futlarda yoki kvadrat futlarda oʻlchangan chiziq aylantiriladi. Kilogramm koeffitsienti hajmni (kub yard yoki metrda) va qatorning zichligini talab qiladi. Koeffitsienti oʻlchamaydigan miqdorni talab qiladigan element sababi bilan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChetda qoldi\u003C/span\u003E ostida koʻrsatiladi, hech qachon taxmin qilinmaydi. Holat satridagi joriy jami xuddi shu raqamni koʻrsatadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoeffitsient qatorlaringiz, tanlovlaringiz va hisoblaydigan bosqichlaringiz hajmlarni hisoblash faylida saqlanadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"5d-xarajatlari-uchun-narx-jadvali\"\u003E5D xarajatlari uchun narx jadvali\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E5D narxlar (JSON)\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E5D narxlar (CSV)\u003C/span\u003E hajmlarni hisoblash stavkalarini narx jadvali sifatida saqlaydi: narxlangan har bir element uchun bitta qator, uning birlik boʻyicha material va ish haqi stavkasi hamda chiqindisi bilan. Uni BimCraft xarajatlar panelida yuklang (Oʻrnatilgan uglerod va 5D xarajat), shunda bino modelining vazifalari taklifni yaratgan oʻsha stavkalar bilan narxlanadi. Jadvalda yoʻq birlikda oʻlchangan elementlar va stavkasi boʻlmagan elementlar chetda qoldiriladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yordamchingiz-bilan\"\u003EYordamchingiz bilan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAgar \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E da yordamchilarga ruxsat bersangiz, ular uglerodni oʻqiy oladi (carbon_check). Koeffitsientlarni yuklash sizning ishingiz.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilib-qo-yish-kerak\"\u003EBilib qoʻyish kerak\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHech narsa hech qayerga yuborilmaydi. Raqamlar siz yuklagan koeffitsientlar darajasida toʻgʻri boʻladi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Uglerod asboblar panelida oʻlchagan narsangizning oʻrnatilgan uglerodini yigʻadi va stavkalaringizni bino modeli ishlatishi mumkin boʻlgan narx jadvaliga aylantiradi. Bu taxminiy hisob, baholash emas. Oʻrnatilgan uglerod Har bir elementning miqdori, chiqindisi bilan birga, koeffitsientlar jadvalining qatoriga koʻpaytiriladi. Qator element nomining soʻzlari boʻyicha mos keladi (\"concrete slab\" kalit soʻzi concrete boʻlgan qatorni topadi). Jadval BimCraft ishlatadigan oʻsha ochiq jadval, shuning uchun bu yerda yuklagan fayl u yerda ham ishlaydi. Dasturga kiradigan qatorlar boshlangʻich qiymatlar: umumiy, tekshirilmagan va hech qanday maʼlumotlar bazasidan emas. Muloqot oynasi buni raqamlar yonida aytadi; raqamga tayanishdan oldin ularni oʻz manbangiz bilan almashtiring. Uglerod ni tanlang. Hisoblangan elementlar kg CO2e miqdorlari bilan koʻrsatiladi; jami yuqorida. Bu bosqichlarni ham hisoblash uchun A4 tashish yoki A5 qurilish chiqindisi ni belgilang — ularga raqam beruvchi qatorlar uchun. Mahsulot bosqichi har doim hisoblanadi. Elementga boshqa qatorni yoki hech birini ishlatish uchun uning qatoridagi roʻyxatdan foydalaning. Koeffitsientlarni fayldan… oʻz manbangizdan tuzilgan koeffitsientlar jadvalini (JSON yoki CSV) yuklaydi; uning qatorlari bir xil id ga ega boshlangʻich qatorlarning oʻrnini egallaydi. Koeffitsientlar (JSON) sizniki saqlaydi. Koeffitsient metr, kvadrat metr, kub metr, element yoki kilogramm uchun. Futlarda yoki kvadrat futlarda oʻlchangan chiziq aylantiriladi. Kilogramm koeffitsienti hajmni (kub yard yoki metrda) va qatorning zichligini talab qiladi. Koeffitsienti oʻlchamaydigan miqdorni talab qiladigan element sababi bilan Chetda qoldi ostida koʻrsatiladi, hech qachon taxmin qilinmaydi. Holat satridagi joriy jami xuddi shu raqamni koʻrsatadi. Koeffitsient qatorlaringiz, tanlovlaringiz va hisoblaydigan bosqichlaringiz hajmlarni hisoblash faylida saqlanadi. 5D xarajatlari uchun narx jadvali 5D narxlar (JSON) va 5D narxlar (CSV) hajmlarni hisoblash stavkalarini narx jadvali sifatida saqlaydi: narxlangan har bir element uchun bitta qator, uning birlik boʻyicha material va ish haqi stavkasi hamda chiqindisi bilan. Uni BimCraft xarajatlar panelida yuklang (Oʻrnatilgan uglerod va 5D xarajat), shunda bino modelining vazifalari taklifni yaratgan oʻsha stavkalar bilan narxlanadi. Jadvalda yoʻq birlikda oʻlchangan elementlar va stavkasi boʻlmagan elementlar chetda qoldiriladi. Yordamchingiz bilan Agar Sozlamalar da yordamchilarga ruxsat bersangiz, ular uglerodni oʻqiy oladi (carbon_check). Koeffitsientlarni yuklash sizning ishingiz. Bilib qoʻyish kerak Hech narsa hech qayerga yuborilmaydi. Raqamlar siz yuklagan koeffitsientlar darajasida toʻgʻri boʻladi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"tag-schedule","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Teglar jadvalini miqdorlar sifatida kiritish","summary":"Qurilish modelidan eksport qilingan teglar jadvali (CSV) hajmda har bir teg uchun turlangan miqdorlarga aylanadi, shunda modelning sanoqlari va maydonlari siz oʻlchaganlaringiz yonida turadi.","section":"tasks","order":77,"keywords":["teglar","teglar jadvali","qurilish modeli","bimcraft","ifc","miqdorlar","csv","jadval","kiritish","turlangan miqdor"],"headings":[{"id":"bilib-oling","text":"Bilib oling","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAsboblar panelidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBelgilar\u003C/span\u003E BimCraft CSV fayl sifatida saqlagan teglar jadvalini kiritadi. Har bir alohida teg turlangan miqdorga aylanadi, xuddi CivilCraft ning kesma va toʻldirma hajmlari kabi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBimCraft da kerakli teglar jadvalini tuzing va uni CSV sifatida saqlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBelgilar\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang va faylni koʻrsating.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaysi ustun qatorga nom berishini (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQator nomini quyidagi ustun bilan belgilash\u003C/span\u003E, odatda teg) va qaysi ustunda son turishini (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiqdor quyidagi ustundan\u003C/span\u003E) koʻrsating. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQatorlarni sanash\u003C/span\u003E bilan har bir qator bitta deb sanaladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBirlikni tanlang. Millimetrdagi uzunlik \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKoʻpaytirish\u003C/span\u003E 0.001 bilan metrga aylanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiqdorlarni qoʻshish\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBir xil tegli satrlar qoʻshib yuboriladi. Son boʻlmagan katak chiqarib tashlanadi va xulosada sanaladi. Xuddi shu jadvalni qayta kiritish yangi miqdorlar qoʻshmasdan, sizda allaqachon bor miqdorlarni yangilaydi; ularning nomlari, stavkalari va chiqindisi sizniki boʻlib qoladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilib-oling\"\u003EBilib oling\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETurlangan miqdor varaqda oʻlchanmaydi, shuning uchun belgilari yoʻq. Hech narsa hech joyga yuborilmaydi; fayl shu yerda oʻqiladi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Asboblar panelidagi Belgilar BimCraft CSV fayl sifatida saqlagan teglar jadvalini kiritadi. Har bir alohida teg turlangan miqdorga aylanadi, xuddi CivilCraft ning kesma va toʻldirma hajmlari kabi. BimCraft da kerakli teglar jadvalini tuzing va uni CSV sifatida saqlang. Belgilar ni tanlang va faylni koʻrsating. Qaysi ustun qatorga nom berishini (Qator nomini quyidagi ustun bilan belgilash, odatda teg) va qaysi ustunda son turishini (Miqdor quyidagi ustundan) koʻrsating. Qatorlarni sanash bilan har bir qator bitta deb sanaladi. Birlikni tanlang. Millimetrdagi uzunlik Koʻpaytirish 0.001 bilan metrga aylanadi. Miqdorlarni qoʻshish. Bir xil tegli satrlar qoʻshib yuboriladi. Son boʻlmagan katak chiqarib tashlanadi va xulosada sanaladi. Xuddi shu jadvalni qayta kiritish yangi miqdorlar qoʻshmasdan, sizda allaqachon bor miqdorlarni yangilaydi; ularning nomlari, stavkalari va chiqindisi sizniki boʻlib qoladi. Bilib oling Turlangan miqdor varaqda oʻlchanmaydi, shuning uchun belgilari yoʻq. Hech narsa hech joyga yuborilmaydi; fayl shu yerda oʻqiladi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"assemblies","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Assemblies and formulas","summary":"Add components to an item and let formulas turn its length, area or count into studs, plates, sheets of board, concrete and hardware, with a worked wall example.","section":"tasks","order":80,"keywords":["assembly","components","formula","studs","drywall","sheets","plates","concrete","cubic yards","hardware","recipe","typical","item parts"],"headings":[{"id":"variables-you-can-use","text":"Variables you can use","level":2},{"id":"worked-example-an-interior-wall","text":"Worked example: an interior wall","level":2},{"id":"more-formulas","text":"More formulas","level":2},{"id":"when-a-formula-is-wrong","text":"When a formula is wrong","level":2},{"id":"limits","text":"Limits","level":2},{"id":"remove-a-component","text":"Remove a component","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EAn item&#039;s \u003Cstrong\u003Eassembly\u003C/strong\u003E is a list of components, each with a quantity formula and its own waste and rates. The formula uses the item&#039;s measured totals, so one takeoff of a wall gives you studs, plates and board at once, and they update as you measure.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"variables-you-can-use\"\u003EVariables you can use\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EItem type\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVariables\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E length, \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E height, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E wall area (L × H), \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E number of runs\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E area, \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E perimeter (outline + cut-outs), \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E depth or thickness, \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E number of areas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E count\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EValues are in the item&#039;s own units: feet and square feet for LF and SF items, meters and square meters for m and m² items. For an SY item, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E is in square yards while \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E and \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E stay in feet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFormulas use \u003Ccode\u003E+ - * /\u003C/code\u003E (or × ÷), parentheses, numbers, and the functions \u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eround\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emin\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Emax\u003C/code\u003E and \u003Ccode\u003Eabs\u003C/code\u003E. The full rules are in \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\"\u003EFormula language\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen the item has a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantity factor\u003C/span\u003E (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ECreate items\u003C/a\u003E), \u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E and \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E are already multiplied by it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"worked-example-an-interior-wall\"\u003EWorked example: an interior wall\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESay you have taken off \u003Cstrong\u003EInterior wall type A\u003C/strong\u003E as a linear item: 4 runs totaling 120 LF, with \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E set to \u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Its \u003Cstrong\u003EMeasured\u003C/strong\u003E values read L = 120, N = 4, A = 1,080 (SF of wall, one face).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESelect the item under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd component\u003C/span\u003E. A component called &quot;Component&quot; appears, with the formula \u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E and its result below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType \u003Ccode\u003EStuds 16 in o.c.\u003C/code\u003E in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EName\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Ccode\u003EEA\u003C/code\u003E in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantity formula\u003C/span\u003E, type \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L * 12 / 16) + N\u003C/code\u003E. The result updates as you type: &quot;= 94 EA&quot;. That is one stud every 16 inches along 120 feet (90), plus one extra to close each of the 4 runs.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd component\u003C/span\u003E again for the plates: name \u003Ccode\u003EPlates, top and bottom\u003C/code\u003E, unit \u003Ccode\u003ELF\u003C/code\u003E, formula \u003Ccode\u003EL * 2\u003C/code\u003E. Result: 240 LF.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the board: name \u003Ccode\u003EGypsum board 4x8, both sides\u003C/code\u003E, unit \u003Ccode\u003Esheets\u003C/code\u003E, formula \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 32)\u003C/code\u003E. Result: 68 sheets (2,160 SF of board ÷ 32 SF per sheet = 67.5, rounded up).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFill in each component&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWaste %\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial $\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELabor $\u003C/span\u003E. Each component gets its own row under the item in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E, priced like an item, and the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E includes it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf the wall cost is all in the components, leave the item&#039;s own material and labor rates at 0, or it is counted twice.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWaste is applied after the formula and is not rounded: 68 sheets with 10% waste is 74.8 sheets. To order whole sheets, put the waste inside the formula, like \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 32 * 1.1)\u003C/code\u003E, and leave the component&#039;s waste at 0.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"more-formulas\"\u003EMore formulas\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EItem\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFormula\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStuds at 24 in on center\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L / 2) + N\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInsulation batts, SF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear with height\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPaint, both sides, gallons at 350 SF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear with height\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 2 / 350)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETile cartons at 15 SF, 10% extra\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * 1.1 / 15)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBase or edge trim, LF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EConcrete, cubic yards\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea with depth\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EConcrete rounded up to a quarter yard\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea with depth\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(A * H / 27 * 4) / 4\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHinges, three per door\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN * 3\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAt least one box, one per 12\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, ceil(N / 12))\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-a-formula-is-wrong\"\u003EWhen a formula is wrong\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe line under the formula turns into an error message, for example \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;X&quot; is not a measured value here. Use L, H, A, N.\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003EA &quot;)&quot; is missing.\u003C/code\u003E The component then has no amounts, its row in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E shows &quot;Formula error: …&quot;, and the header says &quot;Incomplete: 1 formula error (not in the totals)&quot;. Fix the formula and the totals update.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA formula that divides by zero is an error too (&quot;The formula divides by zero.&quot;), for example \u003Ccode\u003EA / H\u003C/code\u003E on an item with no depth.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"limits\"\u003ELimits\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFormulas run on the item&#039;s \u003Cstrong\u003Etotals\u003C/strong\u003E, not run by run. \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L * 12 / 16) + N\u003C/code\u003E adds one stud per run; there is no per-run rounding yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA formula can only use its own item&#039;s variables, not another item&#039;s.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUp to 50 components per item, 500 characters per formula.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"remove-a-component\"\u003ERemove a component\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove component\u003C/span\u003E under it. You can undo it with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"An item's assembly is a list of components, each with a quantity formula and its own waste and rates. The formula uses the item's measured totals, so one takeoff of a wall gives you studs, plates and board at once, and they update as you measure. Variables you can use Item type Variables Linear L length, H height, A wall area (L × H), N number of runs Area A area, P perimeter (outline + cut-outs), H depth or thickness, N number of areas Count N count Values are in the item's own units: feet and square feet for LF and SF items, meters and square meters for m and m² items. For an SY item, A is in square yards while P and H stay in feet. Formulas use + - * / (or × ÷), parentheses, numbers, and the functions ceil, floor, round, min, max and abs. The full rules are in Formula language. When the item has a Quantity factor (see Create items), L, A and N are already multiplied by it. Worked example: an interior wall Say you have taken off Interior wall type A as a linear item: 4 runs totaling 120 LF, with Height set to 9'-0\". Its Measured values read L = 120, N = 4, A = 1,080 (SF of wall, one face). Select the item under Items. In Assembly, choose Add component. A component called \"Component\" appears, with the formula L and its result below. Type Studs 16 in o.c. in Name and EA in Unit. In Quantity formula, type ceil(L * 12 / 16) + N. The result updates as you type: \"= 94 EA\". That is one stud every 16 inches along 120 feet (90), plus one extra to close each of the 4 runs. Choose Add component again for the plates: name Plates, top and bottom, unit LF, formula L * 2. Result: 240 LF. Add the board: name Gypsum board 4x8, both sides, unit sheets, formula ceil(A * 2 / 32). Result: 68 sheets (2,160 SF of board ÷ 32 SF per sheet = 67.5, rounded up). Fill in each component's Waste %, Material $ and Labor $. Each component gets its own row under the item in Quantities, priced like an item, and the Job total includes it. If the wall cost is all in the components, leave the item's own material and labor rates at 0, or it is counted twice. Waste is applied after the formula and is not rounded: 68 sheets with 10% waste is 74.8 sheets. To order whole sheets, put the waste inside the formula, like ceil(A * 2 / 32 * 1.1), and leave the component's waste at 0. More formulas What Item Formula Studs at 24 in on center Linear ceil(L / 2) + N Insulation batts, SF Linear with height A Paint, both sides, gallons at 350 SF Linear with height ceil(A * 2 / 350) Tile cartons at 15 SF, 10% extra Area ceil(A * 1.1 / 15) Base or edge trim, LF Area P Concrete, cubic yards Area with depth A * H / 27 Concrete rounded up to a quarter yard Area with depth ceil(A * H / 27 * 4) / 4 Hinges, three per door Count N * 3 At least one box, one per 12 Count max(1, ceil(N / 12)) When a formula is wrong The line under the formula turns into an error message, for example \"X\" is not a measured value here. Use L, H, A, N. or A \")\" is missing. The component then has no amounts, its row in Quantities shows \"Formula error: …\", and the header says \"Incomplete: 1 formula error (not in the totals)\". Fix the formula and the totals update. A formula that divides by zero is an error too (\"The formula divides by zero.\"), for example A / H on an item with no depth. Limits Formulas run on the item's totals, not run by run. ceil(L * 12 / 16) + N adds one stud per run; there is no per-run rounding yet. A formula can only use its own item's variables, not another item's. Up to 50 components per item, 500 characters per formula. Remove a component Choose Remove component under it. You can undo it with Ctrl+Z.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"price-library","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"\"Narxlar kutubxonasi\"","summary":"\"Elementlaringiz, stavkalaringiz va yigʻmalaringizni kutubxonada saqlang, uni CSV yoki oʻtgan smetadan import qiling, kutubxonadan istalgan hajmga elementlar qoʻshing va hajmning narxlarini undan yangilang.\"","section":"tasks","order":82,"keywords":["kutubxona","soha paketlari","narxlar roʻyxati","narxlar kitobi","xarajat bazasi","csv import","stavkalar","yigʻmalar","qayta ishlatish","shablon elementlar","narxlarni yangilash","qayta narxlash"],"headings":[{"id":"kutubxonani-to-ldirish","text":"Kutubxonani toʻldirish","level":2},{"id":"hajmda-foydalanish","text":"Hajmda foydalanish","level":2},{"id":"csv-ustunlari","text":"CSV ustunlari","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENarxlar kutubxonasi\u003C/strong\u003E har bir ishda foydalanadigan elementlarni saqlaydi: ularning turi, birligi, balandligi, chiqindisi, material va mehnat stavkalari hamda yigʻmasi. U shu brauzerda saqlanadi, har qanday hajmdan alohida, shuning uchun bu yerda ochgan har bir hajm undan foydalana oladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElementlar\u003C/span\u003E panelining tepasidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKutubxona\u003C/span\u003E bilan oching.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kutubxonani-to-ldirish\"\u003EKutubxonani toʻldirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV import qilish…\u003C/span\u003E CSV sifatida saqlangan elektron jadvalni oʻqiydi (quyidagi ustunlarga qarang). Nomi va turi kutubxonada allaqachon bor elementlar almashtiriladi; qolganlari qoʻshiladi. Oʻqib boʻlmaydigan qatorlar oʻtkazib yuboriladi va qaysi va nega ekanligi aytiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShu hajm elementlarini qoʻshish\u003C/span\u003E ochiq hajmning har bir elementini stavkalari va yigʻmasi bilan kutubxonaga nusxalaydi (belgilarini emas).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETakeoffDesk eksport qiladigan smeta CSV (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003ESmetani eksport qilish\u003C/a\u003E) oʻz holicha import qilinadi: oxirgi ishning narxlari keyingisiga boshlangʻich boʻladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoha paketlari…\u003C/span\u003E bir soha uchun, masalan gipskarton, elektr yoki beton uchun narxsiz bepul yigʻmalar qoʻshadi. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003ESoha paketlari\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV eksport qilish\u003C/span\u003E kutubxonani CSV sifatida saqlaydi: nusxa saqlash, elektron jadvalda tahrirlash yoki hamkasbga berish uchun. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETozalash\u003C/span\u003E uni boʻshatadi (ikki marta bosing).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKutubxona bu brauzerning xotirasida yashaydi. Boshqa brauzer, boshqa kompyuter yoki maxfiy oyna oʻz kutubxonasiga ega (yoki hech qanday kutubxonaga ega emas). Uni koʻchirish uchun eksport qiling.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hajmda-foydalanish\"\u003EHajmda foydalanish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EElementlarni belgilang (roʻyxatni toraytirish uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKutubxonadan qidirish\u003C/span\u003E ga yozing) va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHajmga qoʻshish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Ular yigʻmalari bilan bitta qadamda qoʻshiladi, uni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bekor qiladi. Hajmda allaqachon bor nom raqam oladi, masalan \u003Ccode\u003ECarpet (2)\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENarxlarni yangilash\u003C/span\u003E hajm elementlariga kutubxonaning chiqindisi va stavkalarini beradi — nomi va turi kutubxona elementiga mos keladigan har bir element uchun, va xuddi shu nomli yigʻma tarkibiy qismlari uchun ham. Balandliklar, birliklar va formulalar oʻz holicha qoladi. Bitta \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E barcha eski narxlarni qaytaradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"csv-ustunlari\"\u003ECSV ustunlari\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBirinchi qator ustunlarni nomlaydi, istalgan tartibda; boshqa ustunlar eʼtiborga olinmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUstun\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUnga nima yoziladi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem (or Name)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElementning nomi. Majburiy.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EType\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear, Area yoki Count (LF, SF va EA ham ishlaydi). Boʻsh qoldirilsa, birlik hal qiladi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF yoki m; SF, SY yoki m²; EA. Boʻsh: turning odatiy birligi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaste %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10\u003C/code\u003E yoki \u003Ccode\u003E10%\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial per unit, Labor per unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2.10\u003C/code\u003E yoki \u003Ccode\u003E$1,250\u003C/code\u003E kabi stavkalar.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHeight (or Depth)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E9&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E9\u003C/code\u003E, yoki metrik birliklar uchun \u003Ccode\u003E2.7\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EComponent, Formula\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EComponent nomi bor qator (yoki Type \u003Ccode\u003EComponent\u003C/code\u003E) ustidagi elementning yigʻmasiga kiradi. Uning Unit, Waste va stavkalari oʻzinikidir; uning Formula elementning harflaridan foydalanadi, qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EYigʻmalar va formulalar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EItem,Type,Unit,Waste %,Material per unit,Labor per unit,Height,Component,Formula\nPartition type A,Linear,LF,10,2.10,3.33,9&#039;-0&quot;,,\n,Component,EA,,4.25,,,Studs 16 in. o.c.,ceil(L / 1.333) + N\nVCT flooring,Area,SF,5,1.85,1.10,,,\nDuplex outlets,Count,EA,,3.50,45,,,\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUstunlar orasidagi vergul, nuqtali vergul yoki tabulyatsiya — hammasi ishlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Narxlar kutubxonasi har bir ishda foydalanadigan elementlarni saqlaydi: ularning turi, birligi, balandligi, chiqindisi, material va mehnat stavkalari hamda yigʻmasi. U shu brauzerda saqlanadi, har qanday hajmdan alohida, shuning uchun bu yerda ochgan har bir hajm undan foydalana oladi. Uni Elementlar panelining tepasidagi Kutubxona bilan oching. Kutubxonani toʻldirish CSV import qilish… CSV sifatida saqlangan elektron jadvalni oʻqiydi (quyidagi ustunlarga qarang). Nomi va turi kutubxonada allaqachon bor elementlar almashtiriladi; qolganlari qoʻshiladi. Oʻqib boʻlmaydigan qatorlar oʻtkazib yuboriladi va qaysi va nega ekanligi aytiladi. Shu hajm elementlarini qoʻshish ochiq hajmning har bir elementini stavkalari va yigʻmasi bilan kutubxonaga nusxalaydi (belgilarini emas). TakeoffDesk eksport qiladigan smeta CSV (Smetani eksport qilish) oʻz holicha import qilinadi: oxirgi ishning narxlari keyingisiga boshlangʻich boʻladi. Soha paketlari… bir soha uchun, masalan gipskarton, elektr yoki beton uchun narxsiz bepul yigʻmalar qoʻshadi. Qarang: Soha paketlari. CSV eksport qilish kutubxonani CSV sifatida saqlaydi: nusxa saqlash, elektron jadvalda tahrirlash yoki hamkasbga berish uchun. Tozalash uni boʻshatadi (ikki marta bosing). Kutubxona bu brauzerning xotirasida yashaydi. Boshqa brauzer, boshqa kompyuter yoki maxfiy oyna oʻz kutubxonasiga ega (yoki hech qanday kutubxonaga ega emas). Uni koʻchirish uchun eksport qiling. Hajmda foydalanish Elementlarni belgilang (roʻyxatni toraytirish uchun Kutubxonadan qidirish ga yozing) va Hajmga qoʻshish ni tanlang. Ular yigʻmalari bilan bitta qadamda qoʻshiladi, uni Ctrl+Z bekor qiladi. Hajmda allaqachon bor nom raqam oladi, masalan Carpet (2). Narxlarni yangilash hajm elementlariga kutubxonaning chiqindisi va stavkalarini beradi — nomi va turi kutubxona elementiga mos keladigan har bir element uchun, va xuddi shu nomli yigʻma tarkibiy qismlari uchun ham. Balandliklar, birliklar va formulalar oʻz holicha qoladi. Bitta Ctrl+Z barcha eski narxlarni qaytaradi. CSV ustunlari Birinchi qator ustunlarni nomlaydi, istalgan tartibda; boshqa ustunlar eʼtiborga olinmaydi. Ustun Unga nima yoziladi Item (or Name) Elementning nomi. Majburiy. Type Linear, Area yoki Count (LF, SF va EA ham ishlaydi). Boʻsh qoldirilsa, birlik hal qiladi. Unit LF yoki m; SF, SY yoki m²; EA. Boʻsh: turning odatiy birligi. Waste % 10 yoki 10%. Material per unit, Labor per unit 2.10 yoki $1,250 kabi stavkalar. Height (or Depth) 9'-0\", 9, yoki metrik birliklar uchun 2.7. Component, Formula Component nomi bor qator (yoki Type Component) ustidagi elementning yigʻmasiga kiradi. Uning Unit, Waste va stavkalari oʻzinikidir; uning Formula elementning harflaridan foydalanadi, qarang: Yigʻmalar va formulalar. Item,Type,Unit,Waste %,Material per unit,Labor per unit,Height,Component,Formula Partition type A,Linear,LF,10,2.10,3.33,9'-0\",, ,Component,EA,,4.25,,,Studs 16 in. o.c.,ceil(L / 1.333) + N VCT flooring,Area,SF,5,1.85,1.10,,, Duplex outlets,Count,EA,,3.50,45,,, Ustunlar orasidagi vergul, nuqtali vergul yoki tabulyatsiya — hammasi ishlaydi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"trade-packs","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Soha paketlari","summary":"Soha uchun bepul yigʻmalarni narxlar kutubxonangizga qoʻshing, ularni bir qadamda olib tashlang va oʻz kutubxonangizni paket sifatida ulashing.","section":"tasks","order":83,"keywords":["soha paketi","paket","yigʻmalar","shablonlar","boshlangʻich elementlar","elektr","gipsokarton","karkas","boʻyash","beton","pol qoplamasi","gʻishtkorlik","tom qoplamasi","tashqi qoplama","duradgorlik","santexnika","hvac","izolyatsiya","landshaft","dekking","bosh pudratchi","csi","masterformat","cc0","qoʻshish","olib tashlash","ulashish"],"headings":[{"id":"paket-qo-shish","text":"Paket qoʻshish","level":2},{"id":"paketni-olib-tashlash","text":"Paketni olib tashlash","level":2},{"id":"paket-tarkibi","text":"Paket tarkibi","level":2},{"id":"kutubxonangizni-paket-sifatida-ulashish","text":"Kutubxonangizni paket sifatida ulashish","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESoha paketi\u003C/strong\u003E bu bitta soha uchun tayyor elementlar toʻplami: har biri oʻz birligi, balandligi yoki chuqurligi, chiqindisi va \u003Cstrong\u003Eyigʻmasi\u003C/strong\u003E bilan, ya&#039;ni oʻlchangan chiziq, maydon yoki sanoqni materialga aylantiradigan qismlar va formulalar bilan. Masalan, gipsokarton devor oʻz yoʻnaltiruvchi profilini, karkas profillarini, listlarni, vintlarni, lentani va shpaklyovkani olib keladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPaketlar \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003Enarxlar kutubxonasi\u003C/a\u003E ga qoʻshiladi, u yerdan esa elementlarini istalgan hajmga qoʻshishingiz mumkin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paket-qo-shish\"\u003EPaket qoʻshish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElementlar\u003C/span\u003E panelining yuqorisidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKutubxona\u003C/span\u003E ni oching, soʻng \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoha paketlari…\u003C/span\u003E ni oching.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBirliklar\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang: imperial (LF, SF), metrik (m, m²) yoki ikkalasi. Har bir yigʻma ikkala tizimda ham keladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPaket yonidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoʻshish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPaket elementlari kutubxonada paydo boʻladi, paket nomi bilan belgilangan. Ulardan foydalanish uchun ularni kutubxonada belgilang va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHajmga qoʻshish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPaket narx olib kelmaydi.\u003C/strong\u003E Uning elementlari kutubxonada &quot;stavkani belgilang&quot; deb koʻrinadi. Stavkalar sizniki: ularni kutubxonada yoki element tahrirlovchisida kiriting, yoki narxlar roʻyxatingizni CSV sifatida import qilib, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENarxlarni yangilash\u003C/span\u003E ni ishlating.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAgar kutubxonangizda bir xil nom va turdagi element allaqachon boʻlsa, paket sizniki oʻz holicha qoldiradi. Paketni qayta qoʻshish uning oʻz elementlarini yangi versiya bilan almashtiradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paketni-olib-tashlash\"\u003EPaketni olib tashlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESoha paketlari…\u003C/span\u003E da qoʻshgan paketingiz yonidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOlib tashlash\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang, soʻng tasdiqlash uchun yana bir marta. Undan kelgan har bir element bir qadamda kutubxonadan chiqadi. Siz hajmga allaqachon qoʻshgan elementlar oʻsha hajmda qoladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paket-tarkibi\"\u003EPaket tarkibi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir yigʻma qaysi manbalardan yozilganini koʻrish uchun paket ostida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EManbalar va tafsilotlar\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang: qurilish normalari, standartlar va soha birlashmalarining oʻrnatish qoʻllanmalari. Kutubxonada elementning manbalari va taxminlarini, masalan karkas profillari oraligʻi yoki boʻyoqning sarflanish meʼyorini oʻqish uchun element ustiga kursorni olib boring. Ularni ishingiz va mahsulotlaringiz texnik maʼlumotlari bilan solishtiring va farq qilgan joyda formulalarni oʻzgartiring (qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EYigʻmalar va formulalar\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir paket, amaliy smetachilar uni koʻrib chiqquncha \u003Cstrong\u003EBoshlangʻich: hali smetachi tomonidan koʻrib chiqilmagan\u003C/strong\u003E deb belgilanadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir elementda, masalan \u003Ccode\u003E09 21 16\u003C/code\u003E, CSI MasterFormat raqami ham bor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kutubxonangizni-paket-sifatida-ulashish\"\u003EKutubxonangizni paket sifatida ulashish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKutubxonadagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaket sifatida eksport…\u003C/span\u003E uni paket fayli (\u003Ccode\u003E.ccpack.json\u003C/code\u003E) sifatida saqlaydi, uni istalgan kishi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaket faylini ochish…\u003C/span\u003E bilan qoʻshishi mumkin. Odatiy holda, qoʻshgan paketlaringizdan kelgan elementlar chiqarib tashlanadi va unda stavkalar boʻlmaydi. Stavkalaringizni ham yuborish uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStavkalarimni namunaviy stavka sifatida qoʻshish\u003C/span\u003E ni belgilang: ular siz bergan hudud va sana bilan belgilanib chiqadi, paketni qoʻshgan kishi ulardan foydalanish-foydalanmaslikni tanlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPaket fayllari oddiy maʼlumotlar, hech qachon dasturlar emas. TakeoffDesk ulardan foydalanishdan oldin har bir qismini tekshiradi va oʻqiy olmaydigan narsalarni chiqarib tashlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Soha paketi bu bitta soha uchun tayyor elementlar toʻplami: har biri oʻz birligi, balandligi yoki chuqurligi, chiqindisi va yigʻmasi bilan, ya'ni oʻlchangan chiziq, maydon yoki sanoqni materialga aylantiradigan qismlar va formulalar bilan. Masalan, gipsokarton devor oʻz yoʻnaltiruvchi profilini, karkas profillarini, listlarni, vintlarni, lentani va shpaklyovkani olib keladi. Paketlar narxlar kutubxonasi ga qoʻshiladi, u yerdan esa elementlarini istalgan hajmga qoʻshishingiz mumkin. Paket qoʻshish Elementlar panelining yuqorisidagi Kutubxona ni oching, soʻng Soha paketlari… ni oching. Birliklar ni tanlang: imperial (LF, SF), metrik (m, m²) yoki ikkalasi. Har bir yigʻma ikkala tizimda ham keladi. Paket yonidagi Qoʻshish ni tanlang. Paket elementlari kutubxonada paydo boʻladi, paket nomi bilan belgilangan. Ulardan foydalanish uchun ularni kutubxonada belgilang va Hajmga qoʻshish ni tanlang. Paket narx olib kelmaydi. Uning elementlari kutubxonada \"stavkani belgilang\" deb koʻrinadi. Stavkalar sizniki: ularni kutubxonada yoki element tahrirlovchisida kiriting, yoki narxlar roʻyxatingizni CSV sifatida import qilib, Narxlarni yangilash ni ishlating. Agar kutubxonangizda bir xil nom va turdagi element allaqachon boʻlsa, paket sizniki oʻz holicha qoldiradi. Paketni qayta qoʻshish uning oʻz elementlarini yangi versiya bilan almashtiradi. Paketni olib tashlash Soha paketlari… da qoʻshgan paketingiz yonidagi Olib tashlash ni tanlang, soʻng tasdiqlash uchun yana bir marta. Undan kelgan har bir element bir qadamda kutubxonadan chiqadi. Siz hajmga allaqachon qoʻshgan elementlar oʻsha hajmda qoladi. Paket tarkibi Har bir yigʻma qaysi manbalardan yozilganini koʻrish uchun paket ostida Manbalar va tafsilotlar ni tanlang: qurilish normalari, standartlar va soha birlashmalarining oʻrnatish qoʻllanmalari. Kutubxonada elementning manbalari va taxminlarini, masalan karkas profillari oraligʻi yoki boʻyoqning sarflanish meʼyorini oʻqish uchun element ustiga kursorni olib boring. Ularni ishingiz va mahsulotlaringiz texnik maʼlumotlari bilan solishtiring va farq qilgan joyda formulalarni oʻzgartiring (qarang: Yigʻmalar va formulalar). Har bir paket, amaliy smetachilar uni koʻrib chiqquncha Boshlangʻich: hali smetachi tomonidan koʻrib chiqilmagan deb belgilanadi. Har bir elementda, masalan 09 21 16, CSI MasterFormat raqami ham bor. Kutubxonangizni paket sifatida ulashish Kutubxonadagi Paket sifatida eksport… uni paket fayli (.ccpack.json) sifatida saqlaydi, uni istalgan kishi Paket faylini ochish… bilan qoʻshishi mumkin. Odatiy holda, qoʻshgan paketlaringizdan kelgan elementlar chiqarib tashlanadi va unda stavkalar boʻlmaydi. Stavkalaringizni ham yuborish uchun Stavkalarimni namunaviy stavka sifatida qoʻshish ni belgilang: ular siz bergan hudud va sana bilan belgilanib chiqadi, paketni qoʻshgan kishi ulardan foydalanish-foydalanmaslikni tanlaydi. Paket fayllari oddiy maʼlumotlar, hech qachon dasturlar emas. TakeoffDesk ulardan foydalanishdan oldin har bir qismini tekshiradi va oʻqiy olmaydigan narsalarni chiqarib tashlaydi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"earthwork","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Yer ishlari va nuqtaviy balandliklar","summary":"Sayt rejasida nuqtaviy balandliklarni belgilang, ularni sirt hamda kesish va toʻldirish uchun CivilCraft'ga uzating va bu yerda oddiy qazish miqdorlarini oling.","section":"tasks","order":84,"keywords":["yer ishlari","qazish","kesish","toʻldirish","kesish va toʻldirish","vertikal rejalashtirish","nuqtaviy balandlik","balandliklar","topo","sirt","triangulyatsiya","civilcraft","nuqtalar","pnezd","xandaq"],"headings":[{"id":"bu-yerda-oddiy-qazish","text":"Bu yerda oddiy qazish","level":2},{"id":"nuqtaviy-balandliklar-civilcraft-uchun","text":"Nuqtaviy balandliklar CivilCraft uchun","level":2},{"id":"civilcraft-dan-kesish-va-to-ldirish","text":"CivilCraft'dan kesish va toʻldirish","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk varaqda chizilgan narsalarni oʻlchaydi. Yer ishlari yer sirtini talab qiladi, shuning uchun u CivilCraft bilan birgalikda ishlatiladi: CivilCraft nuqtalardan sirtlar quradi, ularni vertikal rejalashtiradi va kesish, toʻldirish hamda tashishni hisoblaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bu-yerda-oddiy-qazish\"\u003EBu yerda oddiy qazish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBir chuqurlikka qazilgan poydevor uchun \u003Cstrong\u003Echuqurlik\u003C/strong\u003E koʻrsatilgan maydon elementi yetarli: hajm = maydon × chuqurlik. Umumiy pudratchining \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003Eixtisoslashgan toʻplami\u003C/a\u003E ommaviy qazish elementiga ega (tabiiy hajm, boʻshashgan hajm va yuk mashinalari) hamda kommunal xandaq elementiga ega (uzunlik va chuqurlik boʻyicha qazish, tagʻ qatlami va koʻmish).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nuqtaviy-balandliklar-civilcraft-uchun\"\u003ENuqtaviy balandliklar CivilCraft uchun\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESayt varagʻining masshtabini belgilang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESanash\u003C/strong\u003E turidagi element yarating, masalan &quot;Mavjud relyef&quot;, va varaqdagi har bir nuqtaviy balandlikni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBelgini tanlang va Tanlangan belgi panelida uning \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElevation\u003C/span\u003E qiymatini kiriting: \u003Ccode\u003E102.5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E102&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E yoki \u003Ccode\u003E31.24 m\u003C/code\u003E. Manfiy va nol balandliklar ham mumkin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E menyusini oching va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpot elevations\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Siz nuqtalar faylini (\u003Ccode\u003E.csv\u003C/code\u003E) olasiz: Point, Northing, Easting, Elevation va Description ustunlari bilan, ochiq varaqning belgilangan nuqtalari uchun har bir nuqtaga bitta qator.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylni CivilCraft&#039;da oching (qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/import-points\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/import-points\"\u003ENuqtalarni import qilish\u003C/a\u003E). U nuqtalardan sirtni quradi (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/build-surface\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/build-surface\"\u003ESirt qurish\u003C/a\u003E); undan keyin sirtlarni solishtiradi va kesish hamda toʻldirishni beradi (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/volumes\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/volumes\"\u003EHajmlar\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENorthing va Easting bu varaqning oʻz koordinatalari boʻlib, futlarda, sahifa burchagidan uning masshtabida oʻlchanadi: nuqtalar orasidagi masofalar va hajmlar toʻgʻri, lekin ular saytning geodezik koordinatalari emas. Kerak boʻlganda ularni CivilCraft&#039;da saytning koordinatalariga koʻchiring.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETurli varaqlardagi nuqtalar koordinatalarni bogʻlamaydi, shuning uchun eksport faqat ochiq varaqni oladi. Balandliklar hajmlarni hisoblash bilan birga saqlanadi va nusxalash hamda qoʻyish orqali uzatiladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"civilcraft-dan-kesish-va-to-ldirish\"\u003ECivilCraft&#039;dan kesish va toʻldirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECivilCraft&#039;ning yer ishlari ikkita sotiladigan element sifatida qaytadi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECivilCraft&#039;da maydonchalar va yoʻlaklarni vertikal rejalashtiring, soʻngra \u003Cstrong\u003EYer ishlari\u003C/strong\u003E ostida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend to TakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/civilcraft/volumes\" data-topic=\"civilcraft/volumes\"\u003EYer ishlari hajmlari\u003C/a\u003E). U miqdorlar faylini (\u003Ccode\u003E.quantities.json\u003C/code\u003E) saqlaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETakeoffDesk&#039;da uni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen takeoff\u003C/span\u003E bilan oching yoki ilovaga tashlang. Hajmlar hisobingiz ochiq qoladi: fayl \u003Cstrong\u003EEarthwork: cut\u003C/strong\u003E va \u003Cstrong\u003EEarthwork: fill\u003C/strong\u003E elementlarini \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#typed-quantities-no-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"typed-quantities-no-drawing\"\u003Eturdagi miqdorlar\u003C/a\u003E sifatida qoʻshadi: fut loyiha uchun kub yard (CY), metr loyiha uchun kub metr (m³) hisobida. Bu bitta qadam: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uni qaytaradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUlarni xohlaganingizcha qayta nomlang, chiqindi, stavkalar va yigʻmalarni sozlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELoyiha oʻzgarganda, CivilCraft&#039;dan yana yuboring va yangi faylni oching: xuddi shu ikki element yangi miqdorlarni oladi. Ularning nomlari, stavkalari, chiqindisi va yigʻmalari siz belgilagandek qoladi. Agar loyihaning birligi oʻzgargan boʻlsa, holat satrida shu haqda aytiladi: stavkalarni tekshiring. Boshqa CivilCraft loyihasidan kelgan fayl oʻzining ikkita elementini qoʻshadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiqdorlar CivilCraft tomonidan oʻlchanganidek tabiiy hajmlardir (toʻr usuli): qisqarish va koʻpayish yoʻq. Ularni chiqindi sifatida qoʻshing yoki boʻshashgan hajm uchun \u003Ccode\u003EQ * 1.25\u003C/code\u003E kabi formula bilan. Element tahrirlagichi har birining qayerdan va qachon kelganini koʻrsatadi; smetaning izohlar ustuni ham buni aytadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiqdorlar fayli oddiy JSON (\u003Ccode\u003E&quot;format&quot;: &quot;cadcraft-quantities&quot;\u003C/code\u003E) boʻlgani uchun uni skript yoki boshqa dastur ham yozishi mumkin: ilova nomi, loyiha, hamda kalit, nom, birlik va miqdorga ega elementlar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk varaqda chizilgan narsalarni oʻlchaydi. Yer ishlari yer sirtini talab qiladi, shuning uchun u CivilCraft bilan birgalikda ishlatiladi: CivilCraft nuqtalardan sirtlar quradi, ularni vertikal rejalashtiradi va kesish, toʻldirish hamda tashishni hisoblaydi. Bu yerda oddiy qazish Bir chuqurlikka qazilgan poydevor uchun chuqurlik koʻrsatilgan maydon elementi yetarli: hajm = maydon × chuqurlik. Umumiy pudratchining ixtisoslashgan toʻplami ommaviy qazish elementiga ega (tabiiy hajm, boʻshashgan hajm va yuk mashinalari) hamda kommunal xandaq elementiga ega (uzunlik va chuqurlik boʻyicha qazish, tagʻ qatlami va koʻmish). Nuqtaviy balandliklar CivilCraft uchun Sayt varagʻining masshtabini belgilang. Sanash turidagi element yarating, masalan \"Mavjud relyef\", va varaqdagi har bir nuqtaviy balandlikni bosing. Belgini tanlang va Tanlangan belgi panelida uning Elevation qiymatini kiriting: 102.5, 102'-6\" yoki 31.24 m. Manfiy va nol balandliklar ham mumkin. Export menyusini oching va Spot elevations ni tanlang. Siz nuqtalar faylini (.csv) olasiz: Point, Northing, Easting, Elevation va Description ustunlari bilan, ochiq varaqning belgilangan nuqtalari uchun har bir nuqtaga bitta qator. Faylni CivilCraft'da oching (qarang: Nuqtalarni import qilish). U nuqtalardan sirtni quradi (Sirt qurish); undan keyin sirtlarni solishtiradi va kesish hamda toʻldirishni beradi (Hajmlar). Northing va Easting bu varaqning oʻz koordinatalari boʻlib, futlarda, sahifa burchagidan uning masshtabida oʻlchanadi: nuqtalar orasidagi masofalar va hajmlar toʻgʻri, lekin ular saytning geodezik koordinatalari emas. Kerak boʻlganda ularni CivilCraft'da saytning koordinatalariga koʻchiring. Turli varaqlardagi nuqtalar koordinatalarni bogʻlamaydi, shuning uchun eksport faqat ochiq varaqni oladi. Balandliklar hajmlarni hisoblash bilan birga saqlanadi va nusxalash hamda qoʻyish orqali uzatiladi. CivilCraft'dan kesish va toʻldirish CivilCraft'ning yer ishlari ikkita sotiladigan element sifatida qaytadi: CivilCraft'da maydonchalar va yoʻlaklarni vertikal rejalashtiring, soʻngra Yer ishlari ostida Send to TakeoffDesk ni tanlang (Yer ishlari hajmlari). U miqdorlar faylini (.quantities.json) saqlaydi. TakeoffDesk'da uni Open takeoff bilan oching yoki ilovaga tashlang. Hajmlar hisobingiz ochiq qoladi: fayl Earthwork: cut va Earthwork: fill elementlarini turdagi miqdorlar sifatida qoʻshadi: fut loyiha uchun kub yard (CY), metr loyiha uchun kub metr (m³) hisobida. Bu bitta qadam: Ctrl+Z uni qaytaradi. Ularni xohlaganingizcha qayta nomlang, chiqindi, stavkalar va yigʻmalarni sozlang. Loyiha oʻzgarganda, CivilCraft'dan yana yuboring va yangi faylni oching: xuddi shu ikki element yangi miqdorlarni oladi. Ularning nomlari, stavkalari, chiqindisi va yigʻmalari siz belgilagandek qoladi. Agar loyihaning birligi oʻzgargan boʻlsa, holat satrida shu haqda aytiladi: stavkalarni tekshiring. Boshqa CivilCraft loyihasidan kelgan fayl oʻzining ikkita elementini qoʻshadi. Miqdorlar CivilCraft tomonidan oʻlchanganidek tabiiy hajmlardir (toʻr usuli): qisqarish va koʻpayish yoʻq. Ularni chiqindi sifatida qoʻshing yoki boʻshashgan hajm uchun Q * 1.25 kabi formula bilan. Element tahrirlagichi har birining qayerdan va qachon kelganini koʻrsatadi; smetaning izohlar ustuni ham buni aytadi. Miqdorlar fayli oddiy JSON (\"format\": \"cadcraft-quantities\") boʻlgani uchun uni skript yoki boshqa dastur ham yozishi mumkin: ilova nomi, loyiha, hamda kalit, nom, birlik va miqdorga ega elementlar.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"bid-areas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Hisob maydonlari","summary":"Belgilarni bino, qavat yoki bosqich boʻyicha teglang, hajmlarni hisoblashni maydonma-maydon bajaring va har bir maydon uchun miqdorlar hamda xarajatlarni oʻqing.","section":"tasks","order":85,"keywords":["muqobil qoʻshish","muqobilni ayirish","asosiy taklif","muqobillar","hisob maydoni","maydon","bino","qavat","sath","bosqich","zona","muqobil","taqsimot","boʻlish","tipik qavat","oraliq jami","maydon boʻyicha"],"headings":[{"id":"hisob-maydonini-yaratish","text":"Hisob maydonini yaratish","level":2},{"id":"maydon-ichida-hisoblash","text":"Maydon ichida hisoblash","level":2},{"id":"belgilarni-boshqa-maydonga-ko-chirish","text":"Belgilarni boshqa maydonga koʻchirish","level":2},{"id":"nomini-o-zgartirish-tartibini-o-zgartirish-yoki-o-chirish","text":"Nomini oʻzgartirish, tartibini oʻzgartirish yoki oʻchirish","level":2},{"id":"miqdorlarni-maydon-bo-yicha-o-qish","text":"Miqdorlarni maydon boʻyicha oʻqish","level":2},{"id":"muqobillar-asosiy-taklif-va-qo-shimcha-hamda-ayirmalar","text":"Muqobillar: asosiy taklif va qoʻshimcha hamda ayirmalar","level":2},{"id":"eksportda","text":"Eksportda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EHisob maydoni — bu loyihaning alohida narxlanadigan qismi: bino, qavat, bosqich, qanot. Har bir belgi bitta hisob maydonida boʻlishi mumkin. Miqdorlar va smetani har bir maydon uchun, har biri uchun oraliq jami bilan oʻqish mumkin, loyihaning umumiy jami esa hammasining yigʻindisi boʻlib qoladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hisob-maydonini-yaratish\"\u003EHisob maydonini yaratish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElementlar\u003C/span\u003E panelining yuqorisida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHisob maydoni\u003C/span\u003E roʻyxatini oching.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYangi hisob maydoni…\u003C/strong\u003E ni tanlang, &quot;Bino A&quot; yoki &quot;Qavat 2&quot; kabi nom kiriting va \u003Cstrong\u003EYaratish\u003C/strong\u003E ni tanlang. Yangi maydon joriy boʻladi. Holat satrida shunday deyiladi: &quot;Yangi belgilar (nom) ichiga tushadi. Boshqa hisob maydonlaridagi belgilar xira koʻrinadi.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"maydon-ichida-hisoblash\"\u003EMaydon ichida hisoblash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERoʻyxatda hisob maydoni tanlangan paytda har bir yangi belgi unga tushadi: chiziqlar, maydonlar, doiralar, sanashlar, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAvtosanash\u003C/span\u003E qoʻshgan belgilar va siz qoʻyadigan narsalar. Boshqa hisob maydonlaridagi va hech qaysida boʻlmagan belgilar varaqda xira qilinadi, shunda qaysi biri qayerga tegishli ekanini koʻrasiz.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHisob maydonisiz hisoblash uchun roʻyxatda \u003Cstrong\u003EHisob maydoni yoʻq\u003C/strong\u003E ni tanlang; bunda hech narsa xira qilinmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETipik qavatlar: Qavat 2 ni hisoblang, uning belgilarini tanlang (varaqda \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), nusxalang, roʻyxatda Qavat 3 ni tanlang va qoʻying. Nusxalar Qavat 3 ga tushadi. Qavatlar bir xil boʻlib, ularni alohida saqlash kerak boʻlmasa, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/typical-groups\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/typical-groups\"\u003Etipik guruh\u003C/a\u003E bir qavatni bir necha marta sanaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"belgilarni-boshqa-maydonga-ko-chirish\"\u003EBelgilarni boshqa maydonga koʻchirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBitta yoki bir nechta belgini tanlang (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + bosish yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). \u003Cstrong\u003ETanlangan belgi\u003C/strong\u003E (yoki \u003Cstrong\u003ETanlangan belgilar\u003C/strong\u003E) ostida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHisob maydoni\u003C/span\u003E maydonida maydonni tanlang. Holat satrida shunday deyiladi: &quot;3 ta belgi Qavat 2 ga koʻchirildi.&quot; Bu bitta bekor qilish bosqichi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nomini-o-zgartirish-tartibini-o-zgartirish-yoki-o-chirish\"\u003ENomini oʻzgartirish, tartibini oʻzgartirish yoki oʻchirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERoʻyxatda \u003Cstrong\u003EHisob maydonlarini boshqarish…\u003C/strong\u003E ni tanlang. Nomini oʻzgartirish uchun ustiga yozing, tartibini oʻzgartirish uchun oʻqlardan foydalaning (jadvallar va ish kitobi unga ergashadi) yoki axlat qutisi bilan birini oʻchiring. Hisob maydonini oʻchirish uning belgilarini saqlab qoladi: ular keyin hech qanday hisob maydonida boʻlmaydi. Har bir oʻzgarishni \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bekor qiladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"miqdorlarni-maydon-bo-yicha-o-qish\"\u003EMiqdorlarni maydon boʻyicha oʻqish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiqdorlar\u003C/span\u003E jadvalida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaydon boʻyicha\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang (u hisob maydoni boʻlgan hajmlarni hisoblashda koʻrinadi). Har bir maydonda unda boʻlgan elementlar, ularning miqdori, birligi va jami, soʻng oraliq jami qatori koʻrsatiladi. Hech qanday hisob maydonida boʻlmagan belgilar oxirida \u003Cstrong\u003EHisob maydoni yoʻq\u003C/strong\u003E sifatida keladi. Elementning qatorini bosing — element ajratib koʻrsatiladi va shu maydon joriy boʻladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYigʻmalar har bir maydon uchun oʻsha maydonning oʻz yigʻindilaridan hisoblanadi. \u003Ccode\u003Eceil(L / 4)\u003C/code\u003E kabi yuqoriga yaxlitlaydigan formula tufayli maydonlar yigʻindisi butun loyiha uchunidan biroz koʻp chiqishi mumkin, xuddi taklifni maydonma-maydon narxlaganda boʻlgani kabi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muqobillar-asosiy-taklif-va-qo-shimcha-hamda-ayirmalar\"\u003EMuqobillar: asosiy taklif va qoʻshimcha hamda ayirmalar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHisob maydoni \u003Cstrong\u003Emuqobil\u003C/strong\u003E boʻlishi mumkin: buyurtmachi taklifga qoʻshishi yoki undan chiqarishi mumkin boʻlgan ish. \u003Cstrong\u003EHisob maydonlarini boshqarish…\u003C/strong\u003E da har bir maydon nomi yonida roʻyxat bor:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETanlov\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENima qiladi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsosiy taklif\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdatdagidek taklifda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuqobilni qoʻshish\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlohida narxlanadi va \u003Cstrong\u003Easosiy taklifdan chiqariladi\u003C/strong\u003E: gilamni yaxshilash, qoʻshimcha soyabon.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMuqobilni ayirish\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAsosiy taklifda, va ayirma sifatida taklif qilinadi: &quot;soyabonni olib tashlash&quot;.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMuqobilning ishini boshqa maydonlar kabi uning hisob maydoniga hisoblang. Hajmlarni hisoblashda muqobil paydo boʻlgach:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiqdorlar\u003C/span\u003E jadvali sarlavhasida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmumiy jami\u003C/span\u003E oʻrniga \u003Cstrong\u003EAsosiy taklif\u003C/strong\u003E yoziladi: qoʻshimcha muqobillarsiz butun hisoblash.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaydon boʻyicha\u003C/span\u003E asosiy taklif va har bir muqobil uchun bittadan qator bilan tugaydi: qoʻshish uchun \u003Cstrong\u003E+$300.00\u003C/strong\u003E, ayirish uchun \u003Cstrong\u003E−$1,050.00\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMuqobil faqat unda belgilari boʻlgan elementlarni, ularning yigʻmalari bilan birga narxlaydi, shuning uchun boshqa elementning yigʻma qismi aralashib qolmaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEksportda CSV asosiy taklif va muqobillar bilan tugaydi, ish kitobiga esa \u003Cstrong\u003EMuqobillar\u003C/strong\u003E varagi qoʻshiladi: asosiy taklif, har bir muqobilning elementlari va oʻzgarishi hamda har bir qoʻshimcha muqobil olingan holdagi asosiy taklif.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eksportda\"\u003EEksportda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003EHisob maydoni boʻyicha\u003C/strong\u003E varagini qoʻshadi: har bir maydonning elementlari va komponentlari miqdor, chiqindi bilan miqdor, material, ish haqi va jami bilan, har bir maydon uchun oraliq jami (\u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E formulasi) va oxirida \u003Cstrong\u003EBarcha hisob maydonlari\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EBelgilar\u003C/strong\u003E varagiga \u003Cstrong\u003EHisob maydoni\u003C/strong\u003E ustuni qoʻshiladi. Hisob maydonlarisiz hajmlarni hisoblash avvalgidek eksport qilinadi. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003EEksport ustunlari\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHisob maydonlari belgilar bilan birga loyiha faylida saqlanadi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Hisob maydoni — bu loyihaning alohida narxlanadigan qismi: bino, qavat, bosqich, qanot. Har bir belgi bitta hisob maydonida boʻlishi mumkin. Miqdorlar va smetani har bir maydon uchun, har biri uchun oraliq jami bilan oʻqish mumkin, loyihaning umumiy jami esa hammasining yigʻindisi boʻlib qoladi. Hisob maydonini yaratish Elementlar panelining yuqorisida Hisob maydoni roʻyxatini oching. Yangi hisob maydoni… ni tanlang, \"Bino A\" yoki \"Qavat 2\" kabi nom kiriting va Yaratish ni tanlang. Yangi maydon joriy boʻladi. Holat satrida shunday deyiladi: \"Yangi belgilar (nom) ichiga tushadi. Boshqa hisob maydonlaridagi belgilar xira koʻrinadi.\" Maydon ichida hisoblash Roʻyxatda hisob maydoni tanlangan paytda har bir yangi belgi unga tushadi: chiziqlar, maydonlar, doiralar, sanashlar, Avtosanash qoʻshgan belgilar va siz qoʻyadigan narsalar. Boshqa hisob maydonlaridagi va hech qaysida boʻlmagan belgilar varaqda xira qilinadi, shunda qaysi biri qayerga tegishli ekanini koʻrasiz. Hisob maydonisiz hisoblash uchun roʻyxatda Hisob maydoni yoʻq ni tanlang; bunda hech narsa xira qilinmaydi. Tipik qavatlar: Qavat 2 ni hisoblang, uning belgilarini tanlang (varaqda Ctrl+A), nusxalang, roʻyxatda Qavat 3 ni tanlang va qoʻying. Nusxalar Qavat 3 ga tushadi. Qavatlar bir xil boʻlib, ularni alohida saqlash kerak boʻlmasa, tipik guruh bir qavatni bir necha marta sanaydi. Belgilarni boshqa maydonga koʻchirish Bitta yoki bir nechta belgini tanlang (Shift + bosish yoki Ctrl+A). Tanlangan belgi (yoki Tanlangan belgilar) ostida Hisob maydoni maydonida maydonni tanlang. Holat satrida shunday deyiladi: \"3 ta belgi Qavat 2 ga koʻchirildi.\" Bu bitta bekor qilish bosqichi. Nomini oʻzgartirish, tartibini oʻzgartirish yoki oʻchirish Roʻyxatda Hisob maydonlarini boshqarish… ni tanlang. Nomini oʻzgartirish uchun ustiga yozing, tartibini oʻzgartirish uchun oʻqlardan foydalaning (jadvallar va ish kitobi unga ergashadi) yoki axlat qutisi bilan birini oʻchiring. Hisob maydonini oʻchirish uning belgilarini saqlab qoladi: ular keyin hech qanday hisob maydonida boʻlmaydi. Har bir oʻzgarishni Ctrl+Z bekor qiladi. Miqdorlarni maydon boʻyicha oʻqish Miqdorlar jadvalida Maydon boʻyicha ni tanlang (u hisob maydoni boʻlgan hajmlarni hisoblashda koʻrinadi). Har bir maydonda unda boʻlgan elementlar, ularning miqdori, birligi va jami, soʻng oraliq jami qatori koʻrsatiladi. Hech qanday hisob maydonida boʻlmagan belgilar oxirida Hisob maydoni yoʻq sifatida keladi. Elementning qatorini bosing — element ajratib koʻrsatiladi va shu maydon joriy boʻladi. Yigʻmalar har bir maydon uchun oʻsha maydonning oʻz yigʻindilaridan hisoblanadi. ceil(L / 4) kabi yuqoriga yaxlitlaydigan formula tufayli maydonlar yigʻindisi butun loyiha uchunidan biroz koʻp chiqishi mumkin, xuddi taklifni maydonma-maydon narxlaganda boʻlgani kabi. Muqobillar: asosiy taklif va qoʻshimcha hamda ayirmalar Hisob maydoni muqobil boʻlishi mumkin: buyurtmachi taklifga qoʻshishi yoki undan chiqarishi mumkin boʻlgan ish. Hisob maydonlarini boshqarish… da har bir maydon nomi yonida roʻyxat bor: Tanlov Nima qiladi Asosiy taklif Odatdagidek taklifda. Muqobilni qoʻshish Alohida narxlanadi va asosiy taklifdan chiqariladi: gilamni yaxshilash, qoʻshimcha soyabon. Muqobilni ayirish Asosiy taklifda, va ayirma sifatida taklif qilinadi: \"soyabonni olib tashlash\". Muqobilning ishini boshqa maydonlar kabi uning hisob maydoniga hisoblang. Hajmlarni hisoblashda muqobil paydo boʻlgach: Miqdorlar jadvali sarlavhasida Umumiy jami oʻrniga Asosiy taklif yoziladi: qoʻshimcha muqobillarsiz butun hisoblash. Maydon boʻyicha asosiy taklif va har bir muqobil uchun bittadan qator bilan tugaydi: qoʻshish uchun +$300.00, ayirish uchun −$1,050.00. Muqobil faqat unda belgilari boʻlgan elementlarni, ularning yigʻmalari bilan birga narxlaydi, shuning uchun boshqa elementning yigʻma qismi aralashib qolmaydi. Eksportda CSV asosiy taklif va muqobillar bilan tugaydi, ish kitobiga esa Muqobillar varagi qoʻshiladi: asosiy taklif, har bir muqobilning elementlari va oʻzgarishi hamda har bir qoʻshimcha muqobil olingan holdagi asosiy taklif. Eksportda XLSX Hisob maydoni boʻyicha varagini qoʻshadi: har bir maydonning elementlari va komponentlari miqdor, chiqindi bilan miqdor, material, ish haqi va jami bilan, har bir maydon uchun oraliq jami (SUM formulasi) va oxirida Barcha hisob maydonlari. Belgilar varagiga Hisob maydoni ustuni qoʻshiladi. Hisob maydonlarisiz hajmlarni hisoblash avvalgidek eksport qilinadi. Qarang: Eksport ustunlari. Hisob maydonlari belgilar bilan birga loyiha faylida saqlanadi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"issues-and-revisions","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Nashrlar, qayta koʻrib chiqishlar va chizmalar oʻzgarishlar jurnali","summary":"Architektor modeli bilan bitta nashrlar tarixini saqlang: nashrlarni oʻqing, obyekt koʻrsatmalarini, ishlab chiqarish chizmalarini va bogʻlangan modellarni nashrga qarab yozing hamda chizmalar oʻzgarishlar jurnalini oʻqing.","section":"tasks","order":86,"keywords":["nashr","qayta koʻrib chiqish","qayta koʻrib chiqishlar","oʻzgarishlar jurnali","chizmalar oʻzgarishlar jurnali","chizmalar reyestri","obyekt koʻrsatmasi","ishlab chiqarish chizmasi","bogʻlangan model","taklif","qurilish","nashrlar tarixi","miqdorlar hisobi","hajmlarni hisoblash"],"headings":[{"id":"nimalarni-bajarasiz","text":"Nimalarni bajarasiz","level":2},{"id":"qadamlar","text":"Qadamlar","level":2},{"id":"yaxshi-bilish-kerak","text":"Yaxshi bilish kerak","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"nimalarni-bajarasiz\"\u003ENimalarni bajarasiz\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EArchitektor bilan bir xil nashrlar tarixida ishlang. Qaysi varaqlar qaysi qayta koʻrib chiqishda chiqqanini koʻring va obyektda sodir boʻlgan ishlarni ularga tegishli nashr bilan bogʻlab turing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qadamlar\"\u003EQadamlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENashrlar va qayta koʻrib chiqishlar\u003C/strong\u003E ni oching.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENashrlar tarixini oʻqish\u003C/strong\u003E ni tanlang va BimCraft yoki boshqa ilovadan saqlangan \u003Ccode\u003E.issues.json\u003C/code\u003E faylini tanlang. Uning nashrlari va yozuvlari sizning tarixingizga qoʻshiladi. Hech narsa almashtirilmaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EObyekt koʻrsatmasi, ishlab chiqarish chizmasi, belgilashlar toʻplami, bogʻlangan model yoki izoh uchun \u003Cstrong\u003EYozuv qoʻshish\u003C/strong\u003E ni tanlang. Unga tegishli nashrni va holatini tanlang. Tanlangan fayl nomi, hajmi va SHA-256 boʻyicha yoziladi; fayl oʻz joyida qoladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EChizmalar oʻzgarishlar jurnali\u003C/strong\u003E har bir varaq uchun bitta qator va har bir nashr uchun bitta ustun koʻrsatadi. Qavs ichidagi qayta koʻrib chiqish oʻzgarishsiz qayta chiqarilgan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOʻzgarishlar jurnalini yuklab olish (CSV)\u003C/strong\u003E nashrlarni, varaqlar jadvalini va yozuvlarni saqlaydi. \u003Cstrong\u003ENashrlar tarixini saqlash\u003C/strong\u003E boshqa ilovalar oʻqiydigan faylni yozadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yaxshi-bilish-kerak\"\u003EYaxshi bilish kerak\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENashrni qayd etish\u003C/strong\u003E oʻlchangan varaqlaringizni nashr qiladi, masalan miqdorlar hisobi bilan. \u003Cstrong\u003EShundan beri oʻzgarishlar\u003C/strong\u003E shu nashrdan keyin qaysi varaqlar qayta oʻlchanganini koʻrsatadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETarix hajmlar hisobi faylida saqlanadi. Har bir oʻzgarish bitta \u003Cstrong\u003EOrtga qaytarish\u003C/strong\u003E qadami.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBir faylni ikki marta oʻqish hech narsani ikki marta qoʻshmaydi. Ikki nusxada bir xil yozuv boʻlsa, yangisi saqlanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Nimalarni bajarasiz Architektor bilan bir xil nashrlar tarixida ishlang. Qaysi varaqlar qaysi qayta koʻrib chiqishda chiqqanini koʻring va obyektda sodir boʻlgan ishlarni ularga tegishli nashr bilan bogʻlab turing. Qadamlar Nashrlar va qayta koʻrib chiqishlar ni oching. Nashrlar tarixini oʻqish ni tanlang va BimCraft yoki boshqa ilovadan saqlangan .issues.json faylini tanlang. Uning nashrlari va yozuvlari sizning tarixingizga qoʻshiladi. Hech narsa almashtirilmaydi. Obyekt koʻrsatmasi, ishlab chiqarish chizmasi, belgilashlar toʻplami, bogʻlangan model yoki izoh uchun Yozuv qoʻshish ni tanlang. Unga tegishli nashrni va holatini tanlang. Tanlangan fayl nomi, hajmi va SHA-256 boʻyicha yoziladi; fayl oʻz joyida qoladi. Chizmalar oʻzgarishlar jurnali har bir varaq uchun bitta qator va har bir nashr uchun bitta ustun koʻrsatadi. Qavs ichidagi qayta koʻrib chiqish oʻzgarishsiz qayta chiqarilgan. Oʻzgarishlar jurnalini yuklab olish (CSV) nashrlarni, varaqlar jadvalini va yozuvlarni saqlaydi. Nashrlar tarixini saqlash boshqa ilovalar oʻqiydigan faylni yozadi. Yaxshi bilish kerak Nashrni qayd etish oʻlchangan varaqlaringizni nashr qiladi, masalan miqdorlar hisobi bilan. Shundan beri oʻzgarishlar shu nashrdan keyin qaysi varaqlar qayta oʻlchanganini koʻrsatadi. Tarix hajmlar hisobi faylida saqlanadi. Har bir oʻzgarish bitta Ortga qaytarish qadami. Bir faylni ikki marta oʻqish hech narsani ikki marta qoʻshmaydi. Ikki nusxada bir xil yozuv boʻlsa, yangisi saqlanadi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"typical-groups","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Tipik guruhlar","summary":"Tipik birlik, xona yoki qavatni bir marta hajmlang va u qancha marta takrorlansa, shuncha marta hisoblang, keyinroq sonini oʻzgartiring va qaysi belgilar tipik ekanini koʻring.","section":"tasks","order":86,"keywords":["tipik","tipik guruh","takror","takror soni","koʻpaytirish","marta","birlik","mehmonxona xonasi","xonadon","tipik qavat","x24","nusxalar"],"headings":[{"id":"tipik-guruh-yaratish","text":"Tipik guruh yaratish","level":2},{"id":"keyinroq-o-zgartirish","text":"Keyinroq oʻzgartirish","level":2},{"id":"bilib-oling","text":"Bilib oling","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EBino koʻpincha takrorlanadi: 24 ta bir xil mehmonxona xonasi, 6 ta tipik qavat, bir xil chiziqlash bilan 40 ta avtoturargoh joyi. \u003Cstrong\u003ETipik guruh\u003C/strong\u003E ulardan birini hajmlash va uni takrorlanadigan marta sanash imkonini beradi, nusxalarni chizmasdan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tipik-guruh-yaratish\"\u003ETipik guruh yaratish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBitta birlikni hajmlang: uning devorlari, poli, rozetkalari — istalgan elementlar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUning belgilarini \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETanlash\u003C/span\u003E asbobi bilan tanlang: birini bosing, soʻng \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + boshqalarini bosing (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste#select-the-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-hash=\"select-the-marks\"\u003EBelgilarni tanlash\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETanlangan belgi\u003C/strong\u003E ostida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETipik\u003C/span\u003E ni oching va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYangi tipik guruh…\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnga nom bering (\u003Ccode\u003EUnit A\u003C/code\u003E) va u necha marta takrorlanishini kiriting (\u003Ccode\u003E24\u003C/code\u003E), soʻng \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuruh yaratish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEndi oʻsha belgilarning har bir miqdori 24 marta hisoblanadi: 10 ft devor chizigʻi 240 ft beradi, 80 SF pol 1,920 SF, ikkita rozetka 48. Xarajatlar ularga ergashadi, va yigʻma formulalari takrorlangan jamilarni koʻradi (\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E ham har bir chiziqni 24 marta sanaydi).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVaraqda guruh belgilari atrofida nomi va soni bilan punktir quti chiziladi, masalan \u003Cstrong\u003EUnit A ×24\u003C/strong\u003E kabi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"keyinroq-o-zgartirish\"\u003EKeyinroq oʻzgartirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuruhlar oʻng panelda \u003Cstrong\u003ETipik guruhlar\u003C/strong\u003E ostida roʻyxatlanadi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHisoblash sonini oʻzgartirish uchun \u003Cstrong\u003E×\u003C/strong\u003E dan keyingi sonni oʻzgartiring (1 dan 10,000 gacha). Har bir miqdor yangilanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENomi maydonida uning nomini oʻzgartiring.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQuti belgisi uning belgilarini tanlaydi (va ularning varagʻini koʻrsatadi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChiqindi qutisi guruhni oʻchiradi. Uning belgilari qoladi, bir marta sanaladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBelgilarni guruhga qoʻshish yoki undan olib tashlash uchun ularni tanlang va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETipik\u003C/span\u003E ostida guruhni (yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETipik emas (×1)\u003C/span\u003E) tanlang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilib-oling\"\u003EBilib oling\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGuruh belgilari bir nechta varaqda va istalgan elementlarda boʻlishi mumkin. Har bir belgi eng koʻpi bilan bitta guruhda boʻladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESiz qoʻygan nusxalar guruhga kirmaydi: tipik birlikning qoʻyilgan nusxasi aks holda yana 24 marta hisoblanardi. &quot;Bir xil narsa N marta&quot; uchun guruhdan, chizgan nusxalaringiz uchun esa nusxalash va qoʻyishdan foydalaning.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBelgilar bir marta chiziladi, shuning uchun 3D koʻrinish va belgilangan PDF bitta birlikni koʻrsatadi; miqdorlar, eksportlar va har bir varaq jadvali uni ×N deb sanaydi. Excel eksportining \u003Cstrong\u003EBelgilar\u003C/strong\u003E varagʻi qaysi belgilar tipik ekanini va ular necha marta hisoblanishini aytadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETaklif maydonlari bilan guruh belgilari oʻz taklif maydonida ×N deb sanaladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Bino koʻpincha takrorlanadi: 24 ta bir xil mehmonxona xonasi, 6 ta tipik qavat, bir xil chiziqlash bilan 40 ta avtoturargoh joyi. Tipik guruh ulardan birini hajmlash va uni takrorlanadigan marta sanash imkonini beradi, nusxalarni chizmasdan. Tipik guruh yaratish Bitta birlikni hajmlang: uning devorlari, poli, rozetkalari — istalgan elementlar. Uning belgilarini Tanlash asbobi bilan tanlang: birini bosing, soʻng Shift + boshqalarini bosing (Belgilarni tanlash). Tanlangan belgi ostida Tipik ni oching va Yangi tipik guruh… ni tanlang. Unga nom bering (Unit A) va u necha marta takrorlanishini kiriting (24), soʻng Guruh yaratish ni tanlang. Endi oʻsha belgilarning har bir miqdori 24 marta hisoblanadi: 10 ft devor chizigʻi 240 ft beradi, 80 SF pol 1,920 SF, ikkita rozetka 48. Xarajatlar ularga ergashadi, va yigʻma formulalari takrorlangan jamilarni koʻradi (N ham har bir chiziqni 24 marta sanaydi). Varaqda guruh belgilari atrofida nomi va soni bilan punktir quti chiziladi, masalan Unit A ×24 kabi. Keyinroq oʻzgartirish Guruhlar oʻng panelda Tipik guruhlar ostida roʻyxatlanadi: Hisoblash sonini oʻzgartirish uchun × dan keyingi sonni oʻzgartiring (1 dan 10,000 gacha). Har bir miqdor yangilanadi. Nomi maydonida uning nomini oʻzgartiring. Quti belgisi uning belgilarini tanlaydi (va ularning varagʻini koʻrsatadi). Chiqindi qutisi guruhni oʻchiradi. Uning belgilari qoladi, bir marta sanaladi. Belgilarni guruhga qoʻshish yoki undan olib tashlash uchun ularni tanlang va Tipik ostida guruhni (yoki Tipik emas (×1)) tanlang. Bilib oling Guruh belgilari bir nechta varaqda va istalgan elementlarda boʻlishi mumkin. Har bir belgi eng koʻpi bilan bitta guruhda boʻladi. Siz qoʻygan nusxalar guruhga kirmaydi: tipik birlikning qoʻyilgan nusxasi aks holda yana 24 marta hisoblanardi. \"Bir xil narsa N marta\" uchun guruhdan, chizgan nusxalaringiz uchun esa nusxalash va qoʻyishdan foydalaning. Belgilar bir marta chiziladi, shuning uchun 3D koʻrinish va belgilangan PDF bitta birlikni koʻrsatadi; miqdorlar, eksportlar va har bir varaq jadvali uni ×N deb sanaydi. Excel eksportining Belgilar varagʻi qaysi belgilar tipik ekanini va ular necha marta hisoblanishini aytadi. Taklif maydonlari bilan guruh belgilari oʻz taklif maydonida ×N deb sanaladi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"read-quantities","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Read quantities and the estimate","summary":"Use the Quantities table by item and by sheet, the job total, highlighting, and the Incomplete warning.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["quantities","totals","by item","by sheet","job total","estimate","summary","report","highlight","incomplete","costs"],"headings":[{"id":"by-item","text":"By item","level":2},{"id":"by-sheet","text":"By sheet","level":2},{"id":"by-area","text":"By area","level":2},{"id":"the-incomplete-warning","text":"The Incomplete warning","level":2},{"id":"highlight-an-item","text":"Highlight an item","level":2},{"id":"item-totals-in-the-side-panel","text":"Item totals in the side panel","level":2},{"id":"marks-on-pdfs-that-are-not-open","text":"Marks on PDFs that are not open","level":2},{"id":"more-room","text":"More room","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table at the bottom of the window is your live estimate. It changes the moment you draw, delete, rescale or edit a rate. Quantities are never stored; they are measured again from the marks every time, so they cannot drift out of date.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"by-item\"\u003EBy item\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy item\u003C/span\u003E (the default). Each item has a row, and each of its assembly components a row under it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EColumn\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeaning\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EName, with the item&#039;s color. &quot;+(n) unscaled&quot; means some marks are on sheets with no scale.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measured total in the item&#039;s unit (components: the formula result).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, or the component&#039;s unit.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWaste %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETyped here or in the item editor.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWith waste\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantity × (1 + waste).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial/unit, Labor/unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERates; you can type them here.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial, Labor\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWith waste × rate, rounded to the cent.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETotal\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial + labor.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe last row, \u003Cstrong\u003EJob total\u003C/strong\u003E, adds the material, labor and total columns. The same total shows at the right of the table&#039;s header.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EType into a waste or rate cell and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or click away to apply it. A value TakeoffDesk cannot read is outlined in red and the status bar says why, for example &quot;Type an amount like 12.50.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick an item&#039;s name in its row to make it the current item, turn on its measuring tool and highlight its marks, without moving the view (the same as clicking it under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E). Clicking one of the row&#039;s figures selects the marks behind it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"by-sheet\"\u003EBy sheet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy sheet\u003C/span\u003E to see each item&#039;s quantity on each sheet, with the number of marks. Click a row to open that sheet with the item highlighted. Use it to check that every sheet was taken off, or to split quantities by floor or area of work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"by-area\"\u003EBy area\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen the takeoff has bid areas, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy area\u003C/span\u003E lists each area&#039;s items and a subtotal. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\"\u003EBid areas\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-incomplete-warning\"\u003EThe Incomplete warning\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen something is left out of the totals, the header shows a warning, for example:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;Incomplete: 1 formula error, 6 marks on sheets with no scale (not in the totals)&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFormula errors\u003C/strong\u003E: an assembly component&#039;s formula cannot be worked out. Its row says &quot;Formula error: …&quot;. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies#when-a-formula-is-wrong\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-hash=\"when-a-formula-is-wrong\"\u003EAssemblies and formulas\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMarks on sheets with no scale\u003C/strong\u003E: give those sheets a scale. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale#why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-hash=\"why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\"\u003ESet the scale\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe same notes go into the exported spreadsheet, so an incomplete estimate never looks complete.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"highlight-an-item\"\u003EHighlight an item\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick an item under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E or in the table. Its marks glow on every sheet; every other mark stays fully visible. The sheets list shows &quot;(n) highlighted&quot; on each sheet with its marks. Click the item again to stop highlighting.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"item-totals-in-the-side-panel\"\u003EItem totals in the side panel\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach item in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E list shows its quantity too. The item editor&#039;s \u003Cstrong\u003EMeasured\u003C/strong\u003E block shows the values its formulas use: length, runs and wall area; area, perimeter and number of areas; or count.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"marks-on-pdfs-that-are-not-open\"\u003EMarks on PDFs that are not open\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA takeoff can include marks on PDFs you have not opened this time. They still count in every total; the sheets list names those PDFs. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003ESave and reopen a takeoff\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"more-room\"\u003EMore room\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe arrow button at the right of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E header hides the table so the sheet gets more room. Choose it again to bring the table back.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"The Quantities table at the bottom of the window is your live estimate. It changes the moment you draw, delete, rescale or edit a rate. Quantities are never stored; they are measured again from the marks every time, so they cannot drift out of date. By item Choose By item (the default). Each item has a row, and each of its assembly components a row under it. Column Meaning Item Name, with the item's color. \"+(n) unscaled\" means some marks are on sheets with no scale. Quantity The measured total in the item's unit (components: the formula result). Unit LF, m, SF, SY, m², EA, or the component's unit. Waste % Typed here or in the item editor. With waste Quantity × (1 + waste). Material/unit, Labor/unit Rates; you can type them here. Material, Labor With waste × rate, rounded to the cent. Total Material + labor. The last row, Job total, adds the material, labor and total columns. The same total shows at the right of the table's header. Type into a waste or rate cell and press Enter or click away to apply it. A value TakeoffDesk cannot read is outlined in red and the status bar says why, for example \"Type an amount like 12.50.\" Click an item's name in its row to make it the current item, turn on its measuring tool and highlight its marks, without moving the view (the same as clicking it under Items). Clicking one of the row's figures selects the marks behind it. By sheet Choose By sheet to see each item's quantity on each sheet, with the number of marks. Click a row to open that sheet with the item highlighted. Use it to check that every sheet was taken off, or to split quantities by floor or area of work. By area When the takeoff has bid areas, By area lists each area's items and a subtotal. See Bid areas. The Incomplete warning When something is left out of the totals, the header shows a warning, for example: \"Incomplete: 1 formula error, 6 marks on sheets with no scale (not in the totals)\" Formula errors: an assembly component's formula cannot be worked out. Its row says \"Formula error: …\". See Assemblies and formulas. Marks on sheets with no scale: give those sheets a scale. See Set the scale. The same notes go into the exported spreadsheet, so an incomplete estimate never looks complete. Highlight an item Click an item under Items or in the table. Its marks glow on every sheet; every other mark stays fully visible. The sheets list shows \"(n) highlighted\" on each sheet with its marks. Click the item again to stop highlighting. Item totals in the side panel Each item in the Items list shows its quantity too. The item editor's Measured block shows the values its formulas use: length, runs and wall area; area, perimeter and number of areas; or count. Marks on PDFs that are not open A takeoff can include marks on PDFs you have not opened this time. They still count in every total; the sheets list names those PDFs. See Save and reopen a takeoff. More room The arrow button at the right of the Quantities header hides the table so the sheet gets more room. Choose it again to bring the table back.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"check-in-3d","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Hajmlarni hisoblashni 3D da tekshirish","summary":"Ochiq varaqning devorlari, plitalari va sanashlarini chizma ustida koʻrib chiqing, ularni aylantiring va bittasini bosib, uning belgisini tanlang.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["png","rasm","tasvir","skrinshot","qavatlar","sathlar","qavatlarga joylash","fasad","glb","gltf","3D eksporti","devor qalinligi","asos balandligi","teshik","eshik tepasi","3d","uch oʻlchamli","tekshirish","koʻrinish","devorlar","devor balandligi","plita","chuqurlik","hajm","aylantirish","model","tanlash","izometrik","perspektiva"],"headings":[{"id":"3d-ko-rinishni-ochish","text":"3D koʻrinishni ochish","level":2},{"id":"nimani-ko-rasiz","text":"Nimani koʻrasiz","level":2},{"id":"atrofga-qarash","text":"Atrofga qarash","level":2},{"id":"qalinligi-asosi-va-teshiklari-bor-devorlar","text":"Qalinligi, asosi va teshiklari bor devorlar","level":2},{"id":"qavatlarni-joylash","text":"Qavatlarni joylash","level":2},{"id":"3d-ko-rinishni-rasm-sifatida-saqlash","text":"3D koʻrinishni rasm sifatida saqlash","level":2},{"id":"3d-ko-rinishni-model-sifatida-saqlash","text":"3D koʻrinishni model sifatida saqlash","level":2},{"id":"3d-dan-belgini-tanlash","text":"3D dan belgini tanlash","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E3D koʻrinish bu ikkinchi chizma emas, tekshiruvdir: u varaqning hajmlarini oʻsha varaqning oʻzida ekranda tik turgʻizadi, shunda yoʻq devor, ikki marta chizilgan plita yoki adashgan sanash bir qarashda koʻrinadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoshlashdan oldin: varaqda masshtab boʻlishi kerak (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EMasshtabni belgilash\u003C/a\u003E). Balandlik va chuqurlik haqiqiy futlarda kerak, shuning uchun masshtabi boʻlmagan varaqda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E buni aytadi va tekis varaqda qoladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-ko-rinishni-ochish\"\u003E3D koʻrinishni ochish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETekshirmoqchi boʻlgan varaqni koʻrsating.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVaraq nomi va masshtabini koʻrsatadigan panelda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tugmasini bosing. Birinchi marta 3D koʻrinish yuklanishi uchun bir lahza kerak boʻladi. Varaq yer ustida chiziladi va hajmlarni hisoblash unda har bir elementning rangida turadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQaytish uchun yana \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E3D\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVaraqqa qaytish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tugmasini bosing. Chizish asbobini (Chiziqli, Maydon, Sanash va hokazo) tanlash ham qaytaradi, chunki belgilar tekis varaqda chiziladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU ekranda varaqni koʻrsatadi; varaqlar roʻyxatida yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bilan varaqlarni almashtiring, 3D koʻrinish ularga ergashadi. Bir vaqtda bir necha qavatni koʻrish uchun ularni qavatlarga joylang (quyida).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nimani-ko-rasiz\"\u003ENimani koʻrasiz\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBelgi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E3D da\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChiziqli chiziq, balandligi bor element\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChiziq boʻylab shu balandlikdagi devor. Egri chiziqlar egri boʻylab boradi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChiziqli chiziq, balandligi yoʻq element\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVaraqdagi chiziq. Uni tik turgʻizish uchun \u003Cstrong\u003EElement\u003C/strong\u003E ostida elementga balandlik bering.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaydon, chuqurligi bor element\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShu chuqurlikdagi plita, kesmalari ochiq holda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaydon, chuqurligi yoʻq element\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYupqa 2&quot; plastina, shunda u baribir koʻrinadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESanash\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHar bir sanalgan nuqtada kichik ustun.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBalandlik chiziqli elementning \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBalandlik\u003C/span\u003E maydoni, chuqurlik esa maydonli elementning \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChuqurlik\u003C/span\u003E maydoni boʻlib, \u003Cstrong\u003EElement\u003C/strong\u003E ostida (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003EHajm elementlarini yaratish\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang). Uni oʻzgartiring, 3D koʻrinish darhol yangilanadi. Varaq nomi ostidagi izohda varaqda nima borligi aytiladi, masalan &quot;3D dagi bu varaq: 2 ta devor, 1 ta plita, 3 ta sanash&quot;, hamda balandligi yoki chuqurligi boʻlmagan nechta chiziq yoki maydon borligi. Bosishlar uning orqali koʻrinishga oʻtadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E3D da raqamlar oʻzgarmaydi: devorning maydoni uning aniq uzunligi koʻpaytirilgan balandligi, plitaning hajmi esa uning sof maydoni (kontur minus kesmalar, egri chiziqlar aniq) koʻpaytirilgan chuqurligi. Egri chiziqlar faqat ekranda qisqa toʻgʻri boʻlaklar bilan chiziladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"atrofga-qarash\"\u003EAtrofga qarash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EHarakat\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENima qiladi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESudrash yoki oʻrta tugma bilan sudrash\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHajmlarni hisoblash atrofida aylanish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + sudrash yoki oʻng tugma bilan sudrash\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESurish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESichqoncha gʻildiragi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKursor turgan joyda kattalashtirish va kichraytirish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESensorli panelda ikki barmoq bilan surish\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAylanish (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E suradi). Chimdish kattalashtiradi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYuqori\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOld\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrqa\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChap\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOʻng\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPastki\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStandart koʻrinishlar, hajmlarni hisoblash boʻyicha kadrlangan. 3D koʻrinish \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E da ochiladi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPerspektiva\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPerspektiva yoqilgan yoki oʻchirilgan (oʻchirilganda parallel).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHammasini kattalashtirish\u003C/span\u003E yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EButun varaq.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVaraq\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYerdagi chizmani koʻrsatish yoki yashirish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoʻrinish kubi, yuqori oʻngda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUndan qarash uchun yuzi, qirrasi yoki burchagini bosing; aylantirish uchun uni sudrang; burish uchun kompas halqasini sudrang; uy tugmasi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIso\u003C/span\u003E ga qaytaradi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBurchakda koʻrinish kubi, kichik X, Y, Z oʻqlari belgisi yoki hech narsa koʻrinadi: buni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E da, TakeoffDesk yorligʻida, \u003Cstrong\u003EBurchak koʻrsatkichi\u003C/strong\u003E ostida tanlang (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003ETakeoffDesk sozlamalari\u003C/a\u003E). Tekis varaqda burchak koʻrsatkichi yoʻq.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBir barmoq aylantiradi; ikki barmoq chimdib kattalashtiradi va surish uchun siljiydi. Bir marta bosish tanlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qalinligi-asosi-va-teshiklari-bor-devorlar\"\u003EQalinligi, asosi va teshiklari bor devorlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBalandligi bor chiziqli element yupqa lenta sifatida turadi. Uni haqiqiy devor sifatida koʻrish uchun elementga sozlamalarida \u003Cstrong\u003E3D da\u003C/strong\u003E ostida shakl bering:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDevor qalinligi\u003C/strong\u003E (8&quot;, 0.2 m): devor chizgan chiziqingiz markazida joylashgan qattiq jismga aylanadi, burchaklari qiyshiq kesilgan holda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsos balandligi\u003C/strong\u003E: devor poldan shuncha yuqoridan boshlanadi (soffit, yuqori shkaf qatori). Maydon elementlarida ham bor: 9&#039;-0&quot; balandlikdagi plafon.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETeshik tepasi\u003C/strong\u003E: ayirilgan kesma (eshik, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#deduct-a-part-of-a-run\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"deduct-a-part-of-a-run\"\u003EChiziq qismini ayirish\u003C/a\u003E) devorni shu balandlikdan yuqorida saqlaydi, shunda eshik eshik sifatida koʻrinadi. Uning yoʻqligida ayirilgan kesma tepagacha boʻshliq qoldiradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBular faqat 3D koʻrinishni shakllantiradi: miqdorlar (uzunlik, devor maydoni, xarajatlar) oʻzgarishsiz qoladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qavatlarni-joylash\"\u003EQavatlarni joylash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHar bir qavatning PDF fayllarini oching.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E3D koʻrinishda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDarajalar…\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang va har bir qavatning balandligini kiriting, masalan \u003Ccode\u003E0\u003C/code\u003E birinchi qavat uchun va keyingisi uchun \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;\u003C/code\u003E. Boʻsh qoldirilsa, varaq chiqarib tashlanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQavatlarga joylash\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Darajasi bor har bir varaq oʻz hajmlarini oʻz balandligida koʻrsatadi; ekrandagi varaq oʻz qavati ostida yotadi, boshqalari konturlar bilan koʻrsatiladi. Izohda nechta qavat joylanganligi aytiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVaraqlar sahifadagi oʻrni boʻyicha tekislanadi, shuning uchun bu bir xil chizilgan qavat rejalari uchun ishlaydi (bir xil varaq oʻlchami va joylashuvi). Darajasi bor, lekin masshtabi yoʻq varaq chiqarib tashlanadi va izohda shunday deyiladi. Bir vaqtda bitta varaq uchun yana \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQavatlarga joylash\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Darajalar hajmlarni hisoblash bilan birga saqlanadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-ko-rinishni-rasm-sifatida-saqlash\"\u003E3D koʻrinishni rasm sifatida saqlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E3D panelida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang — ekrandagi koʻrinishning rasmi (\u003Ccode\u003E… 3D.png\u003C/code\u003E); \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPNG\u003C/span\u003E bosilsa, u ikki barobar katta boʻladi (\u003Ccode\u003E… 3D@2x.png\u003C/code\u003E), chop etish uchun.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-ko-rinishni-model-sifatida-saqlash\"\u003E3D koʻrinishni model sifatida saqlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E3D panelida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Koʻrinish koʻrsatgan narsaning — ekrandagi qavat yoki barcha joylangan qavatlarning — \u003Ccode\u003E.glb\u003C/code\u003E faylini (glTF, ikkilik) olasiz, uni boshqa 3D dasturlar ochadi: har bir belgi uchun bitta obyekt, elementi nomi bilan, elementning rangida, metrda, Y yuqoriga qaragan holda. Varaqning oʻzi va konturlar unda yoʻq.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-dan-belgini-tanlash\"\u003E3D dan belgini tanlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDevor, plita, plastina yoki ustunni bosing. Uning belgisi tanlangan belgiga aylanadi, xuddi uni varaqda bosgandek: u \u003Cstrong\u003ETanlangan belgi\u003C/strong\u003E ostida koʻrinadi, uning elementi joriy boʻladi va holat satrida uning uzunligi va balandligi, yoki maydoni, chuqurligi va kub yardlari beriladi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + bosish belgilarni tanlovga qoʻshadi yoki undan chiqaradi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tanlangan belgilarni oʻchiradi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ularni qaytaradi; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hech narsani tanlamaydi. Varaqqa qaytganda, xuddi shu belgilar tanlangan holda qoladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChizma mavzuga ergashadi: Model da yerdagi varaq tekis koʻrinish kabi qorongʻi boʻladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"3D koʻrinish bu ikkinchi chizma emas, tekshiruvdir: u varaqning hajmlarini oʻsha varaqning oʻzida ekranda tik turgʻizadi, shunda yoʻq devor, ikki marta chizilgan plita yoki adashgan sanash bir qarashda koʻrinadi. Boshlashdan oldin: varaqda masshtab boʻlishi kerak (Masshtabni belgilash). Balandlik va chuqurlik haqiqiy futlarda kerak, shuning uchun masshtabi boʻlmagan varaqda 3D buni aytadi va tekis varaqda qoladi. 3D koʻrinishni ochish Tekshirmoqchi boʻlgan varaqni koʻrsating. Varaq nomi va masshtabini koʻrsatadigan panelda 3D ni tanlang yoki 3 tugmasini bosing. Birinchi marta 3D koʻrinish yuklanishi uchun bir lahza kerak boʻladi. Varaq yer ustida chiziladi va hajmlarni hisoblash unda har bir elementning rangida turadi. Qaytish uchun yana 3D, Varaqqa qaytish ni tanlang yoki 3 tugmasini bosing. Chizish asbobini (Chiziqli, Maydon, Sanash va hokazo) tanlash ham qaytaradi, chunki belgilar tekis varaqda chiziladi. U ekranda varaqni koʻrsatadi; varaqlar roʻyxatida yoki Page Down va Page Up bilan varaqlarni almashtiring, 3D koʻrinish ularga ergashadi. Bir vaqtda bir necha qavatni koʻrish uchun ularni qavatlarga joylang (quyida). Nimani koʻrasiz Belgi 3D da Chiziqli chiziq, balandligi bor element Chiziq boʻylab shu balandlikdagi devor. Egri chiziqlar egri boʻylab boradi. Chiziqli chiziq, balandligi yoʻq element Varaqdagi chiziq. Uni tik turgʻizish uchun Element ostida elementga balandlik bering. Maydon, chuqurligi bor element Shu chuqurlikdagi plita, kesmalari ochiq holda. Maydon, chuqurligi yoʻq element Yupqa 2\" plastina, shunda u baribir koʻrinadi. Sanash Har bir sanalgan nuqtada kichik ustun. Balandlik chiziqli elementning Balandlik maydoni, chuqurlik esa maydonli elementning Chuqurlik maydoni boʻlib, Element ostida (Hajm elementlarini yaratish ga qarang). Uni oʻzgartiring, 3D koʻrinish darhol yangilanadi. Varaq nomi ostidagi izohda varaqda nima borligi aytiladi, masalan \"3D dagi bu varaq: 2 ta devor, 1 ta plita, 3 ta sanash\", hamda balandligi yoki chuqurligi boʻlmagan nechta chiziq yoki maydon borligi. Bosishlar uning orqali koʻrinishga oʻtadi. 3D da raqamlar oʻzgarmaydi: devorning maydoni uning aniq uzunligi koʻpaytirilgan balandligi, plitaning hajmi esa uning sof maydoni (kontur minus kesmalar, egri chiziqlar aniq) koʻpaytirilgan chuqurligi. Egri chiziqlar faqat ekranda qisqa toʻgʻri boʻlaklar bilan chiziladi. Atrofga qarash Harakat Nima qiladi Sudrash yoki oʻrta tugma bilan sudrash Hajmlarni hisoblash atrofida aylanish. Shift + sudrash yoki oʻng tugma bilan sudrash Surish. Sichqoncha gʻildiragi Kursor turgan joyda kattalashtirish va kichraytirish. Sensorli panelda ikki barmoq bilan surish Aylanish (Shift suradi). Chimdish kattalashtiradi. Iso, Yuqori, Old, Orqa, Chap, Oʻng, Pastki Standart koʻrinishlar, hajmlarni hisoblash boʻyicha kadrlangan. 3D koʻrinish Iso da ochiladi. Perspektiva Perspektiva yoqilgan yoki oʻchirilgan (oʻchirilganda parallel). Hammasini kattalashtirish yoki F Butun varaq. Varaq Yerdagi chizmani koʻrsatish yoki yashirish. Koʻrinish kubi, yuqori oʻngda Undan qarash uchun yuzi, qirrasi yoki burchagini bosing; aylantirish uchun uni sudrang; burish uchun kompas halqasini sudrang; uy tugmasi Iso ga qaytaradi. Burchakda koʻrinish kubi, kichik X, Y, Z oʻqlari belgisi yoki hech narsa koʻrinadi: buni Sozlamalar da, TakeoffDesk yorligʻida, Burchak koʻrsatkichi ostida tanlang (TakeoffDesk sozlamalari). Tekis varaqda burchak koʻrsatkichi yoʻq. Bir barmoq aylantiradi; ikki barmoq chimdib kattalashtiradi va surish uchun siljiydi. Bir marta bosish tanlaydi. Qalinligi, asosi va teshiklari bor devorlar Balandligi bor chiziqli element yupqa lenta sifatida turadi. Uni haqiqiy devor sifatida koʻrish uchun elementga sozlamalarida 3D da ostida shakl bering: Devor qalinligi (8\", 0.2 m): devor chizgan chiziqingiz markazida joylashgan qattiq jismga aylanadi, burchaklari qiyshiq kesilgan holda. Asos balandligi: devor poldan shuncha yuqoridan boshlanadi (soffit, yuqori shkaf qatori). Maydon elementlarida ham bor: 9'-0\" balandlikdagi plafon. Teshik tepasi: ayirilgan kesma (eshik, Chiziq qismini ayirish) devorni shu balandlikdan yuqorida saqlaydi, shunda eshik eshik sifatida koʻrinadi. Uning yoʻqligida ayirilgan kesma tepagacha boʻshliq qoldiradi. Bular faqat 3D koʻrinishni shakllantiradi: miqdorlar (uzunlik, devor maydoni, xarajatlar) oʻzgarishsiz qoladi. Qavatlarni joylash Har bir qavatning PDF fayllarini oching. 3D koʻrinishda Darajalar… ni tanlang va har bir qavatning balandligini kiriting, masalan 0 birinchi qavat uchun va keyingisi uchun 12'. Boʻsh qoldirilsa, varaq chiqarib tashlanadi. Qavatlarga joylash ni tanlang. Darajasi bor har bir varaq oʻz hajmlarini oʻz balandligida koʻrsatadi; ekrandagi varaq oʻz qavati ostida yotadi, boshqalari konturlar bilan koʻrsatiladi. Izohda nechta qavat joylanganligi aytiladi. Varaqlar sahifadagi oʻrni boʻyicha tekislanadi, shuning uchun bu bir xil chizilgan qavat rejalari uchun ishlaydi (bir xil varaq oʻlchami va joylashuvi). Darajasi bor, lekin masshtabi yoʻq varaq chiqarib tashlanadi va izohda shunday deyiladi. Bir vaqtda bitta varaq uchun yana Qavatlarga joylash ni tanlang. Darajalar hajmlarni hisoblash bilan birga saqlanadi. 3D koʻrinishni rasm sifatida saqlash 3D panelida PNG ni tanlang — ekrandagi koʻrinishning rasmi (… 3D.png); Shift + PNG bosilsa, u ikki barobar katta boʻladi (… 3D@2x.png), chop etish uchun. 3D koʻrinishni model sifatida saqlash 3D panelida GLB ni tanlang. Koʻrinish koʻrsatgan narsaning — ekrandagi qavat yoki barcha joylangan qavatlarning — .glb faylini (glTF, ikkilik) olasiz, uni boshqa 3D dasturlar ochadi: har bir belgi uchun bitta obyekt, elementi nomi bilan, elementning rangida, metrda, Y yuqoriga qaragan holda. Varaqning oʻzi va konturlar unda yoʻq. 3D dan belgini tanlash Devor, plita, plastina yoki ustunni bosing. Uning belgisi tanlangan belgiga aylanadi, xuddi uni varaqda bosgandek: u Tanlangan belgi ostida koʻrinadi, uning elementi joriy boʻladi va holat satrida uning uzunligi va balandligi, yoki maydoni, chuqurligi va kub yardlari beriladi. Shift + bosish belgilarni tanlovga qoʻshadi yoki undan chiqaradi. Delete tanlangan belgilarni oʻchiradi, Ctrl+Z ularni qaytaradi; Esc hech narsani tanlamaydi. Varaqqa qaytganda, xuddi shu belgilar tanlangan holda qoladi. Chizma mavzuga ergashadi: Model da yerdagi varaq tekis koʻrinish kabi qorongʻi boʻladi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"markups","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Izohlar, bulutlar va ajratmalar","summary":"Varaqlardagi savollar va oʻzgarishlarni izohlar, qayta koʻrib chiqish bulutlari va ajratmalar bilan belgilang, ularning har birini ochiq, javob berilgan yoki yopiq deb kuzating va belgilangan PDF da yuboring.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["belgilash","belgilashlar","izoh","sharh","savol","rfi","bulut","qayta koʻrib chiqish buluti","ajratma","holat","ochiq","javob berilgan","yopiq","koʻrib chiqish","belgilashlar roʻyxati"],"headings":[{"id":"yangisini-qo-shish","text":"Yangisini qoʻshish","level":2},{"id":"holat-va-tahrirlash","text":"Holat va tahrirlash","level":2},{"id":"ro-yxat","text":"Roʻyxat","level":2},{"id":"ulashish","text":"Ulashish","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EBelgilashlar hajmlarni hisoblash paytida eslab qolish yoki soʻrash kerak boʻlgan narsalar uchun: &quot;poydevor turini tasdiqlang&quot;, oʻzgargan devor atrofidagi qayta koʻrib chiqish buluti, rejadagi ajratilgan izoh. Ular varaqda holat bilan turadi, bir joyda roʻyxatga olinadi va belgilangan PDF da chop etiladi. Ular \u003Cstrong\u003Ehech qachon hisobga olinmaydi\u003C/strong\u003E: miqdor ham, narx ham yoʻq.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yangisini-qo-shish\"\u003EYangisini qoʻshish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVaraq ustidagi panelda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkup\u003C/span\u003E ni oching va tanlang:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBelgilash\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQanday\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENote\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayerga borishini bosing, izohni yozing, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. U yuqorida birinchi qatori yonida yumaloq pin sifatida koʻrinadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECloud\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBir burchakni, soʻng qarama-qarshi burchakni bosing va izoh yozing (yoki boʻsh qoldiring). Qutining atrofida tishli qayta koʻrib chiqish buluti chiziladi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHighlight\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkki burchakni bosing: shaffof sariq quti, xohlasangiz izoh bilan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBirinchi burchakdan keyin \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bekor qiladi. Asbob keyingisi uchun yoqilgan qoladi; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E ga qaytaradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"holat-va-tahrirlash\"\u003EHolat va tahrirlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBelgilashni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E bilan bosib tanlang. Oʻng panelda \u003Cstrong\u003EBelgilash\u003C/strong\u003E koʻrinadi: uning turi va varaqi, \u003Cstrong\u003EHolat\u003C/strong\u003E — Ochiq, Javob berilgan yoki Yopiq — hamda matni, uni oʻzgartirish mumkin. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E) uni olib tashlaydi; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uni qaytaradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzoh pinining rangi ochiq boʻlganda toʻq sariq, javob berilgach koʻk, yopilganda kulrang boʻladi; yopilgan bulut kulrang boʻladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ro-yxat\"\u003ERoʻyxat\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOʻng paneldagi \u003Cstrong\u003EBelgilashlar\u003C/strong\u003E hajmlar hisobining har bir belgilashini holati bilan sanab chiqadi va nechtasi hali ochiqligini koʻrsatadi. Faqat hal etilmaganlarni koʻrish uchun \u003Cstrong\u003EFaqat ochiqlari\u003C/strong\u003E ni belgilang. Qatorni bosing: u oʻsha belgilash turgan varaqqa oʻtadi va uni tanlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ulashish\"\u003EUlashish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E ularni sahifalarda chizadi: ajratmalar, bulutlar va pinlar, har biri holatini bosh harflarda (OCHIQ, JAVOB BERILGAN, YOPIQ) va matnini koʻrsatuvchi quti bilan. Belgilashlari bor, lekin hajm belgilari boʻlmagan sahifa ham kiritiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E \u003Cstrong\u003EBelgilashlar\u003C/strong\u003E varaqini qoʻshadi: varaq, tur, holat va matn, har biri bir qatorda.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUlar \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E faylida va \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\"\u003Eichida hajm boʻlgan PDF\u003C/a\u003E da saqlanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Belgilashlar hajmlarni hisoblash paytida eslab qolish yoki soʻrash kerak boʻlgan narsalar uchun: \"poydevor turini tasdiqlang\", oʻzgargan devor atrofidagi qayta koʻrib chiqish buluti, rejadagi ajratilgan izoh. Ular varaqda holat bilan turadi, bir joyda roʻyxatga olinadi va belgilangan PDF da chop etiladi. Ular hech qachon hisobga olinmaydi: miqdor ham, narx ham yoʻq. Yangisini qoʻshish Varaq ustidagi panelda Markup ni oching va tanlang: Belgilash Qanday Note Qayerga borishini bosing, izohni yozing, Add ni tanlang. U yuqorida birinchi qatori yonida yumaloq pin sifatida koʻrinadi. Cloud Bir burchakni, soʻng qarama-qarshi burchakni bosing va izoh yozing (yoki boʻsh qoldiring). Qutining atrofida tishli qayta koʻrib chiqish buluti chiziladi. Highlight Ikki burchakni bosing: shaffof sariq quti, xohlasangiz izoh bilan. Birinchi burchakdan keyin Esc bekor qiladi. Asbob keyingisi uchun yoqilgan qoladi; V Select ga qaytaradi. Holat va tahrirlash Belgilashni Select bilan bosib tanlang. Oʻng panelda Belgilash koʻrinadi: uning turi va varaqi, Holat — Ochiq, Javob berilgan yoki Yopiq — hamda matni, uni oʻzgartirish mumkin. Delete (yoki Delete) uni olib tashlaydi; Ctrl+Z uni qaytaradi. Izoh pinining rangi ochiq boʻlganda toʻq sariq, javob berilgach koʻk, yopilganda kulrang boʻladi; yopilgan bulut kulrang boʻladi. Roʻyxat Oʻng paneldagi Belgilashlar hajmlar hisobining har bir belgilashini holati bilan sanab chiqadi va nechtasi hali ochiqligini koʻrsatadi. Faqat hal etilmaganlarni koʻrish uchun Faqat ochiqlari ni belgilang. Qatorni bosing: u oʻsha belgilash turgan varaqqa oʻtadi va uni tanlaydi. Ulashish Marked PDF ularni sahifalarda chizadi: ajratmalar, bulutlar va pinlar, har biri holatini bosh harflarda (OCHIQ, JAVOB BERILGAN, YOPIQ) va matnini koʻrsatuvchi quti bilan. Belgilashlari bor, lekin hajm belgilari boʻlmagan sahifa ham kiritiladi. XLSX Belgilashlar varaqini qoʻshadi: varaq, tur, holat va matn, har biri bir qatorda. Ular .takeoff.json faylida va ichida hajm boʻlgan PDF da saqlanadi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"export-estimate","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Smetani va belgilangan PDF ni eksport qilish","summary":"Smetani jonli formulalari bilan XLSX ish kitobi yoki CSV sifatida hamda PDF fayllaringizning hajmlar chizilgan nusxalarini yuklab oling.","section":"tasks","order":100,"keywords":["taklif","taklif xulosasi","eksport","xlsx","elektron jadval","ish kitobi","csv","belgilangan pdf","hajmlarni chop etish","hisobot","ulashish","yuborish","legenda"],"headings":[{"id":"smeta-elektron-jadval-sifatida-xlsx","text":"Smeta elektron jadval sifatida (XLSX)","level":2},{"id":"smeta-csv-sifatida","text":"Smeta CSV sifatida","level":2},{"id":"smeta-google-sheets-da","text":"Smeta Google Sheets da","level":2},{"id":"yetishmayotgan-stavkalar-va-tasdiqlash","text":"Yetishmayotgan stavkalar va tasdiqlash","level":2},{"id":"belgilangan-pdf","text":"Belgilangan PDF","level":2},{"id":"eksport-qilinadigan-narsa-yo-qmi","text":"Eksport qilinadigan narsa yoʻqmi?","level":2},{"id":"hajmlarni-ham-saqlang","text":"Hajmlarni ham saqlang","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEksportlar yuklab olishlardir. Ular hajmlar va ochiq PDF lardan kompyuteringizda tayyorlanadi; hech narsa hech qayerga yuborilmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"smeta-elektron-jadval-sifatida-xlsx\"\u003ESmeta elektron jadval sifatida (XLSX)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAsboblar panelidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E menyusini oching va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Brauzeringiz \u003Ccode\u003E(name).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E ni yuklab oladi. Holat satrida &quot;Eksport qilindi: (name).xlsx (jonli formulali smeta, varaq boʻyicha, belgilar, masshtablar).&quot; deb yoziladi va smeta toʻliq boʻlmasa ogohlantirish qoʻshiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUni elektron jadval dasturida oching.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsh kitobida toʻrtta varaq bor va quyidagi hisobotlar tegishli boʻlganda qoʻshiladi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVaraq\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENimani saqlaydi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEstimate\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHar bir element va komponent uchun qator: miqdor, chiqindi, chiqindili miqdor, stavkalar, material, mehnat, jami, izohlar. Pastda umumiy jami.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBy sheet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHar bir elementning har bir varagʻidagi miqdori, belgilar soni bilan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarks\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHar bir belgi: varaq, element, turi, miqdori va tafsilot (segment uzunliklari, yalpi va kesik maydonlar, perimetr).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EScales\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasshtabi yoki belgilari bor har bir varaq: masshtabi, qanday oʻrnatilgani (preset yoki qaysi masofada kalibrlangani) va PDF birligiga fut.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoff summary\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHar bir elementning miqdori, CSI raqami, belgilari va varaqlari, narxlarsiz.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial list\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHajmlar boʻyicha har bir yigʻma qismi jamlangan (bir nechta elementda ishlatilgan bir xil qism bitta qator), chiqindi va material narxi hamda uni ishlatadigan elementlar bilan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuote request\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYetkazib beruvchiga yuboriladigan material roʻyxati: chiqindili miqdorlar, boʻsh birlik narxi ustuni, narxlar kiritilganda toʻladigan hisoblar va jami.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBy division\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECSI MasterFormat boʻlimlari boʻyicha material, mehnat va jami, elementlarda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSI number\u003C/span\u003E boʻlganda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-summary\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-summary\"\u003ETaklif xulosasi\u003C/a\u003E bilan Estimate varagʻi ham oʻz belgilashlari (mehnat yuki, savdo soligʻi, umumiy xarajatlar, foyda, kafolat va taklif) bilan tugaydi, jonli formulalar sifatida.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEstimate varagʻi \u003Cstrong\u003Ejonli formulalarni\u003C/strong\u003E saqlaydi: chiqindili miqdor, yaxlitlangan material va mehnat summalari, har bir qatorning jami va umumiy jami. Elektron jadval dasturlari ularni qayta hisoblaydi, shuning uchun elektron jadvalda stavka yoki chiqindini oʻzgartirsangiz, jamilar oʻzgaradi. TakeoffDesk hisoblagan raqamlar ham katakchalarda saqlanadi va sentgacha mos keladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzohlar ustunida har bir komponentning formulasi, formula xatolari, masshtabsiz varaqdagi belgilar, devor maydoni va perimetr koʻrsatiladi. Biror narsa chiqarib tashlangan boʻlsa, umumiy jami qatorida &quot;Incomplete: see the notes above&quot; (Toʻliq emas: yuqoridagi izohlarga qarang) yoziladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsh kitobi LibreOffice Calc da tekshirilgan, u bir xil jamilarni qayta hisoblagan. U hali Excel da ochilmagan. Ustun boʻyicha batafsil maʼlumot: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-columns\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-columns\"\u003EEksport ustunlari\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"smeta-csv-sifatida\"\u003ESmeta CSV sifatida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E menyusini oching va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Siz \u003Ccode\u003E(name).csv\u003C/code\u003E ni olasiz: Estimate varagʻidagi bir xil qatorlar va ustunlar, oddiy qiymatlar sifatida (formulasiz), hamda umumiy jami. Uni boshqa smeta yoki buxgalteriya tizimiga joylashtirish uchun ishlating.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBu CSV faqat smetani oʻz ichiga oladi; varaq boʻyicha miqdorlar va belgilar roʻyxati uchun XLSX dan foydalaning. Xuddi shu menyudagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMaterial list\u003C/span\u003E faqat material roʻyxatini buyurtma uchun CSV sifatida saqlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"smeta-google-sheets-da\"\u003ESmeta Google Sheets da\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiqdorlar jadvali ustidagi \u003Cstrong\u003EGoogle Sheets uchun nusxalash\u003C/strong\u003E smetani tab bilan ajratilgan matn sifatida buferga qoʻyadi, CSV bilan bir xil qatorlarda. Google Sheet da A1 katakchasini bosing va qoʻying. TakeoffDesk Google ga kirmaydi va u yerga hech narsa yubormaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yetishmayotgan-stavkalar-va-tasdiqlash\"\u003EYetishmayotgan stavkalar va tasdiqlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMiqdori bor, lekin stavkasi yoʻq qator izohida \u003Cstrong\u003EStavka yoʻq\u003C/strong\u003E deb yoziladi, eksport ularni jamlarda hisobga oladi. Smeta tasdiqlangan boʻlsa, eksport kim, qachon va qaysi jami uchun tasdiqlaganini koʻrsatadi. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/sign-off-the-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/sign-off-the-estimate\"\u003EYetishmayotgan stavkalar va smetani tasdiqlash\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"belgilangan-pdf\"\u003EBelgilangan PDF\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChizilishi kerak boʻlgan belgilari bor PDF larni oching.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E menyusini oching va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. &quot;Belgilangan PDF yozilmoqda…&quot; koʻrinadi, soʻngra brauzeringiz har bir belgilangan PDF uchun bitta faylni yuklab oladi, \u003Ccode\u003E(PDF name) (takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E nomi bilan.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENusxada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Euchastkalar elementning rangidagi chiziqlar sifatida chiziladi,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Emaydonlar yengil toʻldirilgan va qattiq kontur bilan, kesiklar ochiq qoldirilgan,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esanashlar nuqtalar boʻladi,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ebelgilari bor har bir sahifada pastki chap burchagida kichik legenda boʻladi: shu sahifadagi har bir elementning rangi, nomi va miqdori.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAsl PDF lar oʻzgarmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIzohlar:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaqat ochiq PDF lar yoziladi. Ochiq boʻlmagan PDF lardagi belgilar jamlarda qoladi, lekin chizilmaydi; avval ularni oching.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELegenda nomlari standart PDF shriftidan foydalanadi. Koʻrsata olmaydigan harflar &quot;?&quot; bilan chop etiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EShifrlangan PDF ni belgilar bilan nusxalab boʻlmaydi: &quot;Bu PDF parol bilan himoyalangan yoki shifrlangan, shuning uchun belgilangan nusxa yozib boʻlmaydi. Hajmlarning oʻzi yaxshi; buning oʻrniga elektron jadvalni eksport qiling.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYorliqdagi birinchi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E PDF yozuvchisini yuklaydi. Oflaynda u faqat ilova panelida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOffline ready\u003C/span\u003E koʻrinsa mavjud boʻladi; qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EOflaynda ishlash\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBir nechta belgilangan PDF bilan Chrome va Edge bir marta soʻrashi mumkin, bu sayt bir nechta fayl yuklab olishi mumkinmi. Ruxsat berish ni tanlang, aks holda faqat birinchi fayl olinadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eksport-qilinadigan-narsa-yo-qmi\"\u003EEksport qilinadigan narsa yoʻqmi?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E kamida bitta elementni talab qiladi: &quot;Eksport uchun hali hech narsa yoʻq: element yarating va uni oʻlchang.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E ochiq PDF da belgilarni talab qiladi: &quot;Ochiq PDF larda hali belgilar yoʻq.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hajmlarni-ham-saqlang\"\u003EHajmlarni ham saqlang\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEksport bu hisobot. Hajmlar ustida keyinroq ishlashni davom ettirish uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E ni ham tanlang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003EHajmlarni saqlash va qayta ochish\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoʻshimcha xarajatlar, foyda, soliq va kafolat qoʻshish hamda taklif yuborish uchun \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-summary\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-summary\"\u003ETaklif xulosasi va taklif\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Eksportlar yuklab olishlardir. Ular hajmlar va ochiq PDF lardan kompyuteringizda tayyorlanadi; hech narsa hech qayerga yuborilmaydi. Smeta elektron jadval sifatida (XLSX) Asboblar panelidagi Export menyusini oching va XLSX ni tanlang. Brauzeringiz (name).xlsx ni yuklab oladi. Holat satrida \"Eksport qilindi: (name).xlsx (jonli formulali smeta, varaq boʻyicha, belgilar, masshtablar).\" deb yoziladi va smeta toʻliq boʻlmasa ogohlantirish qoʻshiladi. Uni elektron jadval dasturida oching. Ish kitobida toʻrtta varaq bor va quyidagi hisobotlar tegishli boʻlganda qoʻshiladi: Varaq Nimani saqlaydi Estimate Har bir element va komponent uchun qator: miqdor, chiqindi, chiqindili miqdor, stavkalar, material, mehnat, jami, izohlar. Pastda umumiy jami. By sheet Har bir elementning har bir varagʻidagi miqdori, belgilar soni bilan. Marks Har bir belgi: varaq, element, turi, miqdori va tafsilot (segment uzunliklari, yalpi va kesik maydonlar, perimetr). Scales Masshtabi yoki belgilari bor har bir varaq: masshtabi, qanday oʻrnatilgani (preset yoki qaysi masofada kalibrlangani) va PDF birligiga fut. Takeoff summary Har bir elementning miqdori, CSI raqami, belgilari va varaqlari, narxlarsiz. Material list Hajmlar boʻyicha har bir yigʻma qismi jamlangan (bir nechta elementda ishlatilgan bir xil qism bitta qator), chiqindi va material narxi hamda uni ishlatadigan elementlar bilan. Quote request Yetkazib beruvchiga yuboriladigan material roʻyxati: chiqindili miqdorlar, boʻsh birlik narxi ustuni, narxlar kiritilganda toʻladigan hisoblar va jami. By division CSI MasterFormat boʻlimlari boʻyicha material, mehnat va jami, elementlarda CSI number boʻlganda. Taklif xulosasi bilan Estimate varagʻi ham oʻz belgilashlari (mehnat yuki, savdo soligʻi, umumiy xarajatlar, foyda, kafolat va taklif) bilan tugaydi, jonli formulalar sifatida. Estimate varagʻi jonli formulalarni saqlaydi: chiqindili miqdor, yaxlitlangan material va mehnat summalari, har bir qatorning jami va umumiy jami. Elektron jadval dasturlari ularni qayta hisoblaydi, shuning uchun elektron jadvalda stavka yoki chiqindini oʻzgartirsangiz, jamilar oʻzgaradi. TakeoffDesk hisoblagan raqamlar ham katakchalarda saqlanadi va sentgacha mos keladi. Izohlar ustunida har bir komponentning formulasi, formula xatolari, masshtabsiz varaqdagi belgilar, devor maydoni va perimetr koʻrsatiladi. Biror narsa chiqarib tashlangan boʻlsa, umumiy jami qatorida \"Incomplete: see the notes above\" (Toʻliq emas: yuqoridagi izohlarga qarang) yoziladi. Ish kitobi LibreOffice Calc da tekshirilgan, u bir xil jamilarni qayta hisoblagan. U hali Excel da ochilmagan. Ustun boʻyicha batafsil maʼlumot: Eksport ustunlari. Smeta CSV sifatida Export menyusini oching va CSV ni tanlang. Siz (name).csv ni olasiz: Estimate varagʻidagi bir xil qatorlar va ustunlar, oddiy qiymatlar sifatida (formulasiz), hamda umumiy jami. Uni boshqa smeta yoki buxgalteriya tizimiga joylashtirish uchun ishlating. Bu CSV faqat smetani oʻz ichiga oladi; varaq boʻyicha miqdorlar va belgilar roʻyxati uchun XLSX dan foydalaning. Xuddi shu menyudagi Material list faqat material roʻyxatini buyurtma uchun CSV sifatida saqlaydi. Smeta Google Sheets da Miqdorlar jadvali ustidagi Google Sheets uchun nusxalash smetani tab bilan ajratilgan matn sifatida buferga qoʻyadi, CSV bilan bir xil qatorlarda. Google Sheet da A1 katakchasini bosing va qoʻying. TakeoffDesk Google ga kirmaydi va u yerga hech narsa yubormaydi. Yetishmayotgan stavkalar va tasdiqlash Miqdori bor, lekin stavkasi yoʻq qator izohida Stavka yoʻq deb yoziladi, eksport ularni jamlarda hisobga oladi. Smeta tasdiqlangan boʻlsa, eksport kim, qachon va qaysi jami uchun tasdiqlaganini koʻrsatadi. Qarang: Yetishmayotgan stavkalar va smetani tasdiqlash. Belgilangan PDF Chizilishi kerak boʻlgan belgilari bor PDF larni oching. Export menyusini oching va Marked PDF ni tanlang. \"Belgilangan PDF yozilmoqda…\" koʻrinadi, soʻngra brauzeringiz har bir belgilangan PDF uchun bitta faylni yuklab oladi, (PDF name) (takeoff).pdf nomi bilan. Nusxada: uchastkalar elementning rangidagi chiziqlar sifatida chiziladi, maydonlar yengil toʻldirilgan va qattiq kontur bilan, kesiklar ochiq qoldirilgan, sanashlar nuqtalar boʻladi, belgilari bor har bir sahifada pastki chap burchagida kichik legenda boʻladi: shu sahifadagi har bir elementning rangi, nomi va miqdori. Asl PDF lar oʻzgarmaydi. Izohlar: Faqat ochiq PDF lar yoziladi. Ochiq boʻlmagan PDF lardagi belgilar jamlarda qoladi, lekin chizilmaydi; avval ularni oching. Legenda nomlari standart PDF shriftidan foydalanadi. Koʻrsata olmaydigan harflar \"?\" bilan chop etiladi. Shifrlangan PDF ni belgilar bilan nusxalab boʻlmaydi: \"Bu PDF parol bilan himoyalangan yoki shifrlangan, shuning uchun belgilangan nusxa yozib boʻlmaydi. Hajmlarning oʻzi yaxshi; buning oʻrniga elektron jadvalni eksport qiling.\" Yorliqdagi birinchi Marked PDF PDF yozuvchisini yuklaydi. Oflaynda u faqat ilova panelida Offline ready koʻrinsa mavjud boʻladi; qarang: Oflaynda ishlash. Bir nechta belgilangan PDF bilan Chrome va Edge bir marta soʻrashi mumkin, bu sayt bir nechta fayl yuklab olishi mumkinmi. Ruxsat berish ni tanlang, aks holda faqat birinchi fayl olinadi. Eksport qilinadigan narsa yoʻqmi? XLSX va CSV kamida bitta elementni talab qiladi: \"Eksport uchun hali hech narsa yoʻq: element yarating va uni oʻlchang.\" Marked PDF ochiq PDF da belgilarni talab qiladi: \"Ochiq PDF larda hali belgilar yoʻq.\" Hajmlarni ham saqlang Eksport bu hisobot. Hajmlar ustida keyinroq ishlashni davom ettirish uchun Save takeoff ni ham tanlang: Hajmlarni saqlash va qayta ochish ga qarang. Qoʻshimcha xarajatlar, foyda, soliq va kafolat qoʻshish hamda taklif yuborish uchun Taklif xulosasi va taklif ga qarang.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"bid-summary","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Taklif xulosasi va tijorat taklifi","summary":"Smetaga ish haqi yukini, savdo soligʻini, umumiy xarajatlarni, foydani va kafolatni qoʻshing, kiritilganlar va chiqarilganlarni yozing va yuborish uchun taklif PDF ni yuklab oling.","section":"tasks","order":101,"keywords":["taklif","ish haqi yuki","yuk","ish haqi fondi","tijorat taklifi","narx taklifi","umumiy xarajatlar","foyda","belgilash","marja","savdo soligʻi","kafolat","kiritilganlar","chiqarilganlar","shartlar","imzo","mijoz","narx"],"headings":[{"id":"belgilashlar","text":"Belgilashlar","level":2},{"id":"tijorat-taklifi","text":"Tijorat taklifi","level":2},{"id":"eksportda","text":"Eksportda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESmeta hajmlarni hisoblaganingizni narxlaydi. \u003Cstrong\u003ETaklif xulosasi\u003C/strong\u003E uni narxga aylantiradi: savdo soligʻi, umumiy xarajatlar, foyda va kafolatni qoʻshadi hamda kiritilgan va chiqarilgan shartlaringiz bilan \u003Cstrong\u003Etaklif PDF\u003C/strong\u003E yaratadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEksport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETaklif xulosasi va taklif…\u003C/span\u003E dan oching. Hammasi hajmlarni hisoblash bilan birga saqlanadi va har bir oʻzgarishni bekor qilish mumkin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"belgilashlar\"\u003EBelgilashlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBeshtasidan istalganiga foizni kiriting (qolganlarini 0 da qoldiring). Ular shu tartibda hisoblanadi, har biri undan yuqoridagi narsaga asoslanadi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQator\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQanday hisoblanadi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial, Ish haqi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESmetaning jamilari (hajmlarda \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/bid-areas#alternates-base-bid-plus-adds-and-deducts\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/bid-areas\" data-hash=\"alternates-base-bid-plus-adds-and-deducts\"\u003Emuqobillar\u003C/a\u003E boʻlsa, asosiy taklif).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIsh haqi yuki\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYuk % × ish haqi: ishchi kuchingizning ish haqiga soliqlar, sugʻurta va imtiyozlar.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EXarajat\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial + ish haqi + ish haqi yuki.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterialga savdo soligʻi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESoliq % × material.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmumiy xarajatlar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmumiy xarajatlar % × (xarajat + soliq).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFoyda\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFoyda % × (xarajat + soliq + umumiy xarajatlar).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKafolat\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKafolat % × yuqoridagi hamma narsa.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETaklif\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQatorlar yigʻindisi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir qator tiyingacha yaxlitlanadi. Ish kitobi xuddi shu qatorlarni Smeta varagining jami ostida jonli formulalar bilan koʻrsatadi. Xulosa yozish davomida yangilanadi: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E foizni qabul qiladi. Har bir muqobil oʻz xarajatida xuddi shu belgilashlar bilan koʻrsatiladi, shunda buyurtmachi uni olib tashlash haqiqatda nimani oʻzgartirishini koʻradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tijorat-taklifi\"\u003ETijorat taklifi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETaklif nima deyishi kerakligini toʻldiring:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELoyiha\u003C/strong\u003E (boʻsh boʻlsa, hajmlarni hisoblash nomi), \u003Cstrong\u003EKimga\u003C/strong\u003E (mijoz) va \u003Cstrong\u003EKimdan\u003C/strong\u003E (sizning kompaniyangiz).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKiritilganlar\u003C/strong\u003E va \u003Cstrong\u003EChiqarilganlar\u003C/strong\u003E: har qatorga bittadan; boshidagi chiziqcha yoki belgi ham boʻladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShartlar\u003C/strong\u003E: erkin matn, masalan &quot;30 kun davomida amal qiladi.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EElementlar va miqdorlarni roʻyxatga kiritish\u003C/strong\u003E: doira, element-element, miqdorlar bilan va narxlarsiz. Yaxlit summali taklif uchun belgini olib tashlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETaklif PDF\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. PDF (\u003Ccode\u003E&lt;takeoff&gt; - proposal.pdf\u003C/code\u003E) da sana, har bir belgilash va taklif bilan narx bloki, muqobillar, doira, kiritilganlar va chiqarilganlar, shartlar hamda imzo va sana qoʻyiladigan qatorlar boʻladi. Agar ayrim miqdorlarni oʻlchab boʻlmasa (masshtabsiz varaq), bu narx ostida aytiladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eksportda\"\u003EEksportda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHajmlarni hisoblashda taklif xulosasi paydo boʻlgach, CSV uning bilan tugaydi va ish kitobiga \u003Cstrong\u003ETaklif xulosasi\u003C/strong\u003E varagi qoʻshiladi: har bir qator, uning foizi va summasi bilan. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003ESmetani eksport qilish\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Smeta hajmlarni hisoblaganingizni narxlaydi. Taklif xulosasi uni narxga aylantiradi: savdo soligʻi, umumiy xarajatlar, foyda va kafolatni qoʻshadi hamda kiritilgan va chiqarilgan shartlaringiz bilan taklif PDF yaratadi. Uni Eksport › Taklif xulosasi va taklif… dan oching. Hammasi hajmlarni hisoblash bilan birga saqlanadi va har bir oʻzgarishni bekor qilish mumkin. Belgilashlar Beshtasidan istalganiga foizni kiriting (qolganlarini 0 da qoldiring). Ular shu tartibda hisoblanadi, har biri undan yuqoridagi narsaga asoslanadi: Qator Qanday hisoblanadi Material, Ish haqi Smetaning jamilari (hajmlarda muqobillar boʻlsa, asosiy taklif). Ish haqi yuki Yuk % × ish haqi: ishchi kuchingizning ish haqiga soliqlar, sugʻurta va imtiyozlar. Xarajat Material + ish haqi + ish haqi yuki. Materialga savdo soligʻi Soliq % × material. Umumiy xarajatlar Umumiy xarajatlar % × (xarajat + soliq). Foyda Foyda % × (xarajat + soliq + umumiy xarajatlar). Kafolat Kafolat % × yuqoridagi hamma narsa. Taklif Qatorlar yigʻindisi. Har bir qator tiyingacha yaxlitlanadi. Ish kitobi xuddi shu qatorlarni Smeta varagining jami ostida jonli formulalar bilan koʻrsatadi. Xulosa yozish davomida yangilanadi: Enter foizni qabul qiladi. Har bir muqobil oʻz xarajatida xuddi shu belgilashlar bilan koʻrsatiladi, shunda buyurtmachi uni olib tashlash haqiqatda nimani oʻzgartirishini koʻradi. Tijorat taklifi Taklif nima deyishi kerakligini toʻldiring: Loyiha (boʻsh boʻlsa, hajmlarni hisoblash nomi), Kimga (mijoz) va Kimdan (sizning kompaniyangiz). Kiritilganlar va Chiqarilganlar: har qatorga bittadan; boshidagi chiziqcha yoki belgi ham boʻladi. Shartlar: erkin matn, masalan \"30 kun davomida amal qiladi.\" Elementlar va miqdorlarni roʻyxatga kiritish: doira, element-element, miqdorlar bilan va narxlarsiz. Yaxlit summali taklif uchun belgini olib tashlang. Taklif PDF ni tanlang. PDF (\u003Ctakeoff\u003E - proposal.pdf) da sana, har bir belgilash va taklif bilan narx bloki, muqobillar, doira, kiritilganlar va chiqarilganlar, shartlar hamda imzo va sana qoʻyiladigan qatorlar boʻladi. Agar ayrim miqdorlarni oʻlchab boʻlmasa (masshtabsiz varaq), bu narx ostida aytiladi. Eksportda Hajmlarni hisoblashda taklif xulosasi paydo boʻlgach, CSV uning bilan tugaydi va ish kitobiga Taklif xulosasi varagi qoʻshiladi: har bir qator, uning foizi va summasi bilan. Qarang: Smetani eksport qilish.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"bid-leveling","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Bid packages and bid leveling","summary":"Split the estimate into packages by trade, send each package's scope to subcontractors, compare the bids that come back on the same scope, and use the chosen bid as the package's price.","section":"tasks","order":102,"keywords":["bid leveling","leveling","bid package","subcontractor","sub bid","scope","plug","trade","csi division","compare bids","low bid","bid tab","bidder","award","chosen bid","use a bid","subcontract price"],"headings":[{"id":"packages","text":"Packages","level":2},{"id":"enter-the-bids","text":"Enter the bids","level":2},{"id":"how-the-bids-are-leveled","text":"How the bids are leveled","level":2},{"id":"use-a-bid-as-the-package-s-price","text":"Use a bid as the package's price","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EA general contractor sends each trade&#039;s scope to subcontractors and compares what comes back. TakeoffDesk does both from the takeoff: open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBid packages and leveling…\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"packages\"\u003EPackages\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere is one package for each CSI division your items use (the first two digits of an item&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSI number\u003C/span\u003E, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\"\u003ECreate takeoff items\u003C/a\u003E). Items without a number make a package of their own. Each package shows its items, how many sheets their marks are on, and our own cost of it (material and labor before markups, from the base bid).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScope CSV\u003C/span\u003E to download what to send a subcontractor: each item with its CSI number, quantity, unit and the sheets it is on. It has no prices. For material suppliers, the workbook&#039;s quote request has the parts list (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/export-estimate\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/export-estimate\"\u003EExport the estimate\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"enter-the-bids\"\u003EEnter the bids\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the empty row under the package, type the bidder&#039;s name and the amount of the bid, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the bid\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf a bid leaves part of the scope out, open its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeft out\u003C/span\u003E list and tick those items.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETo correct a name or an amount, type over it in the table; the × button removes a bid.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach change is one step that \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E takes back, and the bids are saved with the takeoff.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-the-bids-are-leveled\"\u003EHow the bids are leveled\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBids rarely cover the same scope. Leveling fills each left-out item with a \u003Cstrong\u003Eplug\u003C/strong\u003E at our own cost of it, so every bid is compared on the whole package:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELeveled = the bid + the plugs\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe lowest leveled bid is marked \u003Cstrong\u003ELow\u003C/strong\u003E; on a tie, the one entered first. \u003Cstrong\u003EAgainst our cost\u003C/strong\u003E is the leveled bid minus our own cost of the package: negative means under it. A bid that looks lowest can lose once its missing scope is counted.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe workbook gets a \u003Cstrong\u003EBid leveling\u003C/strong\u003E sheet with every package that has bids: our estimate, each bid, its plugs, the leveled total and the difference, as live formulas, and what each bid left out.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"use-a-bid-as-the-package-s-price\"\u003EUse a bid as the package&#039;s price\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse\u003C/span\u003E on a bid and it becomes the price of the whole package in your estimate: the package&#039;s own pricing (the items, their second conditions and assembly parts) drops out of the job total, the items stay as quantities with your own rates for reference, and one line, \u003Cstrong\u003EChosen bid\u003C/strong\u003E, carries the bid&#039;s amount. Items the bid leaves out stay at your own cost, which is what leveling already counted as the plug. Choose another bid, or choose the same one again to take it back; each is one step that \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E undoes.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn the bid summary the sub bids are one line inside the cost: overhead, profit and bond are added on top of them like any other cost; sales tax (on material only) and labor burden (on labor) are not. The workbook&#039;s Estimate sheet carries the chosen bid as its own row and the markups block adds it, with live formulas. The material list leaves out an awarded package&#039;s material, because the subcontractor supplies it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA package inside an alternate&#039;s bid area is not repriced: alternates and bid-area subtotals still use your own prices.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"A general contractor sends each trade's scope to subcontractors and compares what comes back. TakeoffDesk does both from the takeoff: open Export › Bid packages and leveling…. Packages There is one package for each CSI division your items use (the first two digits of an item's CSI number, see Create takeoff items). Items without a number make a package of their own. Each package shows its items, how many sheets their marks are on, and our own cost of it (material and labor before markups, from the base bid). Choose Scope CSV to download what to send a subcontractor: each item with its CSI number, quantity, unit and the sheets it is on. It has no prices. For material suppliers, the workbook's quote request has the parts list (see Export the estimate). Enter the bids In the empty row under the package, type the bidder's name and the amount of the bid, then choose Add the bid. If a bid leaves part of the scope out, open its Left out list and tick those items. To correct a name or an amount, type over it in the table; the × button removes a bid. Each change is one step that Ctrl+Z takes back, and the bids are saved with the takeoff. How the bids are leveled Bids rarely cover the same scope. Leveling fills each left-out item with a plug at our own cost of it, so every bid is compared on the whole package: Leveled = the bid + the plugs The lowest leveled bid is marked Low; on a tie, the one entered first. Against our cost is the leveled bid minus our own cost of the package: negative means under it. A bid that looks lowest can lose once its missing scope is counted. The workbook gets a Bid leveling sheet with every package that has bids: our estimate, each bid, its plugs, the leveled total and the difference, as live formulas, and what each bid left out. Use a bid as the package's price Choose Use on a bid and it becomes the price of the whole package in your estimate: the package's own pricing (the items, their second conditions and assembly parts) drops out of the job total, the items stay as quantities with your own rates for reference, and one line, Chosen bid, carries the bid's amount. Items the bid leaves out stay at your own cost, which is what leveling already counted as the plug. Choose another bid, or choose the same one again to take it back; each is one step that Ctrl+Z undoes. In the bid summary the sub bids are one line inside the cost: overhead, profit and bond are added on top of them like any other cost; sales tax (on material only) and labor burden (on labor) are not. The workbook's Estimate sheet carries the chosen bid as its own row and the markups block adds it, with live formulas. The material list leaves out an awarded package's material, because the subcontractor supplies it. A package inside an alternate's bid area is not repriced: alternates and bid-area subtotals still use your own prices.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"save-and-reopen","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Hajmni saqlash va qayta ochish","summary":"Hajmni .takeoff.json loyiha fayli sifatida saqlang, uni oʻsha PDF lar bilan qayta oching va PDF yoʻqolganda yoki oʻzgarganda nima boʻlishini bilib oling.","section":"tasks","order":110,"keywords":["hajm","PDF ichida","joylash","biriktirma","saqlash","ochish","qayta ochish","loyiha","takeoff.json","davom ettirish","qayta koʻrib chiqilgan PDF","oʻzgargan PDF","yoʻqolgan PDF","zaxira","avtosaqlash","tiklash","nosozlik"],"headings":[{"id":"saqlash","text":"Saqlash","level":2},{"id":"hajmni-pdf-ichida-saqlash","text":"Hajmni PDF ichida saqlash","level":2},{"id":"agar-yorliq-yoki-brauzer-to-xtasa","text":"Agar yorliq yoki brauzer toʻxtasa","level":2},{"id":"qayta-ochish","text":"Qayta ochish","level":2},{"id":"agar-pdf-yo-q-bo-lsa","text":"Agar PDF yoʻq boʻlsa","level":2},{"id":"agar-pdf-o-zgargan-bo-lsa","text":"Agar PDF oʻzgargan boʻlsa","level":2},{"id":"zarar-ko-rgan-yoki-begona-fayl","text":"Zarar koʻrgan yoki begona fayl","level":2},{"id":"ortga-qaytarish-tarixi","text":"Ortga qaytarish tarixi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EHajm kichik loyiha fayli sifatida saqlanadi: \u003Ccode\u003E(name).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E. Unda elementlaringiz, yigʻmalaringiz, stavkalaringiz, har bir varaqning masshtabi va har bir belgi saqlanadi. PDF fayllar \u003Cstrong\u003Esaqlanmaydi\u003C/strong\u003E; ular mazmuni boʻyicha qayta topiladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saqlash\"\u003ESaqlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E guruhidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHajmlarni saqlash\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing. Brauzeringiz \u003Ccode\u003E(name).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E ni yuklab oladi. Holat satrida yoziladi: &quot;Saqlandi: (name).takeoff.json. U oʻsha PDF lar ustida qayta ochiladi (ular mazmuni boʻyicha moslashtiriladi).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaylni ish PDF lari yoniga qoʻying, ikkalasi birga tursin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir saqlash yangi fayl yuklaydi. Brauzer ikkinchisini \u003Ccode\u003E(name) (1).takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E deb nomlashi mumkin; eng yangisini saqlang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENom hajmda ochilgan birinchi PDF dan olinadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHajmlarni saqlash\u003C/span\u003E hajmni fayl sifatida saqlashning yagona yoʻli boʻlib qolmoqda. Ishlayotganingizda TakeoffDesk shu brauzerda tiklash nusxasini ham saqlaydi (quyida qarang), bulutli saqlash hozircha mavjud emas. Saqlanmagan oʻzgarishlar bilan oynani yopmoqchi boʻlsangiz, brauzer chiqib ketishni soʻraydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hajmni-pdf-ichida-saqlash\"\u003EHajmni PDF ichida saqlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEksport\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHajmlar ichiga joylangan PDF\u003C/span\u003E har bir ochiq PDF nusxasini yuklaydi, nomi \u003Ccode\u003EPlans (with takeoff).pdf\u003C/code\u003E kabi boʻladi; u butun hajmni biriktirma sifatida saqlaydi: elementlar, belgilar, masshtablar, taklif maydonlari — \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E da bor hamma narsa. Sahifalari oʻzgarmaydi, shuning uchun u asl nusxa kabi koʻrinadi va chop etiladi, boshqa PDF oʻquvchilar esa hajmni biriktirmalari ichida koʻrsatadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBu PDF ni TakeoffDesk da oching (PDF larni qanday ochsangiz ham) — u \u003Cstrong\u003EBu PDF ichida hajm bor\u003C/strong\u003E deb soʻraydi: hajmni qaytarish uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHajmni ochish\u003C/span\u003E ni, faqat chizmani ochish uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaqat PDF\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Nusxa uni yaratilgan PDF ni ifodalaydi, shuning uchun ikkalasidan saqlangan \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E ikkalasida ham ochiladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBir nechta PDF bilan har bir nusxa butun hajmni olib yuradi; ularni birga oching. Nusxadan qayta saqlash ichidagi hajmni almashtiradi, ikkinchisini qoʻshmaydi. Saqlanadigan asosiy fayl hali ham \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E: u kichik va avtosaqlash hamda ish stoli ilovasi uni yozadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"agar-yorliq-yoki-brauzer-to-xtasa\"\u003EAgar yorliq yoki brauzer toʻxtasa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir oʻzgarishdan bir necha soniya keyin TakeoffDesk hajmning nusxasini shu brauzerning oʻz xotirasida saqlaydi — agar PDF lari 64 MB yoki undan kam boʻlsa, ular bilan birga. Hech narsa yuklanmaydi. Hajmni saqlasangiz, yangisini boshlasangiz yoki boshqa loyihani ochsangiz, nusxa oʻchadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAgar yorliq ishdan chiqsa, brauzer yoki kompyuter toʻxtasa yoki saqlanmagan oʻzgarishlar bilan chiqsangiz, TakeoffDesk keyingi ochilishda \u003Cstrong\u003EIshingizni tiklaysizmi?\u003C/strong\u003E deb soʻraydi va hajmni nomi bilan koʻrsatadi. Qaytarish uchun \u003Cstrong\u003ETiklash\u003C/strong\u003E ni bosing: elementlar, belgilar va masshtablar qaytadi, PDF lar esa saqlangan boʻlsa qayta ochiladi. Holat satrida yoziladi: &quot;Tiklandi: (name). U hali faylga saqlanmagan: Hajmlarni saqlash uni saqlab qoladi.&quot; Agar PDF lar juda katta boʻlib saqlanmagan boʻlsa, ularni qayta oching; belgilar oʻz varaqlarida paydo boʻladi. Qoʻshimcha: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/recover\" data-topic=\"basics/recover\"\u003EIshingizni tiklash\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qayta-ochish\"\u003EQayta ochish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETakeoffDesk ni oching.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E faylini va uning PDF larini birga sahifaga tashlang. Yoki PDF lar uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERejalarni ochish\u003C/span\u003E ni, loyiha uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHajmlarni ochish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang — ikkalasining tartibi ixtiyoriy. Holat satrida yoziladi: &quot;Ochildi (name): 12 ta element, 340 ta belgi.&quot; Har bir varaq oʻz masshtabini qaytarib oladi va belgilar varaqlarda paydo boʻladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPDF larning tartibi ahamiyatga ega emas, ularning fayl nomlari yoki papkalari ham. TakeoffDesk har bir PDF ni uning mazmuni barmoq izi boʻyicha taniydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAgar joriy hajmda saqlanmagan oʻzgarishlar boʻlsa va siz loyihani ochsangiz, TakeoffDesk avval soʻraydi: \u003Cstrong\u003EBekor qilish\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003EOʻzgarishlarni tashlab yuborish\u003C/strong\u003E yoki \u003Cstrong\u003EAvval hajmni saqlash\u003C/strong\u003E. Loyihani ochish joriy elementlar va belgilarni almashtiradi; allaqachon ochiq PDF lar ochiq qoladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"agar-pdf-yo-q-bo-lsa\"\u003EAgar PDF yoʻq boʻlsa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAgar loyihani hamma PDF lari boʻlmasdan ochsangiz, holat satriga qoʻshiladi: &quot;Uning belgilarini koʻrish uchun PDF larini oching (Varaqlar boʻyicha roʻyxatda).&quot; Varaqlar roʻyxati ostida izoh shunday deydi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E&quot;Bu hajm ochiq boʻlmagan PDF larni ham qamrab oladi. Ularning miqdorlari hisoblanadi; belgilarini koʻrish va tahrirlash uchun ularni oching:&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKeyin fayl nomlari va hajmlari keladi. Ularning belgilari hamma jamida va eksportda baribir hisobga olinadi, oʻlchangan masshtablar bilan. Belgilarni koʻrish va tahrirlash uchun bu PDF larni oching.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"agar-pdf-o-zgargan-bo-lsa\"\u003EAgar PDF oʻzgargan boʻlsa\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayta koʻrib chiqilgan yoki boshqa dastur tomonidan qayta saqlangan PDF mazmuni boshqacha, shuning uchun TakeoffDesk uchun u \u003Cstrong\u003Eboshqa fayl\u003C/strong\u003E — nomi bir xil boʻlsa ham. Varaqlar roʻyxati ostidagi izohda bunday fayl shunday deyiladi: &quot;bu nomdagi fayl ochiq, lekin mazmuni farq qiladi&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBelgilar eski versiyaga biriktirilgan boʻlib qoladi. Ular eski oʻrinlari va masshtablari boʻyicha hisoblanishda davom etadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQayta koʻrib chiqilgan PDF yangi varaqlar sifatida masshtabsiz va belgilarsiz ochiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHajmni revizyonga koʻchirish uchun ikkala PDF ni oching va yangi varaqda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESolishtirish\u003C/span\u003E dan foydalaning: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/compare-revisions\"\u003EQayta koʻrib chiqilgan varaqni solishtirish va hajmni koʻchirish\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"zarar-ko-rgan-yoki-begona-fayl\"\u003EZarar koʻrgan yoki begona fayl\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk har bir loyiha faylini ishlatishdan oldin tekshiradi. Koʻrishingiz mumkin boʻlgan xabarlar:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;(file) TakeoffDesk loyihasi emas (u yaroqli JSON emas).&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Bu TakeoffDesk loyiha fayli emas.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Bu loyiha yangiroq TakeoffDesk bilan saqlangan. Uni oʻsha yerda oching.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;3 ta belgi shikastlangan va chiqarib tashlandi.&quot; (qolgani ochiladi)\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ortga-qaytarish-tarixi\"\u003EOrtga qaytarish tarixi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOrtga qaytarish tarixi loyiha ochilganda yangidan boshlanadi. Saqlash uni tozalamaydi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Hajm kichik loyiha fayli sifatida saqlanadi: (name).takeoff.json. Unda elementlaringiz, yigʻmalaringiz, stavkalaringiz, har bir varaqning masshtabi va har bir belgi saqlanadi. PDF fayllar saqlanmaydi; ular mazmuni boʻyicha qayta topiladi. Saqlash Fayl guruhidagi Hajmlarni saqlash ni tanlang yoki Ctrl+S ni bosing. Brauzeringiz (name).takeoff.json ni yuklab oladi. Holat satrida yoziladi: \"Saqlandi: (name).takeoff.json. U oʻsha PDF lar ustida qayta ochiladi (ular mazmuni boʻyicha moslashtiriladi).\" Faylni ish PDF lari yoniga qoʻying, ikkalasi birga tursin. Har bir saqlash yangi fayl yuklaydi. Brauzer ikkinchisini (name) (1).takeoff.json deb nomlashi mumkin; eng yangisini saqlang. Nom hajmda ochilgan birinchi PDF dan olinadi. Hajmlarni saqlash hajmni fayl sifatida saqlashning yagona yoʻli boʻlib qolmoqda. Ishlayotganingizda TakeoffDesk shu brauzerda tiklash nusxasini ham saqlaydi (quyida qarang), bulutli saqlash hozircha mavjud emas. Saqlanmagan oʻzgarishlar bilan oynani yopmoqchi boʻlsangiz, brauzer chiqib ketishni soʻraydi. Hajmni PDF ichida saqlash Eksport › Hajmlar ichiga joylangan PDF har bir ochiq PDF nusxasini yuklaydi, nomi Plans (with takeoff).pdf kabi boʻladi; u butun hajmni biriktirma sifatida saqlaydi: elementlar, belgilar, masshtablar, taklif maydonlari — .takeoff.json da bor hamma narsa. Sahifalari oʻzgarmaydi, shuning uchun u asl nusxa kabi koʻrinadi va chop etiladi, boshqa PDF oʻquvchilar esa hajmni biriktirmalari ichida koʻrsatadi. Bu PDF ni TakeoffDesk da oching (PDF larni qanday ochsangiz ham) — u Bu PDF ichida hajm bor deb soʻraydi: hajmni qaytarish uchun Hajmni ochish ni, faqat chizmani ochish uchun Faqat PDF ni tanlang. Nusxa uni yaratilgan PDF ni ifodalaydi, shuning uchun ikkalasidan saqlangan .takeoff.json ikkalasida ham ochiladi. Bir nechta PDF bilan har bir nusxa butun hajmni olib yuradi; ularni birga oching. Nusxadan qayta saqlash ichidagi hajmni almashtiradi, ikkinchisini qoʻshmaydi. Saqlanadigan asosiy fayl hali ham .takeoff.json: u kichik va avtosaqlash hamda ish stoli ilovasi uni yozadi. Agar yorliq yoki brauzer toʻxtasa Har bir oʻzgarishdan bir necha soniya keyin TakeoffDesk hajmning nusxasini shu brauzerning oʻz xotirasida saqlaydi — agar PDF lari 64 MB yoki undan kam boʻlsa, ular bilan birga. Hech narsa yuklanmaydi. Hajmni saqlasangiz, yangisini boshlasangiz yoki boshqa loyihani ochsangiz, nusxa oʻchadi. Agar yorliq ishdan chiqsa, brauzer yoki kompyuter toʻxtasa yoki saqlanmagan oʻzgarishlar bilan chiqsangiz, TakeoffDesk keyingi ochilishda Ishingizni tiklaysizmi? deb soʻraydi va hajmni nomi bilan koʻrsatadi. Qaytarish uchun Tiklash ni bosing: elementlar, belgilar va masshtablar qaytadi, PDF lar esa saqlangan boʻlsa qayta ochiladi. Holat satrida yoziladi: \"Tiklandi: (name). U hali faylga saqlanmagan: Hajmlarni saqlash uni saqlab qoladi.\" Agar PDF lar juda katta boʻlib saqlanmagan boʻlsa, ularni qayta oching; belgilar oʻz varaqlarida paydo boʻladi. Qoʻshimcha: Ishingizni tiklash. Qayta ochish TakeoffDesk ni oching. .takeoff.json faylini va uning PDF larini birga sahifaga tashlang. Yoki PDF lar uchun Rejalarni ochish ni, loyiha uchun Hajmlarni ochish ni tanlang — ikkalasining tartibi ixtiyoriy. Holat satrida yoziladi: \"Ochildi (name): 12 ta element, 340 ta belgi.\" Har bir varaq oʻz masshtabini qaytarib oladi va belgilar varaqlarda paydo boʻladi. PDF larning tartibi ahamiyatga ega emas, ularning fayl nomlari yoki papkalari ham. TakeoffDesk har bir PDF ni uning mazmuni barmoq izi boʻyicha taniydi. Agar joriy hajmda saqlanmagan oʻzgarishlar boʻlsa va siz loyihani ochsangiz, TakeoffDesk avval soʻraydi: Bekor qilish, Oʻzgarishlarni tashlab yuborish yoki Avval hajmni saqlash. Loyihani ochish joriy elementlar va belgilarni almashtiradi; allaqachon ochiq PDF lar ochiq qoladi. Agar PDF yoʻq boʻlsa Agar loyihani hamma PDF lari boʻlmasdan ochsangiz, holat satriga qoʻshiladi: \"Uning belgilarini koʻrish uchun PDF larini oching (Varaqlar boʻyicha roʻyxatda).\" Varaqlar roʻyxati ostida izoh shunday deydi: \"Bu hajm ochiq boʻlmagan PDF larni ham qamrab oladi. Ularning miqdorlari hisoblanadi; belgilarini koʻrish va tahrirlash uchun ularni oching:\" Keyin fayl nomlari va hajmlari keladi. Ularning belgilari hamma jamida va eksportda baribir hisobga olinadi, oʻlchangan masshtablar bilan. Belgilarni koʻrish va tahrirlash uchun bu PDF larni oching. Agar PDF oʻzgargan boʻlsa Qayta koʻrib chiqilgan yoki boshqa dastur tomonidan qayta saqlangan PDF mazmuni boshqacha, shuning uchun TakeoffDesk uchun u boshqa fayl — nomi bir xil boʻlsa ham. Varaqlar roʻyxati ostidagi izohda bunday fayl shunday deyiladi: \"bu nomdagi fayl ochiq, lekin mazmuni farq qiladi\". Belgilar eski versiyaga biriktirilgan boʻlib qoladi. Ular eski oʻrinlari va masshtablari boʻyicha hisoblanishda davom etadi. Qayta koʻrib chiqilgan PDF yangi varaqlar sifatida masshtabsiz va belgilarsiz ochiladi. Hajmni revizyonga koʻchirish uchun ikkala PDF ni oching va yangi varaqda Solishtirish dan foydalaning: Qayta koʻrib chiqilgan varaqni solishtirish va hajmni koʻchirish. Zarar koʻrgan yoki begona fayl TakeoffDesk har bir loyiha faylini ishlatishdan oldin tekshiradi. Koʻrishingiz mumkin boʻlgan xabarlar: \"(file) TakeoffDesk loyihasi emas (u yaroqli JSON emas).\" \"Bu TakeoffDesk loyiha fayli emas.\" \"Bu loyiha yangiroq TakeoffDesk bilan saqlangan. Uni oʻsha yerda oching.\" \"3 ta belgi shikastlangan va chiqarib tashlandi.\" (qolgani ochiladi) Ortga qaytarish tarixi Ortga qaytarish tarixi loyiha ochilganda yangidan boshlanadi. Saqlash uni tozalamaydi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"compare-revisions","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Qayta koʻrib chiqilgan varaqni solishtirish va hajmni koʻchirish","summary":"Eski varaqni uning qayta koʻrib chiqilgan nusxasi ustiga qoʻying, ularni tekislang, nima oʻzgarganini koʻring va belgilangan belgilarni tekshirib, hajmni yangi varaqqa koʻchiring.","section":"tasks","order":115,"keywords":["qayta koʻrib chiqish","qayta koʻrib chiqilgan","solishtirish","ustma-ust qoʻyish","eski","yangi","oʻzgarishlar","qoʻshimcha","byulleten","qayta chiqarish","hajmni koʻchirish","uzatish","olib oʻtish","tekislash","belgilangan","tekshirish"],"headings":[{"id":"solishtirish","text":"Solishtirish","level":2},{"id":"tekislash","text":"Tekislash","level":2},{"id":"o-zgarishlarni-topish","text":"Oʻzgarishlarni topish","level":2},{"id":"hajmni-ko-chirish","text":"Hajmni koʻchirish","level":2},{"id":"belgilangan-belgilarni-tekshirish","text":"Belgilangan belgilarni tekshirish","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EVaraq qayta chiqarilganda, uni yana hajmlab chiqishingiz shart emas. Eski PDF va yangisini oching, ikki varaqni solishtiring va hajmni koʻchiring. TakeoffDesk chizma oʻzgargan har bir belgini belgilaydi, shuning uchun ularni tekshirasiz va qolganini saqlaysiz.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"solishtirish\"\u003ESolishtirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIkkala PDF ni oching: eski toʻplamni va qayta koʻrib chiqilganini (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E; ular bitta faylda yoki bir nechta faylda boʻlishi mumkin).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYangi\u003C/strong\u003E varaqni koʻrsating.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChizma ostidagi varaq panelida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECompare\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERoʻyxatdan eski varaqni tanlang. TakeoffDesk boshqa PDF dagi bir xil raqamli varaqni yoki bir xil sahifani taklif qiladi. \u003Cstrong\u003ESolishtirish\u003C/strong\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEski chizma endi yangisi ustida qizil rangda turadi. Ikkisi mos keladigan joyda qizil chiziqlar qora chiziqlar ustida turadi; farq qilgan joyda faqat qizil chiziqlar (olib tashlangan) va faqat qora chiziqlar (qoʻshilgan) koʻrinadi. Varaqning pastki qismidagi panelda quyidagi qadamlar bor; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose\u003C/span\u003E solishtirishni tugatadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tekislash\"\u003ETekislash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQayta koʻrib chiqilgan varaqlar koʻpincha bir oz siljigan holda chop etiladi: sahifada surilgan yoki biroz boshqa oʻlchamda. Agar qizil chizma qora ustiga tushmasa, \u003Cstrong\u003EIkki nuqta boʻyicha tekislash\u003C/strong\u003E ni tanlang va toʻrt marta bosing:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eeski (qizil) chizmadagi nuqta, masalan ustun markazi yoki bino burchagi,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eyangi (qora) chizmadagi oʻsha nuqta,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eqizil chizmadagi ikkinchi nuqta, birinchisidan uzoqda,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eqora chizmadagi oʻsha nuqta.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQizil chizma qora ustiga siljiydi, buriladi va masshtablanadi. Holat panelida yangi chizma qanchalik kattaroq ekani koʻrsatiladi (&quot;size × 1.000&quot; bir xil boʻlsa). Tanlashlar uchun yaqinroq kattalashtiring: qanchalik yaqin bossangiz, moslash shunchalik yaxshi boʻladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"o-zgarishlarni-topish\"\u003EOʻzgarishlarni topish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOʻzgarishlarni topish\u003C/strong\u003E ni tanlang. TakeoffDesk ikki chizmaning siyohini solishtiradi: faqat eski varaqdagi siyoh qizil boʻladi, faqat yangi varaqdagi siyoh koʻk boʻladi va holat paneli ularni sanaydi. Oz miqdorda siljigan chiziqlar (qayta chop etish) oʻzgarish deb hisoblanmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EU shuningdek eski varaqdagi har bir belgini koʻrib chiqadi va chizma oʻzgargan joylarda turganlarini sanaydi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Echiziq yoki maydon, agar chizma uning uchlari yoki burchaklaridan birida oʻzgargan boʻlsa yoki uzunligining kamida taxminan oltidan bir qismi boʻylab oʻzgargan boʻlsa;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Esanash, agar uning yonida biror narsa oʻzgargan boʻlsa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hajmni-ko-chirish\"\u003EHajmni koʻchirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBu yerga hajmni koʻchirish\u003C/strong\u003E ni tanlang. Eski varaqdagi har bir belgi tekislash orqali yangisiga koʻchiriladi, bitta qaytarish bosqichida. Oʻzgarish yonidagilar belgilanadi: ular toʻq sariq halqa bilan chiziladi va varaq panelida &quot;(n) to check&quot; koʻrsatiladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAgar yangi varaqda masshtab boʻlmasa, u eski varaqning masshtabini oladi (chizmalarni tekislash uchun masshtablash kerak boʻlgan boʻlsa, sozlanadi). Agar u boshqa masshtabga ega boʻlsa, TakeoffDesk avval soraydi: koʻchirilgan belgilar yangi varaqning masshtabida oʻlchanadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"belgilangan-belgilarni-tekshirish\"\u003EBelgilangan belgilarni tekshirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVaraq panelida &quot;(n) to check&quot; ni tanlang. U keyingi belgilangan belgiga kattalashtiradi va uni tanlaydi; uning paneli nima uchun belgilanganini aytadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAgar chizma uning ostida oʻzgargan boʻlsa, belgini tuzating: burchaklarini suring, belgi qoʻshing yoki oʻchiring yoki qaytadan olib tashlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUning panelida \u003Cstrong\u003ETekshirildi\u003C/strong\u003E ni tanlang. Belgi olib tashlanadi va varaq panelidagi son kamayadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBelgilar hajm bilan birga saqlanadi, shuning uchun ularni keyinroq ham tekshirishingiz mumkin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESolishtirish vektor PDF larda ham, skanerlangan nusxalarda ham ishlaydi, chunki u chizilganini solishtiradi. Qiyshaygan yoki choʻzilgan skaner ikki nuqta bilan faqat taxminan tekislanishi mumkin; shunda koʻproq belgilarni koʻz bilan tekshiring.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"Varaq qayta chiqarilganda, uni yana hajmlab chiqishingiz shart emas. Eski PDF va yangisini oching, ikki varaqni solishtiring va hajmni koʻchiring. TakeoffDesk chizma oʻzgargan har bir belgini belgilaydi, shuning uchun ularni tekshirasiz va qolganini saqlaysiz. Solishtirish Ikkala PDF ni oching: eski toʻplamni va qayta koʻrib chiqilganini (Open plans; ular bitta faylda yoki bir nechta faylda boʻlishi mumkin). Yangi varaqni koʻrsating. Chizma ostidagi varaq panelida Compare ni tanlang. Roʻyxatdan eski varaqni tanlang. TakeoffDesk boshqa PDF dagi bir xil raqamli varaqni yoki bir xil sahifani taklif qiladi. Solishtirish ni tanlang. Eski chizma endi yangisi ustida qizil rangda turadi. Ikkisi mos keladigan joyda qizil chiziqlar qora chiziqlar ustida turadi; farq qilgan joyda faqat qizil chiziqlar (olib tashlangan) va faqat qora chiziqlar (qoʻshilgan) koʻrinadi. Varaqning pastki qismidagi panelda quyidagi qadamlar bor; Esc yoki Close solishtirishni tugatadi. Tekislash Qayta koʻrib chiqilgan varaqlar koʻpincha bir oz siljigan holda chop etiladi: sahifada surilgan yoki biroz boshqa oʻlchamda. Agar qizil chizma qora ustiga tushmasa, Ikki nuqta boʻyicha tekislash ni tanlang va toʻrt marta bosing: eski (qizil) chizmadagi nuqta, masalan ustun markazi yoki bino burchagi, yangi (qora) chizmadagi oʻsha nuqta, qizil chizmadagi ikkinchi nuqta, birinchisidan uzoqda, qora chizmadagi oʻsha nuqta. Qizil chizma qora ustiga siljiydi, buriladi va masshtablanadi. Holat panelida yangi chizma qanchalik kattaroq ekani koʻrsatiladi (\"size × 1.000\" bir xil boʻlsa). Tanlashlar uchun yaqinroq kattalashtiring: qanchalik yaqin bossangiz, moslash shunchalik yaxshi boʻladi. Oʻzgarishlarni topish Oʻzgarishlarni topish ni tanlang. TakeoffDesk ikki chizmaning siyohini solishtiradi: faqat eski varaqdagi siyoh qizil boʻladi, faqat yangi varaqdagi siyoh koʻk boʻladi va holat paneli ularni sanaydi. Oz miqdorda siljigan chiziqlar (qayta chop etish) oʻzgarish deb hisoblanmaydi. U shuningdek eski varaqdagi har bir belgini koʻrib chiqadi va chizma oʻzgargan joylarda turganlarini sanaydi: chiziq yoki maydon, agar chizma uning uchlari yoki burchaklaridan birida oʻzgargan boʻlsa yoki uzunligining kamida taxminan oltidan bir qismi boʻylab oʻzgargan boʻlsa; sanash, agar uning yonida biror narsa oʻzgargan boʻlsa. Hajmni koʻchirish Bu yerga hajmni koʻchirish ni tanlang. Eski varaqdagi har bir belgi tekislash orqali yangisiga koʻchiriladi, bitta qaytarish bosqichida. Oʻzgarish yonidagilar belgilanadi: ular toʻq sariq halqa bilan chiziladi va varaq panelida \"(n) to check\" koʻrsatiladi. Agar yangi varaqda masshtab boʻlmasa, u eski varaqning masshtabini oladi (chizmalarni tekislash uchun masshtablash kerak boʻlgan boʻlsa, sozlanadi). Agar u boshqa masshtabga ega boʻlsa, TakeoffDesk avval soraydi: koʻchirilgan belgilar yangi varaqning masshtabida oʻlchanadi. Belgilangan belgilarni tekshirish Varaq panelida \"(n) to check\" ni tanlang. U keyingi belgilangan belgiga kattalashtiradi va uni tanlaydi; uning paneli nima uchun belgilanganini aytadi. Agar chizma uning ostida oʻzgargan boʻlsa, belgini tuzating: burchaklarini suring, belgi qoʻshing yoki oʻchiring yoki qaytadan olib tashlang. Uning panelida Tekshirildi ni tanlang. Belgi olib tashlanadi va varaq panelidagi son kamayadi. Belgilar hajm bilan birga saqlanadi, shuning uchun ularni keyinroq ham tekshirishingiz mumkin. Solishtirish vektor PDF larda ham, skanerlangan nusxalarda ham ishlaydi, chunki u chizilganini solishtiradi. Qiyshaygan yoki choʻzilgan skaner ikki nuqta bilan faqat taxminan tekislanishi mumkin; shunda koʻproq belgilarni koʻz bilan tekshiring.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"use-with-ai-assistants","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Use TakeoffDesk with an AI assistant","summary":"Let your own AI assistant or script read the takeoff's quantities and estimate, add items and marks, count and measure on a DWG or DXF, and export: permissions, connecting through the dev server, and the activity log.","section":"tasks","order":118,"keywords":["ai","assistant","agent","mcp","model context protocol","script","automation","quantities","estimate","permissions","disconnect","activity"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"turn-it-on","text":"Turn it on","level":2},{"id":"connect-your-assistant","text":"Connect your assistant","level":2},{"id":"you-stay-in-charge","text":"You stay in charge","level":2},{"id":"what-an-assistant-can-ask-for","text":"What an assistant can ask for","level":2},{"id":"if-something-doesn-t-work","text":"If something doesn't work","level":2},{"id":"see-also","text":"See also","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let an AI assistant (or a script you wrote) work with TakeoffDesk, and how to decide what it is allowed to touch.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk has \u003Cstrong\u003Eno AI of its own\u003C/strong\u003E and sends nothing anywhere. You bring the assistant: any program that speaks the Model Context Protocol (MCP). TakeoffDesk only gives it tools, and you choose which.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"turn-it-on\"\u003ETurn it on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and go to the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E, tick \u003Cstrong\u003ELet AI assistants and scripts use TakeoffDesk\u003C/strong\u003E. It is off until you do.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose what it may do: \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E is ticked to start with; tick \u003Cstrong\u003EEdit\u003C/strong\u003E, \u003Cstrong\u003ESave\u003C/strong\u003E or \u003Cstrong\u003EExport\u003C/strong\u003E only when you need them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETools outside the permissions you ticked are not offered to the assistant, and if it asks for one anyway, TakeoffDesk refuses and writes it in the activity log. Turning the switch off ends every connection at once; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset TakeoffDesk settings\u003C/span\u003E turns it off too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"connect-your-assistant\"\u003EConnect your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAssistants connect through the dev server on your computer. Start TakeoffDesk with \u003Ccode\u003Enpm run mcp\u003C/code\u003E instead of \u003Ccode\u003Enpm start\u003C/code\u003E: the server then also answers assistants at \u003Ccode\u003Ehttp://127.0.0.1:8000/mcp\u003C/code\u003E, only from this computer, with the token it keeps in \u003Ccode\u003Edevshell/.mcp-token\u003C/code\u003E. Keep the TakeoffDesk tab open: the assistant works through it. \u003Ccode\u003Edevshell/MCP.md\u003C/code\u003E has the exact settings for Claude Code and Claude Desktop. Never share the token.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStarted with \u003Ccode\u003Enpm start\u003C/code\u003E, the server takes no assistants, and the switch has no effect.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"you-stay-in-charge\"\u003EYou stay in charge\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEvery change is one undo step\u003C/strong\u003E, labelled with the assistant&#039;s name for it (for example &quot;Assistant: …&quot;). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E takes back the assistant&#039;s last change as a whole.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EYou know when one is connected.\u003C/strong\u003E A button in the app bar names the assistant while it is connected; click it to see what it may do, or to \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EActivity.\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E lists every call: when, which tool, done or refused. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave the log\u003C/span\u003E keeps a copy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-assistant-can-ask-for\"\u003EWhat an assistant can ask for\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETool\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EPermission\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eapp_info\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esheets_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe takeoff open, its PDFs and sheets, each sheet&#039;s scale and marks\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esheet_image\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA picture of a sheet, or a zoomed-in part of it, with a grid in the numbers \u003Ccode\u003Emarks_add\u003C/code\u003E takes and the marks already there, so the assistant can see where to measure on a PDF\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eitems_list\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe items with their units, rates and assembly formulas\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_quantities\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantities per item or per sheet; marks on sheets with no scale are listed, never counted as zero\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_estimate\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe priced estimate as TakeoffDesk computes it, with its totals\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExport\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk&#039;s own CSV or XLSX export\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eitems_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAdds items with their units, rates and waste\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emarks_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasures runs, areas and counts on a sheet. Lengths and areas only on a sheet with a scale, never on an unscaled one\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_sheets\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecad_catalog\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Ecad_count\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERead\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOn a DWG or DXF you opened: its sheets and their scales, what can be counted (blocks, layers and types, texts), and exact counts, as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECAD count\u003C/span\u003E makes them (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-from-a-drawing\"\u003ECount from a drawing\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_count_add\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECounts in the drawing and puts a count mark on each object found, in one step; counting again adds only what is new\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ecad_measure\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEdit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasures a linear or an area item from the drawing&#039;s own lines, arcs, polylines and hatches, as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMeasure drawing\u003C/span\u003E does (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-from-a-drawing\"\u003EMeasure from a drawing\u003C/a\u003E); only on a sheet with a scale\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eusd_export\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExport\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA scaled sheet&#039;s measured runs, areas and counts as a 3D check model in USD (\u003Ccode\u003E.usdz\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.usda\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E.usdc\u003C/code\u003E), as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD package (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E in the 3D check view writes it (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/usd\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/usd\"\u003EExport the 3D check view as USD\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cstrong\u003EEdit\u003C/strong\u003E ticked, an assistant adds items and marks (each call one undo step); it cannot move, change or delete marks that are already there.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-something-doesn-t-work\"\u003EIf something doesn&#039;t work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe assistant sees no TakeoffDesk tools:\u003C/strong\u003E check that the switch is on in this window, and that the server was started with \u003Ccode\u003Enpm run mcp\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;needs the export permission&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E tick \u003Cstrong\u003EExport\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssistants\u003C/span\u003E, then ask again.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;401&quot; or &quot;token&quot; errors:\u003C/strong\u003E the token changed (\u003Ccode\u003Edevshell/.mcp-token\u003C/code\u003E was deleted and made again). Copy the new one into the assistant&#039;s settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"see-also\"\u003ESee also\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/assistants-recipes\" data-topic=\"basics/assistants-recipes\"\u003ERecipes for AI assistants\u003C/a\u003E: worked examples, each with the tools it calls.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let an AI assistant (or a script you wrote) work with TakeoffDesk, and how to decide what it is allowed to touch. TakeoffDesk has no AI of its own and sends nothing anywhere. You bring the assistant: any program that speaks the Model Context Protocol (MCP). TakeoffDesk only gives it tools, and you choose which. Turn it on Open Settings (the gear in the app bar, or Ctrl+,) and go to the TakeoffDesk tab. Under Assistants, tick Let AI assistants and scripts use TakeoffDesk. It is off until you do. Choose what it may do: Read is ticked to start with; tick Edit, Save or Export only when you need them. Tools outside the permissions you ticked are not offered to the assistant, and if it asks for one anyway, TakeoffDesk refuses and writes it in the activity log. Turning the switch off ends every connection at once; Reset TakeoffDesk settings turns it off too. Connect your assistant Assistants connect through the dev server on your computer. Start TakeoffDesk with npm run mcp instead of npm start: the server then also answers assistants at http://127.0.0.1:8000/mcp, only from this computer, with the token it keeps in devshell/.mcp-token. Keep the TakeoffDesk tab open: the assistant works through it. devshell/MCP.md has the exact settings for Claude Code and Claude Desktop. Never share the token. Started with npm start, the server takes no assistants, and the switch has no effect. You stay in charge Every change is one undo step, labelled with the assistant's name for it (for example \"Assistant: …\"). Ctrl+Z takes back the assistant's last change as a whole. You know when one is connected. A button in the app bar names the assistant while it is connected; click it to see what it may do, or to Disconnect it. Activity. Settings › TakeoffDesk › Assistants › Activity lists every call: when, which tool, done or refused. Save the log keeps a copy. What an assistant can ask for Tool Permission What it does app_info, sheets_list Read The takeoff open, its PDFs and sheets, each sheet's scale and marks sheet_image Read A picture of a sheet, or a zoomed-in part of it, with a grid in the numbers marks_add takes and the marks already there, so the assistant can see where to measure on a PDF items_list Read The items with their units, rates and assembly formulas takeoff_quantities Read Quantities per item or per sheet; marks on sheets with no scale are listed, never counted as zero takeoff_estimate Read The priced estimate as TakeoffDesk computes it, with its totals takeoff_export Export TakeoffDesk's own CSV or XLSX export items_add Edit Adds items with their units, rates and waste marks_add Edit Measures runs, areas and counts on a sheet. Lengths and areas only on a sheet with a scale, never on an unscaled one cad_sheets, cad_catalog, cad_count Read On a DWG or DXF you opened: its sheets and their scales, what can be counted (blocks, layers and types, texts), and exact counts, as CAD count makes them (Count from a drawing) cad_count_add Edit Counts in the drawing and puts a count mark on each object found, in one step; counting again adds only what is new cad_measure Edit Measures a linear or an area item from the drawing's own lines, arcs, polylines and hatches, as Measure drawing does (Measure from a drawing); only on a sheet with a scale usd_export Export A scaled sheet's measured runs, areas and counts as a 3D check model in USD (.usdz, .usda or .usdc), as USD package (.usdz) in the 3D check view writes it (Export the 3D check view as USD) With Edit ticked, an assistant adds items and marks (each call one undo step); it cannot move, change or delete marks that are already there. If something doesn't work The assistant sees no TakeoffDesk tools: check that the switch is on in this window, and that the server was started with npm run mcp. \"needs the export permission\": tick Export under Assistants, then ask again. \"401\" or \"token\" errors: the token changed (devshell/.mcp-token was deleted and made again). Copy the new one into the assistant's settings. See also Recipes for AI assistants: worked examples, each with the tools it calls.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"new-takeoff","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Yangi hajmlar hisobini boshlash","summary":"Hamma narsani tozalab, sahifani qayta yuklamasdan boʻsh hajmlar hisobini boshlang va avval ishingizni xavfsiz saqlang.","section":"tasks","order":120,"keywords":["yangi","yangi hajmlar hisobi","tozalash","qayta oʻrnatish","boshidan boshlash","boʻsh","PDF larni yopish","keyingi ish"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E har bir PDF ni yopadi va shu sahifada boʻsh hajmlar hisobini boshlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAgar saqlamoqchi boʻlsangiz, joriy hajmlar hisobini saqlang: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E guruhida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESaqlanmagan oʻzgarishlar boʻlsa, TakeoffDesk \u003Cstrong\u003ESaqlanmagan hajmlar hisobi\u003C/strong\u003E deb soradi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff first\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang (u loyihani yuklab oladi, soʻng tozalaydi), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiscard changes\u003C/span\u003E yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECancel\u003C/span\u003E. Oyna boʻsh holatiga qaytadi: PDF yoʻq, elementlar yoʻq, belgilar yoʻq, masshtablar yoʻq. Holat satri aytadi: &quot;Yangi hajmlar hisobi. Boshlash uchun PDF larni oching.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENima tozalanadi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eochiq har bir PDF, uning varaqlari va kichik rasmlari,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eelementlar, yigʻmalar, belgilar va masshtablar,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Ehar bir varaqning kattalashtirishi va joylashuvi,\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eortga qaytarish tarixi (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew\u003C/span\u003E ni ortga qaytarib boʻlmaydi),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eyoy rejimi va avtosanash qidiruvi yoki koʻrib chiqish.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDiskdagi fayllaringizga tegilmaydi. Eski hajmlar hisobini qayta olish uchun uning \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E va PDF larini oching: qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\"\u003EHajmlar hisobini saqlash va qayta ochish\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir yangi hajmlar hisobi elementlarsiz boshlanadi. Elementlarni olib kelish uchun avval ularni nusxalang: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E ostidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECopy item\u003C/span\u003E (yoki elementlarni olib yuradigan belgilarni nusxalang), soʻng yangi hajmlar hisobida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPaste\u003C/span\u003E ni bosing. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EBelgilarni nusxalash, qoʻyish va dublikatlash\u003C/a\u003E. Har bir ishda ishlatadigan elementlar uchun ularni \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/price-library\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/price-library\"\u003Enarxlar kutubxonangizda\u003C/a\u003E saqlang va u yerdan qoʻshing, yoki \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003Esavdo toʻplamini\u003C/a\u003E qoʻshing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"New har bir PDF ni yopadi va shu sahifada boʻsh hajmlar hisobini boshlaydi. Agar saqlamoqchi boʻlsangiz, joriy hajmlar hisobini saqlang: Save takeoff yoki Ctrl+S. File guruhida New ni tanlang. Saqlanmagan oʻzgarishlar boʻlsa, TakeoffDesk Saqlanmagan hajmlar hisobi deb soradi: Save takeoff first ni tanlang (u loyihani yuklab oladi, soʻng tozalaydi), Discard changes yoki Cancel. Oyna boʻsh holatiga qaytadi: PDF yoʻq, elementlar yoʻq, belgilar yoʻq, masshtablar yoʻq. Holat satri aytadi: \"Yangi hajmlar hisobi. Boshlash uchun PDF larni oching.\" Nima tozalanadi: ochiq har bir PDF, uning varaqlari va kichik rasmlari, elementlar, yigʻmalar, belgilar va masshtablar, har bir varaqning kattalashtirishi va joylashuvi, ortga qaytarish tarixi (New ni ortga qaytarib boʻlmaydi), yoy rejimi va avtosanash qidiruvi yoki koʻrib chiqish. Diskdagi fayllaringizga tegilmaydi. Eski hajmlar hisobini qayta olish uchun uning .takeoff.json va PDF larini oching: qarang: Hajmlar hisobini saqlash va qayta ochish. Har bir yangi hajmlar hisobi elementlarsiz boshlanadi. Elementlarni olib kelish uchun avval ularni nusxalang: Items ostidagi Copy item (yoki elementlarni olib yuradigan belgilarni nusxalang), soʻng yangi hajmlar hisobida Paste ni bosing. Qarang: Belgilarni nusxalash, qoʻyish va dublikatlash. Har bir ishda ishlatadigan elementlar uchun ularni narxlar kutubxonangizda saqlang va u yerdan qoʻshing, yoki savdo toʻplamini qoʻshing.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"usd","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"3D tekshiruv koʻrinishini USD sifatida eksport qilish","summary":"3D tekshiruv koʻrinishidagi devorlar, plitalar, plastinalar va chiziqlarni har biri elementi va miqdori bilan USD paket sifatida yozish.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["usd","usdz","openusd","eksport","3d","tekshiruv koʻrinishi","devorlar","plitalar","renderlash"],"headings":[],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E3D tekshiruv koʻrinishida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGLB\u003C/span\u003E yonidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUSD paket (.usdz)\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir obyekt (devor, plita, plastina, sanash ustuni yoki chiziq) faylda bitta obyekt boʻlib, elementining nomi bilan atalgan, elementning nomini va koʻrinish oʻlchagan miqdorni olib yuradi. Plitalar va plastinalar koʻrinishdagidek shaffof boʻladi. Fayl metrlarda, Z yuqoriga qarab yoziladi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"3D tekshiruv koʻrinishida GLB yonidagi USD paket (.usdz) ni tanlang. Har bir obyekt (devor, plita, plastina, sanash ustuni yoki chiziq) faylda bitta obyekt boʻlib, elementining nomi bilan atalgan, elementning nomini va koʻrinish oʻlchagan miqdorni olib yuradi. Plitalar va plastinalar koʻrinishdagidek shaffof boʻladi. Fayl metrlarda, Z yuqoriga qarab yoziladi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"coming-from","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Coming from other takeoff software","summary":"How the habits of dedicated takeoff programs and PDF markup tools map to TakeoffDesk, and the differences that trip people up.","section":"switching","order":10,"keywords":["switching","migrate","conditions","parts","measurement tools","markups list","quantity link","takeoff habits","differences","compare"],"headings":[{"id":"habits-mapped","text":"Habits mapped","level":2},{"id":"differences-that-trip-people-up","text":"Differences that trip people up","level":2},{"id":"not-here-yet","text":"Not here yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIf you have done takeoff in PlanSwift or with the measurement tools in Bluebeam Revu, most of TakeoffDesk will feel familiar: a plan set, a scale per sheet, things you measure, and a priced total. The way the pieces fit together is different in places, and those places are below.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf you know PlanSwift or On-Screen Takeoff, pick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff desk\u003C/span\u003E menu style in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E: a menu bar with File, Edit, View, Scale, Takeoff, Items, Markup and Export over a row of the takeoff tools, with the scale presets on the sheet bar. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/menus-keys-and-mouse\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"habits-mapped\"\u003EHabits mapped\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYou are used to\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIn TakeoffDesk\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpening a job or project that stores the plans (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpen the PDFs and the \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E project side by side. The project stores only the takeoff; the PDFs stay your own files.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA markups list with notes, clouds and highlights (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkup\u003C/span\u003E on the sheet bar: notes, clouds and highlights with a status (Open, Answered, Closed), listed under \u003Cstrong\u003EMarkups\u003C/strong\u003E, drawn in the marked PDF. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/markups\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/markups\"\u003ENotes, clouds and highlights\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasurements saved as markups inside the PDF (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe takeoff lives in the \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E file. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E writes a copy with the takeoff drawn in, for sharing; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF with the takeoff inside\u003C/span\u003E writes a copy that carries the takeoff, to reopen in TakeoffDesk.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoff items (PlanSwift), custom measurement tools saved in the Tool Chest (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EItems\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E: name, type, color, unit, height or depth, waste, rates.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EParts and assemblies with formulas (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe item&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAssembly\u003C/span\u003E: components with a formula using \u003Ccode\u003EL H A N P\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESetting the page scale, or calibrating (both)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPreset\u003C/span\u003E list or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E group, per sheet. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E measures a known dimension.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EApplying one scale to a page range\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot yet: set each sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EViewports with different scales on one sheet (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot yet: one scale per sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPolylength and area tools (Bluebeam), linear and area takeoff (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHolding Shift for straight lines\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E snaps to 45° steps, the same idea.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESnapping to the drawing&#039;s lines\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOn by default: ends, midpoints, intersections and the nearest point on a line, with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to turn it off, as in CAD programs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount tool (both)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVisual search for symbols (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): box one symbol, review, add.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECut-outs or deductions in areas\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) on a selected area, and round cut-outs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDeductions on linear runs\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDraw the run straight through and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E) for the opening. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\"\u003EMeasure linear runs\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArc segments in a polyline\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E): click a point on the curve, then its end.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe Markups list with quantity columns (Bluebeam)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy item\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBy sheet\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEstimating grid with pricing (PlanSwift)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe same table: waste, material and labor per unit, extended totals, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJob total\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExporting to Excel\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E with live formulas, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECSV\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEscape to stop a tool\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E cancels and returns to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERight-click to finish\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERight-click finishes a run or closes an area here too. There is no right-click menu.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"differences-that-trip-people-up\"\u003EDifferences that trip people up\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe takeoff is not inside your PDF.\u003C/strong\u003E Nothing you do changes your PDFs. Save the \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E file and keep it with the drawings. Sending someone the marked PDF does not send them an editable takeoff: send the project file and the original PDFs, or a \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"keep-the-takeoff-inside-the-pdf\"\u003EPDF with the takeoff inside\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPDFs are matched by contents, not by name.\u003C/strong\u003E A revised sheet saved over the old file name is a new file to TakeoffDesk, with no scale and no marks. Your old marks stay on the old version and keep counting. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#when-a-pdf-has-changed\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"when-a-pdf-has-changed\"\u003ESave and reopen a takeoff\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUnscaled marks are left out, not counted as zero.\u003C/strong\u003E If a sheet has no scale, its runs and areas do not count, and the table says &quot;Incomplete&quot;. In many programs you would just see 0. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale#why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-hash=\"why-unscaled-sheets-are-not-counted-as-zero\"\u003ESet the scale\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThere is no page-size guessing.\u003C/strong\u003E Presets assume the PDF is printed at full size. A half-size or &quot;fit to page&quot; PDF needs \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E. Always use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOne item, one main type, more if you ask.\u003C/strong\u003E An item is linear, area or count, and its type locks once it has marks. A condition that gives you both an area and its perimeter is an area item: its perimeter is the \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E variable. A wall with both length and area is a linear item with a height. For a multi-condition item, such as a room with a floor, a base and doors, tick the other kinds under \u003Cstrong\u003EAlso measure\u003C/strong\u003E: each is priced on its own row. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/create-items#one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/create-items\" data-hash=\"one-item-several-kinds-of-marks\"\u003EOne item, several kinds of marks\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFormulas run on totals.\u003C/strong\u003E Assembly formulas use the item&#039;s totals across every sheet, not each run separately. \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E (the number of runs or areas) is there for per-run extras, like one extra stud per wall.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPerimeter includes cut-outs.\u003C/strong\u003E An area&#039;s \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E adds the edges of its holes. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#read-the-area\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"read-the-area\"\u003EMeasure areas with cut-outs\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EDragging pans.\u003C/strong\u003E A left-button drag on the sheet pans, in every tool except \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E. You never need to switch to a pan tool. The wheel zooms; it does not scroll.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA recovery copy, not a cloud.\u003C/strong\u003E TakeoffDesk keeps a copy of your work in this browser and offers it back after a crash (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#if-the-tab-or-the-browser-stops\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"if-the-tab-or-the-browser-stops\"\u003EIf the tab or the browser stops\u003C/a\u003E), but the takeoff is yours to save: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Cloud saving is not available yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEverything is in the browser.\u003C/strong\u003E There is nothing to install, and the plans are never uploaded.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-here-yet\"\u003ENot here yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPer-sheet scale regions are not built yet. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/not-built-yet\"\u003EWhat is not built yet\u003C/a\u003E for the full list and what to do instead.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"If you have done takeoff in PlanSwift or with the measurement tools in Bluebeam Revu, most of TakeoffDesk will feel familiar: a plan set, a scale per sheet, things you measure, and a priced total. The way the pieces fit together is different in places, and those places are below. If you know PlanSwift or On-Screen Takeoff, pick the Takeoff desk menu style in Settings › TakeoffDesk › Menus, keys and mouse: a menu bar with File, Edit, View, Scale, Takeoff, Items, Markup and Export over a row of the takeoff tools, with the scale presets on the sheet bar. See Menus, keys and mouse. Habits mapped You are used to In TakeoffDesk Opening a job or project that stores the plans (PlanSwift) Open the PDFs and the .takeoff.json project side by side. The project stores only the takeoff; the PDFs stay your own files. A markups list with notes, clouds and highlights (Bluebeam) Markup on the sheet bar: notes, clouds and highlights with a status (Open, Answered, Closed), listed under Markups, drawn in the marked PDF. See Notes, clouds and highlights. Measurements saved as markups inside the PDF (Bluebeam) The takeoff lives in the .takeoff.json file. Marked PDF writes a copy with the takeoff drawn in, for sharing; PDF with the takeoff inside writes a copy that carries the takeoff, to reopen in TakeoffDesk. Takeoff items (PlanSwift), custom measurement tools saved in the Tool Chest (Bluebeam) Items under Items: name, type, color, unit, height or depth, waste, rates. Parts and assemblies with formulas (PlanSwift) The item's Assembly: components with a formula using L H A N P. Setting the page scale, or calibrating (both) Preset list or Calibrate in the Scale group, per sheet. Check measures a known dimension. Applying one scale to a page range Not yet: set each sheet. Viewports with different scales on one sheet (Bluebeam) Not yet: one scale per sheet. Polylength and area tools (Bluebeam), linear and area takeoff (PlanSwift) Linear (L) and Area (A). Holding Shift for straight lines Shift snaps to 45° steps, the same idea. Snapping to the drawing's lines On by default: ends, midpoints, intersections and the nearest point on a line, with F3 to turn it off, as in CAD programs. Count tool (both) Count (C). Visual search for symbols (Bluebeam) Auto count (S): box one symbol, review, add. Cut-outs or deductions in areas Cut-out (X) on a selected area, and round cut-outs. Deductions on linear runs Draw the run straight through and press E (Deduct) for the opening. See Measure linear runs. Arc segments in a polyline Arc (R): click a point on the curve, then its end. The Markups list with quantity columns (Bluebeam) The Quantities table, By item or By sheet. Estimating grid with pricing (PlanSwift) The same table: waste, material and labor per unit, extended totals, Job total. Exporting to Excel XLSX with live formulas, or CSV. Escape to stop a tool Esc cancels and returns to Select. Right-click to finish Right-click finishes a run or closes an area here too. There is no right-click menu. Differences that trip people up The takeoff is not inside your PDF. Nothing you do changes your PDFs. Save the .takeoff.json file and keep it with the drawings. Sending someone the marked PDF does not send them an editable takeoff: send the project file and the original PDFs, or a PDF with the takeoff inside. PDFs are matched by contents, not by name. A revised sheet saved over the old file name is a new file to TakeoffDesk, with no scale and no marks. Your old marks stay on the old version and keep counting. See Save and reopen a takeoff. Unscaled marks are left out, not counted as zero. If a sheet has no scale, its runs and areas do not count, and the table says \"Incomplete\". In many programs you would just see 0. See Set the scale. There is no page-size guessing. Presets assume the PDF is printed at full size. A half-size or \"fit to page\" PDF needs Calibrate. Always use Check. One item, one main type, more if you ask. An item is linear, area or count, and its type locks once it has marks. A condition that gives you both an area and its perimeter is an area item: its perimeter is the P variable. A wall with both length and area is a linear item with a height. For a multi-condition item, such as a room with a floor, a base and doors, tick the other kinds under Also measure: each is priced on its own row. See One item, several kinds of marks. Formulas run on totals. Assembly formulas use the item's totals across every sheet, not each run separately. N (the number of runs or areas) is there for per-run extras, like one extra stud per wall. Perimeter includes cut-outs. An area's P adds the edges of its holes. See Measure areas with cut-outs. Dragging pans. A left-button drag on the sheet pans, in every tool except Auto count. You never need to switch to a pan tool. The wheel zooms; it does not scroll. A recovery copy, not a cloud. TakeoffDesk keeps a copy of your work in this browser and offers it back after a crash (If the tab or the browser stops), but the takeoff is yours to save: Ctrl+S. Cloud saving is not available yet. Everything is in the browser. There is nothing to install, and the plans are never uploaded. Not here yet Per-sheet scale regions are not built yet. See What is not built yet for the full list and what to do instead.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"settings","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"TakeoffDesk settings","summary":"Show inches to 1/16, 1/8 or 1/4, start new items with a waste percentage, choose where the Auto count slider starts, snap to the drawing's lines or to 45° without holding Shift, set how wide a door Room fill closes, and pick the 3D view's corner indicator.","section":"reference","order":5,"keywords":["settings","preferences","options","precision","fractions","inches","rounding","waste","default waste","auto count","threshold","match","slider","snap","45","angle","shift","view cube","axis icon","corner indicator","3d"],"headings":[{"id":"feet-and-inches","text":"Feet and inches","level":2},{"id":"waste-to-start-with","text":"Waste to start with","level":2},{"id":"auto-count-where-the-match-slider-starts","text":"Auto count: where the match slider starts","level":2},{"id":"snap-to-the-drawing-s-own-lines","text":"Snap to the drawing's own lines","level":2},{"id":"room-fill-how-wide-an-opening-it-closes","text":"Room fill: how wide an opening it closes","level":2},{"id":"snap-to-45-without-holding-shift","text":"Snap to 45° without holding Shift","level":2},{"id":"count-marker-size","text":"Count marker size","level":2},{"id":"corner-indicator","text":"Corner indicator","level":2},{"id":"path-tool-the-largest-gap-it-joins","text":"Path tool: the largest gap it joins","level":2},{"id":"measurement-labels","text":"Measurement labels","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E with the gear in the app bar or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. The first tab, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E, holds the settings that belong to this app; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E holds the general ones (theme, panels, toolbar). TakeoffDesk&#039;s settings exist only in the app: you change them here, and this browser remembers them. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset TakeoffDesk settings\u003C/span\u003E puts them back to the start.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"feet-and-inches\"\u003EFeet and inches\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EShow lengths to the nearest \u003Cstrong\u003E1/16&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E (the start), \u003Cstrong\u003E1/8&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E or \u003Cstrong\u003E1/4&quot;\u003C/strong\u003E. This changes how lengths read on the sheet, in the panels, in the quantities and in the status bar.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnly the display is rounded. Quantities, costs and the exports are worked out from the exact lengths, and the exports always show 1/16&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"waste-to-start-with\"\u003EWaste to start with\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe waste percentage every new item starts with: 0% (the start), 2%, 3%, 5%, 7.5%, 10%, 15% or 20%. You can still type another waste for each item, in the item editor or straight in the quantities table. Items you already have keep their own waste.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"auto-count-where-the-match-slider-starts\"\u003EAuto count: where the match slider starts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMatch\u003C/span\u003E slider sits when an \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/auto-count\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/auto-count\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/a\u003E search finishes, from 50% to 95%; 75% is the start. Lower offers more look-alikes for you to reject; higher offers fewer. You can still move the slider during each review.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"snap-to-the-drawing-s-own-lines\"\u003ESnap to the drawing&#039;s own lines\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn at the start. While you measure or calibrate, a point near a line of the PDF jumps to its end, its midpoint, a crossing or the nearest point on it. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E in the status bar turn it on and off too. More: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003ESnap to the drawing&#039;s lines\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"room-fill-how-wide-an-opening-it-closes\"\u003ERoom fill: how wide an opening it closes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom fill closes openings up to\u003C/span\u003E sets how wide a door opening or gap the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom\u003C/span\u003E tool treats as closed: 3&#039;-0&quot; to 8&#039;-0&quot;, 4&#039;-0&quot; at the start. Wider than your widest door lets a room run into the next one; narrower than a door leaves the room open. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-areas#fill-a-room-with-one-click\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-areas\" data-hash=\"fill-a-room-with-one-click\"\u003EFill a room with one click\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"snap-to-45-without-holding-shift\"\u003ESnap to 45° without holding Shift\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOff at the start. When it is on, runs, outlines, cut-outs and dragged corners go at 0°, 45°, 90° or 135° from the last point without holding \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E; hold \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to click at any angle. The status bar then reads &quot;Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle&quot;. The point you click on an arc&#039;s curve and circles are never snapped; an arc&#039;s end is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"count-marker-size\"\u003ECount marker size\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow big the count dots are: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExtra small\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESmall\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMedium\u003C/span\u003E (the start: the size the dots always had) or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELarge\u003C/span\u003E. The size holds on screen at every zoom, and the marked PDF draws each dot at the same size on paper, whatever the sheet size, so the PDF at 100% looks as the screen does. More: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/count-by-hand#dot-size-on-screen-and-in-the-pdf\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/count-by-hand\" data-hash=\"dot-size-on-screen-and-in-the-pdf\"\u003ECount by hand\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"corner-indicator\"\u003ECorner indicator\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFor the \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003E3D check view\u003C/a\u003E only: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView cube\u003C/span\u003E (the start: a cube at the top right to click, drag and turn), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAxis icon\u003C/span\u003E (a small X, Y, Z marker at the bottom right) or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENone\u003C/span\u003E. It changes at once and is kept in this browser. The flat sheet never shows one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"path-tool-the-largest-gap-it-joins\"\u003EPath tool: the largest gap it joins\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPath tool: largest gap to join\u003C/span\u003E is how far apart two line ends can be and still count as one path, in PDF points (0.05 to 60; 1.5 at the start). A drawing&#039;s lines often stop a hair short of each other. Larger joins more; smaller keeps lines apart. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"[\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E[\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"]\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E]\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E change it while you pick, and this field follows. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\"\u003EPick the lines\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"measurement-labels\"\u003EMeasurement labels\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShow measurement labels on marks\u003C/strong\u003E writes the length of each segment and the size of a selected area on the sheet. It is off at the start; the figures are always in the item panel, the status bar and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Open Settings with the gear in the app bar or Ctrl+,. The first tab, TakeoffDesk, holds the settings that belong to this app; General holds the general ones (theme, panels, toolbar). TakeoffDesk's settings exist only in the app: you change them here, and this browser remembers them. Reset TakeoffDesk settings puts them back to the start. Feet and inches Show lengths to the nearest 1/16\" (the start), 1/8\" or 1/4\". This changes how lengths read on the sheet, in the panels, in the quantities and in the status bar. Only the display is rounded. Quantities, costs and the exports are worked out from the exact lengths, and the exports always show 1/16\". Waste to start with The waste percentage every new item starts with: 0% (the start), 2%, 3%, 5%, 7.5%, 10%, 15% or 20%. You can still type another waste for each item, in the item editor or straight in the quantities table. Items you already have keep their own waste. Auto count: where the match slider starts Where the Match slider sits when an Auto count search finishes, from 50% to 95%; 75% is the start. Lower offers more look-alikes for you to reject; higher offers fewer. You can still move the slider during each review. Snap to the drawing's own lines On at the start. While you measure or calibrate, a point near a line of the PDF jumps to its end, its midpoint, a crossing or the nearest point on it. F3 and Snap in the status bar turn it on and off too. More: Snap to the drawing's lines. Room fill: how wide an opening it closes Room fill closes openings up to sets how wide a door opening or gap the Room tool treats as closed: 3'-0\" to 8'-0\", 4'-0\" at the start. Wider than your widest door lets a room run into the next one; narrower than a door leaves the room open. See Fill a room with one click. Snap to 45° without holding Shift Off at the start. When it is on, runs, outlines, cut-outs and dragged corners go at 0°, 45°, 90° or 135° from the last point without holding Shift; hold Shift to click at any angle. The status bar then reads \"Snaps to 45°; Shift frees the angle\". The point you click on an arc's curve and circles are never snapped; an arc's end is. Count marker size How big the count dots are: Extra small, Small, Medium (the start: the size the dots always had) or Large. The size holds on screen at every zoom, and the marked PDF draws each dot at the same size on paper, whatever the sheet size, so the PDF at 100% looks as the screen does. More: Count by hand. Corner indicator For the 3D check view only: View cube (the start: a cube at the top right to click, drag and turn), Axis icon (a small X, Y, Z marker at the bottom right) or None. It changes at once and is kept in this browser. The flat sheet never shows one. Path tool: the largest gap it joins Path tool: largest gap to join is how far apart two line ends can be and still count as one path, in PDF points (0.05 to 60; 1.5 at the start). A drawing's lines often stop a hair short of each other. Larger joins more; smaller keeps lines apart. [ and ] change it while you pick, and this field follows. See Pick the lines. Measurement labels Show measurement labels on marks writes the length of each segment and the size of a selected area on the sheet. It is off at the start; the figures are always in the item panel, the status bar and Quantities.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"menus-keys-and-mouse","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Menyular, tugmalar va sichqoncha","summary":"Oʻzingiz ishlaydigan usulga mos menyu uslubini tanlang, har bir buyruqqa oʻz tugmangizni bering, buyruqlarni menyular orasida koʻchiring va gʻildirak hamda sichqoncha tugmalari nima qilishini belgilang.","section":"reference","order":6,"keywords":["menyu uslubi","menyular","menyu paneli","lenta","lenta yorliqlari","asboblar paneli","tezkor tugmalar","klaviatura yorliqlari","tugmalar","moslash","qayta tayinlash","sichqoncha","gʻildirak","teskari","aylantirish yoʻnalishi","oʻrta tugma","oʻng tugma","surish","eksport","import","almashtirish","tanish","hajmlar stoli","shartlar"],"headings":[{"id":"uchta-uslub","text":"Uchta uslub","level":2},{"id":"o-zingizniki-qiling","text":"Oʻzingizniki qiling","level":2},{"id":"sichqoncha","text":"Sichqoncha","level":2},{"id":"o-zingiz-bilan-olib-yuring","text":"Oʻzingiz bilan olib yuring","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk buyruqlari qaysi usul bilan kirmang, bir xil. \u003Cstrong\u003EMenyu uslubi\u003C/strong\u003E faqat ularning ekranda qayerda turishini, u yerda qanday atalishini va qaysi tugmalar ularni bajarishini belgilaydi. Uni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) › TakeoffDesk › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E boʻlimida tanlang; oʻzgarish darhol boʻladi va bu brauzer uni eslab qoladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uchta-uslub\"\u003EUchta uslub\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUslub\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENima olasiz\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk ning oʻz asboblar paneli: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, bir harfli asbob tugmalari bilan. Boshlangʻich.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff desk\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMenyu paneli (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScale\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkup\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E) hajmlarni hisoblash asboblarining bir qatori ustida, ekrandagi hajmlar dasturlari oʻzlarini joylashtirgandek. Qatorda elementlar shartlar deb ataladi. Xuddi shu tugmalar, va yangi element uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"N\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EN\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E qoʻshiladi. Masshtab tayyor sozlamalari varaqning masshtabi yonidagi varaq paneliga koʻchadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff ribbon\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIshga qarab nomlangan lenta yorliqlari: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff\u003C/span\u003E (oʻlchash, shakl, masshtab, chizmadan, shartlar), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarkup\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E (jadval kitobi, belgilangan PDF lar, taklif), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E menyusi va ochish, saqlash, ortga qaytarish va qayta bajarish uchun tezkor qator bilan. Kun boʻyi ishlatiladigan asboblar katta, qoʻshnilari kichik va ustma-ust. Xuddi shu tugmalar; masshtab tayyor sozlamalari varaq panelida.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUchala uslub ham TakeoffDesk tugmalarini saqlaydi: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tanlash, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E chiziqli, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E maydon, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E aylana, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E xona, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yoʻl (PDF chiziqlarini tanlash), \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kesik, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E sanash, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E avtosanash, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E kalibrlash, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tekshirish, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yoy rejimi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ayirish rejimi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E moslash uchun, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E 3D tekshiruv koʻrinishi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tortish va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVaraq panelining asboblari (izohlar, bulutlar, ajratmalar, Solishtirish, 3D) PDF ochilgunicha kutadi; undan oldin tanlansa, holat satri buni aytadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk oʻz tartibiga tegishli, lekin uslubingiz boshqa buyruqqa bergan tugma hech narsa qilmaydi va holat satri uning buyrugʻi qayerga koʻchganini aytadi (&quot;Mening tugmalarim da, Sanash — Ctrl+Alt+C&quot;). \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E va strelkalar doim oʻz maʼnosini saqlaydi. Chiziq yoki kontur chizayotganda, avtosanashni qoʻyayotganda yoki koʻrib chiqayotganda, harflar va yozilgan uzunlikning raqamlari chizma bilan qoladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"o-zingizniki-qiling\"\u003EOʻzingizniki qiling\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EXohlaganingizga eng yaqin uslubni tanlang, soʻng \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECustomize…\u003C/span\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeys and menus\u003C/span\u003E da buyruqni toping (qidiruv oynasi yordam beradi). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a key\u003C/span\u003E ni bosing va tugmani bosing yoki ikki harfli tugma uchun ketma-ket ikki tugmani bosing. Tugmani olib tashlash uchun uni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMenyu paneli bilan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhere it sits\u003C/span\u003E buyruqni boshqa menyuga yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeys only\u003C/span\u003E ga koʻchiradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMouse\u003C/span\u003E da gʻildirakni va varaqni suradigan tugmalarni sozlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnga nom bering va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave\u003C/span\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOʻrnatilgan uslubni saqlash oʻzingizning nusxangizni yaratadi (&quot;Mening hajmlar stolim&quot;); oʻrnatilgani hech qachon oʻzgarmaydi. Ikki buyruqqa berilgan tugma qizil rangda koʻrsatiladi va saqlashdan oldin tuzatilishi kerak.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sichqoncha\"\u003ESichqoncha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESichqoncha gʻildiragi\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScroll up zooms in\u003C/span\u003E (boshlangʻich) yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScroll up zooms out\u003C/span\u003E, hamda qanchalik tez. Sensorli panelda chimdish har doim barmoqlaringiz harakati yoʻnalishida kattalashtiradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVaraqni surish\u003C/strong\u003E: oʻrta tugma, oʻng tugma yoki ikkalasi. Boʻsh qogʻozda chapdan sudrash va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bilan sudrash har doim suradi; sudramasdan oʻng bosish har doim yoʻlni yoki konturni tugatadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E3D koʻrinishlarida sudrash\u003C/strong\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEach view&#039;s own\u003C/span\u003E 3D tekshiruv koʻrinishining tugmalarini saqlaydi (chap va oʻrta aylantiradi, oʻng suradi). Yoki oʻrta va oʻng tugmalarni aylantirish, surish, kattalashtirish yoki hech narsaga sozlang; tugma bilan \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E aylantirish va surishni almashtiradi. Chap tugma doim aylantiradi va tanlaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"o-zingiz-bilan-olib-yuring\"\u003EOʻzingiz bilan olib yuring\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E ishlatilayotgan uslubni kichik \u003Ccode\u003E.ccinput.json\u003C/code\u003E fayl sifatida saqlaydi; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport…\u003C/span\u003E uni boshqa kompyuterdan yoki hamkasbingizdan qoʻshadi. Import qilingan fayl faqat TakeoffDesk ning oʻz buyruqlariga ishora qilishi mumkin: undagi boshqa hamma narsa chiqarib tashlanadi va holat satrida sanaladi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDelete this style\u003C/span\u003E oʻzingizniki boʻlgan uslubni olib tashlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBu sozlamalar shu brauzerda qoladi. Uslub kartalari ostidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse this style in every app\u003C/span\u003E har bir ilovani mos uslubda ochadi (oʻz asboblar paneli, menyu paneli yoki lenta), har bir ilovada qilgan oʻzgarishlaringiz bilan. TakeoffDesk da buyruq qatori bilan uslub yoʻq: hamma ilova uchun biri tanlansa, TakeoffDesk oʻz asboblar panelini saqlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETakeoff ribbon\u003C/span\u003E shuningdek \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERibbon and project browser\u003C/span\u003E joylashuvining lentasi (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E): qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/workspace\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/workspace\"\u003ETakeoffDesk ekrani\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETegishli: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/keyboard\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/keyboard\"\u003EKlaviatura va sichqoncha\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/settings\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/settings\"\u003ETakeoffDesk sozlamalari\u003C/a\u003E · \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/coming-from\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/coming-from\"\u003EBoshqa hajmlar dasturlaridan kelish\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk buyruqlari qaysi usul bilan kirmang, bir xil. Menyu uslubi faqat ularning ekranda qayerda turishini, u yerda qanday atalishini va qaysi tugmalar ularni bajarishini belgilaydi. Uni Settings (Ctrl+,) › TakeoffDesk › Menus, keys and mouse boʻlimida tanlang; oʻzgarish darhol boʻladi va bu brauzer uni eslab qoladi. Uchta uslub Uslub Nima olasiz TakeoffDesk TakeoffDesk ning oʻz asboblar paneli: File, Export, Scale, Takeoff, Edit va View, bir harfli asbob tugmalari bilan. Boshlangʻich. Takeoff desk Menyu paneli (File, Edit, View, Scale, Takeoff, Items, Markup, Export) hajmlarni hisoblash asboblarining bir qatori ustida, ekrandagi hajmlar dasturlari oʻzlarini joylashtirgandek. Qatorda elementlar shartlar deb ataladi. Xuddi shu tugmalar, va yangi element uchun N qoʻshiladi. Masshtab tayyor sozlamalari varaqning masshtabi yonidagi varaq paneliga koʻchadi. Takeoff ribbon Ishga qarab nomlangan lenta yorliqlari: Takeoff (oʻlchash, shakl, masshtab, chizmadan, shartlar), Edit, View, Markup va Estimate (jadval kitobi, belgilangan PDF lar, taklif), File menyusi va ochish, saqlash, ortga qaytarish va qayta bajarish uchun tezkor qator bilan. Kun boʻyi ishlatiladigan asboblar katta, qoʻshnilari kichik va ustma-ust. Xuddi shu tugmalar; masshtab tayyor sozlamalari varaq panelida. Uchala uslub ham TakeoffDesk tugmalarini saqlaydi: V tanlash, L chiziqli, A maydon, O aylana, B xona, P yoʻl (PDF chiziqlarini tanlash), X kesik, C sanash, S avtosanash, K kalibrlash, D tekshirish, R yoy rejimi, E ayirish rejimi, F va W moslash uchun, 3 3D tekshiruv koʻrinishi, F3 tortish va Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+Y, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O, Ctrl+C, Ctrl+X, Ctrl+V, Ctrl+D, Ctrl+A. Varaq panelining asboblari (izohlar, bulutlar, ajratmalar, Solishtirish, 3D) PDF ochilgunicha kutadi; undan oldin tanlansa, holat satri buni aytadi. TakeoffDesk oʻz tartibiga tegishli, lekin uslubingiz boshqa buyruqqa bergan tugma hech narsa qilmaydi va holat satri uning buyrugʻi qayerga koʻchganini aytadi (\"Mening tugmalarim da, Sanash — Ctrl+Alt+C\"). Delete, Esc, Enter, Tab, Space va strelkalar doim oʻz maʼnosini saqlaydi. Chiziq yoki kontur chizayotganda, avtosanashni qoʻyayotganda yoki koʻrib chiqayotganda, harflar va yozilgan uzunlikning raqamlari chizma bilan qoladi. Oʻzingizniki qiling Xohlaganingizga eng yaqin uslubni tanlang, soʻng Customize… ni bosing. Keys and menus da buyruqni toping (qidiruv oynasi yordam beradi). Add a key ni bosing va tugmani bosing yoki ikki harfli tugma uchun ketma-ket ikki tugmani bosing. Tugmani olib tashlash uchun uni bosing. Menyu paneli bilan Where it sits buyruqni boshqa menyuga yoki Keys only ga koʻchiradi. Mouse da gʻildirakni va varaqni suradigan tugmalarni sozlang. Unga nom bering va Save ni bosing. Oʻrnatilgan uslubni saqlash oʻzingizning nusxangizni yaratadi (\"Mening hajmlar stolim\"); oʻrnatilgani hech qachon oʻzgarmaydi. Ikki buyruqqa berilgan tugma qizil rangda koʻrsatiladi va saqlashdan oldin tuzatilishi kerak. Sichqoncha Sichqoncha gʻildiragi: Scroll up zooms in (boshlangʻich) yoki Scroll up zooms out, hamda qanchalik tez. Sensorli panelda chimdish har doim barmoqlaringiz harakati yoʻnalishida kattalashtiradi. Varaqni surish: oʻrta tugma, oʻng tugma yoki ikkalasi. Boʻsh qogʻozda chapdan sudrash va Space bilan sudrash har doim suradi; sudramasdan oʻng bosish har doim yoʻlni yoki konturni tugatadi. 3D koʻrinishlarida sudrash: Each view's own 3D tekshiruv koʻrinishining tugmalarini saqlaydi (chap va oʻrta aylantiradi, oʻng suradi). Yoki oʻrta va oʻng tugmalarni aylantirish, surish, kattalashtirish yoki hech narsaga sozlang; tugma bilan Shift aylantirish va surishni almashtiradi. Chap tugma doim aylantiradi va tanlaydi. Oʻzingiz bilan olib yuring Export ishlatilayotgan uslubni kichik .ccinput.json fayl sifatida saqlaydi; Import… uni boshqa kompyuterdan yoki hamkasbingizdan qoʻshadi. Import qilingan fayl faqat TakeoffDesk ning oʻz buyruqlariga ishora qilishi mumkin: undagi boshqa hamma narsa chiqarib tashlanadi va holat satrida sanaladi. Delete this style oʻzingizniki boʻlgan uslubni olib tashlaydi. Bu sozlamalar shu brauzerda qoladi. Uslub kartalari ostidagi Use this style in every app har bir ilovani mos uslubda ochadi (oʻz asboblar paneli, menyu paneli yoki lenta), har bir ilovada qilgan oʻzgarishlaringiz bilan. TakeoffDesk da buyruq qatori bilan uslub yoʻq: hamma ilova uchun biri tanlansa, TakeoffDesk oʻz asboblar panelini saqlaydi. Takeoff ribbon shuningdek Ribbon and project browser joylashuvining lentasi (Settings › Global › Layout): qarang: TakeoffDesk ekrani. Tegishli: Klaviatura va sichqoncha · TakeoffDesk sozlamalari · Boshqa hajmlar dasturlaridan kelish","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"keyboard","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Klaviatura va sichqoncha","summary":"TakeoffDesk dagi har bir tugma, sichqoncha, sensorli panel va sensorli ekran harakati, guruhlangan holda, platformalar farqlari bilan.","section":"reference","order":10,"keywords":["tugmalar","yorliqlar","tezkor tugmalar","klaviatura","sichqoncha","sensorli panel","sensorli ekran","surish","kattalashtirish","gʻildirak","oʻng tugma","ikki marta bosish","Space","Shift","nusxalash","qoʻyish","kesish","dublikat","hammasini tanlash"],"headings":[{"id":"asboblar","text":"Asboblar","level":2},{"id":"chizish-paytida","text":"Chizish paytida","level":2},{"id":"tanlash-va-tahrirlash","text":"Tanlash va tahrirlash","level":2},{"id":"nusxalash-va-qo-yish","text":"Nusxalash va qoʻyish","level":2},{"id":"fayllar","text":"Fayllar","level":2},{"id":"ko-rinish-va-varaqlar","text":"Koʻrinish va varaqlar","level":2},{"id":"3d-ko-rinish","text":"3D koʻrinish","level":2},{"id":"avtosanash","text":"Avtosanash","level":2},{"id":"yordam","text":"Yordam","level":2},{"id":"dialoglar-va-maydonlar","text":"Dialoglar va maydonlar","level":2},{"id":"platforma-izohlari","text":"Platforma izohlari","level":2},{"id":"brauzer-saqlaydigan-tugmalar","text":"Brauzer saqlaydigan tugmalar","level":2},{"id":"ko-chirish-buyrug-i-qayerda","text":"Koʻchirish buyrugʻi qayerda","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EHarf tugmalari kursor sahifaning istalgan joyida boʻlganda va siz maydonga matn kiritmayotganingizda ishlaydi. Dialog oynasi ochiq boʻlsa, uning oʻz tugmalari ishlaydi. Harflar \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bilan yoki unisiz ishlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"asboblar\"\u003EAsboblar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETugma\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EAsbob\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"L\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EL\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"O\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EO\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECircle\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"B\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EB\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERoom\u003C/span\u003E (xonani bitta bosish bilan toʻldirish)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"R\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ER\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArc\u003C/span\u003E yoqish yoki oʻchirish (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELinear\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E da)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"E\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EE\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeduct\u003C/span\u003E yoqish yoki oʻchirish: yoʻlning keyingi kesmalari chiziladi, lekin hisobga olinmaydi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChizish paytida raqam, \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E yoki \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EType\u003C/span\u003E maydonini oching: uzunlik yoki koordinatalarni yozing, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nuqtani qoʻyadi (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/measure-linear#type-lengths-and-coordinates\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/measure-linear\" data-hash=\"type-lengths-and-coordinates\"\u003EChiziqli yoʻllarni oʻlchash\u003C/a\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E (avval maydonni tanlang)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"S\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ES\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"K\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EK\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasshtabni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chizish-paytida\"\u003EChizish paytida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETugma yoki harakat\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVazifasi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBosish\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqta qoʻyish (sanash bilan nuqta).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"P\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EP\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYoʻl: PDF chizigʻining butun ulangan yoʻlini yoki bosilgan joy atrofidagi konturni tanlang (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/pick-the-lines\"\u003EPDF chiziqlarini tanlash\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChizma chiziqlariga tortishni yoqish yoki oʻchirish (\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/snap-to-the-drawing\"\u003EChizma chiziqlariga tortish\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bosib turilganda bosish\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKesmani oxirgi nuqtadan 0°, 45°, 90° yoki 135° ga tortadi. Yoy nuqtalari va aylanalar uchun emas.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkki marta bosish\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYoʻlni tugatish, yoki maydon yoki kesikni yopish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYoʻlni tugatish, yoki maydon yoki kesikni yopish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOʻng tugma bosish (siljitmasdan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYoʻlni tugatish, yoki maydon yoki kesikni yopish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBirinchi nuqtani bosish\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaydon yoki kesikni yopish (uchinchi nuqtadan boshlab).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOxirgi nuqtani olib tashlash (avval kutilayotgan yoy nuqtasi).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKutilayotgan yoy nuqtasini tashlash; keyin tugallanmagan belgini bekor qilish; keyin \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E ga qaytish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tanlash-va-tahrirlash\"\u003ETanlash va tahrirlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETugma yoki harakat\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVazifasi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBelgini bosish (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E asbobi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUni tanlash va uning elementini joriy qilish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBelgini \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + bosish\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETanlovga qoʻshish yoki undan olib tashlash.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOchiq varaqdagi har bir belgini tanlash.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBurchak dastagini sudrash\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShu nuqtani siljitish (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E 45° ga tortadi). Bitta belgi tanlanganda ishlaydi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETanlangan belgilarni oʻchirish (chizmayotganda emas).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHech narsani tanlamaslik: tanlovni va tekshiruv chizigʻini tozalash.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOrtga qaytarish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Y\"\u003E⌘Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Y\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command Z\"\u003E⇧⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayta bajarish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nusxalash-va-qo-yish\"\u003ENusxalash va qoʻyish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETugma\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVazifasi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command C\"\u003E⌘C\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+C\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETanlangan belgilarni elementlari bilan nusxalash.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command X\"\u003E⌘X\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+X\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKesish: tanlangan belgilarni nusxalash, soʻng ularni oʻchirish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command V\"\u003E⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoʻyish: nusxa kursorga ergashadi; joyini bosing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift Command V\"\u003E⇧⌘V\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+V\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJoyida qoʻyish: ochiq varaqdagi oʻsha joyga.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command D\"\u003E⌘D\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+D\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETanlangan belgilarni dublikatlash: nusxa kursorga ergashadi; joyini bosing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHech narsa qoʻymaslik: kursorda turgan qoʻyish yoki dublikatni bekor qilish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHarflarning oʻzi hamon asboblarni tanlaydi (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"C\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EC\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E — \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECount\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"D\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ED\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E — \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECheck\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E — \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECut-out\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E — \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESelect\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"A\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EA\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E — \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E); faqat ular bilan \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E nusxalaydi va qoʻyadi. Matn maydonida bu tugmalar odatdagidek matnni nusxalaydi va qoʻyadi. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003EBelgilarni nusxalash, qoʻyish va dublikatlash\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-warning\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003EWarning\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChizmayotganingizda \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tanlangan belgini oʻchiradi. Tasodifan shunday boʻlsa, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uni qaytaradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fayllar\"\u003EFayllar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETugma\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVazifasi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOpen plans\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBu ikkisi maydonga yozayotganingizda ham ishlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ko-rinish-va-varaqlar\"\u003EKoʻrinish va varaqlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETugma yoki harakat\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVazifasi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESichqoncha gʻildiragi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKursor joyida kattalashtirish va kichraytirish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESudrash (chap, oʻrta yoki oʻng tugma)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESurish. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E da chapdan sudrash oʻrniga qidiruv oynasini chizadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bosib turib sudrash\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIstalgan asbobda surish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit page\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit width\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"=\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E=\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoʻrinish oʻrtasida kattalashtirish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoʻrinish oʻrtasida kichraytirish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↓\"\u003Efn ↓\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Down\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E / \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ↑\"\u003Efn ↑\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EPage Up\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVaraqlar roʻyxatida keyingi yoki oldingi varaq.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EToʻliq ekran rejimlarini almashtirish (har bir platformada Control, Mac da ham).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBu yordamni ochish yoki yopish, yon panel.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVaraqning 3D tekshiruv koʻrinishi, yoqish yoki oʻchirish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-ko-rinish\"\u003E3D koʻrinish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETugma yoki harakat\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVazifasi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESudrash yoki oʻrta tugma bilan sudrash\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAylantirish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + sudrash yoki oʻng tugma bilan sudrash\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESurish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESichqoncha gʻildiragi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKursor joyida kattalashtirish. Sensorli panelda ikki barmoq surish aylantiradi, chimdish kattalashtiradi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBosish\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKursor ostidagi belgini tanlash (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + bosish qoʻshadi yoki olib tashlaydi).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"W\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EW\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHammasini koʻrsatish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYassi varaqqa qaytish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/check-in-3d\"\u003EHajmlarni 3D da tekshirish\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"avtosanash\"\u003EAvtosanash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETugma yoki harakat\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVazifasi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuti sudrash\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQidiriladigan belgini quti bilan belgilash (qidiruvni boshlaydi).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoslik qutisini bosish\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUni rad etish yoki tiklash.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIshlayotgan qidiruvni bekor qilish yoki koʻrib chiqishni bekor qilish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yordam\"\u003EYordam\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETugma\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVazifasi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYordam panelini ochish yoki yopish (ilova panelidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E tugmasi ham). U har bir asbobda ishlaydi, maydonga yozayotganda ham.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYordam panelini yopish. Uning qidiruv oynasida birinchi \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E qidiruvni tozalaydi. Panel ochiq boʻlganda, varaqni bosgandan keyin bosilgan \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E avval panelni yopadi; TakeoffDesk da bekor qilish uchun yana bosing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoʻpgina Mac klaviaturalarida yuqori qator yorqinlik va ovozni boshqaradi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uchun fn ni bosing yoki Tizim sozlamalari boʻlimida, Keyboard ostida &quot;Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys&quot; ni yoqing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dialoglar-va-maydonlar\"\u003EDialoglar va maydonlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETugma\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EVazifasi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaydonda: qiymatni qoʻllash. Kalibrlash dialogida: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESet the scale\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDialogni yopish (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECancel\u003C/span\u003E kabi); \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew item\u003C/span\u003E shaklini yopish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKeyingi maydonga oʻtish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"platforma-izohlari\"\u003EPlatforma izohlari\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E — Command tugmasi: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. Toʻliq ekran istisno: Control+Shift+F.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOʻng tugma bosish — sensorli panelda ikki barmoq bosish; buning uchun Tizim sozlamalari, Trackpad boʻlimida ikkilamchi bosish yoqilgan boʻlishi kerak. TakeoffDesk faqat ikkilamchi tugmani oʻqiydi; Control-bosish oddiy bosish sifatida hisoblanib, nuqta qoʻshishi mumkin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESensorli panelda ikki barmoq aylantirish varaqni kattalashtiradi (u aylanmaydi). Surish uchun bosib sudrang yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni ushlab sudrang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPage Up va Page Down — klaviaturada boʻlmaganda fn bilan yuqori va pastki strelkalar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E — delete deb yozilgan tugma.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E — Ctrl: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command O\"\u003E⌘O\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+O\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENoutbuk sensorli panelida ikki barmoq aylantirish varaqni kattalashtiradi. Surish uchun bosib sudrang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ELinux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command\"\u003E⌘\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E — Ctrl. Baʼzi ish stollari oʻz Ctrl+Alt yoki Super yorliqlaridan foydalanadi; TakeoffDesk ularning hech birini ishlatmaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESensorli panelda ikki barmoq aylantirish varaqni kattalashtiradi. Surish uchun bosib sudrang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk sensorli ekranni bitta kursor sifatida oʻqiydi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETeginish nuqta qoʻyadi, belgini tanlaydi yoki sanash nuqtasini qoʻshadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBitta barmoq bilan sudrash varaqni suradi (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/span\u003E da qidiruv qutisini chizadi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChimdib kattalashtirish hali qoʻllab-quvvatlanmaydi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit page\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit width\u003C/span\u003E dan foydalaning yoki klaviaturada \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMaydonni yopish uchun birinchi nuqtasiga teging. Yoʻlni tugatish uchun, brauzeringiz ikki marta teginishni ikki marta bosishga aylantiradigan joyda ikki marta teging yoki klaviaturada \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETeginmaguncha jonli uzunlik koʻrsatkichi yoʻq, chunki kursor ustida turish yoʻq.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHozircha hajmlarni hisoblash uchun klaviatura va sichqoncha yoki sensorli panel yaxshiroq.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"brauzer-saqlaydigan-tugmalar\"\u003EBrauzer saqlaydigan tugmalar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBrauzerlar baʼzi yorliqlarni oʻzlari uchun saqlaydi, va sahifa ulardan foydalana olmaydi: yorliqni yopish (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), yangi yorliq yoki oyna (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) va brauzer kattalashtirish (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command −\"\u003E⌘−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E). Shu sababli TakeoffDesk varaqni gʻildirak va oddiy \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E hamda \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E tugmalari bilan kattalashtiradi. Agar \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni tasodifan bossangiz, butun sahifa kattalashadi; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command 0\"\u003E⌘0\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+0\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uni qaytaradi. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EKlaviatura, sichqoncha va sensorli panellar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ko-chirish-buyrug-i-qayerda\"\u003EKoʻchirish buyrugʻi qayerda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoʻchirish buyrugʻi yoʻq: sanash nuqtasini tanlab sudrang, yoki maydon yoki chiziqni tanlab, uning burchak dastaklarini sudrang.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Harf tugmalari kursor sahifaning istalgan joyida boʻlganda va siz maydonga matn kiritmayotganingizda ishlaydi. Dialog oynasi ochiq boʻlsa, uning oʻz tugmalari ishlaydi. Harflar Shift bilan yoki unisiz ishlaydi. Asboblar Tugma Asbob V Select L Linear A Area O Circle B Room (xonani bitta bosish bilan toʻldirish) R Arc yoqish yoki oʻchirish (Linear, Area va Cut-out da) E Deduct yoqish yoki oʻchirish: yoʻlning keyingi kesmalari chiziladi, lekin hisobga olinmaydi Chizish paytida raqam, @ yoki # Type maydonini oching: uzunlik yoki koordinatalarni yozing, Enter nuqtani qoʻyadi (Chiziqli yoʻllarni oʻlchash) X Cut-out (avval maydonni tanlang) C Count S Auto count K Calibrate D Masshtabni Check Chizish paytida Tugma yoki harakat Vazifasi Bosish Nuqta qoʻyish (sanash bilan nuqta). P Yoʻl: PDF chizigʻining butun ulangan yoʻlini yoki bosilgan joy atrofidagi konturni tanlang (PDF chiziqlarini tanlash). F3 Chizma chiziqlariga tortishni yoqish yoki oʻchirish (Chizma chiziqlariga tortish). Shift bosib turilganda bosish Kesmani oxirgi nuqtadan 0°, 45°, 90° yoki 135° ga tortadi. Yoy nuqtalari va aylanalar uchun emas. Ikki marta bosish Yoʻlni tugatish, yoki maydon yoki kesikni yopish. Enter Yoʻlni tugatish, yoki maydon yoki kesikni yopish. Oʻng tugma bosish (siljitmasdan) Yoʻlni tugatish, yoki maydon yoki kesikni yopish. Birinchi nuqtani bosish Maydon yoki kesikni yopish (uchinchi nuqtadan boshlab). Backspace yoki Delete Oxirgi nuqtani olib tashlash (avval kutilayotgan yoy nuqtasi). Esc Kutilayotgan yoy nuqtasini tashlash; keyin tugallanmagan belgini bekor qilish; keyin Select ga qaytish. Tanlash va tahrirlash Tugma yoki harakat Vazifasi Belgini bosish (Select asbobi) Uni tanlash va uning elementini joriy qilish. Belgini Shift + bosish Tanlovga qoʻshish yoki undan olib tashlash. Ctrl+A Ochiq varaqdagi har bir belgini tanlash. Burchak dastagini sudrash Shu nuqtani siljitish (Shift 45° ga tortadi). Bitta belgi tanlanganda ishlaydi. Delete yoki Backspace Tanlangan belgilarni oʻchirish (chizmayotganda emas). Esc Hech narsani tanlamaslik: tanlovni va tekshiruv chizigʻini tozalash. Ctrl+Z Ortga qaytarish. Ctrl+Y yoki Ctrl+Shift+Z Qayta bajarish. Nusxalash va qoʻyish Tugma Vazifasi Ctrl+C Tanlangan belgilarni elementlari bilan nusxalash. Ctrl+X Kesish: tanlangan belgilarni nusxalash, soʻng ularni oʻchirish. Ctrl+V Qoʻyish: nusxa kursorga ergashadi; joyini bosing. Ctrl+Shift+V Joyida qoʻyish: ochiq varaqdagi oʻsha joyga. Ctrl+D Tanlangan belgilarni dublikatlash: nusxa kursorga ergashadi; joyini bosing. Esc Hech narsa qoʻymaslik: kursorda turgan qoʻyish yoki dublikatni bekor qilish. Harflarning oʻzi hamon asboblarni tanlaydi (C — Count, D — Check, X — Cut-out, V — Select, A — Area); faqat ular bilan Ctrl nusxalaydi va qoʻyadi. Matn maydonida bu tugmalar odatdagidek matnni nusxalaydi va qoʻyadi. Qarang: Belgilarni nusxalash, qoʻyish va dublikatlash. Chizmayotganingizda Backspace tanlangan belgini oʻchiradi. Tasodifan shunday boʻlsa, Ctrl+Z uni qaytaradi. Fayllar Tugma Vazifasi Ctrl+O Open plans Ctrl+S Save takeoff Bu ikkisi maydonga yozayotganingizda ham ishlaydi. Koʻrinish va varaqlar Tugma yoki harakat Vazifasi Sichqoncha gʻildiragi Kursor joyida kattalashtirish va kichraytirish. Sudrash (chap, oʻrta yoki oʻng tugma) Surish. Auto count da chapdan sudrash oʻrniga qidiruv oynasini chizadi. Space bosib turib sudrash Istalgan asbobda surish. F Fit page W Fit width + yoki = Koʻrinish oʻrtasida kattalashtirish. − Koʻrinish oʻrtasida kichraytirish. Page Down / Page Up Varaqlar roʻyxatida keyingi yoki oldingi varaq. Ctrl+Shift+F Toʻliq ekran rejimlarini almashtirish (har bir platformada Control, Mac da ham). F1 Bu yordamni ochish yoki yopish, yon panel. 3 Varaqning 3D tekshiruv koʻrinishi, yoqish yoki oʻchirish. 3D koʻrinish Tugma yoki harakat Vazifasi Sudrash yoki oʻrta tugma bilan sudrash Aylantirish. Shift + sudrash yoki oʻng tugma bilan sudrash Surish. Sichqoncha gʻildiragi Kursor joyida kattalashtirish. Sensorli panelda ikki barmoq surish aylantiradi, chimdish kattalashtiradi. Bosish Kursor ostidagi belgini tanlash (Shift + bosish qoʻshadi yoki olib tashlaydi). F yoki W Hammasini koʻrsatish. 3 Yassi varaqqa qaytish. Qarang: Hajmlarni 3D da tekshirish. Avtosanash Tugma yoki harakat Vazifasi Quti sudrash Qidiriladigan belgini quti bilan belgilash (qidiruvni boshlaydi). Moslik qutisini bosish Uni rad etish yoki tiklash. Esc Ishlayotgan qidiruvni bekor qilish yoki koʻrib chiqishni bekor qilish. Yordam Tugma Vazifasi F1 Yordam panelini ochish yoki yopish (ilova panelidagi Help tugmasi ham). U har bir asbobda ishlaydi, maydonga yozayotganda ham. Esc Yordam panelini yopish. Uning qidiruv oynasida birinchi Esc qidiruvni tozalaydi. Panel ochiq boʻlganda, varaqni bosgandan keyin bosilgan Esc avval panelni yopadi; TakeoffDesk da bekor qilish uchun yana bosing. Koʻpgina Mac klaviaturalarida yuqori qator yorqinlik va ovozni boshqaradi. F1 uchun fn ni bosing yoki Tizim sozlamalari boʻlimida, Keyboard ostida \"Use F1, F2, etc. keys as standard function keys\" ni yoqing. Dialoglar va maydonlar Tugma Vazifasi Enter Maydonda: qiymatni qoʻllash. Kalibrlash dialogida: Set the scale. Esc Dialogni yopish (Cancel kabi); New item shaklini yopish. Tab Keyingi maydonga oʻtish. Platforma izohlari Ctrl — Command tugmasi: Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O. Toʻliq ekran istisno: Control+Shift+F. Oʻng tugma bosish — sensorli panelda ikki barmoq bosish; buning uchun Tizim sozlamalari, Trackpad boʻlimida ikkilamchi bosish yoqilgan boʻlishi kerak. TakeoffDesk faqat ikkilamchi tugmani oʻqiydi; Control-bosish oddiy bosish sifatida hisoblanib, nuqta qoʻshishi mumkin. Sensorli panelda ikki barmoq aylantirish varaqni kattalashtiradi (u aylanmaydi). Surish uchun bosib sudrang yoki Space ni ushlab sudrang. Page Up va Page Down — klaviaturada boʻlmaganda fn bilan yuqori va pastki strelkalar. Backspace — delete deb yozilgan tugma. Ctrl — Ctrl: Ctrl+Z, Ctrl+S, Ctrl+O. Noutbuk sensorli panelida ikki barmoq aylantirish varaqni kattalashtiradi. Surish uchun bosib sudrang. Ctrl — Ctrl. Baʼzi ish stollari oʻz Ctrl+Alt yoki Super yorliqlaridan foydalanadi; TakeoffDesk ularning hech birini ishlatmaydi. Sensorli panelda ikki barmoq aylantirish varaqni kattalashtiradi. Surish uchun bosib sudrang. TakeoffDesk sensorli ekranni bitta kursor sifatida oʻqiydi: Teginish nuqta qoʻyadi, belgini tanlaydi yoki sanash nuqtasini qoʻshadi. Bitta barmoq bilan sudrash varaqni suradi (Auto count da qidiruv qutisini chizadi). Chimdib kattalashtirish hali qoʻllab-quvvatlanmaydi. Fit page va Fit width dan foydalaning yoki klaviaturada + va −. Maydonni yopish uchun birinchi nuqtasiga teging. Yoʻlni tugatish uchun, brauzeringiz ikki marta teginishni ikki marta bosishga aylantiradigan joyda ikki marta teging yoki klaviaturada Enter ni bosing. Teginmaguncha jonli uzunlik koʻrsatkichi yoʻq, chunki kursor ustida turish yoʻq. Hozircha hajmlarni hisoblash uchun klaviatura va sichqoncha yoki sensorli panel yaxshiroq. Brauzer saqlaydigan tugmalar Brauzerlar baʼzi yorliqlarni oʻzlari uchun saqlaydi, va sahifa ulardan foydalana olmaydi: yorliqni yopish (Ctrl+W), yangi yorliq yoki oyna (Ctrl+T, Ctrl+N) va brauzer kattalashtirish (Ctrl++, Ctrl+−). Shu sababli TakeoffDesk varaqni gʻildirak va oddiy + hamda − tugmalari bilan kattalashtiradi. Agar Ctrl++ ni tasodifan bossangiz, butun sahifa kattalashadi; Ctrl+0 uni qaytaradi. Qarang: Klaviatura, sichqoncha va sensorli panellar. Koʻchirish buyrugʻi qayerda Koʻchirish buyrugʻi yoʻq: sanash nuqtasini tanlab sudrang, yoki maydon yoki chiziqni tanlab, uning burchak dastaklarini sudrang.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"entry-formats","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Uzunlik, stavka va foizni kiritish","summary":"Masofalar, balandliklar, pul stavkalari va chiqindi foizlari uchun nima kiritish mumkinligi, misollar hamda TakeoffDesk oʻqiy olmagan kirish uchun xabarlar.","section":"reference","order":20,"keywords":["kiritish","format","futlar dyuymlar","kasrlar","oʻnlik fut","metrik","metrlar","millimetrlar","stavka","pul","dollar","foiz","chiqindi","yozish"],"headings":[{"id":"uzunliklar","text":"Uzunliklar","level":2},{"id":"hisoblash","text":"Hisoblash","level":3},{"id":"uzunliklar-qanday-ko-rsatiladi","text":"Uzunliklar qanday koʻrsatiladi","level":2},{"id":"stavkalar-material-va-mehnat-birlik-narxi","text":"Stavkalar (material va mehnat birlik narxi)","level":2},{"id":"chiqindi-foizi","text":"Chiqindi foizi","level":2},{"id":"nomlar-va-birliklar","text":"Nomlar va birliklar","level":2},{"id":"formulalar","text":"Formulalar","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"uzunliklar\"\u003EUzunliklar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFoydalaniladi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECalibrate\u003C/span\u003E ichidagi \u003Cstrong\u003EHaqiqiy masofa\u003C/strong\u003E va element tahrirlagichidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHeight\u003C/span\u003E hamda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDepth\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKiritasiz\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBu degani\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24 fut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24 fut 6½ dyuym\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12 fut 6½ dyuym (chiziqcha oʻrniga boʻshliq)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6-1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12 fut 6½ dyuym (qismlar orasidagi chiziqchalar)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24 fut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E30&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E30 dyuym\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E6½ dyuym\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E¾ dyuym\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24 fut 6 dyuym (shuningdek \u003Ccode\u003Efoot\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Efeet\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Einch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Einches\u003C/code\u003E)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24.5\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24.5 standart birlikda (quyida)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E24.5&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E24.5 fut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7.5 metr\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E750 cm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E750 santimetr\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7500 mm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7,500 millimetr\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOddiy son \u003Cstrong\u003Ekalibrlash\u003C/strong\u003E uchun va LF, SF yoki SY dagi elementlar uchun \u003Cstrong\u003Efutlarda\u003C/strong\u003E, m yoki m² dagi elementlar uchun \u003Cstrong\u003Emetrlarda\u003C/strong\u003E hisoblanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESoʻz protsessorlaridan kelgan egri qoʻshtirnoqlar va tuzatish belgilari (′ ″ ’ ”) \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E va \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;\u003C/code\u003E kabi ishlaydi. Ikkita apostrof \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;&#039;\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;\u003C/code\u003E deb hisoblanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVergullar eʼtiborga olinmaydi: \u003Ccode\u003E1,200 mm\u003C/code\u003E bu 1200 mm.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKasrlarda ikki tomonda ham butun sonlar boʻlishi kerak: \u003Ccode\u003E6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ishlaydi, \u003Ccode\u003E6.5 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E ishlamaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENol va manfiy masofalar qabul qilinmaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXabarlar:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Masofani kiriting, masalan 24&#039;-0&quot; yoki 7.5 m.&quot; (maydon boʻsh)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Noldan katta masofani kiriting.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Futlar va dyuymlar (24&#039;-6 1/2&quot;), oʻnlik futlar, m, cm yoki mm dan foydalaning.&quot; (nomaʼlum birlik)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Bu masofani oʻqib boʻlmadi. 24&#039;-6 1/2&quot; yoki 24.5 kabi kiritib koʻring.&quot;\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EElement balandligini yoki chuqurligini tozalash uchun maydonni boʻshating.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"hisoblash\"\u003EHisoblash\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir uzunlik maydoni, shuningdek chizish paytidagi kiritish qutisi \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E/\u003C/code\u003E va qavslar bilan hisoblashni ham qabul qiladi: \u003Ccode\u003E4+7/16\u003C/code\u003E (standart birlikda 4.4375 dyuym), \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E(24&#039;-0&quot;)/3\u003C/code\u003E (8 fut), \u003Ccode\u003E2*450mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUzunlikka yozilgan chiziqcha hamon uning bir qismi: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E bu 24 fut 6 dyuym, \u003Ccode\u003E6-1/2\u003C/code\u003E esa 6½. Ayirish uchun chiziqcha atrofiga boʻshliq qoʻying: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039; - 6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E bu 23&#039;-6&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOddiy son uzunlikni son sifatida koʻpaytiradi yoki boʻladi; uzunlikka qoʻshilsa, standart birlikda hisoblanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eabs\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eround\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E va \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E ham ishlaydi. Oʻqib boʻlmaydigan hisoblash, xato qayerda yuz berganini koʻrsatib, rad etiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"uzunliklar-qanday-ko-rsatiladi\"\u003EUzunliklar qanday koʻrsatiladi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUzunliklar futlar, dyuymlar va 1/16 dyuymlarda koʻrsatiladi: \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E0&#039;-0 3/4&quot;\u003C/code\u003E. Qiymatlar koʻrsatish uchun eng yaqin 1/16 dyuymgacha yaxlitlanadi; miqdorlarning oʻzi yaxlitlanmaydi. Oʻnlik qiymatlar ikki oʻnlik xona va minglik ajratgichlar bilan koʻrsatiladi, masalan \u003Ccode\u003E1,234.50 LF\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"stavkalar-material-va-mehnat-birlik-narxi\"\u003EStavkalar (material va mehnat birlik narxi)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKiritasiz\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBu degani\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12.5\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$12.50\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E$12.50\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$12.50\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1,250\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$1,250.00\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E0.385\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$0.385 (toʻrt oʻnlik xonagacha; undan koʻpi yaxlitlanadi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(boʻsh)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E$0\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EXabar: &quot;Miqdorni 12.50 kabi kiriting.&quot; yoki &quot;Bu miqdor juda katta.&quot; Manfiy stavkalar qabul qilinmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHisoblangan summalar (material, mehnat, jami) sentgacha hisoblanadi: chiqindili miqdor × stavka, nolidan uzoqqa qarab yarim yaxlitlanadi, xuddi elektron jadvaldagi \u003Ccode\u003EROUND(x, 2)\u003C/code\u003E kabi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"chiqindi-foizi\"\u003EChiqindi foizi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EKiritasiz\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBu degani\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E7.5%\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E7.5%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(boʻsh)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E0%\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkki oʻnlik xonagacha, 0% dan 1000% gacha. Xabarlar: &quot;Foizni 10 yoki 7.5 kabi kiriting.&quot; yoki &quot;1000% dan katta chiqindiga ruxsat berilmaydi.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nomlar-va-birliklar\"\u003ENomlar va birliklar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EElement va komponent nomlari: 200 belgigacha.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKomponentning \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnit\u003C/span\u003Ei: 20 belgigacha istalgan matn, masalan \u003Ccode\u003EEA\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Esheets\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003ECY\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Egal\u003C/code\u003E. Bu faqat belgi; TakeoffDesk uni aylantirmaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"formulalar\"\u003EFormulalar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYigʻma formulalarining oʻz qoidalari bor: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\"\u003EFormula tili\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Uzunliklar Foydalaniladi: Calibrate ichidagi Haqiqiy masofa va element tahrirlagichidagi Height hamda Depth. Kiritasiz Bu degani 24'-0\" 24 fut 24'-6 1/2\" 24 fut 6½ dyuym 12' 6 1/2\" 12 fut 6½ dyuym (chiziqcha oʻrniga boʻshliq) 12'-6-1/2\" 12 fut 6½ dyuym (qismlar orasidagi chiziqchalar) 24' 24 fut 30\" 30 dyuym 6 1/2\" 6½ dyuym 3/4\" ¾ dyuym 24 ft 6 in 24 fut 6 dyuym (shuningdek foot, feet, inch, inches) 24.5 24.5 standart birlikda (quyida) 24.5' 24.5 fut 7.5 m 7.5 metr 750 cm 750 santimetr 7500 mm 7,500 millimetr Oddiy son kalibrlash uchun va LF, SF yoki SY dagi elementlar uchun futlarda, m yoki m² dagi elementlar uchun metrlarda hisoblanadi. Soʻz protsessorlaridan kelgan egri qoʻshtirnoqlar va tuzatish belgilari (′ ″ ’ ”) ' va \" kabi ishlaydi. Ikkita apostrof '' \" deb hisoblanadi. Vergullar eʼtiborga olinmaydi: 1,200 mm bu 1200 mm. Kasrlarda ikki tomonda ham butun sonlar boʻlishi kerak: 6 1/2\" ishlaydi, 6.5 1/2\" ishlamaydi. Nol va manfiy masofalar qabul qilinmaydi. Xabarlar: \"Masofani kiriting, masalan 24'-0\" yoki 7.5 m.\" (maydon boʻsh) \"Noldan katta masofani kiriting.\" \"Futlar va dyuymlar (24'-6 1/2\"), oʻnlik futlar, m, cm yoki mm dan foydalaning.\" (nomaʼlum birlik) \"Bu masofani oʻqib boʻlmadi. 24'-6 1/2\" yoki 24.5 kabi kiritib koʻring.\" Element balandligini yoki chuqurligini tozalash uchun maydonni boʻshating. Hisoblash Har bir uzunlik maydoni, shuningdek chizish paytidagi kiritish qutisi +, -, *, / va qavslar bilan hisoblashni ham qabul qiladi: 4+7/16 (standart birlikda 4.4375 dyuym), 12'6\" + 3/4\", (24'-0\")/3 (8 fut), 2*450mm. Uzunlikka yozilgan chiziqcha hamon uning bir qismi: 24'-6\" bu 24 fut 6 dyuym, 6-1/2 esa 6½. Ayirish uchun chiziqcha atrofiga boʻshliq qoʻying: 24' - 6\" bu 23'-6\". Oddiy son uzunlikni son sifatida koʻpaytiradi yoki boʻladi; uzunlikka qoʻshilsa, standart birlikda hisoblanadi. abs, round, ceil va floor ham ishlaydi. Oʻqib boʻlmaydigan hisoblash, xato qayerda yuz berganini koʻrsatib, rad etiladi. Uzunliklar qanday koʻrsatiladi Uzunliklar futlar, dyuymlar va 1/16 dyuymlarda koʻrsatiladi: 12'-6 1/2\", 0'-0 3/4\". Qiymatlar koʻrsatish uchun eng yaqin 1/16 dyuymgacha yaxlitlanadi; miqdorlarning oʻzi yaxlitlanmaydi. Oʻnlik qiymatlar ikki oʻnlik xona va minglik ajratgichlar bilan koʻrsatiladi, masalan 1,234.50 LF. Stavkalar (material va mehnat birlik narxi) Kiritasiz Bu degani 12.5 $12.50 $12.50 $12.50 1,250 $1,250.00 0.385 $0.385 (toʻrt oʻnlik xonagacha; undan koʻpi yaxlitlanadi) (boʻsh) $0 Xabar: \"Miqdorni 12.50 kabi kiriting.\" yoki \"Bu miqdor juda katta.\" Manfiy stavkalar qabul qilinmaydi. Hisoblangan summalar (material, mehnat, jami) sentgacha hisoblanadi: chiqindili miqdor × stavka, nolidan uzoqqa qarab yarim yaxlitlanadi, xuddi elektron jadvaldagi ROUND(x, 2) kabi. Chiqindi foizi Kiritasiz Bu degani 10 10% 7.5% 7.5% (boʻsh) 0% Ikki oʻnlik xonagacha, 0% dan 1000% gacha. Xabarlar: \"Foizni 10 yoki 7.5 kabi kiriting.\" yoki \"1000% dan katta chiqindiga ruxsat berilmaydi.\" Nomlar va birliklar Element va komponent nomlari: 200 belgigacha. Komponentning Uniti: 20 belgigacha istalgan matn, masalan EA, sheets, CY, gal. Bu faqat belgi; TakeoffDesk uni aylantirmaydi. Formulalar Yigʻma formulalarining oʻz qoidalari bor: Formula tili ga qarang.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"scale-presets","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Masshtab oldindan oʻrnatmalari","summary":"{{ui:Oldindan oʻrnatilgan}} roʻyxatidagi har bir oldindan oʻrnatma — arxitektura, muhandislik va metrik — va har biri PDF haqida nimani taxmin qilishi.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["masshtab","oldindan oʻrnatmalar","arxitektura masshtabi","muhandislik masshtabi","metrik masshtab","nisbat","1/4 dyuym","1/8 dyuym","1:100","haqiqiy oʻlcham"],"headings":[{"id":"arxitektura","text":"Arxitektura","level":2},{"id":"muhandislik","text":"Muhandislik","level":2},{"id":"metrik","text":"Metrik","level":2},{"id":"hisoblangan-masshtablar","text":"Hisoblangan masshtablar","level":2},{"id":"oddiy-bo-lmagan-pdf-lar","text":"Oddiy boʻlmagan PDF lar","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMasshtab\u003C/span\u003E guruhidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOldindan oʻrnatilgan\u003C/span\u003E roʻyxatida uch guruhga boʻlingan 32 ta masshtab bor. Oldindan oʻrnatma ochiq varaqning masshtabini aniq belgilaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir oldindan oʻrnatma PDF sahifa chizmaning haqiqiy qogʻoz oʻlchami ekanini taxmin qiladi: PDF sahifasida bir dyuym qogʻozda bir dyuym (PDF sahifalari dyuymiga 72 ball). Agar PDF oʻlchami oʻzgartirilgan boʻlsa, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibrlash\u003C/span\u003E dan foydalaning. Har qanday masshtab oʻrnatgandan keyin \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETekshirish\u003C/span\u003E dan foydalaning. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EMasshtabni oʻrnatish\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arxitektura\"\u003EArxitektura\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOldindan oʻrnatma\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQogʻozda bir dyuym\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16 fut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/32&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10 fut 8 dyuym\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E8 fut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/16&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E5 fut 4 dyuym\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4 fut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/8&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 fut 8 dyuym\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E2 fut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 fut 4 dyuym\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E1 fut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 1/2&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E8 dyuym\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E4 dyuym\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"muhandislik\"\u003EMuhandislik\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOldindan oʻrnatma\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EQogʻozda bir dyuym\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 10&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E10 fut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 20&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E20 fut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 30&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E30 fut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 40&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E40 fut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 50&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E50 fut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 60&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E60 fut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1&quot; = 100&#039;\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E100 fut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"metrik\"\u003EMetrik\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1:1\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:2\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:5\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:10\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:20\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:25\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:50\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:75\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:150\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:200\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:250\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:500\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1:1000\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMetrik nisbat qogʻozdagi bir birlik haqiqatda shuncha birlikka teng degani: \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E da sahifadagi 10 mm — bu 1 m.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hisoblangan-masshtablar\"\u003EHisoblangan masshtablar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHisoblangan masshtab varaq ostidagi chiziqda &quot;Kalibrlangan 1&quot; = 4.002&#039; on 24&#039;-6&quot;&quot; kabi koʻrinadi: qogʻoz dyuymiga haqiqiy futlar va siz kiritgan masofa. U oldindan oʻrnatmadan 0.5% doirasida boʻlsa, chiziqqa &quot;(1/4&quot; = 1&#039;-0&quot; ga mos)&quot; qoʻshiladi va varaqlar roʻyxatida oldindan oʻrnatma nomi koʻrinadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"oddiy-bo-lmagan-pdf-lar\"\u003EOddiy boʻlmagan PDF lar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBa&#039;zi PDF lar kattaroq sahifa birligini eʼlon qiladi (&quot;foydalanuvchi birligi&quot;); TakeoffDesk buni oldindan oʻrnatmalar va koʻrsatilgan masshtab uchun hisobga oladi. PDF da aylantirilgan sahifalar tik sahifalar bilan bir xil tarzda oʻlchanadi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Masshtab guruhidagi Oldindan oʻrnatilgan roʻyxatida uch guruhga boʻlingan 32 ta masshtab bor. Oldindan oʻrnatma ochiq varaqning masshtabini aniq belgilaydi. Har bir oldindan oʻrnatma PDF sahifa chizmaning haqiqiy qogʻoz oʻlchami ekanini taxmin qiladi: PDF sahifasida bir dyuym qogʻozda bir dyuym (PDF sahifalari dyuymiga 72 ball). Agar PDF oʻlchami oʻzgartirilgan boʻlsa, Kalibrlash dan foydalaning. Har qanday masshtab oʻrnatgandan keyin Tekshirish dan foydalaning. Qarang: Masshtabni oʻrnatish. Arxitektura Oldindan oʻrnatma Qogʻozda bir dyuym 1/16\" = 1'-0\" 16 fut 3/32\" = 1'-0\" 10 fut 8 dyuym 1/8\" = 1'-0\" 8 fut 3/16\" = 1'-0\" 5 fut 4 dyuym 1/4\" = 1'-0\" 4 fut 3/8\" = 1'-0\" 2 fut 8 dyuym 1/2\" = 1'-0\" 2 fut 3/4\" = 1'-0\" 1 fut 4 dyuym 1\" = 1'-0\" 1 fut 1 1/2\" = 1'-0\" 8 dyuym 3\" = 1'-0\" 4 dyuym Muhandislik Oldindan oʻrnatma Qogʻozda bir dyuym 1\" = 10' 10 fut 1\" = 20' 20 fut 1\" = 30' 30 fut 1\" = 40' 40 fut 1\" = 50' 50 fut 1\" = 60' 60 fut 1\" = 100' 100 fut Metrik 1:1, 1:2, 1:5, 1:10, 1:20, 1:25, 1:50, 1:75, 1:100, 1:150, 1:200, 1:250, 1:500, 1:1000. Metrik nisbat qogʻozdagi bir birlik haqiqatda shuncha birlikka teng degani: 1:100 da sahifadagi 10 mm — bu 1 m. Hisoblangan masshtablar Hisoblangan masshtab varaq ostidagi chiziqda \"Kalibrlangan 1\" = 4.002' on 24'-6\"\" kabi koʻrinadi: qogʻoz dyuymiga haqiqiy futlar va siz kiritgan masofa. U oldindan oʻrnatmadan 0.5% doirasida boʻlsa, chiziqqa \"(1/4\" = 1'-0\" ga mos)\" qoʻshiladi va varaqlar roʻyxatida oldindan oʻrnatma nomi koʻrinadi. Oddiy boʻlmagan PDF lar Ba'zi PDF lar kattaroq sahifa birligini eʼlon qiladi (\"foydalanuvchi birligi\"); TakeoffDesk buni oldindan oʻrnatmalar va koʻrsatilgan masshtab uchun hisobga oladi. PDF da aylantirilgan sahifalar tik sahifalar bilan bir xil tarzda oʻlchanadi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"formulas","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Formula tili","summary":"Yigʻma miqdor formulalarining qoidalari — oʻzgaruvchilar, operatorlar, funksiyalar, yaxlitlash va har bir xato xabari.","section":"reference","order":40,"keywords":["formula","ifoda","sintaksis","funksiyalar","ceil","floor","round","min","max","abs","oʻzgaruvchilar","operatorlar","hisoblash"],"headings":[{"id":"o-zgaruvchilar","text":"Oʻzgaruvchilar","level":2},{"id":"operatorlar","text":"Operatorlar","level":2},{"id":"funksiyalar","text":"Funksiyalar","level":2},{"id":"xatolar","text":"Xatolar","level":2},{"id":"loyihalash-bo-yicha-xavfsiz","text":"Loyihalash boʻyicha xavfsiz","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EYigʻma komponentlari miqdorini formuladan oladi. Formula elementning oʻlchangan qiymatlari ustidagi kichik arifmetik ifoda. Ishlangan misollar uchun \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/assemblies\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/assemblies\"\u003EYigʻmalar va formulalar\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"o-zgaruvchilar\"\u003EOʻzgaruvchilar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EElement turi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EOʻzgaruvchi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMaʼnosi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmumiy uzunlik\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElementning balandligi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDevor maydoni, L × H, ochiqliklar chiqarilgan (ularni oʻz ichiga olgan uchastkalar uchun) (BimCraft dan olingan hajm). Agar hajm oʻlchash usulini nomlasa, \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E shu usul bilan oʻlchanadi: usulning eng kichik oʻlchamidan katta boʻlmagan ochiqliklar qoladi, devorlar uchrashgan joyda usul olib tashlagan narsa chiqariladi. Element ostidagi izohda usul nomi koʻrsatiladi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUchastkalar soni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmumiy sof maydon (konturlar minus kesiklar)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUmumiy perimetr, kesik qirralari bilan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElementning chuqurligi yoki qalinligi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EArea\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaydonlar soni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESanoq\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOʻzgaruvchilar elementning birliklarida boʻladi: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/units\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/units\"\u003EBirliklar\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKatta va kichik harflar bir xil: \u003Ccode\u003El\u003C/code\u003E bu \u003Ccode\u003EL\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFaqat elementning oʻz turidagi oʻzgaruvchilar ishlaydi. Chiziqli elementda \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;P&quot; bu yerda oʻlchangan qiymat emas. Foydalaning: L, H, A, N.\u003C/code\u003E xabarini beradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBoʻsh balandlik yoki chuqurlik 0 hisoblanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"operatorlar\"\u003EOperatorlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYozing\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMaʼnosi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoʻshish\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E yoki \u003Ccode\u003E−\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAyirish yoki manfiy qiymat\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E*\u003C/code\u003E yoki \u003Ccode\u003E×\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoʻpaytirish\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E/\u003C/code\u003E yoki \u003Ccode\u003E÷\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoʻlish\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E( )\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGuruhlash\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoʻpaytirish va boʻlish qoʻshish va ayirishdan oldin bajariladi: \u003Ccode\u003EL * 2 + 4\u003C/code\u003E bu (L × 2) + 4. Shubha boʻlsa, qavslardan foydalaning.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESonlarda oʻnlik xona boʻlishi mumkin (\u003Ccode\u003E1.333\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E.5\u003C/code\u003E) va darajalar (\u003Ccode\u003E1e3\u003C/code\u003E = 1000). Boʻshliqlar eʼtiborga olinmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"funksiyalar\"\u003EFunksiyalar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EFunksiya\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENatija\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMisol\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EButun songacha yuqoriga yaxlitlash\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil(67.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 68\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efloor(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EButun songacha pastga yaxlitlash\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efloor(67.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 67\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEng yaqin butun songa yaxlitlash, yarimlar nolidan uzoqqa\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(2.5)\u003C/code\u003E = 3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(x, d)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ed oʻnlik xonagacha yaxlitlash (0 dan 10 gacha)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eround(3.14159, 2)\u003C/code\u003E = 3.14\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emin(a, b, …)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEng kichik qiymat\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emin(N, 10)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(a, b, …)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEng katta qiymat\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, ceil(N / 12))\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eabs(x)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBelgisiz qiymat\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eabs(-3)\u003C/code\u003E = 3\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eceil\u003C/code\u003E va \u003Ccode\u003Efloor\u003C/code\u003E kompyuterning mayda yaxlitlash shovqinini eʼtiborga olmaydi, shuning uchun aniq 1 boʻlishi kerak boʻlgan qiymat hech qachon 2 ga yaxlitlanmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"xatolar\"\u003EXatolar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOʻqib boʻlmaydigan yoki hisoblab boʻlmaydigan formula maydon ostida oʻz xatosini koʻrsatadi va komponent jamlardan chiqarib tashlanadi (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiqdorlar\u003C/span\u003E sarlavhasida &quot;Incomplete&quot; yoziladi). Xabarlar:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXabar\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETuzatish\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula kiriting, masalan L yoki ceil(L / 1.333) + 1.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula boʻsh.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;X&quot; bu yerda oʻlchangan qiymat emas. Foydalaning: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERoʻyxatdagi oʻzgaruvchilardan birini ishlating.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;X&quot; bu yerda funksiya emas. Foydalaning: ceil, floor, round, min, max, abs.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUlardan birini ishlating.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;#&quot; formulada ruxsat etilmaydi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBu belgini olib tashlang (birliklar, \u003Ccode\u003E%\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E$\u003C/code\u003E va \u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E ruxsat etilmaydi).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;)&quot; yetishmayapti. / &quot;)&quot; oʻzining &quot;(&quot; siz turibdi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQavslarni tenglashtiring.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;)&quot; oldida qiymat yetishmayapti.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasalan \u003Ccode\u003Emax(1, )\u003C/code\u003E: qiymatni kiriting.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula juda erta tugaydi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasalan \u003Ccode\u003EL *\u003C/code\u003E: uni tugallang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKutilmagan &quot;…&quot;. Operator yetishmayaptimi?\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkki qiymat yonma-yon, masalan \u003Ccode\u003E2L\u003C/code\u003E: \u003Ccode\u003E2 * L\u003C/code\u003E deb yozing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eceil() 1 ta qiymat oladi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFunksiyaga toʻgʻri sonli qiymat bering.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eround(x, digits) uchun 0 dan 10 gacha butun oʻnlik xonalar kerak.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EButun sonli oʻnlik xonalar sonidan foydalaning.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula nolga boʻlinadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOdatda H 0: elementning balandligini yoki chuqurligini belgilang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula son bermaydi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENatija son boʻlish uchun juda katta.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBu formula juda uzun (eng koʻpi 500 belgi).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQisqartiring.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"loyihalash-bo-yicha-xavfsiz\"\u003ELoyihalash boʻyicha xavfsiz\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFormula faqat yuqoridagi oʻzgaruvchilar va funksiyalar bilan arifmetika bajara oladi. U kod ishga tushira olmaydi va boshqa hech narsani oʻqiy olmaydi, shuning uchun kimdir sizga yuborgan loyiha faylidagi formula zararsiz.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Yigʻma komponentlari miqdorini formuladan oladi. Formula elementning oʻlchangan qiymatlari ustidagi kichik arifmetik ifoda. Ishlangan misollar uchun Yigʻmalar va formulalar ga qarang. Oʻzgaruvchilar Element turi Oʻzgaruvchi Maʼnosi Linear L Umumiy uzunlik Linear H Elementning balandligi Linear A Devor maydoni, L × H, ochiqliklar chiqarilgan (ularni oʻz ichiga olgan uchastkalar uchun) (BimCraft dan olingan hajm). Agar hajm oʻlchash usulini nomlasa, A shu usul bilan oʻlchanadi: usulning eng kichik oʻlchamidan katta boʻlmagan ochiqliklar qoladi, devorlar uchrashgan joyda usul olib tashlagan narsa chiqariladi. Element ostidagi izohda usul nomi koʻrsatiladi Linear N Uchastkalar soni Area A Umumiy sof maydon (konturlar minus kesiklar) Area P Umumiy perimetr, kesik qirralari bilan Area H Elementning chuqurligi yoki qalinligi Area N Maydonlar soni Count N Sanoq Oʻzgaruvchilar elementning birliklarida boʻladi: Birliklar ga qarang. Katta va kichik harflar bir xil: l bu L. Faqat elementning oʻz turidagi oʻzgaruvchilar ishlaydi. Chiziqli elementda P \"P\" bu yerda oʻlchangan qiymat emas. Foydalaning: L, H, A, N. xabarini beradi. Boʻsh balandlik yoki chuqurlik 0 hisoblanadi. Operatorlar Yozing Maʼnosi + Qoʻshish - yoki − Ayirish yoki manfiy qiymat * yoki × Koʻpaytirish / yoki ÷ Boʻlish ( ) Guruhlash Koʻpaytirish va boʻlish qoʻshish va ayirishdan oldin bajariladi: L * 2 + 4 bu (L × 2) + 4. Shubha boʻlsa, qavslardan foydalaning. Sonlarda oʻnlik xona boʻlishi mumkin (1.333, .5) va darajalar (1e3 = 1000). Boʻshliqlar eʼtiborga olinmaydi. Funksiyalar Funksiya Natija Misol ceil(x) Butun songacha yuqoriga yaxlitlash ceil(67.5) = 68 floor(x) Butun songacha pastga yaxlitlash floor(67.5) = 67 round(x) Eng yaqin butun songa yaxlitlash, yarimlar nolidan uzoqqa round(2.5) = 3 round(x, d) d oʻnlik xonagacha yaxlitlash (0 dan 10 gacha) round(3.14159, 2) = 3.14 min(a, b, …) Eng kichik qiymat min(N, 10) max(a, b, …) Eng katta qiymat max(1, ceil(N / 12)) abs(x) Belgisiz qiymat abs(-3) = 3 ceil va floor kompyuterning mayda yaxlitlash shovqinini eʼtiborga olmaydi, shuning uchun aniq 1 boʻlishi kerak boʻlgan qiymat hech qachon 2 ga yaxlitlanmaydi. Xatolar Oʻqib boʻlmaydigan yoki hisoblab boʻlmaydigan formula maydon ostida oʻz xatosini koʻrsatadi va komponent jamlardan chiqarib tashlanadi (Miqdorlar sarlavhasida \"Incomplete\" yoziladi). Xabarlar: Xabar Tuzatish Formula kiriting, masalan L yoki ceil(L / 1.333) + 1. Formula boʻsh. \"X\" bu yerda oʻlchangan qiymat emas. Foydalaning: … Roʻyxatdagi oʻzgaruvchilardan birini ishlating. \"X\" bu yerda funksiya emas. Foydalaning: ceil, floor, round, min, max, abs. Ulardan birini ishlating. \"#\" formulada ruxsat etilmaydi. Bu belgini olib tashlang (birliklar, %, $ va = ruxsat etilmaydi). \")\" yetishmayapti. / \")\" oʻzining \"(\" siz turibdi. Qavslarni tenglashtiring. \")\" oldida qiymat yetishmayapti. Masalan max(1, ): qiymatni kiriting. Formula juda erta tugaydi. Masalan L *: uni tugallang. Kutilmagan \"…\". Operator yetishmayaptimi? Ikki qiymat yonma-yon, masalan 2L: 2 * L deb yozing. ceil() 1 ta qiymat oladi. Funksiyaga toʻgʻri sonli qiymat bering. round(x, digits) uchun 0 dan 10 gacha butun oʻnlik xonalar kerak. Butun sonli oʻnlik xonalar sonidan foydalaning. Formula nolga boʻlinadi. Odatda H 0: elementning balandligini yoki chuqurligini belgilang. Formula son bermaydi. Natija son boʻlish uchun juda katta. Bu formula juda uzun (eng koʻpi 500 belgi). Qisqartiring. Loyihalash boʻyicha xavfsiz Formula faqat yuqoridagi oʻzgaruvchilar va funksiyalar bilan arifmetika bajara oladi. U kod ishga tushira olmaydi va boshqa hech narsani oʻqiy olmaydi, shuning uchun kimdir sizga yuborgan loyiha faylidagi formula zararsiz.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"units","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Birliklar","summary":"Element hisobot bera oladigan birliklar, formula oʻzgaruvchilari ishlatadigan birliklar va imperial hamda metrik birliklar qanday aralashishi.","section":"reference","order":50,"keywords":["birliklar","lf","sf","sy","sq","kvadrat yard","tom kvadratlari","akrlar","gektarlar","metrlar","kvadrat metrlar","ea","har biri","metrik","imperial","konvertatsiya","standart birlik"],"headings":[{"id":"element-birliklari","text":"Element birliklari","level":2},{"id":"formula-o-zgaruvchilarining-birliklari","text":"Formula oʻzgaruvchilarining birliklari","level":2},{"id":"qayerda-birliklar-qat-iy-belgilangan","text":"Qayerda birliklar qatʼiy belgilangan","level":2},{"id":"masshtab-va-birliklar-alohida","text":"Masshtab va birliklar alohida","level":2},{"id":"aniqlik","text":"Aniqlik","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"element-birliklari\"\u003EElement birliklari\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EElement turi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBirlik\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENomi\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChiziqli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Echiziqli fut (standart)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChiziqli\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetrlar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaydon\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadrat fut (standart)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaydon\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadrat yard\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaydon\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESQ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Etom kvadratlari (100 kvadrat fut)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaydon\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eakrlar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaydon\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadrat metrlar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaydon\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Egektarlar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESanash\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEA\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ehar biri\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUni \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBirlik\u003C/span\u003E orqali element tahrirlovchisida istalgan vaqtda oʻzgartiring, hatto oʻlchangandan keyin ham; miqdor darhol aylantiriladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBirlik\u003C/span\u003E roʻyxatida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmumiy\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBirliklar\u003C/span\u003E da yoqilgan birliklar va doim elementning oʻz birligi koʻrsatiladi. Yangi element u yerda yulduzchali belgilangan uzunlik yoki maydon birligida boshlanadi, agar u elementning birliklaridan biri boʻlsa; aks holda LF yoki SF da boshlanadi. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/unit-lists\" data-topic=\"basics/unit-lists\"\u003EBirliklar, kiritilgan qiymatlar va birliklar roʻyxatlari\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"formula-o-zgaruvchilarining-birliklari\"\u003EFormula oʻzgaruvchilarining birliklari\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EElement birligi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EL, P, H\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EA\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efut\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadrat fut (devor maydoni)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetrlar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadrat metrlar (devor maydoni)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESF\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efut\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadrat fut\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESY\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efut\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadrat yard\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESQ\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efut\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadratlar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eac\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efut\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eakrlar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Em²\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetrlar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ekvadrat metrlar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eha\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetrlar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Egektarlar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESY elementlari uchun \u003Ccode\u003EA\u003C/code\u003E kvadrat yardda, \u003Ccode\u003EP\u003C/code\u003E va \u003Ccode\u003EH\u003C/code\u003E esa futda qoladi. SY elementidan olingan hajm \u003Ccode\u003EA * 9 * H / 27\u003C/code\u003E kub yard; plitalar uchun SF dan foydalanish soddaroq.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qayerda-birliklar-qat-iy-belgilangan\"\u003EQayerda birliklar qatʼiy belgilangan\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaʼzi koʻrsatkichlar doim futdan foydalanadi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003Echizish paytida holat satridagi jonli koʻrsatkich (fut-dyuym, SF),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETanlangan belgi\u003C/strong\u003E (fut-dyuym, LF va SF),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Etekshiruv natijasi (fut-dyuym, kasr futlar va metrlar bilan),\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003Eelektron jadvalning Belgilar varagʻidagi kesma uzunliklari va perimetrlar (fut-dyuym).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EElement jamilari, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMiqdorlar\u003C/span\u003E jadvali, formulalar va Smeta varagʻi elementning oʻz birligidan foydalanadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"masshtab-va-birliklar-alohida\"\u003EMasshtab va birliklar alohida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVaraqning masshtabi chizma qanchalik katta ekanini aytadi; elementning birligi esa uni qanday hisobotlashni aytadi. \u003Ccode\u003E1:100\u003C/code\u003E masshtabli metrik chizmani LF da hajmlash mumkin, imperial chizmani esa m² da. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibrlash\u003C/span\u003E istalgan birlikni qabul qiladi: \u003Ccode\u003E24&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E7.5 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E7500 mm\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"aniqlik\"\u003EAniqlik\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk bosgan nuqtalardan aniq oʻlchaydi, shu jumladan haqiqiy yoy uzunliklari va maydonlarni, va miqdorlarni yaxlitlamaydi. Koʻrsatishda uzunliklar 1/16 dyuymgacha, kasrlar esa ikki oʻnlik xonagacha yaxlitlanadi. Pul faqat kengaytirilgan summalarda, tiyingacha yaxlitlanadi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Element birliklari Element turi Birlik Nomi Chiziqli LF chiziqli fut (standart) Chiziqli m metrlar Maydon SF kvadrat fut (standart) Maydon SY kvadrat yard Maydon SQ tom kvadratlari (100 kvadrat fut) Maydon ac akrlar Maydon m² kvadrat metrlar Maydon ha gektarlar Sanash EA har biri Uni Birlik orqali element tahrirlovchisida istalgan vaqtda oʻzgartiring, hatto oʻlchangandan keyin ham; miqdor darhol aylantiriladi. Birlik roʻyxatida Sozlamalar › Umumiy › Birliklar da yoqilgan birliklar va doim elementning oʻz birligi koʻrsatiladi. Yangi element u yerda yulduzchali belgilangan uzunlik yoki maydon birligida boshlanadi, agar u elementning birliklaridan biri boʻlsa; aks holda LF yoki SF da boshlanadi. Qarang: Birliklar, kiritilgan qiymatlar va birliklar roʻyxatlari. Formula oʻzgaruvchilarining birliklari Element birligi L, P, H A LF fut kvadrat fut (devor maydoni) m metrlar kvadrat metrlar (devor maydoni) SF fut kvadrat fut SY fut kvadrat yard SQ fut kvadratlar ac fut akrlar m² metrlar kvadrat metrlar ha metrlar gektarlar SY elementlari uchun A kvadrat yardda, P va H esa futda qoladi. SY elementidan olingan hajm A * 9 * H / 27 kub yard; plitalar uchun SF dan foydalanish soddaroq. Qayerda birliklar qatʼiy belgilangan Baʼzi koʻrsatkichlar doim futdan foydalanadi: chizish paytida holat satridagi jonli koʻrsatkich (fut-dyuym, SF), Tanlangan belgi (fut-dyuym, LF va SF), tekshiruv natijasi (fut-dyuym, kasr futlar va metrlar bilan), elektron jadvalning Belgilar varagʻidagi kesma uzunliklari va perimetrlar (fut-dyuym). Element jamilari, Miqdorlar jadvali, formulalar va Smeta varagʻi elementning oʻz birligidan foydalanadi. Masshtab va birliklar alohida Varaqning masshtabi chizma qanchalik katta ekanini aytadi; elementning birligi esa uni qanday hisobotlashni aytadi. 1:100 masshtabli metrik chizmani LF da hajmlash mumkin, imperial chizmani esa m² da. Kalibrlash istalgan birlikni qabul qiladi: 24'-6\", 7.5 m, 7500 mm. Aniqlik TakeoffDesk bosgan nuqtalardan aniq oʻlchaydi, shu jumladan haqiqiy yoy uzunliklari va maydonlarni, va miqdorlarni yaxlitlamaydi. Koʻrsatishda uzunliklar 1/16 dyuymgacha, kasrlar esa ikki oʻnlik xonagacha yaxlitlanadi. Pul faqat kengaytirilgan summalarda, tiyingacha yaxlitlanadi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"export-columns","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Eksport ustunlari","summary":"XLSX eksportining va CSV ning har bir varagʻi hamda ustuni, Estimate varagʻi olib boradigan formulalar bilan.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["eksport","ustunlar","xlsx","csv","varaq","smeta varagʻi","varaq boʻyicha","belgilar","masshtablar","formulalar","maydonlar"],"headings":[{"id":"estimate-xlsx-varag-i-va-csv","text":"Estimate (XLSX varagʻi va CSV)","level":2},{"id":"varaq-bo-yicha-faqat-xlsx","text":"Varaq boʻyicha (faqat XLSX)","level":2},{"id":"belgilar-faqat-xlsx","text":"Belgilar (faqat XLSX)","level":2},{"id":"taklif-hududi-bo-yicha-faqat-xlsx-agar-hajmlarda-taklif-hududlari-bo-lsa","text":"Taklif hududi boʻyicha (faqat XLSX, agar hajmlarda taklif hududlari boʻlsa)","level":2},{"id":"masshtablar-faqat-xlsx","text":"Masshtablar (faqat XLSX)","level":2},{"id":"fayl-nomlari","text":"Fayl nomlari","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"estimate-xlsx-varag-i-va-csv\"\u003EEstimate (XLSX varagʻi va CSV)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir element uchun bitta qator, undan keyin uning yigʻmasidagi har bir komponent uchun qator (surilgan). Soʻngra boʻsh qator va umumiy jami.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUstun\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMazmuni\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXLSX da\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA Item\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElement nomi (qalin) yoki komponent nomi (surilgan)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMatn\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EB Type\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear, Area, Count yoki Component\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMatn\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EC Unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF, m, SF, SY, m², EA yoki komponentning birligi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMatn\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ED Quantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOʻlchangan jami yoki formula natijasi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESon\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EE Waste %\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChiqindi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFoiz (0.10 = 10%)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EF Qty with waste\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiqdor × (1 + chiqindi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula \u003Ccode\u003ED*(1+E)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EG Material per unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial stavkasi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESon\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EH Labor per unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMehnat stavkasi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESon\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EI Material\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHisoblangan material\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula \u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F*G,2)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJ Labor\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHisoblangan mehnat\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula \u003Ccode\u003EROUND(F*H,2)\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EK Total\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial + mehnat\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula \u003Ccode\u003EI+J\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EL Notes\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoʻllangan formula, formula xatosi, masshtabsiz varaqdagi belgilar, devor maydoni, perimetr\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMatn\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUmumiy jami qatori: yuqoridagi barcha qatorlar boʻyicha I, J va K ustunlarining \u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E yigʻindisi, agar biror narsa chiqarib tashlangan boʻlsa, Notes ustunida &quot;Incomplete: see the notes above&quot; (Toʻliq emas: yuqoridagi izohlarga qarang).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFormula xatosi boʻlgan qatorda miqdor yoki summa boʻlmaydi; uning izohida xato yoziladi. Sarlavha qatori qotirilgan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECSV da xuddi shu ustunlarda oddiy qiymatlar turadi: Waste % foiz soni (10 = 10%), pul esa dollarda ikki oʻnlik xona bilan. Elektron jadval dasturi formula deb qabul qilishi mumkin boʻlgan matn (\u003Ccode\u003E=\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E+\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E-\u003C/code\u003E yoki \u003Ccode\u003E@\u003C/code\u003E bilan boshlanadigan) matn boʻlib qolishi uchun oldiga \u003Ccode\u003E&#039;\u003C/code\u003E qoʻyiladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"varaq-bo-yicha-faqat-xlsx\"\u003EVaraq boʻyicha (faqat XLSX)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUstun\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMazmuni\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVaraq nomi (PDF nomi bilan, agar u ochiq boʻlmasa)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElement nomi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOʻsha elementning shu varaqdagi miqdori, uning birligida\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElementning birligi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarks\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBelgilar soni\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"belgilar-faqat-xlsx\"\u003EBelgilar (faqat XLSX)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir belgi uchun bitta qator.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUstun\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMazmuni\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVaraq nomi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElement nomi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EType\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear, Area yoki Count\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUzunlik, sof maydon yoki 1\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELF yoki m; SF, SY yoki m²; EA\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDetail\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELinear: segment uzunliklari, ayrilganlar &quot;(deduct)&quot; bilan belgilangan va &quot;(uzunlik) ayirildi, (uzunlik) chizildi&quot;. Area: kesiklar boʻlsa yalpi va kesik maydonlar hamda perimetr. Masshtabsiz belgilar uchun &quot;Varaqda masshtab yoʻq&quot;.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBid area\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaqat hajmlarda taklif hududlari boʻlganda: belgining maydoni yoki &quot;Taklif hududi yoʻq&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"taklif-hududi-bo-yicha-faqat-xlsx-agar-hajmlarda-taklif-hududlari-bo-lsa\"\u003ETaklif hududi boʻyicha (faqat XLSX, agar hajmlarda taklif hududlari boʻlsa)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUstun\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMazmuni\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBid area\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHudud nomi yoki &quot;Taklif hududi yoʻq&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EItem\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElement, yoki uning ostidagi surilgan komponent\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUnit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElement yoki komponentning birligi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuantity\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShu hududda oʻlchangan (komponentlar: hudud jamlari boʻyicha formula)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQty with waste\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMiqdor × (1 + chiqindi)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaterial, Labor, Total\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEstimate varagʻidagidek sentgacha hisoblangan\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENotes\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEstimate varagʻidagidek formula, xatolar va masshtabsiz belgilar\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir hudud &quot;(nom) subtotal&quot; qatori bilan tugaydi, uning xarajatlari shu qatorlar ustidagi \u003Ccode\u003ESUM\u003C/code\u003E formulalaridir; oxirgi qator, \u003Cstrong\u003EAll bid areas\u003C/strong\u003E, subtotallarni qoʻshadi. \u003Cstrong\u003EMarks\u003C/strong\u003E varagʻida keyin ettinchi ustun, \u003Cstrong\u003EBid area\u003C/strong\u003E, boʻladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"masshtablar-faqat-xlsx\"\u003EMasshtablar (faqat XLSX)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMasshtabi yoki belgilari bor har bir varaq uchun bitta qator.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EUstun\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMazmuni\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheet\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVaraq nomi\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EScale\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPreset nomi, kalibrlangan masshtab yoki &quot;No scale&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHow\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Preset&quot; yoki &quot;Calibrated on (the distance you typed)&quot; (kalibrlangan, siz kiritgan masofada)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFeet per PDF unit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk ishlatadigan aniq masshtab koeffitsiyenti\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fayl-nomlari\"\u003EFayl nomlari\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E(name).xlsx\u003C/code\u003E va \u003Ccode\u003E(name).csv\u003C/code\u003E, bunda nom hajmlarda ochilgan birinchi PDF dan olinadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECSV UTF-8 kodlashda, baytlar tartibi belgisi (BOM) va Windows qator tugashlari bilan boʻladi; bu har qanday platformadagi elektron jadval dasturlari oʻqiy oladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Estimate (XLSX varagʻi va CSV) Har bir element uchun bitta qator, undan keyin uning yigʻmasidagi har bir komponent uchun qator (surilgan). Soʻngra boʻsh qator va umumiy jami. Ustun Mazmuni XLSX da A Item Element nomi (qalin) yoki komponent nomi (surilgan) Matn B Type Linear, Area, Count yoki Component Matn C Unit LF, m, SF, SY, m², EA yoki komponentning birligi Matn D Quantity Oʻlchangan jami yoki formula natijasi Son E Waste % Chiqindi Foiz (0.10 = 10%) F Qty with waste Miqdor × (1 + chiqindi) Formula D*(1+E) G Material per unit Material stavkasi Son H Labor per unit Mehnat stavkasi Son I Material Hisoblangan material Formula ROUND(F*G,2) J Labor Hisoblangan mehnat Formula ROUND(F*H,2) K Total Material + mehnat Formula I+J L Notes Qoʻllangan formula, formula xatosi, masshtabsiz varaqdagi belgilar, devor maydoni, perimetr Matn Umumiy jami qatori: yuqoridagi barcha qatorlar boʻyicha I, J va K ustunlarining SUM yigʻindisi, agar biror narsa chiqarib tashlangan boʻlsa, Notes ustunida \"Incomplete: see the notes above\" (Toʻliq emas: yuqoridagi izohlarga qarang). Formula xatosi boʻlgan qatorda miqdor yoki summa boʻlmaydi; uning izohida xato yoziladi. Sarlavha qatori qotirilgan. CSV da xuddi shu ustunlarda oddiy qiymatlar turadi: Waste % foiz soni (10 = 10%), pul esa dollarda ikki oʻnlik xona bilan. Elektron jadval dasturi formula deb qabul qilishi mumkin boʻlgan matn (=, +, - yoki @ bilan boshlanadigan) matn boʻlib qolishi uchun oldiga ' qoʻyiladi. Varaq boʻyicha (faqat XLSX) Ustun Mazmuni Sheet Varaq nomi (PDF nomi bilan, agar u ochiq boʻlmasa) Item Element nomi Quantity Oʻsha elementning shu varaqdagi miqdori, uning birligida Unit Elementning birligi Marks Belgilar soni Belgilar (faqat XLSX) Har bir belgi uchun bitta qator. Ustun Mazmuni Sheet Varaq nomi Item Element nomi Type Linear, Area yoki Count Quantity Uzunlik, sof maydon yoki 1 Unit LF yoki m; SF, SY yoki m²; EA Detail Linear: segment uzunliklari, ayrilganlar \"(deduct)\" bilan belgilangan va \"(uzunlik) ayirildi, (uzunlik) chizildi\". Area: kesiklar boʻlsa yalpi va kesik maydonlar hamda perimetr. Masshtabsiz belgilar uchun \"Varaqda masshtab yoʻq\". Bid area Faqat hajmlarda taklif hududlari boʻlganda: belgining maydoni yoki \"Taklif hududi yoʻq\" Taklif hududi boʻyicha (faqat XLSX, agar hajmlarda taklif hududlari boʻlsa) Ustun Mazmuni Bid area Hudud nomi yoki \"Taklif hududi yoʻq\" Item Element, yoki uning ostidagi surilgan komponent Unit Element yoki komponentning birligi Quantity Shu hududda oʻlchangan (komponentlar: hudud jamlari boʻyicha formula) Qty with waste Miqdor × (1 + chiqindi) Material, Labor, Total Estimate varagʻidagidek sentgacha hisoblangan Notes Estimate varagʻidagidek formula, xatolar va masshtabsiz belgilar Har bir hudud \"(nom) subtotal\" qatori bilan tugaydi, uning xarajatlari shu qatorlar ustidagi SUM formulalaridir; oxirgi qator, All bid areas, subtotallarni qoʻshadi. Marks varagʻida keyin ettinchi ustun, Bid area, boʻladi. Masshtablar (faqat XLSX) Masshtabi yoki belgilari bor har bir varaq uchun bitta qator. Ustun Mazmuni Sheet Varaq nomi Scale Preset nomi, kalibrlangan masshtab yoki \"No scale\" How \"Preset\" yoki \"Calibrated on (the distance you typed)\" (kalibrlangan, siz kiritgan masofada) Feet per PDF unit TakeoffDesk ishlatadigan aniq masshtab koeffitsiyenti Fayl nomlari (name).xlsx va (name).csv, bunda nom hajmlarda ochilgan birinchi PDF dan olinadi. CSV UTF-8 kodlashda, baytlar tartibi belgisi (BOM) va Windows qator tugashlari bilan boʻladi; bu har qanday platformadagi elektron jadval dasturlari oʻqiy oladi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"troubleshooting","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"Muammolarni bartaraf etish","summary":"TakeoffDesk da duch kelishingiz mumkin boʻlgan xabarlar va kutilmagan holatlarning belgilari, sabablari va tuzatishlari, ilova koʻrsatganidek keltirilgan.","section":"trouble","order":10,"keywords":["muammolar","xatolar","ishlamayapti","tuzatish","yordam","rad etildi","oʻlchanmayapti","masshtab yoʻq","belgilar yoʻq","eksport amalga oshmadi","oflayn","sensorli"],"headings":[{"id":"fayllarni-ochish","text":"Fayllarni ochish","level":2},{"id":"o-lchash","text":"Oʻlchash","level":2},{"id":"masshtab","text":"Masshtab","level":2},{"id":"miqdorlar-va-formulalar","text":"Miqdorlar va formulalar","level":2},{"id":"avtosanash","text":"Avtosanash","level":2},{"id":"saqlash-va-eksport","text":"Saqlash va eksport","level":2},{"id":"tugmalar-va-sichqoncha","text":"Tugmalar va sichqoncha","level":2},{"id":"sensorli-ekranlar","text":"Sensorli ekranlar","level":2},{"id":"oflaynda-ishlash","text":"Oflaynda ishlash","level":2},{"id":"hali-ham-muammo-bormi","text":"Hali ham muammo bormi","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk koʻpchilik rad etishlarni oyna pastidagi holat satrida tushuntiradi. Quyida xabarni toping.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"fayllarni-ochish\"\u003EFayllarni ochish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXabar yoki belgi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESabab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETuzatish\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF oʻquvchi yuklanmadi. Qayta urinish uchun sahifani qayta yuklang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIlovaning PDF oʻquvchisi yuklanmadi, odatda siz oflaynda boʻlganingiz va ilova hech qachon oflayn foydalanish uchun saqlanmagani uchun.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUlanishni tiklang va qayta yuklang. Soʻng \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOflayn uchun saqlash\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOflayn tayyor\u003C/span\u003E holati paydo boʻlguncha kuting; qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EOflaynda ishlash\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(name) parol bilan himoyalangan. Himoyasiz nusxani oching.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF ochish uchun parol talab qiladi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHimoyasiz nusxa soʻrang yoki ishonchli PDF dasturida parolni olib tashlang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(name) PDF sifatida oʻqilmadi (…)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFayl buzilgan yoki haqiqatan PDF emas.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUni qayta yuklab oling yoki uni yaratgan dasturdan qayta saqlang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(name) allaqachon ochiq.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EXuddi shu PDF (bir xil mazmun) ochiq.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQiladigan ish yoʻq.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk PDF va .takeoff.json loyihalarini ochadi. Oʻtkazib yuborildi: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoshqa fayl turlari tashlab yuborilgan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAvval chizmalarni PDF ga aylantiring.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFayllarni tashlaganimda hech narsa boʻlmaydi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFayllar brauzer oynasidan tashqarida tashlangan, yoki brauzer PDF ni yangi yorliqda ochgan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFayllarni bevosita TakeoffDesk sahifasiga tashlang; &quot;PDF yoki .takeoff.json ni tashlang&quot; ramkasi ishlashini koʻrsatadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKatta toʻplamni ochish biroz vaqt oladi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHar bir PDF uni aniqlash uchun toʻliq oʻqiladi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;(name) ochilmoqda…&quot; xabari yoʻqolguncha kuting. Kichik rasmlar siz aylantirganingizda toʻldiriladi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"o-lchash\"\u003EOʻlchash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXabar yoki belgi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESabab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETuzatish\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAvval PDF ni oching.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHech qanday varaq ochiq emas.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF ni oching.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBu varaqda hali masshtab yoʻq, shuning uchun uni oʻlchab boʻlmaydi. Avval oldindan oʻrnatilgan masshtabni tanlang yoki kalibrlang (sanash masshtabsiz ishlaydi).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChiziqli, maydon, aylana va kesib olish asboblariga masshtab kerak.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/set-the-scale\"\u003EMasshtabni oʻrnating\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAvval chiziqli element yarating (uni Elementlar ostida nomlang), soʻng varaqda bosing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBunday turdagi element yoʻq.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOchilgan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYangi element\u003C/span\u003E shaklini toʻldiring va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoʻshish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAvval hajmlanadigan elementni tanlang (Elementlar paneli).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJoriy element oʻchirilgan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EElementlar\u003C/span\u003E ostidagi elementni bosing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChiziq kamida ikkita nuqtani talab qiladi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESiz bir marta bosgandan keyin tugatdingiz.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKamida ikkita nuqtani bosing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaydon kamida uchta nuqtani talab qiladi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBurchaklar juda kam.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKamida uchta burchakni bosing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKontur oʻzini kesib oʻtadi, shuning uchun uning maydoni notoʻgʻri boʻladi. Uni kesishmasdan qayta chizing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESakkizsimon shakl.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUni ikki maydon sifatida chizing yoki chekka boʻylab tartib bilan aylaning.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAvval maydon belgisini tanlang (Tanlash asbobi), soʻng Kesib olish ni tanlang va uning ichida teshik chizing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKesib olish\u003C/span\u003E tanlangan maydonni talab qiladi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"V\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EV\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing, maydonni bosing, soʻng \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"X\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EX\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKesib olingan qism maydon ichida toʻliq joylashishi kerak.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETeshik konturni kesib oʻtadi yoki undan chiqib ketadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETeshikni maydon ichida chizing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKesib olingan qismlar bir-birining ustiga tushishi mumkin emas.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkki teshik ustma-ust tushadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkkalasini oʻrab oluvchi bitta teshik chizing yoki ularni bir-biridan ajratib turing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E… Nuqta qaytarib qoʻyildi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESudrangan burchak konturni oʻzini kesib oʻtishiga yoki teshikni tashqariga surib chiqarishiga olib kelardi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShaklni toʻgʻri saqlaydigan joyga suring.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAylana chetidagi, markazdan uzoqdagi nuqtani bosing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkkinchi bosish markazga juda yaqin edi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETashqariroq bosing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBosishlar nuqta qoʻshish oʻrniga varaqni suradi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETugma bosilgan holda koʻrsatkich bir necha pikseldan koʻproq siljidi; bu sudrash hisoblanadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHarakatlanmasdan bosing, ayniqsa sensorli panelda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EShift tutib olmaydi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESiz yoy ustida nuqta qoʻyayapsiz yoki aylana chizyapsiz.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E45° tutib olish faqat toʻgʻri kesmalarga qoʻllanadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENuqtalar yaqin chiziqqa sakraydi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChizma chiziqlariga tutib olish yoqilgan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChiziqlar orasiga bosish uchun kattalashtiring, yoki Tutib olishni oʻchirish uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETutib olish belgisi chiqmaydi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETutib olish oʻchiq, varaq skaner qilingan, yoki asbob tutib olmaydi (Sanash, Avtosanash, qoʻyish).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F3\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing; skanerlangan varaqda tutib olish uchun chiziqlar yoʻq.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUzunlik notoʻgʻri\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasshtab notoʻgʻri (koʻpincha oldindan oʻrnatilgan masshtabli, oʻlchami oʻzgartirilgan PDF).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaʼlum oʻlchamda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETekshirish\u003C/span\u003E ni, soʻng \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKalibrlash\u003C/span\u003E ni ishlating.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"masshtab\"\u003EMasshtab\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXabar yoki belgi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESabab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETuzatish\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBir-biridan uzoqroq ikki nuqtani tanlang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKalibrlash nuqtalari deyarli bir-birining ustida.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUzunroq oʻlchamda kalibrlang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKalibrlash dialogidagi xabar, masalan &quot;Bu masofani oʻqib boʻlmadi&quot;\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasofa TakeoffDesk oʻqiy olmaydigan shaklda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EUzunlik, stavka va foiz kiritish\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBu varaqda hali masshtab yoʻq, shuning uchun tekshiradigan narsa yoʻq. Uni kalibrlang yoki oldindan oʻrnatilgan masshtabni tanlang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMasshtabsiz varaqda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETekshirish\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAvval masshtabni oʻrnating.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOldindan oʻrnatilgan\u003C/span\u003E roʻyxati xiralashgan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHech qanday varaq ochiq emas.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF ni oching.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"miqdorlar-va-formulalar\"\u003EMiqdorlar va formulalar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXabar yoki belgi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESabab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETuzatish\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EToʻliq emas: … (jami summada yoʻq)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula xatosi yoki masshtabsiz varaqlardagi belgilar.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/read-quantities#the-incomplete-warning\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/read-quantities\" data-hash=\"the-incomplete-warning\"\u003EMiqdorlar va smetani oʻqish\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElementning yonida +(n) masshtabsiz\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUning baʼzi belgilari masshtabsiz varaqlarda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOʻsha varaqlarga masshtab bering.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormula xatosi: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormulani hisoblab boʻlmaydi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/formulas#errors\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/formulas\" data-hash=\"errors\"\u003EFormula tili\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBu elementda belgilar bor, shuning uchun uning turini oʻzgartirib boʻlmaydi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBelgilar paydo boʻlgach, tur qulflanadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoshqa turdagi yangi element yarating va belgilarni shu bilan qayta chizing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElementga nom kerak.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENom maydoni boʻshatilgan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENom kiriting.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E12.50 kabi miqdor kiriting. / 10 yoki 7.5 kabi foiz kiriting.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStavka yoki chiqindi oʻqib boʻlmadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/entry-formats\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/entry-formats\"\u003EUzunlik, stavka va foiz kiritish\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJami ikki baravar koʻrinadi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElementning oʻz stavkalari va bir xil narxni olib yuradigan tarkibiy qismlari bor.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETarkibiy qismlari narxni olib yursa, elementning oʻz stavkalarini 0 ga oʻrnating.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBu elementning belgilari ochilmagan PDF larda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESiz belgilarining hammasi ochilmagan PDF larda boʻlgan elementni bosdingiz.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOʻsha PDF larni oching; ularning nomlari \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVaraqlar\u003C/span\u003E ostida koʻrsatilgan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"avtosanash\"\u003EAvtosanash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXabar yoki belgi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESabab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETuzatish\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBu quti juda kichik. Butun belgi atrofida chizing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuti juda mayda.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKattalashtiring va butun belgini qutiga oling.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBu quti deyarli boʻsh. Belgi atrofida chizing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQuti faqat qogʻozni oʻz ichiga oladi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBelgining oʻzini qutiga oling.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoslik topilmadi. Moslik surgichini pastroq suring yoki belgini zichroq qutiga soling.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHech narsa yetarlicha yuqori ball olmadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBelgini zich qutiga soling, yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoslik\u003C/span\u003E surgichini pastroq suring.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJuda koʻp moslik, shu jumladan notoʻgʻri belgilar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOʻxshash belgilar haqiqiy belgiga yaqin ball oladi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMoslik\u003C/span\u003E surgichini koʻtaring va ularni rad etish uchun notoʻgʻri qutilarni bosing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBoshqa varaqlarda moslik yoʻq\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOʻsha varaqlarda belgi boshqa oʻlchamda yoki 90° qadamga teng boʻlmagan burchakda chizilgan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOʻsha yerda chizilgan quti bilan oʻsha varaqlarni qidiring, yoki qoʻlda sanang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(n) ta varaqni bu belgi oʻlchamida qidirish uchun juda katta edi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVaraq ishchi oʻlchamda juda katta boʻladi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKattaroq belgini qutiga soling, yoki oʻsha varaqni qoʻlda sanang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQidiruv amalga oshmadi: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFondagi qidiruv toʻxtadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayta urinib koʻring; takrorlansa, sahifani qayta yuklang (avval saqlang). Oflaynda u faqat ilova paneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOflayn tayyor\u003C/span\u003E ni koʻrsatgandan keyin ishlaydi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESudrash surish oʻrniga quti chizadi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAvtosanash\u003C/span\u003E shunday ishlaydi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni ushlab turib sudrang, yoki oʻrta tugma bilan suring.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saqlash-va-eksport\"\u003ESaqlash va eksport\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EXabar yoki belgi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESabab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETuzatish\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHali eksport qilinadigan narsa yoʻq: element yarating va uni hajmlang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EElementlar yoʻq.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAvval element yarating.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOchiq PDF larda hali belgilar yoʻq.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBelgilangan PDF\u003C/span\u003E ochiq PDF larga chizadigan narsa yoʻq.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBelgilari bor PDF larni oching.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBu PDF parol bilan himoyalangan yoki shifrlangan, shuning uchun belgilangan nusxa yozib boʻlmaydi. …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF shifrlangan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOʻrniga \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E eksport qiling, yoki PDF ning shifrlanmagan nusxasidan foydalaning (u oʻz hajmlash faylini talab qiladi, chunki bu boshqa fayl).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBelgilangan PDF yozib boʻlmadi: …\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKoʻpincha: oflaynda va ilova oflayn foydalanish uchun saqlanmagan, shuning uchun PDF yozuvchisi yoʻq.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOnlaynga oʻting va yana \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBelgilangan PDF\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Buning oldini olish uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOflayn uchun saqlash\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOflayn tayyor\u003C/span\u003E holati paydo boʻlguncha kuting.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaqat bitta belgilangan PDF yuklab olindi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrauzer bir vaqtda bir nechta yuklab olishni bloklagan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUshbu sayt uchun bir nechta yuklab olishga ruxsat bering va yana eksport qiling.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(file) TakeoffDesk loyihasi emas (u toʻgʻri JSON emas). / Bu TakeoffDesk loyiha fayli emas.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENotoʻgʻri fayl yoki buzilgan fayl.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E faylini tanlang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBu loyiha yangiroq TakeoffDesk tomonidan saqlangan. Uni oʻsha versiyada oching.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFayl yangiroq versiyadan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUni yangiroq versiyada oching.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E(n) ta belgi buzilgan va chiqarib tashlangan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFaylning bir qismi buzilgan yoki qoʻlda tahrirlangan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQolgani ochildi. Yoʻqolgan belgilarni qayta chizing, yoki eskiroq nusxani oching.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQayta ochgandan keyin belgilar yoʻq\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPDF lar ochiq emas, yoki ulardan biri oʻzgargan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen#when-a-pdf-has-changed\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/save-and-reopen\" data-hash=\"when-a-pdf-has-changed\"\u003EHajmni saqlash va qayta ochish\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrauzer &quot;Saytdan chiqilsinmi?&quot; deb soʻraydi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESaqlanmagan oʻzgarishlar bor.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EQoling va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bilan saqlang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tugmalar-va-sichqoncha\"\u003ETugmalar va sichqoncha\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBelgi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESabab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETuzatish\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EHarf tugmalari ishlamaydi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EKursor maydonda (qidiruv, element tahrirlovchisi, jadval).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EVaraqni bosing, yoki maydondan chiqish uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGʻildirak aylantirish oʻrniga kattalashtiradi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGʻildirak doim varaqni kattalashtiradi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESurish uchun sudrang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EButun sahifa kattalashdi yoki kichiklashdi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBrauzer masshtabi (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command +\"\u003E⌘+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl++\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command −\"\u003E⌘−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command 0\"\u003E⌘0\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+0\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing. Varaqni gʻildirak yoki oddiy \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"+\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E+\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"−\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E−\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bilan kattalashtiring.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace bosganimda belgi yoʻqoldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChizmayotgan boʻlsangiz, Backspace tanlangan belgini oʻchiradi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uni qaytaradi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMac da oʻng tugma bilan tugallanmaydi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EControl-bosish oddiy bosish sifatida qabul qilinadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIkkinchi tugma yoqilgan holda ikki barmoq bilan bosing, yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sensorli-ekranlar\"\u003ESensorli ekranlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESensorli ekranda:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETegish\u003C/strong\u003E nuqta qoʻyadi (yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETanlash\u003C/span\u003E bilan belgini tanlaydi). Bir barmoq bilan sudrash suradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIkki barmoq\u003C/strong\u003E ular orasidagi nuqta atrofida kattalashtirish uchun qisadi, birga harakatlanganda esa suradi. Ikkinchi barmoqni qoʻyish birinchi barmoq boshlagan amalni bekor qiladi, shuning uchun qisish hech qachon nuqta qoldirmaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChiziq yoki konturni \u003Cstrong\u003Euzoq bosish\u003C/strong\u003E (oʻng tugma), \u003Cstrong\u003Eikki marta tegish\u003C/strong\u003E yoki varaq pastidagi panelda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETugatish\u003C/span\u003E bilan \u003Cstrong\u003Etugating\u003C/strong\u003E. Xuddi shu panelda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrqa\u003C/span\u003E (oxirgi nuqtani qaytarish) va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBekor qilish\u003C/span\u003E bor. Maydonlar ham birinchi nuqtaga tegib yopiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBarmoqlar uchun nishonlar kattaroq: nuqtalar tutib oladi, yopiladi va uzoqroqdan tanlanadi, burchak dastaklari esa kattaroq.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUzunliklarni yozish uchun klaviatura kerak; ekrandagi klaviatura \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKiritish\u003C/span\u003E maydoni faol boʻlganda ishlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlanshetda klaviatura va sichqoncha yoki sensorli panel hajmlashni ancha osonlashtiradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"oflaynda-ishlash\"\u003EOflaynda ishlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETugma yoki belgi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ESabab\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ETuzatish\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESaqlab boʻlmadi\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOflayn uchun saqlash vaqtida ilovaning baʼzi fayllari yuklab olinmadi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUlanishingizni tekshiring va tugmani yana tanlang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOflayn rejim mavjud emas\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMaxfiy oynalar va baʼzi boshqariladigan kompyuterlar oflayn nusxalarni bloklaydi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOddiy oynadan yoki boshqa brauzerdan foydalaning.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E&quot;Saqlanmoqda…&quot; hech qachon boshlanmaydi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESiz oflaynda; saqlash ulanishni talab qiladi.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOnlaynda saqlang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYangilanishdan keyin ilova eski\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOflayn nusxa oldingi kundan.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOnlaynda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOflayn tayyor\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang, soʻng \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQayta saqlash (eng yangi versiyani olish)\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJoyni qaytarib olmoqchisiz\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOflayn nusxa taxminan 6 MB.\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOflayn tayyor\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang, soʻng \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOflayn nusxani oʻchirish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/offline\" data-topic=\"basics/offline\"\u003EOflaynda ishlash\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"hali-ham-muammo-bormi\"\u003EHali ham muammo bormi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIlova javob bermay qolsa, sahifani qayta yuklang. Saqlamagan boʻlsangiz, qayta yuklaganda hajmingiz yoʻqoladi, shuning uchun imkon boʻlsa avval \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bilan saqlang. Brauzer savollari uchun qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\"\u003EBrauzerlar va kompyuterlar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk koʻpchilik rad etishlarni oyna pastidagi holat satrida tushuntiradi. Quyida xabarni toping. Fayllarni ochish Xabar yoki belgi Sabab Tuzatish PDF oʻquvchi yuklanmadi. Qayta urinish uchun sahifani qayta yuklang. Ilovaning PDF oʻquvchisi yuklanmadi, odatda siz oflaynda boʻlganingiz va ilova hech qachon oflayn foydalanish uchun saqlanmagani uchun. Ulanishni tiklang va qayta yuklang. Soʻng Oflayn uchun saqlash ni tanlang va Oflayn tayyor holati paydo boʻlguncha kuting; qarang: Oflaynda ishlash. (name) parol bilan himoyalangan. Himoyasiz nusxani oching. PDF ochish uchun parol talab qiladi. Himoyasiz nusxa soʻrang yoki ishonchli PDF dasturida parolni olib tashlang. (name) PDF sifatida oʻqilmadi (…) Fayl buzilgan yoki haqiqatan PDF emas. Uni qayta yuklab oling yoki uni yaratgan dasturdan qayta saqlang. (name) allaqachon ochiq. Xuddi shu PDF (bir xil mazmun) ochiq. Qiladigan ish yoʻq. TakeoffDesk PDF va .takeoff.json loyihalarini ochadi. Oʻtkazib yuborildi: … Boshqa fayl turlari tashlab yuborilgan. Avval chizmalarni PDF ga aylantiring. Fayllarni tashlaganimda hech narsa boʻlmaydi Fayllar brauzer oynasidan tashqarida tashlangan, yoki brauzer PDF ni yangi yorliqda ochgan. Fayllarni bevosita TakeoffDesk sahifasiga tashlang; \"PDF yoki .takeoff.json ni tashlang\" ramkasi ishlashini koʻrsatadi. Katta toʻplamni ochish biroz vaqt oladi Har bir PDF uni aniqlash uchun toʻliq oʻqiladi. \"(name) ochilmoqda…\" xabari yoʻqolguncha kuting. Kichik rasmlar siz aylantirganingizda toʻldiriladi. Oʻlchash Xabar yoki belgi Sabab Tuzatish Avval PDF ni oching. Hech qanday varaq ochiq emas. PDF ni oching. Bu varaqda hali masshtab yoʻq, shuning uchun uni oʻlchab boʻlmaydi. Avval oldindan oʻrnatilgan masshtabni tanlang yoki kalibrlang (sanash masshtabsiz ishlaydi). Chiziqli, maydon, aylana va kesib olish asboblariga masshtab kerak. Masshtabni oʻrnating. Avval chiziqli element yarating (uni Elementlar ostida nomlang), soʻng varaqda bosing. Bunday turdagi element yoʻq. Ochilgan Yangi element shaklini toʻldiring va Qoʻshish ni tanlang. Avval hajmlanadigan elementni tanlang (Elementlar paneli). Joriy element oʻchirilgan. Elementlar ostidagi elementni bosing. Chiziq kamida ikkita nuqtani talab qiladi. Siz bir marta bosgandan keyin tugatdingiz. Kamida ikkita nuqtani bosing. Maydon kamida uchta nuqtani talab qiladi. Burchaklar juda kam. Kamida uchta burchakni bosing. Kontur oʻzini kesib oʻtadi, shuning uchun uning maydoni notoʻgʻri boʻladi. Uni kesishmasdan qayta chizing. Sakkizsimon shakl. Uni ikki maydon sifatida chizing yoki chekka boʻylab tartib bilan aylaning. Avval maydon belgisini tanlang (Tanlash asbobi), soʻng Kesib olish ni tanlang va uning ichida teshik chizing. Kesib olish tanlangan maydonni talab qiladi. V ni bosing, maydonni bosing, soʻng X. Kesib olingan qism maydon ichida toʻliq joylashishi kerak. Teshik konturni kesib oʻtadi yoki undan chiqib ketadi. Teshikni maydon ichida chizing. Kesib olingan qismlar bir-birining ustiga tushishi mumkin emas. Ikki teshik ustma-ust tushadi. Ikkalasini oʻrab oluvchi bitta teshik chizing yoki ularni bir-biridan ajratib turing. … Nuqta qaytarib qoʻyildi. Sudrangan burchak konturni oʻzini kesib oʻtishiga yoki teshikni tashqariga surib chiqarishiga olib kelardi. Shaklni toʻgʻri saqlaydigan joyga suring. Aylana chetidagi, markazdan uzoqdagi nuqtani bosing. Ikkinchi bosish markazga juda yaqin edi. Tashqariroq bosing. Bosishlar nuqta qoʻshish oʻrniga varaqni suradi Tugma bosilgan holda koʻrsatkich bir necha pikseldan koʻproq siljidi; bu sudrash hisoblanadi. Harakatlanmasdan bosing, ayniqsa sensorli panelda. Shift tutib olmaydi Siz yoy ustida nuqta qoʻyayapsiz yoki aylana chizyapsiz. 45° tutib olish faqat toʻgʻri kesmalarga qoʻllanadi. Nuqtalar yaqin chiziqqa sakraydi Chizma chiziqlariga tutib olish yoqilgan. Chiziqlar orasiga bosish uchun kattalashtiring, yoki Tutib olishni oʻchirish uchun F3 ni bosing. Tutib olish belgisi chiqmaydi Tutib olish oʻchiq, varaq skaner qilingan, yoki asbob tutib olmaydi (Sanash, Avtosanash, qoʻyish). F3 ni bosing; skanerlangan varaqda tutib olish uchun chiziqlar yoʻq. Uzunlik notoʻgʻri Masshtab notoʻgʻri (koʻpincha oldindan oʻrnatilgan masshtabli, oʻlchami oʻzgartirilgan PDF). Maʼlum oʻlchamda Tekshirish ni, soʻng Kalibrlash ni ishlating. Masshtab Xabar yoki belgi Sabab Tuzatish Bir-biridan uzoqroq ikki nuqtani tanlang. Kalibrlash nuqtalari deyarli bir-birining ustida. Uzunroq oʻlchamda kalibrlang. Kalibrlash dialogidagi xabar, masalan \"Bu masofani oʻqib boʻlmadi\" Masofa TakeoffDesk oʻqiy olmaydigan shaklda. Uzunlik, stavka va foiz kiritish ga qarang. Bu varaqda hali masshtab yoʻq, shuning uchun tekshiradigan narsa yoʻq. Uni kalibrlang yoki oldindan oʻrnatilgan masshtabni tanlang. Masshtabsiz varaqda Tekshirish. Avval masshtabni oʻrnating. Oldindan oʻrnatilgan roʻyxati xiralashgan Hech qanday varaq ochiq emas. PDF ni oching. Miqdorlar va formulalar Xabar yoki belgi Sabab Tuzatish Toʻliq emas: … (jami summada yoʻq) Formula xatosi yoki masshtabsiz varaqlardagi belgilar. Miqdorlar va smetani oʻqish ga qarang. Elementning yonida +(n) masshtabsiz Uning baʼzi belgilari masshtabsiz varaqlarda. Oʻsha varaqlarga masshtab bering. Formula xatosi: … Formulani hisoblab boʻlmaydi. Formula tili ga qarang. Bu elementda belgilar bor, shuning uchun uning turini oʻzgartirib boʻlmaydi. Belgilar paydo boʻlgach, tur qulflanadi. Boshqa turdagi yangi element yarating va belgilarni shu bilan qayta chizing. Elementga nom kerak. Nom maydoni boʻshatilgan. Nom kiriting. 12.50 kabi miqdor kiriting. / 10 yoki 7.5 kabi foiz kiriting. Stavka yoki chiqindi oʻqib boʻlmadi. Uzunlik, stavka va foiz kiritish ga qarang. Jami ikki baravar koʻrinadi Elementning oʻz stavkalari va bir xil narxni olib yuradigan tarkibiy qismlari bor. Tarkibiy qismlari narxni olib yursa, elementning oʻz stavkalarini 0 ga oʻrnating. Bu elementning belgilari ochilmagan PDF larda. Siz belgilarining hammasi ochilmagan PDF larda boʻlgan elementni bosdingiz. Oʻsha PDF larni oching; ularning nomlari Varaqlar ostida koʻrsatilgan. Avtosanash Xabar yoki belgi Sabab Tuzatish Bu quti juda kichik. Butun belgi atrofida chizing. Quti juda mayda. Kattalashtiring va butun belgini qutiga oling. Bu quti deyarli boʻsh. Belgi atrofida chizing. Quti faqat qogʻozni oʻz ichiga oladi. Belgining oʻzini qutiga oling. Moslik topilmadi. Moslik surgichini pastroq suring yoki belgini zichroq qutiga soling. Hech narsa yetarlicha yuqori ball olmadi. Belgini zich qutiga soling, yoki Moslik surgichini pastroq suring. Juda koʻp moslik, shu jumladan notoʻgʻri belgilar Oʻxshash belgilar haqiqiy belgiga yaqin ball oladi. Moslik surgichini koʻtaring va ularni rad etish uchun notoʻgʻri qutilarni bosing. Boshqa varaqlarda moslik yoʻq Oʻsha varaqlarda belgi boshqa oʻlchamda yoki 90° qadamga teng boʻlmagan burchakda chizilgan. Oʻsha yerda chizilgan quti bilan oʻsha varaqlarni qidiring, yoki qoʻlda sanang. (n) ta varaqni bu belgi oʻlchamida qidirish uchun juda katta edi. Varaq ishchi oʻlchamda juda katta boʻladi. Kattaroq belgini qutiga soling, yoki oʻsha varaqni qoʻlda sanang. Qidiruv amalga oshmadi: … Fondagi qidiruv toʻxtadi. Qayta urinib koʻring; takrorlansa, sahifani qayta yuklang (avval saqlang). Oflaynda u faqat ilova paneli Oflayn tayyor ni koʻrsatgandan keyin ishlaydi. Sudrash surish oʻrniga quti chizadi Avtosanash shunday ishlaydi. Space ni ushlab turib sudrang, yoki oʻrta tugma bilan suring. Saqlash va eksport Xabar yoki belgi Sabab Tuzatish Hali eksport qilinadigan narsa yoʻq: element yarating va uni hajmlang. Elementlar yoʻq. Avval element yarating. Ochiq PDF larda hali belgilar yoʻq. Belgilangan PDF ochiq PDF larga chizadigan narsa yoʻq. Belgilari bor PDF larni oching. Bu PDF parol bilan himoyalangan yoki shifrlangan, shuning uchun belgilangan nusxa yozib boʻlmaydi. … PDF shifrlangan. Oʻrniga XLSX eksport qiling, yoki PDF ning shifrlanmagan nusxasidan foydalaning (u oʻz hajmlash faylini talab qiladi, chunki bu boshqa fayl). Belgilangan PDF yozib boʻlmadi: … Koʻpincha: oflaynda va ilova oflayn foydalanish uchun saqlanmagan, shuning uchun PDF yozuvchisi yoʻq. Onlaynga oʻting va yana Belgilangan PDF ni tanlang. Buning oldini olish uchun Oflayn uchun saqlash ni tanlang va Oflayn tayyor holati paydo boʻlguncha kuting. Faqat bitta belgilangan PDF yuklab olindi Brauzer bir vaqtda bir nechta yuklab olishni bloklagan. Ushbu sayt uchun bir nechta yuklab olishga ruxsat bering va yana eksport qiling. (file) TakeoffDesk loyihasi emas (u toʻgʻri JSON emas). / Bu TakeoffDesk loyiha fayli emas. Notoʻgʻri fayl yoki buzilgan fayl. .takeoff.json faylini tanlang. Bu loyiha yangiroq TakeoffDesk tomonidan saqlangan. Uni oʻsha versiyada oching. Fayl yangiroq versiyadan. Uni yangiroq versiyada oching. (n) ta belgi buzilgan va chiqarib tashlangan. Faylning bir qismi buzilgan yoki qoʻlda tahrirlangan. Qolgani ochildi. Yoʻqolgan belgilarni qayta chizing, yoki eskiroq nusxani oching. Qayta ochgandan keyin belgilar yoʻq PDF lar ochiq emas, yoki ulardan biri oʻzgargan. Hajmni saqlash va qayta ochish ga qarang. Brauzer \"Saytdan chiqilsinmi?\" deb soʻraydi Saqlanmagan oʻzgarishlar bor. Qoling va Ctrl+S bilan saqlang. Tugmalar va sichqoncha Belgi Sabab Tuzatish Harf tugmalari ishlamaydi Kursor maydonda (qidiruv, element tahrirlovchisi, jadval). Varaqni bosing, yoki maydondan chiqish uchun Tab ni bosing. Gʻildirak aylantirish oʻrniga kattalashtiradi Gʻildirak doim varaqni kattalashtiradi. Surish uchun sudrang. Butun sahifa kattalashdi yoki kichiklashdi Brauzer masshtabi (Ctrl++ yoki Ctrl+−). Ctrl+0 ni bosing. Varaqni gʻildirak yoki oddiy + va − bilan kattalashtiring. Backspace bosganimda belgi yoʻqoldi Chizmayotgan boʻlsangiz, Backspace tanlangan belgini oʻchiradi. Ctrl+Z uni qaytaradi. Mac da oʻng tugma bilan tugallanmaydi Control-bosish oddiy bosish sifatida qabul qilinadi. Ikkinchi tugma yoqilgan holda ikki barmoq bilan bosing, yoki Enter ni bosing. Sensorli ekranlar Sensorli ekranda: Tegish nuqta qoʻyadi (yoki Tanlash bilan belgini tanlaydi). Bir barmoq bilan sudrash suradi. Ikki barmoq ular orasidagi nuqta atrofida kattalashtirish uchun qisadi, birga harakatlanganda esa suradi. Ikkinchi barmoqni qoʻyish birinchi barmoq boshlagan amalni bekor qiladi, shuning uchun qisish hech qachon nuqta qoldirmaydi. Chiziq yoki konturni uzoq bosish (oʻng tugma), ikki marta tegish yoki varaq pastidagi panelda Tugatish bilan tugating. Xuddi shu panelda Orqa (oxirgi nuqtani qaytarish) va Bekor qilish bor. Maydonlar ham birinchi nuqtaga tegib yopiladi. Barmoqlar uchun nishonlar kattaroq: nuqtalar tutib oladi, yopiladi va uzoqroqdan tanlanadi, burchak dastaklari esa kattaroq. Uzunliklarni yozish uchun klaviatura kerak; ekrandagi klaviatura Kiritish maydoni faol boʻlganda ishlaydi. Planshetda klaviatura va sichqoncha yoki sensorli panel hajmlashni ancha osonlashtiradi. Oflaynda ishlash Tugma yoki belgi Sabab Tuzatish Saqlab boʻlmadi Oflayn uchun saqlash vaqtida ilovaning baʼzi fayllari yuklab olinmadi. Ulanishingizni tekshiring va tugmani yana tanlang. Oflayn rejim mavjud emas Maxfiy oynalar va baʼzi boshqariladigan kompyuterlar oflayn nusxalarni bloklaydi. Oddiy oynadan yoki boshqa brauzerdan foydalaning. \"Saqlanmoqda…\" hech qachon boshlanmaydi Siz oflaynda; saqlash ulanishni talab qiladi. Onlaynda saqlang. Yangilanishdan keyin ilova eski Oflayn nusxa oldingi kundan. Onlaynda Oflayn tayyor ni tanlang, soʻng Qayta saqlash (eng yangi versiyani olish) ni tanlang. Joyni qaytarib olmoqchisiz Oflayn nusxa taxminan 6 MB. Oflayn tayyor ni tanlang, soʻng Oflayn nusxani oʻchirish ni tanlang. Qarang: Oflaynda ishlash. Hali ham muammo bormi Ilova javob bermay qolsa, sahifani qayta yuklang. Saqlamagan boʻlsangiz, qayta yuklaganda hajmingiz yoʻqoladi, shuning uchun imkon boʻlsa avval Ctrl+S bilan saqlang. Brauzer savollari uchun qarang: Brauzerlar va kompyuterlar.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"not-built-yet","scope":"takeoffcraft","title":"What is not built yet","summary":"Takeoff features this build does not have, and what to do instead today.","section":"trouble","order":20,"keywords":["limits","missing","not yet","roadmap","planned","workaround","per run","cloud","desktop"],"headings":[{"id":"measuring","text":"Measuring","level":2},{"id":"items-and-pricing","text":"Items and pricing","level":2},{"id":"drawings-dwg-and-dxf","text":"Drawings (DWG and DXF)","level":2},{"id":"auto-count","text":"Auto count","level":2},{"id":"files-and-sharing","text":"Files and sharing","level":2},{"id":"screen-and-input","text":"Screen and input","level":2},{"id":"3d-view","text":"3D view","level":2},{"id":"bidding","text":"Bidding","level":2},{"id":"panels","text":"Panels","level":2},{"id":"spreadsheets","text":"Spreadsheets","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ETakeoffDesk is in development. This list is what the current build does not do, and how to get the job done anyway.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"measuring\"\u003EMeasuring\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EInserting a point in the middle of a run or outline\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete the mark and draw it again.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBox (window) selection\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E + click each mark, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command A\"\u003E⌘A\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+A\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E for every mark on the sheet. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/copy-paste\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/copy-paste\"\u003ECopy, paste and duplicate marks\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERotating, mirroring or rescaling a pasted copy\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPaste on a sheet at the same scale and in the same orientation; draw the rest by hand.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReading a scale from a scanned sheet, or from a graphic scale bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPick the preset, or calibrate on the bar&#039;s length.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMore than one scale per sheet (detail areas, enlarged plans)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasure the part at the sheet&#039;s scale, and take off the detail on its own enlarged sheet if the set has one.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"items-and-pricing\"\u003EItems and pricing\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAssembly formulas that use an item&#039;s other kinds of marks (the doors of a room item in its floor&#039;s formulas)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormulas use the main type&#039;s totals; price the other kinds on their own rows.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAssembly formulas worked out run by run\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormulas use the item&#039;s totals; use \u003Ccode\u003EN\u003C/code\u003E for per-run extras.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFormulas that use another item&#039;s quantities\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERepeat the measurement in that item, or work it out in the spreadsheet export.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECrews on assembly components, or a working day other than 8 hours\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGive the crew to the item; read crew-days for another day length as crew-hours ÷ your day.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkups other than notes, clouds and highlights (arrows, dimensions, stamps), or replies on a note\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWrite it in the note&#039;s text; change its status as it is settled.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA price library shared by a team, or kept with your account\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe library is kept in this browser: export it as a CSV and import it on the other computer.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETrade packs reviewed by working estimators\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEvery pack is a starter: check its assumptions against your job and your products before you price with it. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/takeoffcraft/trade-packs\" data-topic=\"takeoffcraft/trade-packs\"\u003ETrade packs\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPrices in trade packs\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPacks bring assemblies only: set your own rates, or import your price list as a CSV.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERenaming the takeoff\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe name comes from the first PDF; rename the downloaded files.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENaming sheets by hand\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESheets are named from the PDF&#039;s page labels; search by file name and page.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"drawings-dwg-and-dxf\"\u003EDrawings (DWG and DXF)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPlot style tables, pen assignments and CTB files on a drawing&#039;s sheets\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA drawing is drawn black, or in its colors darkened for paper; line weights come from the drawing.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpening a binary DXF, or a DWG older than AutoCAD 2000\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESave it as an ASCII DXF or a newer DWG.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFinding a linked drawing (xref) by the folder it sits in\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpen the linked drawing&#039;s file too, with the host: it is found by file name among the open files.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMeasuring 3D polylines, meshes, solids and regions\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount them by layer and type, or measure the plan view with the Linear and Area tools.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EText in a marked PDF from a drawing in scripts other than Latin\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECharacters Helvetica has no glyph for print as &quot;?&quot; in the marked PDF; the drawing on screen is unaffected.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA hand-over of a drawing to another app from the sheet bar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOpen the same file in that app.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA drawing that carries the takeoff inside it, as \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF with the takeoff inside\u003C/span\u003E does for PDFs\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave takeoff\u003C/span\u003E: the \u003Ccode\u003E.takeoff.json\u003C/code\u003E reopens on the same drawing, found by its contents.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDrawing or counting PDF underlays, images and OLE objects placed in a drawing\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EImages show as a frame only. Open the underlay PDF itself as a sheet.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"auto-count\"\u003EAuto count\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFinding symbols on a sheet with no scale drawn at another size\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGive the sheet its scale, or search it with a box drawn there.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFinding mirrored symbols\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount those by hand, or search again with a box around a mirrored one.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"files-and-sharing\"\u003EFiles and sharing\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOne PDF that both shows the marks and carries the takeoff\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMarked PDF\u003C/span\u003E for people to see the marks; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF with the takeoff inside\u003C/span\u003E to reopen in TakeoffDesk.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA CSV of quantities by sheet or of the marks\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUse \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXLSX\u003C/span\u003E: its By sheet and Marks worksheets have them.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECloud saving\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot available yet. Save project files to your computer and back them up.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA desktop app\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk runs in the browser, served from your own computer (\u003Ccode\u003Enpm start\u003C/code\u003E) or any web server (the browser edition).\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"screen-and-input\"\u003EScreen and input\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EA right-click (or long-press) menu\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EUse the toolbar, the panels and the keys. A long press finishes a run or an outline.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERotating the view\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EPages rotated in the PDF already show upright.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-view\"\u003E3D view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDrawing or editing marks in 3D\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGo back to the sheet (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"3\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E3\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) to draw; select and delete work in 3D.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELining up stacked floors plotted at different places on their pages\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EStack floors plotted alike; check the others one sheet at a time.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECount posts sized like the counted object\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEvery post on a sheet is the same size; it marks where a count is, not what it is.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bidding\"\u003EBidding\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESending a package to subcontractors from the app, addenda, award letters\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EExport the package&#039;s CSV (or the bid PDF), send it yourself, and type the bids that come back into the leveling table.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ERepricing an alternate&#039;s bid area with a chosen bid\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlternates and bid-area subtotals use your own prices; adjust the alternate by hand.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAutomatic reminders before a subcontractor&#039;s insurance or license date runs out\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe date is flagged on the Subcontractors page once it is past or within 30 days; check it when you invite.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panels\"\u003EPanels\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EInstead, today\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMoving the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQuantities\u003C/span\u003E table\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOnly the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESheets\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EItems\u003C/span\u003E panels move. See \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"spreadsheets\"\u003ESpreadsheets\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe XLSX workbook has been checked in LibreOffice Calc, which recalculated every total to the same cent as TakeoffDesk. It has not been opened in Excel yet. If a spreadsheet program shows something unexpected, the CSV export holds the same estimate as plain values.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"TakeoffDesk is in development. This list is what the current build does not do, and how to get the job done anyway. Measuring Not built yet Instead, today Inserting a point in the middle of a run or outline Delete the mark and draw it again. Box (window) selection Shift + click each mark, or Ctrl+A for every mark on the sheet. See Copy, paste and duplicate marks. Rotating, mirroring or rescaling a pasted copy Paste on a sheet at the same scale and in the same orientation; draw the rest by hand. Reading a scale from a scanned sheet, or from a graphic scale bar Pick the preset, or calibrate on the bar's length. More than one scale per sheet (detail areas, enlarged plans) Measure the part at the sheet's scale, and take off the detail on its own enlarged sheet if the set has one. Items and pricing Not built yet Instead, today Assembly formulas that use an item's other kinds of marks (the doors of a room item in its floor's formulas) Formulas use the main type's totals; price the other kinds on their own rows. Assembly formulas worked out run by run Formulas use the item's totals; use N for per-run extras. Formulas that use another item's quantities Repeat the measurement in that item, or work it out in the spreadsheet export. Crews on assembly components, or a working day other than 8 hours Give the crew to the item; read crew-days for another day length as crew-hours ÷ your day. Markups other than notes, clouds and highlights (arrows, dimensions, stamps), or replies on a note Write it in the note's text; change its status as it is settled. A price library shared by a team, or kept with your account The library is kept in this browser: export it as a CSV and import it on the other computer. Trade packs reviewed by working estimators Every pack is a starter: check its assumptions against your job and your products before you price with it. See Trade packs. Prices in trade packs Packs bring assemblies only: set your own rates, or import your price list as a CSV. Renaming the takeoff The name comes from the first PDF; rename the downloaded files. Naming sheets by hand Sheets are named from the PDF's page labels; search by file name and page. Drawings (DWG and DXF) Not built yet Instead, today Plot style tables, pen assignments and CTB files on a drawing's sheets A drawing is drawn black, or in its colors darkened for paper; line weights come from the drawing. Opening a binary DXF, or a DWG older than AutoCAD 2000 Save it as an ASCII DXF or a newer DWG. Finding a linked drawing (xref) by the folder it sits in Open the linked drawing's file too, with the host: it is found by file name among the open files. Measuring 3D polylines, meshes, solids and regions Count them by layer and type, or measure the plan view with the Linear and Area tools. Text in a marked PDF from a drawing in scripts other than Latin Characters Helvetica has no glyph for print as \"?\" in the marked PDF; the drawing on screen is unaffected. A hand-over of a drawing to another app from the sheet bar Open the same file in that app. A drawing that carries the takeoff inside it, as PDF with the takeoff inside does for PDFs Save takeoff: the .takeoff.json reopens on the same drawing, found by its contents. Drawing or counting PDF underlays, images and OLE objects placed in a drawing Images show as a frame only. Open the underlay PDF itself as a sheet. Auto count Not built yet Instead, today Finding symbols on a sheet with no scale drawn at another size Give the sheet its scale, or search it with a box drawn there. Finding mirrored symbols Count those by hand, or search again with a box around a mirrored one. Files and sharing Not built yet Instead, today One PDF that both shows the marks and carries the takeoff Marked PDF for people to see the marks; PDF with the takeoff inside to reopen in TakeoffDesk. A CSV of quantities by sheet or of the marks Use XLSX: its By sheet and Marks worksheets have them. Cloud saving Not available yet. Save project files to your computer and back them up. A desktop app TakeoffDesk runs in the browser, served from your own computer (npm start) or any web server (the browser edition). Screen and input Not built yet Instead, today A right-click (or long-press) menu Use the toolbar, the panels and the keys. A long press finishes a run or an outline. Rotating the view Pages rotated in the PDF already show upright. 3D view Not built yet Instead, today Drawing or editing marks in 3D Go back to the sheet (3) to draw; select and delete work in 3D. Lining up stacked floors plotted at different places on their pages Stack floors plotted alike; check the others one sheet at a time. Count posts sized like the counted object Every post on a sheet is the same size; it marks where a count is, not what it is. Bidding Not built yet Instead, today Sending a package to subcontractors from the app, addenda, award letters Export the package's CSV (or the bid PDF), send it yourself, and type the bids that come back into the leveling table. Repricing an alternate's bid area with a chosen bid Alternates and bid-area subtotals use your own prices; adjust the alternate by hand. Automatic reminders before a subcontractor's insurance or license date runs out The date is flagged on the Subcontractors page once it is past or within 30 days; check it when you invite. Panels Not built yet Instead, today Moving the Quantities table Only the Sheets and Items panels move. See Arrange the panels. Spreadsheets The XLSX workbook has been checked in LibreOffice Calc, which recalculated every total to the same cent as TakeoffDesk. It has not been opened in Excel yet. If a spreadsheet program shows something unexpected, the CSV export holds the same estimate as plain values.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"help","scope":"basics","title":"Bu yordamdan foydalanish","summary":"Yordamni oching, uni qidiring va kompyuteringiz uchun qadamlarni koʻring.","section":"start","order":10,"keywords":["yordam","f1","qidirish","oʻquv darslari","qoʻllanma"],"headings":[{"id":"yordamni-ochish","text":"Yordamni ochish","level":2},{"id":"mavzu-topish","text":"Mavzu topish","level":2},{"id":"kompyuteringiz-uchun-qadamlar","text":"Kompyuteringiz uchun qadamlar","level":2},{"id":"yordam-veb-saytda-ham-bor","text":"Yordam veb-saytda ham bor","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EHar bir ilovaning oʻz yordami bor. U ilovaning bir qismi, shuning uchun aloqasiz ham ochiladi va har doim siz ishlatayotgan versiyani tasvirlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yordamni-ochish\"\u003EYordamni ochish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing yoki ilovaning yuqori panelidan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYordam\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYordamni yopish uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYopish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Chizmangiz oʻz holicha qoladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoʻpchilik Mac klaviaturalarida yuqori qator yorqinlik va tovushni boshqaradi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni \u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (yoki globus) tugmasi bilan birga bosing yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYordam\u003C/span\u003E tugmasidan foydalaning. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys#function-keys-on-a-mac\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\" data-hash=\"function-keys-on-a-mac\"\u003EMac da klavishlar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mavzu-topish\"\u003EMavzu topish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYordamning yuqoridagi qidiruv maydoniga yozing. Natijalar yozgan sari yangilanadi va boshqa dasturlarning buyruq nomlarini ham oʻz ichiga oladi, shuning uchun boshqa joyda yozadigan narsangizni yozsangiz, odatda kerakli sahifa topiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMavzular har bir ilovada bir xil guruhlanadi: boshlash, oʻquv darslari, boshqa dasturlardan kelganlar, maʼlumotnoma va muammolarni bartaraf etish.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMavzu ichidagi havolalar keyingi mavzuni shu panelda ochadi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrqaga\u003C/span\u003E sizni avvalgi joyga qaytaradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kompyuteringiz-uchun-qadamlar\"\u003EKompyuteringiz uchun qadamlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaʼzi qadamlar Mac, Windows va Linux oʻrtasida, brauzerlar oʻrtasida hamda onlayn yoki oflaynda boʻlishingizga qarab farq qiladi. Yordam sizga tegishlisini aniqlaydi va shu qadamlarni koʻrsatadi. Mavzu tepasidagi chiziq nimani tanlaganini aytadi, masalan &quot;Mac, Chrome yoki Edge uchun, onlayn qadamlar koʻrsatilmoqda&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBoshqa kompyuter yoki brauzerni tanlash uchun (masalan, hamkasbingizga yordam berish uchun) chiziqdagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOʻzgartirish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHar bir qadamning har bir versiyasini, har biri belgilangan holda koʻrish uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHammasini koʻrsatish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKlaviatura tezkor tugmalari klaviaturangizda yozilganidek yoziladi: \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E Mac da ⌘S, Windows va Linux da Ctrl+S sifatida oʻqiladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"yordam-veb-saytda-ham-bor\"\u003EYordam veb-saytda ham bor\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVeb-sayt bir xil mavzularni getcadcraft.com/tutorials manzilida, har bir platforma qadamlari bilan koʻrsatadi. Ilovada mavzu pastidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVeb-saytda ochish\u003C/span\u003E onlayn boʻlganingizda shu sahifani ochadi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Har bir ilovaning oʻz yordami bor. U ilovaning bir qismi, shuning uchun aloqasiz ham ochiladi va har doim siz ishlatayotgan versiyani tasvirlaydi. Yordamni ochish F1 ni bosing yoki ilovaning yuqori panelidan Yordam ni tanlang. Yordamni yopish uchun Esc ni bosing yoki Yopish ni tanlang. Chizmangiz oʻz holicha qoladi. Koʻpchilik Mac klaviaturalarida yuqori qator yorqinlik va tovushni boshqaradi. F1 ni fn (yoki globus) tugmasi bilan birga bosing yoki Yordam tugmasidan foydalaning. Qarang: Mac da klavishlar. Mavzu topish Yordamning yuqoridagi qidiruv maydoniga yozing. Natijalar yozgan sari yangilanadi va boshqa dasturlarning buyruq nomlarini ham oʻz ichiga oladi, shuning uchun boshqa joyda yozadigan narsangizni yozsangiz, odatda kerakli sahifa topiladi. Mavzular har bir ilovada bir xil guruhlanadi: boshlash, oʻquv darslari, boshqa dasturlardan kelganlar, maʼlumotnoma va muammolarni bartaraf etish. Mavzu ichidagi havolalar keyingi mavzuni shu panelda ochadi. Orqaga sizni avvalgi joyga qaytaradi. Kompyuteringiz uchun qadamlar Baʼzi qadamlar Mac, Windows va Linux oʻrtasida, brauzerlar oʻrtasida hamda onlayn yoki oflaynda boʻlishingizga qarab farq qiladi. Yordam sizga tegishlisini aniqlaydi va shu qadamlarni koʻrsatadi. Mavzu tepasidagi chiziq nimani tanlaganini aytadi, masalan \"Mac, Chrome yoki Edge uchun, onlayn qadamlar koʻrsatilmoqda\". Boshqa kompyuter yoki brauzerni tanlash uchun (masalan, hamkasbingizga yordam berish uchun) chiziqdagi Oʻzgartirish ni tanlang. Har bir qadamning har bir versiyasini, har biri belgilangan holda koʻrish uchun Hammasini koʻrsatish ni tanlang. Klaviatura tezkor tugmalari klaviaturangizda yozilganidek yoziladi: Ctrl+S Mac da ⌘S, Windows va Linux da Ctrl+S sifatida oʻqiladi. Yordam veb-saytda ham bor Veb-sayt bir xil mavzularni getcadcraft.com/tutorials manzilida, har bir platforma qadamlari bilan koʻrsatadi. Ilovada mavzu pastidagi Veb-saytda ochish onlayn boʻlganingizda shu sahifani ochadi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"browsers","scope":"basics","title":"Brauzerlar va kompyuterlar","summary":"Ilovalar qaysi brauzerlarda ishlaydi, ular orasida nima farq qiladi va kompyuteringizga nima kerak.","section":"start","order":20,"keywords":["chrome","edge","firefox","safari","brave","brauzer","mac","windows","linux","ipad","planshet","webgl","talablar","xotira"],"headings":[{"id":"qaysi-brauzer","text":"Qaysi brauzer","level":2},{"id":"brauzerlar-orasidagi-farq","text":"Brauzerlar orasidagi farq","level":2},{"id":"mac-windows-va-linux","text":"Mac, Windows va Linux","level":2},{"id":"planshetlar-va-sensorli-ekranlar","text":"Planshetlar va sensorli ekranlar","level":2},{"id":"eng-eski-brauzer-va-tizim","text":"Eng eski brauzer va tizim","level":2},{"id":"kompyuteringizga-nima-kerak","text":"Kompyuteringizga nima kerak","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIlovalar veb-brauzer ichida ishlaydi. Ular ishni sizning kompyuteringizda bajaradi: fayllaringiz oʻsha yerda ochiladi va hech qachon bizga yuborilmaydi (qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/your-files\" data-topic=\"basics/your-files\"\u003EFayllaringiz qayerga boradi\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"qaysi-brauzer\"\u003EQaysi brauzer\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQuyidagilardan birining yangilangan versiyasidan foydalaning:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EBrauzer\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EDvigatel\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIzohlar\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEng toʻliqi: papkani tanlash, oflayn foydalanish uchun saqlash, fayllarni boshqarish.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EGecko\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EIshlaydi. Butun papkani ochish soddaroq tanlagichdan foydalanadi. Oflayn saqlash shaxsiy oynalarda ishlamasligi mumkin.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EWebKit\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMac va iPad da ishlaydi. Butun papkani ochish soddaroq tanlagichdan foydalanadi. Safari bir necha hafta ishlatilmagan oflayn nusxani oʻchirib yuborishi mumkin.\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUchala dvigatel ham kundalik ish uchun yaxshi. Ilova biror narsani bir brauzerda boshqacha bajarsa, uning yordami sizning brauzeringiz uchun qadamlarni koʻrsatadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"brauzerlar-orasidagi-farq\"\u003EBrauzerlar orasidagi farq\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPapkani ochish.\u003C/strong\u003E Chromium brauzerlari haqiqiy papka tanlagichini koʻrsatadi va papkani toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri oʻqiy oladi. Firefox va Safari sizdan papka tanlashni soʻraydi va undagi har bir faylni oʻqiydi, bu katta loyiha papkalari uchun uzoqroq davom etadi; papkani ilovaga sudrab olib tashlash uchala brauzerda ham ishlaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESaqlash.\u003C/strong\u003E Ilovalar faylni yuklab olish orqali saqlaydi. Yuklab olishlar qayerga borishini va brauzer avval soʻraydimi-yoʻqmi, brauzer hal qiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome yoki Edge da Sozlamalar ichida (Yuklab olishlar boʻlimida) &quot;Yuklab olishdan oldin har bir faylni qayerga saqlashni soʻrash&quot; ni yoqing — shunda har safar papka tanlanadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFirefox da Sozlamalar, soʻng Umumiy, soʻng Yuklab olishlar ni oching va &quot;Fayllarni qayerga saqlashni har doim soʻrash&quot; ni tanlang — shunda har safar papka tanlanadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari da Sozlamalar, soʻng Umumiy ni oching va &quot;Fayl yuklab olinadigan joy&quot; ni &quot;Har bir yuklab olishda soʻrash&quot; ga oʻrnating — shunda har safar papka tanlanadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mac-windows-va-linux\"\u003EMac, Windows va Linux\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIlovalar har bir kompyuterda bir xil. Oʻzgaradigan narsa — klaviatura: tezkor tugmalar kompyuteringiz uchun avtomatik yoziladi. Qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/keys\" data-topic=\"basics/keys\"\u003EKlavishlar, sichqonchalar va trekpadlar\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"planshetlar-va-sensorli-ekranlar\"\u003EPlanshetlar va sensorli ekranlar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaʼzi ilovalar sensorli ekranni qabul qiladi (bir barmoq chizadi yoki tanlaydi, ikki barmoq esa chimdib kattalashtirish va surish uchun ishlatiladi). Har bir ilovaning yordami buni aytadi. iPad da Safari yoki Chrome dan foydalaning. Matnli buyruqlar bilan ishlaydigan ilovalarda klaviatura yordam beradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"eng-eski-brauzer-va-tizim\"\u003EEng eski brauzer va tizim\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBular 0.7 ilovalarining kodidan oʻqilgan, taxminga emas: har bir fayl tahlil qilingan va undagi har bir til xususiyati brauzerlarning eʼlon qilingan moslik maʼlumotlarida tekshirilgan. Bu versiyalardan past boʻlsa, brauzer kodni tushunmagani uchun ilovalar umuman ishga tushmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003E\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EIlovalarni ishga tushira oladigan eng eski versiya\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EChromium 94\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EFirefox\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E93\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ESafari (Mac, iPad, iPhone)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS va iOS 16.4)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECadCraft Studio oʻzining veb-dvigatelini Windows da olib yuradi, shuning uchun Windows 10 yoki 11 kerak; Mac da esa tizim dvigatelidan foydalanadi, shuning uchun macOS 13.3 yoki undan yangisi kerak. Studio dagi Sozlamalar › Yangilanishlar boʻlimi nusxangiz qaysi tizimda ishlashini koʻrsatadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBu ishga tushadigan eng eski versiya — kod asosida oʻqilgan, ilovalar sinab koʻrilgan eski brauzerlar roʻyxati emas. Shuning uchun eski brauzer ishga tushsa ham, baʼzi xususiyatlar ishlamasligi mumkin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"kompyuteringizga-nima-kerak\"\u003EKompyuteringizga nima kerak\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBular ilovalar uchun rejalashtirilgan minimal talablar, oʻlchangan talablar emas:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E8 GB xotira (katta birlashtirilgan modellar uchun 16 GB tavsiya etiladi).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E3D ilovalar uchun WebGL 2 ni qoʻllaydigan grafik chip. Agar 3D koʻrinish boʻsh qolsa, brauzer sozlamalarida apparat tezlashtirish yoqilganini tekshiring.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToʻliq asboblar paneli uchun kamida 1280 piksel kenglikdagi ekran; kichikroq ekranlarda ular qatorlarga oʻraladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJuda katta fayllar (katta chizmalar toʻplami, katta modellar) brauzer yorligʻida koʻp xotira ishlatadi. Ilova sekinlashsa, boshqa ogʻir yorliqlarni yoping.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Ilovalar veb-brauzer ichida ishlaydi. Ular ishni sizning kompyuteringizda bajaradi: fayllaringiz oʻsha yerda ochiladi va hech qachon bizga yuborilmaydi (qarang: Fayllaringiz qayerga boradi). Qaysi brauzer Quyidagilardan birining yangilangan versiyasidan foydalaning: Brauzer Dvigatel Izohlar Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium Eng toʻliqi: papkani tanlash, oflayn foydalanish uchun saqlash, fayllarni boshqarish. Firefox Gecko Ishlaydi. Butun papkani ochish soddaroq tanlagichdan foydalanadi. Oflayn saqlash shaxsiy oynalarda ishlamasligi mumkin. Safari WebKit Mac va iPad da ishlaydi. Butun papkani ochish soddaroq tanlagichdan foydalanadi. Safari bir necha hafta ishlatilmagan oflayn nusxani oʻchirib yuborishi mumkin. Uchala dvigatel ham kundalik ish uchun yaxshi. Ilova biror narsani bir brauzerda boshqacha bajarsa, uning yordami sizning brauzeringiz uchun qadamlarni koʻrsatadi. Brauzerlar orasidagi farq Papkani ochish. Chromium brauzerlari haqiqiy papka tanlagichini koʻrsatadi va papkani toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri oʻqiy oladi. Firefox va Safari sizdan papka tanlashni soʻraydi va undagi har bir faylni oʻqiydi, bu katta loyiha papkalari uchun uzoqroq davom etadi; papkani ilovaga sudrab olib tashlash uchala brauzerda ham ishlaydi. Saqlash. Ilovalar faylni yuklab olish orqali saqlaydi. Yuklab olishlar qayerga borishini va brauzer avval soʻraydimi-yoʻqmi, brauzer hal qiladi. Chrome yoki Edge da Sozlamalar ichida (Yuklab olishlar boʻlimida) \"Yuklab olishdan oldin har bir faylni qayerga saqlashni soʻrash\" ni yoqing — shunda har safar papka tanlanadi. Firefox da Sozlamalar, soʻng Umumiy, soʻng Yuklab olishlar ni oching va \"Fayllarni qayerga saqlashni har doim soʻrash\" ni tanlang — shunda har safar papka tanlanadi. Safari da Sozlamalar, soʻng Umumiy ni oching va \"Fayl yuklab olinadigan joy\" ni \"Har bir yuklab olishda soʻrash\" ga oʻrnating — shunda har safar papka tanlanadi. Mac, Windows va Linux Ilovalar har bir kompyuterda bir xil. Oʻzgaradigan narsa — klaviatura: tezkor tugmalar kompyuteringiz uchun avtomatik yoziladi. Qarang: Klavishlar, sichqonchalar va trekpadlar. Planshetlar va sensorli ekranlar Baʼzi ilovalar sensorli ekranni qabul qiladi (bir barmoq chizadi yoki tanlaydi, ikki barmoq esa chimdib kattalashtirish va surish uchun ishlatiladi). Har bir ilovaning yordami buni aytadi. iPad da Safari yoki Chrome dan foydalaning. Matnli buyruqlar bilan ishlaydigan ilovalarda klaviatura yordam beradi. Eng eski brauzer va tizim Bular 0.7 ilovalarining kodidan oʻqilgan, taxminga emas: har bir fayl tahlil qilingan va undagi har bir til xususiyati brauzerlarning eʼlon qilingan moslik maʼlumotlarida tekshirilgan. Bu versiyalardan past boʻlsa, brauzer kodni tushunmagani uchun ilovalar umuman ishga tushmaydi. Ilovalarni ishga tushira oladigan eng eski versiya Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi Chromium 94 Firefox 93 Safari (Mac, iPad, iPhone) 16.4 (macOS 13.3, iPadOS va iOS 16.4) CadCraft Studio oʻzining veb-dvigatelini Windows da olib yuradi, shuning uchun Windows 10 yoki 11 kerak; Mac da esa tizim dvigatelidan foydalanadi, shuning uchun macOS 13.3 yoki undan yangisi kerak. Studio dagi Sozlamalar › Yangilanishlar boʻlimi nusxangiz qaysi tizimda ishlashini koʻrsatadi. Bu ishga tushadigan eng eski versiya — kod asosida oʻqilgan, ilovalar sinab koʻrilgan eski brauzerlar roʻyxati emas. Shuning uchun eski brauzer ishga tushsa ham, baʼzi xususiyatlar ishlamasligi mumkin. Kompyuteringizga nima kerak Bular ilovalar uchun rejalashtirilgan minimal talablar, oʻlchangan talablar emas: 8 GB xotira (katta birlashtirilgan modellar uchun 16 GB tavsiya etiladi). 3D ilovalar uchun WebGL 2 ni qoʻllaydigan grafik chip. Agar 3D koʻrinish boʻsh qolsa, brauzer sozlamalarida apparat tezlashtirish yoqilganini tekshiring. Toʻliq asboblar paneli uchun kamida 1280 piksel kenglikdagi ekran; kichikroq ekranlarda ular qatorlarga oʻraladi. Juda katta fayllar (katta chizmalar toʻplami, katta modellar) brauzer yorligʻida koʻp xotira ishlatadi. Ilova sekinlashsa, boshqa ogʻir yorliqlarni yoping.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"keys","scope":"basics","title":"Klavishlar, sichqonchalar va trekpadlar","summary":"Tezkor tugmalar qanday yoziladi, Mac da funksiya klavishlari, sichqonchasiz oʻng tugma bilan bosish va surish.","section":"start","order":30,"keywords":["klaviatura","tezkor tugma","ctrl","command","cmd","option","fn","funksiya klavishlari","trekpad","oʻng tugma","oʻrta tugma","magic mouse"],"headings":[{"id":"tezkor-tugmalar-qanday-yoziladi","text":"Tezkor tugmalar qanday yoziladi","level":2},{"id":"mac-da-funksiya-klavishlari","text":"Mac da funksiya klavishlari","level":2},{"id":"brauzer-saqlab-qoladigan-tezkor-tugmalar","text":"Brauzer saqlab qoladigan tezkor tugmalar","level":2},{"id":"trekpadda-sichqoncha-tugmalari","text":"Trekpadda sichqoncha tugmalari","level":2},{"id":"matn-kiritish-qutisida","text":"Matn kiritish qutisida","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"tezkor-tugmalar-qanday-yoziladi\"\u003ETezkor tugmalar qanday yoziladi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYordam har bir tezkor tugmani klaviaturangizda yozilganidek yozadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EYozilishi\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMac da\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWindows va Linux da\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command S\"\u003E⌘S\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+S\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECommand (⌘) va S\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl va S\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EControl (⌃), Shift (⇧) va F\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECtrl, Shift va F\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option ←\"\u003E⌥←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOption (⌥) va ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EAlt va ←\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Delete\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EBackspace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete klavishi\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBackspace\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn Delete\"\u003Efn Delete\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EDelete\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efn va Delete (oldinga oʻchirish)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EDelete\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EReturn\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EEnter\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQoʻshiq belgisi (+) klavishlarni birga ushlab turish degani. &quot;Then&quot; esa ularni birin-ketin bosish degani.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoʻpgina ilovaning tezkor tugmalari Mac da Command yoki Control ni qabul qiladi, shuning uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ikki yoʻl bilan ham ishlaydi. Bir nechtasi, masalan, toʻliq ekran (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), har bir kompyuterda Control klavishidan foydalanadi; yordam buni kerak boʻlgan joyda aytadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mac-da-funksiya-klavishlari\"\u003EMac da funksiya klavishlari\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKoʻpgina Mac klaviaturalarida yuqori qator yorqinlik, ovoz va media ni boshqaradi. F1 dan F12 gacha yuborish uchun:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003Efn\u003C/strong\u003E (yoki globus) tugmasini bosib turing va klavishni bosing, yoki\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETizim sozlamalari\u003C/strong\u003E ni oching, soʻng \u003Cstrong\u003EKlaviatura\u003C/strong\u003E, soʻng \u003Cstrong\u003EKlaviatura tezkor tugmalari\u003C/strong\u003E, soʻng \u003Cstrong\u003EFunksiya klavishlari\u003C/strong\u003E ni tanlang va &quot;F1, F2 va hokazo klavishlarni standart funksiya klavishlari sifatida ishlatish&quot; ni yoqing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaʼzi F klavishlarni macOS oʻzi ham ishlatadi (masalan, Mission Control). Agar klavish ilovada hech narsa qilmasa, uni fn bilan sinab koʻring yoki asboblar panelidagi tugmadan foydalaning.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"brauzer-saqlab-qoladigan-tezkor-tugmalar\"\u003EBrauzer saqlab qoladigan tezkor tugmalar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVeb-sahifa baʼzi tezkor tugmalarni brauzerdan qanday qilmasin ololmaydi. Har bir ilovada:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command N\"\u003E⌘N\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+N\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command T\"\u003E⌘T\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+T\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command W\"\u003E⌘W\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+W\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E doimo brauzer oynalari va yorliqlarini ochadi yoki yopadi. Ilovalar Yangi va Yopish uchun tugmalardan foydalanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EMac da \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Q\"\u003E⌘Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Q\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E va Windows da \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option F4\"\u003E⌥ F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt+F4\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E brauzerdan chiqadi. Saqlanmagan ishingiz boʻlsa, brauzer avval soʻraydi (&quot;Saytdan chiqilsinmi?&quot;); qolish uchun tanlang, soʻng saqlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBrauzerning oʻz toʻliq ekrani (\u003Cspan class=\"hp\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:mac\" title=\"Mac\"\u003EControl-Command-F yoki oynadagi yashil tugma\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hp-sep\"\u003E / \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hpv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\" title=\"Windows or Linux\"\u003EF11\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E) ishlaydi. Ilovalarda ham \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bilan oʻz ekran rejimlari bor, ular ilovaning panellarini ham yashirishi mumkin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trekpadda-sichqoncha-tugmalari\"\u003ETrekpadda sichqoncha tugmalari\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIlovalar oʻng va oʻrta tugmalardan foydalanadi. Uch tugmali sichqonchasiz:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:mac\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EMac\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOʻng tugma bilan bosish:\u003C/strong\u003E ikki barmoq bilan bosing. Ikki barmoq bilan bosish ishlamasa, \u003Cstrong\u003ETizim sozlamalari\u003C/strong\u003E dan \u003Cstrong\u003ETrekpad\u003C/strong\u003E ni oching va &quot;Ikkilamchi bosish&quot; ni yoqing. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bilan bosish brauzer menyusini ochadi, lekin chizma ichida baʼzi ilovalar uni oddiy bosish deb oʻqiydi (Control bosilgan holda), shuning uchun ikki barmoq bilan bosishni afzal koʻring.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOʻrta tugma bilan torttirish (surish):\u003C/strong\u003E har bir ilova surishning boshqa usulini taklif qiladi, masalan \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosib turib sudrash yoki oʻng tugma bilan sudrash. Ilovaning klaviatura sahifasi qaysi usul ekanini aytadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGʻildirak bilan kattalashtirish:\u003C/strong\u003E trekpadda ikki barmoq bilan aylantirish koʻpgina ilovalarda kattalashtiradi. Ilova qoʻllasa, chimdash ham kattalashtiradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"os:windows,linux\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EWindows or Linux\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOʻng tugma bilan bosish:\u003C/strong\u003E ikki barmoq bilan bosing yoki trekpadning pastki oʻng burchagini bosing. Bu trekpad sozlamalaringizga bogʻliq.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOʻrta tugma bilan torttirish (surish):\u003C/strong\u003E har bir ilova surishning boshqa usulini taklif qiladi, masalan \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Space\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ESpace\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosib turib sudrash yoki oʻng tugma bilan sudrash. Ilovaning klaviatura sahifasi qaysi usul ekanini aytadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EGʻildirak bilan kattalashtirish:\u003C/strong\u003E trekpadda ikki barmoq bilan aylantirish koʻpgina ilovalarda kattalashtiradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"matn-kiritish-qutisida\"\u003EMatn kiritish qutisida\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EQutiga (nom, izoh, qidiruv) yozayotganingizda ilovaning bir harfli tezkor tugmalari oʻchiq boʻladi, shuning uchun &quot;L&quot; yozsangiz, L harfi yoziladi. Klavishlarni ilovaga qaytarish uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing yoki chizmaga bosing.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Tezkor tugmalar qanday yoziladi Yordam har bir tezkor tugmani klaviaturangizda yozilganidek yozadi. Yozilishi Mac da Windows va Linux da Ctrl+S Command (⌘) va S Ctrl va S Ctrl+Shift+F Control (⌃), Shift (⇧) va F Ctrl, Shift va F Alt+← Option (⌥) va ← Alt va ← Backspace Delete klavishi Backspace Delete fn va Delete (oldinga oʻchirish) Delete Enter Return Enter Qoʻshiq belgisi (+) klavishlarni birga ushlab turish degani. \"Then\" esa ularni birin-ketin bosish degani. Koʻpgina ilovaning tezkor tugmalari Mac da Command yoki Control ni qabul qiladi, shuning uchun Ctrl+Z ikki yoʻl bilan ham ishlaydi. Bir nechtasi, masalan, toʻliq ekran (Ctrl+Shift+F), har bir kompyuterda Control klavishidan foydalanadi; yordam buni kerak boʻlgan joyda aytadi. Mac da funksiya klavishlari Koʻpgina Mac klaviaturalarida yuqori qator yorqinlik, ovoz va media ni boshqaradi. F1 dan F12 gacha yuborish uchun: fn (yoki globus) tugmasini bosib turing va klavishni bosing, yoki Tizim sozlamalari ni oching, soʻng Klaviatura, soʻng Klaviatura tezkor tugmalari, soʻng Funksiya klavishlari ni tanlang va \"F1, F2 va hokazo klavishlarni standart funksiya klavishlari sifatida ishlatish\" ni yoqing. Baʼzi F klavishlarni macOS oʻzi ham ishlatadi (masalan, Mission Control). Agar klavish ilovada hech narsa qilmasa, uni fn bilan sinab koʻring yoki asboblar panelidagi tugmadan foydalaning. Brauzer saqlab qoladigan tezkor tugmalar Veb-sahifa baʼzi tezkor tugmalarni brauzerdan qanday qilmasin ololmaydi. Har bir ilovada: Ctrl+N, Ctrl+T va Ctrl+W doimo brauzer oynalari va yorliqlarini ochadi yoki yopadi. Ilovalar Yangi va Yopish uchun tugmalardan foydalanadi. Mac da Ctrl+Q va Windows da Alt+F4 brauzerdan chiqadi. Saqlanmagan ishingiz boʻlsa, brauzer avval soʻraydi (\"Saytdan chiqilsinmi?\"); qolish uchun tanlang, soʻng saqlang. Brauzerning oʻz toʻliq ekrani (Control-Command-F yoki oynadagi yashil tugma / F11) ishlaydi. Ilovalarda ham Ctrl+Shift+F bilan oʻz ekran rejimlari bor, ular ilovaning panellarini ham yashirishi mumkin. Trekpadda sichqoncha tugmalari Ilovalar oʻng va oʻrta tugmalardan foydalanadi. Uch tugmali sichqonchasiz: Oʻng tugma bilan bosish: ikki barmoq bilan bosing. Ikki barmoq bilan bosish ishlamasa, Tizim sozlamalari dan Trekpad ni oching va \"Ikkilamchi bosish\" ni yoqing. Ctrl bilan bosish brauzer menyusini ochadi, lekin chizma ichida baʼzi ilovalar uni oddiy bosish deb oʻqiydi (Control bosilgan holda), shuning uchun ikki barmoq bilan bosishni afzal koʻring. Oʻrta tugma bilan torttirish (surish): har bir ilova surishning boshqa usulini taklif qiladi, masalan Space ni bosib turib sudrash yoki oʻng tugma bilan sudrash. Ilovaning klaviatura sahifasi qaysi usul ekanini aytadi. Gʻildirak bilan kattalashtirish: trekpadda ikki barmoq bilan aylantirish koʻpgina ilovalarda kattalashtiradi. Ilova qoʻllasa, chimdash ham kattalashtiradi. Oʻng tugma bilan bosish: ikki barmoq bilan bosing yoki trekpadning pastki oʻng burchagini bosing. Bu trekpad sozlamalaringizga bogʻliq. Oʻrta tugma bilan torttirish (surish): har bir ilova surishning boshqa usulini taklif qiladi, masalan Space ni bosib turib sudrash yoki oʻng tugma bilan sudrash. Ilovaning klaviatura sahifasi qaysi usul ekanini aytadi. Gʻildirak bilan kattalashtirish: trekpadda ikki barmoq bilan aylantirish koʻpgina ilovalarda kattalashtiradi. Matn kiritish qutisida Qutiga (nom, izoh, qidiruv) yozayotganingizda ilovaning bir harfli tezkor tugmalari oʻchiq boʻladi, shuning uchun \"L\" yozsangiz, L harfi yoziladi. Klavishlarni ilovaga qaytarish uchun Esc ni bosing yoki chizmaga bosing.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"find-tools","scope":"basics","title":"Asbob yoki sozlamani topish","summary":"Istalgan asbobni ishga tushirish, sozlamani oʻzgartirish yoki yordam mavzusini ochish uchun Ctrl+K ni bosing va bir necha harf yozing.","section":"start","order":32,"keywords":["topish","qidirish","buyruqlar paneli","tez ochish","buyruqni ishga tushirish","ctrl k","cmd k","asbob","sozlama","tezkor tugma"],"headings":[{"id":"topish-va-ishga-tushirish","text":"Topish va ishga tushirish","level":2},{"id":"bilib-oling","text":"Bilib oling","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EHar bir ilovada uning asboblari, sozlamalari va bu yordam uchun qidiruv maydoni bor. Asbob asboblar panelida qayerda turganini bilishingiz shart emas.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"topish-va-ishga-tushirish\"\u003ETopish va ishga tushirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing yoki yuqoridagi panelda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETopish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENima kerakligini bir necha harf bilan yozing: &quot;fillet&quot;, &quot;panel matni&quot;, &quot;birliklar&quot;. Yozgan har bir soʻz mos kelishi kerak, shuning uchun roʻyxatni toraytirish uchun ikkinchi soʻz qoʻshing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBirinchi mosni ishga tushirish uchun \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing, yoki avval strelka tugmalari bilan siljing. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E qutini yopadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAsbob xuddi asboblar panelida bosilgandek ishga tushadi. Sozlama \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E ni oʻsha sozlamada ochadi. Yordam mavzusi yordam panelida ochiladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilib-oling\"\u003EBilib oling\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOxirgi ishlatganingiz keyingi safar birinchi turadi, shuning uchun tez-tez ishlatadigan asbob bir tugma bosishda yetib boradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHozir ishlay olmaydigan asboblar, masalan, fayl ochilmaguncha, roʻyxatda koʻrinadi, lekin oʻchiq (kulrang) boʻladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EQoʻshimchalar yoqilgandan keyin ularning asboblari ham roʻyxatda boʻladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Har bir ilovada uning asboblari, sozlamalari va bu yordam uchun qidiruv maydoni bor. Asbob asboblar panelida qayerda turganini bilishingiz shart emas. Topish va ishga tushirish Ctrl+K ni bosing yoki yuqoridagi panelda Topish ni tanlang. Nima kerakligini bir necha harf bilan yozing: \"fillet\", \"panel matni\", \"birliklar\". Yozgan har bir soʻz mos kelishi kerak, shuning uchun roʻyxatni toraytirish uchun ikkinchi soʻz qoʻshing. Birinchi mosni ishga tushirish uchun Enter ni bosing, yoki avval strelka tugmalari bilan siljing. Esc qutini yopadi. Asbob xuddi asboblar panelida bosilgandek ishga tushadi. Sozlama Sozlamalar ni oʻsha sozlamada ochadi. Yordam mavzusi yordam panelida ochiladi. Bilib oling Oxirgi ishlatganingiz keyingi safar birinchi turadi, shuning uchun tez-tez ishlatadigan asbob bir tugma bosishda yetib boradi. Hozir ishlay olmaydigan asboblar, masalan, fayl ochilmaguncha, roʻyxatda koʻrinadi, lekin oʻchiq (kulrang) boʻladi. Qoʻshimchalar yoqilgandan keyin ularning asboblari ham roʻyxatda boʻladi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"arrange-panels","scope":"basics","title":"Panellarni joylashtirish va ikkinchi monitordan foydalanish","summary":"Yon panellarni chapga, oʻngga yoki pastga biriktiring, ularni ustma-ust joylashtiring, yorliqlar sifatida guruhlang, mahkamlang yoki yashiring, chizma ustida suzdiring, tartibni zichlashtiring, asboblar paneli necha qatorda boʻlishini tanlang yoki ularni boshqa ekrandagi alohida oynaga koʻchiring.","section":"start","order":35,"keywords":["panellar","biriktirish","suzdirish","panelni koʻchirish","sudrash","joylashuv","yorliqlar","yorliqlar guruhi","ustma-ust","mahkamlash","avtomatik yashirish","panelni yashirish","panelni yopish","ixcham","joylashuv zichligi","zich","asboblar paneli qatorlari","1 qator","2 qator","asboblar paneli qatorlari","ikkinchi monitor","ikki ekran","ikki monitor","bir nechta monitor","oyna","qalqib chiquvchi","joylashuvni tiklash"],"headings":[{"id":"oynada-panelni-ko-chirish","text":"Oynada panelni koʻchirish","level":2},{"id":"panellarni-yorliqlar-sifatida-guruhlash","text":"Panellarni yorliqlar sifatida guruhlash","level":2},{"id":"mahkamlash-yashirish-va-qaytarish","text":"Mahkamlash, yashirish va qaytarish","level":2},{"id":"joylashuv-zichligini-oshirish","text":"Joylashuv zichligini oshirish","level":2},{"id":"asboblar-paneli-necha-qatorda-bo-lishini-tanlash","text":"Asboblar paneli necha qatorda boʻlishini tanlash","level":2},{"id":"klaviaturadan-foydalanish","text":"Klaviaturadan foydalanish","level":2},{"id":"panellarni-ikkinchi-monitorga-qo-yish","text":"Panellarni ikkinchi monitorga qoʻyish","level":2},{"id":"bir-nechta-panellar-oynasi","text":"Bir nechta panellar oynasi","level":2},{"id":"joylashuvning-har-bir-qismi-uchun-xuddi-shunday","text":"Joylashuvning har bir qismi uchun xuddi shunday","level":2},{"id":"dialogni-ko-chirish","text":"Dialogni koʻchirish","level":2},{"id":"panellarni-qaytarish","text":"Panellarni qaytarish","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EChizma yonidagi panellarni koʻchirish mumkin. Ularni oʻzingizga qulay joyga qoʻying yoki birinchi monitorning butun maydonini chizma egallashi uchun ikkinchi monitorda alohida oyna bering.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir panelning sarlavha satri bor: panel nomi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menyusi, mahkamlash tugmasi va yopish tugmasi joylashgan ingichka satr. 0.7 dan oldingi versiyalarda faqat nom va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menyusi boʻladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"oynada-panelni-ko-chirish\"\u003EOynada panelni koʻchirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelni tepadagi nomidan sudrang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESudrash davomida chizmaning chap, oʻng va pastki tomonida konturli sohalar paydo boʻladi. Panelni shulardan biriga tashlang, u oʻsha yerga biriktiriladi. Ustida turgan soha quyuqlashadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelni chizma ustida boshqa joyga tashlasangiz, u suzib yuradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanellar bir tomonni boʻlishishi mumkin: ular ustma-ust joylashadi va ikkitasi orasidagi har bir chiziq joyni boʻlish uchun sudraladi (chiziq fokusda boʻlganda yoʻnalish tugmalari uni siljitadi, ikki marta bosilganda joy teng boʻlinadi). Biriktirilgan tomonning ichki chetini sudrab, uni kengroq yoki torroq qiling; chetni ikki marta bosing — u joyiga qaytadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESuzuvchi panel chizma ustida qoladi. Uni nomi boʻyicha suring, oʻlchamini esa pastki oʻng burchagini sudrab oʻzgartiring (yoki burchakka Tab bilan oʻtib, yoʻnalish tugmalaridan foydalaning). Nomini ikki marta bosing — u avval turgan joyga qayta biriktiriladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelning nomida bir barmoq bilan sudrang. Suzuvchi panelning pastki oʻng burchagini bir barmoq bilan sudrab oʻlchamini oʻzgartiring; biriktirilgan panellar orasidagi chetlar ham shunday. Sudramasdan suzdirish yoki biriktirish uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menyusidan foydalaning.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panellarni-yorliqlar-sifatida-guruhlash\"\u003EPanellarni yorliqlar sifatida guruhlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIkki panel bitta ramkani ulashishi va bir vaqtda bittasini koʻrsatishi mumkin. Panelni nomi boʻyicha boshqa panelning sarlavha satriga sudrang (siz ustida turganingizda satr konturlanadi) va qoʻyib yuboring: ramkaning sarlavha satrida har bir panel uchun yorliq paydo boʻladi. Panelni koʻrsatish uchun yorliqni bosing. Yorliq fokusda boʻlganda \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yorliqlarni almashtiradi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E birinchi va oxirgisiga oʻtkazadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanelni guruhdan chiqarish uchun uning \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menyusida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYorliqlar guruhidan chiqarish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki uni boshqa joyga sudrang. Sudramasdan guruhlash uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYorliq bilan birlashtirish\u003C/span\u003E ni va panel nomini tanlang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mahkamlash-yashirish-va-qaytarish\"\u003EMahkamlash, yashirish va qaytarish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanel sarlavha satridagi mahkamlagich uni \u003Cstrong\u003Eavtomatik yashirish\u003C/strong\u003E rejimiga oʻtkazadi: panel oʻz biriktirilgan joyidan chiqib, shu chetda kichik yorliqqa aylanadi. Yorliqqa tuting, fokuslang yoki bosing — panel chizma ustiga surilib chiqadi; uzoqlashsangiz (yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bossangiz) u qaytib suriladi. Mahkamlagichni yana bosing yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMahkamlashni bekor qilish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang — panel doimiy biriktiriladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanel sarlavhasidagi yopish tugmasi yoki menyudagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBu panelni yashirish\u003C/span\u003E panelni yashiradi va uning biriktirilgan joyini yigʻadi. Chetdagi punktir yorliq uni qaytaradi: uni bosing yoki fokuslab \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"joylashuv-zichligini-oshirish\"\u003EJoylashuv zichligini oshirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmumiy\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETartib zichligi\u003C/span\u003E da ikkita variant bor. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQulay\u003C/span\u003E — standart. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIxcham\u003C/span\u003E shu ilovaning qator balandliklarini, panel ichki boʻshligʻini, asboblar paneli tugmalarini va panel matnini ixchamlashtiradi, shunda ekranga koʻproq sigʻadi. Bu har bir ilova uchun saqlanadi. Sensorli ekran katta tugmalarini ikkala variantda ham saqlaydi, telefon esa oʻz joylashuvini saqlaydi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETartibni tiklash\u003C/span\u003E zichlikni oʻrnatganingizdek qoldiradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"asboblar-paneli-necha-qatorda-bo-lishini-tanlash\"\u003EAsboblar paneli necha qatorda boʻlishini tanlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmumiy\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsboblar paneli qatorlari\u003C/span\u003E da uchta variant bor. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOʻrash\u003C/span\u003E — standart: har bir asboblar guruhi koʻrinadi, qancha qator kerak boʻlsa shuncha qatorda. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 qator\u003C/span\u003E asboblar panelini ikki qatorda, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E1 qator\u003C/span\u003E esa bir qatorda ushlaydi — chizmaga balandlik ajraladi; sigʻmagan guruhlar asboblar paneli ichida yon tomonga surilib koʻrinadi (sichqoncha gʻildiragi, ikki barmoqli surish yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Tab\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ETab\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E bilan asbobga oʻting). Ikki qatorga sigʻadigan asboblar paneli \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E2 qator\u003C/span\u003E da oʻz holicha qoladi, chunki panjara uni faqat balandroq qilardi. Tanlov har bir ilova uchun saqlanadi. Sensorli ekran va telefon oʻz joylashuvini saqlaydi. CadCraft asboblar paneli uchun oʻz sozlamasiga ega: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E ostida.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"klaviaturadan-foydalanish\"\u003EKlaviaturadan foydalanish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir panelning \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E tugmasi menyuni ochadi: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChapga biriktirish\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOʻngga biriktirish\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPastga biriktirish\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChizma ustida suzish\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EChetga mahkamlash\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBu panelni yashirish\u003C/span\u003E, boshqa panel bilan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYorliq bilan birlashtirish\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYangi oynaga koʻchirish\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoyiga qaytarish\u003C/span\u003E. Tugmaga Tab bilan oʻting, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing, yoʻnalish tugmalari bilan siljiting va yana \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E menyuni yopadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panellarni-ikkinchi-monitorga-qo-yish\"\u003EPanellarni ikkinchi monitorga qoʻyish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang, soʻng \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBarcha panellarni yangi oynaga koʻchirish\u003C/span\u003E. Shuningdek, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E ichida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanellarni yangi oynaga koʻchirish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlashingiz mumkin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanellar bilan kichik oyna ochiladi. Uni boshqa monitoringizga sudrang va xohlagancha katta qiling.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIshni davom eting: panellar avvalgidek chizmaga taʼsir qiladi, chizma esa asosiy oynani toʻldiradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanellar oynasi oldinda turganda tezkor tugmalar ishlaydi: u yerda bosgan tugmalaringiz (matn kiritish qutisidan tashqari) chizmaga boradi. Ilova bergan savollar va dialoglar esa asosiy oynada ochiladi, shuning uchun bir narsa paydo boʻlganda oʻsha yerga qarang. Mavzu va panel matnining oʻlchami asosiy oynaga ergashadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:chromium\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EChrome or Edge\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChrome va Edge oynani ikkinchi ekranga oʻzi joylashtira oladi. Ikkinchi ekran ulangan boʻlsa, panellar oynasida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUni boshqa ekranimga qoʻy\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang (yoki panelning \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menyusida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanellarni boshqa ekranimga qoʻy\u003C/span\u003E). Brauzer bir marta ekranlaringizni koʻrishga ruxsat soʻraydi; ruxsat bergach, panellar oynasi har safar oʻsha ekranda ochiladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:firefox,safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EFirefox or Safari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanellar oynasini boshqa monitorga oʻzingiz sudrang. Keyingi safar u xuddi shu joyda va xuddi shu oʻlchamda ochiladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bir-nechta-panellar-oynasi\"\u003EBir nechta panellar oynasi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir panelning oʻz oynasi boʻlishi mumkin: panellar oynalari soni toʻrtgacha, masalan har bir monitor uchun bittadan.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelning \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menyusida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYangi oynaga koʻchirish\u003C/span\u003E shu panel uchun boshqa oyna ochadi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanellar oynasi 2 ga koʻchirish\u003C/span\u003E (va hokazo) esa uni allaqachon ochiq oynaga koʻchiradi. Ikkinchi oyna «panellar 2» deb ataladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanelni nomi boʻyicha bir oynadan boshqasiga sudrang: asosiy oynada qoʻyib yuborsangiz u shu yerga biriktiriladi (siz ustida turganingizda konturli sohalar koʻrinadi) yoki suzadi, boshqa panellar oynasi ustida qoʻyib yuborsangiz unga koʻchadi. Boshqa joyda qoʻyib yuborsangiz, u avvalgi joyida qoladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanellari qolmagan panellar oynasi oʻzi yopiladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESahifa qayta yuklangandan keyin ilova panellar oynalarini yana taklif qiladi. Brauzerlar har bosishda bitta oyna ochadi, shuning uchun har bir oyna uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeyingisini ochish\u003C/span\u003E ni bir marta tanlang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"joylashuvning-har-bir-qismi-uchun-xuddi-shunday\"\u003EJoylashuvning har bir qismi uchun xuddi shunday\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELenta, asboblar qutisi, asboblar qatorlari va holat paneli ham panel kabi oʻz oynasiga chiqadi: qismdagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menyusini oching va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYangi oynaga koʻchirish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoyiga qaytarish\u003C/span\u003E (yoki oynani yopish) uni uyiga qaytaradi. Shu oynada bosgan tugmalaringiz ilovaga yetib boradi, xuddi panellar oynasidagidek. Har bir qismda shunday bitta menyu bor.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dialogni-ko-chirish\"\u003EDialogni koʻchirish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHar bir dialogni chizmaga xalaqit bermaslik uchun koʻchirish mumkin: uning sarlavha satridan bosib suring. Dialog qayerga qoʻyganingizni eslab qoladi, har biri oʻzicha, va keyingi ochilganda oʻsha joyga qaytadi. Markazga qaytarish uchun sarlavha satrini ikki marta bosing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKlaviaturadan: fokus dialog ichida boʻlganda \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Option\"\u003E⌥\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EAlt\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift\"\u003E⇧\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+yoʻnalish tugmasini bosing — u 16 piksel siljiydi; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E qoʻshsangiz 64 piksel. Kichikroq oyna yoki ekrandan keyin ekrandan tashqariga chiqib qolgan dialog qaytarib keltiriladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETelefonda dialoglar butun kenglikdagi varaq boʻlib qoladi va koʻchirilmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ECadCraft Studio da, ish davomida ochiq qoldirishingiz mumkin boʻlgan CadCraft ning \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPDF ga chop etish\u003C/span\u003E dialogida sarlavha satrida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOʻz oynasida ochish\u003C/span\u003E tugmasi bor. Dialog oʻz oynasiga koʻchadi, uni boshqa monitorga qoʻyish mumkin. Dialogni yopsangiz oyna yopiladi, oynani yopsangiz dialog yopiladi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panellarni-qaytarish\"\u003EPanellarni qaytarish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPanellar oynasida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanellarni qaytarish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki shunchaki yoping. Panellar avvalgi joyiga qaytadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAsosiy oynani yopish yoki qayta yuklash ham panellar oynasini yopadi. Ilova qayta ochilganda panellaringiz oʻz oynasida ekanligini aytadi; oynani qaytarish uchun \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOchish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUlarni shu yerda qoldirish\u003C/span\u003E ni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUmumiy\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETartibni tiklash\u003C/span\u003E har bir panelni boshlangan joyiga qaytaradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanellarni yangi oynaga koʻchirganingizda hech narsa ochilmasa, brauzer pop-up oynani bloklagan boʻladi. Ilova buni aytadi va panellarni avvalgi joyida qoldiradi. getcadcraft.com uchun pop-up oynalarga ruxsat bering va qaytadan urinib koʻring.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJoylashuv har bir ilova uchun shu brauzerda, boshqa sozlamalaringiz bilan birga saqlanadi.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Chizma yonidagi panellarni koʻchirish mumkin. Ularni oʻzingizga qulay joyga qoʻying yoki birinchi monitorning butun maydonini chizma egallashi uchun ikkinchi monitorda alohida oyna bering. Har bir panelning sarlavha satri bor: panel nomi, ⋯ menyusi, mahkamlash tugmasi va yopish tugmasi joylashgan ingichka satr. 0.7 dan oldingi versiyalarda faqat nom va ⋯ menyusi boʻladi. Oynada panelni koʻchirish Panelni tepadagi nomidan sudrang. Sudrash davomida chizmaning chap, oʻng va pastki tomonida konturli sohalar paydo boʻladi. Panelni shulardan biriga tashlang, u oʻsha yerga biriktiriladi. Ustida turgan soha quyuqlashadi. Panelni chizma ustida boshqa joyga tashlasangiz, u suzib yuradi. Panellar bir tomonni boʻlishishi mumkin: ular ustma-ust joylashadi va ikkitasi orasidagi har bir chiziq joyni boʻlish uchun sudraladi (chiziq fokusda boʻlganda yoʻnalish tugmalari uni siljitadi, ikki marta bosilganda joy teng boʻlinadi). Biriktirilgan tomonning ichki chetini sudrab, uni kengroq yoki torroq qiling; chetni ikki marta bosing — u joyiga qaytadi. Suzuvchi panel chizma ustida qoladi. Uni nomi boʻyicha suring, oʻlchamini esa pastki oʻng burchagini sudrab oʻzgartiring (yoki burchakka Tab bilan oʻtib, yoʻnalish tugmalaridan foydalaning). Nomini ikki marta bosing — u avval turgan joyga qayta biriktiriladi. Panelning nomida bir barmoq bilan sudrang. Suzuvchi panelning pastki oʻng burchagini bir barmoq bilan sudrab oʻlchamini oʻzgartiring; biriktirilgan panellar orasidagi chetlar ham shunday. Sudramasdan suzdirish yoki biriktirish uchun ⋯ menyusidan foydalaning. Panellarni yorliqlar sifatida guruhlash Ikki panel bitta ramkani ulashishi va bir vaqtda bittasini koʻrsatishi mumkin. Panelni nomi boʻyicha boshqa panelning sarlavha satriga sudrang (siz ustida turganingizda satr konturlanadi) va qoʻyib yuboring: ramkaning sarlavha satrida har bir panel uchun yorliq paydo boʻladi. Panelni koʻrsatish uchun yorliqni bosing. Yorliq fokusda boʻlganda ← va → yorliqlarni almashtiradi, Home va End birinchi va oxirgisiga oʻtkazadi. Panelni guruhdan chiqarish uchun uning ⋯ menyusida Yorliqlar guruhidan chiqarish ni tanlang yoki uni boshqa joyga sudrang. Sudramasdan guruhlash uchun Yorliq bilan birlashtirish ni va panel nomini tanlang. Mahkamlash, yashirish va qaytarish Panel sarlavha satridagi mahkamlagich uni avtomatik yashirish rejimiga oʻtkazadi: panel oʻz biriktirilgan joyidan chiqib, shu chetda kichik yorliqqa aylanadi. Yorliqqa tuting, fokuslang yoki bosing — panel chizma ustiga surilib chiqadi; uzoqlashsangiz (yoki Esc ni bossangiz) u qaytib suriladi. Mahkamlagichni yana bosing yoki Mahkamlashni bekor qilish ni tanlang — panel doimiy biriktiriladi. Panel sarlavhasidagi yopish tugmasi yoki menyudagi Bu panelni yashirish panelni yashiradi va uning biriktirilgan joyini yigʻadi. Chetdagi punktir yorliq uni qaytaradi: uni bosing yoki fokuslab Enter ni bosing. Joylashuv zichligini oshirish Sozlamalar › Umumiy › Tartib zichligi da ikkita variant bor. Qulay — standart. Ixcham shu ilovaning qator balandliklarini, panel ichki boʻshligʻini, asboblar paneli tugmalarini va panel matnini ixchamlashtiradi, shunda ekranga koʻproq sigʻadi. Bu har bir ilova uchun saqlanadi. Sensorli ekran katta tugmalarini ikkala variantda ham saqlaydi, telefon esa oʻz joylashuvini saqlaydi. Tartibni tiklash zichlikni oʻrnatganingizdek qoldiradi. Asboblar paneli necha qatorda boʻlishini tanlash Sozlamalar › Umumiy › Asboblar paneli qatorlari da uchta variant bor. Oʻrash — standart: har bir asboblar guruhi koʻrinadi, qancha qator kerak boʻlsa shuncha qatorda. 2 qator asboblar panelini ikki qatorda, 1 qator esa bir qatorda ushlaydi — chizmaga balandlik ajraladi; sigʻmagan guruhlar asboblar paneli ichida yon tomonga surilib koʻrinadi (sichqoncha gʻildiragi, ikki barmoqli surish yoki Tab bilan asbobga oʻting). Ikki qatorga sigʻadigan asboblar paneli 2 qator da oʻz holicha qoladi, chunki panjara uni faqat balandroq qilardi. Tanlov har bir ilova uchun saqlanadi. Sensorli ekran va telefon oʻz joylashuvini saqlaydi. CadCraft asboblar paneli uchun oʻz sozlamasiga ega: Sozlamalar › CadCraft ostida. Klaviaturadan foydalanish Har bir panelning ⋯ tugmasi menyuni ochadi: Chapga biriktirish, Oʻngga biriktirish, Pastga biriktirish, Chizma ustida suzish, Chetga mahkamlash, Bu panelni yashirish, boshqa panel bilan Yorliq bilan birlashtirish, Yangi oynaga koʻchirish va Joyiga qaytarish. Tugmaga Tab bilan oʻting, Enter ni bosing, yoʻnalish tugmalari bilan siljiting va yana Enter ni bosing. Esc menyuni yopadi. Panellarni ikkinchi monitorga qoʻyish Panelda ⋯ ni tanlang, soʻng Barcha panellarni yangi oynaga koʻchirish. Shuningdek, Sozlamalar ichida Panellarni yangi oynaga koʻchirish ni tanlashingiz mumkin. Panellar bilan kichik oyna ochiladi. Uni boshqa monitoringizga sudrang va xohlagancha katta qiling. Ishni davom eting: panellar avvalgidek chizmaga taʼsir qiladi, chizma esa asosiy oynani toʻldiradi. Panellar oynasi oldinda turganda tezkor tugmalar ishlaydi: u yerda bosgan tugmalaringiz (matn kiritish qutisidan tashqari) chizmaga boradi. Ilova bergan savollar va dialoglar esa asosiy oynada ochiladi, shuning uchun bir narsa paydo boʻlganda oʻsha yerga qarang. Mavzu va panel matnining oʻlchami asosiy oynaga ergashadi. Chrome va Edge oynani ikkinchi ekranga oʻzi joylashtira oladi. Ikkinchi ekran ulangan boʻlsa, panellar oynasida Uni boshqa ekranimga qoʻy ni tanlang (yoki panelning ⋯ menyusida Panellarni boshqa ekranimga qoʻy). Brauzer bir marta ekranlaringizni koʻrishga ruxsat soʻraydi; ruxsat bergach, panellar oynasi har safar oʻsha ekranda ochiladi. Panellar oynasini boshqa monitorga oʻzingiz sudrang. Keyingi safar u xuddi shu joyda va xuddi shu oʻlchamda ochiladi. Bir nechta panellar oynasi Har bir panelning oʻz oynasi boʻlishi mumkin: panellar oynalari soni toʻrtgacha, masalan har bir monitor uchun bittadan. Panelning ⋯ menyusida Yangi oynaga koʻchirish shu panel uchun boshqa oyna ochadi, Panellar oynasi 2 ga koʻchirish (va hokazo) esa uni allaqachon ochiq oynaga koʻchiradi. Ikkinchi oyna «panellar 2» deb ataladi. Panelni nomi boʻyicha bir oynadan boshqasiga sudrang: asosiy oynada qoʻyib yuborsangiz u shu yerga biriktiriladi (siz ustida turganingizda konturli sohalar koʻrinadi) yoki suzadi, boshqa panellar oynasi ustida qoʻyib yuborsangiz unga koʻchadi. Boshqa joyda qoʻyib yuborsangiz, u avvalgi joyida qoladi. Panellari qolmagan panellar oynasi oʻzi yopiladi. Sahifa qayta yuklangandan keyin ilova panellar oynalarini yana taklif qiladi. Brauzerlar har bosishda bitta oyna ochadi, shuning uchun har bir oyna uchun Keyingisini ochish ni bir marta tanlang. Joylashuvning har bir qismi uchun xuddi shunday Lenta, asboblar qutisi, asboblar qatorlari va holat paneli ham panel kabi oʻz oynasiga chiqadi: qismdagi ⋯ menyusini oching va Yangi oynaga koʻchirish ni tanlang; Joyiga qaytarish (yoki oynani yopish) uni uyiga qaytaradi. Shu oynada bosgan tugmalaringiz ilovaga yetib boradi, xuddi panellar oynasidagidek. Har bir qismda shunday bitta menyu bor. Dialogni koʻchirish Har bir dialogni chizmaga xalaqit bermaslik uchun koʻchirish mumkin: uning sarlavha satridan bosib suring. Dialog qayerga qoʻyganingizni eslab qoladi, har biri oʻzicha, va keyingi ochilganda oʻsha joyga qaytadi. Markazga qaytarish uchun sarlavha satrini ikki marta bosing. Klaviaturadan: fokus dialog ichida boʻlganda Alt+Shift+yoʻnalish tugmasini bosing — u 16 piksel siljiydi; Ctrl qoʻshsangiz 64 piksel. Kichikroq oyna yoki ekrandan keyin ekrandan tashqariga chiqib qolgan dialog qaytarib keltiriladi. Telefonda dialoglar butun kenglikdagi varaq boʻlib qoladi va koʻchirilmaydi. CadCraft Studio da, ish davomida ochiq qoldirishingiz mumkin boʻlgan CadCraft ning PDF ga chop etish dialogida sarlavha satrida Oʻz oynasida ochish tugmasi bor. Dialog oʻz oynasiga koʻchadi, uni boshqa monitorga qoʻyish mumkin. Dialogni yopsangiz oyna yopiladi, oynani yopsangiz dialog yopiladi. Panellarni qaytarish Panellar oynasida Panellarni qaytarish ni tanlang yoki shunchaki yoping. Panellar avvalgi joyiga qaytadi. Asosiy oynani yopish yoki qayta yuklash ham panellar oynasini yopadi. Ilova qayta ochilganda panellaringiz oʻz oynasida ekanligini aytadi; oynani qaytarish uchun Ochish ni tanlang yoki Ularni shu yerda qoldirish ni. Sozlamalar › Umumiy › Tartibni tiklash har bir panelni boshlangan joyiga qaytaradi. Panellarni yangi oynaga koʻchirganingizda hech narsa ochilmasa, brauzer pop-up oynani bloklagan boʻladi. Ilova buni aytadi va panellarni avvalgi joyida qoldiradi. getcadcraft.com uchun pop-up oynalarga ruxsat bering va qaytadan urinib koʻring. Joylashuv har bir ilova uchun shu brauzerda, boshqa sozlamalaringiz bilan birga saqlanadi.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"dock-tool-groups","scope":"basics","title":"Dock a group of tools beside the drawing, and bring your windows back","summary":"Turn a ribbon group, a tool-row group or a toolbox group into a palette in a side panel or a column of the drawing, with tabs and collapse, and put it back; every bar has the same grip and close; the windows you tore off come back in one click.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["dock","palette","ribbon group","tool group","toolbox group","tool rows","side panel","tabs","collapse","grip","handle","drag","close","open in a window","restore my windows","second monitor","two screens","remembered windows"],"headings":[{"id":"the-grip-and-the-close-button","text":"The grip and the close button","level":2},{"id":"dock-a-group-as-a-palette","text":"Dock a group as a palette","level":2},{"id":"put-it-back","text":"Put it back","level":2},{"id":"arrange-mode","text":"Arrange mode","level":2},{"id":"your-windows-next-time","text":"Your windows, next time","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E&lt;!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --&gt; &lt;!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner&#039;s switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=&quot;1&quot;]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php &lt;app&gt; for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10&#039;s. --&gt;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-grip-and-the-close-button\"\u003EThe grip and the close button\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEvery bar that can move has the same head: a grip \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⠿\u003C/span\u003E at the far left and a close button \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen in a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the bar&#039;s own choices (such as \u003Cstrong\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/strong\u003E) and \u003Cstrong\u003EHide\u003C/strong\u003E. You can also right-click the head.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"dock-a-group-as-a-palette\"\u003EDock a group as a palette\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrag the group&#039;s grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing&#039;s left and right columns.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group&#039;s name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOr click the grip and pick \u003Cstrong\u003EDock to\u003C/strong\u003E and a place.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETwo groups in the same place become tabs. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E button folds the palette to its head and opens it again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"put-it-back\"\u003EPut it back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EClick the palette&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E×\u003C/span\u003E, pick \u003Cstrong\u003EPut it back\u003C/strong\u003E in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhere you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"arrange-mode\"\u003EArrange mode\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-windows-next-time\"\u003EYour windows, next time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click \u003Cstrong\u003ERestore my windows\u003C/strong\u003E again. \u003Cstrong\u003EKeep them here\u003C/strong\u003E forgets them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"\u003C!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 --\u003E \u003C!-- DRAFT (session ui-dock2-10, 2026-11-15). Not in assets/help/: what it describes shows only with the owner's switch (html[data-cc-ws-edit=\"1\"]). Move it to assets/help/common/ and run php bin/build-help.php \u003Capp\u003E for the eight apps in the same step that turns the switch on; other languages are lang-10's. --\u003E In a layout with a ribbon, tool rows or a toolbox, any group of tools can leave its bar and become a palette at the side, as a column of tools. The grip and the close button Every bar that can move has the same head: a grip ⠿ at the far left and a close button × at the far right. Click the grip for its menu: Open in a window, the bar's own choices (such as Collapse the ribbon) and Hide. You can also right-click the head. Each group of tools has a small grip at the left of its name. Dock a group as a palette Drag the group's grip. Outlined areas appear: the left panel, the right panel, and the drawing's left and right columns. Drop the group on one of them. Its tools now stand in a column there, under a head with the group's name. Or click the grip and pick Dock to and a place. Two groups in the same place become tabs. The ⌃ button folds the palette to its head and opens it again. Put it back Click the palette's ×, pick Put it back in its grip menu, or drag its grip onto the bar it came from. The group goes back to its place in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox. Where you docked each group is remembered for this app and this layout. Arrange mode While you arrange the layout (Settings › Layout › Arrange), the places where a group can dock are outlined. Your windows, next time A bar you moved to its own window remembers where that window was, and on which screen, for this app and layout. When you open the app again, a note offers Restore my windows: one click opens them where they were. A browser may open only one window per click; if one stays closed, click Restore my windows again. Keep them here forgets them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-ribbon","scope":"basics","title":"Lenta va loyiha brauzeri joylashuvida ishlash","summary":"Ilovani chizma ustida yorliqli lenta, chapda Xususiyatlar va loyiha brauzeri, har bir ochiq koʻrinish uchun yorliq bilan joylashuvga oʻtkazing va xohlagan vaqtda klassik joylashuvga qaytishingiz mumkin.","section":"start","order":36,"keywords":["joylashuv","ish maydoni","lenta","lenta yorliqlari","loyiha brauzeri","brauzer","palitralar","xususiyatlar palitrasi","koʻrinish yorliqlari","holat paneli","tez kirish","lentani yigʻish","lentani kichraytirish","lenta oynasi","klassik joylashuv","joylashuvni almashtirish","biriktirilgan"],"headings":[{"id":"tanlash","text":"Tanlash","level":2},{"id":"nima-qayerda","text":"Nima qayerda","level":2},{"id":"lentadan-klaviatura-bilan-foydalanish","text":"Lentadan klaviatura bilan foydalanish","level":2},{"id":"lentani-yig-ish-yoki-unga-o-z-oynasini-berish","text":"Lentani yigʻish yoki unga oʻz oynasini berish","level":2},{"id":"panellaringiz-o-zingizniki-bo-lib-qoladi","text":"Panellaringiz oʻzingizniki boʻlib qoladi","level":2},{"id":"klassik-joylashuvga-qaytish","text":"Klassik joylashuvga qaytish","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELenta va loyiha brauzeri\u003C/strong\u003E ilovaning uchta ish maydoni joylashuvidan biri. Yuqorida yorliqlar lentasi, chap panelda Xususiyatlar va loyiha brauzeri birga turadi, ochgan har bir koʻrinish chizma ustida yorliq oladi va pastda holat paneli joylashgan. Asboblar ilovaning oʻz asboblari: klassik joylashuvda bajara oladigan hamma narsa bu yerda ham ishlaydi, chizmangiz, menyu uslubingiz va tugmalaringiz oʻzgarmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tanlash\"\u003ETanlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E ni oching (tishli belgi yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E yorligʻini tanlang, soʻng \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoylashuv\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsh maydoni\u003C/span\u003E ga oʻting.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELenta va loyiha brauzeri\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJoylashuv darhol oʻzgaradi. Tanlov brauzerdagi barcha ilovalar uchun bir xil: har bir ilova shu joylashuvda ochiladi va u sahifa chizilishidan oldin tayyor boʻladi, shuning uchun klassik joylashuvni hech qachon koʻrmaysiz.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nima-qayerda\"\u003ENima qayerda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESarlavha satri:\u003C/strong\u003E ilovaning nomi, tezkor kirish tugmalari (ochish, saqlash, ortga qaytarish, qayta bajarish), ochiq fayl nomi, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBu yerda har bir asbob nima qiladi\u003C/span\u003E (har bir asbob roʻyxati qidiruv qutisi bilan, qaysilari hozir tayyor va boshqalari nega tayyor emasligi aytiladi), toʻliq ekran, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYordam\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E. Bu joylashuvda sarlavha satri ilova satri oʻrnini egallaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELenta:\u003C/strong\u003E ilovaning asboblari yorliqlarda, har bir yorliq guruhlarda. Chapdagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFayl\u003C/span\u003E ochish, saqlash va boshqalarni beradi. Ba&#039;zi ilovalar ma&#039;lum rejim yoki ish maydonida ishlayotganingizda oʻz yorligʻini qoʻshadi; u qoʻllanilayotgan vaqtda yoqilgan turadi va keyin yoʻqoladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EVariantlar satri:\u003C/strong\u003E lenta ostida, ishlayotgan asbob sizdan nima kutayotgani yoki tanlangan narsa.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EChap panel:\u003C/strong\u003E tepada \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXususiyatlar\u003C/span\u003E, pastda esa palitralar (loyiha brauzeri va panelning oʻz mazmuni) yorliq boʻlib turadi. Ular orasidagi chiziqni sudrab joyni boʻlishing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKoʻrinish yorliqlari:\u003C/strong\u003E ochgan har bir koʻrinish uchun bitta yorliq (varaq, reja, sahna…). Yorligʻining yopish tugmasi bilan yoping; fayl ochiq qoladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKoʻrinish satri va holat paneli:\u003C/strong\u003E chizma ostida koʻrinishning oʻz boshqaruvlari (masshtab, kattalashtirish); pastda ilovaning xabarlari.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHozir ishlay olmaydigan asbob xira koʻrinadi va izohi sababini aytadi (masalan, «Avval faylni oching» yoki ilovada bu asbob hali yoʻqligi). Uni bosing yoki unda \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing, sababini qutida oʻqing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lentadan-klaviatura-bilan-foydalanish\"\u003ELentadan klaviatura bilan foydalanish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELenta yorligʻi fokusda boʻlganda \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"←\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E←\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"→\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003E→\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E yorliqlar orasida yuradi, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn ←\"\u003Efn ←\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EHome\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E va \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"fn →\"\u003Efn →\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnd\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E birinchi va oxirgisiga oʻtkazadi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E avval ishlayotgan asbobni tugatadi, klassik joylashuvdagidek, va har bir tezkor tugma hamda \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ekran rejimlari) avvalgidek ishlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"lentani-yig-ish-yoki-unga-o-z-oynasini-berish\"\u003ELentani yigʻish yoki unga oʻz oynasini berish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELenta yorligʻini ikki marta bosing — lenta faqat yorliqlariga yigʻiladi; yorliqni bossangiz, keyingi harakatgacha uning asboblari koʻrinadi. Yana ikki marta bosing — u ochiq turadi. Lentaning oʻng uchidagi \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELentani koʻchirish\u003C/span\u003E tugmasida ham \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELentani yigʻish\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELentani ochiq saqlash\u003C/span\u003E bor. Har bir ilova buni eslab qoladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELentani koʻchirish\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYangi oynaga koʻchirish\u003C/span\u003E lentani oʻz oynasiga, masalan ikkinchi monitorga qoʻyadi. U yerda bosilgan tugmalar ilovaga yetib boradi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELentani joyiga qaytarish\u003C/span\u003E yoki oynani yopish uni uyiga qaytaradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAsboblar paneli sozlamalari lentaga ham taalluqli: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsboblar paneli\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBelgilar va yorliqlar\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaqat belgilar\u003C/span\u003E (bunda lenta har bir guruhda ikki qator kichik belgi koʻrsatadi) yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaqat yorliqlar\u003C/span\u003E, hamda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuruh nomlarini koʻrsatish (Fayl, Chizish, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panellaringiz-o-zingizniki-bo-lib-qoladi\"\u003EPanellaringiz oʻzingizniki boʻlib qoladi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChap va oʻng panellar \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EPanellarni joylashtirish\u003C/a\u003E da tasvirlangan hamma narsani saqlaydi: biriktirish, suzdirish, mahkamlash, yashirish, yorliqlar, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYangi oynaga koʻchirish\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETartibni tiklash\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"klassik-joylashuvga-qaytish\"\u003EKlassik joylashuvga qaytish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoylashuv\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsh maydoni\u003C/span\u003E ni oching va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft klassik\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Har bir asboblar paneli, yorliq va panel avvalgi joyiga qaytadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETelefonda yoki 760 piksel yoki undan tor oynada ilova tanlaganingizdan qat&#039;i nazar telefon joylashuvidan foydalanadi. Kengroq oyna sizning joylashuvingizni qaytaradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoshqa tartibni sinab koʻrish uchun \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Easboblar qutisi va axborot qutisi joylashuvi\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBu joylashuvda koʻrsatiladigan narsani oʻzgartirish uchun \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EEkrandagi joylashuvni oʻzgartirish\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang; qorongʻi, menyu satri va lentali tartib uchun \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003EDrafting joylashuvi\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Lenta va loyiha brauzeri ilovaning uchta ish maydoni joylashuvidan biri. Yuqorida yorliqlar lentasi, chap panelda Xususiyatlar va loyiha brauzeri birga turadi, ochgan har bir koʻrinish chizma ustida yorliq oladi va pastda holat paneli joylashgan. Asboblar ilovaning oʻz asboblari: klassik joylashuvda bajara oladigan hamma narsa bu yerda ham ishlaydi, chizmangiz, menyu uslubingiz va tugmalaringiz oʻzgarmaydi. Tanlash Sozlamalar ni oching (tishli belgi yoki Ctrl+,). Global yorligʻini tanlang, soʻng Joylashuv › Ish maydoni ga oʻting. Lenta va loyiha brauzeri ni tanlang. Joylashuv darhol oʻzgaradi. Tanlov brauzerdagi barcha ilovalar uchun bir xil: har bir ilova shu joylashuvda ochiladi va u sahifa chizilishidan oldin tayyor boʻladi, shuning uchun klassik joylashuvni hech qachon koʻrmaysiz. Nima qayerda Sarlavha satri: ilovaning nomi, tezkor kirish tugmalari (ochish, saqlash, ortga qaytarish, qayta bajarish), ochiq fayl nomi, Bu yerda har bir asbob nima qiladi (har bir asbob roʻyxati qidiruv qutisi bilan, qaysilari hozir tayyor va boshqalari nega tayyor emasligi aytiladi), toʻliq ekran, Yordam va Sozlamalar. Bu joylashuvda sarlavha satri ilova satri oʻrnini egallaydi. Lenta: ilovaning asboblari yorliqlarda, har bir yorliq guruhlarda. Chapdagi Fayl ochish, saqlash va boshqalarni beradi. Ba'zi ilovalar ma'lum rejim yoki ish maydonida ishlayotganingizda oʻz yorligʻini qoʻshadi; u qoʻllanilayotgan vaqtda yoqilgan turadi va keyin yoʻqoladi. Variantlar satri: lenta ostida, ishlayotgan asbob sizdan nima kutayotgani yoki tanlangan narsa. Chap panel: tepada Xususiyatlar, pastda esa palitralar (loyiha brauzeri va panelning oʻz mazmuni) yorliq boʻlib turadi. Ular orasidagi chiziqni sudrab joyni boʻlishing. Koʻrinish yorliqlari: ochgan har bir koʻrinish uchun bitta yorliq (varaq, reja, sahna…). Yorligʻining yopish tugmasi bilan yoping; fayl ochiq qoladi. Koʻrinish satri va holat paneli: chizma ostida koʻrinishning oʻz boshqaruvlari (masshtab, kattalashtirish); pastda ilovaning xabarlari. Hozir ishlay olmaydigan asbob xira koʻrinadi va izohi sababini aytadi (masalan, «Avval faylni oching» yoki ilovada bu asbob hali yoʻqligi). Uni bosing yoki unda Enter ni bosing, sababini qutida oʻqing. Lentadan klaviatura bilan foydalanish Lenta yorligʻi fokusda boʻlganda ← va → yorliqlar orasida yuradi, Home va End birinchi va oxirgisiga oʻtkazadi. Esc avval ishlayotgan asbobni tugatadi, klassik joylashuvdagidek, va har bir tezkor tugma hamda Ctrl+Shift+F (ekran rejimlari) avvalgidek ishlaydi. Lentani yigʻish yoki unga oʻz oynasini berish Lenta yorligʻini ikki marta bosing — lenta faqat yorliqlariga yigʻiladi; yorliqni bossangiz, keyingi harakatgacha uning asboblari koʻrinadi. Yana ikki marta bosing — u ochiq turadi. Lentaning oʻng uchidagi Lentani koʻchirish tugmasida ham Lentani yigʻish va Lentani ochiq saqlash bor. Har bir ilova buni eslab qoladi. Lentani koʻchirish › Yangi oynaga koʻchirish lentani oʻz oynasiga, masalan ikkinchi monitorga qoʻyadi. U yerda bosilgan tugmalar ilovaga yetib boradi. Lentani joyiga qaytarish yoki oynani yopish uni uyiga qaytaradi. Asboblar paneli sozlamalari lentaga ham taalluqli: Sozlamalar › Global › Asboblar paneli › Belgilar va yorliqlar, Faqat belgilar (bunda lenta har bir guruhda ikki qator kichik belgi koʻrsatadi) yoki Faqat yorliqlar, hamda Guruh nomlarini koʻrsatish (Fayl, Chizish, …). Panellaringiz oʻzingizniki boʻlib qoladi Chap va oʻng panellar Panellarni joylashtirish da tasvirlangan hamma narsani saqlaydi: biriktirish, suzdirish, mahkamlash, yashirish, yorliqlar, Yangi oynaga koʻchirish va Tartibni tiklash. Klassik joylashuvga qaytish Sozlamalar › Global › Joylashuv › Ish maydoni ni oching va CadCraft klassik ni tanlang. Har bir asboblar paneli, yorliq va panel avvalgi joyiga qaytadi. Telefonda yoki 760 piksel yoki undan tor oynada ilova tanlaganingizdan qat'i nazar telefon joylashuvidan foydalanadi. Kengroq oyna sizning joylashuvingizni qaytaradi. Boshqa tartibni sinab koʻrish uchun asboblar qutisi va axborot qutisi joylashuvi ga qarang. Bu joylashuvda koʻrsatiladigan narsani oʻzgartirish uchun Ekrandagi joylashuvni oʻzgartirish ga qarang; qorongʻi, menyu satri va lentali tartib uchun Drafting joylashuvi ga qarang.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"layout-toolbox","scope":"basics","title":"Asboblar qutisi va axborot qutisi joylashuvida ishlash","summary":"Ilovani chapda asboblar ustuni (oʻz asboblaringiz uchun joylar bilan), yuqorida ishlayotgan asbob yoki tanlangan narsani koʻrsatadigan axborot qutisi, oʻngda navigator, har bir koʻrinish uchun yorliq, tezkor variantlar va tahrirlash palitrasi bilan joylashuvga oʻtkazing va xohlagan vaqtda klassik joylashuvga qaytishingiz mumkin.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["joylashuv","ish maydoni","asboblar qutisi","asboblar ustuni","axborot qutisi","axborot paneli","navigator","loyiha xaritasi","tez panel","tezkor variantlar","tahrirlash palitrasi","palitra","mening asboblarim","sevimli asboblar","koʻrinish yorliqlari","asboblar qutisi oynasi","klassik joylashuv","joylashuvni almashtirish"],"headings":[{"id":"tanlash","text":"Tanlash","level":2},{"id":"nima-qayerda","text":"Nima qayerda","level":2},{"id":"asboblar-qutisiga-o-z-oynasini-berish","text":"Asboblar qutisiga oʻz oynasini berish","level":2},{"id":"panellaringiz-o-zingizniki-bo-lib-qoladi","text":"Panellaringiz oʻzingizniki boʻlib qoladi","level":2},{"id":"klassik-joylashuvga-qaytish","text":"Klassik joylashuvga qaytish","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsboblar qutisi va axborot qutisi\u003C/strong\u003E ilovaning uchta ish maydoni joylashuvidan biri. Chizma asboblari chap tomonda ustunda turadi, yuqorida axborot qutisi ishlayotgan asbob nimani kutayotganini yoki siz nimani tanlaganingizni koʻrsatadi, har bir koʻrinish yorligʻi bor va chizma ostidagi tezkor panelda bir nechta kundalik variant turadi. Asboblar ilovaning oʻz asboblari: klassik joylashuvda bajara oladigan hamma narsa bu yerda ham ishlaydi, chizmangiz, menyu uslubingiz va tugmalaringiz oʻzgarmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"tanlash\"\u003ETanlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E ni oching (tishli belgi yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E yorligʻini tanlang, soʻng \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoylashuv\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsh maydoni\u003C/span\u003E ga oʻting.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsboblar qutisi va axborot qutisi\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EJoylashuv darhol oʻzgaradi. Tanlov brauzerdagi barcha ilovalar uchun bir xil: har bir ilova shu joylashuvda ochiladi va u sahifa chizilishidan oldin tayyor boʻladi, shuning uchun klassik joylashuvni hech qachon koʻrmaysiz.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"nima-qayerda\"\u003ENima qayerda\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsboblar paneli:\u003C/strong\u003E ilovaning oʻz asboblar paneli, menyulari bilan birga, chizma maydoni tepasida qoladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAxborot qutisi:\u003C/strong\u003E asboblar paneli ostida. Asbob ishlayotganda u asbobni va undan nima soʻralayotganini koʻrsatadi. Biror narsa tanlaganingizda uning asosiy sozlamalarini koʻrsatadi (devor uchun: turi, qalinligi, uzunligi, joylashuv chizigʻi va balandligi) va ularni shu yerning oʻzida oʻzgartirishingiz mumkin: bu yerdagi oʻzgarish \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXususiyatlar\u003C/span\u003E dagi bilan bir xil, \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command Z\"\u003E⌘Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Z\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E uni ortga qaytaradi. Hech narsa tanlanmagan boʻlsa, u «Hech narsa tanlanmagan» deydi. Har bir ilova bu yerga oʻz qutilarini qoʻshadi, masalan joriy qatlam yoki sath yoki ochiq hujjat.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsboblar qutisi:\u003C/strong\u003E chapdagi ustun, ilovaning asboblari guruhlarda. Guruh nomini bossangiz, u yigʻiladi yoki qayta ochiladi. Ishlayotgan asbob yonadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMening asboblarim:\u003C/strong\u003E asboblar qutisining birinchi guruhi, eng koʻp ishlatadigan asboblaringiz uchun sakkizta boʻsh joy. Boʻsh joyni bosib ilovaning istalgan asbobi yoki buyrugʻini tanlang; yoki asboblar qutisidagi asbobni oʻng tugma bilan bosib \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMening asboblarimga qoʻshish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang; yoki asbobni joyga sudrang. Joyni oʻzgartirish yoki boʻshatish uchun uni oʻng tugma bilan bosing. Sizning joylaringiz shu brauzerda har bir ilova uchun saqlanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENavigator:\u003C/strong\u003E oʻng panel. Ilovaning loyiha brauzeri tepada turadi (rejalar, kesimlar, fasadlar, 3D koʻrinishlar, jadvallar, varaqlar — ilovada mavjud boʻlganlari): ularning birini bossangiz, u ochiladi. Uning ostida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXususiyatlar\u003C/span\u003E va oʻng panelning boshqa mazmuni yorligʻi turadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKoʻrinish yorliqlari:\u003C/strong\u003E ochiq fayldagi har bir koʻrinish uchun yorliq (varaq, reja, sahna…), chizma ustida.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETezkor panel:\u003C/strong\u003E chizma ostida: koʻrinish sozlamalari va ilova bergan kundalik variantlar, masalan masshtab, batafsillik darajasi, koʻrinish diapazoni, moslashtirish, reja, boʻlish yoki 3D, tutib olish va birliklar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETahrirlash palitrasi:\u003C/strong\u003E chizmadagi biror narsani bossangiz, koʻrsatkich yonida kichik palitra chiqadi; unda shu narsa uchun ilovaning tahrirlash buyruqlari — koʻchirish, nusxalash, aylantirish, akslantirish, dublikat yoki oʻchirish — va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EXususiyatlar\u003C/span\u003E boʻladi. \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, sichqoncha gʻildiragi, boshqa bosish yoki uning yopish tugmasi uni yashiradi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHozir ishlay olmaydigan asbob xira koʻrinadi va izohi sababini aytadi. Uni bosing yoki unda \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E ni bosing, sababini qutida oʻqing.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E avval ishlayotgan asbobni tugatadi, klassik joylashuvdagidek, va har bir tezkor tugma hamda \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E (ekran rejimlari) avvalgidek ishlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"asboblar-qutisiga-o-z-oynasini-berish\"\u003EAsboblar qutisiga oʻz oynasini berish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsboblar qutisini koʻchirish\u003C/span\u003E tugmasi asboblar qutisi tepasida \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYangi oynaga koʻchirish\u003C/span\u003E ga ega: asboblar qutisi tor oʻz oynasida ochiladi, uni ilova yonida yoki ikkinchi monitorda qoʻyish mumkin. Shu oynada bosgan tugmalaringiz ilovaga yetib boradi. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsboblar qutisini joyiga qaytarish\u003C/span\u003E yoki oynani yopish uni uyiga qaytaradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAsboblar paneli sozlamalari asboblar qutisiga ham taalluqli: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsboblar paneli\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBelgilar va yorliqlar\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaqat belgilar\u003C/span\u003E yoki \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFaqat yorliqlar\u003C/span\u003E, hamda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGuruh nomlarini koʻrsatish (Fayl, Chizish, …)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panellaringiz-o-zingizniki-bo-lib-qoladi\"\u003EPanellaringiz oʻzingizniki boʻlib qoladi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChap va oʻng panellar \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EPanellarni joylashtirish\u003C/a\u003E da tasvirlangan hamma narsani saqlaydi: biriktirish, suzdirish, mahkamlash, yashirish, yorliqlar, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYangi oynaga koʻchirish\u003C/span\u003E va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETartibni tiklash\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"klassik-joylashuvga-qaytish\"\u003EKlassik joylashuvga qaytish\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoylashuv\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsh maydoni\u003C/span\u003E ni oching va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft klassik\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Har bir asboblar paneli, yorliq va panel avvalgi joyiga qaytadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETelefonda yoki 760 piksel yoki undan tor oynada ilova tanlaganingizdan qat&#039;i nazar telefon joylashuvidan foydalanadi. Kengroq oyna sizning joylashuvingizni qaytaradi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoshqa tartibni sinab koʻrish uchun \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Elenta va loyiha brauzeri joylashuvi\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBu joylashuvda koʻrsatiladigan narsani oʻzgartirish uchun \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EEkrandagi joylashuvni oʻzgartirish\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang; qorongʻi, menyu satri va lentali tartib uchun \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003EDrafting joylashuvi\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Asboblar qutisi va axborot qutisi ilovaning uchta ish maydoni joylashuvidan biri. Chizma asboblari chap tomonda ustunda turadi, yuqorida axborot qutisi ishlayotgan asbob nimani kutayotganini yoki siz nimani tanlaganingizni koʻrsatadi, har bir koʻrinish yorligʻi bor va chizma ostidagi tezkor panelda bir nechta kundalik variant turadi. Asboblar ilovaning oʻz asboblari: klassik joylashuvda bajara oladigan hamma narsa bu yerda ham ishlaydi, chizmangiz, menyu uslubingiz va tugmalaringiz oʻzgarmaydi. Tanlash Sozlamalar ni oching (tishli belgi yoki Ctrl+,). Global yorligʻini tanlang, soʻng Joylashuv › Ish maydoni ga oʻting. Asboblar qutisi va axborot qutisi ni tanlang. Joylashuv darhol oʻzgaradi. Tanlov brauzerdagi barcha ilovalar uchun bir xil: har bir ilova shu joylashuvda ochiladi va u sahifa chizilishidan oldin tayyor boʻladi, shuning uchun klassik joylashuvni hech qachon koʻrmaysiz. Nima qayerda Asboblar paneli: ilovaning oʻz asboblar paneli, menyulari bilan birga, chizma maydoni tepasida qoladi. Axborot qutisi: asboblar paneli ostida. Asbob ishlayotganda u asbobni va undan nima soʻralayotganini koʻrsatadi. Biror narsa tanlaganingizda uning asosiy sozlamalarini koʻrsatadi (devor uchun: turi, qalinligi, uzunligi, joylashuv chizigʻi va balandligi) va ularni shu yerning oʻzida oʻzgartirishingiz mumkin: bu yerdagi oʻzgarish Xususiyatlar dagi bilan bir xil, Ctrl+Z uni ortga qaytaradi. Hech narsa tanlanmagan boʻlsa, u «Hech narsa tanlanmagan» deydi. Har bir ilova bu yerga oʻz qutilarini qoʻshadi, masalan joriy qatlam yoki sath yoki ochiq hujjat. Asboblar qutisi: chapdagi ustun, ilovaning asboblari guruhlarda. Guruh nomini bossangiz, u yigʻiladi yoki qayta ochiladi. Ishlayotgan asbob yonadi. Mening asboblarim: asboblar qutisining birinchi guruhi, eng koʻp ishlatadigan asboblaringiz uchun sakkizta boʻsh joy. Boʻsh joyni bosib ilovaning istalgan asbobi yoki buyrugʻini tanlang; yoki asboblar qutisidagi asbobni oʻng tugma bilan bosib Mening asboblarimga qoʻshish ni tanlang; yoki asbobni joyga sudrang. Joyni oʻzgartirish yoki boʻshatish uchun uni oʻng tugma bilan bosing. Sizning joylaringiz shu brauzerda har bir ilova uchun saqlanadi. Navigator: oʻng panel. Ilovaning loyiha brauzeri tepada turadi (rejalar, kesimlar, fasadlar, 3D koʻrinishlar, jadvallar, varaqlar — ilovada mavjud boʻlganlari): ularning birini bossangiz, u ochiladi. Uning ostida Xususiyatlar va oʻng panelning boshqa mazmuni yorligʻi turadi. Koʻrinish yorliqlari: ochiq fayldagi har bir koʻrinish uchun yorliq (varaq, reja, sahna…), chizma ustida. Tezkor panel: chizma ostida: koʻrinish sozlamalari va ilova bergan kundalik variantlar, masalan masshtab, batafsillik darajasi, koʻrinish diapazoni, moslashtirish, reja, boʻlish yoki 3D, tutib olish va birliklar. Tahrirlash palitrasi: chizmadagi biror narsani bossangiz, koʻrsatkich yonida kichik palitra chiqadi; unda shu narsa uchun ilovaning tahrirlash buyruqlari — koʻchirish, nusxalash, aylantirish, akslantirish, dublikat yoki oʻchirish — va Xususiyatlar boʻladi. Esc, sichqoncha gʻildiragi, boshqa bosish yoki uning yopish tugmasi uni yashiradi. Hozir ishlay olmaydigan asbob xira koʻrinadi va izohi sababini aytadi. Uni bosing yoki unda Enter ni bosing, sababini qutida oʻqing. Esc avval ishlayotgan asbobni tugatadi, klassik joylashuvdagidek, va har bir tezkor tugma hamda Ctrl+Shift+F (ekran rejimlari) avvalgidek ishlaydi. Asboblar qutisiga oʻz oynasini berish Asboblar qutisini koʻchirish tugmasi asboblar qutisi tepasida Yangi oynaga koʻchirish ga ega: asboblar qutisi tor oʻz oynasida ochiladi, uni ilova yonida yoki ikkinchi monitorda qoʻyish mumkin. Shu oynada bosgan tugmalaringiz ilovaga yetib boradi. Asboblar qutisini joyiga qaytarish yoki oynani yopish uni uyiga qaytaradi. Asboblar paneli sozlamalari asboblar qutisiga ham taalluqli: Sozlamalar › Global › Asboblar paneli › Belgilar va yorliqlar, Faqat belgilar yoki Faqat yorliqlar, hamda Guruh nomlarini koʻrsatish (Fayl, Chizish, …). Panellaringiz oʻzingizniki boʻlib qoladi Chap va oʻng panellar Panellarni joylashtirish da tasvirlangan hamma narsani saqlaydi: biriktirish, suzdirish, mahkamlash, yashirish, yorliqlar, Yangi oynaga koʻchirish va Tartibni tiklash. Klassik joylashuvga qaytish Sozlamalar › Global › Joylashuv › Ish maydoni ni oching va CadCraft klassik ni tanlang. Har bir asboblar paneli, yorliq va panel avvalgi joyiga qaytadi. Telefonda yoki 760 piksel yoki undan tor oynada ilova tanlaganingizdan qat'i nazar telefon joylashuvidan foydalanadi. Kengroq oyna sizning joylashuvingizni qaytaradi. Boshqa tartibni sinab koʻrish uchun lenta va loyiha brauzeri joylashuvi ga qarang. Bu joylashuvda koʻrsatiladigan narsani oʻzgartirish uchun Ekrandagi joylashuvni oʻzgartirish ga qarang; qorongʻi, menyu satri va lentali tartib uchun Drafting joylashuvi ga qarang.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"icons-one-set","scope":"basics","title":"One set of icons in every layout","summary":"Every tool in the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the menus and the palettes is drawn from one icon set, in the same style in every layout; choose full colour, an outline in your own colour, or the app's own drawings under Settings.","section":"start","order":37,"keywords":["icons","icon set","icon style","full colour","outline","colorized","each app's own drawings","ribbon icons","toolbar icons","toolbox icons","menu icons","palette icons","consistent icons","layout icons","tool pictures","icon colour"],"headings":[{"id":"choose-how-the-icons-look","text":"Choose how the icons look","level":2},{"id":"what-stays-the-same","text":"What stays the same","level":2},{"id":"if-a-picture-is-wrong","text":"If a picture is wrong","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EEvery tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel&#039;s \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-how-the-icons-look\"\u003EChoose how the icons look\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (Ctrl+,) and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIcons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick one:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFull colour\u003C/span\u003E: two-tone drawings with colour fills.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline\u003C/span\u003E: line drawings in one colour. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOutline colour\u003C/span\u003E sets the colour; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUse the theme colour\u003C/span\u003E puts it back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEach app&#039;s own drawings\u003C/span\u003E: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E. They follow the light and dark theme too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-stays-the-same\"\u003EWhat stays the same\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe tool&#039;s name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EArrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library&#039;s and are not touched.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-a-picture-is-wrong\"\u003EIf a picture is wrong\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHover the tool to read its name, then use \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Every tool has one picture, and the picture is the same wherever you meet the tool: in the ribbon, in a row of tool buttons, in the toolbox, in the File menu, in a menu opened from a panel's ⋯ button, and in the palettes of the Vector and Sketch layouts. Switch the layout and the picture stays put, so you learn each tool once. This is in the lab builds first. A tool the set has no drawing for yet shows its old picture until the drawing is added, and the lab keeps a list of those so none is forgotten. Choose how the icons look Open Settings (Ctrl+,) and find Icons. Pick one: Full colour: two-tone drawings with colour fills. Outline: line drawings in one colour. Outline colour sets the colour; Use the theme colour puts it back. Each app's own drawings: the pictures the app drew for itself, as before. Every layout then shows those instead of the set. The drawings are vectors, so they stay sharp at any size and follow Interface size. They follow the light and dark theme too. What stays the same The tool's name, tooltip, keys and position do not change; only its picture. Arrows that open or close a list (the small carets) are not tool pictures and keep their own shape. The pictures inside a drawing or a model (symbols, hatches, textures) are yours or the library's and are not touched. If a picture is wrong Hover the tool to read its name, then use Report a problem from the Help menu and name the tool; the name tells us which drawing to change.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-own","scope":"basics","title":"Oʻz joylashuvingizni sozlash va sozlamalaringizni saqlash","summary":"Qaysi panel loyiha brauzerini, Xususiyatlarni yoki panelning oʻz mazmunini koʻrsatishini, asboblar qutisi qayerda boʻlishini va panellarda nima turishini tanlang, uni oʻz joylashuvingiz sifatida saqlang va butun sozlamalarni nom bilan saqlab, ular orasida almashtiring.","section":"start","order":39,"keywords":["joylashuv","ish maydoni","sozlash","moslashtirish","mening joylashuvim","oʻz joylashuvim","panellar","tahrirchilar","loyiha brauzeri","xususiyatlar","asboblar qutisi","tez panel","axborot qutisi","ish muhiti","sozlama","profil","sozlamani saqlash","sozlamani almashtirish","sozlamani eksport qilish","sozlamani import qilish","ccenv"],"headings":[{"id":"o-z-joylashuvingizni-sozlash","text":"Oʻz joylashuvingizni sozlash","level":2},{"id":"sozlamangizni-ish-muhiti-sifatida-saqlash","text":"Sozlamangizni ish muhiti sifatida saqlash","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EUchta tayyor joylashuvdan tashqari oʻzingizniki boʻlgan bitta joylashuvni sozlashingiz va butun sozlamalaringizni nom bilan saqlashingiz mumkin, shunda bir qadamda unga qaytasiz.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"o-z-joylashuvingizni-sozlash\"\u003EOʻz joylashuvingizni sozlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamalar\u003C/span\u003E ni oching (tishli belgi yoki \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang, soʻng \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoylashuv\u003C/span\u003E ni.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOʻz joylashuvingizni sozlash…\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Dialog hozir ishlatayotgan joylashuvdan boshlanadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnga nom bering, soʻng tanlang:\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EChizma ustida:\u003C/strong\u003E ilovaning asboblar paneli, lenta yoki hech biri; sarlavha satri; axborot qutisi va unda qaysi boshqaruv elementlari turishi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EChizma yonida:\u003C/strong\u003E asboblar qutisi chapda, oʻngda yoki umuman yoʻq, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMening asboblarim\u003C/span\u003E bilan yoki usiz; qaysi panel palitralarni ushlashi, qaysi biri ustida boʻlishi (masalan, loyiha brauzeri yoki Xususiyatlar) va qaysilari uning ostida yorliq boʻlishi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EChizma maydoni:\u003C/strong\u003E koʻrinish yorliqlari, tez panel va siz belgilagan boshqaruvlar bilan koʻrinish paneli, tahrirlash palitrasi, holat paneli.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKoʻrinish:\u003C/strong\u003E oʻlcham, tugma konturlari va yorliq uslubi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBu joylashuvdan foydalanish\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Ilova darhol unga oʻtadi va joylashuvlari bor boshqa barcha ilovalar ham uni ishlatadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFaqat shu ilovada bor narsalar taklif qilinadi. Joylashuvingiz \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EQoʻshimchalar va fayllardan\u003C/span\u003E boʻlimida koʻrinadi; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBu joylashuvni eksport qilish\u003C/span\u003E uni hamkasbingizga berishingiz mumkin boʻlgan fayl sifatida saqlaydi, olib tashlash tugmasi esa uni oʻchiradi. U toʻldirgan panellar ham hali biriktiriladi, suzadi va oʻz oynalariga koʻchadi, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EPanellarni joylashtirish\u003C/a\u003E da koʻrsatilganidek.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sozlamangizni-ish-muhiti-sifatida-saqlash\"\u003ESozlamangizni ish muhiti sifatida saqlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIsh muhiti — bu shu brauzerdagi barcha ilovalar uchun butun sozlamangiz: joylashuv, menyu uslubi va tugmalaringiz, asboblar paneli uslubi, panellar va ularning oʻlchamlari, hamda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMening asboblarim\u003C/span\u003E. Mavzu va til unga kirmaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESaqlash:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIsh muhitlari\u003C/span\u003E ostida nom kiriting va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamamni saqlash\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang. Mavjud nom bilan saqlasangiz, oʻsha sozlama almashtiriladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAlmashtirish:\u003C/strong\u003E roʻyxatdan sozlama tanlang va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnga oʻtish\u003C/span\u003E ni bosing. Ilova shu sozlamada qayta yuklanadi; saqlanmagan ishingiz boʻlsa, ilova avval soʻraydi, xuddi har qanday qayta yuklashda boʻlgani kabi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUlashish:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEksport\u003C/span\u003E tanlangan sozlamani \u003Ccode\u003E.ccenv.json\u003C/code\u003E fayl sifatida saqlaydi; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESozlamani import qilish…\u003C/span\u003E esa fayldan qoʻshadi. Fayl faqat shu tanlovlarni belgilaydi, boshqa hech narsani emas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOlib tashlash:\u003C/strong\u003E sozlamani tanlang va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOlib tashlash\u003C/span\u003E ni bosing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESiz oʻn ikkitagacha sozlama saqlashingiz mumkin.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDialogni ochmasdan joylashuvni oʻzgartirish uchun (blokni sudrash, asbobni oʻng tugma bilan bosish), \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EEkrandagi joylashuvni oʻzgartirish\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang. Avval tayyor tartiblarni sinab koʻrish uchun \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-toolbox\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-toolbox\"\u003Easboblar qutisi va axborot qutisi joylashuvi\u003C/a\u003E, \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-ribbon\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-ribbon\"\u003Elenta va loyiha brauzeri joylashuvi\u003C/a\u003E va \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-drafting\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-drafting\"\u003EDrafting joylashuvi\u003C/a\u003E ga qarang.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Uchta tayyor joylashuvdan tashqari oʻzingizniki boʻlgan bitta joylashuvni sozlashingiz va butun sozlamalaringizni nom bilan saqlashingiz mumkin, shunda bir qadamda unga qaytasiz. Oʻz joylashuvingizni sozlash Sozlamalar ni oching (tishli belgi yoki Ctrl+,), Global ni tanlang, soʻng Joylashuv ni. Oʻz joylashuvingizni sozlash… ni tanlang. Dialog hozir ishlatayotgan joylashuvdan boshlanadi. Unga nom bering, soʻng tanlang: Chizma ustida: ilovaning asboblar paneli, lenta yoki hech biri; sarlavha satri; axborot qutisi va unda qaysi boshqaruv elementlari turishi. Chizma yonida: asboblar qutisi chapda, oʻngda yoki umuman yoʻq, Mening asboblarim bilan yoki usiz; qaysi panel palitralarni ushlashi, qaysi biri ustida boʻlishi (masalan, loyiha brauzeri yoki Xususiyatlar) va qaysilari uning ostida yorliq boʻlishi. Chizma maydoni: koʻrinish yorliqlari, tez panel va siz belgilagan boshqaruvlar bilan koʻrinish paneli, tahrirlash palitrasi, holat paneli. Koʻrinish: oʻlcham, tugma konturlari va yorliq uslubi. Bu joylashuvdan foydalanish ni tanlang. Ilova darhol unga oʻtadi va joylashuvlari bor boshqa barcha ilovalar ham uni ishlatadi. Faqat shu ilovada bor narsalar taklif qilinadi. Joylashuvingiz Qoʻshimchalar va fayllardan boʻlimida koʻrinadi; Bu joylashuvni eksport qilish uni hamkasbingizga berishingiz mumkin boʻlgan fayl sifatida saqlaydi, olib tashlash tugmasi esa uni oʻchiradi. U toʻldirgan panellar ham hali biriktiriladi, suzadi va oʻz oynalariga koʻchadi, Panellarni joylashtirish da koʻrsatilganidek. Sozlamangizni ish muhiti sifatida saqlash Ish muhiti — bu shu brauzerdagi barcha ilovalar uchun butun sozlamangiz: joylashuv, menyu uslubi va tugmalaringiz, asboblar paneli uslubi, panellar va ularning oʻlchamlari, hamda Mening asboblarim. Mavzu va til unga kirmaydi. Saqlash: Ish muhitlari ostida nom kiriting va Sozlamamni saqlash ni tanlang. Mavjud nom bilan saqlasangiz, oʻsha sozlama almashtiriladi. Almashtirish: roʻyxatdan sozlama tanlang va Unga oʻtish ni bosing. Ilova shu sozlamada qayta yuklanadi; saqlanmagan ishingiz boʻlsa, ilova avval soʻraydi, xuddi har qanday qayta yuklashda boʻlgani kabi. Ulashish: Eksport tanlangan sozlamani .ccenv.json fayl sifatida saqlaydi; Sozlamani import qilish… esa fayldan qoʻshadi. Fayl faqat shu tanlovlarni belgilaydi, boshqa hech narsani emas. Olib tashlash: sozlamani tanlang va Olib tashlash ni bosing. Siz oʻn ikkitagacha sozlama saqlashingiz mumkin. Dialogni ochmasdan joylashuvni oʻzgartirish uchun (blokni sudrash, asbobni oʻng tugma bilan bosish), Ekrandagi joylashuvni oʻzgartirish ga qarang. Avval tayyor tartiblarni sinab koʻrish uchun asboblar qutisi va axborot qutisi joylashuvi, lenta va loyiha brauzeri joylashuvi va Drafting joylashuvi ga qarang.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"addons-basics","scope":"basics","title":"Add-ons and your account list","summary":"How add-ons work in every app and edition. Add one once in the Library and it follows your account, loads the first time an app needs it, and updates inside its major version. Sign in on a computer, pin a version, add a package from a file, or keep working offline.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["add-ons","library","add","remove","update","pin","lab channel","your add-ons","sign in","offline","offline on this device","use offline","add from a file","download as a file","drag and drop","ccaddon","package","paid","licence","entitlement","this file uses","engine","needs","orphan","team add-ons"],"headings":[{"id":"what-an-add-on-is","text":"What an add-on is","level":2},{"id":"your-list","text":"Your list","level":2},{"id":"needs","text":"Needs","level":2},{"id":"files-that-use-add-ons","text":"Files that use add-ons","level":2},{"id":"skill-packs-and-agents","text":"Skill packs and agents","level":2},{"id":"offline","text":"Offline","level":2},{"id":"add-from-a-file","text":"Add from a file","level":2},{"id":"paid-add-ons-offline","text":"Paid add-ons offline","level":2},{"id":"ipad-and-iphone","text":"iPad and iPhone","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-add-on-is\"\u003EWhat an add-on is\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELibrary\u003C/span\u003E and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-list\"\u003EYour list\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ESign in\u003C/strong\u003E connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERemove\u003C/strong\u003E takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECheck for updates\u003C/strong\u003E lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKeep a version\u003C/strong\u003E pins it. \u003Cstrong\u003EFollow newest\u003C/strong\u003E unpins it. \u003Cstrong\u003ETry lab versions\u003C/strong\u003E moves one add-on to the lab channel.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERoll back\u003C/strong\u003E returns to the version you had.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"needs\"\u003ENeeds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"files-that-use-add-ons\"\u003EFiles that use add-ons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says &quot;This file uses ...&quot; and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"skill-packs-and-agents\"\u003ESkill packs and agents\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe add-on directory at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd-ons\u003C/span\u003E on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps&#039; tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker&#039;s code, and they have no price here. Open them with the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESkill packs\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAgents\u003C/span\u003E filters.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend a skill pack\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend an agent listing\u003C/span\u003E in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"offline\"\u003EOffline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDownload everything for offline\u003C/span\u003E fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open \u003Cstrong\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/strong\u003E on getcadcraft.com and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EMake my add-ons available offline\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EOffline on this device\u003C/strong\u003E, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave for offline\u003C/span\u003E in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (&quot;Your add-ons in this browser&quot;) with the same button; \u003Cstrong\u003EUse offline\u003C/strong\u003E on an add-on&#039;s page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"add-from-a-file\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn an add-on&#039;s page, \u003Cstrong\u003EDownload as a file\u003C/strong\u003E saves its signed package (a \u003Ccode\u003E.ccaddon.json\u003C/code\u003E file). In the app, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd from a file\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EYour add-ons\u003C/span\u003E takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app&#039;s window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"paid-add-ons-offline\"\u003EPaid add-ons offline\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ipad-and-iphone\"\u003EiPad and iPhone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAdd-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What an add-on is An add-on adds features (a new tool or panel) or data (regulation packs, materials, trade packs) to an app. You add it once in the Library and it is on your account list, so it follows you to every edition: the browser, Studio, the portable build and the apps on a tablet. Your list Open Settings › Add-ons › Your add-ons. Sign in connects this app to your account. Signed out, the app keeps a list for this device only, and offers to merge it into your account when you sign in. In Studio the sign-in shows a short code to approve in your browser. Remove takes an add-on off the list. It is refused while another add-on you keep needs it, and the screen names that add-on. When you remove something, anything that was brought in only for it is taken off too, and the screen says which. Check for updates lists every change together. Updates inside the same major version arrive by themselves. A new major version, a changed permission, a pinned version or a lab version always asks you first, and an update is all or nothing: if one file fails its check, nothing changes. Keep a version pins it. Follow newest unpins it. Try lab versions moves one add-on to the lab channel. Roll back returns to the version you had. Needs An add-on can need other add-ons or a shared engine. Add brings them along and tells you what it also adds, how big it is and which permissions it asks for. Engines are shared: one copy serves everything that needs it, and a copy nothing needs is freed after 30 days. Files that use add-ons A drawing remembers the add-ons whose data it holds. Open it on a computer that does not have them and the app says \"This file uses ...\" and offers to add them. Until you do, the data stays in the file untouched. Skill packs and agents The add-on directory at Add-ons on getcadcraft.com also lists skill packs and agents for your own AI assistant. They are text only: a skill pack is instructions your assistant reads, an agent is a listing that describes a program someone wrote that uses the apps' tools. We host, run and vouch for none of an outside maker's code, and they have no price here. Open them with the Skill packs and Agents filters. To offer one, a verified member or lab tester uses Send a skill pack or Send an agent listing in the directory once submissions are open. A person on our team reads every submission before it is listed, and the same review decides it as for any add-on. Offline Download everything for offline fetches every add-on on your list. Once fetched, Studio and the portable build work with no connection. Each download is checked against its checksum and its signature before it is used. In a browser, the website does the same for your whole list in one go: open Your add-ons on getcadcraft.com and choose Make my add-ons available offline under Offline on this device, in the browser you will take with you. The check below it says how many are ready, how much is stored and when, and names anything missing or out of date. Add-ons that come inside an app are ready once that app is saved for offline (Save for offline in the app bar). Browsers can clear stored files when space runs low, so look at that check before you go. With no account, the Library keeps a list for this browser (\"Your add-ons in this browser\") with the same button; Use offline on an add-on's page adds it there and fetches it at once. Free add-ons only. Sign up and the list moves onto your account. Add from a file On an add-on's page, Download as a file saves its signed package (a .ccaddon.json file). In the app, Add from a file under Your add-ons takes that file with no connection needed, or drop the file onto the app's window. The app checks the signature first and refuses a file that was changed, is not signed by getcadcraft.com, or is made for another app. Reload the app to use it. Paid add-ons offline A paid add-on keeps working offline through its licence on the device: a signed entitlement that lasts up to 30 days from the last time the app (or the Your add-ons page) was online, and never past the end of what you bought. Going online again renews it. A paid package file only installs on a device that holds a licence for it. iPad and iPhone Add-ons that are only data download as usual. Code add-ons made by CadCraft are already inside the app and are switched on from your list. Code add-ons from outside makers are not offered on the iPad and iPhone apps; the browser app (Add to Home Screen) has them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"layout-edit","scope":"basics","title":"Change a layout on the screen","summary":"Drag a block to another place, right-click a tool to remove, move or add one, and keep the result as a layout of your own that you can export.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["layout","arrange","drag","handle","move block","right-click","tool","remove tool","add tool","new group","rename group","my layout","reset","undo","workspace","customize ribbon","customize toolbox"],"headings":[{"id":"move-a-block","text":"Move a block","level":2},{"id":"change-what-a-block-holds","text":"Change what a block holds","level":2},{"id":"switch-layouts","text":"Switch layouts","level":2},{"id":"keep-it","text":"Keep it","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EYou can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMy\u003C/span\u003E and the layout&#039;s name, and every later change edits that copy.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"move-a-block\"\u003EMove a block\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E, then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange your own layout…\u003C/span\u003E. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEvery block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDrop the block on a place. The layout changes at once.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe bar at the bottom has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E for each move, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E to bring the built-in layout back, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Return\"\u003EReturn\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEnter\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"change-what-a-block-holds\"\u003EChange what a block holds\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove from here\u003C/span\u003E takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove earlier\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove later\u003C/span\u003E change its place in the group.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a tool\u003C/span\u003E lists the app&#039;s tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew group\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERename the group\u003C/span\u003E make a group and name it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset this block\u003C/span\u003E gives the block back the tools the app offers.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"switch-layouts\"\u003ESwitch layouts\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ELayouts are chosen in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E. Choosing one does not reload the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"keep-it\"\u003EKeep it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour layout is listed in Settings under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFrom add-ons and files\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport this layout\u003C/span\u003E saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers&#039; layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESee also \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-own\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-own\"\u003EArrange your own layout and save your setups\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"You can change a layout without leaving the drawing. The built-in layout is never changed: your first change makes a copy named My and the layout's name, and every later change edits that copy. Move a block Open Settings (the gear, or Ctrl+,), choose Global, then Layout, and choose Arrange your own layout…. With a layout on, the screen goes into Arrange mode and the dialog closes. Every block (the ribbon, the tool rows, the toolbox, the palettes, the status bar and the others) has a small handle at its corner. Drag a handle: a map of the places appears. The places the block can go to are outlined; the others are dimmed and say why. Drop the block on a place. The layout changes at once. The bar at the bottom has Undo and Redo for each move, Reset to bring the built-in layout back, and Done. Without a mouse: put the focus on a handle and press Enter. A list of the places that block may go to opens; choose one. Change what a block holds Right-click a tool in the ribbon, the tool rows or the toolbox: Remove from here takes the tool out of its group (the tool is still in the app; it is only not shown here). Move earlier and Move later change its place in the group. Add a tool lists the app's tools and then every command the app has; the one you pick goes after the tool you clicked. New group and Rename the group make a group and name it. Reset this block gives the block back the tools the app offers. Switch layouts Layouts are chosen in Settings › Global › Layout: your own layouts first, then the built-in ones and Classic. Choosing one does not reload the app. Keep it Your layout is listed in Settings under From add-ons and files. Export this layout saves it as a file you can give a colleague or check on the developers' layouts page. The file only says where blocks go and which tools they hold: no code. See also Arrange your own layout and save your setups.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"offline","scope":"basics","title":"Oflaynda ishlash","summary":"Ilovani oflayn foydalanish uchun saqlash, ulanishsiz nima ishlashi va nimaga ulanish kerakligi.","section":"start","order":40,"keywords":["oflayn","internet yoʻq","samolyot","obyektga tashrif","kesh","service worker","oʻrnatish","yuklab olish","ulanish"],"headings":[{"id":"ilovani-oflayn-foydalanish-uchun-saqlash","text":"Ilovani oflayn foydalanish uchun saqlash","level":2},{"id":"oflaynda-nima-ishlaydi","text":"Oflaynda nima ishlaydi","level":2},{"id":"ulanish-kerak-bo-lgan-narsalar","text":"Ulanish kerak boʻlgan narsalar","level":2},{"id":"bilib-oling","text":"Bilib oling","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EIlovalar ishni sizning kompyuteringizda bajaradi, shuning uchun koʻpchilik ishi ulanishsiz ham ishlaydi. Brauzerga faqat ilovaning fayllari oldindan saqlangan boʻlishi kerak.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ilovani-oflayn-foydalanish-uchun-saqlash\"\u003EIlovani oflayn foydalanish uchun saqlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlovani onlayn ekanligingizda oching.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYuqoridagi panelda \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOflayn uchun saqlash\u003C/span\u003E ni tanlang.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E&quot;Oflayn tayyor&quot; yozuvini kuting. Ilovaning fayllari, uning fayl oʻquvchilari va bu yordam endi brauzeringizda saqlangan. DWG yoki PDF fayllarini oʻqiydigan ilovalar oʻz oʻquvchilarini ham saqlaydi, shuning uchun birinchi safar bu bir daqiqa olishi mumkin.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBuni har bir ilova uchun, siz ishlatadigan har bir brauzerda bir marta qiling. Keyinchalik ulanishsiz qaytish uchun avval ishlatgan oʻsha manzilni yoki uning xatchoʻpini oching.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"net:offline\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003EOffline\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHozir oflaynsiz. Agar bu ilova oflayn foydalanish uchun saqlangan boʻlsa, pastdagi hamma narsa ishlaydi. Saqlanmagan boʻlsa, bu yorliqda allaqachon yuklangan narsalardan hali ham foydalanishingiz mumkin, lekin ulanmaguncha uni qayta yuklamang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"oflaynda-nima-ishlaydi\"\u003EOflaynda nima ishlaydi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKompyuteringizdagi fayllarni ochish, chizish, tahrirlash, oʻlchash va tekshirish.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESaqlash va eksport: har bir saqlash kompyuteringizga yuklab olishdir.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBu yordam, qidiruv bilan birga.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"ulanish-kerak-bo-lgan-narsalar\"\u003EUlanish kerak boʻlgan narsalar\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlovani birinchi marta ochish va uni oflayn foydalanish uchun saqlash.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIlovaning yangi versiyasini olish. Onlayn boʻlganingizda ilova keyingi ochilganda eng yangi versiyani oladi, va \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOflayn uchun saqlash\u003C/span\u003E saqlangan nusxani yangilaydi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EVeb-saytga havolalar, masalan \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVeb-saytda ochish\u003C/span\u003E va boshqa sahifalarga havolalar.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKompyuterlar orasida bulutli saqlash va sinxronlash — ular hali mavjud emas.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bilib-oling\"\u003EBilib oling\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESaqlangan nusxa bitta kompyuterdagi bitta brauzerga tegishli. Brauzeringizning sayt maʼlumotlarini tozalasangiz, u oʻchadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EBaʼzi brauzerlardagi shaxsiy oynalar va baʼzi qulflangan ish kompyuterlari oflayn saqlashga ruxsat bermaydi. Tugma saqlay olmasa, buni aytadi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"browser:safari\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ESafari\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESafari bir necha hafta tashrif buyurilmagan saytlarning saqlangan maʼlumotlarini oʻchiradi. Ilovani onlayn ekanligingizda vaqti-vaqti bilan oching yoki sayohatdan oldin uni qayta saqlang.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECadCraft Studio — bitta oʻrnatishda barcha sakkizta ilovani oʻz ichiga olgan ish stoli ilovasi; getcadcraft.com/download manzilida.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Ilovalar ishni sizning kompyuteringizda bajaradi, shuning uchun koʻpchilik ishi ulanishsiz ham ishlaydi. Brauzerga faqat ilovaning fayllari oldindan saqlangan boʻlishi kerak. Ilovani oflayn foydalanish uchun saqlash Ilovani onlayn ekanligingizda oching. Yuqoridagi panelda Oflayn uchun saqlash ni tanlang. \"Oflayn tayyor\" yozuvini kuting. Ilovaning fayllari, uning fayl oʻquvchilari va bu yordam endi brauzeringizda saqlangan. DWG yoki PDF fayllarini oʻqiydigan ilovalar oʻz oʻquvchilarini ham saqlaydi, shuning uchun birinchi safar bu bir daqiqa olishi mumkin. Buni har bir ilova uchun, siz ishlatadigan har bir brauzerda bir marta qiling. Keyinchalik ulanishsiz qaytish uchun avval ishlatgan oʻsha manzilni yoki uning xatchoʻpini oching. Hozir oflaynsiz. Agar bu ilova oflayn foydalanish uchun saqlangan boʻlsa, pastdagi hamma narsa ishlaydi. Saqlanmagan boʻlsa, bu yorliqda allaqachon yuklangan narsalardan hali ham foydalanishingiz mumkin, lekin ulanmaguncha uni qayta yuklamang. Oflaynda nima ishlaydi Kompyuteringizdagi fayllarni ochish, chizish, tahrirlash, oʻlchash va tekshirish. Saqlash va eksport: har bir saqlash kompyuteringizga yuklab olishdir. Bu yordam, qidiruv bilan birga. Ulanish kerak boʻlgan narsalar Ilovani birinchi marta ochish va uni oflayn foydalanish uchun saqlash. Ilovaning yangi versiyasini olish. Onlayn boʻlganingizda ilova keyingi ochilganda eng yangi versiyani oladi, va Oflayn uchun saqlash saqlangan nusxani yangilaydi. Veb-saytga havolalar, masalan Veb-saytda ochish va boshqa sahifalarga havolalar. Kompyuterlar orasida bulutli saqlash va sinxronlash — ular hali mavjud emas. Bilib oling Saqlangan nusxa bitta kompyuterdagi bitta brauzerga tegishli. Brauzeringizning sayt maʼlumotlarini tozalasangiz, u oʻchadi. Baʼzi brauzerlardagi shaxsiy oynalar va baʼzi qulflangan ish kompyuterlari oflayn saqlashga ruxsat bermaydi. Tugma saqlay olmasa, buni aytadi. Safari bir necha hafta tashrif buyurilmagan saytlarning saqlangan maʼlumotlarini oʻchiradi. Ilovani onlayn ekanligingizda vaqti-vaqti bilan oching yoki sayohatdan oldin uni qayta saqlang. CadCraft Studio — bitta oʻrnatishda barcha sakkizta ilovani oʻz ichiga olgan ish stoli ilovasi; getcadcraft.com/download manzilida.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"layout-drafting","scope":"basics","title":"The Drafting layout: a 2D drafting workspace","summary":"A workspace with a menu bar, a ribbon, file tabs, a viewport label, navigation bar and axes over the drawing, Model and sheet tabs and a row of drawing-mode toggles, in dark chrome.","section":"start","order":42,"keywords":["drafting","layout","workspace","menu bar","ribbon","quick access","navigation bar","axes","viewport label","command line","model tab","sheet tab","status bar","toggles","grid","snap","ortho","polar","dark","2D"],"headings":[{"id":"what-is-where","text":"What is where","level":2},{"id":"choose-it","text":"Choose it","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EDrafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-is-where\"\u003EWhat is where\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETop row:\u003C/strong\u003E the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenu bar\u003C/strong\u003E under it, with the menus drafting programs use: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFile\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EModify\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E and the rest the app has.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERibbon\u003C/strong\u003E under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app&#039;s colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOver the drawing:\u003C/strong\u003E the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECommand line:\u003C/strong\u003E in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app&#039;s own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EBottom:\u003C/strong\u003E the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGrid\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESnap\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrtho\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPolar\u003C/span\u003E and the others the app has) with the app&#039;s messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app&#039;s name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-it\"\u003EChoose it\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrafting\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClassic\u003C/span\u003E always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/layout-edit\" data-topic=\"basics/layout-edit\"\u003EChange a layout on the screen\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Drafting is a layout for people who draw in 2D all day: the whole chrome is dark, and the controls sit where drafting programs have taught people to look for them. It is built from the same blocks as every other layout, so it works in every app that has the parts it asks for and leaves out, with a note, the parts an app does not have (a view cube in an app with no 3D view, for example). What is where Top row: the app mark and name, your quick-access tools (the ones this app has), the document name and the window buttons. The document name shows a dot while there are unsaved changes. Menu bar under it, with the menus drafting programs use: File, Edit, View, Modify, Tools and the rest the app has. Ribbon under the menu bar. A tab that appears when something is selected lights up in the app's colour. The ribbon never wraps: what does not fit goes behind a ⋯ button. Over the drawing: the view label at the top left, the navigation bar at the right edge and the axes at the bottom left. An app with a 3D view also gets a view cube at the top right. Between them the drawing keeps the pointer. Command line: in an app that has one (CadCraft), the app's own command bar stays where it was: Drafting does not add a second one. Bottom: the Model and sheet tabs, and a row of mode toggles (Grid, Snap, Ortho, Polar and the others the app has) with the app's messages beside them. A toggle the app does not have is simply not there. The app's name and logo show once, in the top row, whatever the width of the window. Choose it Settings › Global › Layout › Drafting. Classic always brings back the layout you had. To move a block or change what a block holds, see Change a layout on the screen. Good to know On a phone, or in a window 760 pixels wide or narrower, the app uses its phone layout whatever you picked. A wider window brings Drafting back. This layout is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"interface-sizes","scope":"basics","title":"The interface on a small laptop and on a very large screen","summary":"The interface picks a compact, normal or comfortable step for your window by itself, keeps side panels at a width that suits it, and folds extra tools into a menu instead of wrapping.","section":"start","order":43,"keywords":["density","compact","comfortable","small screen","laptop","13 inch","large screen","ultrawide","4k","panel width","toolbar wrap","scale","window size","responsive"],"headings":[{"id":"three-steps","text":"Three steps","level":2},{"id":"panels-and-bars","text":"Panels and bars","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"three-steps\"\u003EThree steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ECompact\u003C/strong\u003E on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENormal\u003C/strong\u003E on a regular monitor.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EComfortable\u003C/strong\u003E on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/arrange-panels\" data-topic=\"basics/arrange-panels\"\u003EArrange the panels\u003C/a\u003E). A touch screen is never made compact.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"panels-and-bars\"\u003EPanels and bars\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESide panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003E⋯\u003C/span\u003E menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"The interface follows the size of your window. You do not have to set anything. Three steps Compact on a small laptop screen (a window under 1600 pixels wide or 900 high), so the drawing gets the room. Normal on a regular monitor. Comfortable on a very wide, large screen (3000 pixels wide and 1200 high or more), where targets and type grow a little. The step is chosen again when you resize the window or move it to another screen. It is separate from the Comfortable / Compact choice in the panels (see Arrange the panels). A touch screen is never made compact. Panels and bars Side panels keep a width that fits the step and the window, so a panel is never a third of a small screen and never a sliver on an ultrawide. A bar of tools never wraps onto a second line: the tools that do not fit fold into a ⋯ menu at its end, and come back when the window is wider. Good to know This is in the lab (the version for testing) and is not released yet. There is no setting to pick a step yourself, and no presentation mode, yet.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"your-files","scope":"basics","title":"Fayllaringiz qayerga boradi","summary":"Fayllar kompyuteringizda qoladi, saqlash qanday ishlaydi va brauzer nimani eslab qoladi.","section":"start","order":50,"keywords":["maxfiylik","yuklash","bulut","saqlash","yuklab olish","xotira","mahalliy","xavfsizlik","maxfiy"],"headings":[{"id":"fayllaringiz-kompyuteringizda-qoladi","text":"Fayllaringiz kompyuteringizda qoladi","level":2},{"id":"saqlash-qanday-ishlaydi","text":"Saqlash qanday ishlaydi","level":2},{"id":"brauzer-nimani-eslab-qoladi","text":"Brauzer nimani eslab qoladi","level":2},{"id":"bulutli-saqlash","text":"Bulutli saqlash","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"fayllaringiz-kompyuteringizda-qoladi\"\u003EFayllaringiz kompyuteringizda qoladi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChizma, model yoki PDF ochganingizda, ilova uni brauzeringiz ichida oʻqiydi. \u003Cstrong\u003EFayl yuklanmaydi.\u003C/strong\u003E Biz uni hech qachon koʻrmaymiz, va u ulanishsiz ham xuddi shunday ishlaydi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"saqlash-qanday-ishlaydi\"\u003ESaqlash qanday ishlaydi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EVeb-sahifa kompyuteringizdagi fayllarni oʻzi qayta yoza olmaydi, shuning uchun ilovalar yangi faylni \u003Cstrong\u003Eyuklab olish\u003C/strong\u003E orqali saqlaydi:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYuklab olish brauzer yuklab olishlarni qaerga qoʻyishiga boradi, odatda Yuklab olishlar papkasiga, agar brauzerni har safar soʻraydigan qilib sozlamagan boʻlsangiz (qarang: \u003Ca href=\"/tutorials/basics/browsers#what-differs-between-browsers\" data-topic=\"basics/browsers\" data-hash=\"what-differs-between-browsers\"\u003EBrauzerlar va kompyuterlar\u003C/a\u003E).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFayl oʻzgartiradigan ilovalar uni yangi nom bilan nusxa sifatida saqlaydi, masalan &quot;(tahrirlangan)&quot; yoki &quot;(belgilangan)&quot;, shuning uchun asl nusxangiz tegilmagan qoladi.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESaqlanmagan ishi bor yorliqni yopsangiz, brauzer avval soʻraydi (&quot;Saytdan chiqilsinmi?&quot;).\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"brauzer-nimani-eslab-qoladi\"\u003EBrauzer nimani eslab qoladi\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBaʼzi ilovalar brauzeringizda kichik sozlamalarni eslab qoladi, masalan muallif ismingiz yoki asbob uslublari. Ular oʻsha kompyuterdagi oʻsha brauzerda qoladi, va sayt maʼlumotlarini tozalash ularni oʻchiradi. Har bir ilovaning yordami nimani saqlashini aytadi.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"bulutli-saqlash\"\u003EBulutli saqlash\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKompyuterlar orasida bulutli saqlash va sinxronlash tijorat litsenziyasining bir qismi. Ular hali mavjud emas. Shu vaqtgacha fayllaringizni boshqa loyiha fayllaringiz turgan joyda saqlang va odatdagi usulda zaxiralang.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Fayllaringiz kompyuteringizda qoladi Chizma, model yoki PDF ochganingizda, ilova uni brauzeringiz ichida oʻqiydi. Fayl yuklanmaydi. Biz uni hech qachon koʻrmaymiz, va u ulanishsiz ham xuddi shunday ishlaydi. Saqlash qanday ishlaydi Veb-sahifa kompyuteringizdagi fayllarni oʻzi qayta yoza olmaydi, shuning uchun ilovalar yangi faylni yuklab olish orqali saqlaydi: Yuklab olish brauzer yuklab olishlarni qaerga qoʻyishiga boradi, odatda Yuklab olishlar papkasiga, agar brauzerni har safar soʻraydigan qilib sozlamagan boʻlsangiz (qarang: Brauzerlar va kompyuterlar). Fayl oʻzgartiradigan ilovalar uni yangi nom bilan nusxa sifatida saqlaydi, masalan \"(tahrirlangan)\" yoki \"(belgilangan)\", shuning uchun asl nusxangiz tegilmagan qoladi. Saqlanmagan ishi bor yorliqni yopsangiz, brauzer avval soʻraydi (\"Saytdan chiqilsinmi?\"). Brauzer nimani eslab qoladi Baʼzi ilovalar brauzeringizda kichik sozlamalarni eslab qoladi, masalan muallif ismingiz yoki asbob uslublari. Ular oʻsha kompyuterdagi oʻsha brauzerda qoladi, va sayt maʼlumotlarini tozalash ularni oʻchiradi. Har bir ilovaning yordami nimani saqlashini aytadi. Bulutli saqlash Kompyuterlar orasida bulutli saqlash va sinxronlash tijorat litsenziyasining bir qismi. Ular hali mavjud emas. Shu vaqtgacha fayllaringizni boshqa loyiha fayllaringiz turgan joyda saqlang va odatdagi usulda zaxiralang.","lang":"uz"},{"slug":"connect-ai-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Windows","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":63,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","windows"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Claude\\claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.cursor\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codeium\\windsurf\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %APPDATA%\\Code\\User\\mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.codex\\config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\config\\mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from %USERPROFILE%\\.gemini\\settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-macos","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a Mac","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":64,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","macos"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/Library/Application Support/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-linux","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on Linux","summary":"Let your own AI app work with the CadCraft apps: one click in CadCraft Studio, or a short paste for each AI app. Includes the one-line test that proves it works.","section":"start","order":65,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","mcp","claude","cursor","vs code","windsurf","codex","gemini","set up","test","linux"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"the-easy-way","text":"The easy way","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"or-paste-it-yourself","text":"Or paste it yourself","level":2},{"id":"claude-desktop","text":"Claude Desktop","level":3},{"id":"claude-code","text":"Claude Code","level":3},{"id":"cursor","text":"Cursor","level":3},{"id":"windsurf","text":"Windsurf","level":3},{"id":"visual-studio-code","text":"Visual Studio Code","level":3},{"id":"codex-cli","text":"Codex CLI","level":3},{"id":"google-antigravity","text":"Google Antigravity","level":3},{"id":"gemini-cli","text":"Gemini CLI","level":3},{"id":"browser-ai-and-phones","text":"Browser AI and phones","level":2},{"id":"if-it-does-not-work","text":"If it does not work","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, &quot;MCP&quot;.)\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-easy-way\"\u003EThe easy way\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one&#039;s settings, and writes it only after you press \u003Cstrong\u003EYes\u003C/strong\u003E. \u003Cstrong\u003EDisconnect\u003C/strong\u003E takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app&#039;s settings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the \u003Cstrong\u003ERead\u003C/strong\u003E that is on to begin with. In Studio, \u003Cstrong\u003ECheck the connection\u003C/strong\u003E tests each step without the AI and says which one failed.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"or-paste-it-yourself\"\u003EOr paste it yourself\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E and nothing else.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-desktop\"\u003EClaude Desktop\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERestart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"claude-code\"\u003EClaude Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen a terminal.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERun the command below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Claude Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eclaude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"cursor\"\u003ECursor\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Cursor and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"windsurf\"\u003EWindsurf\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Windsurf and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"visual-studio-code\"\u003EVisual Studio Code\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;servers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;stdio&quot;,\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"codex-cli\"\u003ECodex CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcp_servers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E[mcp_servers.cadcraft]\ncommand = &quot;npx&quot;\nargs = [&quot;-y&quot;,&quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,&quot;connect&quot;]\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.codex/config.toml.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"google-antigravity\"\u003EGoogle Antigravity\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"gemini-cli\"\u003EGemini CLI\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd the CadCraft entry below (inside &quot;mcpServers&quot; if the file has one).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStart Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;cadcraft&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [\n        &quot;-y&quot;,\n        &quot;@getcadcraft/mcp&quot;,\n        &quot;connect&quot;\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EUndo:\u003C/strong\u003E Delete the &quot;cadcraft&quot; entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis path comes from the AI app&#039;s public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio&#039;s Connect, which looks first.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"browser-ai-and-phones\"\u003EBrowser AI and phones\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"if-it-does-not-work\"\u003EIf it does not work\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe AI app does not list CadCraft:\u003C/strong\u003E restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E&quot;Could not reach CadCraft Studio&quot;:\u003C/strong\u003E open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIt can look but not change:\u003C/strong\u003E Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to let the AI app you already use (Claude, Cursor, Visual Studio Code, Windsurf, Codex, Gemini…) reach your CadCraft apps, how to check that it works in under a minute, and how to take it out again. The apps contain no AI; your AI app asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. (For those who search for it: this uses the Model Context Protocol, \"MCP\".) The easy way Open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI. Studio looks for the AI apps on this computer, shows you in plain words what it would add to each one's settings, and writes it only after you press Yes. Disconnect takes it out again. Nothing secret is written into the AI app's settings. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. It should list the CadCraft apps it can reach and then give you a count by layer. It only reads, so it needs no extra permission beyond the Read that is on to begin with. In Studio, Check the connection tests each step without the AI and says which one failed. Or paste it yourself One card for each AI app. Each one adds a single entry named cadcraft and nothing else. Claude Desktop Open ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Restart Claude Desktop completely, then ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json. Claude Code Open a terminal. Run the command below. Start Claude Code and ask it the test prompt. claude mcp add cadcraft --scope user -- npx -y @getcadcraft/mcp connect Undo: claude mcp remove cadcraft --scope user Cursor Open ~/.cursor/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Cursor and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.cursor/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Windsurf Open ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Windsurf and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Visual Studio Code Open ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"servers\" if the file has one). Start Visual Studio Code and ask it the test prompt. { \"servers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"type\": \"stdio\", \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Codex CLI Open ~/.codex/config.toml (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcp_servers\" if the file has one). Start Codex CLI and ask it the test prompt. [mcp_servers.cadcraft] command = \"npx\" args = [\"-y\",\"@getcadcraft/mcp\",\"connect\"] Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.codex/config.toml. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Google Antigravity Open ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Google Antigravity and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/config/mcp_config.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Gemini CLI Open ~/.gemini/settings.json (it is made if it does not exist; keep anything already in it). Add the CadCraft entry below (inside \"mcpServers\" if the file has one). Start Gemini CLI and ask it the test prompt. { \"mcpServers\": { \"cadcraft\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [ \"-y\", \"@getcadcraft/mcp\", \"connect\" ] } } } Undo: Delete the \"cadcraft\" entry from ~/.gemini/settings.json. This path comes from the AI app's public guides. If it does not match your install, use Studio's Connect, which looks first. Browser AI and phones AI apps in a web browser, and on phones and tablets, cannot read a settings file on your computer. They use the hosted connector instead (needs CadCraft Studio open on a computer). Studio › Connect your AI shows the link. If it does not work The AI app does not list CadCraft: restart it fully (quit, not just close the window), then check the entry is in its settings. \"Could not reach CadCraft Studio\": open Studio and the app you want; each app has Settings › Assistants to turn on. It can look but not change: Edit, Save and Export are separate permissions you turn on per app in Studio.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"connect-ai-mobile","scope":"basics","title":"Connect your AI on a phone or tablet","summary":"How your own AI app reaches the CadCraft apps from a phone or tablet: through the hosted connector, with CadCraft Studio open on a computer. Includes the one-line test.","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","connect","android","ipad","phone","tablet","hosted connector","test"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"prove-it-works","text":"Prove it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-can-and-cannot-do","text":"What it can and cannot do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a \u003Cstrong\u003Ehosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOn the computer, open \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio › Connect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E and choose \u003Cstrong\u003EHosted connector\u003C/strong\u003E. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn your AI app, add a connector (a &quot;remote&quot; or &quot;custom&quot; connector) with that address and sign in when asked.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EKeep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"prove-it-works\"\u003EProve it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn your AI app, paste this:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003EUse the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer.\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-can-and-cannot-do\"\u003EWhat it can and cannot do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn An AI app on a phone or tablet cannot read a settings file on your computer, so it does not use the paste cards. It connects to a hosted connector instead, and CadCraft Studio must be open on a computer you own to answer. How On the computer, open CadCraft Studio › Connect your AI and choose Hosted connector. Studio shows the address to add and asks you to sign in. In your AI app, add a connector (a \"remote\" or \"custom\" connector) with that address and sign in when asked. Keep Studio open. When it is closed the AI app says CadCraft is not reachable. Prove it works In your AI app, paste this: Use the CadCraft tools: list the apps you can reach, then open the sample drawing in my CadCraft folder and tell me how many objects it has, by layer. What it can and cannot do The hosted connector carries only the tool calls and their answers for the apps and permissions you allowed. It never holds your files, and the answers are marked as data from your files, not as instructions. You can disconnect it in Studio at any time.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"local-models","scope":"basics","title":"Use an AI that runs on your own computer","summary":"Work with a local AI model and no network: through an AI app that can use tools, .","section":"start","order":66,"keywords":["ai","assistant","local","offline","ollama","lm studio","llama.cpp","jan","air-gapped","private","model","ask box"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"how","text":"How","level":2},{"id":"good-to-know","text":"Good to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how\"\u003EHow\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUse an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp&#039;s server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (&quot;MCP&quot;). Add the single \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E entry shown in \u003Cstrong\u003EConnect your AI\u003C/strong\u003E, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EProgram\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003ECan use tools through MCP\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELM Studio\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ellama.cpp (llama-server)\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, start it with \u003Ccode\u003E--jinja\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EJan\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EYes, turn on tool calling for the model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EOllama\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ENot on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThis list is taken from each program&#039;s own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"good-to-know\"\u003EGood to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERaise the model&#039;s context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESmall models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything else stays the same: the permission levels, \u003Cstrong\u003ESuggest\u003C/strong\u003E mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to use an AI model that runs on your own computer, so nothing you ask leaves it. This suits firms that cannot send drawings to an outside service. The apps contain no AI; the model asks them to do things, and you decide what it may do. How Use an AI app on this computer that can use tools. LM Studio, Jan and llama.cpp's server can each use tools through the Model Context Protocol (\"MCP\"). Add the single cadcraft entry shown in Connect your AI, open CadCraft Studio, then ask your question in that app. Program Can use tools through MCP LM Studio Yes llama.cpp (llama-server) Yes, start it with --jinja Jan Yes, turn on tool calling for the model Ollama Not on its own: use it as the model, with Jan or an editor in front This list is taken from each program's own documentation. It has not yet been tried with every program on every system. Good to know Raise the model's context length before you start; the default in some programs is small and tool descriptions will not fit. Small models call tools less reliably than large hosted ones. If the answer says what it would do but nothing changes, try a larger model or a model marked as able to use tools. Everything else stays the same: the permission levels, Suggest mode, the folders you allowed and the activity list. A model on this computer sends nothing out.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"engines","scope":"basics","title":"Run an engine on a model","summary":"The Engines panel runs the shared calculation engines (schematics, pipe and power networks, motion, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems, PLC) on a model you paste.","section":"tasks","order":40,"keywords":["engines","schematic","network","power","load flow","robot","kinematics","queue","simulation","schedule","critical path","requirements","risk","fault tree","modbus","circuit","spice","board","pcb","modelica","plc"],"headings":[{"id":"run-one","text":"Run one","level":2},{"id":"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene","text":"Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open \u003Cstrong\u003EEngines\u003C/strong\u003E from the button in the bar at the top, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E and type &quot;engines&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"run-one\"\u003ERun one\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERun\u003C/span\u003E. The results come back as tables, with the engine&#039;s own problems above them and the limits of its method below.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset\u003C/span\u003E puts the example text back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"controls-on-a-model-or-on-the-3d-scene\"\u003EControls on a model, or on the 3D scene\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to a flow model\u003C/span\u003E is the queues engine&#039;s model. In ModelCraft, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThe program bound to the 3D scene\u003C/span\u003E ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads \u003Ccode\u003EName.x\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.y\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.z\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003EName.rotZ\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003EName.hidden\u003C/code\u003E, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a \u003Ccode\u003Escale\u003C/code\u003E (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and \u003Ccode\u003Evalues\u003C/code\u003E says what off and on mean (\u003Ccode\u003E[0, 2]\u003C/code\u003E puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \u003Ccode\u003E&quot;keep&quot;: true\u003C/code\u003E to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEverything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EProblems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"Some calculations are the same in every app, so they live in one panel instead of eight. Open Engines from the button in the bar at the top, or press Ctrl+K and type \"engines\". Run one Choose an engine from the list: schematics, pipe networks and power systems, motion and robots, queues, schedule and cost, requirements, risk, live data, circuits, boards, systems or controls. Choose a worked example, or replace the text with your own model. Most engines read JSON; circuits, systems and controls read their own text (a circuit deck, Modelica, structured text). Press Run. The results come back as tables, with the engine's own problems above them and the limits of its method below. Reset puts the example text back. Controls on a model, or on the 3D scene The controls engine also takes a JSON input that ties a structured-text program to something it can sense and command. The program bound to a flow model is the queues engine's model. In ModelCraft, The program bound to the 3D scene ties it to the placements (groups and components) of the open model: a sensor reads Name.x, Name.y, Name.z, Name.rotZ or Name.hidden, a command writes one of them, and the program decides. Position sensors are whole numbers, so give each a scale (1000 turns metres into millimetres); a command is on or off, and values says what off and on mean ([0, 2] puts the placement at 0 or 2 m). A run changes nothing in the model: the results table shows where each placement would end up. Add \"keep\": true to write the final state into the model as one undo step. A placement that is not in the model is reported by name. Things to know Everything runs in this page. Nothing is uploaded, and nothing is saved in your file. Problems the engine finds also appear in the Problems panel, under their own source. The examples are small on purpose, with answers you can check by hand. They are a way to see what an engine does, not a design. The results are calculation aids. A person who is responsible for the design checks them.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistant-in-the-app","scope":"basics","title":"Ask for help inside the app","summary":"Open the Ask box from Help, see why something happened from the steps you took, report a problem with those steps, and see exactly what an assistant was sent.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["show me how","teacher","walk me through","how do i","sign off","signed off","unsigned","unverified","figures","rules","ask","assistant","ai","help button","why did this happen","history","steps","undo","report a problem","bug report","model excerpt","model data only","personal data","sent back","held back","project stage","brief","concept","tender","step by step","teacher","knowledge pack"],"headings":[{"id":"open-it-from-help","text":"Open it from Help","level":2},{"id":"why-did-this-happen","text":"Why did this happen?","level":2},{"id":"report-a-problem-with-the-steps","text":"Report a problem with the steps","level":2},{"id":"what-an-assistant-is-sent","text":"What an assistant is sent","level":2},{"id":"project-stage","text":"Project stage","level":2},{"id":"show-me-how-with-no-assistant","text":"Show me how, with no assistant","level":2},{"id":"rules-every-assistant-follows","text":"Rules every assistant follows","level":2},{"id":"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit","text":"Sign off an estimate or an audit","level":2},{"id":"step-by-step-on-your-screen","text":"Step by step on your screen","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app&#039;s own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"open-it-from-help\"\u003EOpen it from Help\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPress \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"F1\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EF1\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E or choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EHelp\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant\u003C/span\u003E at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your question and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith a question goes a short note of where you are: the file&#039;s name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"why-did-this-happen\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhy did this happen?\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ERead the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith an assistant connected, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAsk the assistant to explain\u003C/span\u003E and it explains from those same steps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"report-a-problem-with-the-steps\"\u003EReport a problem with the steps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReport a problem\u003C/span\u003E. The app&#039;s own About box opens with your words in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELeave \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd the steps I took before it happened\u003C/span\u003E ticked. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the steps\u003C/span\u003E to read them first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESee the excerpt\u003C/span\u003E to read it first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAdd your name and email and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESend report\u003C/span\u003E. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-an-assistant-is-sent\"\u003EWhat an assistant is sent\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAssistants get model data only. People&#039;s names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EActivity\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESet the list to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEverything\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder each line read \u003Cstrong\u003ESent back\u003C/strong\u003E: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. \u003Cstrong\u003EHeld back\u003C/strong\u003E lists each value that was kept, with the reason.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe log never keeps the answer itself.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"project-stage\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPick the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EProject stage\u003C/span\u003E: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESave details\u003C/span\u003E. The stage is kept in the file with the other details.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"show-me-how-with-no-assistant\"\u003EShow me how, with no assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe teacher works from the app&#039;s own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn the Ask box type what you want to do, for example &quot;how do I draw a wall&quot;.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow me how\u003C/span\u003E. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose a topic. A step card opens with the topic&#039;s first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EDo the step, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENext\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack\u003C/span\u003E goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"rules-every-assistant-follows\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOptional.\u003C/strong\u003E Everything works without an assistant and offline.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EThe app calculates.\u003C/strong\u003E An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETrust but verify.\u003C/strong\u003E What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say &quot;Not signed off by a person&quot; until you sign them off. Open the list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERules every assistant follows\u003C/span\u003E in the Ask box.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EModel data only.\u003C/strong\u003E Your personal and account details are never sent.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sign-off-an-estimate-or-an-audit\"\u003ESign off an estimate or an audit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDrawing details\u003C/span\u003E in the bar at the top.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign-off\u003C/span\u003E, check your name, add a note if you like and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESign off\u003C/span\u003E beside \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEstimate\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAudit\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWho signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOnly you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETake my sign-off back\u003C/span\u003E removes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"step-by-step-on-your-screen\"\u003EStep by step on your screen\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EClose the step\u003C/span\u003E button.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAn assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E","text":"The apps contain no AI. The Ask box sends a question to the assistant you connected, which answers by using the app's own tools. This page covers what is around that box. It is in the lab builds. Open it from Help Press F1 or choose Help. Choose Ask the assistant at the top of the Help panel. The Ask box opens. Type your question and choose Ask. With a question goes a short note of where you are: the file's name, how much is selected, the screen layout, the tool in use and the project stage. It never holds text from the file. Why did this happen? In the Ask box choose Why did this happen?. Read the list. It is the last steps in this window, oldest first: the commands you started, each change to the model by its name in the undo list, steps you took back or put back, and what an assistant did or was refused. With an assistant connected, choose Ask the assistant to explain and it explains from those same steps. The list works with no assistant connected. It is a record of steps, not a judgement. Report a problem with the steps In the Ask box, type what went wrong and choose Report a problem. The app's own About box opens with your words in it. Leave Add the steps I took before it happened ticked. Open See the steps to read them first. Only if you want to, tick the model excerpt. It holds what the app counts and how much is selected: no names, no emails, no folders and never the file itself. Open See the excerpt to read it first. Add your name and email and choose Send report. The report goes to our Submit a problem page, and the box gives you the link to follow it. An assistant can write the draft for you. It can only put the draft in this box: sending is always yours. What an assistant is sent Assistants get model data only. People's names (author, drawn by, last saved by), contact details, account and licence details and your user name in a folder path are held back before anything leaves the app. Choose Activity in the bar at the top. Set the list to Everything. Under each line read Sent back: the size of the answer and the names of its fields. Held back lists each value that was kept, with the reason. The log never keeps the answer itself. Project stage Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Pick the Project stage: Brief, Concept, Design development, Submission, Working drawings, Tender or Close-out. Choose Save details. The stage is kept in the file with the other details. An assistant reads the stage so its help fits where the project is. Show me how, with no assistant The teacher works from the app's own Help. It needs no assistant and sends nothing anywhere. In the Ask box type what you want to do, for example \"how do I draw a wall\". Choose Show me how. The Help topics that answer it are listed. The tool you are using and the project stage move the best fit to the top. Choose a topic. A step card opens with the topic's first step, and a ring marks the real button when the layout you use has one. Do the step, then choose Next. Back goes to the step before. Nothing is pressed for you. A topic with no numbered steps says so: open it in Help instead. Rules every assistant follows Optional. Everything works without an assistant and offline. The app calculates. An assistant explains, arranges and checks, and never writes a figure. Under each answer the box says whether every figure in it is in a result the app returned, and lists the ones it cannot find. A figure on that list is not to be trusted until the app has calculated it. Trust but verify. What an assistant makes is marked unverified until you check it. Estimates and audits an assistant hands back say \"Not signed off by a person\" until you sign them off. Open the list under Rules every assistant follows in the Ask box. Model data only. Your personal and account details are never sent. Sign off an estimate or an audit Choose Drawing details in the bar at the top. Under Sign-off, check your name, add a note if you like and choose Sign off beside Estimate or Audit. Who signed and when are kept in the file with the other details. If the drawing is saved after you sign, the panel says so: sign off again. Only you can sign off. No assistant can do it, or take your sign-off back. Take my sign-off back removes it. Step by step on your screen An assistant, or a lesson, can show a task one step at a time. A small card says what to do, and a ring marks the real button on your screen. Nothing is pressed for you. Close the card with its Close the step button. An assistant answers better when it knows this version of the app. The knowledge pack holds the manuals, the step-by-step help, every command and the skills as plain text, with a version that matches the app. The Ask box says so when a connected pack is for another version.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"assistants-recipes","scope":"basics","title":"Recipes for AI assistants","summary":"Worked examples for using your own AI assistant with the CadCraft apps: what to ask, the tools it calls, and the permissions each needs. Every recipe here is run by our tests with the same calls.","section":"tasks","order":62,"keywords":["ai","assistant","mcp","recipes","examples","prompts","automation","batch","convert","plot","check","takeoff","cut","fill","parameters","script"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"recipes","text":"Recipes","level":2},{"id":"tidy-a-drawing","text":"Tidy a drawing","level":3},{"id":"plot-a-set-of-sheets","text":"Plot a set of sheets","level":3},{"id":"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant","text":"Convert drawings for a consultant","level":3},{"id":"check-drawings-before-sending-them","text":"Check drawings before sending them","level":3},{"id":"ask-a-building-model-questions","text":"Ask a building model questions","level":3},{"id":"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft","text":"Draw a room in BimCraft","level":3},{"id":"total-a-takeoff","text":"Total a takeoff","level":3},{"id":"site-numbers","text":"Site numbers","level":3},{"id":"try-a-part-variant","text":"Try a part variant","level":3},{"id":"fill-in-a-title-block","text":"Fill in a title block","level":3},{"id":"your-files-and-your-assistant","text":"Your files and your assistant","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EReady-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps&#039; tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThere are two ways in. In \u003Cstrong\u003ECadCraft Studio\u003C/strong\u003E, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). \u003Cstrong\u003EWithout a window\u003C/strong\u003E, the CadCraft file server for assistants (\u003Ccode\u003Enpx @getcadcraft/mcp --root &lt;folder&gt;\u003C/code\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft\u003C/code\u003E command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-tip\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ETip\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStart read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"recipes\"\u003ERecipes\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"tidy-a-drawing\"\u003ETidy a drawing\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_open {path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg&quot;}            → d1\ndrawing_describe {doc: &quot;d1&quot;}                                    layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses\ncommand_run {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, input: &quot;PURGE&quot;}                         one undo step: &quot;Assistant: PURGE&quot;\ndrawing_save {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, path: &quot;Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"plot-a-set-of-sheets\"\u003EPlot a set of sheets\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_open {path: …}  ·  drawing_describe {doc}                the sheets of each drawing\ndrawing_plot {doc, layout: &quot;&lt;sheet&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Plots/&lt;drawing&gt; &lt;sheet&gt;.pdf&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"convert-drawings-for-a-consultant\"\u003EConvert drawings for a consultant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Efiles_list {folder: &quot;Kitchen&quot;, extensions: [&quot;dwg&quot;, &quot;dxf&quot;]}\ndrawing_convert {path: &quot;Kitchen/&lt;file&gt;&quot;, out: &quot;Out/&lt;file&gt;.dwg&quot;, version: &quot;2013&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"check-drawings-before-sending-them\"\u003ECheck drawings before sending them\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Edrawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [&quot;0&quot;]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. Keep your office&#039;s rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: \u003Ccode\u003Ecadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json\u003C/code\u003E (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"ask-a-building-model-questions\"\u003EAsk a building model questions\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eifc_open {path: &quot;house.ifc&quot;}                                    → d1\nifc_query {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, class: &quot;IfcDoor&quot;}                         each door with its level\nifc_properties {doc: &quot;d1&quot;, id: &lt;door&gt;}                          Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. In Studio, BimCraft&#039;s own tools answer the same about the model you have open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"draw-a-room-in-bimcraft\"\u003EDraw a room in BimCraft\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Ewalls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true}     one undo step\nopening_add {wall: &quot;&lt;the first wall&#039;s GlobalId&gt;&quot;, kind: &quot;door&quot;}                    one undo step\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_new\u003C/code\u003E starts a building first and \u003Ccode\u003Eifc_save\u003C/code\u003E writes it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"total-a-takeoff\"\u003ETotal a takeoff\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Etakeoff_open {path: &quot;job.takeoff.json&quot;}  ·  takeoff_estimate {doc}  ·  takeoff_export {doc, out: &quot;job.xlsx&quot;}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"site-numbers\"\u003ESite numbers\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;How much cut and fill does the pad need?&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Esite_open {path: &quot;site.civilcraft.json&quot;}  ·  surface_volume {doc}       cut, fill and net, per pad\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read. With a level instead of a design: \u003Ccode\u003Esurface_volume {doc, datum: 100}\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"try-a-part-variant\"\u003ETry a part variant\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Epart_open {path: &quot;screw.partcraft.json&quot;}  ·  params_list {doc}\nparam_set {doc, name: &quot;l&quot;, value: 40}                           one undo step, the part rebuilt\nmass_properties {doc}                                            volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Read and Edit; Save (\u003Ccode\u003Epart_save\u003C/code\u003E) to keep it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 id=\"fill-in-a-title-block\"\u003EFill in a title block\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAsk:\u003C/strong\u003E &quot;Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.&quot;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cpre class=\"hcode\"\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eblock_insert {doc, block: &quot;TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD&quot;, at: [0, 0], attributes: {&quot;SHEET-NO&quot;: &quot;A-101&quot;, &quot;SHEET-TITLE&quot;: &quot;Kitchen plan&quot;}}\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/pre\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENeeds Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-files-and-your-assistant\"\u003EYour files and your assistant\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe apps never send your files anywhere. \u003Cstrong\u003EBut what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant:\u003C/strong\u003E a cloud assistant&#039;s maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job&#039;s folders out of the ones you allow.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn Ready-made requests for your own AI assistant, and what it does with them. The apps contain no AI: your assistant reads the files and calls the apps' tools, and you decide which permissions it has. Each recipe names the tools it calls, so you can check its work in the activity log, and each one is run by our tests with exactly these calls, so they keep working. There are two ways in. In CadCraft Studio, an assistant works with the apps you have open (Settings › Assistants in each app). Without a window, the CadCraft file server for assistants (npx @getcadcraft/mcp --root \u003Cfolder\u003E) works on files in folders you name; the cadcraft command line does the same jobs for your own scripts. The recipes say which way they use; most work both ways. Start read-only. Ask the assistant to describe a file before it changes anything; its answers are better when it has looked first, and Read is the only permission that is on to begin with. Recipes Tidy a drawing Ask: \"List the layers with nothing on them and the blocks nobody uses, then purge the unused blocks.\" The assistant opens the drawing and reads it, then runs PURGE: drawing_open {path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-equipment.dwg\"} → d1 drawing_describe {doc: \"d1\"} layers with 0 objects, blocks with 0 uses command_run {doc: \"d1\", input: \"PURGE\"} one undo step: \"Assistant: PURGE\" drawing_save {doc: \"d1\", path: \"Kitchen/kitchen-tidy.dwg\"} Needs Read and Edit, and Save to write the result. Dimension arrowheads count as used, so they stay. Plot a set of sheets Ask: \"Plot every sheet of every drawing in the Kitchen folder to PDF.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_open {path: …} · drawing_describe {doc} the sheets of each drawing drawing_plot {doc, layout: \"\u003Csheet\u003E\", out: \"Plots/\u003Cdrawing\u003E \u003Csheet\u003E.pdf\"} Needs Read and Export. From the command line, one PDF per drawing with all its sheets: cadcraft plot Kitchen/*.dwg Plots --all. Convert drawings for a consultant Ask: \"Save copies of the drawings in Kitchen as AutoCAD 2013 DWG in the Out folder.\" files_list {folder: \"Kitchen\", extensions: [\"dwg\", \"dxf\"]} drawing_convert {path: \"Kitchen/\u003Cfile\u003E\", out: \"Out/\u003Cfile\u003E.dwg\", version: \"2013\"} Needs Read and Export; the originals are not changed. From the command line: cadcraft convert Kitchen/*.dwg Kitchen/*.dxf Out --to dwg --version 2013. Check drawings before sending them Ask: \"Check the drawings in Kitchen: nothing on layer 0, colours by layer, no unused blocks. Give me a table of what fails.\" drawing_check {doc, rules: {layers: {noObjectsOn: [\"0\"]}, objects: {colorByLayer: true}, blocks: {noUnused: true}}} Needs Read. Keep your office's rules in a file and the command line checks a whole folder: cadcraft check Kitchen/*.dwg --rules office-standards.json (exit code 1 when something fails, so it fits in a script). Ask a building model questions Ask: \"How many doors does the house have on each level, and which are external?\" ifc_open {path: \"house.ifc\"} → d1 ifc_query {doc: \"d1\", class: \"IfcDoor\"} each door with its level ifc_properties {doc: \"d1\", id: \u003Cdoor\u003E} Pset_DoorCommon.IsExternal Needs Read. In Studio, BimCraft's own tools answer the same about the model you have open. Draw a room in BimCraft Ask: \"Draw a 6 by 4 metre room on Level 1 with a single door in the south wall.\" walls_add {points: [[0, 0], [6000, 0], [6000, 4000], [0, 4000]], closed: true} one undo step opening_add {wall: \"\u003Cthe first wall's GlobalId\u003E\", kind: \"door\"} one undo step Needs Edit. Walls join and the room follows, as with the Draw tools. Without a window, ifc_new starts a building first and ifc_save writes it. Total a takeoff Ask: \"Give me the estimate by item and export it to XLSX.\" takeoff_open {path: \"job.takeoff.json\"} · takeoff_estimate {doc} · takeoff_export {doc, out: \"job.xlsx\"} Needs Read, and Export for the file. Marks on sheets with no scale are listed and never counted as zero, so an incomplete estimate says so. Site numbers Ask: \"How much cut and fill does the pad need?\" site_open {path: \"site.civilcraft.json\"} · surface_volume {doc} cut, fill and net, per pad Needs Read. With a level instead of a design: surface_volume {doc, datum: 100}. Try a part variant Ask: \"Set the length to 40 mm, rebuild, and give me the mass.\" part_open {path: \"screw.partcraft.json\"} · params_list {doc} param_set {doc, name: \"l\", value: 40} one undo step, the part rebuilt mass_properties {doc} volume, mass from the material, centre, inertia Needs Read and Edit; Save (part_save) to keep it. Fill in a title block Ask: \"Insert the title block at 0,0 with sheet number A-101 and the title Kitchen plan.\" block_insert {doc, block: \"TITLEBLOCK-ARCHD\", at: [0, 0], attributes: {\"SHEET-NO\": \"A-101\", \"SHEET-TITLE\": \"Kitchen plan\"}} Needs Edit. One undo step; the attributes it does not name keep their defaults. Your files and your assistant The apps never send your files anywhere. But what your assistant reads goes to whoever runs that assistant: a cloud assistant's maker sees the parts of the drawing it is shown. If that matters for a job, use an assistant that runs on your own computer, or keep that job's folders out of the ones you allow.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"community-testing","scope":"basics","title":"Community testing","summary":"How to try a test on the Community testing page and send your result.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["community","testing","test","results","report","feedback","files","passed","failing"],"headings":[{"id":"send-a-result","text":"Send a result","level":2},{"id":"sending-files","text":"Sending files","level":2},{"id":"your-privacy","text":"Your privacy","level":2},{"id":"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work","text":"What counts as \"known not to work\"","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ESome checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"send-a-result\"\u003ESend a result\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the \u003Cstrong\u003ECommunity testing\u003C/strong\u003E page on the website and choose a test.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUse the public build named in \u003Cstrong\u003EBefore you start\u003C/strong\u003E, never a lab build.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFollow the \u003Cstrong\u003ESteps\u003C/strong\u003E and compare with the \u003Cstrong\u003EExpected result\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFill in \u003Cstrong\u003ESend a result\u003C/strong\u003E: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"sending-files\"\u003ESending files\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-privacy\"\u003EYour privacy\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EYour first name is shown next to a result only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EShow my first name\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENotes are shown to others only if you tick \u003Cstrong\u003EAnyone may read my notes\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFiles are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-counts-as-known-not-to-work\"\u003EWhat counts as &quot;known not to work&quot;\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Some checks need a real computer, a real file or a real device. The Community testing page lists them so anyone can help. Send a result Open the Community testing page on the website and choose a test. Use the public build named in Before you start, never a lab build. Follow the Steps and compare with the Expected result. Fill in Send a result: passed, still failing, partly works, or could not run it. Say which system you used and what happened. You do not need an account to send a result. A signed-in account is needed only to send files. Sending files When a test asks for files, drag them into the framed area (or click it, or press Enter or Space on it to choose them). You can send several at once; each shows its name and size and a Remove button. The form says which file types and sizes we take. We never take programs, scripts or web pages. Your privacy A result sent while you are signed in carries your account so we can write back. It is never shown on the page. Your first name is shown next to a result only if you tick Show my first name. Notes are shown to others only if you tick Anyone may read my notes. Files are seen only by the CadCraft team, kept privately and deleted automatically after the number of days the form states. Remove anything private from a file first. What counts as \"known not to work\" Each test lists what is not built yet. Please do not report those as bugs.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"work-together-live","scope":"basics","title":"Work together live","summary":"Share the file open in an app so teammates edit it with you on your own network with a short code, and join someone else's session. Invite links over the internet are not open yet.","section":"tasks","order":90,"keywords":["live","studio live","work together","collaborate","share live","join","code","qr","invite link","link","host","approve","guest","network","relay","license","many people","limit","allow anyway","slow","recent edits","edit log","who changed","history"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"share-the-file-you-have-open","text":"Share the file you have open","level":2},{"id":"let-people-in","text":"Let people in","level":2},{"id":"when-many-people-join","text":"When many people join","level":2},{"id":"codes-on-your-own-network","text":"Codes on your own network","level":2},{"id":"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet","text":"Invite links over the internet: not open yet","level":2},{"id":"join-someone-else-s-session","text":"Join someone else's session","level":2},{"id":"who-changed-what-recent-edits","text":"Who changed what: Recent edits","level":2},{"id":"assistants-in-a-session","text":"Assistants in a session","level":2},{"id":"when-the-session-ends","text":"When the session ends","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app&#039;s own page about live sessions.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-the-file-you-have-open\"\u003EShare the file you have open\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E in the app&#039;s bar, type the name others should see, then choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShare live\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio shows a code like \u003Ccode\u003EK7-Q4M2X\u003C/code\u003E with a picture to scan and the computer&#039;s address. Give the code to the people you want to invite.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYour file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-people-in\"\u003ELet people in\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E lets them change the file with you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E turns them away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E shows everyone. Change a person&#039;s role there, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERemove\u003C/span\u003E them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can&#039;t come back without a new invitation.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-many-people-join\"\u003EWhen many people join\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA session&#039;s usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow anyway\u003C/span\u003E lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEdit\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EView only\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EKeep it at 20\u003C/span\u003E turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETo allow more before anyone knocks, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow more people…\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIn the session\u003C/span\u003E. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to 20\u003C/span\u003E puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"codes-on-your-own-network\"\u003ECodes on your own network\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA code works for 10 minutes. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew code\u003C/span\u003E makes another; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop inviting\u003C/span\u003E closes it. People already in stay.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOne-time code\u003C/span\u003E lets one person in per code.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAfter 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESessions on your own network are free, for everyone.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"invite-links-over-the-internet-not-open-yet\"\u003EInvite links over the internet: not open yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EInvite links aren&#039;t open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E part of the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhen invite links open, this is how they will work:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOver the internet\u003C/span\u003E, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInvite by link\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECopy the link and send it like a meeting link.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe link&#039;s secret part (after \u003Ccode\u003E#\u003C/code\u003E) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can&#039;t read, and you still approve each person. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENew link\u003C/span\u003E makes the old one stop working at once; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EStop the link\u003C/span\u003E ends it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaking an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"join-someone-else-s-session\"\u003EJoin someone else&#039;s session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft Studio&#039;s home screen, find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin a live session\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host&#039;s link here too.)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EType your name and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin\u003C/span\u003E. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host&#039;s file once the host lets you in.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWithout Studio, scan the picture under the host&#039;s code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELive\u003C/span\u003E, then under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin with the drawing open here\u003C/span\u003E type the code or the address and code, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EJoin here\u003C/span\u003E. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host&#039;s drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can&#039;t find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"who-changed-what-recent-edits\"\u003EWho changed what: Recent edits\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe Live panel lists \u003Cstrong\u003ERecent edits\u003C/strong\u003E: who made each change and what it was (the step&#039;s name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow more\u003C/span\u003E lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly what is selected\u003C/span\u003E keeps just the edits that touched it.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe list is made in your own window from the session&#039;s edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"assistants-in-a-session\"\u003EAssistants in a session\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf someone turned on assistants in their app&#039;s settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host&#039;s own assistant joins at once; anyone else&#039;s waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAllow\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDeny\u003C/span\u003E. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-session-ends\"\u003EWhen the session ends\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe host chooses \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEnd the session\u003C/span\u003E, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELeave\u003C/span\u003E does the same for you alone.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to share a file live from CadCraft Studio, let people in, and join a session someone else shares. What you see in the drawing itself while you work together is on the app's own page about live sessions. Share the file you have open Open the file in its app inside CadCraft Studio on a computer. Choose Live in the app's bar, type the name others should see, then choose Share live. Studio shows a code like K7-Q4M2X with a picture to scan and the computer's address. Give the code to the people you want to invite. Your file stays on your computer. Only you save it, and everyone sees your saves. Let people in Nobody gets in without you. When someone knocks, a card shows their name and device and whether they came on this network or through the internet: Edit lets them change the file with you. View only lets them watch; anything they try to change is taken back. Deny turns them away. The list under In the session shows everyone. Change a person's role there, or Remove them: they keep a copy of what they had, and they can't come back without a new invitation. When many people join A session's usual size is up to 20 people besides you. It is not a hard limit: how many people can work well together depends on their computers, the file and the network, so Studio asks you before a session grows past it instead of deciding for you. When someone knocks and would make more than 20, their card says so, and Studio explains what to expect: every change goes to everyone, so with many people each change takes longer to reach each person, and slower laptops and connections fall behind first. Then you choose: Allow anyway lets more people in for this session. Each person still waits for your Edit, View only or Deny. Keep it at 20 turns away the people waiting over the limit; they are told you are keeping the session small. To allow more before anyone knocks, choose Allow more people… under In the session. Back to 20 puts the usual size back. Your choice lasts for this session only; the next one starts at 20 again. If things slow down, fewer people, a quieter file (fewer people changing it at the same moment) or a better connection (a cable instead of Wi-Fi) helps. Codes on your own network A code works for 10 minutes. New code makes another; Stop inviting closes it. People already in stay. One-time code lets one person in per code. After 3 wrong codes in a row, Studio closes the code and makes a new one, and tells you. Sessions on your own network are free, for everyone. Invite links over the internet: not open yet Invite links aren't open yet. Sessions on your own network are free. Today the Over the internet part of the Live panel says so in a plain sentence instead of offering a link. When invite links open, this is how they will work: Under Over the internet, choose how long the link works (1 hour, 8 hours, or until you end the session), then Invite by link. Copy the link and send it like a meeting link. The link's secret part (after #) never reaches getcadcraft.com: the site only passes on encrypted messages it can't read, and you still approve each person. New link makes the old one stop working at once; Stop the link ends it. Making an invite link will need you signed in, with a commercial license in force for the app. Guests will need nothing: no account, no license. Join someone else's session In CadCraft Studio's home screen, find Join a live session. Type the code the host gave you, or type the address shown under their code followed by the code. (Once invite links open, you will paste the host's link here too.) Type your name and choose Join. Studio opens the right app; it fills with the host's file once the host lets you in. Without Studio, scan the picture under the host's code with a device on the same network: the app opens in the browser. In CadCraft, if you already have the same file open in a Studio window, you can join from that window instead: choose Live, then under Join with the drawing open here type the code or the address and code, and choose Join here. Only the changes made since the file was opened travel. If the host's drawing is a different one, it replaces the one in that window; your file on disk stays as it is. Guest, hotel and school Wi-Fi often keep devices apart, so a code can't find the host there. Use a network that lets devices see each other, such as the office network. Invite links, for when you are not on the same network, are not open yet. Who changed what: Recent edits The Live panel lists Recent edits: who made each change and what it was (the step's name, such as Line or Move), newest first, with how long ago. Show more lists more of them. With something selected in CadCraft or MarkupCraft, the panel also says who changed it last, and Only what is selected keeps just the edits that touched it. The list is made in your own window from the session's edits while the session runs. It is gone when the session ends: it is never saved in the file or sent anywhere. Everyone in the session can see who made each change. If you joined after people had started, or were away for a while, the edits from before are not in your list, and the panel says so. Assistants in a session If someone turned on assistants in their app's settings, their AI assistant can ask to work in the session too. The host's own assistant joins at once; anyone else's waits for the host, with a card saying whose assistant it is: Allow or Deny. An assistant edits like its person, with its own undo, and leaves the session when its person leaves. When the session ends The host chooses End the session, or closes the file. Everyone else keeps an unsaved copy of the file as it was: save it if you want to keep it. Leave does the same for you alone.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"pen-and-touch","scope":"basics","title":"Draw with a pen on a tablet","summary":"What the app does when you draw with a pen on a touch screen: it ignores your palm, can leave the drawing to the pen while your fingers move the view, and lets the pen's buttons and a two-finger tap undo.","section":"tasks","order":94,"keywords":["pen","stylus","tablet","touch","palm","palm rejection","finger","fingers","two fingers","tap","undo","redo","side button","barrel button","eraser","pressure","hover","phone"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time","text":"A pen is noticed the first time","level":2},{"id":"your-palm-is-ignored","text":"Your palm is ignored","level":2},{"id":"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view","text":"Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view","level":2},{"id":"undo-with-a-tap","text":"Undo with a tap","level":2},{"id":"the-pen-s-buttons","text":"The pen's buttons","level":2},{"id":"these-are-the-device-s-settings","text":"These are the device's settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-pen-is-noticed-the-first-time\"\u003EA pen is noticed the first time\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"your-palm-is-ignored\"\u003EYour palm is ignored\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EIgnore my palm while I use a pen\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"let-the-pen-draw-and-your-fingers-move-the-view\"\u003ELet the pen draw and your fingers move the view\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDraw and select\u003C/span\u003E (the start): a finger does what the pen does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly move the view\u003C/span\u003E: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"undo-with-a-tap\"\u003EUndo with a tap\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETap with two fingers to undo, three to redo\u003C/span\u003E on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-pen-s-buttons\"\u003EThe pen&#039;s buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen side button\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does (a right click)\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen eraser end\u003C/span\u003E (on pens that have one): \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E at the start, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERedo\u003C/span\u003E. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"these-are-the-device-s-settings\"\u003EThese are the device&#039;s settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E and resetting an app&#039;s settings leave them as they are.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPen pressure and tilt don&#039;t change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen&#039;s pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How the app works with a pen on a tablet or a touch-screen laptop, and the settings that change it. They are in Settings › General › Pen and touch, which shows on a touch screen, or once you have used a pen. A pen is noticed the first time Nothing changes until you touch the drawing with a pen. From then on the app remembers, on this device, that you draw with one, and the choices below start to apply. Before that, your fingers draw and select as usual. Your palm is ignored With Ignore my palm while I use a pen on (it starts on), a touch on the drawing is ignored while the pen touches the screen, for a moment after you lift it or while it hovers just above the screen, and whenever the contact is as big as a palm. Rest your hand on the screen and draw. If a quick finger right after the pen does nothing, wait a moment: that moment is the palm rule at work. Let the pen draw and your fingers move the view Under Fingers on the drawing, once you use a pen here: Draw and select (the start): a finger does what the pen does. Only move the view: one finger on the drawing does nothing, so a stray touch never draws or picks. Two fingers still move and zoom the view as usual. The toolbars, panels and dialogs work with your fingers either way. Undo with a tap With Tap with two fingers to undo, three to redo on (it starts on), tap the drawing with two fingers together to undo your last step, and with three to redo it. It works with or without a pen. Moving the fingers is a pan or a zoom, never a tap. The pen's buttons Pen side button: What the app does (a right click) at the start, or Undo or Redo. Pen eraser end (on pens that have one): What the app does at the start, or Undo or Redo. In ModelCraft, what the app does is to erase while the eraser end touches. These are the device's settings The pen and touch choices are kept for this device and apply in every app on it, so you set them once. Reset the layout and resetting an app's settings leave them as they are. Not built yet Pen pressure and tilt don't change line weights yet, and no app has a handwriting or sketch-to-shape tool. The app reads the pen's pressure, tilt and hover, so these can come later per app.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"input-devices","scope":"basics","title":"Use a trackpad, 3D mouse or controller","summary":"Set what a trackpad, your mouse's side buttons, a pen, finger taps, a 3D mouse, a game controller or a MIDI controller does, for every app or for one app.","section":"tasks","order":95,"keywords":["trackpad","touchpad","two fingers","pinch","scroll","mouse","side button","back button","forward button","tilt wheel","pen","stylus","eraser","tap","3D mouse","space mouse","6 axis","game controller","gamepad","joystick","MIDI","knob","fader","pad","input device","customize","assign"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"every-app-or-only-this-app","text":"Every app, or only this app","level":2},{"id":"trackpad","text":"Trackpad","level":2},{"id":"mouse-buttons","text":"Mouse buttons","level":2},{"id":"pen-and-finger-taps","text":"Pen and finger taps","level":2},{"id":"3d-mouse","text":"3D mouse","level":2},{"id":"game-controller","text":"Game controller","level":2},{"id":"midi-controller","text":"MIDI controller","level":2},{"id":"share-your-settings","text":"Share your settings","level":2},{"id":"not-built-yet","text":"Not built yet","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGlobal\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInput devices\u003C/span\u003E, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"every-app-or-only-this-app\"\u003EEvery app, or only this app\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAt the top, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThese settings are for\u003C/span\u003E:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly\u003C/span\u003E this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEvery app\u003C/span\u003E again to drop this app&#039;s own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app&#039;s apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"trackpad\"\u003ETrackpad\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger scroll\u003C/span\u003E: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWhat the app does\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPan the view\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EZoom\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOrbit (3D views)\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPinch\u003C/span\u003E: zoom, as the app does, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse the direction\u003C/span\u003E apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"mouse-buttons\"\u003EMouse buttons\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack side button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EForward side button\u003C/span\u003E: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EFit everything in view\u003C/span\u003E. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EWheel tilted sideways\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe wheel&#039;s zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app&#039;s own tab, under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"pen-and-finger-taps\"\u003EPen and finger taps\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESide button\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EEraser end\u003C/span\u003E: what the app does, or any command.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwo-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EThree-finger tap\u003C/span\u003E (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENothing\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPalm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPen and touch\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"3d-mouse\"\u003E3D mouse\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect a 3D mouse\u003C/span\u003E and pick it in the browser&#039;s list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach movement (\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPush forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELift and press\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt forward and back\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETilt left and right\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETwist\u003C/span\u003E) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse\u003C/span\u003E turns it round.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOnly the strongest movement at a time\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach button runs a command or fits the view.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"game-controller\"\u003EGame controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPlug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESpeed\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDead zone\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReverse up and down on the sticks\u003C/span\u003E are there too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"midi-controller\"\u003EMIDI controller\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EConnect MIDI\u003C/span\u003E. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAdd a control for\u003C/span\u003E (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELearn it\u003C/span\u003E, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"share-your-settings\"\u003EShare your settings\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EExport\u003C/span\u003E saves the settings shown as a file; \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EImport\u003C/span\u003E reads one back (settings this version doesn&#039;t know are left out, and you&#039;re told how many). \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EBack to the defaults\u003C/span\u003E undoes every change for the settings shown.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"not-built-yet\"\u003ENot built yet\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app&#039;s own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to choose what each of your input devices does in the app. The settings are in Settings › Global › Input devices, one card per device. Until you change something, every device works as it did before. Every app, or only this app At the top, These settings are for: Every app (the start): what you set applies in every app that has no settings of its own. Only this app: the app takes a copy of the shared settings and keeps its own from then on. Change them here without touching the other apps. Choose Every app again to drop this app's own settings and go back to the shared ones. The settings are kept on this device, in every app window and in the desktop app's apps. Trackpad Two-finger scroll: What the app does, Pan the view, Zoom or Orbit (3D views). Pinch: zoom, as the app does, or Nothing. Speed and Reverse the direction apply when you have chosen pan, zoom or orbit. The app tells a trackpad from a mouse wheel by the way it scrolls, so a mouse wheel keeps doing what it does. Mouse buttons Back side button and Forward side button: run any command, such as Undo and Redo, or Fit everything in view. A side button set to a command no longer takes the browser back a page. Wheel tilted sideways: what the app does, pan the view, or nothing. The wheel's zoom direction and which buttons pan or orbit are in the app's own tab, under Menus, keys and mouse. Pen and finger taps Side button and Eraser end: what the app does, or any command. Two-finger tap and Three-finger tap (they start as Undo and Redo): any command, or Nothing. Palm rejection and what your fingers do once you use a pen stay under Pen and touch. 3D mouse Choose Connect a 3D mouse and pick it in the browser's list; the browser remembers it for this site. Then push, lift, tilt and twist the cap to move the view under the pointer: Each movement (Push left and right, Push forward and back, Lift and press, Tilt forward and back, Tilt left and right, Twist) can pan, zoom, orbit or do nothing, and Reverse turns it round. Speed, Dead zone (how far the cap moves before anything happens) and Only the strongest movement at a time. Each button runs a command or fits the view. A 3D mouse needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Game controller Plug in a controller and press any button so the browser shows it to the app. The sticks pan, orbit or zoom; the triggers zoom in and out; every button can run a command. Speed, Dead zone and Reverse up and down on the sticks are there too. MIDI controller Choose Connect MIDI. Then, for each control: pick what it should do under Add a control for (a knob or fader pans, zooms or orbits; a pad or key runs a command), choose Learn it, and turn the knob or press the pad. Each learned control is listed, with a button to remove it. MIDI needs Chrome or Edge in the browser. Share your settings Export saves the settings shown as a file; Import reads one back (settings this version doesn't know are left out, and you're told how many). Back to the defaults undoes every change for the settings shown. Not built yet A wheel dial (such as the ones on Windows) and the desktop app's own drivers for 3D mice are not supported yet. A 3D mouse, controller or knob moves the view only in apps that have handed their views over; their buttons work everywhere.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"undo-across-windows","scope":"basics","title":"Undo the last step across windows","summary":"In CadCraft Studio, take back the last thing you did in any app window from the Studio window, in the order you worked, without changing windows first.","section":"tasks","order":140,"keywords":["undo","undo across apps","undo last step","last step","project undo","studio undo","order I worked","undo in another app","windows","journal"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-do","text":"What you will do","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works","text":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"what-it-will-not-do","text":"What it will not do","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-do\"\u003EWhat you will do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYou drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffDesk, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under \u003Cstrong\u003EOpen windows\u003C/strong\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"how-it-works\"\u003EHow it works\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example &quot;Rename the takeoff in TakeoffDesk&quot;.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo last step\u003C/span\u003E in the Studio window. Studio asks &quot;Undo this step in that app?&quot;; nothing happens until you say \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUndo it\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EStudio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-will-not-do\"\u003EWhat it will not do\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt takes back \u003Cstrong\u003Eone window&#039;s own last step\u003C/strong\u003E only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffDesk by this.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA closed window&#039;s steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIt does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EEach app&#039;s own Undo (\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control\"\u003E⌃\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E+\u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Z\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EZ\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will do You drew a wall in BimCraft, then moved a mark in TakeoffDesk, and you want the last one back without hunting for the right window. In the Studio window, under Open windows, choose Undo last step. How it works Each app window tells Studio when it finishes a step, with the name you see in its own Undo. Studio keeps the newest step of every window and the order between them. The line beside the button names the newest one, for example \"Rename the takeoff in TakeoffDesk\". Choose Undo last step in the Studio window. Studio asks \"Undo this step in that app?\"; nothing happens until you say Undo it. Studio asks that window for its own next undo and the window runs it, exactly as if you had pressed Undo there. Choose the button again for the step before. What it will not do It takes back one window's own last step only. It does not undo the effects of that step in another app: a change in BimCraft that fed a takeoff is not undone in TakeoffDesk by this. If you have changed that window since (typed in it, opened another file, or undone by hand there), Studio does not force anything. It skips that window and says nothing was undone; use Undo inside the app. A closed window's steps are gone. Steps older than half an hour are not offered. It does not undo a save, and it is not offered in a browser tab on its own: it needs the apps open as windows of one Studio. Each app's own Undo (Ctrl+Z) works as before, and is told to Studio too, so the two never disagree.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"full-screen-crosshair","scope":"basics","title":"Full-screen crosshair","summary":"Two thin lines through the pointer, edge to edge across the drawing or view, to check by eye that things line up. One switch turns it on in every app.","section":"reference","order":30,"keywords":["full screen crosshair","full-screen cursor","crosshair","cursor","cursorsize","cursorsize 100","edge to edge","line up","alignment","align","guide lines","cross hairs"],"headings":[{"id":"turn-it-on","text":"Turn it on","level":2},{"id":"what-it-does","text":"What it does","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EThe full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD&#039;s \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E 100.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"turn-it-on\"\u003ETurn it on\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear in the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), go to \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E and tick \u003Cstrong\u003ECrosshair from edge to edge in every app\u003C/strong\u003E under \u003Cstrong\u003EFull-screen crosshair\u003C/strong\u003E. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"what-it-does\"\u003EWhat it does\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EToolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECadCraft\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003ECursor\u003C/strong\u003E › \u003Cstrong\u003EFull screen\u003C/strong\u003E, or type \u003Ccode class=\"hcmd\"\u003ECURSORSIZE\u003C/code\u003E and 100.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"The full-screen crosshair draws two thin lines through the pointer: one across the whole width of the drawing or view under it, one down its whole height. Move the pointer to an edge or a corner and you can see at once whether other things sit on the same line. It is the same as AutoCAD's CURSORSIZE 100. Turn it on Open Settings (the gear in the app bar, or Ctrl+,), go to General and tick Crosshair from edge to edge in every app under Full-screen crosshair. It is one switch for all eight apps on this computer: turn it on in one app and the others have it too, also in tabs that are already open. What it does The lines show while the pointer is over a drawing or a view, also when no tool is running. Toolbars, cards and hints that sit over the view stay on top of the lines; a dialog never gets them. With a finger nothing changes: the lines follow a mouse, a trackpad or a pen. In CadCraft the crosshair is drawn by the drawing itself: it turns with the coordinate system (UCS), and with the view split it stays in the pane you are working in. CadCraft also has it as a cursor size of its own: Settings › CadCraft › Cursor › Full screen, or type CURSORSIZE and 100.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"unit-lists","scope":"basics","title":"Units, typed values and the unit lists","summary":"Type a length in any unit with its mark, choose which units the unit lists show, and star the unit new work starts in. A file always keeps its own unit.","section":"reference","order":60,"keywords":["units","unit list","metric","imperial","feet","inches","feet and inches","meters","millimeters","US survey foot","survey feet","international foot","yards","miles","nautical mile","chain","rod","link","furlong","fathom","point","pica","acre","hectare","square","roofing square","acre-foot","board foot","gallon","gon","grad","radian","degrees minutes seconds","slope","percent","H:V","rise run","default unit","star","INSUNITS"],"headings":[{"id":"what-you-will-learn","text":"What you will learn","level":2},{"id":"type-a-length-in-any-unit","text":"Type a length in any unit","level":2},{"id":"choose-the-units-the-lists-show","text":"Choose the units the lists show","level":2},{"id":"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used","text":"Where the lists and the star are used","level":2},{"id":"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit","text":"A file keeps its own unit","level":2}],"html":"\u003Ch2 id=\"what-you-will-learn\"\u003EWhat you will learn\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHow to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"type-a-length-in-any-unit\"\u003EType a length in any unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit&#039;s mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EType\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EMeans\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039; 6 1/2&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;-6&quot;\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ft 6 in\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Efeet and inches\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E450 mm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3.2 m\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1.5 km\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2 dm\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E400 nm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Emetric lengths (\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is the nanometer)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E2.5 mi\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E250 mil\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Eyards, miles, thousandths of an inch\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 US mi\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Ethe US survey foot and mile\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E2 rd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E100 li\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 ch\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E1 fur\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Erods, links, chains, furlongs\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E1 nmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003E1 NM\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E6 ftm\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Enautical miles, fathoms\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003Ccode\u003E12 pt\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E3 pc\u003C/code\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003Epoints and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Enm\u003C/code\u003E is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type \u003Ccode\u003Enmi\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003ENM\u003C/code\u003E. \u003Ccode\u003ENm\u003C/code\u003E is refused, because it could be either.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Ccode\u003Eft\u003C/code\u003E is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type \u003Ccode\u003EUS ft\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003Eusft\u003C/code\u003E or \u003Ccode\u003Esurvey ft\u003C/code\u003E. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: \u003Ccode\u003E2*3 yd\u003C/code\u003E, \u003Ccode\u003E12&#039;6&quot; + 3 ch\u003C/code\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIn CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so \u003Ccode\u003E10 US ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 and \u003Ccode\u003E10 ft\u003C/code\u003E is 10 project feet.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"choose-the-units-the-lists-show\"\u003EChoose the units the lists show\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E (the gear on the app bar, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E), choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E, and find \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnits\u003C/span\u003E. There is one list for each kind: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELength\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArea\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EVolume\u003C/span\u003E, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EAngle\u003C/span\u003E and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESlope\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EEach unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClick the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file&#039;s unit, or the one for your region).\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the unit lists\u003C/span\u003E puts the starting lists back, with no stars.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"where-the-lists-and-the-star-are-used\"\u003EWhere the lists and the star are used\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"ht-wrap\"\u003E\u003Ctable class=\"ht\"\u003E\u003Cthead\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EApp\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat follows the switches\u003C/th\u003E\u003Cth scope=\"col\"\u003EWhat the star sets\u003C/th\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/thead\u003E\u003Ctbody\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECadCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003E\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ECivilCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe project&#039;s units list\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EModelCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list beside the value box\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit of a new model\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EBimCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe units list on the plan toolbar\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept)\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EMarkupCraft\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring and position units in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E, and the unit in the calibrate dialog\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe measuring unit, until MarkupCraft&#039;s own settings have been saved\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003Ctr\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ETakeoffDesk\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003EThe unit lists of an item\u003C/td\u003E\u003Ctd\u003ELength and area: the unit of a new item\u003C/td\u003E\u003C/tr\u003E\u003C/tbody\u003E\u003C/table\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe angle and slope lists are saved, but no app&#039;s box follows them yet.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"a-file-keeps-its-own-unit\"\u003EA file keeps its own unit\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"What you will learn How to type a value in any unit, and how to choose which units the unit lists in the apps show and which one new work starts in. Every app shares one table of units, with the exact sizes their legal definitions give. Type a length in any unit In a box that takes a length, type the number and the unit's mark after it. The app turns it into the unit the box is in. Type Means 12'6\", 12' 6 1/2\", 12'-6\", 3 ft 6 in feet and inches 450 mm, 3.2 m, 1.5 km, 2 dm, 400 nm metric lengths (nm is the nanometer) 3 yd, 2.5 mi, 250 mil yards, miles, thousandths of an inch 10 US ft, 1 US mi the US survey foot and mile 2 rd, 100 li, 3 ch, 1 fur rods, links, chains, furlongs 1 nmi or 1 NM, 6 ftm nautical miles, fathoms 12 pt, 3 pc points and picas (1/72 and 1/6 of an inch) nm is always the nanometer. For the nautical mile type nmi or NM. Nm is refused, because it could be either. ft is the international foot (0.3048 m). The US survey foot (1200/3937 m) is a different unit: type US ft, usft or survey ft. Rods, links, chains, furlongs and acres are the international-foot ones. Sums work as before where the app takes them, with any of these marks: 2*3 yd, 12'6\" + 3 ch. In CadCraft a mark is read when the drawing has units (its $INSUNITS). A drawing with no units reads one only when its length format is Engineering or Architectural, where one drawing unit is an inch. In CivilCraft a project in feet is in US survey feet, as it always was, so 10 US ft is 10 and 10 ft is 10 project feet. Choose the units the lists show Open Settings (the gear on the app bar, or Ctrl+,), choose General, and find Units. There is one list for each kind: Length, Area, Volume, Angle and Slope. Each unit has a switch. A unit that is off is left out of the unit lists in the apps. Click the star beside a unit to make it the default for new work. Click it again to take the star away. With no star, each app keeps its own default (the file's unit, or the one for your region). Reset the unit lists puts the starting lists back, with no stars. The choices are the same in every app in this browser, and they are saved as you make them. Where the lists and the star are used App What follows the switches What the star sets CadCraft The units ($INSUNITS) of a new drawing, when it is a unit a drawing can carry CivilCraft The project's units list Length: a new project in meters (a metric star) or feet. Area and volume: the unit areas and volumes are reported in ModelCraft The units list beside the value box The unit of a new model BimCraft The units list on the plan toolbar The display units, until you pick them on the toolbar (your earlier pick is kept) MarkupCraft The measuring and position units in Settings, and the unit in the calibrate dialog The measuring unit, until MarkupCraft's own settings have been saved TakeoffDesk The unit lists of an item Length and area: the unit of a new item The angle and slope lists are saved, but no app's box follows them yet. A file keeps its own unit The settings never change a file. A drawing keeps its units, a CivilCraft project its feet or meters, a model its unit. The unit a file uses is always in its list, even when it is turned off in Settings.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"lost-toolbar","scope":"basics","title":"Where did my toolbar go?","summary":"The bars, menus or panels went missing. Here is what hides them on purpose, the keys that bring them back, and one button that puts the whole layout back.","section":"trouble","order":5,"keywords":["toolbar gone","toolbar missing","lost toolbar","lost menu","menu disappeared","ribbon disappeared","bars hidden","show bars","full screen","panels gone","reset layout","layout","ribbon","collapsed","locked toolbar"],"headings":[{"id":"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout","text":"The quickest fix: reset the layout","level":2},{"id":"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen","text":"The bars are hidden (full screen)","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-looks-different","text":"The toolbar looks different","level":2},{"id":"the-toolbar-s-own-menu","text":"The toolbar's own menu","level":2},{"id":"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small","text":"Everything is too big or too small","level":2},{"id":"the-panels-are-gone","text":"The panels are gone","level":2},{"id":"on-a-phone","text":"On a phone","level":2},{"id":"still-missing","text":"Still missing?","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003ENothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-quickest-fix-reset-the-layout\"\u003EThe quickest fix: reset the layout\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E with the gear button in the app bar, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command ,\"\u003E⌘,\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+,\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E tab.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EUnder \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELayout\u003C/span\u003E, choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app&#039;s own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Caside class=\"hc hc-note\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hc-label\"\u003ENote\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn CadCraft Studio, \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E in Studio&#039;s own window also has \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the layout in every app\u003C/span\u003E. Each app&#039;s windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/aside\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-bars-are-hidden-full-screen\"\u003EThe bars are hidden (full screen)\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe screen-mode button in the app bar, and \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWhile the bars are hidden, a small \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Control Shift F\"\u003E⌃⇧F\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+Shift+F\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave this mode, or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E to leave full screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIf the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EScreen\u003C/span\u003E: the app does what is chosen there when it opens.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\"hv\" data-v=\"input:touch\"\u003E\u003Cp class=\"hv-label\"\u003ETouch\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETap the \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EShow bars\u003C/span\u003E tab, or tap the top edge of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-looks-different\"\u003EThe toolbar looks different\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools in another order, or tools you can&#039;t find:\u003C/strong\u003E someone arranged the toolbar. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EOriginal order\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EOnly icons, or only words:\u003C/strong\u003E \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar buttons\u003C/span\u003E in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETools won&#039;t move:\u003C/strong\u003E the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E, or clear \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EToolbar\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EA ribbon that shows only its tab names:\u003C/strong\u003E it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMenus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar:\u003C/strong\u003E a menu style is on. Pick the app&#039;s own style under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › the app&#039;s tab › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMenus, keys and mouse\u003C/span\u003E. Every command is in every style; \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E finds any of them by name.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-toolbar-s-own-menu\"\u003EThe toolbar&#039;s own menu\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ERight-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu:\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EArrange the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDone arranging\u003C/span\u003E in the same menu, or press \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Esc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EEsc\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, when it looks right.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ELock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E / \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EUnlock the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: a locked toolbar can&#039;t be arranged or reset by accident.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset the toolbar\u003C/span\u003E: tools back in their first order.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWith a ribbon menu style: \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ECollapse the ribbon\u003C/span\u003E or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPin the ribbon open\u003C/span\u003E.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a keyboard, the menu key (or \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Shift F10\"\u003E⇧ F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003EShift+F10\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E) opens it for the tool that has the focus.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"everything-is-too-big-or-too-small\"\u003EEverything is too big or too small\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EInterface size\u003C/span\u003E makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanel text size\u003C/span\u003E beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio&#039;s own window has one in its \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E too.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"the-panels-are-gone\"\u003EThe panels are gone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPanels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window).\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ELook for a second window called after the app with &quot;panels&quot;, and choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPut the panels back\u003C/span\u003E in it.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOr choose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EReset layout\u003C/span\u003E under \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ESettings\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EGeneral\u003C/span\u003E › \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EPanels\u003C/span\u003E, which brings every panel home.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"on-a-phone\"\u003EOn a phone\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ETools\u003C/span\u003E button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EMove\u003C/span\u003E puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"still-missing\"\u003EStill missing?\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFind any tool by name with \u003Ckbd class=\"hk\"\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-mac\" title=\"Command K\"\u003E⌘K\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"k-pc\"\u003ECtrl+K\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/kbd\u003E, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app&#039;s name and what you were doing.\u003C/p\u003E","text":"Nothing is deleted when a bar or a panel goes away: the app only hides or moves it. Each of these ways is on purpose, and each has a way back. The quickest fix: reset the layout Open Settings with the gear button in the app bar, or press Ctrl+,. Choose the General tab. Under Layout, choose Reset the layout. The toolbar goes back to its first order and buttons, the panels go back to their sides, the screen mode goes back to the normal view and the menu style goes back to the one the app starts with. Your theme, language, sizes and the app's own settings stay as they are, and so do any menu styles you made yourself (choose them again under Menus, keys and mouse). In CadCraft Studio, Settings in Studio's own window also has Reset the layout in every app. Each app's windows follow at once, and an app you open later starts from its first layout. The bars are hidden (full screen) The screen-mode button in the app bar, and Ctrl+Shift+F, go from the normal view to full screen, then to full screen with the bars hidden, then back. While the bars are hidden, a small Show bars tab stays at the top middle of the window. Choose it, or point at the top edge of the window, and the bars slide down; they hide again a moment after you move away. Press Ctrl+Shift+F to leave this mode, or Esc to leave full screen. If the app opens with its bars hidden every time, look at Settings › General › Screen: the app does what is chosen there when it opens. Tap the Show bars tab, or tap the top edge of the screen. The toolbar looks different Tools in another order, or tools you can't find: someone arranged the toolbar. Choose Original order under Settings › General › Toolbar. Only icons, or only words: Toolbar buttons in the same place picks icons and labels, icons only or labels only. Hold the pointer over an icon to see its name. Tools won't move: the toolbar is locked. Right-click the toolbar (or press and hold it) and choose Unlock the toolbar, or clear Lock the toolbar under Settings › General › Toolbar. A ribbon that shows only its tab names: it is collapsed. Choose a tab name to open its tools for one command, or double-click a tab name (or choose the pin at the end of the tab row) to keep the ribbon open. Menus or a ribbon instead of the toolbar: a menu style is on. Pick the app's own style under Settings › the app's tab › Menus, keys and mouse. Every command is in every style; Ctrl+K finds any of them by name. The toolbar's own menu Right-click the toolbar, or press and hold it on a touch screen, for a short menu: Arrange the toolbar: drag tools within their group and groups by their name, or move the focused one with the arrow keys. Choose Done arranging in the same menu, or press Esc, when it looks right. Lock the toolbar / Unlock the toolbar: a locked toolbar can't be arranged or reset by accident. Reset the toolbar: tools back in their first order. With a ribbon menu style: Collapse the ribbon or Pin the ribbon open. On a keyboard, the menu key (or Shift+F10) opens it for the tool that has the focus. Everything is too big or too small Settings › General › Interface size makes the bars, toolbars, panels and dialogs of this app bigger or smaller, from 80 % to 140 %. The drawing keeps its own zoom, so a smaller interface leaves more room for it, for example with two apps side by side on one monitor. Panel text size beside it changes only the text in the side panels, on top of the interface size. Each app keeps its own size; CadCraft Studio's own window has one in its Settings too. The panels are gone Panels can float over the drawing, dock on another side, or move to a window of their own (often on a second monitor, or behind this window). Look for a second window called after the app with \"panels\", and choose Put the panels back in it. Or choose Reset layout under Settings › General › Panels, which brings every panel home. On a phone On a phone the panels are sheets: open one from the bar at the bottom of the screen. The Tools button in that bar hides and shows the toolbar, and Move puts it at the top or the bottom of the screen. Still missing? Find any tool by name with Ctrl+K, even while its bar is hidden. If something is still not where it should be after resetting the layout, tell us on the support page with the app's name and what you were doing.","lang":"en"},{"slug":"recover","scope":"basics","title":"Recover unsaved work","summary":"How the apps keep a recovery copy while you work, and how to get your work back after a crash or a closed tab.","section":"trouble","order":55,"keywords":["autosave","recover","recovery","crash","lost work","closed tab","unsaved","restore","backup"],"headings":[{"id":"when-the-copy-is-kept","text":"When the copy is kept","level":2},{"id":"get-your-work-back","text":"Get your work back","level":2},{"id":"things-to-know","text":"Things to know","level":2}],"html":"\u003Cp\u003EWhile you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"when-the-copy-is-kept\"\u003EWhen the copy is kept\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EA few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you switch to another tab or window.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"get-your-work-back\"\u003EGet your work back\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Col\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOpen the same app again, in the same browser.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EIf it closed before your work was saved, it asks \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover your work?\u003C/span\u003E and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChoose \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ERecover\u003C/span\u003E to open it, or \u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003EDiscard\u003C/span\u003E to throw it away.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESave it to a file as soon as it opens.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ol\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan class=\"hui\"\u003ENot now\u003C/span\u003E keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 id=\"things-to-know\"\u003EThings to know\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003EWhen you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EAnother tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPrivate windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EClearing your browser&#039;s site data removes the copies.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ENot every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app&#039;s own help says whether it does.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E","text":"While you work, each app keeps a recovery copy of what you have not saved yet. It is not a save: your file on your computer only changes when you save it. The copy is there so a crash, a closed tab or a computer that turns off does not cost you your work. When the copy is kept A few seconds after you stop editing, and at least every 30 seconds while you keep going. When you switch to another tab or window. The copy stays in this browser, on this computer. Nothing is uploaded. Get your work back Open the same app again, in the same browser. If it closed before your work was saved, it asks Recover your work? and lists what it kept, with the time of the last copy. Choose Recover to open it, or Discard to throw it away. Save it to a file as soon as it opens. Not now keeps the copies for 30 days, and the app asks again the next time it opens. A reload counts too: reload a tab with unsaved work and the app offers it back. Things to know When you save, or close a file on purpose, its recovery copy is removed. Another tab of the same app that is still open never offers your copies. It only offers work from a tab that has gone. Private windows in some browsers, and a browser with no space left, cannot keep a copy. The app tells you when that happens, so save to a file more often. Clearing your browser's site data removes the copies. Not every app keeps a recovery copy yet. Each app's own help says whether it does.","lang":"en"}],"locale":"uz","chain":["uz","en"]};
